values
  ('286143253482104791', 'The Likely Lads', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Michael Tuchner, Kip Gowans', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'James Bolam, Rodney Bewes, Brigit Forsyth, Mary Tamm, Sheila Fearn, Zena Walker, Alun Armstrong, Judy Buxton', null, 'With the destruction of their previous neighbourhood has inevitably come the destruction of the lads’ favoured watering hole The Fat Ox. Again, it’s Bob rather than Terry who is visibly distressed by this. Upset and much the worse for free alcohol, Bob then storms into the library to seek sympathy from Thelma - who is, predictably, unimpressed. So when Thelma finds out that Terry has been getting semi-serious with glamorous Finnish shop assistant Chris, she takes it upon herself to try and pair them off for good via planning first a dinner party and then that mainstay of 70s comedy, a camping expedition. Of course, things don’t go quite according to plan and before you can say ‘I can see the way this is going’ we are set up for japes, larks and embarrassing incidents aplenty, which culminate in the lads getting rather fed up with their partners’ attempts to inflict the rugged outdoor lifestyle upon them and trying to hitch up and drive off with the girls still asleep in the caravan.', 'With the destruction of their previous neighbourhood has inevitably come the destruction of the lads’ favoured watering hole The Fat Ox. Again, it’s Bob rather than Terry who is visibly distressed by this. Upset and much the worse for free alcohol, Bob then storms into the library to seek sympathy from Thelma - who is, predictably, unimpressed. So when Thelma finds out that Terry has been getting semi-serious with glamorous Finnish shop assistant Chris, she takes it upon herself to try and pair them off for good via planning first a dinner party and then that mainstay of 70s comedy, a camping expedition. Of course, things don’t go quite according to plan and before you can say ‘I can see the way this is going’ we are set up for japes, larks and embarrassing incidents aplenty, which culminate in the lads getting rather fed up with their partners’ attempts to inflict the rugged outdoor lifestyle upon them and trying to hitch up and drive off with the girls still asleep in the caravan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iBgBGgSEYCMQwXQIrUADPwTtFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56837'),
  ('164894468343279179', 'The Lilliputian Minuet', 1905, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The film, of which only fragments are known to survive, features Méliès as a magician making playing-card figures come to life in miniature.', 'The film, of which only fragments are known to survive, features Méliès as a magician making playing-card figures come to life in miniature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4RMjUFJnoY6PaXDnNd1MckUhRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189600'),
  ('492373196142178786', 'The Limehouse Golem', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Juan Carlos Medina, Simon Dennis, Nick Wilkinson', 'Jane Goldman', 'Bill Nighy, Olivia Cooke, Douglas Booth, Daniel Mays, Sam Reid, María Valverde, Eddie Marsan, Henry Goodman', null, 'A series of murders has shaken the community to the point where people believe that only a legendary creature from dark times – the mythical Golem – must be responsible.', 'A series of murders has shaken the community to the point where people believe that only a legendary creature from dark times – the mythical Golem – must be responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9NnEq4Be7hhwSvkNf6dOAD8ppi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369300'),
  ('1021089630833880812', 'The Limey', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Steven Soderbergh, Edward Lachman, Gregory Jacobs', 'Lem Dobbs', 'Terence Stamp, Lesley Ann Warren, Luis Guzmán, Barry Newman, Joe Dallesandro, Nicky Katt, Peter Fonda, Amelia Heinle', 'R', 'The Limey follows Wilson, a tough English ex-con who travels to Los Angeles to avenge his daughter''s death. Upon arrival, Wilson goes to task battling Valentine and an army of L.A.''s toughest criminals, hoping to find clues and piece together what happened. After surviving a near-death beating, getting thrown from a building and being chased down a dangerous mountain road, the Englishman decides to dole out some bodily harm of his own.', 'The Limey follows Wilson, a tough English ex-con who travels to Los Angeles to avenge his daughter''s death. Upon arrival, Wilson goes to task battling Valentine and an army of L.A.''s toughest criminals, hoping to find clues and piece together what happened. After surviving a near-death beating, getting thrown from a building and being chased down a dangerous mountain road, the Englishman decides to dole out some bodily harm of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efAnFInZYrenNvBlLIXN2oLYyNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10388'),
  ('84265634113703171', 'The Limit of Sleeping Beauty', 2017, 'Drama', 'Takehiro Shindo, Kotoe Tsutsumi, Ryo Yoshida', 'Ken Ninomiya', 'Yuki Sakurai, Nino Furuhata, Ippei Sasaki, Masato Shinkawa, Junko Abe, Masayuki Shida, Tomoki Kimura, Chiaki Kawamo', null, 'Aki is an unsuccessful 29-year-old actress who eventually became a magician''s assistant. While pretending to be hypnotised on the stage, Aki finds the boundary between reality and illusion becoming increasingly vague. For Aki, the only beautiful memory she has was the time spent with her lover Kaito.', 'Aki is an unsuccessful 29-year-old actress who eventually became a magician''s assistant. While pretending to be hypnotised on the stage, Aki finds the boundary between reality and illusion becoming increasingly vague. For Aki, the only beautiful memory she has was the time spent with her lover Kaito.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCAJ1WFsJC6ehv2ggXX4WUpKVgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479016'),
  ('571513661911497643', 'The Limits of Control', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jim Jarmusch, Christopher Doyle, Cristina Amengual Watson', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Isaach de Bankolé, Alex Descas, Jean-François Stévenin, Óscar Jaenada, Luis Tosar, Paz de la Huerta, Tilda Swinton, Youki Kudoh', 'R', 'A mysterious stranger works outside the law and keeps his objectives hidden, trusting no one. While his demeanor is paradoxically focused and dreamlike all at once, he embarks on a journey that not only takes him across Spain, but also through his own consciousness.', 'A mysterious stranger works outside the law and keeps his objectives hidden, trusting no one. While his demeanor is paradoxically focused and dreamlike all at once, he embarks on a journey that not only takes him across Spain, but also through his own consciousness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e4hjFt3V8LTUXPxvZ2plPpgGLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8284'),
  ('1987217007396502', 'The Limping Man', 1953, 'Thriller', 'Pat Kelly, Douglas Hickox, John Pitcher', 'Ian Stuart Black, Reginald Long', 'Lloyd Bridges, Moira Lister, Alan Wheatley, Leslie Phillips, Hélène Cordet, Tom Gill, Bruce Beeby, Rachel Roberts', null, 'An American veteran returns to England after WWII to learn that his London lover has become involved with a dangerous spy ring and their search for a limping sniper.', 'An American veteran returns to England after WWII to learn that his London lover has become involved with a dangerous spy ring and their search for a limping sniper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swtHnAu4ILtJOCna3Sd9nGH2GTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122221'),
  ('254434123351791974', 'The Lincoln Conspiracy', 1977, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'James L. Conway', 'Jonathan Cobbler', 'Bradford Dillman, John Dehner, Whit Bissell, John Anderson, Robert Middleton, Ken Kercheval, Christopher Allport, Fred Grandy', 'G', 'Speculates that John Wilkes Booth, murderer of Abraham Lincoln, escaped to Canada instead of being tracked down and killed soon after the assassination.', 'Speculates that John Wilkes Booth, murderer of Abraham Lincoln, escaped to Canada instead of being tracked down and killed soon after the assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccXUt6KYOTocjzRLWLSNOJxIiAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99850'),
  ('75135667920931398', 'The Lincoln Lawyer', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Brad Furman, Lukas Ettlin, Lauren Pasternack', 'John Romano', 'Matthew McConaughey, Ryan Phillippe, William H. Macy, Marisa Tomei, Josh Lucas, John Leguizamo, Michael Peña, Bob Gunton', 'R', 'Mick Haller is a charismatic defense attorney who does business out of his Lincoln Continental sedan. Mick spends most of his time defending petty crooks and other bottom-feeders, so it comes as quite a surprise when he lands the case of a lifetime: defending a Beverly Hills playboy who is accused of attempted murder. However, what Mick initially thinks is an open-and-shut case with a big monetary reward develops into something more sinister.', 'Mick Haller is a charismatic defense attorney who does business out of his Lincoln Continental sedan. Mick spends most of his time defending petty crooks and other bottom-feeders, so it comes as quite a surprise when he lands the case of a lifetime: defending a Beverly Hills playboy who is accused of attempted murder. However, what Mick initially thinks is an open-and-shut case with a big monetary reward develops into something more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOn8Ve9Yi8fxjRkmLr5BZoOc7KV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50348'),
  ('244525279248554569', 'The Line', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'James Cotten, Alisa Fredericks, Lynnette M. Myers', 'R. Ellis Frazier', 'Ray Liotta, Andy Garcia, Esai Morales, Armand Assante, Valerie Cruz, Kevin Gage, Bruce Davison, Joe Morton', 'R', 'The story centers around veteran assassin Mark Shields as he tracks down, Pelon, the elusive head of the Salazar Crime Cartel. Through twists of fate, Shields ends up with a local woman, Olivia who is also fighting her own demons for the sake of her daughter. Set in the rich and atmospheric backdrop of Tijuana, Mexico, La Linea (The Line) is full of action and drama.', 'The story centers around veteran assassin Mark Shields as he tracks down, Pelon, the elusive head of the Salazar Crime Cartel. Through twists of fate, Shields ends up with a local woman, Olivia who is also fighting her own demons for the sake of her daughter. Set in the rich and atmospheric backdrop of Tijuana, Mexico, La Linea (The Line) is full of action and drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqFJRRM4uK3DWXEwsluAP1Pb5fH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21878'),
  ('937628438717372623', 'The Line', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ursula Meier, Agnès Godard, Oceane Wannaz', 'Ursula Meier, Stéphanie Blanchoud, Antoine Jaccoud', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Stéphanie Blanchoud, Benjamin Biolay, Dali Benssalah, Elli Spagnolo, India Hair, Eric Ruf, Thomas Wiesel', null, 'Margaret, 35, has a history of violent behaviour which has cost her a romantic relationship. She has moved back in with her mother Christina, a fragile, immature 55-year-old woman who blames Margaret, her firstborn, for ruining her dreams of a career as a concert pianist. In a state of unbridled fury during an argument, Margaret hits Christina. The law steps in, further complicating family dynamics. As she awaits trial, Margaret is forbidden from coming into contact with her mother or within 100 metres of their home. This only intensifies her desire to be closer to her family. Every day, Margaret appears at this 100-metre threshold to see her 12-year-old sister Marion and give her music lessons.', 'Margaret, 35, has a history of violent behaviour which has cost her a romantic relationship. She has moved back in with her mother Christina, a fragile, immature 55-year-old woman who blames Margaret, her firstborn, for ruining her dreams of a career as a concert pianist. In a state of unbridled fury during an argument, Margaret hits Christina. The law steps in, further complicating family dynamics. As she awaits trial, Margaret is forbidden from coming into contact with her mother or within 100 metres of their home. This only intensifies her desire to be closer to her family. Every day, Margaret appears at this 100-metre threshold to see her 12-year-old sister Marion and give her music lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UjMVqRyGwYmzizGxZfXjShIyEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926332'),
  ('993572943275940114', 'The Line, the Cross & the Curve', 1994, 'Drama, Music', 'Kate Bush, Roger Pratt, Laurie Borg', 'Kate Bush', 'Kate Bush, Miranda Richardson, Lindsay Kemp, Lily, Stewart Avon-Arnold, Peter Richardson, Christopher Banaman, John Chesworth', null, 'A singer struggles to dance well in rehearsal with her band. A power outage leaves her alone in the studio, reviewing her life, when a mysterious woman appears through the mirror and gives her a pair of Red Shoes. The cursed shoes dance beautifully, but endlessly. The singer is drawn irresistibly into the fey world beyond the mirror, where she must redeem three magic symbols from the mysterious woman in order to obtain release from the cursed shoes.', 'A singer struggles to dance well in rehearsal with her band. A power outage leaves her alone in the studio, reviewing her life, when a mysterious woman appears through the mirror and gives her a pair of Red Shoes. The cursed shoes dance beautifully, but endlessly. The singer is drawn irresistibly into the fey world beyond the mirror, where she must redeem three magic symbols from the mysterious woman in order to obtain release from the cursed shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xd2zaDZGDQ7bCOHrFJPiL0onhSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36127'),
  ('1113377244172337813', 'The Lines That Define Me', 2022, 'Drama', 'Norihiro Koizumi', 'Sho Kataoka, Norihiro Koizumi', 'Ryusei Yokohama, Kaya Kiyohara, Kanata Hosoda, Yuumi Kawai, Yosuke Eguchi, Tomokazu Miura, Yasuko Tomita, Kenichi Yajima', null, 'Sousuke Aoyama is a college student who suffers painfully from the loss of his parents in a traffic accident. He meets Kozan Shinoda, a suibokuga (India-ink painting) artist, at an exhibition. Kozan becomes interested in Sousuke and surprisingly accepts him as his disciple. However, Kozan''s niece is dismissive of Sousuke and declares to compete with Sousuke for the "Kozan Award." Although Sousuke seemed uninterested in painting at first, he gradually becomes drawn to it by each stroke he draws...', 'Sousuke Aoyama is a college student who suffers painfully from the loss of his parents in a traffic accident. He meets Kozan Shinoda, a suibokuga (India-ink painting) artist, at an exhibition. Kozan becomes interested in Sousuke and surprisingly accepts him as his disciple. However, Kozan''s niece is dismissive of Sousuke and declares to compete with Sousuke for the "Kozan Award." Although Sousuke seemed uninterested in painting at first, he gradually becomes drawn to it by each stroke he draws...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEGntUceylAIDmTp9H6xckGCHmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961266'),
  ('707584714610428815', 'The Lineup', 1958, 'Crime', 'Don Siegel, Hal Mohr, Lawrence W. Butler', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Eli Wallach, Robert Keith, Richard Jaeckel, Mary LaRoche, William Leslie, Emile Meyer, Marshall Reed, Raymond Bailey', 'NR', 'In San Francisco, a psychopathic gangster and his mentor retrieve heroin packages carried by unsuspecting travelers.', 'In San Francisco, a psychopathic gangster and his mentor retrieve heroin packages carried by unsuspecting travelers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SyTNyeZpJ4lXoPBV7p8h5ek0Uy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24508'),
  ('894260255521167573', 'The Linguini Incident', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Richard Shepard, Robert D. Yeoman, Gary Marcus', 'Richard Shepard, Tamar Brott', 'Rosanna Arquette, David Bowie, Andre Gregory, Eszter Balint, Buck Henry, Viveca Lindfors, Marlee Matlin, Eloy Casados', null, 'A frustrated sorceress, a guy from the United Kingdom intimidated, a creative best friend.', 'A frustrated sorceress, a guy from the United Kingdom intimidated, a creative best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8sNxBOXxbXO7jO8DOOnf2wiAxC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47252'),
  ('745042121463984753', 'The Linnet', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Witold Leszczyński, Zbigniew Napiórkowski', 'Witold Leszczyński', 'Krzysztof Majchrzak, Anna Seniuk, Joanna Sienkiewicz, Jerzy Block, Marek Siudym, Tomasz Jarosiński, Franciszek Pieczka, Anna Milewska', null, 'Kaziuk, a stubborn peasant and his pregnant wife live in a backwood village, unaffected by the civilization. The village is once visited by a couple of wanderers, and strange things start to happen afterward. A new schoolteacher is sent to the area. She stirs erotic fantasies in Kaziuk. In a stir of frustration Kaziuk cuts down a family tree - a sacrilegious act in the eyes of his family. Going a step further and using a scythe for cutting the rye instead of a sickle brings the whole village against him.', 'Kaziuk, a stubborn peasant and his pregnant wife live in a backwood village, unaffected by the civilization. The village is once visited by a couple of wanderers, and strange things start to happen afterward. A new schoolteacher is sent to the area. She stirs erotic fantasies in Kaziuk. In a stir of frustration Kaziuk cuts down a family tree - a sacrilegious act in the eyes of his family. Going a step further and using a scythe for cutting the rye instead of a sickle brings the whole village against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3HjLvIAoilCAFQ9xwXQuK4vnEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81231'),
  ('380302166511104229', 'The Lion', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Ludovic Colbeau-Justin, Thomas Lerebour, Jérémy Mainguy', 'Alexandre Coquelle, Matthieu Le Naour', 'Dany Boon, Philippe Katerine, Anne Serra, Samuel Jouy, Sophie Verbeeck, Carole Brana, Benoît Pétré, Aksel Üstün', null, 'A psychiatric hospital patient pretends to be crazy. In charge of caring for this patient, a caregiver will begin to doubt the mental state of his "protégé".', 'A psychiatric hospital patient pretends to be crazy. In charge of caring for this patient, a caregiver will begin to doubt the mental state of his "protégé".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfLuACsPcwH6aonTKukn96d1qpp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589970'),
  ('1072674095557557510', 'The Lion and the Song', 1959, 'Animation', 'Břetislav Pojar, Vladimír Malík', 'Břetislav Pojar', null, null, 'A musician is playing his music to some animals, when a hungry lion shows up.', 'A musician is playing his music to some animals, when a hungry lion shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoylJCP2fUQrFYlqVBkoN1HtL3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284957'),
  ('142900631154396230', 'The Lion Child', 1993, 'Adventure, Family', 'Patrick Grandperret, Jean-Michel Humeau', 'Catherine K. Galodé', 'Mathurin Sinze, Souleyman Koli, Salif Keita, Sophie-Véronique Toué Tagbé, Sidy Lamine Diarra, Jean-René de Fleurieu', null, 'In the village of Pama, Sirga the lioness and Oule the young boy, born the same day, grow up together as sister and brother. Oule discovers the world alongside Sirga, and it is through her that he learns the secrets of the brush. He knows how to speak to the trees, the beasts, the bees and the wind. But one day, horsemen arrive from the Nord to take away all of the children of the village in chains and sell them into slavery. Oule and his friend Lena are bought by a nobleman of the high plains who, terrified by Oule''s powers, sends him into exile. But Oule posesses the strength of lions and he finds Sirga. With Lena, they will reconstruct the village of Pama...', 'In the village of Pama, Sirga the lioness and Oule the young boy, born the same day, grow up together as sister and brother. Oule discovers the world alongside Sirga, and it is through her that he learns the secrets of the brush. He knows how to speak to the trees, the beasts, the bees and the wind. But one day, horsemen arrive from the Nord to take away all of the children of the village in chains and sell them into slavery. Oule and his friend Lena are bought by a nobleman of the high plains who, terrified by Oule''s powers, sends him into exile. But Oule posesses the strength of lions and he finds Sirga. With Lena, they will reconstruct the village of Pama...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oDnWf9SRhey6iNRRar9BS0QTEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47480'),
  ('211092837517880620', 'The Lion Dance', 1936, 'Music, Documentary', 'Yasujirō Ozu', null, 'Kikugorô Onoe, Kinjirou Onoe, Shigeru Onoe, Wafuu Matsunaga, Shinzou Fujita, Izaburou Kashiwa, Tazaemon Morotsuki, Junji Masuda', null, 'The lion dance in traditional Japanese theatre.', 'The lion dance in traditional Japanese theatre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ef19lYxIiGkrJnHFNiGRrsZfpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201553'),
  ('951796625429534700', 'The Lion from Estrela', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Duarte, Manuel Guimarães, Regina Frois', 'Félix Bermudes, João Bastos, Ernesto Rodrigues', 'António Silva, Milú, Maria Eugénia, Erico Braga, Laura Alves, Curado Ribeiro, Artur Agostinho, Maria Olguim', null, 'Anastácio lives in Lisbon and is fanatic for Sporting CP, one of the city''s football teams. When the team travels to face Porto, he follows it with the family, staying in house of his friend, Mr. Barata, pretending to be rich.', 'Anastácio lives in Lisbon and is fanatic for Sporting CP, one of the city''s football teams. When the team travels to face Porto, he follows it with the family, staying in house of his friend, Mr. Barata, pretending to be rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRRCxX8jRphSbVqHCpVb3SuPkrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79128'),
  ('647910738310155853', 'The Lion Guard: Return of the Roar', 2016, 'Family, TV Movie, Animation, Adventure', 'Howy Parkins', 'Ford Riley', 'Max Charles, Joshua Rush, Madison Pettis, Andrew Kishino, Vargus Mason, Rob Lowe, Gabrielle Union, Eden Riegel', 'G', 'Set in the African savannah, the film follows Kion as he assembles the members of the ''Lion Guard''. Throughout the film, the diverse team of young animals will learn how to utilize each of their unique abilities to solve problems and accomplish tasks to maintain balance within the Circle of Life, while also introducing viewers to the vast array of animals that populate the prodigious African landscape.', 'Set in the African savannah, the film follows Kion as he assembles the members of the ''Lion Guard''. Throughout the film, the diverse team of young animals will learn how to utilize each of their unique abilities to solve problems and accomplish tasks to maintain balance within the Circle of Life, while also introducing viewers to the vast array of animals that populate the prodigious African landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzcQ7cQBHIdsKLN4exd7bCyy1pk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359983'),
  ('948829348236775005', 'The Lion Has Seven Heads', 1971, 'Drama', 'Glauber Rocha, Sébastien Kamba, Guido Cosulich', 'Glauber Rocha, Gianni Amico', 'Rada Rassimov, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Giulio Brogi, Hugo Carvana, Gabriele Tinti, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Baiack, Miguel', null, 'A white-robed preacher wanders and sermonizes across African lands; European communists and CIA spies conspire out of mutual self-interest to engineer the appointment of an African bourgeois to a puppet government presidency; and a revolutionary group marches in exile.', 'A white-robed preacher wanders and sermonizes across African lands; European communists and CIA spies conspire out of mutual self-interest to engineer the appointment of an African bourgeois to a puppet government presidency; and a revolutionary group marches in exile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggcVPHmCnufUKPp87PCgLzzITMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186908'),
  ('49295982347599412', 'The Lion Has Wings', 1939, 'Documentary, War', 'Adrian Brunel, Michael Powell, Brian Desmond Hurst', 'Adrian Brunel, E. V. H. Emmett', 'Merle Oberon, Ralph Richardson, June Duprez, Flora Robson, Robert Douglas, Anthony Bushell, Brian Worth, Austin Trevor', null, 'This early, influential propaganda film blends documentary and studio footage to show the valiant efforts of the Royal Air Force to defend the British people against the Nazis.', 'This early, influential propaganda film blends documentary and studio footage to show the valiant efforts of the Royal Air Force to defend the British people against the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guPhRJdo22N3sNROzlP3TI7Rr10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47197'),
  ('39731412071753968', 'The Lion Hunters', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Jean Rouch, Jean Rouch, Damouré Zika', null, 'Tahirou Koro, Issiaka Moussa, Belébia Moussa, Wangari Moussa, Yaya Koro, Osseini Dembo', null, 'Etnographic documentary about lion hunting in Africa.', 'Etnographic documentary about lion hunting in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dX6pWFc1iEUFrSN9HHIc3CDvUVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110770'),
  ('1127395991498897996', 'The Lion in Winter', 1968, 'Drama, History', 'Anthony Harvey, Douglas Slocombe, Kip Gowans', 'James Goldman', 'Peter O''Toole, Katharine Hepburn, Anthony Hopkins, John Castle, Nigel Terry, Timothy Dalton, Jane Merrow, Nigel Stock', 'PG', 'Henry II and his estranged queen, Eleanor of Aquitaine, battle over the choice of an heir.', 'Henry II and his estranged queen, Eleanor of Aquitaine, battle over the choice of an heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMgJnZADJObzfjA70ygXJkjnrFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18988'),
  ('1081901992824559201', 'The Lion in Winter', 2003, 'Drama, History, TV Movie, Romance', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Sergei Kozlov, Kieron Phipps', 'James Goldman', 'Glenn Close, Patrick Stewart, Andrew Howard, Antal Konrád, Rafe Spall, John Light, Soma Marko, Jonathan Rhys Meyers', null, 'King Henry II keeps his wife Eleanor locked away in the towers because of her frequent attempts to overthrow him. With Eleanor out of the way he can have his dalliances with his young mistress. Needless to say the queen is not pleased, although she still has affection for the king. Working through her sons, she plots the king''s demise and the rise of her second and preferred son, Richard, to the throne. The youngest, John, is an overweight buffoon and the only one holding his father''s affection is the king''s choice after the death of his first son, young Henry. But John is also overly eager for power and is willing to plot his father''s demise with middle brother Geoffrey and the young king of France, Phillip. Geoffrey sees his younger brother''s weakness and sees that route as his path to power. Political and court intrigue ensues.', 'King Henry II keeps his wife Eleanor locked away in the towers because of her frequent attempts to overthrow him. With Eleanor out of the way he can have his dalliances with his young mistress. Needless to say the queen is not pleased, although she still has affection for the king. Working through her sons, she plots the king''s demise and the rise of her second and preferred son, Richard, to the throne. The youngest, John, is an overweight buffoon and the only one holding his father''s affection is the king''s choice after the death of his first son, young Henry. But John is also overly eager for power and is willing to plot his father''s demise with middle brother Geoffrey and the young king of France, Phillip. Geoffrey sees his younger brother''s weakness and sees that route as his path to power. Political and court intrigue ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6yEfCBBMNp6jdny9AD4ZTG9tgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37945'),
  ('884020196353646345', 'The Lion King', 1994, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Adventure, Comedy', 'Roger Allers, Rob Minkoff', 'Jonathan Roberts, Linda Woolverton, Irene Mecchi', 'Matthew Broderick, Moira Kelly, Nathan Lane, Ernie Sabella, James Earl Jones, Jeremy Irons, Robert Guillaume, Rowan Atkinson', 'G', 'Young lion prince Simba, eager to one day become king of the Pride Lands, grows up under the watchful eye of his father Mufasa; all the while his villainous uncle Scar conspires to take the throne for himself. Amid betrayal and tragedy, Simba must confront his past and find his rightful place in the Circle of Life.', 'Young lion prince Simba, eager to one day become king of the Pride Lands, grows up under the watchful eye of his father Mufasa; all the while his villainous uncle Scar conspires to take the throne for himself. Amid betrayal and tragedy, Simba must confront his past and find his rightful place in the Circle of Life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKCr78MXSLixwmZ8DyJLrpMsd15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8587'),
  ('95204421503203126', 'The Lion King', 2019, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, Animation', 'Kim Richards, Caleb Deschanel, David H. Venghaus Jr.', 'Jeff Nathanson', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, John Oliver, Donald Glover, James Earl Jones, John Kani, Alfre Woodard, Beyoncé, JD McCrary', 'PG', 'Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub''s arrival. Scar, Mufasa''s brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba''s exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.', 'Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub''s arrival. Scar, Mufasa''s brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba''s exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420818'),
  ('204220242732103986', 'The Lion King 1½', 2004, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Bradley Raymond', 'Tom Rogers', 'Nathan Lane, Ernie Sabella, Julie Kavner, Jerry Stiller, Matthew Broderick, Robert Guillaume, Moira Kelly, Whoopi Goldberg', 'G', 'Timon the meerkat and Pumbaa the warthog are best pals and the unsung heroes of the African savanna. This prequel to the smash Disney animated adventure takes you back -- way back -- before Simba''s adventure began. You''ll find out all about Timon and Pumbaa and tag along as they search for the perfect home and attempt to raise a rambunctious lion cub.', 'Timon the meerkat and Pumbaa the warthog are best pals and the unsung heroes of the African savanna. This prequel to the smash Disney animated adventure takes you back -- way back -- before Simba''s adventure began. You''ll find out all about Timon and Pumbaa and tag along as they search for the perfect home and attempt to raise a rambunctious lion cub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2hN0WT7Dz46HfhQbr6uzSYfVW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11430'),
  ('52272461838826261', 'The Lion King II: Simba''s Pride', 1998, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Darrell Rooney, Rob LaDuca, Jamie Thomason', 'Flip Kobler, Cindy Marcus', 'Matthew Broderick, Neve Campbell, Jason Marsden, Nathan Lane, Ernie Sabella, Andy Dick, Robert Guillaume, James Earl Jones', 'G', 'The circle of life continues for Simba, now fully grown and in his rightful place as the king of Pride Rock. Simba and Nala have given birth to a daughter, Kiara who''s as rebellious as her father was. But Kiara drives her parents to distraction when she catches the eye of Kovu, the son of the evil lioness, Zira. Will Kovu steal Kiara''s heart?', 'The circle of life continues for Simba, now fully grown and in his rightful place as the king of Pride Rock. Simba and Nala have given birth to a daughter, Kiara who''s as rebellious as her father was. But Kiara drives her parents to distraction when she catches the eye of Kovu, the son of the evil lioness, Zira. Will Kovu steal Kiara''s heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWR1x6UCMCGN9xEf8RGhPS934X0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9732'),
  ('741321971873796902', 'The Lion of Flanders', 1985, 'History, Drama, War', 'Hugo Claus', 'Hendrik Conscience, Hugo Claus', 'Jan Decleir, Frank Aendenboom, Theu Boermans, Julien Schoenaerts, Josine van Dalsum, Herbert Flack, Filip Peeters, Vic de Wachter', null, 'A tale centered on the Battle of the Golden Spurs in 1302 where the Flemish rank and file won a major victory over the glorious French knights.', 'A tale centered on the Battle of the Golden Spurs in 1302 where the Flemish rank and file won a major victory over the glorious French knights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sme8srhuPiY2BHYbnZOwn9ufJ8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52260'),
  ('194259354239475136', 'The Lion Roars', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Cheung Man-Po', 'Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Ivy Kong Yuk-Yee, Sunny Chan Wing-Sun', 'Louis Koo, Cecilia Cheung, Fan Bingbing, Wyman Wong Wai-Man, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Emotion Cheung Kam-Ching, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Joe Lee Yiu-Ming', null, 'During the Soong Dynasty, a beautiful woman named Liu is searching for a husband, but is unable to find one until she hears the avant-garde poetry of Chen. Soon the two are married and Chen discovers that his new bride is violently temperamental and insanely jealous, who limits his activities and lifestyle. When a princess falls in love with the poet and the Emperor decrees that Chen must take the princess in as a second-wife. The love between Liu and Chen is put to the test.', 'During the Soong Dynasty, a beautiful woman named Liu is searching for a husband, but is unable to find one until she hears the avant-garde poetry of Chen. Soon the two are married and Chen discovers that his new bride is violently temperamental and insanely jealous, who limits his activities and lifestyle. When a princess falls in love with the poet and the Emperor decrees that Chen must take the princess in as a second-wife. The love between Liu and Chen is put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUr7VBrJCQtcTtW0ZAKI7BjFdRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206664'),
  ('675188242980826779', 'The Lion Sleeps Tonight', 2018, 'Drama', 'Nobuhiro Suwa', 'Nobuhiro Suwa', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Pauline Étienne, Maud Wyler, Arthur Harari, Isabelle Weingarten, Noë Sampy, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Jean-Louis Berard', null, 'An aging movie actor who is preparing to shoot a death scene finds himself visited by the spirit of a dead, long-ago lover.', 'An aging movie actor who is preparing to shoot a death scene finds himself visited by the spirit of a dead, long-ago lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XMUOQQrEcPRz4F7xc37psvsSpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475954'),
  ('496879487949863116', 'The Lion Standing in the Wind', 2015, 'Drama', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Hiroshi Saito', 'Takao Osawa, Satomi Ishihara, Yoko Maki, Masato Hagiwara, Ryohei Suzuki, Ayako Fujitani, Hajime Yamazaki, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'Koichiro Shimada is sent to a research facility in Kenya, Africa by a teaching hospital in Japan. He encounters a desperate situation and decides to work there as a doctor, treating patients hurt in battles. He struggles with nurses and colleagues at the hospital. Koichiro Shimada then encounters a boy soldier severely wounded mentally. This changes Koichiro Shimada’s fate.', 'Koichiro Shimada is sent to a research facility in Kenya, Africa by a teaching hospital in Japan. He encounters a desperate situation and decides to work there as a doctor, treating patients hurt in battles. He struggles with nurses and colleagues at the hospital. Koichiro Shimada then encounters a boy soldier severely wounded mentally. This changes Koichiro Shimada’s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inancpFhkV1EBvmziK904WoBddr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363425'),
  ('1102576475692198796', 'The Lion Woman', 2016, 'Drama', 'Vibeke Idsøe, Dan Laustsen', 'Vibeke Idsøe', 'Rolf Lassgård, Kjersti Tveterås, Ida Ursin-Holm, Rolf Kristian Larsen, Lisa Loven Kongsli, Connie Nielsen, Karen-Lise Mynster, Henrik Mestad', null, 'Eva Arctander is born with hypertrichosis, meaning that she is covered from head to toe with fine blonde hair. Her father is so ashamed of her that he hides her away from the world in their apartment. However, Eva’s nanny fights for her right to be treated like everyone else.', 'Eva Arctander is born with hypertrichosis, meaning that she is covered from head to toe with fine blonde hair. Her father is so ashamed of her that he hides her away from the world in their apartment. However, Eva’s nanny fights for her right to be treated like everyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jE3pFIN42ykmgcMLwDGjqwcmUI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377690'),
  ('1130056913933070921', 'The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe', 1979, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Bill Melendez, Jim Duffy, Carol Leith', null, 'Rachel Warren, Susan Sokol, Reg Williams, Simon Adams, Victor Spinetti, Dick Vosburgh, Don Parker, Liz Proud', null, 'This Emmy Award winner for Best Animated Special is based on the first book of C.S. Lewis'' acclaimed series, "The Chronicles of Narnia." Four children pass through a mystic portal in a wardrobe and discover the magical kingdom of Narnia, a land of talking animals and mythical creatures. There, an evil witch''s spell has cast the land into eternal winter. Fearing that an ancient prophecy is coming to fruition, and that the children are Narnia''s rightful rulers, the White Witch tricks their youngest brother into betraying his family, enacting an ancient magic that she can use to halt the fulfillment of the prophecy. Now, only Aslan, noble lion and High King above all kings in Narnia, can help them defeat the witch, restore springtime to Narnia, and claim their rightful places on the throne.', 'This Emmy Award winner for Best Animated Special is based on the first book of C.S. Lewis'' acclaimed series, "The Chronicles of Narnia." Four children pass through a mystic portal in a wardrobe and discover the magical kingdom of Narnia, a land of talking animals and mythical creatures. There, an evil witch''s spell has cast the land into eternal winter. Fearing that an ancient prophecy is coming to fruition, and that the children are Narnia''s rightful rulers, the White Witch tricks their youngest brother into betraying his family, enacting an ancient magic that she can use to halt the fulfillment of the prophecy. Now, only Aslan, noble lion and High King above all kings in Narnia, can help them defeat the witch, restore springtime to Narnia, and claim their rightful places on the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ebzw3VOkceR4gq9w3ZQ5nptOS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40611'),
  ('761250904310907544', 'The Lion''s Busy', 1950, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'In an African jungle, hungry Beaky Buzzard can''t wait until Leo the Lion is decently deceased before trying to devour him. Leo takes a rocket to the Moon to try to escape Beaky, but finds Beaky already there waiting for him.', 'In an African jungle, hungry Beaky Buzzard can''t wait until Leo the Lion is decently deceased before trying to devour him. Leo takes a rocket to the Moon to try to escape Beaky, but finds Beaky already there waiting for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrFGKt6or7ZedgWUff5OoHGcNLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188783'),
  ('257994455621908148', 'The Lion''s Share', 1978, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Jorge Gundín, Adolfo Aristarain, Claudio Reiter', 'Adolfo Aristarain', 'Julio De Grazia, Luisina Brando, Fernanda Mistral, Julio Chávez, Ulises Dumont, Arturo Maly, Osvaldo Terranova, Beba Bidart', null, 'Story of a ordinary human being who, by chance, take possession of the money that was stolen from a bank, thinking that will solve all his problems.', 'Story of a ordinary human being who, by chance, take possession of the money that was stolen from a bank, thinking that will solve all his problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeOnC06cAtsJcXrTlIbqkOIo9fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215868'),
  ('256754891931995253', 'The Lions Are Loose', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Michel Audiard', 'Claudia Cardinale, Jean-Claude Brialy, Michèle Morgan, Danielle Darrieux, Lino Ventura, Darry Cowl, Jean Ozenne, Denise Provence', null, 'A young woman leaves her hometown and husband to explore Paris, where she becomes entangled in a rivalry between a doctor and a novelist in high society.', 'A young woman leaves her hometown and husband to explore Paris, where she becomes entangled in a rivalry between a doctor and a novelist in high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqNU3eq5MpwBoUvV4pAuRjUMBUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76748'),
  ('494817305921682818', 'The Lions by the River Tigris', 2026, 'Documentary, Family, History', 'Zaradasht Ahmed', 'Zaradasht Ahmed', 'Bashar, Fadel, Fakhri', null, 'In Mosul, a city devastated during the battle for liberation from the Islamic State, the fight to heal and preserve its identity, culture, and art is not over. Three men refuse to let Mosul remain in ruins.', 'In Mosul, a city devastated during the battle for liberation from the Islamic State, the fight to heal and preserve its identity, culture, and art is not over. Three men refuse to let Mosul remain in ruins.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fb%2Fgracenote%2Fb129b11b617be8de925e85807eacbe40.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-lions-by-the-river-tigris'),
  ('378427165681279015', 'The Liquidator', 1965, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jack Cardiff, David Tomblin, Edward Scaife', 'Peter Yeldham', 'Rod Taylor, Trevor Howard, Jill St. John, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Eric Sykes, John Le Mesurier, Derek Nimmo, David Tomlinson', 'NR', 'Lighthearted spy drama about Boysie Oakes, who takes a nice job with the British Secret Service, enjoys all the perks, and signs all the forms before learning that his job depends on murdering people, and not romancing all the beautiful civilian staff in Whitehall.', 'Lighthearted spy drama about Boysie Oakes, who takes a nice job with the British Secret Service, enjoys all the perks, and signs all the forms before learning that his job depends on murdering people, and not romancing all the beautiful civilian staff in Whitehall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imi3N0uyOsfRLmLMTgIidh9rHJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26199'),
  ('390277283997893229', 'The Liquidator', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jizhou Xu, Yang Yufei', 'Jizhou Xu', 'Deng Chao, Ethan Juan, Liu Shishi, Wen Qi, Yu Ailei, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Guo Jingfei, He Hongshan', null, 'A criminal psychologist and a forensic expert works together to track down a serial killer who targets people who have been acquitted of notable crimes and uses their guilt as his modus operandi.', 'A criminal psychologist and a forensic expert works together to track down a serial killer who targets people who have been acquitted of notable crimes and uses their guilt as his modus operandi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bv3yYIMU9C3iiH9GcL4SbGHcyIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494858'),
  ('980682064594083281', 'The List', 2007, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Gary Wheeler, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Johnston H. Moore, Michelle Hoppe, Gary Wheeler', 'Malcolm McDowell, Chuck Carrington, Hilarie Burton, Pat Hingle, Mary Beth Peil, Will Patton, Frank Hoyt Taylor, Tim Ware', 'PG', 'A sudden death tied to a list from the past leads to unimaginable evil. Fresh out of law school and full of hope for the future, Renny Jacobson is stunned by his father''s sudden death--and then by the terms of the will: the elder Jacobson has left the bulk of his estate to charity.', 'A sudden death tied to a list from the past leads to unimaginable evil. Fresh out of law school and full of hope for the future, Renny Jacobson is stunned by his father''s sudden death--and then by the terms of the will: the elder Jacobson has left the bulk of his estate to charity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LgBFdLKTZQwquWcQZHYTRE27ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14600'),
  ('870008610041163047', 'The List', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Melissa Miller Costanzo, Broderick Engelhard', 'Steve Vitolo, Rob Lederer', 'Halston Sage, Christian Navarro, Shelley Hennig, Geoff Pierson, Gregg Sulkin, Lucy DeVito, Clark Backo, Brendan Meyer', 'R', 'After her fiance sleeps with a celebrity on his free pass list, Abby Meyers, with nothing but five names and a fantasy shared by millions, sets out for Los Angeles to sleep with someone from hers.', 'After her fiance sleeps with a celebrity on his free pass list, Abby Meyers, with nothing but five names and a fantasy shared by millions, sets out for Los Angeles to sleep with someone from hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0MdxxoNAzuANVnZkZcD15W1d5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151344'),
  ('1061172253144403578', 'The List of Adrian Messenger', 1963, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'John Huston, Joseph MacDonald, Edward Scaife', 'Anthony Veiller', 'George C. Scott, Kirk Douglas, Dana Wynter, Clive Brook, Gladys Cooper, Herbert Marshall, Jacques Roux, John Merivale', 'NR', 'Adrian Messenger, a famous writer, asks his friend Anthony Gethryn, a former British agent, to help him investigate the whereabouts of the people who appear on a list, without asking him the reason why he should do so.', 'Adrian Messenger, a famous writer, asks his friend Anthony Gethryn, a former British agent, to help him investigate the whereabouts of the people who appear on a list, without asking him the reason why he should do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kegT7mgLFZc69exeq4sE3qxIHew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11605'),
  ('145048402803247808', 'The List of My Desires', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Didier Le Pêcheur, Myriam Vinocour', 'Didier Le Pêcheur, Delphine Labouret', 'Mathilde Seigner, Marc Lavoine, Frédérique Bel, Virginie Hocq, Patrick Chesnais, Tiphaine Haas, Julien Boisselier, Michel Vuillermoz', null, 'When the little haberdasher Arras discovers she''s won 18 million in the lottery and can now afford anything she wants, she has only one fear: losing the small joys of life made simple it cherishes above all. But fate is obstinate, and this is giving too long this good fortune will trigger it, despite herself, a hurricane that will change everything. Everything except her.', 'When the little haberdasher Arras discovers she''s won 18 million in the lottery and can now afford anything she wants, she has only one fear: losing the small joys of life made simple it cherishes above all. But fate is obstinate, and this is giving too long this good fortune will trigger it, despite herself, a hurricane that will change everything. Everything except her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5a4QIJ7Zvbhez9YM2OY53qAto0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277230'),
  ('335246912327333826', 'The Listener', 2024, 'Drama', 'Steve Buscemi, Anka Malatynska, LaTrisa Jackson', 'Alessandro Camon', 'Tessa Thompson, Logan Marshall-Green, Derek Cecil, Margaret Cho, Blu del Barrio, Ricky Velez, Alia Shawkat, Jamie Hector', null, 'Beth is a helpline volunteer – part of the small army that gets on the phone every night across America, fielding calls from all kinds of people feeling lonely, broken, hopeless. Over the last year the tide has become a tsunami. As Beth goes through her shift, the stakes rise: is this the night she will lose someone? Save someone? Eventually, Beth’s own story comes to light, revealing why she does it. All along we remain with her: listening, comforting, connecting – patching the world back together, one stitch at a time.', 'Beth is a helpline volunteer – part of the small army that gets on the phone every night across America, fielding calls from all kinds of people feeling lonely, broken, hopeless. Over the last year the tide has become a tsunami. As Beth goes through her shift, the stakes rise: is this the night she will lose someone? Save someone? Eventually, Beth’s own story comes to light, revealing why she does it. All along we remain with her: listening, comforting, connecting – patching the world back together, one stitch at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ldRGB2xBeXJKxo5KqUOZcq35rW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914243'),
  ('505694390129910281', 'The Listening', 2006, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Giacomo Martelli, Eric Maddison', 'Riccardo Brun, Inigo Dominguez, Giacomo Martelli', 'Michael Parks, Maya Sansa, Vincent Riotta, Matt Patresi, James Parks, Andrea Tidona, Bruce McGuire, Vincent Riotta', 'PG-13', 'Estranged by the degree of corporate influence within the largest U.S. listening station in the world, an aging NSA officer defects and mounts a clandestine counter-listening station high in the Italian alps.', 'Estranged by the degree of corporate influence within the largest U.S. listening station in the world, an aging NSA officer defects and mounts a clandestine counter-listening station high in the Italian alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJQjjDrV0gMIZ4l0ARKKqQLYf7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23843'),
  ('389864327828159641', 'The Litterbug', 1961, 'Animation', 'Hamilton Luske', null, 'Clarence Nash, John Dehner', null, 'Donald and his nephews are litterbugs: they drop garbage everywhere they go - even when they are out for a drive in Donald''s car - until they are stopped by a policeman who makes them pick up everything they have dropped.', 'Donald and his nephews are litterbugs: they drop garbage everywhere they go - even when they are out for a drive in Donald''s car - until they are stopped by a policeman who makes them pick up everything they have dropped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TN0YDfap5VXS4RxcusN90u85ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67591'),
  ('1029216562452773610', 'The Little Alien', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Amalie Næsby Fick', 'Amalie Næsby Fick', 'Jesper Christensen, Anders W. Berthelsen, Bodil Jørgensen, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Louis Næss-Schmidt, Sofie Torp, Peter Frödin, Sara Fanta Traore', null, 'It''s the summer holiday, and Little Allan is home alone. But his older neighbor Helge will take care of him. Helge is fascinated by space, and it doesn''t take long before Little Allan is pulled into Helge''s plan to get in contact with aliens.', 'It''s the summer holiday, and Little Allan is home alone. But his older neighbor Helge will take care of him. Helge is fascinated by space, and it doesn''t take long before Little Allan is pulled into Helge''s plan to get in contact with aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66OgShb92ZCSJxMe3pvhCUOLKcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885021'),
  ('274869262250391579', 'The Little Apartment', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Isidoro M. Ferry, Marco Ferreri, Francisco Sempere', 'Rafael Azcona, Marco Ferreri', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Mary Carrillo, Concha López Silva, Ángel Álvarez, María Luisa Ponte, Andrea Moro, Gregorio Saugar, Celia Conde', null, 'Rodolfo and Petrita each live in separate quarters in dilapidated Madrid, while looking to have a little apartment (or "pisito", in Spanish dialect). Unfortunately their low salaries prevent them from acquiring one. Soon, Rodolfo''s co-workers urge him to marry the old and frail Doña Martina, who is the main tenant in the apartment he boards in. According to Spanish rent-control law, he could inherit the lease from his spouse. Thus begin his misgivings and Petrita''s. Written by Emilio', 'Rodolfo and Petrita each live in separate quarters in dilapidated Madrid, while looking to have a little apartment (or "pisito", in Spanish dialect). Unfortunately their low salaries prevent them from acquiring one. Soon, Rodolfo''s co-workers urge him to marry the old and frail Doña Martina, who is the main tenant in the apartment he boards in. According to Spanish rent-control law, he could inherit the lease from his spouse. Thus begin his misgivings and Petrita''s. Written by Emilio', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dStiJbDzWC1Edkr5eYWmCq0ZONU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110924'),
  ('517013399525981092', 'The Little Apocalypse', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Durul Taylan, Yağmur Taylan', 'Doğu Yücel', 'Başak Köklükaya, Cansel Elçin, Binnur Kaya, İlker Aksum, Bora Akkaş, Serra Gürgünlü, Ece Ekşi, Arda Seçilmiş', null, 'Having lost her mother in the 1999 earthquake, Bilge and her family go on a vacation to the south. On the way to their rented house, she sees a series of visions. Things get worse when a small earthquake occurs, bringing back memories of her loss and releasing her inner demons.', 'Having lost her mother in the 1999 earthquake, Bilge and her family go on a vacation to the south. On the way to their rented house, she sees a series of visions. Things get worse when a small earthquake occurs, bringing back memories of her loss and releasing her inner demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZ66GfBwI7Ah1WuW7eR7DK6qoZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52137'),
  ('284695785327711415', 'The Little Bather', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Robert Dhéry, Jean Tournier, Clément Claude', 'Claude Clément, Robert Dhéry, Colette Brosset', 'Louis de Funès, Andréa Parisy, Franco Fabrizi, Michel Galabru, Robert Dhéry, Colette Brosset, Pierre Dac, Jacques Legras', null, 'Louis-Philippe Fourchaume, another typical lead-role for French comedy superstar Louis de Funès, is the dictatorial CEO of a French company which designs and produces sail yachts, and fires in yet another tantrum his designer André Castagnier, not realizing that man is his only chance to land a vital contract with the Italian magnate Marcello Cacciaperotti. So he has to find him at his extremely rural birthplace in ''la France profonde'', which proves a torturous odyssey for the spoiled rich man; when he does get there his torment is far from over: the country bumpkin refuses to resume his slavish position now the shoe is on the other foot, so Fourchaume is dragged along in the boorish family life, and at times unable to control his temper, which may cost him more credit then he painstakingly builds up...', 'Louis-Philippe Fourchaume, another typical lead-role for French comedy superstar Louis de Funès, is the dictatorial CEO of a French company which designs and produces sail yachts, and fires in yet another tantrum his designer André Castagnier, not realizing that man is his only chance to land a vital contract with the Italian magnate Marcello Cacciaperotti. So he has to find him at his extremely rural birthplace in ''la France profonde'', which proves a torturous odyssey for the spoiled rich man; when he does get there his torment is far from over: the country bumpkin refuses to resume his slavish position now the shoe is on the other foot, so Fourchaume is dragged along in the boorish family life, and at times unable to control his temper, which may cost him more credit then he painstakingly builds up...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scxiE4uHetFNXLsdSycWG7Elb2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46655'),
