  ('307248540942640054', 'The Little Gangster', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, William Lubtchansky', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Richard Anconina, Gérald Thomassin, Clotilde Courau, Jocelyne Perhirin, Cécile Reigher, Daniel Villanova, Dominique Huchede, Ananda Regi', null, 'Marc, a troubled teenager, is bored in his native, depressing city of Sete. One day, a simple phone call makes him aware of the existence of Stephanie, a sister he has never met. Armed with a pistol his mother found, he goes out to find her. He steals money from a perfume shop, and is then stopped by a policeman who wants to search him. In the car, Marc threatens the policeman with his gun, demanding that he helps him find his sister...', 'Marc, a troubled teenager, is bored in his native, depressing city of Sete. One day, a simple phone call makes him aware of the existence of Stephanie, a sister he has never met. Armed with a pistol his mother found, he goes out to find her. He steals money from a perfume shop, and is then stopped by a policeman who wants to search him. In the car, Marc threatens the policeman with his gun, demanding that he helps him find his sister...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11Rof8z20wAl6efs001ydiZMRvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162827'),
  ('848089787026143950', 'The Little Ghost', 2013, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Alain Gsponer, Norbert Kiehne', 'Martin Ritzenhoff', 'Uwe Ochsenknecht, Herbert Knaup, Jonas Holdenrieder, Emily Kusche, Bettina Stucky, Sandra Borgmann, Stephan Kampwirth, Aljoscha Stadelmann', null, 'The Little Ghost lives in the castle over looking a small town and awakens for precisely one hour after the clock strikes midnight. Follow him on this adventure to see his first sunrise ever!', 'The Little Ghost lives in the castle over looking a small town and awakens for precisely one hour after the clock strikes midnight. Follow him on this adventure to see his first sunrise ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mV1O1mlP1YHg3jJz38Zw72FWLfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235044'),
  ('487675393534639635', 'The Little Giant', 1933, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Roy Del Ruth, Sidney Hickox', 'Robert Lord, Wilson Mizner', 'Edward G. Robinson, Mary Astor, Helen Vinson, Russell Hopton, Kenneth Thomson, Shirley Grey, Berton Churchill, Don Dillaway', 'NR', 'Prohibition is ending so bootlegger Bugs Ahearn decides to crack California society. He leases a house from down-on-her-luck Ruth and hires her as social secretary. He rescues Polly Cass from a horsefall and goes home to meet her dad who sells him some phony stock certificates. When he learns about this he sends to Chicago for mob help.', 'Prohibition is ending so bootlegger Bugs Ahearn decides to crack California society. He leases a house from down-on-her-luck Ruth and hires her as social secretary. He rescues Polly Cass from a horsefall and goes home to meet her dad who sells him some phony stock certificates. When he learns about this he sends to Chicago for mob help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7YHYu2JO0zBCEsBW8lKRBvpTgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27991'),
  ('949607817012187303', 'The Little Girl and Her Cat', 1899, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Madeleine Koehler', null, 'A little girl sits at a table, holding a container of what appears to be some sort of food. Suddenly there''s a flash of movement: a tortoiseshell cat, with long hair and a very furry tail, has leapt onto the table.', 'A little girl sits at a table, holding a container of what appears to be some sort of food. Suddenly there''s a flash of movement: a tortoiseshell cat, with long hair and a very furry tail, has leapt onto the table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8SjHWNQuBfPhGQQhTv5MxLQFL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195286'),
