  ('1127609354825904513', 'The Little Girl Who Lives Down the Lane', 1976, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nicolas Gessner, Charles Braive, Justine Héroux', 'Laird Koenig', 'Jodie Foster, Martin Sheen, Alexis Smith, Mort Shuman, Scott Jacoby, Dorothy Davis, Clesson Goodhue, Hubert Noël', 'PG', '13-year-old Rynn Jacobs lives in a New England beach town. Whenever the landlady inquires after Rynn''s father, she claims that he''s not available. But when the landlady''s son, Frank, won''t leave Rynn alone, she teams up with a neighbor Mario to maintain the dark family secret that she''s been keeping to herself.', '13-year-old Rynn Jacobs lives in a New England beach town. Whenever the landlady inquires after Rynn''s father, she claims that he''s not available. But when the landlady''s son, Frank, won''t leave Rynn alone, she teams up with a neighbor Mario to maintain the dark family secret that she''s been keeping to herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlH7atDoN2iOmq6pNsoFIlebhgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19971'),
