  ('848215028507058223', 'The Little House', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori', 'Emiko Hiramatsu, Yoji Yamada', 'Takako Matsu, Haru Kuroki, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Chieko Baisho, Yui Natsukawa, Yukijiro Hotaru, Isao Hashizume, Kazuko Yoshiyuki', null, 'Following the death of the unmarried and childless Taki, Takeshi, a young relative of hers, discovers several pages of closely written lines in which the old lady has recorded her memories. This is how he learns the truth about her youth working as a housemaid and nanny for the Hirai family in a little house in Tokyo with a red gabled roof.', 'Following the death of the unmarried and childless Taki, Takeshi, a young relative of hers, discovers several pages of closely written lines in which the old lady has recorded her memories. This is how he learns the truth about her youth working as a housemaid and nanny for the Hirai family in a little house in Tokyo with a red gabled roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfi1kRQv3kf6Ws8kxJ5jWM8vFvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254679'),
  ('1117820821618189021', 'The Little Hut', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Robson, Freddie Young', 'F. Hugh Herbert', 'Ava Gardner, Stewart Granger, David Niven, Walter Chiari, Finlay Currie, Jean Cadell, Henry Oscar, Viola Lyel', null, 'Sir Philip Ashlow (Stewart Granger), his neglected wife, Lady Ashlow (Ava Gardner) and his best friend Henry Brittingham-Brett (David Niven) are shipwrecked on a desert island. This potential ménage à trois where the two men compete for the lady''s attention is interrupted by the unexpected arrival of a fourth inhabitant of the island.', 'Sir Philip Ashlow (Stewart Granger), his neglected wife, Lady Ashlow (Ava Gardner) and his best friend Henry Brittingham-Brett (David Niven) are shipwrecked on a desert island. This potential ménage à trois where the two men compete for the lady''s attention is interrupted by the unexpected arrival of a fourth inhabitant of the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8X0o3vDNfQ75GQa10Inan7Y7cCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138699'),
  ('87114923436726905', 'The Little Island', 1958, 'Animation', 'Richard Williams', 'Richard Williams', null, null, 'Depicts the dreams, ideas, and struggles of three men (representing "truth," "beauty," and "good") who settle on a tiny island.', 'Depicts the dreams, ideas, and struggles of three men (representing "truth," "beauty," and "good") who settle on a tiny island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBpi7unZl5QyctMXpFfhp1YJZlT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56664'),
  ('266483757968548903', 'The little man', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Nikos Gardelis, Markos Zervas', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Kostas Voutsas, Martha Karagianni, Spyros Kalogirou, Nitsa Marouda, Mary Metaxa, Mitsi Konstadara, Giorgos Tsitsopoulos, Nasos Kedrakas', null, 'Eftixios is a very decent, low profile man in love with his employee , an ambitious girl who wants to be an actress .Their life becomes upside down when a friend butcher wants to enter filming business.', 'Eftixios is a very decent, low profile man in love with his employee , an ambitious girl who wants to be an actress .Their life becomes upside down when a friend butcher wants to enter filming business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VLcyOQMie2cc6TTNicMY3W1cfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368180'),
  ('159115875640762474', 'The Little Match Girl', 1928, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jean Renoir, Jean Bachelet, Simone Amiguet', 'Jean Renoir', 'Catherine Hessling, Eric Barclay, Jean Storm, Manuel Raaby, Amy Wells, Guy Ferrant, Mme. Heuschling, Comtesse Tolstoi', null, 'An impoverished girl tries to sell matches on New Year''s Eve. Shivering with cold and unable to sell her wares, she sits in a sheltered nook. Striking a match to keep warm, the flame shows her what''s beyond.', 'An impoverished girl tries to sell matches on New Year''s Eve. Shivering with cold and unable to sell her wares, she sits in a sheltered nook. Striking a match to keep warm, the flame shows her what''s beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGvx4Lqhir9xCtfY36z1PmpiePU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36260'),
  ('213120052423193605', 'The Little Match Girl', 1937, 'Animation, Family', 'Arthur Davis, Sid Marcus', null, null, null, 'A small girl makes her living selling matches on the streets of New York. It''s winter, and the hustling crowds at best ignore her, and some are outright rude. She takes shelter and, to try to stave off the cold a bit, lights a match. It gets blown out; this happens again, then on the third try, she falls into a dream. In this dream, cherubs attend her, she gets a new doll, then a new dress. The cherubs put her on a throne. Then a storm comes, and she goes toward a candle. That candle goes out, and we see that back in the real world, so did her match and her life. An angel comes along and takes her soul.', 'A small girl makes her living selling matches on the streets of New York. It''s winter, and the hustling crowds at best ignore her, and some are outright rude. She takes shelter and, to try to stave off the cold a bit, lights a match. It gets blown out; this happens again, then on the third try, she falls into a dream. In this dream, cherubs attend her, she gets a new doll, then a new dress. The cherubs put her on a throne. Then a storm comes, and she goes toward a candle. That candle goes out, and we see that back in the real world, so did her match and her life. An angel comes along and takes her soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcnzNWKsL4yf4QHB2pgNCLpJlUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219543'),
  ('683069711241368839', 'The Little Matchgirl', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Roger Allers', null, null, 'G', 'An animated short based on Hans Christian Andersen''s tale about a poor young girl with a burning desire to find comfort and happiness in her life. Desperate to keep warm, the girl lights the matches she sells, and envisions a very different life for herself in the fiery flames filled with images of loving relatives, bountiful food, and a place to call home.', 'An animated short based on Hans Christian Andersen''s tale about a poor young girl with a burning desire to find comfort and happiness in her life. Desperate to keep warm, the girl lights the matches she sells, and envisions a very different life for herself in the fiery flames filled with images of loving relatives, bountiful food, and a place to call home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GmeFUrGNdbXbWWjd78iDCmE4Ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38580'),
  ('263907324635770237', 'The Little Mermaid', 1968, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Ivan Aksenchuk, Mikhail Druyan, Lydia Kovalevskaya', 'Aleksandr Galich', 'Nina Gulyayeva, Viktoriya Ivanova, Anatoliy Papanov, Yuliya Yulskaya, Lidiya Korolyova, Vladimir Troshin, Roza Makagonova', null, 'Rusalochka opens in modern day Copenhagen, Denmark. Several tourists gather around the capital''s famous mermaid statue, as a tour guide explains its significance. A fish in the water below the tourists scoffs at their foolishness, and then, proceeds to tell about the doomed love of the mermaid. Upon reaching her 15th birthday, the Little Mermaid is allowed to swim up to the surface above. As soon as she does, however, the Mermaid spots a young prince caught up in a dreadful storm. She admires the man''s bravery and decides to save him, declaring that, "The beautiful and the brave should not perish." After the mermaid returns to the ocean, she decides that she wants to become human.', 'Rusalochka opens in modern day Copenhagen, Denmark. Several tourists gather around the capital''s famous mermaid statue, as a tour guide explains its significance. A fish in the water below the tourists scoffs at their foolishness, and then, proceeds to tell about the doomed love of the mermaid. Upon reaching her 15th birthday, the Little Mermaid is allowed to swim up to the surface above. As soon as she does, however, the Mermaid spots a young prince caught up in a dreadful storm. She admires the man''s bravery and decides to save him, declaring that, "The beautiful and the brave should not perish." After the mermaid returns to the ocean, she decides that she wants to become human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uG7wWSmdEssgYZxXB0L7mFJE929.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90277'),
  ('47440414342326829', 'The Little Mermaid', 1976, 'Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Vladimir Bychkov, Emil Vagenstein, Boris Golev', 'Grigori Yagdfeld, Viktor Vitkovich', 'Viktoriya Novikova, Valentin Nikulin, Galina Artyomova, Yuri Senkevich, Galina Volchek, Stefan Iliev, Mikhail Pugovkin, Svetlana Mojseyenko', null, 'A little Mermaid falls in love with a Prince whom she saves during a storm. Using all kinds of magical incantations in exchange for the Mermaid’s beautiful blue hair, a witch replaces her fish tail with human legs, making it possible for the Mermaid to walk and live on earth at the cost of great pain with every step she takes. The Little Mermaid willingly suffers through these trials only to be near her beloved. But the Prince, not realizing how lucky he is, becomes enamored with a beautiful but vain princess.', 'A little Mermaid falls in love with a Prince whom she saves during a storm. Using all kinds of magical incantations in exchange for the Mermaid’s beautiful blue hair, a witch replaces her fish tail with human legs, making it possible for the Mermaid to walk and live on earth at the cost of great pain with every step she takes. The Little Mermaid willingly suffers through these trials only to be near her beloved. But the Prince, not realizing how lucky he is, becomes enamored with a beautiful but vain princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePjh9sY0eN2W7c1YYsVR3wDkA3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215478'),
  ('425519685777432797', 'The Little Mermaid', 1989, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'John Musker, Ron Clements, Ruben A. Aquino', 'John Musker, Ron Clements', 'Jodi Benson, Samuel E. Wright, Pat Carroll, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Kenneth Mars, Buddy Hackett, Jason Marin, René Auberjonois', 'G', 'This colorful adventure tells the story of an impetuous mermaid princess named Ariel who falls in love with the very human Prince Eric and puts everything on the line for the chance to be with him. Memorable songs and characters -- including the villainous sea witch Ursula.', 'This colorful adventure tells the story of an impetuous mermaid princess named Ariel who falls in love with the very human Prince Eric and puts everything on the line for the chance to be with him. Memorable songs and characters -- including the villainous sea witch Ursula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plcZXvI310FkbwIptvd6rqk63LP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10144'),
  ('906828828320330524', 'The Little Mermaid', 1992, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Masakazu Higuchi, Chinami Namba', 'Jack Olesker', 'Samantha Paris, Scott Menville, Jeff Bennett, Cam Clarke, Tress MacNeille, B.J. Ward, Jim Cummings, Frank Welker', null, 'This charming, lively tale based on Hans Christian Anderson''s beloved children''s story comes to splendid life in an enchanting animated film. The beautiful and adventurous mermaid, Princess Lena, lives with her family in a watery castle and has everything she could ever need, but she longs for only one thing; to explore the world of humans. Determined to marry Prince Stefan, whom she sees when a whirlpool takes her to the surface, Princess Lena must turn to the evil sea witch Cassandra and pay a heavy price for her promise of help.', 'This charming, lively tale based on Hans Christian Anderson''s beloved children''s story comes to splendid life in an enchanting animated film. The beautiful and adventurous mermaid, Princess Lena, lives with her family in a watery castle and has everything she could ever need, but she longs for only one thing; to explore the world of humans. Determined to marry Prince Stefan, whom she sees when a whirlpool takes her to the surface, Princess Lena must turn to the evil sea witch Cassandra and pay a heavy price for her promise of help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miLHuvLBJ23iDCad4rmUMMQlsMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209792'),
  ('689378873235950946', 'The Little Mermaid', 2018, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Chris Bouchard, Neil Oseman, Blake Harris', 'Blake Harris', 'Poppy Drayton, Shirley MacLaine, Loreto Peralta, William Moseley, Gina Gershon, Shanna Collins, William Forsythe, Tom Nowicki', 'PG', 'A young reporter and his niece discover a beautiful and enchanting creature they believe to be the real little mermaid.', 'A young reporter and his niece discover a beautiful and enchanting creature they believe to be the real little mermaid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEM80vqREgfjk7YhIbl4AgfZ47S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385448'),
  ('889655332931123510', 'The Little Mermaid', 2023, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'John Sorapure, Adam Kirley, Ben Howarth', 'Ron Clements, John Musker', 'Halle Bailey, Jonah Hauer-King, Melissa McCarthy, Javier Bardem, Noma Dumezweni, Art Malik, Daveed Diggs, Jacob Tremblay', 'PG', 'The youngest of King Triton’s daughters, and the most defiant, Ariel longs to find out more about the world beyond the sea, and while visiting the surface, falls for the dashing Prince Eric. With mermaids forbidden to interact with humans, Ariel makes a deal with the evil sea witch, Ursula, which gives her a chance to experience life on land, but ultimately places her life – and her father’s crown – in jeopardy.', 'The youngest of King Triton’s daughters, and the most defiant, Ariel longs to find out more about the world beyond the sea, and while visiting the surface, falls for the dashing Prince Eric. With mermaids forbidden to interact with humans, Ariel makes a deal with the evil sea witch, Ursula, which gives her a chance to experience life on land, but ultimately places her life – and her father’s crown – in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym1dxyOk4jFcSl4Q2zmRrA5BEEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447277'),
  ('991092934156929003', 'The Little Mermaid II: Return to the Sea', 2000, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Jim Kammerud, Brian Smith, Bill Speers', 'Elizabeth Anderson, Temple Mathews', 'Jodi Benson, Samuel E. Wright, Tara Strong, Pat Carroll, Buddy Hackett, Kenneth Mars, Max Casella, Stephen Furst', 'G', 'Set several years after the first film, Ariel and Prince Eric are happily married with a daughter, Melody. In order to protect Melody from the Sea Witch, Morgana, they have not told her about her mermaid heritage. Melody is curious and ventures into the sea, where she meets new friends. But will she become a pawn in Morgana''s quest to take control of the ocean from King Triton?', 'Set several years after the first film, Ariel and Prince Eric are happily married with a daughter, Melody. In order to protect Melody from the Sea Witch, Morgana, they have not told her about her mermaid heritage. Melody is curious and ventures into the sea, where she meets new friends. But will she become a pawn in Morgana''s quest to take control of the ocean from King Triton?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3UHxvYv8ZgWLL0lM45f979OSo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10898'),
  ('100249033856890691', 'The Little Mermaid Live!', 2019, 'Family, Music, TV Movie', 'Hamish Hamilton, Travis Hagenbuch', 'John Musker, Brian Strickland, Ron Clements', 'Auliʻi Cravalho, Shaggy, Graham Phillips, Amber Riley, John Stamos, Queen Latifah, Jodi Benson, René Auberjonois', null, 'Live musical performances by a star-studded cast will be interwoven into the broadcast of the animated classic.', 'Live musical performances by a star-studded cast will be interwoven into the broadcast of the animated classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVZklqsmbbkOgTG4o0nVtM8rJ82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642271'),
  ('650282964849924158', 'The Little Mermaid: Ariel''s Beginning', 2008, 'Family, Animation', 'Peggy Holmes', 'Ron Clements, John Musker', 'Jodi Benson, Samuel E. Wright, Jim Cummings, Sally Field, Tara Strong, Jennifer Hale, Grey DeLisle, Kari Wahlgren', 'PG', 'Follow Ariel''s adventures before she gave up her fins for true love. When Ariel wasn''t singing with her sisters, she spent time with her mother, Queen Athena. Ariel is devastated when Athena is killed by pirates, and after King Triton outlaws all singing. Along with pals Flounder and Sebastian, Ariel sets off in hopes of changing her father''s decision to ban music from the kingdom.', 'Follow Ariel''s adventures before she gave up her fins for true love. When Ariel wasn''t singing with her sisters, she spent time with her mother, Queen Athena. Ariel is devastated when Athena is killed by pirates, and after King Triton outlaws all singing. Along with pals Flounder and Sebastian, Ariel sets off in hopes of changing her father''s decision to ban music from the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EwcdQH134T4HGr0W3m2FnLjTnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13676'),
  ('1125336245672178903', 'The Little Minister', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Wallace, Henry W. Gerrard, Carl Dreher', 'Jane Murfin, Victor Heerman, Sarah Y. Mason', 'Katharine Hepburn, John Beal, Alan Hale, Donald Crisp, Lumsden Hare, Andy Clyde, Beryl Mercer, Billy Watson', 'NR', 'The stoic, proper Rev. Gavin Dishart, newly assigned to a church in the small Scottish village of Thrums, finds himself unexpectedly falling for one of his parishioners, the hot-blooded Gypsy girl Babbie. A village-wide scandal soon erupts over the minister''s relationship with this feisty, passionate young woman, who holds a secret about the village''s nobleman, Lord Milford Rintoul, and his role in an increasingly fractious labor dispute.', 'The stoic, proper Rev. Gavin Dishart, newly assigned to a church in the small Scottish village of Thrums, finds himself unexpectedly falling for one of his parishioners, the hot-blooded Gypsy girl Babbie. A village-wide scandal soon erupts over the minister''s relationship with this feisty, passionate young woman, who holds a secret about the village''s nobleman, Lord Milford Rintoul, and his role in an increasingly fractious labor dispute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKj7KJDsgoTX5PtfQkMZosfwf9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43690'),
  ('964753821322237563', 'The Little Nightingale', 1957, 'Music, Drama, Family', 'Antonio del Amo, César Fraile', 'Antonio Guzmán Merino', 'Joselito, Lina Canalejas, Luis Induni, Mario Berriatúa, Domingo Rivas, Aníbal Vela, Luis Domínguez Luna, Carmen Sánchez', null, 'Joselito is a child whose mother left town when he was just a baby and whose father has died. He lives with his grandfather, the bellringer of the town, and his best friend is the sexton. He enjoys singing and has not lost hope of someday meeting her mother.', 'Joselito is a child whose mother left town when he was just a baby and whose father has died. He lives with his grandfather, the bellringer of the town, and his best friend is the sexton. He enjoys singing and has not lost hope of someday meeting her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnXUtFhDUVfcSiCXWLszFZluPXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99949'),
  ('46930325618518196', 'The Little Orphan', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'William Hanna', null, 'The Bide A Wee Mouse Home has sent the orphan mouse Nibbles to spend Thanksgiving with Jerry. Unfortunately, Nibbles is always hungry.', 'The Bide A Wee Mouse Home has sent the orphan mouse Nibbles to spend Thanksgiving with Jerry. Unfortunately, Nibbles is always hungry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVZDDu1OFraZnLtBOnOUkWkd1TJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72668'),
  ('633193826692952796', 'The Little Panda Fighter', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Michelle Gabriel', 'Ale McHaddo', 'Raul Schlosser, Sidney Ross, Cláudia Victória, Charlie Mambertt, Eli Moreno, Claudio Satiro, Wallace Costa', 'PG', 'A panda named Pancada, who works at a boxing club, wishes to become a dancer but gets caught up in an upcoming fight due to a case of mistaken identity.', 'A panda named Pancada, who works at a boxing club, wishes to become a dancer but gets caught up in an upcoming fight due to a case of mistaken identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwN0GsDgeYaLEGzho0HcJu1mLP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258722'),
  ('70669068355367468', 'The Little Polar Bear', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Thilo Rothkirch, Piet De Rycker, Alexander Lindner', 'Piet De Rycker, Bert Schrickel, Thomas Wittenburg', 'Mijail Verona, Jeanette Biedermann, Vanessa Petruo, Ingolf Lück, Barbara Adolph, Anke Engelke, Maximilian Artajo, Jochen Busse', 'G', 'This charming animated adventure follows a young polar bear, Lars, as he befriends Robbie, a seal. Together, these two form a friendship that proves different breeds of animals can get along perfectly well.', 'This charming animated adventure follows a young polar bear, Lars, as he befriends Robbie, a seal. Together, these two form a friendship that proves different breeds of animals can get along perfectly well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PRh6NAZuf99AyZqjYKwjYZZlLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9084'),
  ('722859184011474674', 'The Little Polar Bear: Lars and the Little Tiger', 2002, 'Family, Animation', 'Thilo Rothkirch', 'Hans de Beer', 'Mijail Verona, Maximilian Artajo, Lisa Mitsching, Oliver Petszokat, Harry Rowohlt, Wolfgang Völz, Anna Friedrich, Jürgen Kluckert', null, 'Hans der Beer''s beloved polar bear Lars returns for more adventures, with a new feline friend.', 'Hans der Beer''s beloved polar bear Lars returns for more adventures, with a new feline friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyPhT1XfztKh4jQxmdXrjCOZljr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204712'),
  ('136993596970444948', 'The Little Prince', 1974, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Family, Music', 'Stanley Donen, Christopher Challis', 'Alan Jay Lerner', 'Steven Warner, Richard Kiley, Bob Fosse, Gene Wilder, Donna McKechnie, Joss Ackland, Clive Revill, Victor Spinetti', 'G', 'After a pilot is forced to make an emergency landing in the Sahara Desert, he befriends a young prince from outer space; the friendship conjures up stories of journeys through the solar system for the stranded aviator.', 'After a pilot is forced to make an emergency landing in the Sahara Desert, he befriends a young prince from outer space; the friendship conjures up stories of journeys through the solar system for the stranded aviator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAUiufPCoU8P4F1w4MqpjcxIVCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37627'),
  ('947685504838016336', 'The Little Prince', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Mark Osborne, Kris Kapp, Lynne Kamm', 'Mark Osborne', 'Riley Osborne, Mackenzie Foy, Jeff Bridges, Rachel McAdams, Marion Cotillard, James Franco, Benicio del Toro, Bud Cort', 'PG', 'Based on the best-seller book ''The Little Prince'', the movie tells the story of a little girl that lives with resignation in a world where efficiency and work are the only dogmas. Everything will change when accidentally she discovers her neighbor that will tell her about the story of the Little Prince that he once met.', 'Based on the best-seller book ''The Little Prince'', the movie tells the story of a little girl that lives with resignation in a world where efficiency and work are the only dogmas. Everything will change when accidentally she discovers her neighbor that will tell her about the story of the Little Prince that he once met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/je5Z7gbFTzrs3FPHINo9yGiHoVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309809'),
  ('438791410593153735', 'The Little Prince and the Eight-Headed Dragon', 1963, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Yasuji Mori, Yugo Serikawa, Isao Takahata', 'Ichirō Ikeda, Takashi Iijima', 'Morio Kazama, Chiharu Kuri, Yukiko Okada, Masato Yamanouchi, Kiyoshi Kawakubo, Hideo Kinoshita, Kinshirô Iwao, Shûichi Kazamatsuri', null, 'In this influential cult-classic animated film based on Japanese folklore, Susano is the youngest son of Izanagi and Izanami, the heavenly couple who created the Earth. Still a young boy, Susano is devastated by the passing away of his mother. Determined to find her despite the reprimands of his father, he embarks on a journey to find his brother and his sister for spiritual guidance.', 'In this influential cult-classic animated film based on Japanese folklore, Susano is the youngest son of Izanagi and Izanami, the heavenly couple who created the Earth. Still a young boy, Susano is devastated by the passing away of his mother. Determined to find her despite the reprimands of his father, he embarks on a journey to find his brother and his sister for spiritual guidance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx68nhniEwkLpeaeyS5TOsKwlM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84480'),
  ('602156222213856053', 'The Little Prince(ss)', 2021, 'Family, Drama', 'Mira Peng, Marcus Patterson', 'Mira Peng', 'Kalo Moss, Ching Yin Ryan Hu, Evan Lai, Brian Yang, Lynn Chen, Danni Wang, Yvette Tucker, Ellarose Kaylor', 'PG', 'When Gabriel, a 7-year-old Chinese kid who loves ballet, becomes friends with Rob, another Chinese kid from school, Rob’s dad gets suspicious about Gabriel''s feminine behavior and decides to intervene.', 'When Gabriel, a 7-year-old Chinese kid who loves ballet, becomes friends with Rob, another Chinese kid from school, Rob’s dad gets suspicious about Gabriel''s feminine behavior and decides to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O65UNeSnWqRcuTUFcy75PluCzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818370'),
  ('950220024745504896', 'The Little Princess', 1939, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Walter Lang, Arthur C. Miller, William V. Skall', 'Walter Ferris, Ethel Hill', 'Shirley Temple, Richard Greene, Anita Louise, Ian Hunter, Arthur Treacher, Mary Nash, Cesar Romero, Miles Mander', 'G', 'A little girl goes in search of her father who is reported missing by the military during the Second Boer War.', 'A little girl goes in search of her father who is reported missing by the military during the Second Boer War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnMSURyv7R6gjmUm5SYdTxXLzIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26531'),
  ('669076051583598849', 'The Little Queen', 2014, 'Drama', 'Alexis Durand-Brault, Yves Bélanger, Marc Larose', 'Catherine Léger, Sophie Lorain', 'Laurence Leboeuf, Patrice Robitaille, Denis Bouchard, Josée Deschênes, René-Daniel Dubois, Judith Baribeau, Jeff Boudreault, Sébastien Delorme', 'PG', 'Julie, star cyclist, is two races away from winning the World Cup. It is the culmination of years of effort. Julie loves the spotlight. Her entourage too. Encouraged by her coach and doctor, she has been doping since the age of 14. When her doctor denounces her, she manages to hush up the case, but the extent of the mess leads to abuse, lies, and treason. Caught in a gear that goes beyond her, will she succeed in finding a way out?', 'Julie, star cyclist, is two races away from winning the World Cup. It is the culmination of years of effort. Julie loves the spotlight. Her entourage too. Encouraged by her coach and doctor, she has been doping since the age of 14. When her doctor denounces her, she manages to hush up the case, but the extent of the mess leads to abuse, lies, and treason. Caught in a gear that goes beyond her, will she succeed in finding a way out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVgljvNJtNujbKPKYSrE1Hz6fo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273632'),
  ('534237355861697379', 'The Little Raccoon', 1974, 'Animation, Family', 'Oleg Churkin', 'Margarita Dolottseva', 'Klara Rumyanova, Mariya Vinogradova', null, 'A story about a little raccoon who needs to prove to his mother he''s brave enough to go to the pond to gather herbs at night, on his birthday.', 'A story about a little raccoon who needs to prove to his mother he''s brave enough to go to the pond to gather herbs at night, on his birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3z0vvaUQL8tMGioPzjTl4vZpjvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285366'),
  ('212092746544681769', 'The Little Rascals', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Richard Bowen, Penelope Spheeris, Ronald Chong', 'Stephen Mazur, Penelope Spheeris, Paul Guay', 'Bug Hall, Brittany Ashton Holmes, Travis Tedford, Kevin Jamal Woods, Jordan Warkol, Zachary Mabry, Ross Bagley, Courtland Mead', 'PG', 'When nine-year-old Alfalfa falls for Darla, his "He-Man-Woman-Hating" friends attempt to sabotage their relationship.', 'When nine-year-old Alfalfa falls for Darla, his "He-Man-Woman-Hating" friends attempt to sabotage their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qI7PKX2JSw4yD2iQm3pyHvKir28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10897'),
  ('344327929573793623', 'The Little Rascals Save the Day', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Levie Isaacks, Alex Zamm', 'William Robertson, Alex Zamm', 'Jet Jurgensmeyer, Drew Justice, Jenna Ortega, Connor Berry, Camden Gray, Isaiah Fredericks, Eden Wood, Chase Vacnin', 'PG', 'When the Little Rascals are unable to raise enough money to save their grandma''s bakery from shutting down, their only hope is to win a local talent show and use the prize money to save the shop.', 'When the Little Rascals are unable to raise enough money to save their grandma''s bakery from shutting down, their only hope is to win a local talent show and use the prize money to save the shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nuZUJge3egVZI1rPLVpjRHPMf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260535'),
  ('355944125116512650', 'The Little Rebels', 1955, 'Drama', 'Jean Delannoy, Pierre Montazel', 'Jean Delannoy', 'Jean Gabin, Anne Doat, Serge Lecointe, Jimmy Urbain, Robert Dalban, Jean-Jacques Delbo, Dora Doll, Jane Marken', null, 'Judge Julien Lamy regularly deals with the welfare of children, namely down on their luck delinquents. When an orphan named Alain Robert burns down a barn belonging to his abusive foster family, Judge Lamy has no choice but to send him to a juvenile jail. There he meets an older boy named Francis Lanoux, who is desperate to escape and be reunited with his girlfriend Sylvette. The boys eventually flee the institution, as Francis goes in search of his lost love and Alain continues looking for his parents. Unfortunately, the little rebels run into some big problems once on the outside.', 'Judge Julien Lamy regularly deals with the welfare of children, namely down on their luck delinquents. When an orphan named Alain Robert burns down a barn belonging to his abusive foster family, Judge Lamy has no choice but to send him to a juvenile jail. There he meets an older boy named Francis Lanoux, who is desperate to escape and be reunited with his girlfriend Sylvette. The boys eventually flee the institution, as Francis goes in search of his lost love and Alain continues looking for his parents. Unfortunately, the little rebels run into some big problems once on the outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUBwOax7gDBFNWkvVgTKeFtwhku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78179'),
  ('706156209815574409', 'The Little Shop of Horrors', 1960, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Roger Corman, Charles B. Griffith, Mel Welles', 'Roger Corman', 'Jonathan Haze, Jackie Joseph, Mel Welles, Dick Miller, Myrtle Vail, Karyn Kupcinet, Toby Michaels, Wally Campo', 'NR', 'Seymour works in a skid row florist shop and is in love with his beautiful co-worker, Audrey. He creates a new plant that not only talks but cannot survive without human flesh and blood.', 'Seymour works in a skid row florist shop and is in love with his beautiful co-worker, Audrey. He creates a new plant that not only talks but cannot survive without human flesh and blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9MrumN9oCfv1rFoEvMLwucWD7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24452'),
  ('274524664405978521', 'The Little Sister', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hafsia Herzi, Jérémie Attard, Camille Servignat', 'Hafsia Herzi', 'Nadia Melliti, Park Ji-min, Amina Ben Mohamed, Rita Benmannana, Melissa Guers, Razzak Ridha, Louis Memmi, Anouar Kardellas', null, 'Fatima, 17, the youngest daughter of a French-Algerian family in a Paris suburb, leaves school for a prestigious prep class. She plays football, has a secret boyfriend, but hides that she loves women. In Paris, new freedoms clash with family tradition and faith, forcing her to find her own path.', 'Fatima, 17, the youngest daughter of a French-Algerian family in a Paris suburb, leaves school for a prestigious prep class. She plays football, has a secret boyfriend, but hides that she loves women. In Paris, new freedoms clash with family tradition and faith, forcing her to find her own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI3wYg9pcGmrX1IPjcz4PO9TI09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961077'),
  ('81817312256954983', 'The Little Soldier', 1947, 'Animation, Family, Romance', 'Paul Grimault', 'Jacques Prévert, Paul Grimault', null, null, 'A budding romance between two toy dancers is put into dangers when the boy is conscripted into the toy army.', 'A budding romance between two toy dancers is put into dangers when the boy is conscripted into the toy army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1Go6ryBUhl4D2d6iQTt42jk5qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162528'),
  ('774907588381212035', 'The Little Soldier', 1963, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Francis Cognany, Raoul Coutard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Michel Subor, Anna Karina, Henri-Jacques Huet, Paul Beauvais, László Szabó, Georges de Beauregard, Gilbert Edard, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'Despite his lack of political convictions, photojournalist Bruno Forestier is roped into a paramilitary group waging a shadow war in Geneva against the Algerian independence movement.', 'Despite his lack of political convictions, photojournalist Bruno Forestier is roped into a paramilitary group waging a shadow war in Geneva against the Algerian independence movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzKFKVZHeGhJQYWZN6qO3GXUApU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50785'),
  ('379080410952676259', 'The Little Stranger', 2018, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Nathan Nugent, Lenny Abrahamson, Ole Bratt Birkeland', 'Lucinda Coxon', 'Domhnall Gleeson, Ruth Wilson, Will Poulter, Oliver Zetterström, Charlotte Rampling, Liv Hill, Harry Hadden-Paton, Anna Madeley', 'R', 'In a dusty post-war summer in rural Warwickshire, a doctor is called to a patient at lonely Hundreds Hall. Home to the Ayres family for over two centuries, the Georgian house is now in decline. But are the Ayreses haunted by something more sinister than a dying way of life?', 'In a dusty post-war summer in rural Warwickshire, a doctor is called to a patient at lonely Hundreds Hall. Home to the Ayres family for over two centuries, the Georgian house is now in decline. But are the Ayreses haunted by something more sinister than a dying way of life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izPtQ2relqT5LWflL7x4JLTbLxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455108'),
  ('602415852096928859', 'The Little Switzerland', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Kepa Sojo', 'Daniel Monedero, Kepa Sojo, Sonia Pacios', 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Maggie Civantos, Jon Plazaola, Secun de la Rosa, Ramón Barea, Antonio Resines, Enrique Villén, Lander Otaola', 'PG-13', 'The discovery of the tomb of William Tell’s son in a town in the Basque Country spurs the village''s cantankerous citizens to lobby for Swiss annexation.', 'The discovery of the tomb of William Tell’s son in a town in the Basque Country spurs the village''s cantankerous citizens to lobby for Swiss annexation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ji3iTy8Cwwk2G1coxNiKoZSBHJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574374'),
  ('222952344321204537', 'The Little Thief', 1988, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Dominique Chapuis, Claude Miller', 'Annie Miller, Luc Béraud, Claude Miller', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Didier Bezace, Simon de La Brosse, Clotilde de Bayser, Raoul Billerey, Chantal Banlier, Nathalie Cardone, Renée Faure', 'R', 'In a small town in post-WWII France, 16-year-old Janine tries to improve her conditions by any means necessary. Three people—Michel, a married lover; Raoul, a fellow thief; Mauricette, a photographer she meets in prison—will help her learn from her mistakes.', 'In a small town in post-WWII France, 16-year-old Janine tries to improve her conditions by any means necessary. Three people—Michel, a married lover; Raoul, a fellow thief; Mauricette, a photographer she meets in prison—will help her learn from her mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyKrL3Al1f1T4VWHOyAjSgORBq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8768'),
  ('917916803986713498', 'The Little Thief', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pierre Milon, Catherine Pujol, Erick Zonca', 'Virginie Wagon, Erick Zonca', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Jean-Jérôme Esposito, Martial Bezot, Jean-Arnaud Dalomba, Jo Prestia, Ingrid Preynat, Véronique Balme, Olivier Gerby', 'NR', 'In this French drama, a teenager falls into a life of crime, little realizing the consequences. S. is a moody young man who loses his job at a bakery, and decides to throw in his lot with a group of thieves about the same age as himself. S. and his cronies are strictly small-timers, pulling off second-rate break-ins for an older crime boss, but his willingness to do what he''s told helps him rise up the ladder to bigger and more lucrative jobs. However, S. lacks the maturity or experience to deal with the risks, and after a few disastrous mistakes, he finds his fortunes sinking far faster than they rose.', 'In this French drama, a teenager falls into a life of crime, little realizing the consequences. S. is a moody young man who loses his job at a bakery, and decides to throw in his lot with a group of thieves about the same age as himself. S. and his cronies are strictly small-timers, pulling off second-rate break-ins for an older crime boss, but his willingness to do what he''s told helps him rise up the ladder to bigger and more lucrative jobs. However, S. lacks the maturity or experience to deal with the risks, and after a few disastrous mistakes, he finds his fortunes sinking far faster than they rose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWi6vBZOgsQzJfKpiITB7HPOWGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116751'),
  ('436652638666244651', 'The Little Things', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Jason Inman, Alejandro Mora, John Lee Hancock', 'John Lee Hancock', 'Denzel Washington, Rami Malek, Jared Leto, Chris Bauer, Michael Hyatt, Terry Kinney, Natalie Morales, Isabel Arraiza', 'R', 'Deputy Sheriff Joe "Deke" Deacon joins forces with Sgt. Jim Baxter to search for a serial killer who''s terrorizing Los Angeles. As they track the culprit, Baxter is unaware that the investigation is dredging up echoes of Deke''s past, uncovering disturbing secrets that could threaten more than his case.', 'Deputy Sheriff Joe "Deke" Deacon joins forces with Sgt. Jim Baxter to search for a serial killer who''s terrorizing Los Angeles. As they track the culprit, Baxter is unaware that the investigation is dredging up echoes of Deke''s past, uncovering disturbing secrets that could threaten more than his case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLO1aD1ghdtVMT32z2sRmzgYKYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602269'),
  ('208920136345826976', 'The Little Tiger on the Sunflower', 1981, 'Family, Animation', 'Leonid Nosyrev, Svetlana Kashcheeva', 'Yuriy Koval, Leonid Nosyrev', 'Evgeni Leonov, Aleksandr Baranov, Aleksey Ptitsyn', null, 'Taiga tale about a tiger cub who warmed the seed of sunflower.', 'Taiga tale about a tiger cub who warmed the seed of sunflower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTZ0PUyWaIRP2NemQ42VyMiTTX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219796'),
  ('418245990748015944', 'The Little Troll Prince', 1987, 'TV Movie, Family, Animation, Fantasy, Music', 'Ray Patterson', 'Clifford Campion, Shirley Hartman', 'Ami Foster, Danny Cooksey, Vincent Price, Jonathan Winters, Don Knotts, Cloris Leachman, Charlie Adler, Michael Bell', 'G', 'A little troll prince escapes his kingdom, perched atop a tall mountain in Norway, for the human world, where a family teaches him the true meaning of Christmas.', 'A little troll prince escapes his kingdom, perched atop a tall mountain in Norway, for the human world, where a family teaches him the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYpLlE0IsPgoFMpf5xmH5dpQFBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48881'),
  ('850706407786502687', 'The Little Vampire', 2000, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Uli Edel, Bernd Heinl', 'Larry Wilson, Karey Kirkpatrick', 'Jonathan Lipnicki, Richard E. Grant, Jim Carter, Alice Krige, Rollo Weeks, Anna Popplewell, Pamela Gidley, Tommy Hinkley', 'G', 'Based on the popular books, the story tells of Tony who wants a friend to add some adventure to his life. What he gets is Rudolph, a vampire kid with a good appetite. The two end up inseparable, but their fun is cut short when all the hopes of the vampire race could be gone forever in single night. With Tony''s access to the daytime world, he helps them to find what they''ve always wanted.', 'Based on the popular books, the story tells of Tony who wants a friend to add some adventure to his life. What he gets is Rudolph, a vampire kid with a good appetite. The two end up inseparable, but their fun is cut short when all the hopes of the vampire race could be gone forever in single night. With Tony''s access to the daytime world, he helps them to find what they''ve always wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBGfZGKX3KJnljxsX6r24lzRe0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24100'),
  ('1035326292182058297', 'The Little Vampire 3D', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Richard Claus, Karsten Kiilerich, Niels Grønlykke', 'Richard Claus, Larry Wilson', 'Rasmus Hardiker, Amy Saville, Jim Carter, Joseph Kloska, Phoebe Givron-Taylor, Tim Pigott-Smith, Alice Krige, Julia Rhodes', null, 'Tony, a thirteen-year-old boy on vacation in rural Germany, is fascinated by the idea of vampires. Meanwhile Rudolph, a vampire of "similar" age (313!), encounters trouble when his clan is threatened by a dangerously obsessed hunter. Fate brings these two boys together, as Tony & Rudolph set off an action-packed battle to stop the villain, save Rudolph''s family and learn the power of friendship.', 'Tony, a thirteen-year-old boy on vacation in rural Germany, is fascinated by the idea of vampires. Meanwhile Rudolph, a vampire of "similar" age (313!), encounters trouble when his clan is threatened by a dangerously obsessed hunter. Fate brings these two boys together, as Tony & Rudolph set off an action-packed battle to stop the villain, save Rudolph''s family and learn the power of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9z2rBO4i5MhbvpEIxXZUoXSYUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442056'),
  ('963002538460484873', 'The Little Whirlwind', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Riley Thomson, Ray DeVally', null, 'Walt Disney, Thelma Boardman', 'NR', 'Mickey wants some of the cake Minnie has just baked, so he offers to clean up her yard. As he''s working, a tiny tornado (smaller than him) with a mind of its own comes along and causes trouble. After Mickey finally chases the little twister off, it gets its big brother, which makes a grand mess of the yard. Most of the cartoon, except for the opening and closing, has no dialogue.', 'Mickey wants some of the cake Minnie has just baked, so he offers to clean up her yard. As he''s working, a tiny tornado (smaller than him) with a mind of its own comes along and causes trouble. After Mickey finally chases the little twister off, it gets its big brother, which makes a grand mess of the yard. Most of the cartoon, except for the opening and closing, has no dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3m2uoZmYkmjdiaqOvPcCS9wKPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67592'),
  ('472665382722903461', 'The Little Witch', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Schaerer, Matthias Fleischer, Manuel Kreuzpaintner', 'Matthias Pacht', 'Karoline Herfurth, Axel Prahl, Luis Vorbach, Momo Beier, Michael Gempart, Anna Striesow, Suzanne von Borsody, Barbara Melzl', null, 'The little witch is only 127 years old – too young for the annual coven of witches. Although she is not yet old enough to be a real witch she wants to become a really good one. This decision causes trouble inside her magic world.', 'The little witch is only 127 years old – too young for the annual coven of witches. Although she is not yet old enough to be a real witch she wants to become a really good one. This decision causes trouble inside her magic world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTRg6yy75VQ0yoszgLQgp3MTHtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425194'),
  ('603848280307904473', 'The Little World of Don Camillo', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Hayer, Julien Duvivier, Alberto Cardone', 'René Barjavel, Julien Duvivier', 'Fernandel, Gino Cervi, Vera Talchi, Franco Interlenghi, Saro Urzì, Charles Vissières, Sylvie, Clara Auteri Pepe', null, 'In a village of the Po valley where the earth is hard and life miserly, the priest and the communist mayor are always fighting to be the head of the community. If in secret, they admired and liked each other, politics still divided them as it is dividing the country. And when the mayor wants his "People''s House"; the priest wants his "Garden City" for the poor. Division exist between the richest and the poorest, the pious and the atheists and even between lovers. But if the people are hard as the country, they are good in the bottom of there heart.', 'In a village of the Po valley where the earth is hard and life miserly, the priest and the communist mayor are always fighting to be the head of the community. If in secret, they admired and liked each other, politics still divided them as it is dividing the country. And when the mayor wants his "People''s House"; the priest wants his "Garden City" for the poor. Division exist between the richest and the poorest, the pious and the atheists and even between lovers. But if the people are hard as the country, they are good in the bottom of there heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDbzuBgsgZ5VVljMHNni3gJK9Qx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11972'),
  ('1042206268665658879', 'The Littlest Horse Thieves', 1976, 'Family, Drama', 'Charles Jarrott', 'Rosemary Anne Sisson', 'Alastair Sim, Peter Barkworth, Maurice Colbourne, Susan Tebbs, Chloe Franks, Benjie Bolgar, Prunella Scales, Leslie Sands', 'G', 'When the owner of a Yorkshire coal-mine decides to mechanize to increase profits, the mine''s pit ponies are scheduled to be destroyed. So, three children plan to steal them to keep them safe. But when they''re caught, it''s up to the mine owners and the miners themselves to decide what''s right.', 'When the owner of a Yorkshire coal-mine decides to mechanize to increase profits, the mine''s pit ponies are scheduled to be destroyed. So, three children plan to steal them to keep them safe. But when they''re caught, it''s up to the mine owners and the miners themselves to decide what''s right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4sVg2mS9OQfN3wmDRxJvDV3x7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103777'),
  ('97660738548910749', 'The Littlest Outlaw', 1955, 'Drama, Family, Adventure', 'Roberto Gavaldón', 'Bill Walsh', 'Pedro Armendáriz, Joseph Calleia, Rodolfo Acosta, Andrés Velázquez, Laila Maley, Gilberto González, José Torvay, Eulalio González', null, 'Little Pablito is the ten year old son of a cruel horse trainer. The trainer is responsible for training a Mexican General''s horse to jump for the grand race. The trainer''s methods cause the horse to become afraid of jumping and the general orders the animal''s death. Pablito runs away with the horse, becoming a fugitive. He travels throughout Mexico encountering several fugitives and a priest who tries to help.', 'Little Pablito is the ten year old son of a cruel horse trainer. The trainer is responsible for training a Mexican General''s horse to jump for the grand race. The trainer''s methods cause the horse to become afraid of jumping and the general orders the animal''s death. Pablito runs away with the horse, becoming a fugitive. He travels throughout Mexico encountering several fugitives and a priest who tries to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL64NjedV7cVxCyWyCQikv1Mm4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206171'),
  ('444023906785564008', 'The Littlest Rebel', 1935, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music, War', 'David Butler, John F. Seitz, Booth McCracken', 'Edwin J. Burke', 'Shirley Temple, John Boles, Jack Holt, Karen Morley, Bill Robinson, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Willie Best, Frank McGlynn Sr.', 'NR', 'Virgie Cary''s father, a rebel officer, sneaks back to his rundown plantation to see his dying wife and is arrested. A Yankee officer takes pity and sets up an escape. Everyone is captured and the officers are to be executed. Virgie and Uncle Billy beg President Lincoln to intercede.', 'Virgie Cary''s father, a rebel officer, sneaks back to his rundown plantation to see his dying wife and is arrested. A Yankee officer takes pity and sets up an escape. Everyone is captured and the officers are to be executed. Virgie and Uncle Billy beg President Lincoln to intercede.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMaqJwSPCNFXkGuECB3efImC1iE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43897'),
  ('591836883215808194', 'The Live Ghost', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Charley Rogers', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Walter Long, Mae Busch, Charlie Hall, Arthur Housman, Leo Willis', 'NR', 'Fish market workers Stan and Ollie are persuaded by a sea captain to shanghai a crew for him at the local bar for a dollar a head. Successful at first, the boys end up getting themselves shanghaied, and the crew vow revenge.', 'Fish market workers Stan and Ollie are persuaded by a sea captain to shanghai a crew for him at the local bar for a dollar a head. Successful at first, the boys end up getting themselves shanghaied, and the crew vow revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84ixlfC6ydEMQt1fVdabYe55WfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48827'),
  ('838013941079955336', 'The Lives of a Bengal Lancer', 1935, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Henry Hathaway, Charles Lang, Clem Beauchamp', 'Grover Jones, William Slavens McNutt', 'Gary Cooper, Franchot Tone, Richard Cromwell, Guy Standing, C. Aubrey Smith, Kathleen Burke, Douglass Dumbrille, Monte Blue', 'NR', 'In the Northwest Frontier of India, the 41st Bengal Lancers led by the harsh Colonel Tom Stone are having trouble with the rebellious leader Mohammed Khan. Surly McGregor and wry, blue-blooded Forsythe are officers in charge of newcomer Lieutenant Stone, the commanding officer’s inexperienced son. Motivated by a grudge toward his father, Lt. Stone allows himself to be captured by the enemy.', 'In the Northwest Frontier of India, the 41st Bengal Lancers led by the harsh Colonel Tom Stone are having trouble with the rebellious leader Mohammed Khan. Surly McGregor and wry, blue-blooded Forsythe are officers in charge of newcomer Lieutenant Stone, the commanding officer’s inexperienced son. Motivated by a grudge toward his father, Lt. Stone allows himself to be captured by the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcThieJiNXmXk9cjqfIYU4QEkhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43898'),
  ('1150780151669164606', 'The Lives of Others', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Florian Henckel von Donnersmarck, Hagen Bogdanski', 'Florian Henckel von Donnersmarck', 'Martina Gedeck, Ulrich Mühe, Sebastian Koch, Ulrich Tukur, Thomas Thieme, Hans-Uwe Bauer, Volkmar Kleinert, Matthias Brenner', 'R', 'In 1984 East Berlin, dedicated Stasi officer Gerd Wiesler begins spying on a famous playwright and his actress-lover Christa-Maria. Wiesler becomes unexpectedly sympathetic to the couple, and faces conflicting loyalties when his superior takes a liking to Christa-Maria.', 'In 1984 East Berlin, dedicated Stasi officer Gerd Wiesler begins spying on a famous playwright and his actress-lover Christa-Maria. Wiesler becomes unexpectedly sympathetic to the couple, and faces conflicting loyalties when his superior takes a liking to Christa-Maria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVUDMnskSc01rdbyH0tLATTJUdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582'),
  ('267289721012582383', 'The Living and the Dead', 2006, 'Drama, Horror', 'Milton Kam, Simon Rumley', 'Simon Rumley', 'Leo Bill, Roger Lloyd Pack, Kate Fahy, Sarah Ball, Neil Conrich, Richard Wills-Cotton', null, 'Lord Donald and Lady Nancy reside in the magnificent but run-down Longleigh House with James, their mentally disabled adult son. Nancy has fallen seriously ill and Donald is preparing to sell the house to raise enough money to pay for an operation. He arranges for the family nurse, Mary, to take care of Nancy while he leaves to tend to the sale. However, James wants to prove to his father that he can look after his mother on his own and decides to lock Mary out of the house. It isn''t long before James starts mixing his mother''s pills and forgetting to take his own medication, and as the stress of looking after his mother increases, so too does the severity of his own condition.', 'Lord Donald and Lady Nancy reside in the magnificent but run-down Longleigh House with James, their mentally disabled adult son. Nancy has fallen seriously ill and Donald is preparing to sell the house to raise enough money to pay for an operation. He arranges for the family nurse, Mary, to take care of Nancy while he leaves to tend to the sale. However, James wants to prove to his father that he can look after his mother on his own and decides to lock Mary out of the house. It isn''t long before James starts mixing his mother''s pills and forgetting to take his own medication, and as the stress of looking after his mother increases, so too does the severity of his own condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxdORa3kVs4wPtI0ZmdRSsjNHYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13254'),
  ('757430228797827676', 'The Living Coffin', 1959, 'Horror, Western', 'Fernando Méndez, Víctor Herrera', null, 'Gastón Santos, Rayo de Plata, María Duval, Pedro de Aguillón, Carlos Ancira, Hortensia Santoveña, Carolina Barret, Antonio Raxel', null, 'A cowboy and his sidekick meet a ranching family that is haunted by spirits and vampires.', 'A cowboy and his sidekick meet a ranching family that is haunted by spirits and vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vjHKHQWi7BfFp1DfYbqW8Z4Sud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141442'),
  ('1044067582755058642', 'The Living Daylights', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'John Glen, Alec Mills, Jim Morahan', 'Richard Maibaum, Michael G. Wilson', 'Timothy Dalton, Maryam D''Abo, Joe Don Baker, Art Malik, John Rhys-Davies, Jeroen Krabbé, Andreas Wisniewski, Thomas Wheatley', 'PG', 'After a defecting Russian general reveals a plot to assassinate foreign spies, James Bond is assigned a secret mission to dispatch the new head of the KGB to prevent an escalation of tensions between the Soviet Union and the West.', 'After a defecting Russian general reveals a plot to assassinate foreign spies, James Bond is assigned a secret mission to dispatch the new head of the KGB to prevent an escalation of tensions between the Soviet Union and the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oRlmWX9hewpn2B44wawBjHd7dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:708'),
  ('1092228782647700168', 'The Living Dead', 2019, 'Fantasy', 'Qiu Zhongwei', null, 'Yu Bin, Zheng Fanxing, Wang Yifei, He Longlong, Gao Hanyu, Zhang Xiwei', null, 'Near Qishan Mountain, there is a little town called Fu Feng, which is nicknamed the "City That Never Turns Dark". There, lies a legend of the "Lit Lamp Murderer". Wen Ning arrives at Fu Feng, and he realizes the abnormality of the town; the whole town is filled only with the weak and sick; and is very run down. When the night arrives, Wen Ning purposefully lit up a lamp to attract ghost shadows. Just as he was about to capture them, a ray of blue sword light appears and the black shadow disappears. Wen Ning looks up, and sees his nephew, Lan Sizhui. Wen Ning and Lan Sizhui decides to work together and solve the mystery and capture the culprit behind the mysterious incidents.', 'Near Qishan Mountain, there is a little town called Fu Feng, which is nicknamed the "City That Never Turns Dark". There, lies a legend of the "Lit Lamp Murderer". Wen Ning arrives at Fu Feng, and he realizes the abnormality of the town; the whole town is filled only with the weak and sick; and is very run down. When the night arrives, Wen Ning purposefully lit up a lamp to attract ghost shadows. Just as he was about to capture them, a ray of blue sword light appears and the black shadow disappears. Wen Ning looks up, and sees his nephew, Lan Sizhui. Wen Ning and Lan Sizhui decides to work together and solve the mystery and capture the culprit behind the mysterious incidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/didMRUZIJ6kiWUbiL2krN6UAdJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643786'),
  ('733640329481336897', 'The Living Dead at Manchester Morgue', 1974, 'Horror', 'Jorge Grau, Francisco Sempere, Gianni Arduini', 'Sandro Continenza, Marcello Coscia, Juan Cobos', 'Cristina Galbó, Ray Lovelock, Arthur Kennedy, Aldo Massasso, Giorgio Trestini, Roberto Posse, José Lifante, Jeannine Mestre', 'R', 'When a series of murders hit the remote English countryside, a detective suspects a pair of travelers when it is actually the work of the undead, jarred back to life by an experimental ultra-sonic radiation machine used by the Ministry of Agriculture to kill insects.', 'When a series of murders hit the remote English countryside, a detective suspects a pair of travelers when it is actually the work of the undead, jarred back to life by an experimental ultra-sonic radiation machine used by the Ministry of Agriculture to kill insects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfa3HmGdq1MZSLaJKtj1st1MDF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25627'),
  ('1093206345497660328', 'The Living Dead Girl', 1982, 'Horror', 'Jean Rollin, Max Monteillet', 'Jean Rollin, Jacques Ralf', 'Marina Pierro, Françoise Blanchard, Mike Marshall, Carina Barone, Fanny Magier, Patricia Besnard-Rousseau', null, 'A toxic spill revives a beautiful, dead heiress who, with the help of her childhood friend, must quench her insatiable thirst for blood.', 'A toxic spill revives a beautiful, dead heiress who, with the help of her childhood friend, must quench her insatiable thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42tNjk8Y9tqu1ooIzPO7UwuviEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77010'),
  ('440413944728405303', 'The Living Desert', 1953, 'Documentary', 'James Algar, Robert H. Crandall', 'Winston Hibler', 'Winston Hibler', null, 'Although first glance reveals little more than stones and sand, the desert is alive. Witness moving rocks, spitting mud pots, gorgeous flowers and the never-ending battle for survival between desert creatures of every shape, size and description.', 'Although first glance reveals little more than stones and sand, the desert is alive. Witness moving rocks, spitting mud pots, gorgeous flowers and the never-ending battle for survival between desert creatures of every shape, size and description.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFMhGIMqXdZZYG9pfnyC26bRD6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11383'),
  ('176346271116669064', 'The Living End', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Gregg Araki, Gregg Araki', 'Gregg Araki', 'Mike Dytri, Craig Gilmore, Mark Finch, Mary Woronov, Johanna Went, Darcy Marta, Scott Goetz, Brett Vail', 'NR', 'Two HIV-positive young men — a semi-employed film critic and a hot hustler — tear off on a cross-country crime spree.', 'Two HIV-positive young men — a semi-employed film critic and a hot hustler — tear off on a cross-country crime spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmPkGH3UkDOdVRNfMGxEcAKGj4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33247'),
  ('176453200102121673', 'The Living Forest', 2003, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Angel de la Cruz, Manolo Gómez', 'Angel de la Cruz', 'Nacho Aldeguer, Mar Bordallo, Claudio Rodríguez, Juan Miguel Cuesta, Javier Franquelo, Rafael Azcárraga, Lucía Esteban, María Teresa Neila', 'PG', 'Each day when the humans leave Cecebre Forest, its transforms into a magical place where plants and creatures come alive in wonderful ways. Trouble strikes on the day that men in hard hats plant a long, hard, cold telephone pole in the middle of the forest. The forest is in disarray and Furi, a friendly mole, finds that his friend Linda is missing along with an entire mole colony! The forest creatures join Furi on his quest to find the moles, proving that friendship can overcome any obstacle.', 'Each day when the humans leave Cecebre Forest, its transforms into a magical place where plants and creatures come alive in wonderful ways. Trouble strikes on the day that men in hard hats plant a long, hard, cold telephone pole in the middle of the forest. The forest is in disarray and Furi, a friendly mole, finds that his friend Linda is missing along with an entire mole colony! The forest creatures join Furi on his quest to find the moles, proving that friendship can overcome any obstacle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GfndIjtIwg2HbHRPLxt56ONJXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49612'),
  ('3229714171033969', 'The Living Ghost', 1942, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'William Beaudine, Mack Stengler, Richard L''Estrange', 'Joseph Hoffman', 'James Dunn, Joan Woodbury, Paul McVey, Vera Gordon, Norman Willis, J. Farrell MacDonald, Minerva Urecal, George Eldredge', null, 'A detective investigating kidnapping case discovers the victim, who may be a zombie.', 'A detective investigating kidnapping case discovers the victim, who may be a zombie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXgcmju6l2pkEi0cazBhCSRKSVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40951'),
  ('314458198847467171', 'The Living Head', 1963, 'Horror', 'Chano Urueta', 'Adolfo López Portillo, Federico Curiel', 'Mauricio Garcés, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Abel Salazar, Germán Robles, Guillermo Cramer, Antonio Raxel, Eric del Castillo', 'NR', 'A group of archaeologists break into the tomb of an ancient Aztec general, arousing the warrior''s head and sending his undead servant out to take revenge on the careless scientists.', 'A group of archaeologists break into the tomb of an ancient Aztec general, arousing the warrior''s head and sending his undead servant out to take revenge on the careless scientists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFRvhKtXBJDrGbmLYPSFGhSPy9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30907'),
  ('649232783617524202', 'The Living Idol', 1957, 'Drama, Adventure', 'René Cardona, Albert Lewin, Jack Hildyard', 'Albert Lewin', 'Steve Forrest, Liliane Montevecchi, James Robertson Justice, Sara García, Eduardo Noriega', 'NR', 'An archaeologist believes a Mexican woman is the reincarnation of an Aztec princess.', 'An archaeologist believes a Mexican woman is the reincarnation of an Aztec princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mz5RrV3wR6ZRqWjwcHVyfBsLf8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191186'),
  ('624578966042004454', 'The Living Playing Cards', 1905, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVoh7zc508Atp0f5Af3xPlLz2Zb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44333'),
  ('519956199711928411', 'The Living Sea', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Greg MacGillivray, Greg MacGillivray', 'Tim Cahill, Roger Holzberg', 'Meryl Streep, Judith Connor, Stephanie K. Martin, Marty Thomas, William Hamner, Jennifer Rock', 'NR', 'The Living Sea celebrates the beauty and power of the ocean as it explores our relationship with this complex and fragile environment. Using beautiful images of unspoiled healthy waters, The Living Sea offers hope for recovery engendered by productive scientific efforts. Oceanographers studying humpback whales, jellyfish, and deep-sea life show us that the more we understand the ocean and its inhabitants, the more we will know how to protect them. The film also highlights the Central Pacific islands of Palau, one of the most spectacular underwater habitats in the world, to show the beauty and potential of a healthy ocean.', 'The Living Sea celebrates the beauty and power of the ocean as it explores our relationship with this complex and fragile environment. Using beautiful images of unspoiled healthy waters, The Living Sea offers hope for recovery engendered by productive scientific efforts. Oceanographers studying humpback whales, jellyfish, and deep-sea life show us that the more we understand the ocean and its inhabitants, the more we will know how to protect them. The film also highlights the Central Pacific islands of Palau, one of the most spectacular underwater habitats in the world, to show the beauty and potential of a healthy ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TnXJlonfRHsYhePYIPH85PQbIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17704'),
  ('925819493214281442', 'The Living World', 2003, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Eugène Green, Raphaël O''Byrne', 'Eugène Green', 'Christelle Prot, Alexis Loret, Adrien Michaux, Laurène Cheilan, Achille Trocellier, Marin Charvet, Arnold Pasquier', null, 'An ogre keeps in his castle two children, whom he intends to eat. A knight and his companion will try to save them, and will be assisted by the ogre''s wife, who thus will also get rid of her husband. A medieval story in contemporary settings.', 'An ogre keeps in his castle two children, whom he intends to eat. A knight and his companion will try to save them, and will be assisted by the ogre''s wife, who thus will also get rid of her husband. A medieval story in contemporary settings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcC31uGdUWVAuR8a20f85DeY2kF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126100'),
  ('351877528139943289', 'The Lizard', 2004, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kamal Tabrizi', 'Peyman Ghasemkhani', 'Parviz Parastouei, Bahram Ibrahimi, Shahrokh Foroutanian, Farideh Sepah Mansour, Maede Tahmasbi, Ali Abedini, Bahram Ebrahimi, Cryus Hemati', null, 'The satirical commentary on clergymen in post-revolutionary Iran. While in prison, petty criminal Reza (Parviz Parastui) comes across a clergyman, sparking a plan for escape. Reza dons his new acquaintance''s clerical robes and makes a bid for freedom. He soon learns that being a clergyman brings little respect from the public. Reza travels to the outlying villages, from where he plots to escape the country. However, his plans must be put on hold when the villagers accept him into their community and expect him to perform religious duties. Will Reza''s prison break transform him into an unlikely pillar of the community?', 'The satirical commentary on clergymen in post-revolutionary Iran. While in prison, petty criminal Reza (Parviz Parastui) comes across a clergyman, sparking a plan for escape. Reza dons his new acquaintance''s clerical robes and makes a bid for freedom. He soon learns that being a clergyman brings little respect from the public. Reza travels to the outlying villages, from where he plots to escape the country. However, his plans must be put on hold when the villagers accept him into their community and expect him to perform religious duties. Will Reza''s prison break transform him into an unlikely pillar of the community?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDnxWhlRLab2h7nFGvuUsq0HQho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75404'),
  ('715391771261308081', 'The Lizzie McGuire Movie', 2003, 'Family, Comedy', 'Jim Fall, Jerzy Zieliński, Robin Lippin', 'Ed Decter, John J. Strauss, Susan Estelle Jansen', 'Hilary Duff, Adam Lamberg, Yani Gellman, Alex Borstein, Brendan Kelly, Ashlie Brillault, Clayton Snyder, Jake Thomas', 'PG', 'Lizzie McGuire has graduated from middle school and takes a trip to Rome, Italy with her class. And what was supposed to be only a normal trip, becomes a teenager''s dream come true.', 'Lizzie McGuire has graduated from middle school and takes a trip to Rome, Italy with her class. And what was supposed to be only a normal trip, becomes a teenager''s dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecDrdzRhl01fck3Bwd3pn9Qm3Un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18736'),
  ('498412077601420139', 'The Load', 2016, 'History, Drama', 'Alan Jonsson', 'Arturo Ruiz Serrano, Alan Jonsson', 'María Valverde, Horacio García Rojas, Gerardo Taracena, Norma Reyna, Harold Torres, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Eric Francés, Eusebio Lázaro', null, 'Late sixteenth century. A Tameme Indian man and a noble Spanish woman flee through the forests of the New World in search of freedom. Their frantic journey softens the tension between them and dissolves their longstanding differences and creates intimate bonds that threaten their very survival.', 'Late sixteenth century. A Tameme Indian man and a noble Spanish woman flee through the forests of the New World in search of freedom. Their frantic journey softens the tension between them and dissolves their longstanding differences and creates intimate bonds that threaten their very survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nGZaSd5kUOmFkks4YulxxSbm8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295460'),
  ('567982041013012300', 'The Loan Stranger', 1942, 'Animation', 'Alex Lovy', null, 'Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers, Harold Peary', 'NR', 'Woody is happily (and nuttily) driving down the street when his car breaks down. He tries to get a loan on it from a nearby wolf. The wolf agrees to give Woody the loan but exclaims if he doesn''t receive payment in thirty days, he''ll take Woody''s car away. Sure enough, a title card tells us, "Thirty days have elapsed (and so has Woody''s memory)". The wolf appears at Woody''s door trying to serve him with a notice but the crafty woodpecker pretends he''s not home. The wolf tries to trap him disguised as a deliveryman giving Woody a cake... but the woodpecker throws it in his face bellowing, "I don''t like cheesecake!" Finally, the fox throws a punch at Woody and believes to have seriously injured him. He sympathetically agrees to forget about the loan only to be infuriated when Woody "recovers" holding a cuckoo clock and asking, "How about a loan on the clock, Doc?"', 'Woody is happily (and nuttily) driving down the street when his car breaks down. He tries to get a loan on it from a nearby wolf. The wolf agrees to give Woody the loan but exclaims if he doesn''t receive payment in thirty days, he''ll take Woody''s car away. Sure enough, a title card tells us, "Thirty days have elapsed (and so has Woody''s memory)". The wolf appears at Woody''s door trying to serve him with a notice but the crafty woodpecker pretends he''s not home. The wolf tries to trap him disguised as a deliveryman giving Woody a cake... but the woodpecker throws it in his face bellowing, "I don''t like cheesecake!" Finally, the fox throws a punch at Woody and believes to have seriously injured him. He sympathetically agrees to forget about the loan only to be infuriated when Woody "recovers" holding a cuckoo clock and asking, "How about a loan on the clock, Doc?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80wiWeROCCVTNqPCQOjkCcyIiVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87249'),
  ('349700384355930475', 'The Lobster', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Thimios Bakatakis, Jessica Timlin', 'Efthimis Filippou, Yorgos Lanthimos', 'Colin Farrell, Rachel Weisz, Olivia Colman, Léa Seydoux, Michael Smiley, Ariane Labed, John C. Reilly, Ben Whishaw', 'R', 'In a dystopian near future, single people, according to the laws of The City, are taken to The Hotel, where they are obliged to find a romantic partner in forty-five days or are transformed into animals and sent off into The Woods.', 'In a dystopian near future, single people, according to the laws of The City, are taken to The Hotel, where they are obliged to find a romantic partner in forty-five days or are transformed into animals and sent off into The Woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y9ILV1unpW9mLpGcqyGQU72LUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254320'),
  ('381055337519500849', 'The Local Stigmatic', 1990, 'Drama', 'David Wheeler, Edward Lachman, Michael Rizzo', 'Heathcote Williams', 'Al Pacino, Paul Guilfoyle, Joseph Maher, Michael Higgins, Brian Mallon, James Bulleit', 'PG-13', 'Two symbiotic sociopaths play obscurely deviant mind games with each other while engaging in perversely brutal acts of violence against victims apparently chosen at random', 'Two symbiotic sociopaths play obscurely deviant mind games with each other while engaging in perversely brutal acts of violence against victims apparently chosen at random', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP1q3x2EIcmq6jRem9AwpVEjGZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72781'),
  ('439098321201488311', 'The Locals', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Greg Page, Bret Nichols', 'Greg Page', 'Johnny Barker, Dwayne Cameron, Kate Elliott, Aidee Walker, Paul Glover, Peter McCauley, Dave Gibson, Glen Levy', 'NR', 'Two best friends, Grant and Paul, hita country road for a night of fun, but unfortunately take a short cut to their fate...where they meet the Locals.', 'Two best friends, Grant and Paul, hita country road for a night of fun, but unfortunately take a short cut to their fate...where they meet the Locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnC2JbGHPHxRvCkdUATq4isCIBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35250'),
  ('16506460971570672', 'The Loch Ness Horror', 1981, 'Horror', 'Larry Buchanan, Robert Ebinger, John S. Curran', 'Larry Buchanan, Lynn Shubert', 'Sandy Kenyon, Miki McKenzie, Barry Buchanan, Eric Scott, Karey-Louis Scott, Doc Livingston, Stuart Lancaster, Preston Hanson', 'PG', 'Hunters set out to catch the legendary Scottish monster that has defied explanation and eluded capture since the 1940s.', 'Hunters set out to catch the legendary Scottish monster that has defied explanation and eluded capture since the 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgnh49ijlYLXginEcFgZg7h8kkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97974'),
  ('851181126450794219', 'The Loch Ness Horror', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tyler-James', 'Tyler-James', 'Becca Hirani, Tara MacGowran, May Kelly, Howard J. Dave, Beatrice Fletcher, Giedre Jackyte, Matthew Baunsgard, Mike Kelson', null, 'A vanished submarine prompts a rescue operation that leads to the Loch Ness monster. Having escaped the Loch, the creature unleashes decades of pent-up aggression on those it encounters.', 'A vanished submarine prompts a rescue operation that leads to the Loch Ness monster. Having escaped the Loch, the creature unleashes decades of pent-up aggression on those it encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFdG5U2PzhRrHRpbbORQrcAMn8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981347'),
  ('309088598693640169', 'The Lockdown', 2024, 'Action', 'Ryan C. Jaeger', 'Stephen Niver, H. Daniel Gross, Ryan C. Jaeger', 'Caity Lotz, Leo Howard, Hon Ping Tang, Michael Biehn, Joseph Angelo, Tharoth Sam, Ron Weaver, Achira Detter', 'R', 'Siblings Charlie and Jack are trapped in Myanmar''s toughest prison and accused of a crime they didn''t commit. Forced into televised fights against other inmates, they must work together and fight for their freedom.', 'Siblings Charlie and Jack are trapped in Myanmar''s toughest prison and accused of a crime they didn''t commit. Forced into televised fights against other inmates, they must work together and fight for their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78ZjjWtG2AxHMo9buTJbzXsbTJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327530'),
  ('1059656545614115375', 'The Lockdown Plan', 2022, 'Comedy', null, 'Chris Lang, Noémie Saglio', 'Zita Hanrot, Sabrina Ouazani, Joséphine Draï, Marc Ruchmann, Syrus Shahidi, Tom Dingler, Yvan Naubron, Guillaume Labbé', null, 'When their plan to spend COVID-19 quarantine together unravels, the friends grapple with the challenge of being cut off from each other—and the world.', 'When their plan to spend COVID-19 quarantine together unravels, the friends grapple with the challenge of being cut off from each other—and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZn7D3zWjCqOwrWwf3LhxPaSINo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:941717'),
  ('371228381525862231', 'The Locked Door', 1929, 'Drama, Thriller', 'George Fitzmaurice, Cullen Tate, Ray June', 'Earle Browne, George Scarborough, C. Gardner Sullivan', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Rod La Rocque, William ''Stage'' Boyd, Betty Bronson, Harry Stubbs, Harry Mestayer, Mack Swain, Zasu Pitts', 'NR', 'On her first anniversary, Ann Reagan finds that her sister-in-law is involved with a shady character that she used to be intimate with, and determines to intervene.', 'On her first anniversary, Ann Reagan finds that her sister-in-law is involved with a shady character that she used to be intimate with, and determines to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQmOYu0QpnlYMiFhra1JybO8f8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39048'),
  ('1118940612543389577', 'The Locker', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kei Horie, Takahiro Hyakusoku', 'Osamu Fukutani, Issei Shibata', 'Asami Mizukawa, Chisato Morishita, Fumina Hara, Maki Horikita, Soko Wada, Mayuka Suzuki, Tomohisa Yuge, Tsugumi Shinohara', null, 'A group of teenagers unleash a curse when they use haunted public lockers in Shibuya. Supposedly, if you leave a gift in one of the lockers you will be lucky in love. However, the results are anything but lucky as a creepy female ghost with long black hair soon shows up to kill them off one by one.', 'A group of teenagers unleash a curse when they use haunted public lockers in Shibuya. Supposedly, if you leave a gift in one of the lockers you will be lucky in love. However, the results are anything but lucky as a creepy female ghost with long black hair soon shows up to kill them off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtWbPC1Bk97uG3xsapUmbspd6NY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167972'),
  ('104780793451810857', 'The Locker 2', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kei Horie, Takahiro Hyakusoku', 'Issei Shibata, Osamu Fukutani', 'Maki Horikita, Fumina Hara, Akane Kimura, Kenichi Matsuyama, Asami Mizukawa, Chisato Morishita, Tomohisa Yuge, Shuji Kashiwabara', null, 'Seconds before Reika (from the first movie) dies, she gives the key to a coin locker to her pupil Ayano. After a hunt for the right coin locker, Ayano finally finds the right one but she soon realizes that some things should be left alone. When some other students at her school finds the coin locker, the curse begins once again. The long haired girl is once again out to get anyone who''s opened the coin locker.', 'Seconds before Reika (from the first movie) dies, she gives the key to a coin locker to her pupil Ayano. After a hunt for the right coin locker, Ayano finally finds the right one but she soon realizes that some things should be left alone. When some other students at her school finds the coin locker, the curse begins once again. The long haired girl is once again out to get anyone who''s opened the coin locker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IcNgcoQLOrsdIODklsTcmq5cWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167979'),
  ('619827012906232998', 'The Locket', 1946, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Nicholas Musuraca, John Brahm, Harry D''Arcy', 'Norma Barzman, Sheridan Gibney', 'Laraine Day, Brian Aherne, Robert Mitchum, Gene Raymond, Sharyn Moffett, Ricardo Cortez, Henry Stephenson, Katherine Emery', 'NR', 'A dark personal secret drives a young woman to use every man she encounters.', 'A dark personal secret drives a young woman to use every man she encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maLGJ5CDL2vWWqKPsd12bwTxFO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38042'),
  ('161529973800660796', 'The Locksmith', 2023, 'Thriller, Mystery, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Harvard, Marlana Sheetz, Jeff Bierman', 'Chris LaMont, John Glosser, Joe Russo', 'Ryan Phillippe, Kate Bosworth, Madeleine Guilbot, Gabriella Quezada, Ving Rhames, Jeffrey Nordling, Charlie Weber, George Akram', 'R', 'A thief fresh out of prison, tries to work his way back into the life of his daughter and ex-fiancé. Determined, he is forced to use the skills he has as a gifted locksmith. Things take a tumultuous turn after an unexpected disappearance.', 'A thief fresh out of prison, tries to work his way back into the life of his daughter and ex-fiancé. Determined, he is forced to use the skills he has as a gifted locksmith. Things take a tumultuous turn after an unexpected disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNQ9Z3TQ5vU5fvwuHqZvLooFcCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075519'),
  ('441643625759989964', 'The Locusts', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Patrick Kelley, Phedon Papamichael', 'John Patrick Kelley', 'Kate Capshaw, Vince Vaughn, Jeremy Davies, Ashley Judd, Paul Rudd, Daniel Meyer, Jessica Capshaw, Jessica Robertson', 'R', 'Delilah Potts has always had her choice of men to work her ranch and fill her bed. But from the moment Clay Hewitt, a handsome drifter with a mysterious past, arrives at her door, Delilah knows that her life will never be the same. And when he spurns her affections, she unleashes a torrent of forbidden passions and deadly secrets that will prove to Clay that the only thing darker and more dangerous than the past he''s escaping... is the one he''s about to discover.', 'Delilah Potts has always had her choice of men to work her ranch and fill her bed. But from the moment Clay Hewitt, a handsome drifter with a mysterious past, arrives at her door, Delilah knows that her life will never be the same. And when he spurns her affections, she unleashes a torrent of forbidden passions and deadly secrets that will prove to Clay that the only thing darker and more dangerous than the past he''s escaping... is the one he''s about to discover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9vNY9tJUENOvXRCUg5FFACtrtL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75250'),
  ('789794554549925365', 'The Lodge', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andy Knapp, Elizabeth Roath, John Rauschelbach', 'Deb Havener', 'Deanna Cramer, Liz Jones, Elizabeth Kell, Mandi Kreisher, Kevin McClatchy, Owen Szabo', null, 'A young couple''s weekend getaway at a secluded mountain ranch becomes an unfathomable nightmare when they discover the truth about the caretaker.', 'A young couple''s weekend getaway at a secluded mountain ranch becomes an unfathomable nightmare when they discover the truth about the caretaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13Z36tF6dxpBrkDQOsGaabxwHoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35247'),
  ('317189071304857897', 'The Lodge', 2020, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Patrick Arias, Yari Azzopardi, Frank Ruszczynski', 'Sergio Casci, Veronika Franz, Severin Fiala', 'Riley Keough, Jaeden Martell, Lia McHugh, Richard Armitage, Alicia Silverstone, Katelyn Wells, Rebecca Faulkenberry, Danny Keough', 'R', 'When a father is forced to abruptly depart for work, he leaves his children, Aidan and Mia, at their holiday home in the care of his new girlfriend, Grace. Isolated and alone, a blizzard traps them inside the lodge as terrifying events summon specters from Grace''s dark past.', 'When a father is forced to abruptly depart for work, he leaves his children, Aidan and Mia, at their holiday home in the care of his new girlfriend, Grace. Isolated and alone, a blizzard traps them inside the lodge as terrifying events summon specters from Grace''s dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yake2myhbW7c6dKbmwYDy1i40bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474764'),
  ('849147251086852770', 'The Lodger', 1932, 'Action, Thriller, Romance, Crime', 'Maurice Elvey, Basil Emmott, William Luff', 'Miles Mander', 'Ivor Novello, Elizabeth Allan, A.W. Baskcomb, Barbara Everest, Jack Hawkins, Shayle Gardner, Peter Gawthorne, Kynaston Reeves', 'NR', 'An elderly couple''s lodger, a British musician (Ivor Novello), becomes the suspect in a series of killings.', 'An elderly couple''s lodger, a British musician (Ivor Novello), becomes the suspect in a series of killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRCdfKgWfQEgMLtPe7nrsV18Zos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175822'),
  ('546671149708363769', 'The Lodger', 1944, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Lucien Ballard, John Brahm', 'Barré Lyndon', 'Merle Oberon, Laird Cregar, George Sanders, Cedric Hardwicke, Sara Allgood, Aubrey Mather, Queenie Leonard, Doris Lloyd', null, 'In Victorian era London, the inhabitants of a family home with rented rooms upstairs fear the new lodger is Jack the Ripper.', 'In Victorian era London, the inhabitants of a family home with rented rooms upstairs fear the new lodger is Jack the Ripper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKuVeCVHRN9hfNWEk06JBVKuWww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29094'),
  ('339002774304943895', 'The Lodger', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'David Ondaatje, David A. Armstrong', 'David Ondaatje', 'Alfred Molina, Hope Davis, Shane West, Donal Logue, Philip Baker Hall, Rachael Leigh Cook, Rebecca Pidgeon, Simon Baker', 'R', 'Follows a seasoned detective on the trail of a ruthless killer intent on slaughtering prostitutes along West Hollywood''s Sunset Strip. It appears that the murderer''s grisly methods are identical to that of London''s infamous 19th century psychopath Jack the Ripper – a relentless serial killer who was never caught by police. To make matters worse, the detective soon notices the parallels between the crimes committed by the West Hollywood stalker and those of a serial murderer incarcerated years ago. Could the wrong man be behind bars?', 'Follows a seasoned detective on the trail of a ruthless killer intent on slaughtering prostitutes along West Hollywood''s Sunset Strip. It appears that the murderer''s grisly methods are identical to that of London''s infamous 19th century psychopath Jack the Ripper – a relentless serial killer who was never caught by police. To make matters worse, the detective soon notices the parallels between the crimes committed by the West Hollywood stalker and those of a serial murderer incarcerated years ago. Could the wrong man be behind bars?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prfQla0ZriFC9PecssAiladiby4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15052'),
  ('207575022447261481', 'The Lodger', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'Baptiste Drapeau', 'Baptiste Drapeau, Ollivier Briand, Mauricio Carrasco', 'Jacqueline Bisset, Alice Isaaz, Bastien Ughetto, François-Dominique Blin, Quentin Laclotte, Olivier Maltini, Antoine Macaud', null, 'Julie just started university in Bordeaux. She moves into the house of Elizabeth, an old widow who lends her a room in exchange for her help with daily chores. There’s one condition: acting as if Victor, Elizabeth’s dead husband, was still alive. But soon, Julie starts feeling his presence… and an inescapable and dangerous love triangle begins.', 'Julie just started university in Bordeaux. She moves into the house of Elizabeth, an old widow who lends her a room in exchange for her help with daily chores. There’s one condition: acting as if Victor, Elizabeth’s dead husband, was still alive. But soon, Julie starts feeling his presence… and an inescapable and dangerous love triangle begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35iyoI248BJ4s1j7lxzI0hU1C1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783572'),
  ('1003175556422813490', 'The Lodger: A Story of the London Fog', 1927, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Gaetano di Ventimiglia, Alma Reville', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Eliot Stannard', 'Ivor Novello, Marie Ault, Arthur Chesney, June Tripp, Malcolm Keen, Reginald Gardiner, Eve Gray, Alfred Hitchcock', 'NR', 'London. A mysterious serial killer brutally murders young blond women by stalking them in the night fog. One foggy, sinister night, a young man who claims his name is Jonathan Drew arrives at the guest house run by the Bunting family and rents a room.', 'London. A mysterious serial killer brutally murders young blond women by stalking them in the night fog. One foggy, sinister night, a young man who claims his name is Jonathan Drew arrives at the guest house run by the Bunting family and rents a room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tD84zwFeFRf3zG98x558N3PBMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2760'),
  ('456780766522324195', 'The Lodgers', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Brian O''Malley, Richard Kendrick', 'David Turpin', 'Charlotte Vega, Bill Milner, Eugene Simon, David Bradley, Moe Dunford, Deirdre O''Kane, Roisin Murphy, Anthony Murphy', 'R', '1920, rural Ireland. Anglo-Irish twins Rachel and Edward share a strange existence in their crumbling family estate. Each night, the property becomes the domain of a sinister presence (The Lodgers) which enforces three rules upon the twins: they must be in bed by midnight; they may not permit an outsider past the threshold; and if one attempts to escape, the life of the other is placed in jeopardy. When troubled war veteran Sean returns to the nearby village, he is immediately drawn to the mysterious Rachel, who in turn begins to break the rules set out by The Lodgers. The consequences pull Rachel into a deadly confrontation with her brother - and with the curse that haunts them.', '1920, rural Ireland. Anglo-Irish twins Rachel and Edward share a strange existence in their crumbling family estate. Each night, the property becomes the domain of a sinister presence (The Lodgers) which enforces three rules upon the twins: they must be in bed by midnight; they may not permit an outsider past the threshold; and if one attempts to escape, the life of the other is placed in jeopardy. When troubled war veteran Sean returns to the nearby village, he is immediately drawn to the mysterious Rachel, who in turn begins to break the rules set out by The Lodgers. The consequences pull Rachel into a deadly confrontation with her brother - and with the curse that haunts them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoqFM6t9wlBITWKRogJUompoClh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429467'),
  ('186161830453106697', 'The Loft', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Richard Cowan, Scott August, Patrick Longman', 'Bart De Pauw', 'Karl Urban, James Marsden, Wentworth Miller, Eric Stonestreet, Matthias Schoenaerts, Isabel Lucas, Rachael Taylor, Rhona Mitra', 'R', 'For five men, the opportunity to share a penthouse in the city -- in which to carry on extramarital affairs -- is a dream come true, until the dead body of an unknown woman turns up. Realizing that her killer must be one of their group, the men are gripped by paranoia as each one suspects another. Friendships are tested, loyalties are questioned, and marriages crumble while fear and suspicion run rampant.', 'For five men, the opportunity to share a penthouse in the city -- in which to carry on extramarital affairs -- is a dream come true, until the dead body of an unknown woman turns up. Realizing that her killer must be one of their group, the men are gripped by paranoia as each one suspects another. Friendships are tested, loyalties are questioned, and marriages crumble while fear and suspicion run rampant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msHg4MRKZBcGwIakhMEaYRSdYag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72784'),
  ('1144493516191345894', 'The London Man', 1943, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Henri Decoin, Paul Cotteret', 'Henri Decoin', 'Fernand Ledoux, Suzy Prim, Jules Berry, Mony Dalmès, Blanche Montel, René Génin, Made Siamé, Marcelle Monthil', null, 'Maloin, a maritime station guard, spends his nights at the port signal box. One night, he becomes the witness of a murder: for a simple suitcase smuggled, the altercation between the two men turns to drama. While the first falls and drowns, the second flees. Maloin, instead of warning the police, decides to dive in and recover the suitcase...which contains more than 3 million in small denominations! That''s when the trouble begins...', 'Maloin, a maritime station guard, spends his nights at the port signal box. One night, he becomes the witness of a murder: for a simple suitcase smuggled, the altercation between the two men turns to drama. While the first falls and drowns, the second flees. Maloin, instead of warning the police, decides to dive in and recover the suitcase...which contains more than 3 million in small denominations! That''s when the trouble begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa9xT7jlfGDqp7nc0nVsRHz9hub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85745'),
  ('775807929744539638', 'The London Nobody Knows', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Norman Cohen, Terry Maher', 'Geoffrey S. Fletcher, Brian Comport', 'James Mason', null, 'Based on Geoffrey Fletcher’s book, this captivating documentary exposes the real London of the swinging sixties. Turning its back on familiar sights, the film explores the hidden details of a crumbling metropolis. With James Mason as our Guide, we are led on an tour of the weird and wonderful pockets of London from abandoned music-halls to egg breaking factories.', 'Based on Geoffrey Fletcher’s book, this captivating documentary exposes the real London of the swinging sixties. Turning its back on familiar sights, the film explores the hidden details of a crumbling metropolis. With James Mason as our Guide, we are led on an tour of the weird and wonderful pockets of London from abandoned music-halls to egg breaking factories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBQnDecjLhXreWre9EMjXivn0PS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19054'),
  ('1076570128771945564', 'The Lone Chipmunks', 1954, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Dessie Flynn, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'In this Lone-Ranger spoof,a cleaned-up version of Pegleg Pete robs a western bank and makes his getaway, and decides to hide his loot in a tree inhabited by two chipmunks, the chattering-and-clattering Chip ''n'' Dale. They resent the intrusion but really begin to give Pete a hard time when they discover a reward if posted for his capture. The cavalry arrives but Chip ''n'' Dale have the situation well in hand.', 'In this Lone-Ranger spoof,a cleaned-up version of Pegleg Pete robs a western bank and makes his getaway, and decides to hide his loot in a tree inhabited by two chipmunks, the chattering-and-clattering Chip ''n'' Dale. They resent the intrusion but really begin to give Pete a hard time when they discover a reward if posted for his capture. The cavalry arrives but Chip ''n'' Dale have the situation well in hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWVbrnzyGbtilbb9OHa70kGdpxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85917'),
  ('492576681604217275', 'The Lone Gun', 1954, 'Western', 'Ray Nazarro, Lester White, Ralph E. Black', 'Richard Schayer, Don Martin', 'George Montgomery, Dorothy Malone, Frank Faylen, Neville Brand, Skip Homeier, Douglas Kennedy, Douglas Fowley, Fay Roope', 'NR', 'Cruze arrives in town and when he stands up to the three Moran brothers, he gets appointed Marshal. First the brothers kill a rancher while framing another man. But when the jailer is murdered, Cruze gets evidence the Morans did it. He tries to raise a posse to chase them down but the townsmen refuse to go. So he rides off by himself to face the three of them.', 'Cruze arrives in town and when he stands up to the three Moran brothers, he gets appointed Marshal. First the brothers kill a rancher while framing another man. But when the jailer is murdered, Cruze gets evidence the Morans did it. He tries to raise a posse to chase them down but the townsmen refuse to go. So he rides off by himself to face the three of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st2RK7Wxhy2erGh7NuhAAL5feoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197605'),
  ('178492160872756261', 'The Lone Ranger', 1956, 'Adventure, Western', 'Stuart Heisler, Edwin B. DuPar, Robert Farfan', 'Herb Meadow', 'Clayton Moore, Jay Silverheels, Lyle Bettger, Bonita Granville, Perry Lopez, Robert J. Wilke, John Pickard, Beverly Washburn', 'NR', 'The territorial governor asks the Lone Ranger to investigate mysterious raids on settlers by Indians who ride with saddles. Wealthy rancher Reese Kilgore wants to mine silver on Spirit Mountain which is sacred to the Indians.', 'The territorial governor asks the Lone Ranger to investigate mysterious raids on settlers by Indians who ride with saddles. Wealthy rancher Reese Kilgore wants to mine silver on Spirit Mountain which is sacred to the Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oRRRoCMDRQ3d23eAzEOcme58iZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108266'),
  ('720780307863516349', 'The Lone Ranger', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Western', 'Gore Verbinski, Bojan Bazelli, Brad Ricker', 'Ted Elliott, Terry Rossio, Justin Haythe', 'Johnny Depp, Armie Hammer, Tom Wilkinson, William Fichtner, Helena Bonham Carter, Barry Pepper, James Badge Dale, Ruth Wilson', 'PG-13', 'The Texas Rangers chase down a gang of outlaws led by Butch Cavendish, but the gang ambushes the Rangers, seemingly killing them all. One survivor is found, however, by an American Indian named Tonto, who nurses him back to health. The Ranger, donning a mask and riding a white stallion named Silver, teams up with Tonto to bring the unscrupulous gang and others of that ilk to justice.', 'The Texas Rangers chase down a gang of outlaws led by Butch Cavendish, but the gang ambushes the Rangers, seemingly killing them all. One survivor is found, however, by an American Indian named Tonto, who nurses him back to health. The Ranger, donning a mask and riding a white stallion named Silver, teams up with Tonto to bring the unscrupulous gang and others of that ilk to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDuJGq8biNMW7zM3w95UaDJv0KG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57201'),
  ('221910610523851531', 'The Lone Ranger and the Lost City of Gold', 1958, 'Action, Adventure, Western', 'Lesley Selander, Kenneth Peach, Willard M. Reineck', 'Robert Schaefer, Eric Freiwald', 'Clayton Moore, Jay Silverheels, Douglas Kennedy, Noreen Nash, Charles Watts, Lisa Montell, Ralph Moody, Dean Fredericks', 'NR', 'Three Indians were brutally murdered by a gang of hooded outlaws. Each one possessed a silver medallion, which were sections cut off from a large silver plaque which served as a treasure map to a secret location where a large amount of gold is reputedly stashed. Two more medallions are unaccounted for, and the The Lone Ranger and his friend Tonto must use all their resources to intercept the gang, prevent further carnage and save the owners of the medallions.', 'Three Indians were brutally murdered by a gang of hooded outlaws. Each one possessed a silver medallion, which were sections cut off from a large silver plaque which served as a treasure map to a secret location where a large amount of gold is reputedly stashed. Two more medallions are unaccounted for, and the The Lone Ranger and his friend Tonto must use all their resources to intercept the gang, prevent further carnage and save the owners of the medallions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4OJND47dGVa3djcGI2K95Q7n6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108267'),
  ('229648163896551207', 'The Lone Runner', 1986, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ruggero Deodato, Roberto Forges Davanzati', 'Chris Trainor, Steven Luotto', 'Miles O''Keeffe, Savina Geršak, Donald Hodson, Ronald Lacey, John Steiner, Hal Yamanouchi, Michael Aronin, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua', null, 'The Summerking''s daughter has been kidnapped, and the legendary hero of the desert comes to her rescue as he did when she was young. The Lone Runner proves to be an unstoppable hero with limitless fighting abilities. He battles those who would harm innocents, and does what ever else he can for them.', 'The Summerking''s daughter has been kidnapped, and the legendary hero of the desert comes to her rescue as he did when she was young. The Lone Runner proves to be an unstoppable hero with limitless fighting abilities. He battles those who would harm innocents, and does what ever else he can for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnl2psm3MxQNhCyvSVjEBdqNGkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29174'),
  ('19471290286422148', 'The Lone Wolf', 2021, 'Mystery', 'Filipe Melo, Vasco Viana', 'Filipe Melo', 'Adriano Luz, António Fonseca, Maria João Pinho, Beatriz Batarda, Custódia Gallego, Márcia Breia, Ana Cloe', null, 'One night on Viva FM''s late night show, host Vitor Lobo gets a phone call from an old friend.', 'One night on Viva FM''s late night show, host Vitor Lobo gets a phone call from an old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edPjeib4kkLdz2wAP6AlYws1PC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829294'),
  ('34362397290929413', 'The Lone Wolf Meets a Lady', 1940, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Sidney Salkow, Henry Freulich, Morris Stoloff', 'John Francis Larkin', 'Warren William, Jean Muir, Eric Blore, Victor Jory, Roger Pryor, Warren Hull, Thurston Hall, Fred Kelsey', 'NR', 'A hardworking secretary for a rich woman finds herself engaged to the woman''s son and accused of a murder she didn''t commit.', 'A hardworking secretary for a rich woman finds herself engaged to the woman''s son and accused of a murder she didn''t commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnYKhyCxI0yhxksyZ1Jdw5N4XyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85231'),
  ('291096857373535550', 'The Lone Wolf Spy Hunt', 1939, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Peter Godfrey, Allen G. Siegler', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Warren William, Ida Lupino, Rita Hayworth, Virginia Weidler, Ralph Morgan, Tom Dugan, Don Beddoe, Leonard Carey', 'NR', 'Spies force former jewel thief Michael Lanyard to steal defense secrets in Washington.', 'Spies force former jewel thief Michael Lanyard to steal defense secrets in Washington.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkpDlu7QoVgQQJ8Y7kaPNpqIrme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149793'),
  ('695059713183584862', 'The Lonedale Operator', 1911, 'Thriller, Drama, Western', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer', 'Mack Sennett', 'Blanche Sweet, George Nichols, Francis J. Grandon, Wilfred Lucas, Edward Dillon, Edna Foster, Verner Clarges, Joseph Graybill', null, 'A young woman takes over her sick father''s role as telegraph operator at a railway station, and has to deal with a team intent on train robbery.', 'A young woman takes over her sick father''s role as telegraph operator at a railway station, and has to deal with a team intent on train robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MdTy7ampj1kE7PYwqxoektrGko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130450'),
  ('1063087191865451689', 'The Loneliest Boy in the World', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Martin Owen, Håvard Helle', 'Piers Ashworth', 'Max Harwood, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Susan Wokoma, Evan Ross, Tallulah Haddon, Hammed Animashaun, Ashley Benson, Ben Miller', 'R', 'After losing his mother, a lonely boy decides to (literally) dig up some new friends, but when they mysteriously come back to life, he’s launched into a series of misadventures as he tries to keep their secret safe from neighbors, classmates and social workers alike.', 'After losing his mother, a lonely boy decides to (literally) dig up some new friends, but when they mysteriously come back to life, he’s launched into a series of misadventures as he tries to keep their secret safe from neighbors, classmates and social workers alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6McNUszcZnRkSa8ZhwlKoLchrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992277'),
  ('785098751362101894', 'The Loneliest Planet', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julia Loktev, Inti Briones', 'Julia Loktev', 'Hani Furstenberg, Gael García Bernal, Bidzina Gujabidze, Tali Pitakhelauri, Tako Pitakhelauri, Ani Kushashvili, Amiran Gudrshauri', null, 'Backpacking in the Caucasus Mountains, walking for hours, an engaged couple and their tour guide trade anecdotes and play games to pass the time, until a momentary misstep, that takes only two or three seconds, changes everything.', 'Backpacking in the Caucasus Mountains, walking for hours, an engaged couple and their tour guide trade anecdotes and play games to pass the time, until a momentary misstep, that takes only two or three seconds, changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZWKbwa9eZvqJJhh5BJQRZRMGTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82321'),
  ('469661515838924661', 'The Loneliness of the Long Distance Runner', 1962, 'Drama', 'Tony Richardson, Basil Rayburn, Andrew Mollo', 'Alan Sillitoe', 'Michael Redgrave, Tom Courtenay, Avis Bunnage, Alec McCowen, James Bolam, Joe Robinson, Dervis Ward, Topsy Jane', 'NR', 'A rebellious youth, sentenced to a boy’s reformatory for robbing a bakery, rises through the ranks of the institution by impressing its Governor through his prowess as a long distance runner. He is encouraged to compete in an upcoming race, but faces ridicule from his peers.', 'A rebellious youth, sentenced to a boy’s reformatory for robbing a bakery, rises through the ranks of the institution by impressing its Governor through his prowess as a long distance runner. He is encouraged to compete in an upcoming race, but faces ridicule from his peers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePhZKUNyFGc8lzx0E0LiCcKs4y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16103'),
  ('680606587922799234', 'The Lonely Guy', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, Victor J. Kemper, Jack Roe', 'Ed. Weinberger, Stan Daniels', 'Steve Martin, Charles Grodin, Judith Ivey, Steve Lawrence, Robyn Douglass, Merv Griffin, Joyce Brothers, Candi Brough', 'R', 'A writer for a greeting card company learns the true meaning of loneliness when he comes home to find his girlfriend in bed with another man.', 'A writer for a greeting card company learns the true meaning of loneliness when he comes home to find his girlfriend in bed with another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6HWtKt6m41SMZuUeFcs94nWfHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27171'),
  ('695227592254426382', 'The Lonely Island Presents: The Unauthorized Bash Brothers Experience', 2019, 'Comedy, Music', 'Joshua Gegen, Andy Morris, Akiva Schaffer', 'Akiva Schaffer, Andy Samberg, Jorma Taccone', 'Andy Samberg, Akiva Schaffer, Jorma Taccone, Hannah Simone, Jenny Slate, Sterling K. Brown, Jim O''Heir, Stephanie Beatriz', 'NR', 'The Lonely Island spoofs Jose Canseco and Mark McGwire in this visual rap album set in the Bash Brothers'' 1980s heyday.', 'The Lonely Island spoofs Jose Canseco and Mark McGwire in this visual rap album set in the Bash Brothers'' 1980s heyday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUrrHBV64W4BwXSzMlGdqjDdWIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604196'),
  ('868240165683816618', 'The Lonely Lady', 1983, 'Drama, Horror', 'Peter Sasdy, Brian West, Gil Rossellini', 'Shawn Randall, John Kershaw', 'Pia Zadora, Lloyd Bochner, Bibi Besch, Joseph Cali, Anthony Holland, Jared Martin, Ray Liotta, Glory Annen', 'R', 'A young screenwriter allows others to exploit her in the hopes of "making it" in Hollywood.', 'A young screenwriter allows others to exploit her in the hopes of "making it" in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cZqppOcKXDQSUw7rY8dRJ0KEb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114394'),
  ('117403321631126175', 'The Lonely Man', 1957, 'Western', 'Henry Levin, Lionel Lindon', 'Harry Essex, Robert Smith', 'Jack Palance, Anthony Perkins, Neville Brand, Robert Middleton, Elisha Cook Jr., Claude Akins, Lee Van Cleef, Harry Shannon', 'NR', 'Aging gunslinger Jacob Wade hopes to settle down with his estranged son, but his old enemies have other plans for him. Gunslinger Jacob Wade finds his long-abandoned son Riley, now a young man who hates his father but has nowhere else to go. Hoping to settle down, Jacob finds no town will have him. They end at Monolith, the ranch of Jacob''s former girlfriend Ada, to whom he had no intention of returning. A mustang hunt finds Riley himself attracted to the shapely Ada...and Jacob having trouble with his eyesight. And his visions of a quiet life are doomed by the re-appearance of enemies from his past...', 'Aging gunslinger Jacob Wade hopes to settle down with his estranged son, but his old enemies have other plans for him. Gunslinger Jacob Wade finds his long-abandoned son Riley, now a young man who hates his father but has nowhere else to go. Hoping to settle down, Jacob finds no town will have him. They end at Monolith, the ranch of Jacob''s former girlfriend Ada, to whom he had no intention of returning. A mustang hunt finds Riley himself attracted to the shapely Ada...and Jacob having trouble with his eyesight. And his visions of a quiet life are doomed by the re-appearance of enemies from his past...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNOYeby8RNcMFaKfPSxLEl1A1DR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43250'),
  ('137484543651460326', 'The Lonely Passion of Judith Hearne', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Clayton, Peter Hannan', 'Peter Nelson', 'Maggie Smith, Bob Hoskins, Wendy Hiller, Marie Kean, Ian McNeice, Rudi Davies, Prunella Scales, Áine Ní Mhuirí', null, 'A penniless middle-aged spinster scrapes by giving piano lessons in the Dublin of the 1950s. She makes a sad last bid for love with a fellow resident of her rundown boarding house, who imagines she has the money to bankroll the business he hopes to open.', 'A penniless middle-aged spinster scrapes by giving piano lessons in the Dublin of the 1950s. She makes a sad last bid for love with a fellow resident of her rundown boarding house, who imagines she has the money to bankroll the business he hopes to open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8Nv1flxRFzjhSywUVApHKWeAMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35841'),
  ('703563613421410542', 'The Lonely Trail', 1936, 'Western', 'Joseph Kane, William Nobles', 'Bernard McConville, Jack Natteford', 'John Wayne, Ann Rutherford, Cy Kendall, Bob Kortman, Fred ''Snowflake'' Toones, Sam Flint, Dennis Moore, Jim Toney', null, 'Though he fought for the North in the Civil War, John is asked by the Governor of Texas to get rid of some troublesome carpetbaggers. He enlists the help of Holden before learning that Holden too is plundering the local folk.', 'Though he fought for the North in the Civil War, John is asked by the Governor of Texas to get rid of some troublesome carpetbaggers. He enlists the help of Holden before learning that Holden too is plundering the local folk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KqD7AcLeRxtV3lSkxr8fT85cZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190837'),
  ('686250150188005838', 'The Lonely Villa', 1909, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer, Arthur Marvin', 'Mack Sennett, André de Lorde', 'Mary Pickford, Marion Leonard, Robert Harron, Violet Mersereau, Owen Moore, David Miles, Gladys Egan, Adele DeGarde', 'G', 'A gang of thieves lure a man out of his home so that they can rob it and threaten his wife and children. The family barricade themselves in an interior room, but the criminals are well-equipped for breaking in. When the father finds out what is happening, he must race against time to get back home.', 'A gang of thieves lure a man out of his home so that they can rob it and threaten his wife and children. The family barricade themselves in an interior room, but the criminals are well-equipped for breaking in. When the father finds out what is happening, he must race against time to get back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZqDwBiwNMj4oY8co6mEmcXNnxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127105'),
  ('156204776757518805', 'The Lonely Voice of Man', 1987, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Sergey Yurizditskiy', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Tatyana Goryacheva, Andrey Gradov, Vladimir Degtyarev, Lyudmila Yakovleva, Nikolay Kochegarov, Sergey Shukailo, Vladimir Gladyshev, Ivan Neganov', null, 'Set in the early 1920s after the end of the Russian Civil War, Red Army soldier Nikita returns to his hometown to see his partner Lyuba, both of whom are scarred by the trauma of the Russian Empire of yesteryear.', 'Set in the early 1920s after the end of the Russian Civil War, Red Army soldier Nikita returns to his hometown to see his partner Lyuba, both of whom are scarred by the trauma of the Russian Empire of yesteryear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daUy4ZaI6yM7OQY8IkvScfDx15S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178907'),
  ('487552394909586737', 'The Loner', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jacques Deray, Jean-François Robin', 'Jacques Deray, Simon Michaël', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jean-Pierre Malo, Michel Beaune, Pierre Vernier, François Dunoyer, Franck Ayas, Laurent Gendron, Jean-Claude de Goros', null, 'In Paris , Commissioner Stan Jalard and Inspector Simon Lecache plan to quit the police to go and enjoy a more peaceful life in the West Indies. In a nightclub, during a routine visit, they spot Schneider, a dreaded gangster and public enemy. At the time of his arrest, Simon is killed at close range by the criminal. Stan then decides to stay in the police to avenge Simon. Being the godfather of Christian, Simon''s son, who sometimes lives in a boarding school, sometimes at home, he takes charge of his education. Two years later, Stan has been promoted, and he''s told that Schneider had resurfaced in the capital. A long hunt begins.', 'In Paris , Commissioner Stan Jalard and Inspector Simon Lecache plan to quit the police to go and enjoy a more peaceful life in the West Indies. In a nightclub, during a routine visit, they spot Schneider, a dreaded gangster and public enemy. At the time of his arrest, Simon is killed at close range by the criminal. Stan then decides to stay in the police to avenge Simon. Being the godfather of Christian, Simon''s son, who sometimes lives in a boarding school, sometimes at home, he takes charge of his education. Two years later, Stan has been promoted, and he''s told that Schneider had resurfaced in the capital. A long hunt begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2He4IwsJF6bjr7kjDeE5ngJbym0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72655'),
  ('182672823486806075', 'The Lonesome Mouse', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lillian Randolph, William Hanna, Frank Graham', 'NR', 'Jerry crashes a vase onto Tom''s head, which gets Mammy to throw Tom out. Jerry at first revels in his freedom, but soon tires of this, and, under a flag of truce, hatches a plan with Tom.', 'Jerry crashes a vase onto Tom''s head, which gets Mammy to throw Tom out. Jerry at first revels in his freedom, but soon tires of this, and, under a flag of truce, hatches a plan with Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tKO5NIBHbBaKmT3BsJT8lnx54m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39892'),
  ('697260606575247656', 'The Long Absence', 1961, 'Drama', 'Marcel Weiss, Henri Colpi', 'Gérard Jarlot, Marguerite Duras', 'Alida Valli, Georges Wilson, Charles Blavette, Philippe de Chérisey, Jacques Harden, Paul Faivre, Catherine Fonteney, Diane Lepvrier', null, 'Therese, a café owner, mourns the mysterious disappearance of her husband sixteen years earlier. A tramp arrives in the town and she believes him to be her husband. But he is suffering from amnesia and she tries to bring back his memory of earlier times.', 'Therese, a café owner, mourns the mysterious disappearance of her husband sixteen years earlier. A tramp arrives in the town and she believes him to be her husband. But he is suffering from amnesia and she tries to bring back his memory of earlier times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPs6Lnp0vfiQDzZELxd4uI09AYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131836'),
  ('435329726432187788', 'The Long and the Short and the Tall', 1961, 'War, Comedy, Drama', 'Erwin Hillier, Leslie Norman', 'Wolf Mankowitz', 'Laurence Harvey, Richard Todd, Richard Harris, David McCallum, Ronald Fraser, John Meillon, John Rees, Kenji Takaki', 'NR', 'Based on a play by Willis Hall. A troop of British soldiers are out in the jungle to record jungle noises and troop noises in the jungle so that the recordings can be played back by other troops to divert the enemy to their whereabouts. As they progress to what they think is closer to the base camp they find themselves farther and farther from radio range until the only channel they can get clearly is that of a Japanese broadcast. They now realize they are probably only 10 to 15 miles from a Japanese camp! The tension is added to by rowdy and openly admitted "non-hero" Private Bamforth who has nothing good to say about anyone and especially Corporal Johnstone (who holds an equal dislike for Bamforth). When a Japanese soldier is taken as their prisoner, the true colours of each man comes to the surface', 'Based on a play by Willis Hall. A troop of British soldiers are out in the jungle to record jungle noises and troop noises in the jungle so that the recordings can be played back by other troops to divert the enemy to their whereabouts. As they progress to what they think is closer to the base camp they find themselves farther and farther from radio range until the only channel they can get clearly is that of a Japanese broadcast. They now realize they are probably only 10 to 15 miles from a Japanese camp! The tension is added to by rowdy and openly admitted "non-hero" Private Bamforth who has nothing good to say about anyone and especially Corporal Johnstone (who holds an equal dislike for Bamforth). When a Japanese soldier is taken as their prisoner, the true colours of each man comes to the surface', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6DagP8sQ8778d0VtbB08cb8gaT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68198'),
  ('953426441759769479', 'The Long Arm', 1956, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Charles Frend, Gordon Dines', 'Robert Barr, Janet Green', 'Jack Hawkins, John Stratton, Dorothy Alison, Michael Brooke, Sam Kydd, Glyn Houston, Richard Leech, Newton Blick', 'NR', 'Scotland Yard detectives attempt to solve a spate of safe robberies across England beginning with clues found at the latest burglary in London. The film is notable for using a police procedural style made popular by Ealing in their 1950 film The Blue Lamp. It is known in the US as The Third Key.', 'Scotland Yard detectives attempt to solve a spate of safe robberies across England beginning with clues found at the latest burglary in London. The film is notable for using a police procedural style made popular by Ealing in their 1950 film The Blue Lamp. It is known in the US as The Third Key.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMWQCfhYNucYrF8JlTYvzXq6L3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50799'),
  ('734535398471587603', 'The Long Darkness', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kei Kumai, Kiyomi Kuroda', 'Kei Kumai, Keiji Hasebe', 'Komaki Kurihara, Gō Katō, Yasushi Nagata, Hisako Takihana, Kinzō Shin, Kaneko Iwasaki, Kayoko Onishi, Hisashi Igawa', null, 'The relationship between Tetsuro, a university student from a disgraced, burdened family, and Shino, a waitress supporting her impoverished relatives. The couple decides to marry despite the significant emotional and social hardships each faces, viewing their love as a means to overcome the shame and despair inherited from their pasts.', 'The relationship between Tetsuro, a university student from a disgraced, burdened family, and Shino, a waitress supporting her impoverished relatives. The couple decides to marry despite the significant emotional and social hardships each faces, viewing their love as a means to overcome the shame and despair inherited from their pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDwcSKJqS9Uy1Z9Ju6ATSFUgD3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12469'),
