  ('425778687645574709', 'The Long Duel', 1967, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Ken Annakin, Jack Hildyard', 'Peter Yeldham', 'Yul Brynner, Trevor Howard, Charlotte Rampling, Harry Andrews, Andrew Keir, Virginia North, Laurence Naismith, Maurice Denham', null, 'An idealistic colonial police officer is sent to capture a rebel leader who threatens the stability of the Raj''s north-west frontier. Despite his official colonial capacity, the policeman is impressed by the ingenuity and integrity of his enemy and is determined to arrest him alive rather than bring him in dead as his superiors might wish.', 'An idealistic colonial police officer is sent to capture a rebel leader who threatens the stability of the Raj''s north-west frontier. Despite his official colonial capacity, the policeman is impressed by the ingenuity and integrity of his enemy and is determined to arrest him alive rather than bring him in dead as his superiors might wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3syg814Sdz4CAQaXucinlWvixoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95562'),
  ('395554932544800961', 'The Long Dumb Road', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Hannah Fidell, Andrew Droz Palermo', 'Carson D. Mell, Hannah Fidell', 'Tony Revolori, Jason Mantzoukas, Taissa Farmiga, Grace Gummer, Ron Livingston, Casey Wilson, Ciara Bravo, Cynthy Wu', 'R', 'Two guys serendipitously meet at a time when they both find themselves at personal crossroads and decide to embark on an unplanned road trip across the American Southwest.', 'Two guys serendipitously meet at a time when they both find themselves at personal crossroads and decide to embark on an unplanned road trip across the American Southwest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGfKFEnKqSVaM0I2xxUnDeLx7t4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457243'),
  ('7891532948744806', 'The Long Excuse', 2016, 'Drama', 'Miwa Nishikawa, Yutaka Yamazaki, Shinji Kuma', 'Miwa Nishikawa', 'Masahiro Motoki, Pistol Takehara, Kenshin Fujita, Tamaki Shiratori, Keiko Horiuchi, Sosuke Ikematsu, Haru Kuroki, Maho Yamada', null, 'A recently widowed writer whose wife died in a bus crash comes to terms with his grief—or lack of it—in caring for the children of a working man who also lost his wife in the same accident.', 'A recently widowed writer whose wife died in a bus crash comes to terms with his grief—or lack of it—in caring for the children of a working man who also lost his wife in the same accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxCsNKSi08lf62gxvTiQaDy0yWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391804'),
  ('1094817881596934522', 'The Long Farewell', 1987, 'Drama', 'Kira Muratova, Gennady Karyuk', 'Natalya Ryazantseva', 'Zinaida Sharko, Oleg Vladimirsky, Yuriy Kayurov, Lidiya Dranovskaya, Tetyana Mychko, Svitlana Kabanova, Lidiya Brazilskaya, Sofiya Belska', null, 'A single mother is confused by the changes in her teenage son, who has become distant since spending summer vacation with his father.', 'A single mother is confused by the changes in her teenage son, who has become distant since spending summer vacation with his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obo9c0BM9QPcLx5TEeYvhscNfTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148822'),
  ('909039083241967539', 'The Long Game', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Julio Quintana, Alex Quintana', 'Julio Quintana, Jennifer C. Stetson, Paco Farias', 'Jay Hernandez, Dennis Quaid, Cheech Marin, Julian Works, Jaina Lee Ortiz, Brett Cullen, Oscar Nuñez, Paulina Chávez', 'PG', 'In a segregated Texas, five Mexican-American teenage caddies were prohibited from playing at the country club where they worked. Against all odds, they formed their own team, built a one-hole course in the fields, and won the 1957 Texas State championship. Based on a true story.', 'In a segregated Texas, five Mexican-American teenage caddies were prohibited from playing at the country club where they worked. Against all odds, they formed their own team, built a one-hole course in the fields, and won the 1957 Texas State championship. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inta4LBe5fJsjgsZjCT6nxjSHso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079810'),
  ('855429727926811157', 'The Long Good Friday', 1980, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'John Mackenzie, Phil Meheux, Simon Hinkly', 'Barrie Keeffe', 'Bob Hoskins, Helen Mirren, Dave King, Bryan Marshall, Derek Thompson, Eddie Constantine, Paul Freeman, P.H. Moriarty', 'R', 'In the late 1970s, Cockney crime boss Harold Shand, a gangster trying to become a legitimate property mogul, has big plans to get the American Mafia to bankroll his transformation of a derelict area of London into the possible venue for a future Olympic Games. However, a series of bombings targets his empire on the very weekend the Americans are in town. Shand is convinced there is a traitor in his organization, and sets out to eliminate the rat in typically ruthless fashion.', 'In the late 1970s, Cockney crime boss Harold Shand, a gangster trying to become a legitimate property mogul, has big plans to get the American Mafia to bankroll his transformation of a derelict area of London into the possible venue for a future Olympic Games. However, a series of bombings targets his empire on the very weekend the Americans are in town. Shand is convinced there is a traitor in his organization, and sets out to eliminate the rat in typically ruthless fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXS667me5Jfoj1b0xuxgjEMKunF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14807'),
