  ('515687590016203932', 'The Long Kiss Goodnight', 1996, 'Crime, Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Renny Harlin, Guillermo Navarro, Kristie Sills', 'Shane Black', 'Geena Davis, Samuel L. Jackson, Yvonne Zima, Craig Bierko, Tom Amandes, Brian Cox, Patrick Malahide, David Morse', 'R', 'Samantha Caine is a small-town schoolteacher and mom with no memory of her life before washing up on a beach eight years ago. After a car accident and a violent home invasion trigger flashes of her past, she discovers she used to be a deadly CIA assassin. Teaming up with a wisecracking private investigator, Samantha must return to her old ways to take down the people who tried to erase her.', 'Samantha Caine is a small-town schoolteacher and mom with no memory of her life before washing up on a beach eight years ago. After a car accident and a violent home invasion trigger flashes of her past, she discovers she used to be a deadly CIA assassin. Teaming up with a wisecracking private investigator, Samantha must return to her old ways to take down the people who tried to erase her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yREdXX5lMFUKhTvb0ofI7mzUHlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11412'),
  ('900637395485476372', 'The Long Memory', 1953, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Hamer, Harry Waxman, Weston Drury Jr.', 'Frank Harvey, Robert Hamer', 'John Mills, John McCallum, Elizabeth Sellars, Eva Bergh, Geoffrey Keen, Michael Martin Harvey, John Chandos, John Slater', 'NR', 'An innocent man is released from prison after 12 years and tracks down the witnesses who lied about him in court.', 'An innocent man is released from prison after 12 years and tracks down the witnesses who lied about him in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uocURWNbUKZyEiF3V4BpIa3JCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50208'),
  ('7435163528881660', 'The Long Night', 1947, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Anatole Litvak, Sol Polito, Aaron Rosenberg', 'John Wexley', 'Henry Fonda, Barbara Bel Geddes, Vincent Price, Ann Dvorak, Howard Freeman, Moroni Olsen, Elisha Cook Jr., Queenie Smith', 'NR', 'City police surround a building, attempting to capture a suspected murderer. The suspect knows there is no escape but refuses to give in.', 'City police surround a building, attempting to capture a suspected murderer. The suspect knows there is no escape but refuses to give in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM9ckww6Apnni3YrQl9R4qsXN7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44626'),
  ('83967310275156032', 'The Long Night', 2022, 'Horror', 'Rich Ragsdale, Pierluigi Malavasi', 'Robert Sheppe, Mark Young', 'Scout Taylor-Compton, Nolan Gerard Funk, Deborah Kara Unger, Jeff Fahey, Kevin Ragsdale, King Orba, Erika Stasiuleviciute, Juniper Ghazi', 'R', 'A devoted couple''s quiet weekend takes a bizarre turn when a nightmarish cult and their maniacal leader come to fulfill an apocalyptic prophesy.', 'A devoted couple''s quiet weekend takes a bizarre turn when a nightmarish cult and their maniacal leader come to fulfill an apocalyptic prophesy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLHGciBl5kwUVJCUj8xKtDqkP7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925705'),
  ('959699987808294092', 'The Long Night of Francisco Sanctis', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Francisco Márquez, Andrea Testa, Federico Lastra', 'Francisco Márquez, Andrea Testa', 'Diego Velázquez, Valeria Lois, Laura Paredes, Marcelo Subiotto, Rafael Federman, Romina Pinto, Santiago Ruiz, Fiorela Duranda', null, 'During the military dictatorship of Argentina in 1977, office clerk Francisco Sanctis, his wife and children lead a quiet life in Bueno Aires. But one day an old friend calls him after 20 years, asking him to sign something. When they meet, she explains that she actually wants him to warn two of her friends that are about to be kidnapped by the army, and Francisco must decide if he wants to risk everything for two strangers.', 'During the military dictatorship of Argentina in 1977, office clerk Francisco Sanctis, his wife and children lead a quiet life in Bueno Aires. But one day an old friend calls him after 20 years, asking him to sign something. When they meet, she explains that she actually wants him to warn two of her friends that are about to be kidnapped by the army, and Francisco must decide if he wants to risk everything for two strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQfslMWBcaTWKTd0g3bdtBZl54J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392809'),
  ('741159047244745430', 'The Long Recess', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Aleksei Korenev', 'Aleksei Korenev', 'Mikhail Kononov, Evgeni Leonov, Aleksandr Zbruev, Rolan Bykov, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Yuriy Kuzmenkov, Nataliya Bogunova, Natalya Gvozdikova', null, 'A young teacher goes to a school for adults. He is younger than many of his students and some of them are starting to miss school.', 'A young teacher goes to a school for adults. He is younger than many of his students and some of them are starting to miss school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cp2ixGFZadxL9RC3rCQk5OHmXEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75262'),
  ('1150700781540268947', 'The Long Riders', 1980, 'Western, Action, Crime, Drama, History', 'Walter Hill, Ric Waite, Craig R. Baxley', 'Stacy Keach, James Keach, Steven Philip Smith', 'David Carradine, Keith Carradine, Robert Carradine, James Keach, Stacy Keach, Dennis Quaid, Randy Quaid, Kevin Brophy', 'R', 'The origins, exploits and the ultimate fate of the James gang is told in a sympathetic portrayal of the bank robbers made up of brothers who begin their legendary bank raids because of revenge.', 'The origins, exploits and the ultimate fate of the James gang is told in a sympathetic portrayal of the bank robbers made up of brothers who begin their legendary bank raids because of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Dk9dieSkZeiEVarZFsPJdF9Qel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14729'),
  ('399813909461642083', 'The Long Ships', 1964, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jack Cardiff, Christopher Challis', 'Beverley Cross, Berkely Mather', 'Richard Widmark, Sidney Poitier, Russ Tamblyn, Rosanna Schiaffino, Oskar Homolka, Edward Judd, Lionel Jeffries, Beba Lončar', 'PG', 'Moorish ruler El Mansuh is determined to locate a massive bell made of gold known as the "Mother of Voices." Viking explorer Rolfe also becomes intent on finding the mythical treasure, and sails with his crew from Scandinavia to Africa to track it down. Reluctantly working together, El Mansuh and Rolfe, along with their men, embark on a quest for the prized object, but only one leader will be able to claim the bell as his own — if it even exists at all.', 'Moorish ruler El Mansuh is determined to locate a massive bell made of gold known as the "Mother of Voices." Viking explorer Rolfe also becomes intent on finding the mythical treasure, and sails with his crew from Scandinavia to Africa to track it down. Reluctantly working together, El Mansuh and Rolfe, along with their men, embark on a quest for the prized object, but only one leader will be able to claim the bell as his own — if it even exists at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgZOBBGsZGKhK7ajbmAe2egcqbc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44736'),
  ('254474240449530576', 'The Long Vacations of ''36', 1976, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jaime Camino, Fernando Arribas, Martín Sacristán', 'Jaime Camino, Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'José Sacristán, Concha Velasco, Francisco Rabal, Analía Gadé, Ismael Merlo, Ángela Molina, Vicente Parra, Charo Soriano', null, 'Spain, 1936. The Civil War breaks out. In a village near Barcelona, several families decide to continue living in their summer houses until the violence ends.', 'Spain, 1936. The Civil War breaks out. In a village near Barcelona, several families decide to continue living in their summer houses until the violence ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5U2KVc7QxOFzhoy2cha2htlBnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221711'),
  ('989571223662977959', 'The Long Voyage Home', 1940, 'Drama, War', 'John Ford, Gregg Toland, Wingate Smith', 'Dudley Nichols', 'John Wayne, Thomas Mitchell, Ian Hunter, Barry Fitzgerald, Wilfrid Lawson, John Qualen, Mildred Natwick, Ward Bond', 'NR', 'The crew of the merchant ship Glencairn hope to survive a transatlantic crossing during World War II. Adapted from four Eugene O''Neill one-act plays.', 'The crew of the merchant ship Glencairn hope to survive a transatlantic crossing during World War II. Adapted from four Eugene O''Neill one-act plays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZifqG5wSSAoCGl7r3ESFW46Opl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52859'),
  ('668851799668724001', 'The Long Wait', 1954, 'Crime, Drama', 'Franz Planer, Victor Saville, William McGarry', 'Alan Green, Lesser Samuels', 'Anthony Quinn, Charles Coburn, Gene Evans, Peggie Castle, Mary Ellen Kay, Shirley Patterson, Dolores Donlon, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'Soon after thumbing a ride from a truck driver, Johnny McBride is badly burned and suffers from complete amnesia when the vehicle he’s riding in blows a tire and goes over an embankment in a fiery blaze. McBride later receives a tip from an acquaintance that a photo of him was placed prominently in the window of a photography studio in a town called Lyncastle, so Johnny immediately leaves for the burg in the hopes that something there will jog his memory.', 'Soon after thumbing a ride from a truck driver, Johnny McBride is badly burned and suffers from complete amnesia when the vehicle he’s riding in blows a tire and goes over an embankment in a fiery blaze. McBride later receives a tip from an acquaintance that a photo of him was placed prominently in the window of a photography studio in a town called Lyncastle, so Johnny immediately leaves for the burg in the hopes that something there will jog his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pz8wzIFZ4lLySHKcqC7xUyLn4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37195'),
  ('881732207133519340', 'The Long Walk', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Francis Lawrence, Jo Willems, Sinan Saber', 'JT Mollner', 'Cooper Hoffman, David Jonsson, Garrett Wareing, Tut Nyuot, Charlie Plummer, Ben Wang, Jordan Gonzalez, Joshua Odjick', 'R', 'In a dystopian 1970s America, fifty teenage boys take part in a deadly annual walking contest, forced to maintain a minimum pace or be executed, until only one survivor remains.', 'In a dystopian 1970s America, fifty teenage boys take part in a deadly annual walking contest, forced to maintain a minimum pace or be executed, until only one survivor remains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wobVTa99eW0ht6c1rNNzLkazPtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604079'),
  ('508314338855026306', 'The Long Walk Home', 1990, 'Drama, History', 'Richard Pearce, Roger Deakins', 'John Cork', 'Sissy Spacek, Whoopi Goldberg, Dwight Schultz, Ving Rhames, Dylan Baker, Erika Alexander, Lexi Randall, Richard Habersham', 'PG', 'Two women, black and white, in 1955 Montgomery Alabama, must decide what they are going to do in response to the famous bus boycott led by Martin Luther King.', 'Two women, black and white, in 1955 Montgomery Alabama, must decide what they are going to do in response to the famous bus boycott led by Martin Luther King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7T2oVjLHHIDY6FQH9e04oOgPWQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51763'),
  ('782342750261189105', 'The Long Way Home', 1997, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Mark Jonathan Harris, Don Lenzer', 'Mark Jonathan Harris', 'Morgan Freeman, Ed Asner, Sean Astin, Martin Landau, Miriam Margolyes, David Paymer, Nina Siemaszko, Helen Slater', null, 'The story of the post World War II Jewish refugee situation from liberation to the establishment of the modern state of Israel.', 'The story of the post World War II Jewish refugee situation from liberation to the establishment of the modern state of Israel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inb3aRpo10mOpGxBzwE0v1OF53c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113290'),
  ('1052087558738727360', 'The Long Way Home', 1998, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Glenn Jordan, Tobias A. Schliessler', 'Patrick Jamain, Louise Vincent', 'Jack Lemmon, Sarah Paulson, Kristin Griffith, Garwin Sanford, Rosemary Dunsmore, Peter Dvorsky, Tom Butler, James Purcell', null, 'A retired widower wanders away from his daughter''s home, hooks up with a free-spirited young woman, and goes on a cross-country odyssey to look up an old flame he''s recently heard from after 55 years.', 'A retired widower wanders away from his daughter''s home, hooks up with a free-spirited young woman, and goes on a cross-country odyssey to look up an old flame he''s recently heard from after 55 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds2fd9eRXQLcLlouRJ1QDk8OaCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111693'),
  ('918336791480727591', 'The Long Way Home', 2013, 'War, Drama, History', 'Alphan Eşeli, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'Serdar Tantekin, Alphan Eşeli', 'Uğur Polat, Nergis Öztürk, Serdar Orçin, Muharrem Bayrak, Şevket Süha Tezel, Sıla Çetindağ, Miray Akay, Şebnem Hassanisoughi', null, 'Inhospitable at the best of times, the snow-covered mountainscapes of Eastern Anatolia constituted a fatal frontier for many war exiles after the battle of Sarikamish in 1915, and provides a canvas laced with beauty and threat for this bone-chilling survival yarn, the superb debut feature of Alphan Eşeli. Starting out with three characters – a refugee mother and daughter and their grizzled guide – the film traces their daunting trek across this barren terrain to safety, with the Russians encroaching and other stragglers, including a pair of wounded, frostbitten Ottoman soldiers, all orbiting the same burnt-out village they find in their path. Puncturing its aura of ghostly impasse with some shocking narrative reversals, and constantly prickling with the mutual dread of strangers in gruelling extremes, the movie stakes out hugely credible ground next to established Eastern Front war classics (In the Fog, Come and See) while remaining thoroughly its own beast. (Source: LFF programme)', 'Inhospitable at the best of times, the snow-covered mountainscapes of Eastern Anatolia constituted a fatal frontier for many war exiles after the battle of Sarikamish in 1915, and provides a canvas laced with beauty and threat for this bone-chilling survival yarn, the superb debut feature of Alphan Eşeli. Starting out with three characters – a refugee mother and daughter and their grizzled guide – the film traces their daunting trek across this barren terrain to safety, with the Russians encroaching and other stragglers, including a pair of wounded, frostbitten Ottoman soldiers, all orbiting the same burnt-out village they find in their path. Puncturing its aura of ghostly impasse with some shocking narrative reversals, and constantly prickling with the mutual dread of strangers in gruelling extremes, the movie stakes out hugely credible ground next to established Eastern Front war classics (In the Fog, Come and See) while remaining thoroughly its own beast. (Source: LFF programme)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWJ6CAqZZ36cz5Kb14RR5CkznLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231030'),
  ('3432700403027113', 'The Long Way Home', 2015, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Chun Sung-il, Lee Jae-hyeok, Jung Sung-jin', 'Chun Sung-il, Kim Ik-ro', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Yeo Jin-goo, Chung Sung-hwa, Jo Hee-bong, Kim Won-hae, Jung Suk-won, Kim Sun-young, Noh Young-hak', null, 'Nam-bok, a middle-aged South Korean farmer is conscripted and assigned a mission to deliver a classified military document that may decide the fate of the war. After losing it while under attack from the enemy, he then faces a teenage North Korean soldier named Yeong-gwang who happens to acquire the secret document on his way to the North.', 'Nam-bok, a middle-aged South Korean farmer is conscripted and assigned a mission to deliver a classified military document that may decide the fate of the war. After losing it while under attack from the enemy, he then faces a teenage North Korean soldier named Yeong-gwang who happens to acquire the secret document on his way to the North.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wT2TvLsB3n76TLZAOJv84nSsjHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361297'),
  ('205818687699947326', 'The Long Weekend', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pat Holden, Brian Pearson', 'Tad Safran', 'Chris Klein, Brendan Fehr, Chandra West, Cobie Smulders, Paul Campbell, Craig Fairbrass, Evangeline Lilly, Chelan Simmons', 'R', 'Cooper is an actor who sees life as one big party, while Ed is in advertising and takes life too seriously. When Ed gets stressed over a deadline he has to meet, his brother Cooper works hard in trying to get his brother hooked up with a girl, thus a long weekend of stress and beautiful women, culminating in Ed meeting, and making love to, the woman of his dreams.', 'Cooper is an actor who sees life as one big party, while Ed is in advertising and takes life too seriously. When Ed gets stressed over a deadline he has to meet, his brother Cooper works hard in trying to get his brother hooked up with a girl, thus a long weekend of stress and beautiful women, culminating in Ed meeting, and making love to, the woman of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSzN5KfJW9htMdItZ5pQ5QFRTO2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19109'),
  ('702991332954005574', 'The Long, Hot Summer', 1958, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, Eli Dunn, Joseph LaShelle', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward, Anthony Franciosa, Orson Welles, Lee Remick, Angela Lansbury, Richard Anderson, Sarah Marshall', 'NR', 'Accused barn burner and conman Ben Quick arrives in a small Mississippi town and quickly ingratiates himself with its richest family, the Varners.', 'Accused barn burner and conman Ben Quick arrives in a small Mississippi town and quickly ingratiates himself with its richest family, the Varners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWQddN7kfkVqSimb4SQc35gNUnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40085'),
  ('882114372670585186', 'The Long, Long Trailer', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vincente Minnelli, Robert Surtees, Joel Freeman', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Lucille Ball, Desi Arnaz, Marjorie Main, Keenan Wynn, Gladys Hurlbut, Moroni Olsen, Bert Freed, Madge Blake', 'NR', 'A newly wed couple, Tacy and Nicky, travel in a trailer for their honeymoon. The journey is a humorous one that could end up destroying their marriage.', 'A newly wed couple, Tacy and Nicky, travel in a trailer for their honeymoon. The journey is a humorous one that could end up destroying their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOFWMCpKqRYMqG8ROtk09SzkmV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24518'),
  ('528910103530571782', 'The Longest Day', 1962, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Ken Annakin, Jean Bourgoin, Bernhard Wicki', 'Romain Gary, James Jones, David Pursall', 'John Wayne, Robert Mitchum, Henry Fonda, Richard Burton, Sean Connery, Leslie Phillips, Robert Ryan, Paul Anka', 'PG', 'The retelling of June 6, 1944, from the perspectives of the Germans, US, British, Canadians, and the Free French. Marshall Erwin Rommel, touring the defenses being established as part of the Reich''s Atlantic Wall, notes to his officers that when the Allied invasion comes they must be stopped on the beach. "For the Allies as well as the Germans, it will be the longest day"', 'The retelling of June 6, 1944, from the perspectives of the Germans, US, British, Canadians, and the Free French. Marshall Erwin Rommel, touring the defenses being established as part of the Reich''s Atlantic Wall, notes to his officers that when the Allied invasion comes they must be stopped on the beach. "For the Allies as well as the Germans, it will be the longest day"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zmvEofdIlgXrQl9A7e5IOzlnFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9289'),
  ('227649172076603071', 'The Longest Distance', 2013, 'Drama, Family', 'Claudia Pinto Emperador, Mariella Pérez, Gabo Guerra', 'Claudia Pinto Emperador', 'Carme Elias, Omar Moya, Alec Whaite, Iván Tamayo, Alberto Rowinsky, Isabel Rocatti, Marcos Moreno, Malena González', null, 'Two sides of the same country: a chaotic and violent city contrasting against a natural paradise where the oldest mountains on the planet can be found. Two main characters that find each other at a crucial moment. Two fearless journeys, one that begins as a childlike adventure and ends up on the other side of the country and a one-way journey, free and determined. The same destiny will inevitably bond a woman with her grandson. Without knowing it they are part of an unbreakable family circle that deeply unites them. Second opportunities will arise while individual freedom of choice will become imposing. Everything comes together to tell us: there is only one destiny, the one you choose for yourself.', 'Two sides of the same country: a chaotic and violent city contrasting against a natural paradise where the oldest mountains on the planet can be found. Two main characters that find each other at a crucial moment. Two fearless journeys, one that begins as a childlike adventure and ends up on the other side of the country and a one-way journey, free and determined. The same destiny will inevitably bond a woman with her grandson. Without knowing it they are part of an unbreakable family circle that deeply unites them. Second opportunities will arise while individual freedom of choice will become imposing. Everything comes together to tell us: there is only one destiny, the one you choose for yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHxfWJXDll0lVQfnE3JhUsIAXEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268187'),
  ('974774926951099953', 'The Longest Night', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Gabriela Calvache, Gris Jordana', 'Gabriela Calvache', 'Noëlle Schonwald, Cristian Mercado, Jaime Tamariz, Ariana Freire, Nadine Muñoz Cervantes, Cristina Marchán, Naomi Ruf Calvache, Joaquín González Muro', null, 'A beautiful woman turns to prostitution. She must surrender her income to the leader of a human trafficking ring, but her daughter’s illness and a drug addiction prevent her from delivering her usual share. An unexpected event will give her the opportunity to stop obeying and take justice into her own hands.', 'A beautiful woman turns to prostitution. She must surrender her income to the leader of a human trafficking ring, but her daughter’s illness and a drug addiction prevent her from delivering her usual share. An unexpected event will give her the opportunity to stop obeying and take justice into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0MP9swm7E4C9owBJvHl7NNeKFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573227'),
  ('663632003952050007', 'The Longest Night in Shanghai', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhang Yibai, Tao Yang', 'Zhang Yibai', 'Vicky Zhao, Masahiro Motoki, Naomi Nishida, Takashi Tsukamoto, Dylan Kuo, Soko Wada, Sam Lee, Shinobu Otsuka', null, 'A successful Japanese make-up artist collides with a tough-talking Shanghai taxi driver in this romantic dramedy that twists traditional roles by making the beauty expert a male and the cab driver a feisty female. Although he works in a glamorous industry, Naoki Mizushima can''t help but notice that his life is anything but beautiful. Can the uncouth Lin Xi help him make over his life for the better?', 'A successful Japanese make-up artist collides with a tough-talking Shanghai taxi driver in this romantic dramedy that twists traditional roles by making the beauty expert a male and the cab driver a feisty female. Although he works in a glamorous industry, Naoki Mizushima can''t help but notice that his life is anything but beautiful. Can the uncouth Lin Xi help him make over his life for the better?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPqgSmDBU6qYS9QHNnzbLyxaeNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52463'),
  ('383859029335064791', 'The Longest Nite', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Mau Kin-Tak, Patrick Yau Tat-Chi, Siu Chi-Ming', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Maggie Shiu, Sunny Fang Kang, Lung Fong, Ronny Ching Siu-Lung, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Wong Tin-Lam', null, 'A corrupt cop named Sam handles negotiations between two Triad leaders who plan to join forces. However, he meets a suspicious bald man named Tony, who keeps following him around and disrupting his personal business.', 'A corrupt cop named Sam handles negotiations between two Triad leaders who plan to join forces. However, he meets a suspicious bald man named Tony, who keeps following him around and disrupting his personal business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGceZ7I1IibzaWHngbrsuOf75g5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41158'),
  ('845607789473801111', 'The Longest Penalty Shot in the World', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santiago, Juan Antonio Castaño, Javier Gil del Álamo', 'Roberto Santiago', 'Fernando Tejero, María Botto, Marta Larralde, Carlos Kaniowsky, Javier Gutiérrez, Enrique Villén, Fernando Cayo, Héctor Colomé', null, 'Fernando (Fernando Tejero) is a loser. A gray type, without ambition, that works like bookcases distributor in a supermarket of the quarter. In his free short whiles, he is a substitute keeper of a football team, a third regional one. In all the season he has not played a single minute. But the last Sunday of the league the referee indicates penalty and the regular keeper injures itself. Fernando must occupy the goal for the first time. If penalty scores, the team of the district will proclaim champion. If no, all the effort of a year will not have been worth for anything. When the penalty is just about to be kicked, a group of indignant fans with the referee invades the field and prevents the kick. The competition committee decides that the penalty must play the following Sunday, in the same goal, with same players and the field closed to the public. El Penalti más largo del mundo, (The Longest Penalty Shot in the World) is exactly the history of that week of delay.', 'Fernando (Fernando Tejero) is a loser. A gray type, without ambition, that works like bookcases distributor in a supermarket of the quarter. In his free short whiles, he is a substitute keeper of a football team, a third regional one. In all the season he has not played a single minute. But the last Sunday of the league the referee indicates penalty and the regular keeper injures itself. Fernando must occupy the goal for the first time. If penalty scores, the team of the district will proclaim champion. If no, all the effort of a year will not have been worth for anything. When the penalty is just about to be kicked, a group of indignant fans with the referee invades the field and prevents the kick. The competition committee decides that the penalty must play the following Sunday, in the same goal, with same players and the field closed to the public. El Penalti más largo del mundo, (The Longest Penalty Shot in the World) is exactly the history of that week of delay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCHM8G50TUOpAf7CIdxKcKZo9Nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43431'),
  ('948496827135506561', 'The Longest Summer', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fruit Chan, Lau Kwok-Wai, Lam Wah-Chuen', 'Fruit Chan', 'Tony Ho, Sam Lee, Jo Kok Cho-Lam, Robby Cheung, Bobby Lam Sek-Gin, Gary Lai, Chan Sang, Pang Yik-Wai', null, 'It is July 1st of 1997, and Hong Kong is bright in celebration. The United Kingdom handover of Hong Kong to the People''s Republic of China leaves Ga Yin, and his fellow soldiers without work. Which leads them to find employment and money any way they can get it. Without much success, Ga Yin decides to join his brother Ga Suen in the triad gang world.', 'It is July 1st of 1997, and Hong Kong is bright in celebration. The United Kingdom handover of Hong Kong to the People''s Republic of China leaves Ga Yin, and his fellow soldiers without work. Which leads them to find employment and money any way they can get it. Without much success, Ga Yin decides to join his brother Ga Suen in the triad gang world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l42DP6D0x9OGKAJrtYq98ICBT7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118211'),
  ('688931938066280792', 'The Longest Week', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Glanz, Ben Kutchins, Eric LaFranchi', 'Peter Glanz', 'Jason Bateman, Olivia Wilde, Billy Crudup, Jenny Slate, Tony Roberts, Barry Primus, Laura Clery, William Abadie', 'PG-13', 'Left broke and homeless by his wealthy parents'' divorce, a young man moves in with an old friend and finally meets the woman of his dreams -- only to discover she''s already dating his friend.', 'Left broke and homeless by his wealthy parents'' divorce, a young man moves in with an old friend and finally meets the woman of his dreams -- only to discover she''s already dating his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXWsjQefKVsJdQQsu5NZT1Zk1rv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206821'),
  ('46313615268993739', 'The Longest Yard', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc, Clifford C. Coleman', 'Tracy Keenan Wynn', 'Burt Reynolds, Eddie Albert, Ed Lauter, Michael Conrad, James Hampton, Harry Caesar, John Steadman, Charles Tyner', 'R', 'A football player-turned-convict organizes a team of inmates to play against a team of prison guards. His dilemma is that the warden asks him to throw the game in return for an early release, but he is also concerned about the inmates'' lack of self-esteem.', 'A football player-turned-convict organizes a team of inmates to play against a team of prison guards. His dilemma is that the warden asks him to throw the game in return for an early release, but he is also concerned about the inmates'' lack of self-esteem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qtpPGRpMEnwhRRoq3iqyQm238V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4985'),
  ('547686696806426413', 'The Longest Yard', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Segal, Dean Semler, John Nasraway', 'Tracy Keenan Wynn', 'Adam Sandler, Chris Rock, James Cromwell, Nelly, Michael Irvin, Bob Sapp, William Fichtner, Cloris Leachman', 'PG-13', 'Disgraced pro football quarterback Paul Crewe lands in a Texas federal penitentiary, where manipulative Warden Hazen recruits him to advise the institution''s football team of prison guards. Crewe suggests a tune-up game which lands him quarterbacking a crew of inmates in a game against the guards. Aided by incarcerated ex-NFL coach and player Nate Scarborough, Crewe and his team must overcome not only the bloodthirstiness of the opposition, but also the corrupt warden trying to fix the game against them.', 'Disgraced pro football quarterback Paul Crewe lands in a Texas federal penitentiary, where manipulative Warden Hazen recruits him to advise the institution''s football team of prison guards. Crewe suggests a tune-up game which lands him quarterbacking a crew of inmates in a game against the guards. Aided by incarcerated ex-NFL coach and player Nate Scarborough, Crewe and his team must overcome not only the bloodthirstiness of the opposition, but also the corrupt warden trying to fix the game against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbKcVBcxF96ARW2oKHqDYAcLdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9291'),
  ('831080056248632166', 'The Longing', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Jürgen Brüning', 'Jürgen Brüning', 'Hendrik Scheider, Aldri Anunciação, Tarik Qazi, Daniel Bätscher, Zezé Motta', 'NR', 'Cyrus, Tim and Erik were high school buddies and meet again ten years later. They spend the summer together in Brazil. All of them are occupied in dealing with experiences from their past but new developments make them face their inner conflicts and their friendship with each other', 'Cyrus, Tim and Erik were high school buddies and meet again ten years later. They spend the summer together in Brazil. All of them are occupied in dealing with experiences from their past but new developments make them face their inner conflicts and their friendship with each other', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJvUK4yT3n1fikHZQ3eWjsIgGKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121886'),
  ('724784684147037032', 'The Longshots', 2008, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Fred Durst, Conrad W. Hall, Scott Cameron', 'Nick Santora', 'Ice Cube, Keke Palmer, Tasha Smith, Jill Marie Jones, Dash Mihok, Matt Craven, Glenn Plummer, Garrett Morris', 'PG', 'The true story of Jasmine Plummer who, at the age of eleven, became the first female to play in Pop Warner football tournament in its 56-year history.', 'The true story of Jasmine Plummer who, at the age of eleven, became the first female to play in Pop Warner football tournament in its 56-year history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrejNUR8giaAYIJkaLztELRrVXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13579'),
  ('405548037674430769', 'The Look of Love', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Winterbottom, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Matt Greenhalgh', 'Steve Coogan, Anna Friel, Imogen Poots, Tamsin Egerton, Chris Addison, James Lance, Simon Bird, Shirley Henderson', 'NR', 'Paul Raymond builds a porn, entertainment and real estate empire that makes him the wealthiest man in Britain, but drugs doom his beloved daughter, Debbie.', 'Paul Raymond builds a porn, entertainment and real estate empire that makes him the wealthiest man in Britain, but drugs doom his beloved daughter, Debbie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0z11oO94cBIcI2zzGeuxfrPQuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158914'),
