  ('315754560535314638', 'The Looney, Looney, Looney Bugs Bunny Movie', 1981, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Crime, Music, Western', 'Friz Freleng', 'Tedd Pierce, Friz Freleng, John W. Dunn', 'Mel Blanc, June Foray, Bea Benaderet, Stan Freberg, Ralph James, Frank Nelson, Frank Welker', 'G', 'Bugs Bunny hosts an award show featuring several classic Looney Tunes shorts and characters.', 'Bugs Bunny hosts an award show featuring several classic Looney Tunes shorts and characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hsUFCUVvURJCvxofQaqMN9noDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41394'),
  ('942212990856284854', 'The Loop', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Patryk Vega', 'Grzegorz Barłog, Patryk Vega', 'Antoni Królikowski, Piotr Stramowski, Katarzyna Warnke, Rafał Cieszyński, Dagmara Kaźmierska, Arkadiusz Nader, Henryk Talar, Tomasz Dedek', null, 'A seeming coincidence makes the paths of a police officer Daniel and two twin brothers from Ukraine cross. Thanks to the information acquired from Zenia and Alex and their contacts with the local underworld, the young policeman is quickly promoted and becomes an officer of the Central Anticorruption Bureau.', 'A seeming coincidence makes the paths of a police officer Daniel and two twin brothers from Ukraine cross. Thanks to the information acquired from Zenia and Alex and their contacts with the local underworld, the young policeman is quickly promoted and becomes an officer of the Central Anticorruption Bureau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HxCaKn8kEeFVoL7xbH7ipes0za.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713059'),
  ('744023917934134180', 'The Lorax', 1972, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Drama, Fantasy', 'Hawley Pratt', 'Dr. Seuss', 'Eddie Albert, Bob Holt, Athena Lorde, Harlen Carraher, Scatman Crothers, Vivian Vance, Thurl Ravenscroft', null, 'The Once-ler, a ruined industrialist, tells the tale of his rise to wealth and subsequent fall, as he disregarded the warnings of a wise old forest creature called the Lorax about the environmental destruction caused by his greed.', 'The Once-ler, a ruined industrialist, tells the tale of his rise to wealth and subsequent fall, as he disregarded the warnings of a wise old forest creature called the Lorax about the environmental destruction caused by his greed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f2T6PDGXcsCfkeizkwS4O1dyQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38060'),
  ('76847981294894078', 'The Lorax', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Chris Renaud, Kyle Balda', 'Cinco Paul, Ken Daurio', 'Danny DeVito, Ed Helms, Zac Efron, Rob Riggle, Taylor Swift, Jenny Slate, Betty White, Nasim Pedrad', 'PG', 'A 12-year-old boy searches for the one thing that will enable him to win the affection of the girl of his dreams. To find it he must discover the story of the Lorax, the grumpy yet charming creature who fights to protect his world.', 'A 12-year-old boy searches for the one thing that will enable him to win the affection of the girl of his dreams. To find it he must discover the story of the Lorax, the grumpy yet charming creature who fights to protect his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tePFnZFw5JvjwjQjaKkqDPNMLPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73723'),
  ('597196770555721371', 'The Lord of the G-Strings: The Femaleship of the String', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Terry West, John Paul Fedele', 'Terry West', 'Erin Brown, Darian Caine, A.J. Khan, Barbara Joyce, Michael R. Thomas, John Link, Anushka Garin, Allanah Rhodes', 'R', 'In the mythical realm of Diddle Earth, delectable Throbbit Bildo Saggins, is sent by Smirnoff the Wizard to destroy the legendary G-String - the most powerful weapon in the land.', 'In the mythical realm of Diddle Earth, delectable Throbbit Bildo Saggins, is sent by Smirnoff the Wizard to destroy the legendary G-String - the most powerful weapon in the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nk0LBlLQItdXka8NQYpVUP2jaIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34648'),
  ('1100615872512866934', 'The Lord of the Rings', 1978, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Ralph Bakshi, Timothy Galfas, John Sparey', 'Peter S. Beagle, Chris Conkling', 'Christopher Guard, William Squire, Michael Scholes, John Hurt, Simon Chandler, Dominic Guard, Michael Graham Cox, Anthony Daniels', 'PG', 'Young Hobbit Frodo Baggins is thrown into an amazing adventure when he''s tasked with destroying the One Ring, created by the dark lord Sauron. Frodo must travel in a small fellowship of nine warriors and accomplices. But it won''t be an easy journey for the Fellowship of the Ring, on the ultimate quest to rid Middle-earth of evil.', 'Young Hobbit Frodo Baggins is thrown into an amazing adventure when he''s tasked with destroying the One Ring, created by the dark lord Sauron. Frodo must travel in a small fellowship of nine warriors and accomplices. But it won''t be an easy journey for the Fellowship of the Ring, on the ultimate quest to rid Middle-earth of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liW0mjvTyLs7UCumaHhx3PpU4VT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123'),
  ('738237068898832385', 'The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Peter Jackson, Andrew Lesnie, Dan Hennah', 'Philippa Boyens, Fran Walsh, Peter Jackson', 'Elijah Wood, Ian McKellen, Viggo Mortensen, Sean Astin, Ian Holm, Liv Tyler, Christopher Lee, Sean Bean', 'PG-13', 'Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.', 'Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120'),
  ('288254017947006763', 'The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King', 2003, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Peter Jackson, Andrew Lesnie, Carolynne Cunningham', 'Peter Jackson, Fran Walsh, Philippa Boyens', 'Elijah Wood, Ian McKellen, Viggo Mortensen, Sean Astin, Andy Serkis, Dominic Monaghan, Billy Boyd, John Noble', 'PG-13', 'As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men. Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​', 'As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men. Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCzpDGLbOoPwLjy3OAm5NUPOTrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122'),
  ('715764498401930089', 'The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers', 2002, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Andrew Lesnie, Carolynne Cunningham, Belindalee Hope', 'Fran Walsh, Philippa Boyens, Stephen Sinclair', 'Elijah Wood, Ian McKellen, Viggo Mortensen, Sean Astin, Andy Serkis, John Rhys-Davies, Orlando Bloom, Bernard Hill', 'PG-13', 'Frodo Baggins and the other members of the Fellowship continue on their sacred quest to destroy the One Ring--but on separate paths. Their destinies lie at two towers--Orthanc Tower in Isengard, where the corrupt wizard Saruman awaits, and Sauron''s fortress at Barad-dur, deep within the dark lands of Mordor. Frodo and Sam are trekking to Mordor to destroy the One Ring of Power while Gimli, Legolas and Aragorn search for the orc-captured Merry and Pippin. All along, nefarious wizard Saruman awaits the Fellowship members at the Orthanc Tower in Isengard.', 'Frodo Baggins and the other members of the Fellowship continue on their sacred quest to destroy the One Ring--but on separate paths. Their destinies lie at two towers--Orthanc Tower in Isengard, where the corrupt wizard Saruman awaits, and Sauron''s fortress at Barad-dur, deep within the dark lands of Mordor. Frodo and Sam are trekking to Mordor to destroy the One Ring of Power while Gimli, Legolas and Aragorn search for the orc-captured Merry and Pippin. All along, nefarious wizard Saruman awaits the Fellowship members at the Orthanc Tower in Isengard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VTN0pR8gcqV3EPUHHfMGnJYN9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121'),
  ('760922446510116248', 'The Lord of the Rings: The War of the Rohirrim', 2024, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Kenji Kamiyama', 'Arty Papageorgiou, Phoebe Gittins, Jeffrey Addiss', 'Brian Cox, Gaia Wise, Luke Pasqualino, Laurence Ubong Williams, Lorraine Ashbourne, Miranda Otto, Shaun Dooley, Benjamin Wainwright', 'PG-13', 'A sudden attack by Wulf, a clever and traitorous lord of Rohan seeking vengeance for the death of his father, forces Helm Hammerhand, the King of Rohan, and his people to make a daring last stand in the ancient stronghold of the Hornburg.', 'A sudden attack by Wulf, a clever and traitorous lord of Rohan seeking vengeance for the death of his father, forces Helm Hammerhand, the King of Rohan, and his people to make a daring last stand in the ancient stronghold of the Hornburg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hE9SAMyMSUGAPsHUGdyl6irv11v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839033'),
  ('895213872732191750', 'The Lords of Discipline', 1983, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Franc Roddam, Brian Tufano', 'Lloyd Fonvielle, Thomas Pope', 'David Keith, Robert Prosky, G.D. Spradlin, Barbara Babcock, Michael Biehn, Rick Rossovich, Mitchell Lichtenstein, Mark Breland', 'R', 'Will arrives for his last year at Military Academy, in the Deep South USA, in the 1960''s. A black student, Pearce, has been accepted, for the first time and Will is asked to keep an eye out for the inevitable racism. The racists come in the form of The Ten, a secret group of the elite students. They want Pearce to leave on his own free will, but are prepared to torture him to make it ''his free will''. Will is forced to help Pearce and he is prepared to risk his own career to do so.', 'Will arrives for his last year at Military Academy, in the Deep South USA, in the 1960''s. A black student, Pearce, has been accepted, for the first time and Will is asked to keep an eye out for the inevitable racism. The racists come in the form of The Ten, a secret group of the elite students. They want Pearce to leave on his own free will, but are prepared to torture him to make it ''his free will''. Will is forced to help Pearce and he is prepared to risk his own career to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27iADagjEjBvO3Lg10QGmzVSpLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67530'),
  ('896462138076764390', 'The Lords of Flatbush', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Stephen Verona, Martin Davidson, Edward Lachman', 'Gayle Gleckler, Stephen Verona, Martin Davidson', 'Perry King, Sylvester Stallone, Henry Winkler, Paul Mace, Susan Blakely, Maria Smith, Renee Paris, Paul Jabara', 'PG', 'Set in 1958, the coming of age story follows four lower middle-class Brooklyn teenagers known as The Lords of Flatbush. The Lords chase girls, steal cars, shoot pool, get into street fights, and hang out at a local malt shop.', 'Set in 1958, the coming of age story follows four lower middle-class Brooklyn teenagers known as The Lords of Flatbush. The Lords chase girls, steal cars, shoot pool, get into street fights, and hang out at a local malt shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmXNjWFK4zlkStngN2qdVZ9Vprh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38925'),
  ('674166242525444115', 'The Lords of Salem', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Zombie, Brandon Trost', 'Rob Zombie', 'Sheri Moon Zombie, Bruce Davison, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Judy Geeson, Meg Foster, Patricia Quinn, Ken Foree, Dee Wallace', 'R', 'Heidi, a radio DJ, is sent a box containing a record - a "gift from the Lords". The sounds within the grooves trigger flashbacks of her town''s violent past. Is Heidi going mad, or are the Lords back to take revenge on Salem, Massachusetts?', 'Heidi, a radio DJ, is sent a box containing a record - a "gift from the Lords". The sounds within the grooves trigger flashbacks of her town''s violent past. Is Heidi going mad, or are the Lords back to take revenge on Salem, Massachusetts?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqZ6CGGZpQWt139YioekSYHvvkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104755'),
  ('496711169989680943', 'The Loreley''s Grasp', 1973, 'Horror', 'Amando de Ossorio, Miguel Fernández Mila, Paulino González', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'Tony Kendall, Helga Liné, Silvia Tortosa, Josefina Jartin, Loreta Tovar, José Thelman, Luis Induni, Francisco Nieto', 'R', 'The legendary Loreley has been living for centuries in a grotto beneath the river Rhein in Germany. Every night when the moon is full, she turns into a reptile-like creature craving for human blood. When one girl after another of a nearby boarding school is killed by her, a hunter named Sigurd is engaged to kill the monster.', 'The legendary Loreley has been living for centuries in a grotto beneath the river Rhein in Germany. Every night when the moon is full, she turns into a reptile-like creature craving for human blood. When one girl after another of a nearby boarding school is killed by her, a hunter named Sigurd is engaged to kill the monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/micPCYMRphOexESw5zgJUufreBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28068'),
  ('855821801960455905', 'The Lorry', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marguerite Duras, Jean-David Lefebvre, Bruno Nuytten', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Gérard Depardieu, Marguerite Duras', null, 'In this most talky and personal of films, director Marguerite Duras and actor Gerard Depardieu do an on-camera read-through of a movie script. Occasionally, the director comments about the characters or their motivations, and sometimes the actor does. That''s all -- there is no action, there are no location shots, no one pretends to be anything else. The script itself tells about an encounter between a blank-slate of a woman hitchhiker, and a communist truck driver. As the reading progresses, Duras comments bitterly about the failed ideals of communism and the glorious revolution that will probably never happen.', 'In this most talky and personal of films, director Marguerite Duras and actor Gerard Depardieu do an on-camera read-through of a movie script. Occasionally, the director comments about the characters or their motivations, and sometimes the actor does. That''s all -- there is no action, there are no location shots, no one pretends to be anything else. The script itself tells about an encounter between a blank-slate of a woman hitchhiker, and a communist truck driver. As the reading progresses, Duras comments bitterly about the failed ideals of communism and the glorious revolution that will probably never happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93knueN8tjQ3jAe8NrYFbivGi2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64133'),
  ('1132467576964968120', 'The Losers', 1970, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jack Starrett', 'Alan Caillou', 'William Smith, Bernie Hamilton, Adam Roarke, Houston Savage, Eugene Cornelius, Paul Koslo, John Garwood, Vic Diaz', 'R', 'Some bikers are hired by the CIA during the Vietnam War to rescue a captured agent from the clutches of the Red Chinese army. After a round of drinking, fighting, and whoring around, the cycle gang, led by Big Bill Smith, fix up their Yamahas with machine guns, grenades and armor plating, and storm the enemy camp.', 'Some bikers are hired by the CIA during the Vietnam War to rescue a captured agent from the clutches of the Red Chinese army. After a round of drinking, fighting, and whoring around, the cycle gang, led by Big Bill Smith, fix up their Yamahas with machine guns, grenades and armor plating, and storm the enemy camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3am2zzhMhlpscgP6tGDASG5DWWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121901'),
  ('769723768840966731', 'The Losers', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sylvain White, Scott Kevan, Garrett Warren', 'James Vanderbilt, Peter Berg', 'Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Zoe Saldaña, Chris Evans, Idris Elba, Columbus Short, Óscar Jaenada, Jason Patric, Holt McCallany', 'PG-13', 'On a mission deep in the Bolivian jungle, a team of elite commandos finds itself on the receiving end of a lethal betrayal. Now presumed dead, the men join forces with a mysterious operative named Aisha to hunt down their enemy and even the score.', 'On a mission deep in the Bolivian jungle, a team of elite commandos finds itself on the receiving end of a lethal betrayal. Now presumed dead, the men join forces with a mysterious operative named Aisha to hunt down their enemy and even the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9dVH0n7YnBqLmW2c5AzftxhhpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34813'),
  ('1042268776577033066', 'The Loss of a Teardrop Diamond', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jodie Markell, Giles Nuttgens', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Bryce Dallas Howard, Chris Evans, Ellen Burstyn, Ann-Margret, Jennifer Sipes, Mamie Gummer, Will Patton, Jessica Collins', null, 'Fisher Willow is the disliked Memphis débutante daughter of a plantation owner with a distaste for narrow-minded people and a penchant for shocking and insulting those around her. After returning from studies overseas, Fisher falls in love with Jimmy, the down-and-out son of an alcoholic father and an insane mother who works at a store on her family''s plantation.', 'Fisher Willow is the disliked Memphis débutante daughter of a plantation owner with a distaste for narrow-minded people and a penchant for shocking and insulting those around her. After returning from studies overseas, Fisher falls in love with Jimmy, the down-and-out son of an alcoholic father and an insane mother who works at a store on her family''s plantation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2immR0qBuTDab4Wx3iigKepAOV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28424'),
  ('974216482824223338', 'The Loss of Sexual Innocence', 1999, 'Drama', 'Mike Figgis, Benoît Delhomme', null, 'Julian Sands, Saffron Burrows, Justin Chadwick, Stefano Dionisi, Kelly Macdonald, Gina McKee, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Bernard Hill', 'R', 'The story of the sexual development of a filmmaker through three stages of his life.', 'The story of the sexual development of a filmmaker through three stages of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVg5oHFnzEE51cZ8Tq1qe8iWMZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15059'),
  ('652290419461633211', 'The Lost', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chris Sivertson, Zoran Popović, Alisa Fredericks', 'Jack Ketchum', 'Marc Senter, Shay Astar, Alex Frost, Megan Henning, Robin Sydney, Michael Bowen, Ed Lauter, Dee Wallace', null, 'A charismatic psycho suspected of killing two innocent campers in a cold-blooded double homicide grows increasingly unstable as his suburban empire starts to crack at the foundations.', 'A charismatic psycho suspected of killing two innocent campers in a cold-blooded double homicide grows increasingly unstable as his suburban empire starts to crack at the foundations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7umv0xy6252iBzQz4OgbII8xnQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15711'),
  ('817153869608411722', 'The Lost Battalion', 2001, 'History, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Russell Mulcahy, Jonathan Freeman', 'James Carabatsos', 'Rick Schroder, Phil McKee, Jamie Harris, Jay Rodan, Adam James, Daniel Caltagirone, Michael Goldstrom, André Vippolis', null, 'Fact-based war drama about an American battalion of over 500 men which gets trapped behind enemy lines in the Argonne Forest in October 1918 France during the closing weeks of World War I.', 'Fact-based war drama about an American battalion of over 500 men which gets trapped behind enemy lines in the Argonne Forest in October 1918 France during the closing weeks of World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNnozLnF3YivsGGyGEgUiKaO4pT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35583'),
  ('1105248913523067556', 'The Lost Bladesman', 2011, 'History, Drama, Action, War', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung, Alan Mak Siu-Fai, Jonathan Li Tsz-Chun', 'Alan Mak Siu-Fai, Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Donnie Yen, Jiang Wen, Sun Li, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Chen Hong, Shao Bing, Andy On Chi-Kit, Wang Xuebing', null, 'During the warring period of the three kingdoms, ancient China is in turmoil. To unify the country, general Cao Cao, the real power behind the Emperor, enlists the aid of the greatest warrior in the land, Guan Yu. However, Guan Yu is a loyal friend of Cao Cao''s enemy Liu Bei so to persuade the peerless warrior to fight, Cao Cao takes his beloved Qi Lan hostage. After leading Cao Cao''s forces to victory Guan Yu sets out with Qi Lan to rejoin Liu Bei. Now Cao Cao has deemed him too great a threat to live, and on the journey he must face all the forces at the Emperor''s command sent to destroy him.', 'During the warring period of the three kingdoms, ancient China is in turmoil. To unify the country, general Cao Cao, the real power behind the Emperor, enlists the aid of the greatest warrior in the land, Guan Yu. However, Guan Yu is a loyal friend of Cao Cao''s enemy Liu Bei so to persuade the peerless warrior to fight, Cao Cao takes his beloved Qi Lan hostage. After leading Cao Cao''s forces to victory Guan Yu sets out with Qi Lan to rejoin Liu Bei. Now Cao Cao has deemed him too great a threat to live, and on the journey he must face all the forces at the Emperor''s command sent to destroy him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JfgKo0Ipvu9AWO9y5Y56OGxPn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62977'),
  ('510258043555897544', 'The Lost Boys', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Joel Schumacher, Michael Chapman, William S. Beasley', 'Janice Fischer, James Jeremias, Jeffrey Boam', 'Jason Patric, Corey Haim, Dianne Wiest, Barnard Hughes, Edward Herrmann, Kiefer Sutherland, Jami Gertz, Corey Feldman', 'R', 'When an unsuspecting town newcomer is drawn to local blood fiends, the Frog brothers and other unlikely heroes gear up to rescue him.', 'When an unsuspecting town newcomer is drawn to local blood fiends, the Frog brothers and other unlikely heroes gear up to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH1lvyQvfbL5GKScTtT6zkIvDEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1547'),
  ('729771886318011855', 'The Lost Boys', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zeno Graton, Ben Pigeard-Benazera, Olivier Boonjing', 'Zeno Graton, Clara Bourreau', 'Khalil Ben Gharbia, Julien de Saint Jean, Eye Haïdara, Jonathan Couzinié, Samuel Di Napoli, Matéo Bastien, N’landu Lubansu, Amine Hamidou', null, 'In a youth correctional facility, Joe is preparing his return to society. But William’s arrival turns his desire for freedom into desire of another kind. Behind fences and cell walls, passions begin to play havoc with the need for liberty.', 'In a youth correctional facility, Joe is preparing his return to society. But William’s arrival turns his desire for freedom into desire of another kind. Behind fences and cell walls, passions begin to play havoc with the need for liberty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iLvMitjAswoh33VeAP2jCBAILE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000563'),
  ('689221351817534918', 'The Lost Brother', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Adrián Caetano, Marianela Sberna', 'Adrián Caetano, Nora Mazzitelli', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Daniel Hendler, Ángela Molina, Alián Devetac, Pablo Cedrón, Alejandra Flechner, Erasmo Olivera, Déborah Vidret', null, 'Cetarti is drowning in nothingness. With no job or purpose, he spends his days inside watching documentaries on television, until one day he is informed that his mother and brother were gunned down. He travels from Buenos Aires to Lapachito, a decrepit town in the province of Chaco in northern Argentina to deal with their bodies and to get the life insurance money. There he meets Duarte, a sort of boss in the town and a friend of his mother''s murderer who also kidnaps people for money. Cetarti''s path will lead him to committing illegal acts to get his hands on the insurance money and to his involvement in Duarte''s dark dealings, leading to an absurd and unexpected outcome.', 'Cetarti is drowning in nothingness. With no job or purpose, he spends his days inside watching documentaries on television, until one day he is informed that his mother and brother were gunned down. He travels from Buenos Aires to Lapachito, a decrepit town in the province of Chaco in northern Argentina to deal with their bodies and to get the life insurance money. There he meets Duarte, a sort of boss in the town and a friend of his mother''s murderer who also kidnaps people for money. Cetarti''s path will lead him to committing illegal acts to get his hands on the insurance money and to his involvement in Duarte''s dark dealings, leading to an absurd and unexpected outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueJ0hARGGEA2JT1o3e9DEpjErat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447904'),
  ('201427154342963267', 'The Lost Bus', 2025, 'Thriller, History', 'Paul Greengrass, Pål Ulvik Rokseth, Dylan Goss', 'Brad Ingelsby, Paul Greengrass', 'Matthew McConaughey, America Ferrera, Yul Vazquez, Ashlie Atkinson, Kimberli Flores, Levi McConaughey, Kay McConaughey, John Messina', 'R', 'A determined father risks everything to rescue a dedicated teacher and her students from a raging wildfire.', 'A determined father risks everything to rescue a dedicated teacher and her students from a raging wildfire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IPxzGlE17fJAwUTMul4opMeutA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1236470'),
  ('760828900872483719', 'The Lost Chapter: Yuki''s Revenge', 2025, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Quentin Tarantino', null, 'Uma Thurman, Miyu Ishidate Roberts, Quentin Tarantino', 'NR', 'Visionary director Quentin Tarantino had a dream of a Kill Bill chapter that never made it to the silver screen, a chapter known as "Yuki''s Revenge." Over twenty years later, Tarantino and Epic have come together to bring the story to life in Fortnite.', 'Visionary director Quentin Tarantino had a dream of a Kill Bill chapter that never made it to the silver screen, a chapter known as "Yuki''s Revenge." Over twenty years later, Tarantino and Epic have come together to bring the story to life in Fortnite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x14YpgJ9Z77vufopLaPGDFSftcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1588237'),
  ('90956534055757987', 'The Lost Children', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Orlando von Einsiedel, Lali Houghton, Franklin Dow', null, 'Fátima Mucutuy, Yeritza Mucutuy, Madadme Mendoza Ortiz, Nicolás Ordóñez, Henry Guerrero, Eliécer Muñoz, Edwin Manchola, Pedro Arnulfo Sánchez', 'PG-13', 'After a plane crash, four indigenous children fight to survive in the Colombian Amazon using ancestral wisdom as an unprecedented rescue mission unfolds.', 'After a plane crash, four indigenous children fight to survive in the Colombian Amazon using ancestral wisdom as an unprecedented rescue mission unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Te2bKuSyVkqt0m2GdSueU4dfCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1372665'),
  ('779637078554680042', 'The Lost Choices', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ahn Yong-Hoon', 'Ahn Yong-Hoon', 'Yoon So-Yi, Shin Hyun-been, Ahn Se-ha, Jo Young-jin, Kim Young-sun, Kim Kyung-sik, Zhang Dong, Kim Jung-woo', null, 'A young women is raped while on her way home. When she is rejected by the police, because they don''t believe her, she sets out revenge. But not only on her rapist, but also the police and everybody who did not believe her.', 'A young women is raped while on her way home. When she is rejected by the police, because they don''t believe her, she sets out revenge. But not only on her rapist, but also the police and everybody who did not believe her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSBnujZ4ptmh8HT1tbLdtXTXBGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369852'),
  ('351405463024935598', 'The Lost City', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Andy Garcia, Emmanuel Kadosh', null, 'Andy Garcia, Richard Bradford, Nestor Carbonell, Enrique Murciano, Dominik Garcia, Dustin Hoffman, Bill Murray, Lorena Feijóo', null, 'In Havana, Cuba in the late 1950''s, a wealthy family, one of whose sons is a prominent nightclub owner, is caught in the violent transition from the oppressive regime of Batista to the Marxist government of Fidel Castro. Castro''s regime ultimately leads the nightclub owner to flee to New York.', 'In Havana, Cuba in the late 1950''s, a wealthy family, one of whose sons is a prominent nightclub owner, is caught in the violent transition from the oppressive regime of Batista to the Marxist government of Fidel Castro. Castro''s regime ultimately leads the nightclub owner to flee to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v19DsrJb0TJxTCdgaUzzuvOjfeD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9700'),
  ('609786606744773577', 'The Lost City', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Aaron Nee, Tommy Rodriguez, Wilhem Perez', 'Adam Nee, Aaron Nee, Dana Fox', 'Sandra Bullock, Channing Tatum, Daniel Radcliffe, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Brad Pitt, Oscar Nuñez, Patti Harrison, Bowen Yang', 'PG-13', 'Reclusive author Loretta Sage writes about exotic places in her popular adventure novels that feature a handsome cover model named Alan. While on tour promoting her new book with Alan, Loretta gets kidnapped by an eccentric billionaire who hopes she can lead him to the ancient city''s lost treasure that featured in her latest story. Alan, determined to prove he can be a hero in real life and not just on the pages of her books, sets off to rescue her.', 'Reclusive author Loretta Sage writes about exotic places in her popular adventure novels that feature a handsome cover model named Alan. While on tour promoting her new book with Alan, Loretta gets kidnapped by an eccentric billionaire who hopes she can lead him to the ancient city''s lost treasure that featured in her latest story. Alan, determined to prove he can be a hero in real life and not just on the pages of her books, sets off to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnheO8cFvCYcmZsDrBoabJbKLFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752623'),
  ('985518734813853386', 'The Lost City of Z', 2017, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Doug Torres, Philip Stephanou, Florence Ortiz', 'James Gray', 'Charlie Hunnam, Robert Pattinson, Sienna Miller, Tom Holland, Angus Macfadyen, Edward Ashley, Clive Francis, Ian McDiarmid', 'PG-13', 'A true-life drama in the 1920s, centering on British explorer Col. Percy Fawcett, who discovered evidence of a previously unknown, advanced civilization in the Amazon and disappeared whilst searching for it.', 'A true-life drama in the 1920s, centering on British explorer Col. Percy Fawcett, who discovered evidence of a previously unknown, advanced civilization in the Amazon and disappeared whilst searching for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgDVkGFltTm1MCoFtlq91r7jwi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314095'),
  ('354232684465180276', 'The Lost Continent', 1968, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Paul Beeson, Michael Carreras', 'Michael Carreras', 'Eric Porter, Hildegard Knef, Suzanna Leigh, Tony Beckley, Jimmy Hanley, James Cossins, Reg Lye, Ben Carruthers', null, 'An eclectic group of characters set sail on Captain Lansen’s leaky cargo ship in an attempt to escape their various troubles. When a violent storm strikes, the ship is swept into the Sargasso Sea and the passengers find themselves trapped on an island populated by man-eating seaweed, giant crabs and Spanish conquistadors who believe it’s still the 16th century.', 'An eclectic group of characters set sail on Captain Lansen’s leaky cargo ship in an attempt to escape their various troubles. When a violent storm strikes, the ship is swept into the Sargasso Sea and the passengers find themselves trapped on an island populated by man-eating seaweed, giant crabs and Spanish conquistadors who believe it’s still the 16th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlEUe4DyZ21j4pApjF6nT8EYZAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5147'),
  ('128012202795053817', 'The Lost Daughter', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Emmanuela Fragiadaki, Gemma Nunn', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal', 'Olivia Colman, Jessie Buckley, Dakota Johnson, Ed Harris, Paul Mescal, Peter Sarsgaard, Dagmara Dominczyk, Jack Farthing', 'R', 'A woman''s seaside vacation takes a dark turn when her obsession with a young mother forces her to confront secrets from her past.', 'A woman''s seaside vacation takes a dark turn when her obsession with a young mother forces her to confront secrets from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1oLNRFixpFOVsyz1HCqCUW3wiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554230'),
  ('866137320385757300', 'The Lost Empire', 1984, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Jim Wynorski, Jacques Haitkin, Betsy Magruder', 'Jim Wynorski', 'Melanie Vincz, Raven De La Croix, Angela Aames, Paul Coufos, Robert Tessier, Angus Scrimm, Blackie Dammett, Linda Shayne', 'R', 'A police officer and her two companions battle an evil genius with diabolical plans to destroy the world. Whoever can find the three sacred jewels can anticipate total power.', 'A police officer and her two companions battle an evil genius with diabolical plans to destroy the world. Whoever can find the three sacred jewels can anticipate total power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfOlpM4M4r88ZB712ZYnQrCCM8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100697'),
  ('1092338480434657983', 'The Lost Expedition', 1975, 'Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Venyamin Dorman, Vadim Kornilyev, Aleksandr Izbutskiy', 'Avenir Zak, Isai Kuznetsov', 'Mykola Hrynko, Yevgeniya Simonova, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Viktor Sergachyov, Vakhtang Kikabidze, Nikolay Olyalin, Olga Mateshko, Lev Prygunov', null, 'An expedition of a few geologists is going to Siberia in order to found a gold sources during 1918.', 'An expedition of a few geologists is going to Siberia in order to found a gold sources during 1918.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glrhg37qYYyeSvSpFxsS84MpseA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72799'),
  ('77983442635792849', 'The Lost Future', 2010, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Paul Gilpin, Mikael Salomon', null, 'Sean Bean, Annabelle Wallis, Corey Sevier, Eleanor Tomlinson, Jonathan Pienaar, Hannah Tointon, Sam Claflin, Jessica Haines', null, 'A group of post-apocalyptic survivors, struggle to survive in a world where jungles and forests and primeval wetlands and deserts have obliterated civilization. They staunchly face genetically mutating beasts and mysterious diseases in an attempt to re-establish the human race as masters of Earth.', 'A group of post-apocalyptic survivors, struggle to survive in a world where jungles and forests and primeval wetlands and deserts have obliterated civilization. They staunchly face genetically mutating beasts and mysterious diseases in an attempt to re-establish the human race as masters of Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwP3xGH78aaNbGVFisFxx4LLuay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50674'),
  ('983895004809196633', 'The Lost Girls', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Livia De Paolis', 'Livia De Paolis', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Joely Richardson, Iain Glen, Louis Partridge, Emily Carey, Amelia Minto, Livia De Paolis, Siobhan Hewlett', null, 'Inspired by the classic tale of Peter Pan, The Lost Girls chronicles four generations of Darling women as they struggle in the aftermath of their adventures with Peter Pan in Neverland. Like her grandmother and her mother Jane before her, Wendy must escape Pan’s hold on her and the promise he desperately wants her to keep. As her daughter Berry comes into Peter’s orbit, Wendy must fight to save her relationship with her daughter while reconciling her legacy.', 'Inspired by the classic tale of Peter Pan, The Lost Girls chronicles four generations of Darling women as they struggle in the aftermath of their adventures with Peter Pan in Neverland. Like her grandmother and her mother Jane before her, Wendy must escape Pan’s hold on her and the promise he desperately wants her to keep. As her daughter Berry comes into Peter’s orbit, Wendy must fight to save her relationship with her daughter while reconciling her legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EZn9mAaEHxKXZvxPqzr7ILpQy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762006'),
  ('1137100277846688777', 'The Lost Honor of Katharina Blum', 1975, 'Drama', 'Jost Vacano, Volker Schlöndorff, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Angela Winkler, Mario Adorf, Dieter Laser, Jürgen Prochnow, Heinz Bennent, Hannelore Hoger, Rolf Becker, Harald Kuhlmann', 'R', 'After a chance encounter with a wanted man, a woman is harassed by the police and press until she takes violent action.', 'After a chance encounter with a wanted man, a woman is harassed by the police and press until she takes violent action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7Z1gzPkHm29jmiqnjvzXZg2koI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4762'),
