  ('540930331693399019', 'The Lost King', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Zac Nicholson, Marcus Collier, Angus Finlayson', 'Steve Coogan, Jeff Pope', 'Sally Hawkins, Steve Coogan, Harry Lloyd, Mark Addy, James Fleet, Lee Ingleby, Adam Robb, Benjamin Scanlan', 'PG-13', 'An amateur historian defies the academic establishment in her efforts to find King Richard III''s remains, which were lost for over 500 years.', 'An amateur historian defies the academic establishment in her efforts to find King Richard III''s remains, which were lost for over 500 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3kOebicMlDMrfe0kTJ2YxqnFw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914216'),
  ('686012672269005878', 'The Lost Language of Cranes', 1992, 'Drama', 'Nigel Finch, Remi Adefarasin, Anthony Garrick', 'Sean Mathias', 'Brian Cox, Eileen Atkins, Angus Macfadyen, Corey Parker, Cathy Tyson, René Auberjonois, John Schlesinger, Ben Daniels', null, 'When a young gay man comes out of the closet, his friends support him, but when he comes out to his parents, he stirs up a wealth of hidden feelings and secrets in their relationship.', 'When a young gay man comes out of the closet, his friends support him, but when he comes out to his parents, he stirs up a wealth of hidden feelings and secrets in their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FkewaOCcLiSPyP2w4WLvzVxLu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55103'),
  ('26608764285671146', 'The Lost Leonardo', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Andreas Koefoed, Adam Jandrup', 'Duska Zagorac, Andreas Dalsgaard, Mark Monroe', 'Georgina Adam, Warren Adelson, Evan Beard, Yves Bouvier, Alexandra Bregman, Alison Cole, Dianne Dwyer Modestini, Maria Teresa Fiorio', 'PG-13', 'London, England, 2008. Some of the most distinguished experts on the work of Italian artist Leonardo da Vinci (1452-1519) gather at the National Gallery to examine a painting known as Salvator Mundi; an event that turns out to be the first act of one of the most fascinating stories in the history of art.', 'London, England, 2008. Some of the most distinguished experts on the work of Italian artist Leonardo da Vinci (1452-1519) gather at the National Gallery to examine a painting known as Salvator Mundi; an event that turns out to be the first act of one of the most fascinating stories in the history of art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVXECwOa4g5ZHND6dOxXjQ5bbpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822099'),
  ('565296654947233377', 'The Lost Letter', 1972, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Borys Ivchenko, Vitaliy Zymovets', 'Ivan Drach', 'Ivan Mykolaichuk, Fedir Stryhun, Lidiya Belozyorova, Zemfira Tsakhilova, Mikhail Golubovich, Vladimir Glukhoy, Vasyl Symchych, Anatoli Barchuk', null, 'Folk comedy that tells the adventures of Ukrainian cossacks Vasyl and Andriy as they set out on a long journey to deliver a letter from their leader to the Russian empress in St. Petersburg.', 'Folk comedy that tells the adventures of Ukrainian cossacks Vasyl and Andriy as they set out on a long journey to deliver a letter from their leader to the Russian empress in St. Petersburg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMwGWpNpD6bPP3mbuEBwmEDm4EV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124007'),
  ('699797262451572424', 'The Lost Lotteries', 2022, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Prueksa Amaruji, Chookiat Narongrit, Somchai Leelarakskul', 'Prueksa Amaruji', 'Wongravee Nateetorn, Padung Songsang, Phantira Pipityakorn, Napapa Tantrakul, Somjit Jongjohor, Thanaporn Wagprayoon, Anusorn Pinyopojanee, Torphong Kul-on', null, 'Five down-on-their-luck strangers must band together to steal back winning lottery tickets worth millions from a wicked mafia boss.', 'Five down-on-their-luck strangers must band together to steal back winning lottery tickets worth millions from a wicked mafia boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zS778tx0ITlEf1YstGIYTNdS0bb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034337'),
  ('163711644472222953', 'The Lost Missile', 1958, 'Science Fiction', 'William Berke', 'John McPartland, Jerome Bixby', 'Robert Loggia, Phillip Pine, Marilee Earle, Kitty Kelly, Lawrence Dobkin, Larry Kerr, John McNamara, Mike Steele', null, 'A missile from parts unknown enters an orbit only 5 miles above Earth''s surface and, due to friction from its intense speed through our atmosphere, proceeds to incinerate everything in its immediate wake.', 'A missile from parts unknown enters an orbit only 5 miles above Earth''s surface and, due to friction from its intense speed through our atmosphere, proceeds to incinerate everything in its immediate wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZYXb3SsthY71babjeSapRsE4r4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94480'),
  ('242976436277484808', 'The Lost Moment', 1947, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Hal Mohr, Martin Gabel', 'Leonardo Bercovici', 'Robert Cummings, Susan Hayward, Agnes Moorehead, Joan Lorring, Eduardo Ciannelli, John Archer, Frank Puglia, Minerva Urecal', 'NR', 'In a long flashback, a New York publisher is in Venice pursuing the lost love letters of an early-19th-century poet, Jeffrey Ashton, who disappeared mysteriously. Using a false name, Lewis Venable rents a room from Juliana Bordereau, once Jeffrey Ashton''s lover, now an aged recluse. Running the household is Juliana''s severe niece, Tina, who mistrusts Venable from the first moment. He realizes all is not right when late one night he finds Tina, her hair unpinned and wild, at the piano. She calls him Jeffrey and throws herself at him. The family priest warns Venable to tread carefully around her fantasies, but he wants the letters at any cost, even Tina''s sanity.', 'In a long flashback, a New York publisher is in Venice pursuing the lost love letters of an early-19th-century poet, Jeffrey Ashton, who disappeared mysteriously. Using a false name, Lewis Venable rents a room from Juliana Bordereau, once Jeffrey Ashton''s lover, now an aged recluse. Running the household is Juliana''s severe niece, Tina, who mistrusts Venable from the first moment. He realizes all is not right when late one night he finds Tina, her hair unpinned and wild, at the piano. She calls him Jeffrey and throws herself at him. The family priest warns Venable to tread carefully around her fantasies, but he wants the letters at any cost, even Tina''s sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSUiir5uokSB5xr9LzRhNSsxcrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72544'),
  ('128407187890657328', 'The Lost One', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Peter Lorre, Václav Vích', 'Axel Eggebrecht, Benno Vigny, Peter Lorre', 'Peter Lorre, Karl John, Helmuth Rudolph, Johanna Hofer, Renate Mannhardt, Eva Ingeborg Scholz, Peter Ahrweiler, Gisela Trowe', null, 'A German scientist murders his fiancée during World War II when he learns that she has been selling the results of his secret research to the enemy.', 'A German scientist murders his fiancée during World War II when he learns that she has been selling the results of his secret research to the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTjLxVby8Y4jvkyEpW6g08iBttC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88176'),
  ('1066716147559933812', 'The Lost Patient', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie, Drama', 'Christophe Charrier, Pierre Baboin, Véronique Labrid', 'Elodie Namer, Christophe Charrier', 'Txomin Vergez, Clotilde Hesme, Audrey Dana, Stéphane Rideau, Rebecca Williams, Matthieu Lucci, Alex Lawther, Baptiste Carrion-Weiss', null, 'The 19 years old Thomas wakes up in a hospital after three years in a coma. He doesn''t remember anything. The psychologist Anna tells him that his family has been murdered and that he is the only survivor of the massacre while his sister Laura is still missing.', 'The 19 years old Thomas wakes up in a hospital after three years in a coma. He doesn''t remember anything. The psychologist Anna tells him that his family has been murdered and that he is the only survivor of the massacre while his sister Laura is still missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHwGtD4zT0IhKdc2JQNxHAJFGWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006917'),
  ('748742693903601702', 'The Lost Patrol', 1934, 'Action, War', 'John Ford, Harold Wenstrom, W. Argyle Nelson', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Victor McLaglen, Boris Karloff, Wallace Ford, Reginald Denny, J.M. Kerrigan, Billy Bevan, Alan Hale, Brandon Hurst', 'NR', 'A World War I British Army patrol is crossing the Mesopotamian desert when their commanding officer, the only one who knows their destination, is killed by the bullet of unseen bandits. The patrol''s sergeant keeps them heading north on the assumption that they will hit their brigade. They stop for the night at an oasis and awaken the next morning to find their horses stolen, their sentry dead, the oasis surrounded and survival difficult.', 'A World War I British Army patrol is crossing the Mesopotamian desert when their commanding officer, the only one who knows their destination, is killed by the bullet of unseen bandits. The patrol''s sergeant keeps them heading north on the assumption that they will hit their brigade. They stop for the night at an oasis and awaken the next morning to find their horses stolen, their sentry dead, the oasis surrounded and survival difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zwui44GZmgEq1bLZ7uBfjZ5MLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46910'),
  ('780147730534094153', 'The Lost Prince', 2020, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Guillaume Schiffman, Michel Hazanavicius, Alban Lelievre', 'Noé Debré, Michel Hazanavicius, Bruno Merle', 'Omar Sy, Bérénice Bejo, François Damiens, Sarah Gaye, Keyla Fala, Néotis Ronzon, Philippe Vieux, Philippe Uchan', null, 'Djibi lives alone with Sofia, his 8-year-old daughter. Every night, he invents a story to put him to sleep. When Sofia falls asleep, these extraordinary stories come to life somewhere in an imaginary world inhabited by knights, pirates and other dragons. In this world that belongs only to them, Sofia is always the princess to save, and the brave Prince is none other than Djibi himself. But 3 years later, the entry of Sofia to the college will mark the end of her childhood. To the despair of her father, she no longer needs her stories at night. On the one hand, Djibi will have to accept that his daughter will grow up and move away from him. On the other hand, in the World of Stories, the Prince will have to face the most epic of all his adventures. Find your destiny in a world where it no longer has a place.', 'Djibi lives alone with Sofia, his 8-year-old daughter. Every night, he invents a story to put him to sleep. When Sofia falls asleep, these extraordinary stories come to life somewhere in an imaginary world inhabited by knights, pirates and other dragons. In this world that belongs only to them, Sofia is always the princess to save, and the brave Prince is none other than Djibi himself. But 3 years later, the entry of Sofia to the college will mark the end of her childhood. To the despair of her father, she no longer needs her stories at night. On the one hand, Djibi will have to accept that his daughter will grow up and move away from him. On the other hand, in the World of Stories, the Prince will have to face the most epic of all his adventures. Find your destiny in a world where it no longer has a place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFcSfoMu9hQIX4t0CxIkDJKgIES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520725'),
  ('492321582120753461', 'The Lost Princess', 2025, 'Action, Adventure', 'Hicham Hajji, Ayoub Lamrani, Abdessamad Bounasser', 'Hicham Hajji, Jean-Daniel Camus', 'Cillian O''Sullivan, Gary Dourdan, Robert Knepper, Soraya Azzabi, Eric Roberts, Irma Lake, Luka Peroš, Kacey Mottet Klein', null, 'After an Ayahuasca vision transports him to a haunted castle, Alec meets Hanna who tales him the story of her mother''s forced marriage and how the forbidden passion with her father was in danger when the princess pregnancy became obvious', 'After an Ayahuasca vision transports him to a haunted castle, Alec meets Hanna who tales him the story of her mother''s forced marriage and how the forbidden passion with her father was in danger when the princess pregnancy became obvious', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31S2ISsDtbnxb0kuXZl1SxSMD0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086910'),
  ('407767348129244137', 'The Lost Skeleton of Cadavra', 2001, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Larry Blamire, Kevin F. Jones', 'Larry Blamire', 'Fay Masterson, Andrew Parks, Susan McConnell, Brian Howe, Jennifer Blaire, Dan Conroy, Robert Deveau, Darrin Reed', null, 'A dedicated scientist, aided by his clueless wife, rolls up his shirt sleeves and tries to save the world from a radioactive monster, curious space aliens, an evil scientist and a crabby skeleton.', 'A dedicated scientist, aided by his clueless wife, rolls up his shirt sleeves and tries to save the world from a radioactive monster, curious space aliens, an evil scientist and a crabby skeleton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGUjqu7DotLx6yfakAeqaj8D1FO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18841'),
  ('425484898607549563', 'The Lost Son', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Chris Menges, Barry Ackroyd', 'Eric Leclere, Margaret Leclere, Mark Mills', 'Daniel Auteuil, Nastassja Kinski, Katrin Cartlidge, Marianne Denicourt, Ciarán Hinds, Billie Whitelaw, Cyril Shaps, Bruce Greenwood', null, 'Xavier Lombard is a world-weary private eye in London, in exile from his native Paris; his best friend is Nathalie, a high-class call girl. He gets a call from an old friend from the Paris police department, now a businessman whose brother-in-law is missing. The missing man''s parents hire Xavier over their daughter''s objections, and quickly he finds himself in the realm of children''s sexual slavery.', 'Xavier Lombard is a world-weary private eye in London, in exile from his native Paris; his best friend is Nathalie, a high-class call girl. He gets a call from an old friend from the Paris police department, now a businessman whose brother-in-law is missing. The missing man''s parents hire Xavier over their daughter''s objections, and quickly he finds himself in the realm of children''s sexual slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Et7EXmtQ4Ds2xc5hBPxuUwmSqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30964'),
  ('1112235659698804032', 'The Lost Squadron', 1932, 'Drama, Action, War, History', 'George Archainbaud, Edward Cronjager, Leo Tover', 'Humphrey Pearson', 'Richard Dix, Mary Astor, Robert Armstrong, Dorothy Jordan, Joel McCrea, Erich von Stroheim, Hugh Herbert, Ralph Ince', 'NR', 'When World War I comes to an end, three pilots find themselves on hard times. They wind up in Hollywood, where they work as stunt fliers for a sadistic director.', 'When World War I comes to an end, three pilots find themselves on hard times. They wind up in Hollywood, where they work as stunt fliers for a sadistic director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAHbsh9MJOOPCxzfQvcsTNN02Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98398'),
  ('1135617300817945907', 'The Lost Thing', 2010, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Ruhemann, Shaun Tan', 'Shaun Tan', 'Tim Minchin', null, 'A boy finds a strange creature on a beach, and decides to find a home for it in a world where everyone believes there are far more important things to pay attention to.', 'A boy finds a strange creature on a beach, and decides to find a home for it in a world where everyone believes there are far more important things to pay attention to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w272Z6vRaC1H6WZU5pIffaU04MR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58515'),
  ('660475007143544721', 'The Lost Treasure of the Grand Canyon', 2008, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Farhad Mann, Adam Sliwinski, Cole Boughton', 'Clay Carmouche', 'Shannen Doherty, Michael Shanks, JR Bourne, Toby Berner, Heather Doerksen, Duncan Fraser, Peter New, Byron Chief-Moon', null, 'A team of Smithsonian researchers have stumbled across a lost walled Aztec city guarded by some evil spirits, including a "great flying serpent of death." As days turn to weeks, Susan Jordan, the daughter of the professor leading the expedition, assembles a team to rescue her father and his colleagues from the clutches of the ancient Aztec warriors and their horrible serpent god.', 'A team of Smithsonian researchers have stumbled across a lost walled Aztec city guarded by some evil spirits, including a "great flying serpent of death." As days turn to weeks, Susan Jordan, the daughter of the professor leading the expedition, assembles a team to rescue her father and his colleagues from the clutches of the ancient Aztec warriors and their horrible serpent god.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quq3P4NYgJHgWrFkgN6dnXN2ub6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18676'),
  ('885490053949292642', 'The Lost Treasure of the Knights Templar', 2006, 'Family, Adventure, Action', 'Kasper Barfoed, Peter Bækkel, Arn Lou', 'Philip LaZebnik', 'Julie Grundtvig Wester, Christian Heldbo Wienberg , Nicklas Svale Andersen, Frederikke Thomassen, Peter Gantzler, Ulf Pilgaard, Kurt Ravn, Birgitte Simonsen', null, 'Danish brilliant pre-teen student Nis uses his summer holiday to learn Latin so he can properly study the Knights Templar inheritance on Bjornholm island from sources. His friends Mathias, a dumb jock, and Kathrine, who only comes to spend time wear her dad, who really wanted a boy, prefer childish fun, but get dragged in his quest for a treasure. Mats''s strength, Kathrine''s connections and even Nis''s bratty kid sister''s blunt remarks contribute to find out about two brotherhoods, heirs of 12th century factions in the Templar order and deal with danger.', 'Danish brilliant pre-teen student Nis uses his summer holiday to learn Latin so he can properly study the Knights Templar inheritance on Bjornholm island from sources. His friends Mathias, a dumb jock, and Kathrine, who only comes to spend time wear her dad, who really wanted a boy, prefer childish fun, but get dragged in his quest for a treasure. Mats''s strength, Kathrine''s connections and even Nis''s bratty kid sister''s blunt remarks contribute to find out about two brotherhoods, heirs of 12th century factions in the Templar order and deal with danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snHsYUnPuQcxxJUKWlGZiLlSxo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16043'),
  ('138662591975449801', 'The Lost Treasure of the Knights Templar II', 2007, 'Family, Adventure, Action', 'Giacomo Campeotto, Manuel Alberto Claro, Rasmus Lyhne', 'Philip LaZebnik, Søren Frellesen', 'Julie Grundtvig Wester, Christian Heldbo Wienberg , Nicklas Svale Andersen, Frederikke Thomassen, Peter Gantzler, David Owe, Kurt Ravn, Trine Pallesen', null, 'In 1361 the Danish King Valdemar''s troops approached the city walls of Visby, Gotland. Meanwhile, a young woman named Sigrid was leaving tracks all over the place leading to the whereabouts of a great treasure.She was able to fulfill her mission before being captured and immured alive in a tower, as punishment for not revealing the whereabouts of the treasure. Currently Kathrine, 14, and his three friends have to follow the tracks of 700 years ago during the Medieval Week celebration in Visby to rescue his father, who has been kidnapped, and find the lost treasure. But the fearful and dangerous Black Brotherhood lies in wait.', 'In 1361 the Danish King Valdemar''s troops approached the city walls of Visby, Gotland. Meanwhile, a young woman named Sigrid was leaving tracks all over the place leading to the whereabouts of a great treasure.She was able to fulfill her mission before being captured and immured alive in a tower, as punishment for not revealing the whereabouts of the treasure. Currently Kathrine, 14, and his three friends have to follow the tracks of 700 years ago during the Medieval Week celebration in Visby to rescue his father, who has been kidnapped, and find the lost treasure. But the fearful and dangerous Black Brotherhood lies in wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqkKfQPOzZd4tNfuS8OA7lUVMn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16044'),
  ('229854666189154320', 'The Lost Treasure of the Knights Templar III: The Mystery of the Snake Crown', 2008, 'Family, Adventure, Action', 'Giacomo Campeotto, Manuel Alberto Claro, Antony Castle', 'Søren Frellesen, Philip LaZebnik', 'Julie Grundtvig Wester, Christian Heldbo Wienberg , Nicklas Svale Andersen, Frederikke Thomassen, Emma Leth, Mick Øgendahl, Peter Gilsfort, Cecilia Zwick-Nash', null, 'The snake crown is stolen (or taken back) from the Knight Templars by the earth worshippers of Crete; the three kids try to retrieve it on behalf of the Knight Templars.', 'The snake crown is stolen (or taken back) from the Knight Templars by the earth worshippers of Crete; the three kids try to retrieve it on behalf of the Knight Templars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txFrw4xZtPMk18qN4V2lF9QUUmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16045'),
  ('46573456412189995', 'The Lost Tribe', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'Mark E. Davidson', 'Emily Baldoni, Nick Mennell, Brianna Brown, Hadley Fraser, Maxine Bahns, Ryan Alosio, Lance Henriksen, Terry Notary', 'R', 'After a devastating boat crash, a group of friends are stranded on an uncharted island where they encounter an ancient tribe of humanoid creatures.', 'After a devastating boat crash, a group of friends are stranded on an uncharted island where they encounter an ancient tribe of humanoid creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8unm1Ui0ypBLnsCwtiQvyK7CIQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59120'),
  ('349319446115616853', 'The Lost Valentine', 2011, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Darnell Martin, Frank Prinzi', null, 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Betty White, Sean Faris, Billy Magnussen, Meghann Fahy, Nadia Dajani, Lori Beth Sikes, Gil Gerard', null, 'A young and cynical female journalist learns love may transcend trials and time as she discovers a story that will change her life forever. When war separates lovers on their wedding anniversary Feb. 14, 1944 at LA Union Train Station, Navy pilot Neil Thomas makes a promise he isn''t sure he can keep - to return to the train station safe by their next anniversary. For sixty years Caroline Thomas keeps her promise by waiting at the train station until her missing in action husband can finally keep his with the "lost valentine." The message and meaning shows romance and love can be real; worth fighting, and maybe even dying for.', 'A young and cynical female journalist learns love may transcend trials and time as she discovers a story that will change her life forever. When war separates lovers on their wedding anniversary Feb. 14, 1944 at LA Union Train Station, Navy pilot Neil Thomas makes a promise he isn''t sure he can keep - to return to the train station safe by their next anniversary. For sixty years Caroline Thomas keeps her promise by waiting at the train station until her missing in action husband can finally keep his with the "lost valentine." The message and meaning shows romance and love can be real; worth fighting, and maybe even dying for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLil9ucsqiMgannyyJJrsXPMUQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61348'),
  ('793548269135677908', 'The Lost Viking', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Emmet Cummins', 'David Shillitoe', 'Dean Ridge, Ross O''Hennessy, Kezia Burrows, Ioan Hefin, Ian Virgo, James Groom, Chris Hampson, Michelle McTernan', null, 'A young Viking called Vitharr arrives in Britain with dreams of conquest and adventure, but when his family and clan are ambushed and killed, he must survive alone in this strange,dangerous new land as he searches for his Uncle''s settlement.', 'A young Viking called Vitharr arrives in Britain with dreams of conquest and adventure, but when his family and clan are ambushed and killed, he must survive alone in this strange,dangerous new land as he searches for his Uncle''s settlement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwLNpTRoJjPMTKyhYFGMQo5ra31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526746'),
  ('626036090494821894', 'The Lost Volcano', 1950, 'Adventure', 'Ford Beebe, Marcel Le Picard', 'Ford Beebe', 'Johnny Sheffield, Donald Woods, Marjorie Lord, John Ridgely, Tommy Ivo, Elena Verdugo, Don C. Harvey, Grandon Rhodes', 'NR', 'Little David Gordon lives in the jungle with his parents Ruth and Fred, along with their servant Nona. David likes living there while his father captures wild animals; he''s made friends with Bomba the jungle boy, who has shown him a great deal about life in the jungle. One day two adventurers come looking for ancient treasure in the shadow of a live volcano.', 'Little David Gordon lives in the jungle with his parents Ruth and Fred, along with their servant Nona. David likes living there while his father captures wild animals; he''s made friends with Bomba the jungle boy, who has shown him a great deal about life in the jungle. One day two adventurers come looking for ancient treasure in the shadow of a live volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8fUq6X6yPmzwhAMfW0xFqKvbVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109216'),
  ('1032523860035499625', 'The Lost World', 1925, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Romance, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Harry O. Hoyt, Arthur Edeson', 'Marion Fairfax', 'Bessie Love, Lewis Stone, Wallace Beery, Lloyd Hughes, Alma Bennett, Arthur Hoyt, Margaret McWade, Bull Montana', null, 'The first film adaptation of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s classic novel about a land where prehistoric creatures still roam.', 'The first film adaptation of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s classic novel about a land where prehistoric creatures still roam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/411VnWtYJdEFKiaGqJOeTmBv8th.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2981'),
  ('732428935710540539', 'The Lost World', 1960, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Irwin Allen, Winton C. Hoch, Ad Schaumer', 'Irwin Allen, Charles Bennett', 'Michael Rennie, Jill St. John, David Hedison, Claude Rains, Fernando Lamas, Richard Haydn, Ray Stricklyn, Jay Novello', null, 'Professor Challenger leads an expedition of scientists and adventurers to a remote plateau deep in the Amazonian jungle to verify his claim that dinosaurs still live there.', 'Professor Challenger leads an expedition of scientists and adventurers to a remote plateau deep in the Amazonian jungle to verify his claim that dinosaurs still live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYL7AKgi7V50OsEaGX6ct9MkRas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2982'),
  ('700375349297758570', 'The Lost World', 1992, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Timothy Bond, Paul Beeson', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'John Rhys-Davies, David Warner, Eric McCormack, Nathania Stanford, Darren Peter Mercer, Tamara Gorski, Sala Came, Fidelis Cheza', null, 'Unfazed by ridicule from fellow scientists, professor Challenger (John Rhys-Davies) leads an expedition to investigate rumored sightings of prehistoric life still thriving in the unexplored African jungle. He''s joined by a thrill-seeking journalist, his archrival and a beautiful adventurer on a perilous trek through mysterious and uncharted territory, filled with danger and deception. David Warner, Eric McCormack and Tamara Gorski co-star.', 'Unfazed by ridicule from fellow scientists, professor Challenger (John Rhys-Davies) leads an expedition to investigate rumored sightings of prehistoric life still thriving in the unexplored African jungle. He''s joined by a thrill-seeking journalist, his archrival and a beautiful adventurer on a perilous trek through mysterious and uncharted territory, filled with danger and deception. David Warner, Eric McCormack and Tamara Gorski co-star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJQovqiutwWadYa7r42iyMT3l9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2983'),
  ('716839084188446537', 'The Lost World', 1998, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Barry Gravelle, Bob Keen', 'Jean LaFleur, Léopold St-Pierre', 'Patrick Bergin, Jayne Heitmeyer, Julian Casey, David Nerman, Michael Sinelnikoff, Gregoriane Minot Payeur, Jack Langedijk, Russell Yuen', null, 'A scientist discovers dinosaurs on a remote plateau in Mongolia.', 'A scientist discovers dinosaurs on a remote plateau in Mongolia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTOoIVMCEMLgnhotdD1gGdhyPO2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2997'),
  ('166166920695230119', 'The Lost World', 1999, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Richard Franklin, Lyle Binnie, Mark Wareham', 'Jim Henshaw', 'Peter McCauley, William deVry, William Snow, Michael Sinelnikoff, Rachel Blakely, Jennifer O''Dell, Laura Vazquez, Robert Coleby', 'NR', 'A group of unlikely allies are assembled to go on an expedition deep within the Amazon forest in search of new discoveries.', 'A group of unlikely allies are assembled to go on an expedition deep within the Amazon forest in search of new discoveries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4NmOigSNycvCEi562rWmzCOpIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3002'),
  ('465968252768186480', 'The Lost World', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Stuart Orme, David Odd', 'Adrian Hodges, Tony Mulholland', 'Bob Hoskins, James Fox, Tom Ward, Matthew Rhys, Elaine Cassidy, Peter Falk, Bianca Roe, Nathaniel Lees', null, 'This Lost World is a splendid BBC TV dramatisation of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s famous adventure story. Bob Hoskins makes an unusually genial Professor Challenger, far less of a bully than Doyle''s character, but his slightly stereotyped companions are nicely filled out by a solid cast. James Fox is Challenger''s more timid but still covertly adventurous rival, Tom Ward is the moustachioed big game hunter who faces an Allosaurus with an elephant gun, and Matthew Rhys plays the tagalong reporter hoping to impress his faithless fiancée.', 'This Lost World is a splendid BBC TV dramatisation of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s famous adventure story. Bob Hoskins makes an unusually genial Professor Challenger, far less of a bully than Doyle''s character, but his slightly stereotyped companions are nicely filled out by a solid cast. James Fox is Challenger''s more timid but still covertly adventurous rival, Tom Ward is the moustachioed big game hunter who faces an Allosaurus with an elephant gun, and Matthew Rhys plays the tagalong reporter hoping to impress his faithless fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22PtJeHtI19j15nkQiM561Ng7cH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3003'),
  ('240817212621327859', 'The Lost World: Jurassic Park', 1997, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, John Berger', 'David Koepp', 'Jeff Goldblum, Julianne Moore, Pete Postlethwaite, Arliss Howard, Richard Attenborough, Vince Vaughn, Vanessa Lee Chester, Peter Stormare', 'PG-13', 'Four years after Jurassic Park''s genetically bred dinosaurs ran amok, multimillionaire John Hammond shocks chaos theorist Ian Malcolm by revealing that he has been breeding more beasties at a secret location. Malcolm, his paleontologist ladylove and a wildlife videographer join an expedition to document the lethal lizards'' natural behavior in this action-packed thriller.', 'Four years after Jurassic Park''s genetically bred dinosaurs ran amok, multimillionaire John Hammond shocks chaos theorist Ian Malcolm by revealing that he has been breeding more beasties at a secret location. Malcolm, his paleontologist ladylove and a wildlife videographer join an expedition to document the lethal lizards'' natural behavior in this action-packed thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fSkhv35nPSw9hwPVCMINQFG1WD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330'),
  ('1100877570069322719', 'The Lottery', 1969, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Larry Yust, Isidore Mankofsky, Arthur R. Botham', 'Shirley Jackson, Larry Yust', 'Olive Dunbar, William Benedict, William Fawcett, Joe Haworth, Ed Begley Jr., Jim Boles, Donna Bowen, Blanche Bronte', 'NR', 'Every year, on June 27th, in a small village in New England, inhabited by no more than 300 people, a lottery is held in which a family is chosen as part of a ritual to ensure a good harvest.', 'Every year, on June 27th, in a small village in New England, inhabited by no more than 300 people, a lottery is held in which a family is chosen as part of a ritual to ensure a good harvest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88ivnSe7VLnXebsjXtpDLgoQoFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354623'),
  ('708155230085369410', 'The Loud House Movie', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Dave Needham, Brittany Campbell', 'Chris Viscardi, Kevin Sullivan', 'Asher Bishop, David Tennant, Michelle Gomez, Jill Talley, Brian Stepanek, Catherine Taber, Liliana Mumy, Nika Futterman', 'G', 'The Loud family travel to Scotland and discover they are descendants of Scottish royalty as they move into their giant ancestral castle.', 'The Loud family travel to Scotland and discover they are descendants of Scottish royalty as they move into their giant ancestral castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dM5DILTl9ddpjvnJhs2nA1U9Ru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410113'),
  ('232426710842749798', 'The Love Bug', 1968, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Robert Stevenson, Edward Colman', 'Don DaGradi, Bill Walsh', 'Dean Jones, Michele Lee, David Tomlinson, Buddy Hackett, Joe Flynn, Benson Fong, Andy Granatelli, Joe E. Ross', 'G', 'Down-on-his-luck race car driver Jim Douglas teams up with a little VW Bug that has a mind of its own, not realizing Herbie''s worth until a sneaky rival plots to steal him.', 'Down-on-his-luck race car driver Jim Douglas teams up with a little VW Bug that has a mind of its own, not realizing Herbie''s worth until a sneaky rival plots to steal him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Lc1efdYZUZia2zsRWcUkiD1KdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14136'),
