  ('325904425556331075', 'The Love Bug Rally', 1971, 'Action, Comedy', 'Alexander Posch, Ken Hoover, Boris Larin', 'Alexander De Callier, Rudolf Zehetgruber', 'Rudolf Zehetgruber, Gerd Duwner, Kathrin Oginski, Constanze Sieck, Harry Fuß, Gretl Elb, Jim Brown, Bob Mackay', null, 'A German race car driver in a yellow love bug named Dudu teams up with a Scottish driver in a hovercraft to win a race in the African desert.', 'A German race car driver in a yellow love bug named Dudu teams up with a Scottish driver in a hovercraft to win a race in the African desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8v7zafZt5xdNXXNo9LjLaGVXSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102653'),
  ('532032339243502344', 'The Love Butcher', 1975, 'Horror', 'Mikel Angel, Don Jones, Don Jones', 'Mikel Angel, James M. Tanenbaum', 'James Lemp, Kay Neer, Jeremiah Beecher, Robin Sherwood, Richard Kennedy, Louis Ojena, Marilyn Jones, John Parker', 'R', 'The twisted tale of Caleb, and his alter ego Lester. After being pushed around too far, Caleb transforms into Lester and returns to those who have wronged him.', 'The twisted tale of Caleb, and his alter ego Lester. After being pushed around too far, Caleb transforms into Lester and returns to those who have wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e47rZK47ShPZGCoSeA7qCQbk4fB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81437'),
  ('960590104994823713', 'The Love Eterne', 1963, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Li Han-Hsiang, Tadashi Nishimoto', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Betty Loh Ti, Ivy Ling Po, Yam Kit, Li Kun, Chen Yanyan, Ching Miao, Kao Pao-Shu, Ou-Yang Sha-Fei', null, 'In this dreamy romance set in China during the fourth-century, a young woman convinces her parents to allow her to dress as a boy and attend university.', 'In this dreamy romance set in China during the fourth-century, a young woman convinces her parents to allow her to dress as a boy and attend university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZW1z3ACCtGeeG87umzOQ04pOe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107248'),
  ('781807195647958972', 'The Love Flower', 1920, 'Drama', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer, Paul H. Allen', 'D.W. Griffith', 'Carol Dempster, Richard Barthelmess, George MacQuarrie, Anders Randolf, Florence Short, Crauford Kent, Adolph Lestina, William James', null, 'A man murders his wife''s lover and escapes with his daughter to the South Pacific. A detective pursues him, joined by a young man who eventually falls in love with the daughter.', 'A man murders his wife''s lover and escapes with his daughter to the South Pacific. A detective pursues him, joined by a young man who eventually falls in love with the daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tQwIx1uDwUrGnBb1GVcs5RPogq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184249'),
  ('537579896419324899', 'The Love Game', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Penzer', 'Philippe de Broca', 'Jean-Pierre Cassel, Geneviève Cluny, Jean-Louis Maury, Robert Vattier, Claude Cerval, Pierre Repp, Maria Pacôme, Jeanne Pérez', null, 'Victor and Suzanne are a couple at odds about commitment. Suzanne needs more reassurance from Victor about the future of their relationship. He is a painter with an inspired creative side who finds it difficult to understand Suzanne''s point of view. They are happy together; what is the problem? So when a friend comes into the picture and proposes to Suzanne, Victor suddenly realizes that Suzanne was right. Without a formal commitment, the suddenly insecure man does not like the view from the opposite shore.', 'Victor and Suzanne are a couple at odds about commitment. Suzanne needs more reassurance from Victor about the future of their relationship. He is a painter with an inspired creative side who finds it difficult to understand Suzanne''s point of view. They are happy together; what is the problem? So when a friend comes into the picture and proposes to Suzanne, Victor suddenly realizes that Suzanne was right. Without a formal commitment, the suddenly insecure man does not like the view from the opposite shore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PHTz0AkebFKc1k3hNoxGszfqZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269125'),
  ('933284451079664136', 'The Love God?', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Nat Hiken, William Margulies, Phil Bowles', 'Nat Hiken', 'Don Knotts, Anne Francis, Edmond O''Brien, Maureen Arthur, James Gregory, Maggie Peterson, Jesslyn Fax, Jacques Aubuchon', 'NR', 'Ornithologist Abner Peacock sells off his modest-selling birdwatching periodical to a charlatan who turns it into a girlie mag, making it a massive financial success. After Peacock and the magazine are taken to court on obscenity charges, he unwillingly becomes a reluctant hero and ends up a swinging libertine.', 'Ornithologist Abner Peacock sells off his modest-selling birdwatching periodical to a charlatan who turns it into a girlie mag, making it a massive financial success. After Peacock and the magazine are taken to court on obscenity charges, he unwillingly becomes a reluctant hero and ends up a swinging libertine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7W7amRSCelwAvpxh7XJj75FO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40721'),
  ('306231428679102368', 'The Love Goddesses', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Saul J. Turell', 'Graeme Ferguson, Saul J. Turell', 'Carl King', 'NR', 'This insightful documentary features some of the major and most beautiful actresses to grace the silver screen. It shows how the movie industry changed its depiction of sex and actresses'' portrayal of sex from the silent movie era to the present. Classic scenes are shown from the silent movie ''True Heart Susie,'' starring Lillian Gish, to ''Love Me Tonight'' (1932), blending sex and sophistication, starring Jeanette MacDonald (pre-Nelson Eddy), and to Elizabeth Taylor in ''A Place in the Sun'' (1951), plus much , much more.', 'This insightful documentary features some of the major and most beautiful actresses to grace the silver screen. It shows how the movie industry changed its depiction of sex and actresses'' portrayal of sex from the silent movie era to the present. Classic scenes are shown from the silent movie ''True Heart Susie,'' starring Lillian Gish, to ''Love Me Tonight'' (1932), blending sex and sophistication, starring Jeanette MacDonald (pre-Nelson Eddy), and to Elizabeth Taylor in ''A Place in the Sun'' (1951), plus much , much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkOxKjZpOCA2BlLnYAUvyg5vBzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67363'),
  ('518238648031000430', 'The Love Guru', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marco Schnabel, Peter Deming, Penny Charter', 'Mike Myers, Graham Gordy', 'Mike Myers, Jessica Alba, Justin Timberlake, Romany Malco, Meagan Good, John Oliver, Verne Troyer, Manu Narayan', 'PG-13', 'Born in America and raised in an Indian ashram, Pitka returns to his native land to seek his fortune as a spiritualist and self-help expert. His skills are put to the test when he must get a brokenhearted hockey player''s marriage back on track in time for the man to help his team win the Stanley Cup.', 'Born in America and raised in an Indian ashram, Pitka returns to his native land to seek his fortune as a spiritualist and self-help expert. His skills are put to the test when he must get a brokenhearted hockey player''s marriage back on track in time for the man to help his team win the Stanley Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sp8AV64ftAZCT9uWfgbCb3olGDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12177'),
  ('1028943516457808133', 'The Love Letter', 1998, 'Romance, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Dan Curtis, Donald P.H. Eaton, Tracy Kilpatrick', null, 'Campbell Scott, Jennifer Jason Leigh, David Dukes, Estelle Parsons, Daphne Ashbrook, Gerrit Graham, Kali Rocha, Laurie Kennedy', null, '20th century computer games designer Scott, Civil War buff, buys an antique desk from that era and, while polishing it, he discovers a secret compartment in which sits an unmailed letter--a letter written by a young poet named Lizzie over a century earlier. Touched by her yearning for passion, he writes her back, egged on by his mystically inclined mother. Magically, his letter reaches Lizzie and they begin a correspondence that threatens Scott''s impending marriage but promises to bring fulfilment to Lizzie. Spanning the Civil War to the present, the perils of Lizzie''s war-torn situation threaten her safe passage into the future. Will their love endure the test of time?', '20th century computer games designer Scott, Civil War buff, buys an antique desk from that era and, while polishing it, he discovers a secret compartment in which sits an unmailed letter--a letter written by a young poet named Lizzie over a century earlier. Touched by her yearning for passion, he writes her back, egged on by his mystically inclined mother. Magically, his letter reaches Lizzie and they begin a correspondence that threatens Scott''s impending marriage but promises to bring fulfilment to Lizzie. Spanning the Civil War to the present, the perils of Lizzie''s war-torn situation threaten her safe passage into the future. Will their love endure the test of time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7DKV2pIP6u5WvXIdUl2VA5hz3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57943'),
  ('955723425429456444', 'The Love Letter', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tami Reiker, Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Justin Muller', 'Maria Maggenti', 'Kate Capshaw, Blythe Danner, Ellen DeGeneres, Geraldine McEwan, Julianne Nicholson, Tom Everett Scott, Tom Selleck, Gloria Stuart', 'PG-13', 'In the sleepy New England town of Loblolly By The Sea, a letter has arrived that is going to wake things up. It is a love letter - ardent, sensual... and unsigned. As the letter falls into different hands, residents of the small town to eye one another with renewed interest - wondering who it''s for and who it''s from. Determined to find the letter''s author, Helen MacFarquhar begins a quest that will open her life to a new chapter involving two decidedly different men: George, an old friend from her past, and Johnny, a young man very much in her present. Unexpectedly, one mysterious love note has the power to unlock some startling secrets, leaving a trail of wonderful surprises as it turns an entire town upside down.', 'In the sleepy New England town of Loblolly By The Sea, a letter has arrived that is going to wake things up. It is a love letter - ardent, sensual... and unsigned. As the letter falls into different hands, residents of the small town to eye one another with renewed interest - wondering who it''s for and who it''s from. Determined to find the letter''s author, Helen MacFarquhar begins a quest that will open her life to a new chapter involving two decidedly different men: George, an old friend from her past, and Johnny, a young man very much in her present. Unexpectedly, one mysterious love note has the power to unlock some startling secrets, leaving a trail of wonderful surprises as it turns an entire town upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w8QCvKDFn1cJ3sW3RGWcwlitgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31342'),
  ('477011097516894474', 'The Love Letter', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jérôme Bonnell, Pascal Lagriffoul', 'Jérôme Bonnell', 'Grégory Montel, Grégory Gadebois, Anaïs Demoustier, Léa Drucker, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, Pablo Pauly, Charlotte Clamens, Gaëtan Peau', null, 'Jonas, a 40 something Parisian, is still desperately in love with his ex-girlfriend Léa. When he knocks on her door to confess his feelings and she turns him down, he ends up at the café downstairs. Inspiration strikes and he sits down to write her a long love letter, dodging everything he was supposed to do that day. What begins as a last attempt to get her back surprisingly turns into a vivid musing on the state of his life. Over the course of a day, helped by a wisecracking bartender and an array of patrons from the neighborhood, Jonas has to face his past relationships, his uncertain future and, most of all, himself.', 'Jonas, a 40 something Parisian, is still desperately in love with his ex-girlfriend Léa. When he knocks on her door to confess his feelings and she turns him down, he ends up at the café downstairs. Inspiration strikes and he sits down to write her a long love letter, dodging everything he was supposed to do that day. What begins as a last attempt to get her back surprisingly turns into a vivid musing on the state of his life. Over the course of a day, helped by a wisecracking bartender and an array of patrons from the neighborhood, Jonas has to face his past relationships, his uncertain future and, most of all, himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJ1GqLcd0nyuTSbMgKXbdK4JYev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833428'),
  ('114118431052561549', 'The Love Life of an Octopus', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon', null, null, null, 'An octopus slithers into a narrow crack near the shore; we see its eye up close. It feeds on a crab. In spring it''s time to mate. A male grabs a female; he inserts his third arm in her respiratory cavity. We watch another pair: a larger female is the aggressor here. Mating is repeated over hours and days. The female releases strings of fertilized eggs that hang from the roof of a nest. She guards her spawn for a month, fanning the strings to circulate water for oxygen and cleanliness.', 'An octopus slithers into a narrow crack near the shore; we see its eye up close. It feeds on a crab. In spring it''s time to mate. A male grabs a female; he inserts his third arm in her respiratory cavity. We watch another pair: a larger female is the aggressor here. Mating is repeated over hours and days. The female releases strings of fertilized eggs that hang from the roof of a nest. She guards her spawn for a month, fanning the strings to circulate water for oxygen and cleanliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gYPgIl7lG8uY59gUgTxmgwygj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117595'),
  ('326687792530150307', 'The Love Lottery', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Charles Crichton, Douglas Slocombe, Dock Mathieson', 'Monja Danischewsky', 'David Niven, Peggy Cummins, Anne Vernon, Herbert Lom, Charles Victor, Gordon Jackson, Felix Aylmer, Hugh McDermott', 'NR', 'Rex Allerton is a top Hollywood star and an idol of the female population. To get away from the pressure of the fans who won''t leave him alone, he relocates to a remote Italian village where unanticipated trouble arises when unwittingly he becomes the prize for an international lottery.', 'Rex Allerton is a top Hollywood star and an idol of the female population. To get away from the pressure of the fans who won''t leave him alone, he relocates to a remote Italian village where unanticipated trouble arises when unwittingly he becomes the prize for an international lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT3h4xCagLxnnVaNQgxNZdRICO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42880'),
  ('602955394661777078', 'The Love Nest', 1923, 'Comedy', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton, Robert Ives', 'Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Joe Roberts, Virginia Fox, Steve Murphy', null, 'In an attempt to forget his lost sweetheart, Buster takes a long trip at the sea when he''s caught by pirates.', 'In an attempt to forget his lost sweetheart, Buster takes a long trip at the sea when he''s caught by pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a9i1jw1BE87l5yjZXsyCztoUh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51367'),
  ('487430612200662787', 'The Love of a Woman', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Grémillon, Louis Page', 'Jean Grémillon, René Wheeler, René Fallet', 'Micheline Presle, Massimo Girotti, Gaby Morlay, Paolo Stoppa, Marc Cassot, Yvette Etiévant, Marius David, Roland Lesaffre', null, 'Marie, a young doctor, settles down on the Ouessant Island. She will be able to win the diffidence of the local population but she will have to fight for her independence after falling in love with an Italian engineer.', 'Marie, a young doctor, settles down on the Ouessant Island. She will be able to win the diffidence of the local population but she will have to fight for her independence after falling in love with an Italian engineer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wuuwNQwp7SA1WQcQ89gGDW5mM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64103'),
  ('76809758331013783', 'The Love of Captain Brando', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jaime de Armiñán, Rosa Biadiu, Roberto Parra', 'Jaime de Armiñán, Juan Tébar', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Ana Belén, Jaime Gamboa, Julieta Serrano, Antonio Ferrandis, Amparo Soler Leal, Pilar Muñoz, Eduardo Calvo', null, 'During the last years of Franco''s dictatorship, Fernando, an old republican exile, returns to his home in a small Castilian village and befriends Aurora, a young and attractive teacher.', 'During the last years of Franco''s dictatorship, Fernando, an old republican exile, returns to his home in a small Castilian village and befriends Aurora, a young and attractive teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fthz9nOIBFKNtgHGvWxUwV26W8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264562'),
  ('285607719929866169', 'The Love of Jeanne Ney', 1927, 'Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Marc Sorkin, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Ilya Ehrenburg, Ladislaus Vajda, Rudolf Leonhardt', 'Édith Jéhanne, Uno Henning, Fritz Rasp, Brigitte Helm, Sig Arno, Vladimir Sokoloff, Margarete Kupfer, Robert Scholz', null, 'In the Crimea, the Reds and the Whites aren''t done fighting, and Jeanne discovers that the man she loves is a Bolshevik (when he kills her father). Penniless, she returns to Paris where she works for her uncle. Soon after, her lover Andreas is in France to organize the sailors in Toulon. So also is a thief, traitor, and libertine, Khalibiev, who wants to seduce Jeanne. His schemes, Jeanne and Andreas''s naivete, and a lost diamond bring the lovers to the brink of tragedy.', 'In the Crimea, the Reds and the Whites aren''t done fighting, and Jeanne discovers that the man she loves is a Bolshevik (when he kills her father). Penniless, she returns to Paris where she works for her uncle. Soon after, her lover Andreas is in France to organize the sailors in Toulon. So also is a thief, traitor, and libertine, Khalibiev, who wants to seduce Jeanne. His schemes, Jeanne and Andreas''s naivete, and a lost diamond bring the lovers to the brink of tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v4VJ3vsXHe0dZSzcGzDg7J5Owe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125693'),
  ('107581207305843015', 'The Love of Zero', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Florey', 'Slavko Vorkapich, Robert Florey', 'Tamara Shavrova, Joseph Marievsky, Anielka Elter', null, 'While playing his trombone one Sunday, the enthusiastic Zero sees Beatrix and falls in love. He returns the next week to express his feelings, and it''s mutual. Over the next few months, they spoon, kiss, and find happiness. Then, she receives a letter from Kabul, demanding that she return to the palace of the Grand Vizier. The lovers part, heartbroken. Zero tries expressing himself to a woman on the street. He meets derision. Then, news of Beatrix. Does this romance end in smiles or tears?', 'While playing his trombone one Sunday, the enthusiastic Zero sees Beatrix and falls in love. He returns the next week to express his feelings, and it''s mutual. Over the next few months, they spoon, kiss, and find happiness. Then, she receives a letter from Kabul, demanding that she return to the palace of the Grand Vizier. The lovers part, heartbroken. Zero tries expressing himself to a woman on the street. He meets derision. Then, news of Beatrix. Does this romance end in smiles or tears?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoJEcwkZ0sXwUp8NqjkHovxxSNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96941'),
  ('764416741566407118', 'The Love Parade', 1930, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Victor Milner', 'Guy Bolton', 'Maurice Chevalier, Jeanette MacDonald, Lupino Lane, Lillian Roth, Eugene Pallette, E.H. Calvert, Edgar Norton, Lionel Belmore', 'NR', 'The queen of mythical Sylvania marries a courtier, who finds his new life unsatisfying.', 'The queen of mythical Sylvania marries a courtier, who finds his new life unsatisfying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWAoFnPsH4gYiFGqLwzicyMazdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51759'),
  ('858487234068659086', 'The Love Punch', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Joel Hopkins, Jérôme Alméras, Eliot Mathews', 'Joel Hopkins', 'Emma Thompson, Pierce Brosnan, Celia Imrie, Timothy Spall, Louise Bourgoin, Laurent Lafitte, Tuppence Middleton, Jack Wilkinson', 'PG-13', 'Retirement at last! Middle-aged and divorced, company owner Richard Jones is looking forward to a worry-free existence as he arrives at his office on his last day of work. Much to his dismay, he discovers that the management buyout of his company was fraudulent. The company is now bankrupt and the employee pension fund — including his own — has been embezzled. Enlisting the help of his ex-wife Kate, Richard sets out to track down the shady businessman behind the fraud.', 'Retirement at last! Middle-aged and divorced, company owner Richard Jones is looking forward to a worry-free existence as he arrives at his office on his last day of work. Much to his dismay, he discovers that the management buyout of his company was fraudulent. The company is now bankrupt and the employee pension fund — including his own — has been embezzled. Enlisting the help of his ex-wife Kate, Richard sets out to track down the shady businessman behind the fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaJZm5z38RUi9czHxaiayN1OMAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209249'),
  ('449063562836453591', 'The Love Scam', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Vladan Radović', 'Caterina Salvadori, Ciro Zecca', 'Antonio Folletto, Laura Adriani, Vincenzo Nemolato, Saverio Picozzi, Vincenzo Picozzi, Loris De Luna, Biagio Manna, Roberto De Francesco', 'R', 'Drowning in debt, two brothers concoct a plan to scam a wealthy heiress and save their home in Naples — but unexpected love soon complicates the scheme.', 'Drowning in debt, two brothers concoct a plan to scam a wealthy heiress and save their home in Naples — but unexpected love soon complicates the scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWBjdB6tP71ed4WTFxuqDZnWVk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397854'),
  ('739355407880125678', 'The Love Trap', 1929, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William Wyler, Gilbert Warrenton', 'John B. Clymer, Clarence Marks', 'Laura La Plante, Neil Hamilton, Robert Ellis, Jocelyn Lee, Norman Trevor, Clarissa Selwynne, Rita La Roy, Earl McCarthy', null, 'A chorus girl loses her job and thus the room she owes back rent on, and ends up being rescued from the street by a dashing rich man. But his family isn''t over-accepting of chorus girls joining their family.', 'A chorus girl loses her job and thus the room she owes back rent on, and ends up being rescued from the street by a dashing rich man. But his family isn''t over-accepting of chorus girls joining their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzX8cFxKRb9nd9ABgkOmEVBqbT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108155'),
  ('782047552899408059', 'The Love Witch', 2016, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'M. David Mullen, Anna Biller, Jacob Torossian', 'Anna Biller', 'Samantha Robinson, Gian Keys, Laura Waddell, Jeffrey Vincent Parise, Jared Sanford, Robert Seeley, Jennifer Ingrum, Randy Evans', 'NR', 'A modern-day witch uses spells and magic to get men to fall in love with her, with deadly consequences.', 'A modern-day witch uses spells and magic to get men to fall in love with her, with deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6mZjCwGn9KCTrStTRM88pui0is.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374052'),
  ('1046536441419892542', 'The Lovebirds', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Showalter, Scott August, Brian Burgoyne', 'Brendan Gall, Aaron Abrams', 'Issa Rae, Kumail Nanjiani, Paul Sparks, Anna Camp, Nicholas X. Parsons, Kyle Bornheimer, Barry Rothbart, Catherine Cohen', 'R', 'A couple experiences a defining moment in their relationship when they are unintentionally embroiled in a murder mystery. As their journey to clear their names takes them from one extreme – and hilarious - circumstance to the next, they must figure out how they, and their relationship, can survive the night.', 'A couple experiences a defining moment in their relationship when they are unintentionally embroiled in a murder mystery. As their journey to clear their names takes them from one extreme – and hilarious - circumstance to the next, they must figure out how they, and their relationship, can survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jdLnvALCpK1NkeQU1z4YvOe2dZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576156'),
  ('189746719210069625', 'The Loved One', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Tony Richardson, Haskell Wexler', 'Terry Southern, Christopher Isherwood', 'Robert Morse, Jonathan Winters, Anjanette Comer, Rod Steiger, Dana Andrews, Milton Berle, James Coburn, John Gielgud', 'NR', 'Newly arrived in Hollywood from England, Dennis Barlow finds he has to arrange his uncle''s interment at the highly-organised and very profitable Whispering Glades funeral parlour. His fancy is caught by one of their cosmeticians, Aimee Thanatogenos. But he has three problems - the strict rules of owner Blessed Reverand Glenworthy, the rivalry of embalmer Mr Joyboy, and the shame of now working himself at The Happy Hunting Ground pets'' memorial home.', 'Newly arrived in Hollywood from England, Dennis Barlow finds he has to arrange his uncle''s interment at the highly-organised and very profitable Whispering Glades funeral parlour. His fancy is caught by one of their cosmeticians, Aimee Thanatogenos. But he has three problems - the strict rules of owner Blessed Reverand Glenworthy, the rivalry of embalmer Mr Joyboy, and the shame of now working himself at The Happy Hunting Ground pets'' memorial home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ismkfTtpJ1Nu8EJacMdwaiAmLwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16303'),
  ('1057915576046318200', 'The Loved One', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Irene Emma Villamor, Pao Orendain', 'Irene Emma Villamor', 'Catriona Gray, Jackie Lou Blanco, Adrian Alandy, Ian Pangilinan, Max Eigenmann', 'Not Rated', 'Reuniting them after 15 years to play former lovers whose paths cross again, forcing them to confront unresolved emotions, past heartbreak, and lingering feelings, with the story exploring themes of lost love, memory, and moving on as they navigate painful encounters years later.', 'Reuniting them after 15 years to play former lovers whose paths cross again, forcing them to confront unresolved emotions, past heartbreak, and lingering feelings, with the story exploring themes of lost love, memory, and moving on as they navigate painful encounters years later.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrVZQcphJRWVJgQZtWztrauB6Fwe.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-loved-one-2026-2'),
  ('325169594585150806', 'The Loved Ones', 2010, 'Horror', 'Sean Byrne, Brendan Campbell, Lauren Wilbow', 'Sean Byrne', 'Xavier Samuel, Robin McLeavy, John Brumpton, Richard Wilson, Victoria Thaine, Jessica McNamee, Andrew S. Gilbert, Suzi Dougherty', 'R', 'When Brent turns down his classmate Lola''s invitation to the prom, she concocts a wildly violent plan for revenge.', 'When Brent turns down his classmate Lola''s invitation to the prom, she concocts a wildly violent plan for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydsLYdSiPSIL1LOWWYu7VCvDTT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46420'),
  ('825909342285992528', 'The Loveless', 1984, 'Drama', 'Monty Montgomery, Kathryn Bigelow, Doyle Smith', 'Monty Montgomery, Kathryn Bigelow', 'Willem Dafoe, Robert Gordon, Marin Kanter, J. Don Ferguson, Tina L''Hotsky, Lawrence Matarese, Danny Rosen, Phillip Kimbrough', 'R', 'Trouble ensues when a motorcycle gang stops in a small southern town while heading to the races at Daytona.', 'Trouble ensues when a motorcycle gang stops in a small southern town while heading to the races at Daytona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aZcW9NBsLX7ZldQkDtbKkHMfUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36826'),
  ('1077950394797754745', 'The Lovely Bones', 2009, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Andrew Lesnie, Peter Jackson', 'Fran Walsh, Philippa Boyens, Peter Jackson', 'Saoirse Ronan, Mark Wahlberg, Rachel Weisz, Susan Sarandon, Stanley Tucci, Rose McIver, Michael Imperioli, Carolyn Dando', 'PG-13', 'After being brutally murdered, 14-year-old Susie Salmon watches from heaven over her grief-stricken family -- and her killer. As she observes their daily lives, she must balance her thirst for revenge with her desire for her family to heal.', 'After being brutally murdered, 14-year-old Susie Salmon watches from heaven over her grief-stricken family -- and her killer. As she observes their daily lives, she must balance her thirst for revenge with her desire for her family to heal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sn0iDphRxQ7I6aLd9igIgACITak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7980'),
  ('705962135966988701', 'The Lovely Month of May', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Étienne Becker, Denys Clerval', 'Catherine Winter, Chris Marker', 'Yves Montand, Chris Marker, Jean-Luc Godard, Anna Karina, Edgar Morin, Alain Resnais, Jacques Rivette, Jean Rouch', null, 'Candid interviews of ordinary people on the meaning of happiness, an often amorphous and inarticulable notion that evokes more basic and fundamentally egalitarian ideals of self-betterment, prosperity, tolerance, economic opportunity, and freedom.', 'Candid interviews of ordinary people on the meaning of happiness, an often amorphous and inarticulable notion that evokes more basic and fundamentally egalitarian ideals of self-betterment, prosperity, tolerance, economic opportunity, and freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IzgPTaENPpg3b7wexti3RmMBK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128779'),
  ('747577795591728017', 'The Lovemakers', 1961, 'Drama', 'Luigi Bazzoni, Albino Cocco, Vincenzo Gamna', 'Vasco Pratolini, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Massimo Franciosa', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Claudia Cardinale, Pietro Germi, Romolo Valli, Gabriella Pallotta, Gina Sammarco, Marcella Valeri, Emma Baron', null, 'The death of a wealthy patriarch in 1885 sets off an interfamily power struggle. Son Ferdinando buys out his other relatives in order to gain full control over the dead man''s property. But Ferdinando''s nephew Amerigo holds out. Amerigo''s stance is weakened when he heads for Florence and meets prostitute Bianca.', 'The death of a wealthy patriarch in 1885 sets off an interfamily power struggle. Son Ferdinando buys out his other relatives in order to gain full control over the dead man''s property. But Ferdinando''s nephew Amerigo holds out. Amerigo''s stance is weakened when he heads for Florence and meets prostitute Bianca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0kjfRJHgeKexlg4xrwB0uiwudw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159474'),
  ('419634444665730849', 'The Lover', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Robert Fraisse', 'Gérard Brach, Jean-Jacques Annaud', 'Jane March, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Frédérique Meininger, Arnaud Giovaninetti, Melvil Poupaud, Lisa Faulkner, Jeanne Moreau, Xiem Mang', 'R', 'A poor French teenage girl engages in an illicit affair with a wealthy Chinese heir in 1920s Saigon. For the first time in her young life she has control, and she wields it deftly over her besotted lover throughout a series of clandestine meetings and torrid encounters.', 'A poor French teenage girl engages in an illicit affair with a wealthy Chinese heir in 1920s Saigon. For the first time in her young life she has control, and she wields it deftly over her besotted lover throughout a series of clandestine meetings and torrid encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgBGy8QaIFD9jQJWgi837czobEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10995'),
  ('842208907674831366', 'The Lover', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valery Todorovsky, Serhiy Mykhalchuk, Tatyana Talkova', 'Gennadiy Ostrovskiy', 'Oleg Yankovskiy, Sergey Garmash, Vera Voronkova, Valeriy Prokhorov, Irina Sokolova, Andrei Smirnov, Vladimir Yumatov, Galina Kashkovskaya', null, 'This is a remarkably subtle film–a character study that focuses on Mitya’s attempts to cope with each new startling phase of discovery. At first he mourns for his dead wife, but then he discovers that he didn’t really know her.', 'This is a remarkably subtle film–a character study that focuses on Mitya’s attempts to cope with each new startling phase of discovery. At first he mourns for his dead wife, but then he discovers that he didn’t really know her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uvBuoXoJcycNMBrnORWiMFCyzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49700'),
