  ('2769064292292848', 'The Low Land', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Miguel Santesmases, Patricia Arasa Montón, Aurora Lago Villalón', 'Miguel Santesmases, Ángeles González-Sinde', 'Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Pere Arquillué, Itziar Miranda, Javier Gúzman, Lydia Vera, Sonia Bel Faci, Mariano Anós, Gema Burgues', null, 'Carmen, a well-known writer on her fifties, has returned a year ago to a farmhouse in the small town where she was born, in Bajo Aragón (Teruel, Spain). Her vital crisis is complicated when Eduardo, a film producer with whom she had a love affair twenty years ago reappears in her life.', 'Carmen, a well-known writer on her fifties, has returned a year ago to a farmhouse in the small town where she was born, in Bajo Aragón (Teruel, Spain). Her vital crisis is complicated when Eduardo, a film producer with whom she had a love affair twenty years ago reappears in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m28I4KLQVRmw5F4n5s7lfVdrFkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1391483'),
  ('417482195536874980', 'The Lower Depths', 1936, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Jean Renoir, Jean Bachelet, Fédote Bourgasoff', 'Jean Renoir, Charles Spaak, Evgeny Zamyatin', 'Jean Gabin, Suzy Prim, Louis Jouvet, Jany Holt, Junie Astor, Nathalie Alexeief-Darsène, Vladimir Sokoloff, Robert Le Vigan', null, 'Inhabitants of a flophouse struggle to survive under the harsh treatment imposed by the landlord, Kostyleva. One resident, young thief Wasska Pepel, ends his affair with the landlord''s wife, Vassilissa, and takes up with her sister, Natacha. Pepel also befriends the baron, a former nobleman fallen on hard times, but Pepel''s attempts at happiness are complicated when he''s accused of murder by a spiteful Vassilissa.', 'Inhabitants of a flophouse struggle to survive under the harsh treatment imposed by the landlord, Kostyleva. One resident, young thief Wasska Pepel, ends his affair with the landlord''s wife, Vassilissa, and takes up with her sister, Natacha. Pepel also befriends the baron, a former nobleman fallen on hard times, but Pepel''s attempts at happiness are complicated when he''s accused of murder by a spiteful Vassilissa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jKTFaQE4jYeMRqoY1tR1Flp73n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45802'),
  ('605686705552429133', 'The Lower Depths', 1957, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Kazuo Yamasaki, Yoshimitsu Banno', 'Akira Kurosawa, Hideo Oguni', 'Toshirō Mifune, Isuzu Yamada, Kyōko Kagawa, Ganjirō Nakamura II, Minoru Chiaki, Kamatari Fujiwara, Akemi Negishi, Nijiko Kiyokawa', null, 'Residents of a rundown boardinghouse in 19th-century Japan, including a mysterious old man and an aging actor, get drawn into a love triangle that turns violent. When amoral thief Sutekichi breaks off his affair with landlady Osugi to romance her younger sister, Okayo, Osugi extracts her revenge by revealing her infidelity to her jealous husband.', 'Residents of a rundown boardinghouse in 19th-century Japan, including a mysterious old man and an aging actor, get drawn into a love triangle that turns violent. When amoral thief Sutekichi breaks off his affair with landlady Osugi to romance her younger sister, Okayo, Osugi extracts her revenge by revealing her infidelity to her jealous husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhvK59WDqMzjv5Vm9bPA1xtP0kv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26893'),
  ('280402594194415626', 'The Lowlife', 2017, 'Drama', 'Takahisa Zeze, Yasuyuki Sasaki, Kaori Harimoto', 'Tomoko Ogawa', 'Ayano Moriguchi, Kokone Sasaki, Aina Yamada, Shugo Oshinari, Ryu Morioka, Yoichiro Saito, Noriko Eguchi, Makiko Watanabe', null, 'Based on a 2016 novel by Mana Sakura, “The Lowlife” shows the stories of three women who work in Japan’s adult video industry.', 'Based on a 2016 novel by Mana Sakura, “The Lowlife” shows the stories of three women who work in Japan’s adult video industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoAto9LMjYFmdgrKvnSdgsRtHRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488981'),
