  ('659084694922054162', 'The Lunchbox', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ritesh Batra, Michael Simmonds', 'Ritesh Batra', 'Irrfan Khan, Nimrat Kaur, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Lillete Dubey, Nasir Khan, Bharati Achrekar, Nakul Vaid, Yashvi Punneet Nagar', null, 'A mistaken delivery in Mumbai''s famously efficient lunchbox delivery system (Mumbai''s Dabbawallahs) connects a young housewife to a stranger in the dusk of his life. They build a fantasy world together through notes in the lunchbox. Gradually, this fantasy threatens to overwhelm their reality.', 'A mistaken delivery in Mumbai''s famously efficient lunchbox delivery system (Mumbai''s Dabbawallahs) connects a young housewife to a stranger in the dusk of his life. They build a fantasy world together through notes in the lunchbox. Gradually, this fantasy threatens to overwhelm their reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSOiz1h97i3qwjZJXY8SeLvjPsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191714'),
  ('278292038762861589', 'The Lunchroom', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ana Inés Berard, María Victoria Andino, Lara Sade', 'Diego Lerman, Ezequiel Radusky', 'Liliana Juárez, Rosario Bléfari, Verónica Perrotta, Sol Lugo, Nina Suárez, Pedro Palomar, Rubén Gaetano, Amparo Maldonado', null, 'Lila, a dedicated cleaning staff employee, runs an unofficial cafeteria with her friend Marcela. When she is officially promoted to direct it, tensions arise with Marcela that upset the delicate balance of the office after 30 years of camaraderie.', 'Lila, a dedicated cleaning staff employee, runs an unofficial cafeteria with her friend Marcela. When she is officially promoted to direct it, tensions arise with Marcela that upset the delicate balance of the office after 30 years of camaraderie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrdz5gSx8KTQsgAu2cyAv2NYpjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648426'),
  ('324089639003627855', 'The Lunnis and the Great Fairy Tale Adventures', 2019, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini, Rolo Pulpeiro', 'Álvaro Ron, Gorka Magallón, Daniel García Rodríguez', 'Carla Chiorazzo, Bruno Oro, Lucrecia Perez, Ramón Barea, Pablo Carbonell, Javier Losán, César Camino, Rodrigo Poisón', null, 'Imagination and the World of Fantasy are in danger. Mar, an eight-year-old little girl, who''s an expert in stories and legends thanks to the books read to her every night by her grandfather, decides she has to try and save them. With the help of her friends, the Lunnis, they will embark on a magical adventure to stop them disappearing.', 'Imagination and the World of Fantasy are in danger. Mar, an eight-year-old little girl, who''s an expert in stories and legends thanks to the books read to her every night by her grandfather, decides she has to try and save them. With the help of her friends, the Lunnis, they will embark on a magical adventure to stop them disappearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyIb9OAsOtH0FXTkUPeazWN1mUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571234'),
  ('238043936324485084', 'The Lure', 2015, 'Horror, Music, Romance, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Agnieszka Smoczyńska, Jakub Kijowski', 'Robert Bolesto', 'Michalina Olszańska, Marta Mazurek, Kinga Preis, Jakub Gierszał, Andrzej Konopka, Zygmunt Malanowicz, Marcin Kowalczyk, Magdalena Cielecka', null, 'Two mermaid sisters, who end up performing at a nightclub, face cruel and bloody choices when one of them falls in love with a beautiful young man.', 'Two mermaid sisters, who end up performing at a nightclub, face cruel and bloody choices when one of them falls in love with a beautiful young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxdssWM8WyzBFq6pYwBHeTIJK1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375742'),
  ('218470450599029448', 'The Lustful Vicar', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Torgny Wickman, Lasse Björne', 'Torgny Wickman, Inge Ivarson', 'Jarl Borssén, Margit Carlqvist, John Elfström, Håkan Westergren, Åke Fridell, Lissi Alandh, Arne Källerud, Kim Anderzon', null, 'During a witch trial in the seventeenth century a woman is accused of being a witch and burned at the stake. The witch curse the village priest who pushed through the accusations and promises that her offspring will avenge her. During the Caroline the priest''s son take over as vicar of the congregation, and the daughter of the witch bewitches him so that he suffers constant erection. This is off course very embarrassing for the vicar. The local women has to step in and try to set things right', 'During a witch trial in the seventeenth century a woman is accused of being a witch and burned at the stake. The witch curse the village priest who pushed through the accusations and promises that her offspring will avenge her. During the Caroline the priest''s son take over as vicar of the congregation, and the daughter of the witch bewitches him so that he suffers constant erection. This is off course very embarrassing for the vicar. The local women has to step in and try to set things right', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJ7xu1uFVxCzJrUYGAjFP7ApkOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101459'),
  ('1066762352329882480', 'The Lusty Men', 1952, 'Drama, Western', 'Nicholas Ray, Lee Garmes, Edward Killy', 'David Dortort, Horace McCoy, Alfred Hayes', 'Susan Hayward, Robert Mitchum, Arthur Kennedy, Arthur Hunnicutt, Frank Faylen, Walter Coy, Carol Nugent, Maria Hart', 'NR', 'Retired rodeo champion Jeff McCloud agrees to mentor novice rodeo contestant Wes Merritt against the wishes of Merritt''s wife who fears the dangers of this rough sport.', 'Retired rodeo champion Jeff McCloud agrees to mentor novice rodeo contestant Wes Merritt against the wishes of Merritt''s wife who fears the dangers of this rough sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JBtbRmuf8B73pxYlTdAwr9T9C3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43370'),
  ('1059133904331795668', 'The Luzhin Defence', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marleen Gorris, Bernard Lutic', 'Peter Berry', 'John Turturro, Emily Watson, Geraldine James, Stuart Wilson, Fabio Sartor, Peter Blythe, Orla Brady, Mark Tandy', null, 'Based upon the novel by Vladimir Nabokov, a chess grandmaster travels to Italy in the 1920s to play in a tournament and falls in love.', 'Based upon the novel by Vladimir Nabokov, a chess grandmaster travels to Italy in the 1920s to play in a tournament and falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVV3PhTO58R0CAsvWhsUkYDzIEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52654'),
  ('587940853106679505', 'The Lychee Road', 2025, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Dong Chengpeng, Wang Boxue, Haiping Gu', 'Yuyue Shen, Si''ao Dai, Dong Chengpeng', 'Dong Chengpeng, White-K, Sabrina Zhuang, Terrance Lau Chun-Him, Andy Lau, Yang Mi, Chang Yuan, Wei Xiang', null, 'A Tang Dynasty minor official risks everything to deliver lychees across China. Li Shande, middle-aged and struggling, sees this dangerous mission as his last chance for success.', 'A Tang Dynasty minor official risks everything to deliver lychees across China. Li Shande, middle-aged and struggling, sees this dangerous mission as his last chance for success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbTrwhUxxJ0BgDai1FflfeOELrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1356587'),
  ('465531994585742390', 'The Lynx', 1982, 'Drama', 'Stanisław Różewicz, Jerzy Wójcik', 'Stanisław Różewicz', 'Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Franciszek Pieczka, Piotr Bajor, Janusz Paluszkiewicz, Ryszarda Hanin, Maria Klejdysz, Henryk Machalica, Hanna Mikuć', null, 'Set during the German occupation of Poland during WWII. A priest in a small village meets a revolutionary who is on an assignment to kill a supposed Nazi collaborator.', 'Set during the German occupation of Poland during WWII. A priest in a small village meets a revolutionary who is on an assignment to kill a supposed Nazi collaborator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rrX5o88ctV6wZoO2BXr7WJRZiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337270'),
  ('867426668005056039', 'The Macaluso Sisters', 2020, 'Drama', 'Cinzia Castania, Claudia Ceccaroni, Daniela Gusmano', 'Emma Dante, Giorgio Vasta, Elena Stancanelli', 'Viola Pusatieri, Eleonora De Luca, Simona Malato, Susanna Piraino, Serena Barone, Maria Rosaria Alati, Anita Pomario, Donatella Finocchiaro', null, 'Maria, Pinuccia, Lia, Katia and Antonella are five sisters who live in an apartment in Palermo. They make a living by renting doves for ceremonies. On a normal day at the beach, tragedy strucks.', 'Maria, Pinuccia, Lia, Katia and Antonella are five sisters who live in an apartment in Palermo. They make a living by renting doves for ceremonies. On a normal day at the beach, tragedy strucks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBpfslKNy6VCTMu48o0sslJZgKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606865'),
  ('780115733020408110', 'The Machine', 1961, 'Animation', 'Daniel Szczechura, Tadeusz Kowalski', 'Daniel Szczechura, Mirosław Kijowicz', null, null, 'An animated short film in which many men work many years on a machine which is revealed to be something very common.', 'An animated short film in which many men work many years on a machine which is revealed to be something very common.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjrIE909eG78HpsyaqGXtFj4IFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147562'),
  ('1056307632106695865', 'The Machine', 1994, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'François Dupeyron, Dietrich Lohmann', 'François Dupeyron', 'Gérard Depardieu, Nathalie Baye, Didier Bourdon, Natalia Wörner, Julie Depardieu, Claude Berri, Erwan Baynaud, Marc Andréoni', null, 'This deftly made French psychological thriller terrifies with its exploration of an experiment gone horribly wrong. Dr. Marc Lacroix, a psychiatrist specializing in brain functions, is obsessed with the link between mind and spirit. To find his link he studies the criminally insane. He builds a secret machine, known only to his mistress Marianne, in which he hopes to exchange minds between humans. He simultaneously wants to help the mentally ill recover, and he wants to experience their madness. He chooses the psychotic killer, Zyto, a man who stabbed at least three women, for his experiment. The initial experiment is successful and the two exchange minds. But trouble ensues when Zyto refuses to reverse the switch. There is little Marc can do when Zyto takes over Marc''s life, and more ominously his wife and child whom are unknowingly in mortal danger. Marc, encased in Zyto''s body, is returned to the asylum. Will Marc''s wife recognize the danger? Will Zyto kill again?', 'This deftly made French psychological thriller terrifies with its exploration of an experiment gone horribly wrong. Dr. Marc Lacroix, a psychiatrist specializing in brain functions, is obsessed with the link between mind and spirit. To find his link he studies the criminally insane. He builds a secret machine, known only to his mistress Marianne, in which he hopes to exchange minds between humans. He simultaneously wants to help the mentally ill recover, and he wants to experience their madness. He chooses the psychotic killer, Zyto, a man who stabbed at least three women, for his experiment. The initial experiment is successful and the two exchange minds. But trouble ensues when Zyto refuses to reverse the switch. There is little Marc can do when Zyto takes over Marc''s life, and more ominously his wife and child whom are unknowingly in mortal danger. Marc, encased in Zyto''s body, is returned to the asylum. Will Marc''s wife recognize the danger? Will Zyto kill again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8w1Szh5ZueTtD4Rcg4E5AxNCezT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197537'),
  ('198888104356170194', 'The Machine', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'João Falcão, Walter Carvalho, Tereza Gonzalez', 'João Falcão, Adriana Falcão', 'Paulo Autran, Gustavo Falcão, Mariana Ximenes, Vladimir Brichta, Fabiana Karla, Wagner Moura, Lázaro Ramos, Zéu Britto', null, 'In Nordestina, a small town lost in the Brazilian badlands, young Karina dreams of becoming an actress and leaving to explore the world. Before losing his love, Dona Nazaré’s son, Antônio, takes the first step in a kamikaze crusade to bring the world to Karina. For that, Antônio leaves town and announces, in a TV show that he will set off on a sensational adventure: a trip into the future, starting from Nordestina’s square. A story where dreams contradict reality, geographical and political conditions threaten to block life, and love plays the part of the transforming element.', 'In Nordestina, a small town lost in the Brazilian badlands, young Karina dreams of becoming an actress and leaving to explore the world. Before losing his love, Dona Nazaré’s son, Antônio, takes the first step in a kamikaze crusade to bring the world to Karina. For that, Antônio leaves town and announces, in a TV show that he will set off on a sensational adventure: a trip into the future, starting from Nordestina’s square. A story where dreams contradict reality, geographical and political conditions threaten to block life, and love plays the part of the transforming element.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuaZy5NxFVGG4MwfmqvP5MudR6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55253'),
  ('333490474945926401', 'The Machine', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Caradog W. James, Nicolai Brüel', 'Caradog W. James', 'Caity Lotz, Toby Stephens, Denis Lawson, Sam Hazeldine, Pooneh Hajimohammadi, Jonathan Byrne, Jade Croot, John-Paul Macleod', 'R', 'Already deep into a second Cold War, Britain’s Ministry of Defense seeks a game-changing weapon. Programmer Vincent McCarthy unwittingly provides an answer in The Machine, a super-strong human cyborg. When a programming bug causes the prototype to decimate his lab, McCarthy takes his obsessive efforts underground, far away from inquisitive eyes.', 'Already deep into a second Cold War, Britain’s Ministry of Defense seeks a game-changing weapon. Programmer Vincent McCarthy unwittingly provides an answer in The Machine, a super-strong human cyborg. When a programming bug causes the prototype to decimate his lab, McCarthy takes his obsessive efforts underground, far away from inquisitive eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNHAZaTrFVOjwLhkMYm4syUjNw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174675'),
  ('551863661849651307', 'The Machine', 2023, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Peter Atencio, Eigil Bryld', 'Kevin Biegel, Scotty Landes', 'Bert Kreischer, Mark Hamill, Jimmy Tatro, Stephanie Kurtzuba, Nikola Đuričko, Iva Babić, Martyn Ford, Robert Maaser', 'R', 'Bert Kreischer faces a familial crisis and the arrival of his estranged father when the ghost of his booze-soaked past arrives: a murderous mobster hellbent on kidnapping Bert back to the motherland to atone for his crimes. Together, he and his father must retrace the steps of his younger self in the midst of a war between a sociopathic crime family while they attempt to find common ground.', 'Bert Kreischer faces a familial crisis and the arrival of his estranged father when the ghost of his booze-soaked past arrives: a murderous mobster hellbent on kidnapping Bert back to the motherland to atone for his crimes. Together, he and his father must retrace the steps of his younger self in the midst of a war between a sociopathic crime family while they attempt to find common ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9dGI7LIOMMlFzyIBUta1svft2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647250'),
  ('127178179645786449', 'The Machine Girl', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Minase Yashiro, Asami, Yuya Ishikawa, Kentarō Shimazu, Honoka, Noriko Kohara, Ryosuke Kawamura, Nobuhiro Nishihara', null, 'The life of a young, Japanese schoolgirl is destroyed when her family is killed by a Ninja-Yakuza family. Her hand cut off, she replaces it with various machines-of-death, and seeks revenge.', 'The life of a young, Japanese schoolgirl is destroyed when her family is killed by a Ninja-Yakuza family. Her hand cut off, she replaces it with various machines-of-death, and seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qccgrtiVYzEBPIvWz7hEY5a2Aax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13964'),
  ('878712586666356117', 'The Machine of Eden', 1970, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, '"''Mis-takes'' give birth to ''shape'' (which, in this work, is ''matter,'' subject and otherwise) amidst a weave of thought: ... the ''dream'' of Eden will speak for itself." The second part of the of The Weir-Falcon Saga trilogy.', '"''Mis-takes'' give birth to ''shape'' (which, in this work, is ''matter,'' subject and otherwise) amidst a weave of thought: ... the ''dream'' of Eden will speak for itself." The second part of the of The Weir-Falcon Saga trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7ktP0RqZ2VERQxfU1PqbZd1xOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144943'),
