  ('637974070118218905', 'The Machinist', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Xavi Giménez, Brad Anderson, Óscar Faura', 'Scott Kosar', 'Christian Bale, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, John Sharian, Michael Ironside, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Reg E. Cathey, Anna Massey', 'R', 'Trevor, an insomniac lathe operator, experiences unusual occurrences at work and home. A strange man follows him everywhere, but no one else seems to notice him.', 'Trevor, an insomniac lathe operator, experiences unusual occurrences at work and home. A strange man follows him everywhere, but no one else seems to notice him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diAYqR4xdF9Hnj7qun6DEQhRrT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4553'),
