  ('1130728712672730223', 'The MacKintosh Man', 1973, 'Thriller', 'John Huston, Oswald Morris, Michael Stevenson', 'William Fairchild, Gerald Hanley, Gladys Hill', 'Paul Newman, Dominique Sanda, James Mason, Harry Andrews, Ian Bannen, Michael Hordern, Nigel Patrick, Peter Vaughan', 'PG', 'A member of British Intelligence assumes a fictitious criminal identity and allows himself to be caught, imprisoned, and freed in order to infiltrate a spy organization and expose a traitor; only, someone finds him out and exposes him to the gang...', 'A member of British Intelligence assumes a fictitious criminal identity and allows himself to be caught, imprisoned, and freed in order to infiltrate a spy organization and expose a traitor; only, someone finds him out and exposes him to the gang...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrdrQkgQoPYhE22ntyY8P3gzwLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32627'),
  ('999965351984768252', 'The Macomber Affair', 1947, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Zoltan Korda, Karl Struss', 'Casey Robinson, Seymour Bennett', 'Gregory Peck, Joan Bennett, Robert Preston, Reginald Denny, Jean Gillie, Carl Harbord, Frederick Worlock, Vernon Downing', 'NR', 'A big-game hunter takes a rich American couple on an African safari. Film adaptation of Ernest Hemingway''s "The Short Happy Life of Francis Macomber".', 'A big-game hunter takes a rich American couple on an African safari. Film adaptation of Ernest Hemingway''s "The Short Happy Life of Francis Macomber".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUcc9ABsB612wZnHbgADVpHnnK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28567'),
  ('898171162532268875', 'The Mad', 2007, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'John Kalangis, Brendan Steacy', 'Kevin Hennelly, Christopher Warre Smets, John Kalangis', 'Billy Zane, Maggie Castle, Jordan Madley, Shauna MacDonald, Evan Charles Flock, Ian McPhail, Rothaford Gray, Matthew Deslippe', 'NR', 'A horror-thriller in which a doctor and his teenage daughter are terrorized by flesh-eating zombies at a truck stop.', 'A horror-thriller in which a doctor and his teenage daughter are terrorized by flesh-eating zombies at a truck stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdKEBV3MNMvZv4jVAXFUYiOXXar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24632'),
  ('613890202683190669', 'The Mad Adventures of Rabbi Jacob', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Henri Decaë, Gérard Oury', 'Roberto De Leonardis', 'Louis de Funès, Suzy Delair, Marcel Dalio, Claude Giraud, Renzo Montagnani, Janet Brandt, André Falcon, Xavier Gélin', 'G', 'In this riot of frantic disguises and mistaken identities, Victor Pivert, a blustering, bigoted French factory owner, finds himself taken hostage by Slimane, an Arab rebel leader. The two dress up as rabbis as they try to elude not only assasins from Slimane''s country, but also the police, who think Pivert is a murderer. Pivert ends up posing as Rabbi Jacob, a beloved figure who''s returned to France for his first visit after 30 years in the United States. Adding to the confusion are Pivert''s dentist-wife, who thinks her husband is leaving her for another woman, their daughter, who''s about to get married, and a Parisian neighborhood filled with people eager to celebrate the return of Rabbi Jacob.', 'In this riot of frantic disguises and mistaken identities, Victor Pivert, a blustering, bigoted French factory owner, finds himself taken hostage by Slimane, an Arab rebel leader. The two dress up as rabbis as they try to elude not only assasins from Slimane''s country, but also the police, who think Pivert is a murderer. Pivert ends up posing as Rabbi Jacob, a beloved figure who''s returned to France for his first visit after 30 years in the United States. Adding to the confusion are Pivert''s dentist-wife, who thinks her husband is leaving her for another woman, their daughter, who''s about to get married, and a Parisian neighborhood filled with people eager to celebrate the return of Rabbi Jacob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYuCFxS2BGCHNGuv9No0GoP2DZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760'),
  ('1095904224831806212', 'The Mad Bomber', 1973, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Bert I. Gordon, Bert I. Gordon', 'Bert I. Gordon', 'Vince Edwards, Chuck Connors, Neville Brand, Hank Brandt, Christina Hart, Faith Quabius, Ilona Wilson, Nancy Honnold', 'R', 'Los Angeles detectives Minelli and Blake must track down a serial rapist who may know the identity of a mentally disturbed bomber.', 'Los Angeles detectives Minelli and Blake must track down a serial rapist who may know the identity of a mentally disturbed bomber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtFtaExGJl1vam9HnUiwAiOYFCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97904'),
  ('520379730635573585', 'The Mad Butcher', 1971, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Guido Zurli', 'Dick Randall, Karl Ross, Dag Molin', 'Victor Buono, Franca Polesello, Brad Harris, Dario Michaelis, Karin Field, Luca Sportelli, Hansi Linder, Tina Buranzo', null, 'After being released from a mental hospital, Otto returns to his old job as a butcher. He tries to adjust to his new life, but after a bitter argument with his wife, he accidentally kills her. Fearing he will be sent back to the hospital, he grinds up her body and sells it as sausages. As friends and relatives start asking questions about her disappearance, they too start ending up in the butcher''s display case.', 'After being released from a mental hospital, Otto returns to his old job as a butcher. He tries to adjust to his new life, but after a bitter argument with his wife, he accidentally kills her. Fearing he will be sent back to the hospital, he grinds up her body and sells it as sausages. As friends and relatives start asking questions about her disappearance, they too start ending up in the butcher''s display case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6ZY89fQnL88sBHyKKskByzyWQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90029'),
  ('914367958397259205', 'The Mad Doctor', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'David Hand, David Hand', 'David Hand', 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'A dark and stormy night. Pluto is spirited away to the spooky lair of an evil genius for a mad transplant scheme to put his head on the body of a chicken. Mickey gives chase, but find himself threatened severely by the doctor''s castle and its denizens.', 'A dark and stormy night. Pluto is spirited away to the spooky lair of an evil genius for a mad transplant scheme to put his head on the body of a chicken. Mickey gives chase, but find himself threatened severely by the doctor''s castle and its denizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKCGY7sRouxLrDhwdA5jcp026YA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101806'),
  ('1132735377194774220', 'The Mad Doctor', 1940, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Tim Whelan, Ted Tetzlaff, Joseph C. Youngerman', 'Howard J. Green', 'Basil Rathbone, Ellen Drew, John Howard, Barbara Jo Allen, Ralph Morgan, Martin Kosleck, Kitty Kelly, Hugh O''Connell', 'NR', 'A reporter sleuths the mystery behind an oft-married Viennese doctor whose wives met mysterious fates.', 'A reporter sleuths the mystery behind an oft-married Viennese doctor whose wives met mysterious fates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMElj2frwFuppgSL9eChoO5rhTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29292'),
  ('302974760544931206', 'The Mad Doctor of Market Street', 1942, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Hans J. Salter, Joseph H. Lewis, Jerome Ash', 'Al Martin', 'Lionel Atwill, Una Merkel, Nat Pendleton, Claire Dodd, Anne Nagel, Hardie Albright, Richard Davies, John Eldredge', null, 'A fugitive doctor tries to raise the dead for South Sea Islanders.', 'A fugitive doctor tries to raise the dead for South Sea Islanders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PIqI16ZZNKIqu93QlVzqIT8qJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36456'),
  ('731417171075935436', 'The Mad Dog', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'It''s bath day for Pluto; we open with him already being scrubbed. He gets out, and his tug of war with Mickey and the towel lands Mickey in the tub. The soap jumps out, and Pluto swallows it, hic-cupping soap bubbles as Mickey chases him. Pluto gets out, and the people on the street think Pluto is rabid and start hiding and throwing things at him. Dogcatcher Pete comes along, and prepares to shoot Pluto. Mickey catches up to him just in time. He tries pleading, then fighting, but they get away when Mickey throws a kitten into Pete''s pants. In the ensuing chase, a fruit cart provides more diversions, and ultimately they manage to crash Pete into his own truck.', 'It''s bath day for Pluto; we open with him already being scrubbed. He gets out, and his tug of war with Mickey and the towel lands Mickey in the tub. The soap jumps out, and Pluto swallows it, hic-cupping soap bubbles as Mickey chases him. Pluto gets out, and the people on the street think Pluto is rabid and start hiding and throwing things at him. Dogcatcher Pete comes along, and prepares to shoot Pluto. Mickey catches up to him just in time. He tries pleading, then fighting, but they get away when Mickey throws a kitten into Pete''s pants. In the ensuing chase, a fruit cart provides more diversions, and ultimately they manage to crash Pete into his own truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DebxJFjA9ZmW4RCYXkjHBPQRxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156488'),
  ('515183995119097330', 'The Mad Executioners', 1963, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Edwin Zbonek, Gisela Anton, Richard Angst', 'Robert A. Stemmle', 'Hansjörg Felmy, Maria Perschy, Dieter Borsche, Wolfgang Preiss, Harry Riebauer, Rudolf Forster, Chris Howland, Rudolf Fernau', 'NR', 'A group of hooded vigilantes hang wrong-doers with a rope stolen from Scotland Yard''s Black Museum.', 'A group of hooded vigilantes hang wrong-doers with a rope stolen from Scotland Yard''s Black Museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6WDfNGIR8XI9HLeKKIm710JMtG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178695'),
  ('269470393699403854', 'The Mad Fox', 1962, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Tomu Uchida, Norifumi Suzuki, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Hashizo Ōkawa, Michiko Saga, Ryūnosuke Tsukigata, Jun Usami, Chōichirō Kawarasaki, Yoshi Katō, Kensaku Hara, Eijirō Yanagi', null, 'A court fortune-teller loses his mind after a conspiracy leads to the death of his lover. Hope appears to be on the horizon after he becomes romantically involved with his dead lover''s twin sister, but more complications arise thanks to a chance encounter with a clan of shape-shifters.', 'A court fortune-teller loses his mind after a conspiracy leads to the death of his lover. Hope appears to be on the horizon after he becomes romantically involved with his dead lover''s twin sister, but more complications arise thanks to a chance encounter with a clan of shape-shifters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTIksgtzxtjaguZXraGZz2rIxIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261680'),
  ('812229090344085368', 'The Mad Genius', 1931, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Barney McGill', 'J. Grubb Alexander, Harvey F. Thew', 'John Barrymore, Marian Marsh, Charles Butterworth, Donald Cook, Luis Alberni, Carmel Myers, André Luguet, Frankie Darro', 'NR', 'A crippled puppeteer rescues an abused young boy and turns the boy into a great ballet dancer. Complications ensue when, as a young man, the dancer falls in love with a young woman the puppeteer is also in love with.', 'A crippled puppeteer rescues an abused young boy and turns the boy into a great ballet dancer. Complications ensue when, as a young man, the dancer falls in love with a young woman the puppeteer is also in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNbV1RbDnj7rsADWFZPRnI9pOG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156329'),
  ('327519912937459153', 'The Mad Ghoul', 1943, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'James P. Hogan, Milton Krasner, Bernard B. Brown', 'Brenda Weisberg, Paul Gangelin', 'George Zucco, David Bruce, Evelyn Ankers, Turhan Bey, Robert Armstrong, Milburn Stone, Addison Richards, Rose Hobart', null, 'A university chemistry professor experiments with an ancient Mayan gas on a medical student, turning the would-be surgeon into a murdering ghoul as part of a plan to steal his lover.', 'A university chemistry professor experiments with an ancient Mayan gas on a medical student, turning the would-be surgeon into a murdering ghoul as part of a plan to steal his lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wq5vrKcGYf7Iv4jiy286rDYmDJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84234'),
  ('297990385688566437', 'The Mad Hatter', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Halyna Hutchins, Catherine Devaney', 'R.V. Romero', 'Nick Miller, Samuel Caleb Walker, Michael Berryman, Isadora Cruz, Rachel Brunner, Dennis Mallen, Fedor Steer, Julia Kay', 'R', 'An eccentric professor takes four of his students to the mansion of the “Mad Hatter”, an urban legend driven insane by mercury poisoning and grief. He says that there’s nothing to worry about now: the strange, shambling “caretakers” that haunt the home are merely servants that have fallen to inbreeding, and the Hatter himself has been dead for years. But as the students start disappearing one by one, those that remain start to question if the professor’s experiment is truly scientific...and if the Hatter didn’t just succumb to his madness, but decided to spread it...', 'An eccentric professor takes four of his students to the mansion of the “Mad Hatter”, an urban legend driven insane by mercury poisoning and grief. He says that there’s nothing to worry about now: the strange, shambling “caretakers” that haunt the home are merely servants that have fallen to inbreeding, and the Hatter himself has been dead for years. But as the students start disappearing one by one, those that remain start to question if the professor’s experiment is truly scientific...and if the Hatter didn’t just succumb to his madness, but decided to spread it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTUfalNirpq7SBASa6lnzs27iam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698320'),
  ('216973101423916082', 'The Mad Kings', 2015, 'Drama', 'Laurent Laffargue, Fabrice Main, Ludovic Leiba', 'Laurent Laffargue, Frédérique Moreau', 'Sergi López, Céline Sallette, Éric Cantona, Romane Bohringer, Guillaume Gouix, Victorien Cacioppo, Roxane Arnal, Jean-Baptiste Sagory', null, 'In Casteljaloux, a town in southwestern France, friendship, drunken nights, heat and tall tales set the pace of daily life. And here, men are Kings of the World. But when Jeannot gets out of prison, he has only one thing in mind: to win back Chantal, the love of his life, who moved in with the village butcher while he was serving time. A Greek tragedy that soon takes on the feel of a Western…', 'In Casteljaloux, a town in southwestern France, friendship, drunken nights, heat and tall tales set the pace of daily life. And here, men are Kings of the World. But when Jeannot gets out of prison, he has only one thing in mind: to win back Chantal, the love of his life, who moved in with the village butcher while he was serving time. A Greek tragedy that soon takes on the feel of a Western…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcf8e4E7q9LShUPXUaODrRa0nYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361486'),
  ('891111270837974116', 'The Mad Magician', 1954, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Horror', 'John Brahm, Bert Glennon, Hal Herman', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Vincent Price, Mary Murphy, Eva Gabor, John Emery, Donald Randolph, Lenita Lane, Patrick O''Neal, Jay Novello', null, 'Don Gallico is an inventor of stage magic effects who aspires to become a star in his own right. Just before his first performance his act is shut down by capricious manager Ross Ormond who wants Gallico''s brilliant buzz saw effect for the act of The Great Rinaldi, an established star. With this defeat, and the humiliation of having already lost his wife Claire to Ormond, Gallico decides it is time to take matters into his own hands.', 'Don Gallico is an inventor of stage magic effects who aspires to become a star in his own right. Just before his first performance his act is shut down by capricious manager Ross Ormond who wants Gallico''s brilliant buzz saw effect for the act of The Great Rinaldi, an established star. With this defeat, and the humiliation of having already lost his wife Claire to Ormond, Gallico decides it is time to take matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctYNCvKiMN3yRHAXe6q2l6anMRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28363'),
  ('485540830070379856', 'The Mad Masters', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Jean Rouch', null, 'Jean Rouch', null, 'The subject of the film was the Hauka movement. The Hauka movement consisted of mimicry and dancing to become possessed by French Colonial administrators. The participants performed the same elaborate military ceremonies of their colonial occupiers, but in more of a trance than true recreation.', 'The subject of the film was the Hauka movement. The Hauka movement consisted of mimicry and dancing to become possessed by French Colonial administrators. The participants performed the same elaborate military ceremonies of their colonial occupiers, but in more of a trance than true recreation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3L6pzmvpS0Yweav4XgH0QOoufxs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84820'),
  ('945122118299495688', 'The Mad Miss Manton', 1938, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Romance', 'Leigh Jason, Nicholas Musuraca, Edward Donahue', 'Philip G. Epstein', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Henry Fonda, Sam Levene, Frances Mercer, Stanley Ridges, Whitney Bourne, Vickie Lester, Ann Evers', 'NR', 'When the murdered body discovered by beautiful, vivacious socialite Melsa Manton disappears, police and press label her a prankster until she and her group of friends prove them wrong.', 'When the murdered body discovered by beautiful, vivacious socialite Melsa Manton disappears, police and press label her a prankster until she and her group of friends prove them wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqxNe28kUMwgm0wC74zboq9uuXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43855'),
  ('658868928436949202', 'The Mad Monk', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Johnnie To, Tony Ching Siu-Tung', 'Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Stephen Chow, Maggie Cheung, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Wong Yat-Fei, Kirk Wong Chi-Keung, Poon Hang-Sang, Michael Chan Wai-Man', null, 'The gods in heaven complain to the Jade Emperor about the malicious practical jokes played on them by Dragon Fighter Lohan.', 'The gods in heaven complain to the Jade Emperor about the malicious practical jokes played on them by Dragon Fighter Lohan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruAVJL4czDJcnbUtwnTQC8obCFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75197'),
  ('453390211163515373', 'The Mad Monster', 1942, 'Horror', 'Sam Newfield, Jack Greenhalgh, Melville De Lay', 'Fred Myton', 'George Zucco, Anne Nagel, Johnny Downs, Glenn Strange, Robert Strange, Gordon De Main, John Elliott, Reginald Barlow', 'NR', 'A mad scientist changes his simple-minded handyman into a werewolf in order to prove his supposedly crazy scientific theories - and exact revenge.', 'A mad scientist changes his simple-minded handyman into a werewolf in order to prove his supposedly crazy scientific theories - and exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Mhd2VXiTu1jmkmCbw6L96n40Ba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110980'),
  ('432667158414020484', 'The Mad Phoenix', 1997, 'Drama', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Sander Lee, Kwok Man-Ki', 'Raymond To Kwok-Wai', 'Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Poon Chan-Leung, Louisa So Yuk-Wah, Elaine Ng Yee-Lei, James Wong Jim, Chow Chi-Fai, Leung Hon-Wai, Teresa Lee Fung', null, 'A Cantonese librettist enjoys immense popularity over the course of decades, followed by decline.', 'A Cantonese librettist enjoys immense popularity over the course of decades, followed by decline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCB1P3RdVcWAkb6uidzKa3SajcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396296'),
  ('404195212748118505', 'The Mad Room', 1969, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bernard Girard, Harry Stradling Jr., Rusty Meek', 'Reginald Denham, Bernard Girard, A.Z. Martin', 'Stella Stevens, Shelley Winters, Skip Ward, Carol Cole, Severn Darden, Beverly Garland, Michael Burns, Barbara Sammeth', null, 'Ellen Hardy gets a rude awakening when she discovers that her brother and sister are scheduled to leave their mental institution. As children, they were put there after killing their parents. Ellen, who now lives in the house of an old widow, Mrs. Armstrong, takes them in. But if their secret gets out, it could jeopardize Ellen''s plans to wed Mrs. Armstrong''s stepson. She struggles with anxiety -- until Mrs. Armstrong suddenly turns up dead.', 'Ellen Hardy gets a rude awakening when she discovers that her brother and sister are scheduled to leave their mental institution. As children, they were put there after killing their parents. Ellen, who now lives in the house of an old widow, Mrs. Armstrong, takes them in. But if their secret gets out, it could jeopardize Ellen''s plans to wed Mrs. Armstrong''s stepson. She struggles with anxiety -- until Mrs. Armstrong suddenly turns up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYS9iqvukBOKIE4c0sShHOUrRMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139132'),
  ('1147366284425659994', 'The Mad Women''s Ball', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Nicolas Karakatsanis, Mélanie Laurent', 'Julien Decoin, Christophe Deslandes', 'Lou de Laâge, Mélanie Laurent, Benjamin Voisin, Emmanuelle Bercot, Cédric Kahn, Lomane de Dietrich, Christophe Montenez, Coralie Russier', null, 'A woman who is unfairly institutionalized at a Paris asylum plots to escape with the help of one of its nurses. Based on the novel ''Le bal des folles'' by Victoria Mas.', 'A woman who is unfairly institutionalized at a Paris asylum plots to escape with the help of one of its nurses. Based on the novel ''Le bal des folles'' by Victoria Mas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8KeSPmFDxqHKwNzyiuwUvPIrw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680531'),
  ('135782865140737005', 'The Madagascar Penguins in a Christmas Caper', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Gary Trousdale', null, 'Tom McGrath, Chris Miller, Christopher Knights, John DiMaggio, Bill Fagerbakke, Rif Hutton, Holly Dorff, Hope Levy', 'G', 'During the holiday season, when the animals of the Central Park Zoo are preparing for Christmas, Private, the youngest of the penguins notices that the Polar Bear is all alone. Assured that nobody should have to spend Christmas alone, Private goes into the city for some last-minute Christmas shopping. Along the way, he gets stuffed into a stocking', 'During the holiday season, when the animals of the Central Park Zoo are preparing for Christmas, Private, the youngest of the penguins notices that the Polar Bear is all alone. Assured that nobody should have to spend Christmas alone, Private goes into the city for some last-minute Christmas shopping. Along the way, he gets stuffed into a stocking', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOVdfrRfzQjYwezOxIap13j05d8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10258'),
  ('696687175273433528', 'The Maddening', 1996, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Danny Huston, Nick McLean', 'Andrew Neiderman', 'Burt Reynolds, Angie Dickinson, Mia Sara, Candace Hutson, Brian Wimmer, Marie Debrey, Daniel Greene, Josh Mostel', 'R', 'David and Cassie Osborne have an argument one night. So the next morning after David goes to work, Cassie runs off to her sister''s house for a few days with their daughter Samantha. Only they never get there. David starts looking for them, and her sister, Joanne, thinks David had something to do with their disappearance, and calls the police. Actually Samantha and Cassie are with Roy and Georgina Scudder, and their daughter Jill. Roy picked them up after their car broke down. The only problem is, the Scudders, who seem a little odd at first, won''t let them leave or call anyone.', 'David and Cassie Osborne have an argument one night. So the next morning after David goes to work, Cassie runs off to her sister''s house for a few days with their daughter Samantha. Only they never get there. David starts looking for them, and her sister, Joanne, thinks David had something to do with their disappearance, and calls the police. Actually Samantha and Cassie are with Roy and Georgina Scudder, and their daughter Jill. Roy picked them up after their car broke down. The only problem is, the Scudders, who seem a little odd at first, won''t let them leave or call anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp3pGEUiLqxb9IaCCWXD4iOBUJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128145'),
  ('699096377065849856', 'The Madman of Lab Four', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Besnard, André Cagnard, Pierre Cosson', 'Jacques Besnard, Jean Halain', 'Jean Lefebvre, Maria Latour, Bernard Blier, Michel Serrault, Pierre Tornade, Pierre Brasseur, Margo Lion, Robert Dalban', null, 'This talkative and unevenly paced feature finds Fou (Jean Lefebvre) the inventor of a gas that makes the users fall in love. He is chased by his boss, the police, and spies, who seek to secure the secret recipe for their own selfish purposes. A shadowy American underworld figure tries to intimidate the inventor. A half-hearted attempt at comedy tries to go along with the double dealing and trickery of the thin plot of the film.', 'This talkative and unevenly paced feature finds Fou (Jean Lefebvre) the inventor of a gas that makes the users fall in love. He is chased by his boss, the police, and spies, who seek to secure the secret recipe for their own selfish purposes. A shadowy American underworld figure tries to intimidate the inventor. A half-hearted attempt at comedy tries to go along with the double dealing and trickery of the thin plot of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jZAFkP64r3qkjaodIFemzFPnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187856'),
  ('848781356680576445', 'The Madmen of Mandoras', 1963, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'David Bradley, Stanley Cortez', 'Richard Miles, Steve Bennett', 'Walter Stocker, Audrey Caire, Carlos Rivas, John Holland, Marshall Reed, Scott Peters, Keith Dahle, Dani Lynn', null, 'A group of Nazi survivors save Hitler''s brain keeping it alive in a huge jar hooked up to a machine. The Nazis plan to release a deadly gas destroying all life on the planet. To ensure their success they kidnap Professor Coleman the only man on the planet with the antidote to the poison gas.', 'A group of Nazi survivors save Hitler''s brain keeping it alive in a huge jar hooked up to a machine. The Nazis plan to release a deadly gas destroying all life on the planet. To ensure their success they kidnap Professor Coleman the only man on the planet with the antidote to the poison gas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkkz0hxfS0dERGO3YtozAt8dFwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79185'),
  ('482643661106495815', 'The Madness Express', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Van Hoofstadt, Bruno Degrave, Patrick Schmitt', 'Olivier Van Hoofstadt, Frédéric Jurie', 'Artus, Elsa Zylberstein, Benjamin Tranié, Maël Rouin Berrandou, Nicolas Lumbreras, Bérangère McNeese, Louise Coldefy, Philippe Duquesne', null, 'Sébastien, a conscientious and professional train inspector, dreams of being transferred to the South of France. To validate his transfer, he has to make one last routine run under the supervision of Madeleine, a slightly sociopathic inspector who won''t let him go. That''s when everything goes wrong: between a driver who thinks he''s driving a fighter jet, a jealous colleague and passengers who are each crazier than the last, what was supposed to be a formality turns into the worst trip of his life.', 'Sébastien, a conscientious and professional train inspector, dreams of being transferred to the South of France. To validate his transfer, he has to make one last routine run under the supervision of Madeleine, a slightly sociopathic inspector who won''t let him go. That''s when everything goes wrong: between a driver who thinks he''s driving a fighter jet, a jealous colleague and passengers who are each crazier than the last, what was supposed to be a formality turns into the worst trip of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVJTN9Ur3dbFUi4pyxh8t8H02XE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999134'),
  ('817801304379520965', 'The Madness of Dr. Tube', 1915, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Abel Gance, Léonce-Henri Burel', 'Abel Gance', 'Albert Dieudonné, Le Clown Di-go-mo', null, 'A wacky scientist develops a powder that he believes will have the effect of distorting reality for those who take it. To test its effect, he tries it out on his boy assistant, his pets, his nieces, and their beaus. But, chaos ensues as his nieces don''t find their appearances as funny as the rest, so Doctor Tube tries to find a way to make things right.', 'A wacky scientist develops a powder that he believes will have the effect of distorting reality for those who take it. To test its effect, he tries it out on his boy assistant, his pets, his nieces, and their beaus. But, chaos ensues as his nieces don''t find their appearances as funny as the rest, so Doctor Tube tries to find a way to make things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vVU6N5va5DWBigpkINNrc7pvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174178'),
  ('398388744701148160', 'The Madness of King George', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Nicholas Hytner, Andrew Dunn, Martin Childs', 'Alan Bennett', 'Nigel Hawthorne, Helen Mirren, Ian Holm, Anthony Calf, Amanda Donohoe, Rupert Graves, Geoffrey Palmer, Julian Wadham', 'PG-13', 'Aging King George III of England is exhibiting signs of madness, a problem little understood in 1788. As the monarch alternates between bouts of confusion and near-violent outbursts of temper, his hapless doctors attempt the ineffectual cures of the day. Meanwhile, Queen Charlotte and Prime Minister William Pitt the Younger attempt to prevent the king''s political enemies, led by the Prince of Wales, from usurping the throne.', 'Aging King George III of England is exhibiting signs of madness, a problem little understood in 1788. As the monarch alternates between bouts of confusion and near-violent outbursts of temper, his hapless doctors attempt the ineffectual cures of the day. Meanwhile, Queen Charlotte and Prime Minister William Pitt the Younger attempt to prevent the king''s political enemies, led by the Prince of Wales, from usurping the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dTSY023ZyBbgVSKDRuA6JLGSnZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11318'),
  ('625630634914964945', 'The Madwoman of Chaillot', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bryan Forbes, Claude Renoir, Burnett Guffey', 'Edward Anhalt', 'Katharine Hepburn, Charles Boyer, Claude Dauphin, Edith Evans, John Gavin, Paul Henreid, Oskar Homolka, Yul Brynner', 'G', 'An eccentric Parisian woman''s optimistic perception of life begins to sound more rational than the traditional beliefs of others. The story is set in a 20th-century society endangered by power and greed and imagines the rebellion of the "little people" against corrupt and soulless authority.', 'An eccentric Parisian woman''s optimistic perception of life begins to sound more rational than the traditional beliefs of others. The story is set in a 20th-century society endangered by power and greed and imagines the rebellion of the "little people" against corrupt and soulless authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWyMz5SThqKOeMBhc8xwOM5yNaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148662'),
  ('368168957662813722', 'The Mafia Kills Only in Summer', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Roberto Forza, Alessandro Casale, Elisa Becchere', 'Michele Astori, Marco Martani, Pif', 'Pif, Cristiana Capotondi, Rosario Lisma, Barbara Tabita, Alex Bisconti, Ginevra Antona, Antonino Bruschetta, Claudio Gioè', null, 'While Arturo tries to gain the love of Flora, he witnesses the history of Sicily from 1969 to 1992, miraculously dodging the crimes of the Mafia and supporting as a journalist the heroic struggle of the judges and policemen who fought this infamous organization.', 'While Arturo tries to gain the love of Flora, he witnesses the history of Sicily from 1969 to 1992, miraculously dodging the crimes of the Mafia and supporting as a journalist the heroic struggle of the judges and policemen who fought this infamous organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4UNLLbxEAHGKu35nQ2Wcmce4fV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239877'),
  ('662020384031680742', 'The Mafu Cage', 1978, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Karen Arthur, John Bailey', 'Don Chastain, Éric Wesphal', 'Lee Grant, Carol Kane, Will Geer, James Olson, William Sherwood', 'R', 'Two strange sisters live in a crumbling mansion, where they keep a pet ape, which belonged to their late father, locked in a cage. While one of the sisters seems to be keeping her head on straight, as it were, the other appears to be sinking further and further into barbarism and insanity.', 'Two strange sisters live in a crumbling mansion, where they keep a pet ape, which belonged to their late father, locked in a cage. While one of the sisters seems to be keeping her head on straight, as it were, the other appears to be sinking further and further into barbarism and insanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93UDxZcRmkK34W5UMj5xbCnpRAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56132'),
  ('535814423143018892', 'The Magdalene Sisters', 2002, 'Drama, History', 'Peter Mullan, Nigel Willoughby', 'Peter Mullan', 'Anne-Marie Duff, Nora-Jane Noone, Dorothy Duffy, Geraldine McEwan, Eileen Walsh, Mary Murray, Eamonn Owens, Britta Smith', 'R', 'Three young Irish women struggle to maintain their spirits while they endure dehumanizing abuse as inmates of a Magdalene Sisters Asylum.', 'Three young Irish women struggle to maintain their spirits while they endure dehumanizing abuse as inmates of a Magdalene Sisters Asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akOnyPsfzcDvCwP3lzY35i2NIha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8094'),
  ('79531823585664718', 'The Magic Blade', 1976, 'Action, Drama', 'Chor Yuen, Wong Chit', 'Ni Kuang, Szeto On', 'Ti Lung, Lo Lieh, Ching Li, Tang Ching, Tanny Tien-Ni, Lily Li, Fan Mei-Sheng, Ku Feng', null, 'Two rival swordsmen in imperial China, poncho-clad Fu Hung-Hsueh and Yen nan-Fei vie with a power-hungry villain for the deadly Peacock Dart and fend off waves of expert killers during their journey.', 'Two rival swordsmen in imperial China, poncho-clad Fu Hung-Hsueh and Yen nan-Fei vie with a power-hungry villain for the deadly Peacock Dart and fend off waves of expert killers during their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAypWbFLVATm0CcMZMQ38dUWP1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26875'),
  ('485628218768520052', 'The Magic Book', 1900, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Characters from a large magic book come to life.', 'Characters from a large magic book come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jbZujeJNBr9SkE16ERhi0nljjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106038'),
  ('769053757859178610', 'The Magic Box', 1952, 'Drama', 'Jack Cardiff, John Boulting, Cliff Owen', 'Eric Ambler', 'Robert Donat, Margaret Johnston, Maria Schell, Renée Asherson, Richard Attenborough, Robert Beatty, Martin Boddey, Edward Chapman', null, 'Now old, ill, poor, and largely forgotten, William Freise-Greene was once very different. As young and handsome William Green he changed his name to include his first wife''s so that it sounded more impressive for the photographic portrait work he was so good at. But he was also an inventor and his search for a way to project moving pictures became an obsession that ultimately changed the life of all those he loved.', 'Now old, ill, poor, and largely forgotten, William Freise-Greene was once very different. As young and handsome William Green he changed his name to include his first wife''s so that it sounded more impressive for the photographic portrait work he was so good at. But he was also an inventor and his search for a way to project moving pictures became an obsession that ultimately changed the life of all those he loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRtukdvDz3tkyhSC8GzGOkQhAb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80596'),
  ('274461660858877286', 'The Magic Christian', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Geoffrey Unsworth, Joseph McGrath, Ray Freeborn', 'Joseph McGrath, Terry Southern', 'Peter Sellers, Ringo Starr, Isabel Jeans, Caroline Blakiston, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Spike Milligan, John Cleese, Richard Attenborough', 'PG', 'Sir Guy Grand, the richest man in the world, adopts a homeless man, Youngman. Together, they set out to prove that anyone--and anything--can be bought.', 'Sir Guy Grand, the richest man in the world, adopts a homeless man, Youngman. Together, they set out to prove that anyone--and anything--can be bought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92OHvXPieitIzkmPWbycCvclQ5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24152'),
  ('1060137157394643717', 'The Magic City', 1955, 'Drama', 'Nikos Koundouros, Vasilis Georgiadis', 'Margarita Lymberaki', 'George Foundas, Margarita Papageorgiou, Stephanos Stratigos, Manos Katrakis, Thanasis Veggos, Mimis Fotopoulos, Andreas Douzos, Eva Brika', null, 'A look at poverty in post-war Athens. Kosmas, a young man living in the slums, constantly tries to make ends meet, hoping for a better day. Because of debts, he gets tangled up in smuggling. His morals are tested and he tries to find a way out.', 'A look at poverty in post-war Athens. Kosmas, a young man living in the slums, constantly tries to make ends meet, hoping for a better day. Because of debts, he gets tangled up in smuggling. His morals are tested and he tries to find a way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpKgQttzr1mtWgLZ3TBjOunXFit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257623'),
  ('816364773848044398', 'The Magic Crane', 1993, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Tom Lau Moon-Tong, Ko Chiu-Lam', 'Tsui Hark', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Jay Lau Kam-Ling, Lau Shun', null, 'On his way to a congress of kung fu masters, an initiate falls from a high cliff, only to be rescued by lovely Tien Lam (Anita Mui), who rides a huge crane. The rest of the movie features a battle between warring martial arts factions, an equally fierce rivalry between the two daughters of the Crane Master, the accidental empowerment of an unprincipled master after having eaten half of a secret scroll, a battle with an immense tortoise whose spleeny vapors save a group of poisoned swordsmen, lots of great aerial fights against nearly invincible villains, and the usual blood spurting from assorted mouths.', 'On his way to a congress of kung fu masters, an initiate falls from a high cliff, only to be rescued by lovely Tien Lam (Anita Mui), who rides a huge crane. The rest of the movie features a battle between warring martial arts factions, an equally fierce rivalry between the two daughters of the Crane Master, the accidental empowerment of an unprincipled master after having eaten half of a secret scroll, a battle with an immense tortoise whose spleeny vapors save a group of poisoned swordsmen, lots of great aerial fights against nearly invincible villains, and the usual blood spurting from assorted mouths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPzGjKyuCNRJ4901fJY6gDzNNZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70697'),
  ('120758491428314759', 'The Magic Dice', 1905, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Another magic short of Méliès.', 'Another magic short of Méliès.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twXqygwr7q1WioGFmnn1lCIJseu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189602'),
  ('1134212790427590757', 'The Magic Faraway Tree', 2026, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Ben Gregor, Zac Nicholson', 'Simon Farnaby', 'Andrew Garfield, Claire Foy, Nicola Coughlan, Jessica Gunning, Rebecca Ferguson, Hiran Abeysekera, Phoenix Laroche, Delilah Bennett-Cardy', null, 'A modern family relocates to the countryside where the children discover a magical tree with eccentric residents. They''re transported to fantastical lands, rekindling their family bond through adventures.', 'A modern family relocates to the countryside where the children discover a magical tree with eccentric residents. They''re transported to fantastical lands, rekindling their family bond through adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtS8mW6aLuartATut8TrD39zTIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140521'),
  ('444381778584683114', 'The Magic Flute', 1975, 'Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Ingmar Bergman, Kerstin Forsmark, Sven Nykvist', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Josef Köstlinger, Irma Urrila, Håkan Hagegård, Elisabeth Erikson, Britt-Marie Aruhn, Kirsten Vaupel, Birgitta Smiding, Ulrik Cold', 'G', 'The Queen of the Night enlists a handsome prince named Tamino to rescue her beautiful kidnapped daughter, Princess Pamina, in this screen adaptation of the beloved Mozart opera. Aided by the lovelorn bird hunter Papageno and a magical flute that holds the power to change the hearts of men, young Tamino embarks on a quest for true love, leading to the evil Sarastro''s temple where Pamina is held captive.', 'The Queen of the Night enlists a handsome prince named Tamino to rescue her beautiful kidnapped daughter, Princess Pamina, in this screen adaptation of the beloved Mozart opera. Aided by the lovelorn bird hunter Papageno and a magical flute that holds the power to change the hearts of men, young Tamino embarks on a quest for true love, leading to the evil Sarastro''s temple where Pamina is held captive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N0L2ijwcVjRLJRSXbv3AKT2Vnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44864'),
  ('434702082906446594', 'The Magic Flute', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Kenneth Branagh, Lee Grumett, Josh Robertson', 'Stephen Fry', 'Joseph Kaiser, Amy Carson, Ben Davis, Silvia Moi, René Pape, Lyubov Petrova, Tom Randle, Liz Smith', 'PG', 'During World War I, in an unnamed country, a soldier named Tamino is sent by the Queen of the Night to rescue her daughter Pamina from the clutches of the supposedly evil Sarastro. But all is not as it seems.', 'During World War I, in an unnamed country, a soldier named Tamino is sent by the Queen of the Night to rescue her daughter Pamina from the clutches of the supposedly evil Sarastro. But all is not as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjUjatQEMIHtCngnyTib943x7TU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37028'),
  ('1047985935977218495', 'The Magic Flute', 2022, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Music, Family', 'Florian Sigl, Peter Matjasko, Matthias Schuart', 'Andrew Lowery, Jason Young', 'Jack Wolfe, F. Murray Abraham, Niamh McCormack, Ellie Courtiour, Cosima Henman, Amir Wilson, Rolando Villazón, Tedros Teclebrhan', 'NR', 'A seventeen year old travels from London to the Austrian Alps to attend the legendary Mozart boarding school. There, he discovers a centuries-old forgotten passageway into the fantastic world of Mozart''s "The Magic Flute".', 'A seventeen year old travels from London to the Austrian Alps to attend the legendary Mozart boarding school. There, he discovers a centuries-old forgotten passageway into the fantastic world of Mozart''s "The Magic Flute".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeIKugiQy1e3RZTrwXH1a84D8eo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818110'),
  ('148407254985038551', 'The Magic Garter Belt', 1980, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Andrés Pajares, Adriana Vega, Antonio Ozores, María Luisa Ponte, Blaki, Adriana Ozores, Alexia Loreto, María Isbert', null, 'A solicitor''s secretary goes to a creepy mansion to hand an inheritance to the deceased''s niece. The house''s service is trying to terrify the girl out of the house, where they know a treasure is hidden.', 'A solicitor''s secretary goes to a creepy mansion to hand an inheritance to the deceased''s niece. The house''s service is trying to terrify the girl out of the house, where they know a treasure is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGHDe8Id6hNTQrlLkb9Q25e47tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77671'),
  ('322126910615868056', 'The Magic Gloves', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Martín Rejtman, Ana Piterbarg, José Luis García', 'Martín Rejtman', 'Vicentico, Valeria Bertuccelli, Fabián Arenillas, Cecilia Biagini, Susana Pampín, Diego Olivera, Leonardo Azamor, Darío Levy', null, 'This film follows the crisscrossed fortunes of, among others, a rock musician, a flight attendant, a dog walker with an alarming penchant for over-the-counter medication, and a cab driver, who doesn’t really care about his life spiralling out of control, as long as he can sit in his old Renault 12.', 'This film follows the crisscrossed fortunes of, among others, a rock musician, a flight attendant, a dog walker with an alarming penchant for over-the-counter medication, and a cab driver, who doesn’t really care about his life spiralling out of control, as long as he can sit in his old Renault 12.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WIGGC9jG91LSt3c4UV0p2kgtbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126104'),
  ('165414242630644524', 'The Magic Hour', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Koki Mitani, Hideo Yamamoto, Shozo Katashima', 'Koki Mitani', 'Koichi Sato, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Eri Fukatsu, Haruka Ayase, Toshiyuki Nishida, Yoshimasa Kondo, Yuki Amami, Kenji Anan', null, 'A hustler who gets in trouble with a gang boss in the port town of Sukago agrees to make good with the don by putting him in contact with a mysterious hitman — an assassin the hustler has no idea how to contact. Instead, he hires an actor to play the role, though the thespian has no idea what he''s getting into.', 'A hustler who gets in trouble with a gang boss in the port town of Sukago agrees to make good with the don by putting him in contact with a mysterious hitman — an assassin the hustler has no idea how to contact. Instead, he hires an actor to play the role, though the thespian has no idea what he''s getting into.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4QcMHgIQm15JAQC3QaabiRhwvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46361'),
  ('554243353241142542', 'The Magic Kids: Three Unlikely Heroes', 2020, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Felix Poplawsky, Tim Trageser', 'Marc Hillefeld', 'Arsseni Bultmann, Aaron Kissiov, Johanna Schraml, Axel Stein, Sonja Gerhardt, Christian Berkel, Waldemar Kobus, Julia Koschitz', null, 'Vlad has just moved and joined one of the most famous magical schools in the world, where he meets fairies, witches, trolls and dwarfs. Him and his father are the first vampires in town, but he soon meets other special kids.', 'Vlad has just moved and joined one of the most famous magical schools in the world, where he meets fairies, witches, trolls and dwarfs. Him and his father are the first vampires in town, but he soon meets other special kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbLDJ8bxEATrZkXopKBXQFzlSdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594436'),
  ('705020356137645055', 'The Magic Lantern', 1903, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Zizi Papillon', null, 'Two impish clowns construct a magic lantern. They prop it up at an angle, and use it to project pictures onto a wall. When the picture show ends, they open up the lantern to reveal a group of dancing girls inside - and this is only the first of the indications that this lantern really is magical.', 'Two impish clowns construct a magic lantern. They prop it up at an angle, and use it to project pictures onto a wall. When the picture show ends, they open up the lantern to reveal a group of dancing girls inside - and this is only the first of the indications that this lantern really is magical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7lSTxxu6bgwf62MY6j7COpBmD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147746'),
  ('1124182727579569726', 'The Magic Mountain', 1982, 'Drama', 'Michael Ballhaus, Hans W. Geißendörfer', 'Hans W. Geißendörfer', 'Christoph Eichhorn, Marie-France Pisier, Flavio Bucci, Charles Aznavour, Rod Steiger, Hans Christian Blech, Alexander Radszun, Margot Hielscher', null, 'Hans Castorp, fresh from university and about to become a civil engineer, comes to the Sanatorium Berghof in the Swiss Alps to visit his cousin Joachim, an army officer, who is recovering there from tuberculosis. Intending to remain at the Berghof for three weeks, Hans is gradually contaminated by the morbid atmosphere pervading the place. Wishing very much to be considered a patient like the others, he achieves his ends and stays in the sanatorium for ...seven years. During this time, he has enough time to take part in the furious philosophical debates pitting against each other Settembrini, a secular humanist, and Naphta, a totalitarian Jesuit. And to fall in love with the beautiful but enigmatic Clawdia Chauchat. When he is finally discharged in 1914 - along with all the other patients - it is only to plunge into the horrors of World War I.', 'Hans Castorp, fresh from university and about to become a civil engineer, comes to the Sanatorium Berghof in the Swiss Alps to visit his cousin Joachim, an army officer, who is recovering there from tuberculosis. Intending to remain at the Berghof for three weeks, Hans is gradually contaminated by the morbid atmosphere pervading the place. Wishing very much to be considered a patient like the others, he achieves his ends and stays in the sanatorium for ...seven years. During this time, he has enough time to take part in the furious philosophical debates pitting against each other Settembrini, a secular humanist, and Naphta, a totalitarian Jesuit. And to fall in love with the beautiful but enigmatic Clawdia Chauchat. When he is finally discharged in 1914 - along with all the other patients - it is only to plunge into the horrors of World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvNfceXVqwCWhgj1DhNbdVcA6sS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4051'),
  ('369321423929017063', 'The Magic Mountain', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Documentary, History', 'Anca Damian', 'Anca Damian, Anna Winkler', 'Christophe Miossec, Lizzie Brocheré', null, 'The film investigates the adventures of mountain climber and photographer Adam J. Winkler, who fought in Afghanistan with the Mujahideen against the Soviets in the 1980s. The director employs a highly original artistic technique involving animated collage of period materials.', 'The film investigates the adventures of mountain climber and photographer Adam J. Winkler, who fought in Afghanistan with the Mujahideen against the Soviets in the 1980s. The director employs a highly original artistic technique involving animated collage of period materials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxvjmwrfSm5fNfN5okHuTpLJelZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346758'),
  ('979933325352281091', 'The Magic of Belle Isle', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Reed Morano, Rob Reiner, Michael Pitt', 'Guy Thomas, Rob Reiner, Andrew Scheinman', 'Morgan Freeman, Virginia Madsen, Madeline Carroll, Emma Fuhrmann, Nicolette Pierini, Kenan Thompson, Fred Willard, Boyd Holbrook', 'PG', 'In an effort to tap into his original talent, a wheelchair-bound author moves to a rural town, where he befriends a single mother and her three kids, who help reignite his passion for writing.', 'In an effort to tap into his original talent, a wheelchair-bound author moves to a rural town, where he befriends a single mother and her three kids, who help reignite his passion for writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imoZLjmCnfG4f69Dq0f2Zsr9XOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101731'),
  ('301122911711015063', 'The Magic of Flight', 1996, 'Documentary, History', 'Greg MacGillivray, Greg MacGillivray, Brad Ohlund', 'Jack Stephens', 'Tom Selleck', null, 'Take a technological thrill ride The Magic of Flight takes you on a technological thrill ride faster, higher and wider than modern science or even your imagination! Relive the first flight of the Wright Brothers, then soar with the Blue Angels as they defy the laws of gravity. Narrated by Tom Selleck.', 'Take a technological thrill ride The Magic of Flight takes you on a technological thrill ride faster, higher and wider than modern science or even your imagination! Relive the first flight of the Wright Brothers, then soar with the Blue Angels as they defy the laws of gravity. Narrated by Tom Selleck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhKYR15fW3kFTZrFPcks3ostNdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21928'),
  ('891006864913817550', 'The Magic of Lassie', 1978, 'Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Michael D. Margulies, Don Chaffey, Don Torpin', 'Jean Holloway, Robert B. Sherman, Richard M. Sherman', 'Mickey Rooney, Pernell Roberts, Stephanie Zimbalist, Michael Sharrett, Alice Faye, Gene Evans, James Stewart, Mike Mazurki', 'G', 'Lassie is claimed from his family by a "former owner" and then braves a cross country trip to rejoin the ones that love her.', 'Lassie is claimed from his family by a "former owner" and then braves a cross country trip to rejoin the ones that love her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkB28Y7WAHpQvOo5Lg7FvSkj6TM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88203'),
  ('997874564529037454', 'The Magic of Méliès', 1997, 'Documentary, History', 'Jacques Mény, Jean-Pierre Caussidery, Anne Gille', 'Jacques Mény', 'Marina Moncade, Daniel Ceccaldi, Charles-Antoine Decroix, Abdul Alafrez, Claire Mosser, Didier Cremer, Alain Kanto, Philippe Duval', null, 'A walk through the life and work of the brilliant French filmmaker Georges Méliès (1861-1938), pioneer of special and visual effects.', 'A walk through the life and work of the brilliant French filmmaker Georges Méliès (1861-1938), pioneer of special and visual effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddgl8kqMGKob8qFNFcrIdERgi8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91603'),
  ('1118814372063853100', 'The Magic of Ordinary Days', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Brent Shields, Eric Van Haren Noman', 'Camille Thomasson', 'Keri Russell, Skeet Ulrich, Mare Winningham, Tania Gunadi, Eric Winter, Gwendoline Yeo, Stephen Strachan, Katie Keating', 'PG', 'Pregnant out of wedlock, an educated young woman is pressured by her father into an arranged marriage with a lonely farmer in this drama set during WWII.', 'Pregnant out of wedlock, an educated young woman is pressured by her father into an arranged marriage with a lonely farmer in this drama set during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UAR1KJNyvBdhTXmmlxqROUCxi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47525'),
  ('1116420066528471', 'The Magic Ring', 1979, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Leonid Nosyrev', null, 'Yuri Volyntsev, Anatoliy Barantsev, Mariya Vinogradova, Kira Smirnova, Tatyana Vasileva, Boris Novikov, Klara Rumyanova', null, 'Vanya has no money at all, and he gave away his last piece of clothing to save some poor animals. Now he has a cat, a dog, and a snake living in his house. But it turns out that the snake is the king''s daughter, so she gave him a magic ring as a gift for saving her. Now Vanya can wish for anything he wants, and his wish will come true!', 'Vanya has no money at all, and he gave away his last piece of clothing to save some poor animals. Now he has a cat, a dog, and a snake living in his house. But it turns out that the snake is the king''s daughter, so she gave him a magic ring as a gift for saving her. Now Vanya can wish for anything he wants, and his wish will come true!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JI7Brdc1wNMUqWXlZBIs2i7m40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79216'),
  ('684554965418350237', 'The Magic Roundabout', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Frank Passingham, Dave Borthwick, Jean Duval', 'Raoff Sanoussi, Paul Bassett', 'Robbie Williams, Kylie Minogue, Ian McKellen, Joanna Lumley, Jim Broadbent, Bill Nighy, Tom Baker, Ray Winstone', 'G', 'A shaggy, candy-loving puppy named Dougal along with a group of friends embarks on a dangerous journey in an effort to imprison their oppressor -- the evil ice sorcerer ZeeBad (Zebedee''s evil twin). As the world is placed in mortal danger Zeebad who wants to turn the world to ice. Doogal and his friends must recover 3 diamonds that are needed to stop him.', 'A shaggy, candy-loving puppy named Dougal along with a group of friends embarks on a dangerous journey in an effort to imprison their oppressor -- the evil ice sorcerer ZeeBad (Zebedee''s evil twin). As the world is placed in mortal danger Zeebad who wants to turn the world to ice. Doogal and his friends must recover 3 diamonds that are needed to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUUxGu8Oxtzk2VasR99Jqy74ogK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16455'),
  ('1059010663766527357', 'The Magic School Bus Rides Again: Kids in Space', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Richard Weston', 'David Skelly', 'Kate McKinnon, Matthew Mucci, Mikaela Blake, Gabby Clarke, Miles Koseleci-Vieira, Birva Pandya, Lynsey Pham, Kaden Stephen', null, 'The Magic School Bus kids blast into orbit - and onto the International Space Station - only to find themselves on the run from a giant tardigrade.', 'The Magic School Bus kids blast into orbit - and onto the International Space Station - only to find themselves on the run from a giant tardigrade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibOcE3edsTZK2wTCvuNC4n5EQs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726661'),
  ('612775583560208171', 'The Magic Snowflake', 2013, 'Family, Animation', 'Luc Vinciguerra', 'Alexandre Reverend, Luc Vinciguerra, David Max Freedman', 'Nathan Simony, Benoît Allemane, Évelyne Grandjean, Alexis Tomassian, Jean-Claude Donda, Vincent Grass, Mary Pat Gleason', 'NR', 'A young boy named Nicholas is about to become the next Santa Claus, but must first avoid a crisis that''s threatening the magic of Christmas before he can succeed in his new role.', 'A young boy named Nicholas is about to become the next Santa Claus, but must first avoid a crisis that''s threatening the magic of Christmas before he can succeed in his new role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fV6pwW85sg40NDk7c72AgZt0t88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305387'),
  ('482881463204913926', 'The Magic Sun', 1966, 'Documentary, Music', 'Phill Niblock', null, 'Sun Ra, Marshall Allen', null, 'Multi-faceted artist Phil Niblock captures a brief moment of an interstellar communication by the Arkestra in their prime. Black turns white in a so-called negative post-process, while Niblock''s camera focuses on microscopic details of hands, bodies and instruments. A brilliant tribute to the Sun King by another brilliant supra-planetary sovereign. (Eye of Sound)', 'Multi-faceted artist Phil Niblock captures a brief moment of an interstellar communication by the Arkestra in their prime. Black turns white in a so-called negative post-process, while Niblock''s camera focuses on microscopic details of hands, bodies and instruments. A brilliant tribute to the Sun King by another brilliant supra-planetary sovereign. (Eye of Sound)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQndY21cdUJR2ftMZqGBgjooO2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401502'),
  ('293112696852460058', 'The Magic Sword', 1950, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Vojislav Nanović, Milenko Stojanović, Dušan Petrović', 'Vojislav Nanović, Jugoslav Đorđević', 'Rade Marković, Vera Ilić-Đukić, Milivoje Živanović, Marko Marinković, Mihajlo ''Bata'' Paskaljević, Milan Ajvaz, Ljubiša Jovanović, Zora Zlatković', null, 'Evil Bash-Chelik is terrorizing people, but only the magic sword can harm him. A young hero goes on the dangerous quest to find that sword.', 'Evil Bash-Chelik is terrorizing people, but only the magic sword can harm him. A young hero goes on the dangerous quest to find that sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CRBsy6D5tFpuTW3ZvBEzF3OLBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266079'),
  ('203198841257196785', 'The Magic Sword', 1962, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Family', 'Bert I. Gordon, Paul Vogel', 'Bernard C. Schoenfeld', 'Basil Rathbone, Estelle Winwood, Gary Lockwood, Anne Helm, Liam Sullivan, Danielle De Metz, Merritt Stone, Nick Bon Tempi', null, 'The son of a sorceress, armed with weapons, armour and six magically summoned knights, goes on a quest to save a princess from a vengeful wizard.', 'The son of a sorceress, armed with weapons, armour and six magically summoned knights, goes on a quest to save a princess from a vengeful wizard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVivlmUdyUwqSBnQkSzX3TLduky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26643'),
  ('912878884770088578', 'The Magic Touch', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Herman Yau', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Leon Lai Ming, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Winnie Lau Siu-Wai, Sunny Fang Kang, Chan Hiu-Ying, Michael Dinga, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai', null, 'Hui Wai Tak tells people''s fortunes by feeling their bones. In reality though, he is a scam artist who gathers information on his clients in advance and uses it to milk them for money. When the wife of Commissioner David Ho of the Inland Revenue Department (IRD) comes to see him, he reveals that her husband is cheating on her. After facing the wrath of his wife, Ho decides to get revenge and sends junior assessor Yau Ho Kay to investigate Hui''s income. During the investigation, Hui sustains a brain injury and slips into a coma. After he wakes up, he suddenly discovers that he has gained the real ability to see people''s futures.', 'Hui Wai Tak tells people''s fortunes by feeling their bones. In reality though, he is a scam artist who gathers information on his clients in advance and uses it to milk them for money. When the wife of Commissioner David Ho of the Inland Revenue Department (IRD) comes to see him, he reveals that her husband is cheating on her. After facing the wrath of his wife, Ho decides to get revenge and sends junior assessor Yau Ho Kay to investigate Hui''s income. During the investigation, Hui sustains a brain injury and slips into a coma. After he wakes up, he suddenly discovers that he has gained the real ability to see people''s futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqnJmJpspwVh6WiUxAp0lPX7brU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198526'),
  ('380360739334602930', 'The Magic Tuche', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Christian Abomnes, Olivier Baroux', null, 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Isabelle Nanty, Claire Nadeau, Sarah Stern, Pierre Lottin, Théo Fernandez, Scali Delpeyrat, Philippe Magnan', null, 'After a groundbreaking presidential election, Jeff Tuche becomes the new President of France and moves in the Elysee with his family to govern the country.', 'After a groundbreaking presidential election, Jeff Tuche becomes the new President of France and moves in the Elysee with his family to govern the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99SuHd12RS16gToStNx9IN6bEXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424619'),
  ('871204356502811170', 'The Magic Voyage', 1992, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Michael Schoemann, Phil Nibbelink, Kevin Richardson', 'David T. Reilly, Scott Santoro', 'Michael Habeck, Beate Hasenau, Lutz Mackensy, Hans Paetsch, Jens Wawrczeck, Katja Nottke, Christian Schult, Eric Vaessen', null, 'Christopher Columbus decides to go on a journey to prove that the Earth is not flat. His companion is a smart wood worm who''s on a quest of his own: to save a beautiful fairy princess from the evil lord Swarm and his insect army.', 'Christopher Columbus decides to go on a journey to prove that the Earth is not flat. His companion is a smart wood worm who''s on a quest of his own: to save a beautiful fairy princess from the evil lord Swarm and his insect army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap3puVC9opCv3JwRYDEFFicuWlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110812'),
  ('438004843874726733', 'The Magic Voyage of Sinbad', 1953, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Fyodor Provorov, Viktor Zorin', 'Konstantin Isayev', 'Sergey Stolyarov, Alla Larionova, Ninel Myshkova, B. Surovtsev, Mikhail Troyanovsky, Nadir Malishevsky, Ivan Pereverzev, Nikolay Kryuchkov', null, 'Sadko is based on an opera by Nikolai Rimsky-Korsakov, which was based on a Russian epic tale of the same name. In the old Russian city of Novgorod, the merchants are feasting in a gorgeous palace and Sadko is bragging that he can bring to their land a sweet-voiced bird of happiness. They laugh at him, but he is offered help by the Ocean King''s daughter, who is mesmerized by Sadko''s singing and is in love with him. The hero is destined to visit many lands in his search of the bird. First shown in the USA in 1953 with English subtitles. This entry is for 1962 English-dub by Roger Corman''s Filmgroup, which runs about 8 minutes shorter (removes much of the music) than the Russian original (see, Sadko, 1953)', 'Sadko is based on an opera by Nikolai Rimsky-Korsakov, which was based on a Russian epic tale of the same name. In the old Russian city of Novgorod, the merchants are feasting in a gorgeous palace and Sadko is bragging that he can bring to their land a sweet-voiced bird of happiness. They laugh at him, but he is offered help by the Ocean King''s daughter, who is mesmerized by Sadko''s singing and is in love with him. The hero is destined to visit many lands in his search of the bird. First shown in the USA in 1953 with English subtitles. This entry is for 1962 English-dub by Roger Corman''s Filmgroup, which runs about 8 minutes shorter (removes much of the music) than the Russian original (see, Sadko, 1953)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diNe9V70UxzxdxSjhJGhCohi7dF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46997'),
  ('143645547020096261', 'The Magician', 1898, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'In this scene is shown a magician behind an ordinary table, upon which he suddenly and mysteriously causes to appear a large box, into which he leaps. The sides of the box fall to the ground, but instead of containing the magician a lively clown steps forth who further mystifies the audience by causing the box to disappear, and in its place is seen a fully laid table with a smoking dinner, to which the clown applies himself. The table, however, suddenly disappears much to the astonishment of the clown, who is confronted by the magician in the garb of Mephistopheles. This he suddenly changes to that of a sculptor, and in the background is seen a pedestal with the bust of a young lady, which comes to life as the sculptor applies the mallet and chisel.', 'In this scene is shown a magician behind an ordinary table, upon which he suddenly and mysteriously causes to appear a large box, into which he leaps. The sides of the box fall to the ground, but instead of containing the magician a lively clown steps forth who further mystifies the audience by causing the box to disappear, and in its place is seen a fully laid table with a smoking dinner, to which the clown applies himself. The table, however, suddenly disappears much to the astonishment of the clown, who is confronted by the magician in the garb of Mephistopheles. This he suddenly changes to that of a sculptor, and in the background is seen a pedestal with the bust of a young lady, which comes to life as the sculptor applies the mallet and chisel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGhMSIKGkinEPJnEEQMxt8BhbPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96186'),
  ('100822146862952742', 'The Magician', 1926, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Rex Ingram, John F. Seitz, Michael Powell', 'Rex Ingram', 'Alice Terry, Paul Wegener, Firmin Gémier, Iván Petrovich, Gladys Hamer, Henry Wilson, Hubert I. Stowitts, Claude Fielding', null, 'A young woman, Margaret Dauncey, is caught between the forces of a charlatan magician, Oliver Haddo, whom she is unable to resist, and the love of a handsome surgeon, Arthur Burdon, who has saved her from being a helpless cripple by performing a delicate operation on her spine.', 'A young woman, Margaret Dauncey, is caught between the forces of a charlatan magician, Oliver Haddo, whom she is unable to resist, and the love of a handsome surgeon, Arthur Burdon, who has saved her from being a helpless cripple by performing a delicate operation on her spine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjKOJmmIC1rIXw1u2TYHFcyn5Bl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29466'),
  ('1091454649162814978', 'The Magician', 1958, 'Drama', 'Gunnar Fischer, Ingmar Bergman, Gösta Ekman', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Max von Sydow, Ingrid Thulin, Gunnar Björnstrand, Naima Wifstrand, Bengt Ekerot, Bibi Andersson, Gertrud Fridh, Lars Ekborg', 'NR', 'A traveling magician and his troupe arrive in a Swedish town in the 1840s, where their act is scrutinized by local authorities and a skeptical medical official. Their stay leads to a series of confrontations that test the boundaries between performance, belief, and deception.', 'A traveling magician and his troupe arrive in a Swedish town in the 1840s, where their act is scrutinized by local authorities and a skeptical medical official. Their stay leads to a series of confrontations that test the boundaries between performance, belief, and deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46DEYkr96MxzUmdwgmj2U7gWokZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29453'),
  ('598224541379313387', 'The Magician', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Scott Ryan, Massimiliano Andrighetto', 'Scott Ryan', 'Scott Ryan, Ben Walker, Massimiliano Andrighetto, Kane Mason, Nathaniel Lindsay, Adam Ryan', null, 'Following the dealings of Melbourne-based hitman Ray as seen through the eyes of his ex-neighbour and friend Max, an Italian film student. Max and his camera witness Ray''s work life as it unfolds from day to day, giving an insight into a world we rarely see, and at the same time developing an unusual friendship with his subject.', 'Following the dealings of Melbourne-based hitman Ray as seen through the eyes of his ex-neighbour and friend Max, an Italian film student. Max and his camera witness Ray''s work life as it unfolds from day to day, giving an insight into a world we rarely see, and at the same time developing an unusual friendship with his subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWbwXZEmtOtftuRJ5C6RcmEaHlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14096'),
  ('806403048193745131', 'The Magician', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cem Yılmaz, Ali Taner Baltacı', null, 'Cem Yılmaz, Mazhar Alanson, Özlem Tekin, Tuna Orhan, Tuncer Salman, Kemal İnci, Gürgen Öz, Caner Alkaya', null, 'Failed magician Iskender decides to do a tour to save his career, but has to bring his grumpy and senile father along. The tour is quite unexpectedly interrupted when a bride actually disappears from the stage.', 'Failed magician Iskender decides to do a tour to save his career, but has to bring his grumpy and senile father along. The tour is quite unexpectedly interrupted when a bride actually disappears from the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95LhqrzaGi1UjLA1QAPFevqI4cr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13296'),
  ('327436320599307427', 'The Magician', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Kang Dae-hui, Kim Dae-seung, Cho Sang-yun', 'Kim Dae-seung, Jo Jung-hwa', 'Yoo Seung-ho, Go Ara, Lee Kyung-young, Jo Yoon-hee, Kwak Do-won, Park Cheol-min, Jo Dal-hwan, Jang Yoo-sang', null, 'A Princess in the Joseon Dynasty travels to the Qing Dynasty to marry. On the way to there, she meets a young magician and falls in love with him.', 'A Princess in the Joseon Dynasty travels to the Qing Dynasty to marry. On the way to there, she meets a young magician and falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlvCpomcyFB4OyYjUIAvJgZhtHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366654'),
  ('622946122824594847', 'The Magician and the Imp', 1902, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'The magician appears upon the stage with an imp as his assistant. The imp holds a piece of cloth in his hand. At the command of the magician the cloth is suddenly transformed into a beautiful girl, clad in tights. A barrel is then introduced and the girl enters one end.', 'The magician appears upon the stage with an imp as his assistant. The imp holds a piece of cloth in his hand. At the command of the magician the cloth is suddenly transformed into a beautiful girl, clad in tights. A barrel is then introduced and the girl enters one end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1phuZcA5xTBVoIkqI1MAIsW0MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108273'),
  ('479088227821245521', 'The Magician''s Alms', 1905, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A magician transforms a tiny dinner table into a full meal for a homeless man.', 'A magician transforms a tiny dinner table into a full meal for a homeless man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwP0VyGEtbIxJI38TdYutWTWt3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119994'),
  ('520004869307105613', 'The Magician''s Cavern', 1901, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A very enthusiastic magician performs several tricks.', 'A very enthusiastic magician performs several tricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9reSbdj372YPYKpOrSKBiNXJD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107261'),
  ('990461340230642446', 'The Magician''s Elephant', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Felicity Coonan, Wendy Rogers', 'Martin Hynes', 'Noah Jupe, Mandy Patinkin, Brian Tyree Henry, Natasia Demetriou, Sian Clifford, Benedict Wong, Miranda Richardson, Kirby Howell-Baptiste', 'PG', 'Peter is searching for his long-lost sister when he crosses paths with a fortune teller in the market square. His only question is: is his sister still alive? The answer, that he must find a mysterious elephant and the magician who will conjure it, sets Peter off on a journey to complete three seemingly impossible tasks that will change the face of his town forever.', 'Peter is searching for his long-lost sister when he crosses paths with a fortune teller in the market square. His only question is: is his sister still alive? The answer, that he must find a mysterious elephant and the magician who will conjure it, sets Peter off on a journey to complete three seemingly impossible tasks that will change the face of his town forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAoAgzOCxSytYBqqCQulhXNR3LB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776835'),
  ('366000563183607706', 'The Magician''s Hat', 1990, 'Animation', 'Milan Blažeković', 'Sunčana Škrinjarić, Fred P. Sharkey, Milan Blažeković', 'Dragan Milivojević, Ivo Rogulja, Emil Glad, Nada Rocco, Slavica Knežević, Ljubomir ''Kiki'' Kapor, Sven Lasta, Đurđa Ivezić', null, 'Thistle the magician and his forest friends take on the emperor Mrazomor and his horde of ice witches.', 'Thistle the magician and his forest friends take on the emperor Mrazomor and his horde of ice witches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rk2h5CojdhimiL3KucaufKNHfvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50349'),
  ('928670988228972756', 'The Magnet', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Charles Frend, Lionel Banes', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Stephen Murray, Kay Walsh, James Fox, Meredith Edwards, Gladys Henson, Thora Hird, Michael Brooke, Wylie Watson', null, 'A classic Ealing comedy in which a young boy steals a magnet and becomes a hero.', 'A classic Ealing comedy in which a young boy steals a magnet and becomes a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbcqM35Xmx4mAogvqEV7kjW67Hq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80031'),
  ('690705452686534244', 'The Magnet', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Akhenaton, Kamel Saleh, Denis Rouden', 'Kamel Saleh, Akhenaton', 'Kamel Saleh, Akhenaton, Houari Djerir, Brahim Aimad, Sofiane Madjid Mammeri, Malek Brahimi (Freeman), Titoff, Georges Neri', null, 'The story of a group of friends, all around 30, who live in the Le Panier district of Marseille, France. It''s not a bad life, made up of slightly shady dealings, nights out, sun and just hanging out. But the neighborhood is an inescapable presence. Over a period of a few summer days, their carefree lives will plunge into a predictable tragedy.', 'The story of a group of friends, all around 30, who live in the Le Panier district of Marseille, France. It''s not a bad life, made up of slightly shady dealings, nights out, sun and just hanging out. But the neighborhood is an inescapable presence. Over a period of a few summer days, their carefree lives will plunge into a predictable tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBkpmuyoLbXiBLwhrLm2KvORibv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32193'),
  ('938647968555863931', 'The Magnetic Monster', 1953, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Curt Siodmak, Richard Dixon, Maxwell O. Henry', 'Curt Siodmak, Ivan Tors', 'Richard Carlson, King Donovan, Leo Britt, Jean Byron, Harry Ellerbe, Frank Gerstle, John Vosper, Byron Foulger', 'NR', 'The Office of Scientific Investigations tracks down the source of increased magnetism and radioactivity in Los Angeles, and discovers that a man-made isotope is consuming available energy from nearby mass every few hours, doubling its size in the process. Although microscopic, it will soon become big enough to destroy Earth; and how to stop it is yet to be determined. The film''s Deltatron special effects footage is taken from the 1934 German sci-fi film GOLD.', 'The Office of Scientific Investigations tracks down the source of increased magnetism and radioactivity in Los Angeles, and discovers that a man-made isotope is consuming available energy from nearby mass every few hours, doubling its size in the process. Although microscopic, it will soon become big enough to destroy Earth; and how to stop it is yet to be determined. The film''s Deltatron special effects footage is taken from the 1934 German sci-fi film GOLD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIV85xjg61orfVQnQykTSNGKTVj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44692'),
  ('1128523096555157611', 'The Magnetic Telescope', 1942, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Julian Noa, Jackson Beck', null, 'When police interfere with a reckless scientist''s experiment, it creates a deadly meteor shower only Superman can stop.', 'When police interfere with a reckless scientist''s experiment, it creates a deadly meteor shower only Superman can stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eyDin3a7AZjZBPfGLZN7CfZmqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99678'),
  ('18018063377270435', 'The Magnificent Ambersons', 1942, 'Drama, Romance', 'Orson Welles, Stanley Cortez, Harry Mancke', 'Orson Welles', 'Joseph Cotten, Dolores Costello, Anne Baxter, Tim Holt, Agnes Moorehead, Ray Collins, Erskine Sanford, Richard Bennett', 'NR', 'The spoiled young heir to the decaying Amberson fortune comes between his widowed mother and the man she has always loved.', 'The spoiled young heir to the decaying Amberson fortune comes between his widowed mother and the man she has always loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5EosvM0delNPkgBDGYYZvJl46n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965'),
  ('1073629609203857174', 'The Magnificent Butcher', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Ma Koon-Wah', 'Wong Jing, Edward Tang', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Kwan Tak-Hing, Yuen Biao, Wai Pak, Fan Mei-Sheng, Paul Chung Fat, Lee Hoi-Sang, Fung Hak-On', null, 'A plump butcher student of Wong Fei Hung, Lam Sai-Wing gets into trouble with a rival kung-fu school known as Five Dragons. He is accused of raping the Head of that school''s goddaughter and killing his son. Now Ko, the Head of Five Dragons, wants revenge.', 'A plump butcher student of Wong Fei Hung, Lam Sai-Wing gets into trouble with a rival kung-fu school known as Five Dragons. He is accused of raping the Head of that school''s goddaughter and killing his son. Now Ko, the Head of Five Dragons, wants revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zU373WqLUfuDOkdWOhelnbexKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18812'),
  ('302658060642887249', 'The Magnificent Cuckold', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Marcello Ugolini, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Diego Fabbri, Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Claudia Cardinale, Bernard Blier, Michèle Girardon, Paul Guers, Philippe Nicaud, Gian Maria Volonté, Susy Andersen', null, 'Andrea Artusi is a successful businessman with a beautiful wife, Maria, and a happy marriage - until he has an affair. After his own cheating, he starts to become obsessed with his wife''s fidelity. Since she is one of the most desired women in town, he worries that it would be very easy for her to cheat on him. Now every time a man looks at his wife, Andrea goes crazy. Meanwhile, Maria finds out about her husband''s affair and decides to plan her revenge.', 'Andrea Artusi is a successful businessman with a beautiful wife, Maria, and a happy marriage - until he has an affair. After his own cheating, he starts to become obsessed with his wife''s fidelity. Since she is one of the most desired women in town, he worries that it would be very easy for her to cheat on him. Now every time a man looks at his wife, Andrea goes crazy. Meanwhile, Maria finds out about her husband''s affair and decides to plan her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twiUAjQBrkQXoj5tzWlrLb8zEXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164777'),
  ('352943152683676862', 'The Magnificent Dope', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Walter Lang', 'George Seaton', 'Henry Fonda, Lynn Bari, Don Ameche, Edward Everett Horton, George Barbier, Frank Orth, Roseanne Murray, Marietta Canty', 'NR', 'Dwight Dawson, who runs an unsuccessful success school, stages a contest to find the biggest failure in the USA, for publicity value when the "dope" takes his course. But winner Tad Page is contented with his idle, lazy life and threatens to convert Dawson''s other students to his philosophy. Dawson captalizes on Tad''s attraction to Claire Harris to win him over; but will Tad find out Claire is really engaged to Dawson?', 'Dwight Dawson, who runs an unsuccessful success school, stages a contest to find the biggest failure in the USA, for publicity value when the "dope" takes his course. But winner Tad Page is contented with his idle, lazy life and threatens to convert Dawson''s other students to his philosophy. Dawson captalizes on Tad''s attraction to Claire Harris to win him over; but will Tad find out Claire is really engaged to Dawson?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seacdoBtsKIYP9jwxxZDMhRcu0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97821'),
  ('920385568508412185', 'The Magnificent Nine', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Yukihiro Okimura, Megumu Sawada', 'Kenichi Suzuki, Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Sadao Abe, Eita Nagayama, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Karen Iwata, Yuko Takeuchi, Ryuhei Matsuda, Yasufumi Terawaki, Yudai Chiba', null, 'Residents in a town have a hard time due to the land tax and forced labor. 9 people, including Juzaburo Kokutaya (Sadao Abe), worry about the future of their town. They then set up a plan to save the town. The plan is to lend large amounts of money to han (historical term for the estate of a warrior) and distribute the interest annually to the residents, but if they''re caught they will lose their lives.', 'Residents in a town have a hard time due to the land tax and forced labor. 9 people, including Juzaburo Kokutaya (Sadao Abe), worry about the future of their town. They then set up a plan to save the town. The plan is to lend large amounts of money to han (historical term for the estate of a warrior) and distribute the interest annually to the residents, but if they''re caught they will lose their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Nx2khV1IpGMc76LHe6zCisVkWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394314'),
  ('53833861647158429', 'The Magnificent One', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance, Action, Adventure', 'Philippe de Broca, Tony Aboyantz, Claude Gorsky', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Philippe de Broca, Vittorio Caprioli', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jacqueline Bisset, Vittorio Caprioli, Hans Meyer, Monique Tarbès, Mario David, Bruno Garcin, Raymond Gérôme', null, 'A writer of pulpy book series in which he''s the hero and his beautiful English roommate is the love interest attempts to finish his new book in time at the publisher''s demand.', 'A writer of pulpy book series in which he''s the hero and his beautiful English roommate is the love interest attempts to finish his new book in time at the publisher''s demand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIGYrhZY3DOXNJAoWQHSiqs9W7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19562'),
  ('1069985875073976577', 'The Magnificent Ruffians', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Cho Wai-Kei, Chan Yau-Man', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Lu Feng, Lo Meng, Phillip Kwok Chui, Annie Liu On-Lai, Wong Lik, Chiang Sheng, Sun Chien, Lau Fong-Sai', null, 'Venom regulars Philip Kwok, Chiang Sheng, and Sun Chien star as a gang of unemployed martial artists who spend their days stuffing their faces at local restaurants and letting the staff beat them up instead of paying the bill. Their fortunes appear to improve when the head of a local security agency hires them to take out the competition, who their new employer insists is up to no good. But the boys are being played for fools, and after an unfortunate misunderstanding, they unite with their former adversary to take out the true villain.', 'Venom regulars Philip Kwok, Chiang Sheng, and Sun Chien star as a gang of unemployed martial artists who spend their days stuffing their faces at local restaurants and letting the staff beat them up instead of paying the bill. Their fortunes appear to improve when the head of a local security agency hires them to take out the competition, who their new employer insists is up to no good. But the boys are being played for fools, and after an unfortunate misunderstanding, they unite with their former adversary to take out the true villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XKX4MUeU7hauNY0EndClNlYidF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141131'),
  ('865530783751735071', 'The Magnificent Scoundrels', 1991, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Lee Lik-Chi, Abdul M. Rumjahn', 'Lee Lik-Chi, Edward Leung Yiu-Ming', 'Stephen Chow, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Tien Niu, Amy Yip Chi-Mei, Wu Ma, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Yuen Wah, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai', null, 'Valentino is a mediocre con artist who crosses paths with Kwan, a fellow con artist. Together, they impersonate various people and create numerous schemes to make money. Meanwhile, gangsters are making a scheme of their own.', 'Valentino is a mediocre con artist who crosses paths with Kwan, a fellow con artist. Together, they impersonate various people and create numerous schemes to make money. Meanwhile, gangsters are making a scheme of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQxM0RkVtxhDbMRWl91QsG3gr0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56124'),
  ('828722957483850010', 'The Magnificent Seven', 1960, 'Western, Action, Adventure', 'Charles Lang, John Sturges, Jaime Contreras', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Yul Brynner, Eli Wallach, Steve McQueen, Charles Bronson, Robert Vaughn, Brad Dexter, James Coburn, Horst Buchholz', 'NR', 'An oppressed Mexican peasant village hires seven gunfighters to help defend their homes.', 'An oppressed Mexican peasant village hires seven gunfighters to help defend their homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5ToxOyJwuZD4VOfI0qEn5uIjeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966'),
  ('89356896205097432', 'The Magnificent Seven', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Western', 'Antoine Fuqua, Sean Ryan Jennings, Leslie McDonald', 'William Roberts, Shinobu Hashimoto, Akira Kurosawa', 'Denzel Washington, Chris Pratt, Ethan Hawke, Vincent D''Onofrio, Lee Byung-hun, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Martin Sensmeier, Peter Sarsgaard', 'PG-13', 'Looking to mine for gold, greedy industrialist Bartholomew Bogue seizes control of the Old West town of Rose Creek. With their lives in jeopardy, Emma Cullen and other desperate residents turn to bounty hunter Sam Chisolm for help. Chisolm recruits an eclectic group of gunslingers to take on Bogue and his ruthless henchmen. With a deadly showdown on the horizon, the seven mercenaries soon find themselves fighting for more than just money once the bullets start to fly.', 'Looking to mine for gold, greedy industrialist Bartholomew Bogue seizes control of the Old West town of Rose Creek. With their lives in jeopardy, Emma Cullen and other desperate residents turn to bounty hunter Sam Chisolm for help. Chisolm recruits an eclectic group of gunslingers to take on Bogue and his ruthless henchmen. With a deadly showdown on the horizon, the seven mercenaries soon find themselves fighting for more than just money once the bullets start to fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezcS78TIjgr85pVdaPDd2rSPVNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333484'),
  ('114949538999864090', 'The Magnificent Seven Deadly Sins', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Graham Stark, Harvey Harrison, Derek Cracknell', 'Spike Milligan, Barry Cryer, Graham Chapman', 'Spike Milligan, Marty Feldman, Leslie Phillips, Harry H. Corbett, Yvonne Paul, Bruce Forsyth, Felicity Devonshire, Paul Whitsun-Jones', null, 'A septet of satirical vignettes based on the Seven Deadly Sins.', 'A septet of satirical vignettes based on the Seven Deadly Sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNVgX6yKTlHgkjSGZEIJWfZLthZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226124'),
  ('196934747630533937', 'The Magnificent Seven Ride!', 1972, 'Western', 'George McCowan, Fred J. Koenekamp, Robert Goodstein', 'Arthur Rowe', 'Lee Van Cleef, Stefanie Powers, Michael Callan, Mariette Hartley, Luke Askew, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Ralph Waite, Melissa Murphy', 'PG', 'Marshal Chris Adams turns down a friend''s request to help stop the depredations of a gang of Mexican bandits. When his wife is killed by bank robbers and his friend is killed capturing the last thief, Chris feels obligated to take up his friend''s cause and recruits a writer and five prisoners to destroy the desperadoes.The last in the original series of four "Magnificent Seven" movies.', 'Marshal Chris Adams turns down a friend''s request to help stop the depredations of a gang of Mexican bandits. When his wife is killed by bank robbers and his friend is killed capturing the last thief, Chris feels obligated to take up his friend''s cause and recruits a writer and five prisoners to destroy the desperadoes.The last in the original series of four "Magnificent Seven" movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9wUJuEBpAFS6fjXguyWqudZWhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43417'),
  ('440796865461095641', 'The Magnificent Tramp', 1959, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gilles Grangier, Louis Page, Jacques Deray', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean Gabin, Darry Cowl, Bernard Blier, Julien Carette, Dora Doll, Paul Frankeur, Gaby Basset, Jacqueline Maillan', null, 'Bum Archimède wants to spend the winter in prison, but to get there proves not to be that easy.', 'Bum Archimède wants to spend the winter in prison, but to get there proves not to be that easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gc3x0hGUUzdCxYgcxPzcdOdEBlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33017'),
  ('554758007003390439', 'The Magnificent Trio', 1966, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Chang Cheh, Wong Wing-Lung', 'Chang Cheh', 'Margaret Tu Chuan, Chin Ping, Fanny Fan Lai, Jimmy Wang Yu, Lo Lieh, Cheng Lui, Lui Ming, Violet Pan Ying-Zi', null, 'A wandering swordsman named Lu Fang who is returning from battle discovers that several farmers have kidnapped the local magistrate’s daughter. He sides with them after learning that this is an act of desperation to improve their low standard of living.', 'A wandering swordsman named Lu Fang who is returning from battle discovers that several farmers have kidnapped the local magistrate’s daughter. He sides with them after learning that this is an act of desperation to improve their low standard of living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bANFVAAvCBMi5ykWz2akAKDvz82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64998'),
  ('642043533569525221', 'The Magnificent Two', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Eric Rattray, Ernest Steward, Cliff Owen', 'Michael Pertwee', 'Eric Morecambe, Ernie Wise, Margit Saad, Virgílio Teixeira, Cecil Parker, Isobel Black, Martin Benson, Michael Godfrey', null, 'Two salesmen travel to a small South American Country to peddle their wares. However the country is in the middle of a major conflict between the Government led by Diaz and the rebels led by Torez. When Torez is accidentally killed the rebels mistaken pick up one of the salesmen, Eric, as he looks like Torez. Eric and Ernie are promised millions to carry on the charade once the rebels take charge. However once Eric takes charge he finds himself back in danger as scheming general Carillo plans to remove the impostor from his role.', 'Two salesmen travel to a small South American Country to peddle their wares. However the country is in the middle of a major conflict between the Government led by Diaz and the rebels led by Torez. When Torez is accidentally killed the rebels mistaken pick up one of the salesmen, Eric, as he looks like Torez. Eric and Ernie are promised millions to carry on the charade once the rebels take charge. However once Eric takes charge he finds himself back in danger as scheming general Carillo plans to remove the impostor from his role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWdTvj8HDeVVgeb386YrZ2bBip9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43996'),
  ('13143655658627071', 'The Magus', 1968, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy', 'Guy Green, Billy Williams', 'John Fowles', 'Michael Caine, Anthony Quinn, Candice Bergen, Anna Karina, Paul Stassino, Julian Glover, Takis Emmanuel, George Pastell', null, 'A teacher on a Greek island becomes involved in bizarre mind-games with the island''s magus (magician) and a beautiful young woman.', 'A teacher on a Greek island becomes involved in bizarre mind-games with the island''s magus (magician) and a beautiful young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMfTUp1Ic53zKZwtskLt9XLeUCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33228'),
  ('629105965980683991', 'The Mahabharata', 1990, 'Drama, War', 'Peter Brook, William Lubtchansky, Marc Guilbert', 'Peter Brook, Marie-Hélène Estienne, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Erika Alexander, Lou Bihler, Urs Bihler, Ryszard Cieślak, Georges Corraface, Jean-Paul Denizon, Mamadou Dioumé, Miriam Goldschmidt', null, 'One of the great masterpieces of world literature comes to vivid life in an elaborate production from acclaimed theater and film innovator Peter Brook. This collection of ancient Sanskrit stories (composed into the longest book ever written) comprises a series of enlightened fables at the heart of countless beliefs, legends, and teachings; indeed, its very title means "the great story of mankind." Brook and writer Jean-Claude Carriere worked for eight years to develop this epic concerning two sides of a royal family, the Pandavas and the Kauravas, whose struggle leads to a fascinating voyage of emotions, passion and vision of glory. Briefly, the Mahabharata is a tale of two rival sets of brothers, cousins to eachother, each born into royalty and with divinely guided paths in life. The result, however, is a great war, death, destruction - a vast epic.', 'One of the great masterpieces of world literature comes to vivid life in an elaborate production from acclaimed theater and film innovator Peter Brook. This collection of ancient Sanskrit stories (composed into the longest book ever written) comprises a series of enlightened fables at the heart of countless beliefs, legends, and teachings; indeed, its very title means "the great story of mankind." Brook and writer Jean-Claude Carriere worked for eight years to develop this epic concerning two sides of a royal family, the Pandavas and the Kauravas, whose struggle leads to a fascinating voyage of emotions, passion and vision of glory. Briefly, the Mahabharata is a tale of two rival sets of brothers, cousins to eachother, each born into royalty and with divinely guided paths in life. The result, however, is a great war, death, destruction - a vast epic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vshPIXZ6kpaazO6odS5WtWPoa2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150523'),
  ('778570075335129261', 'The Maias: Story of a Portuguese Family', 2014, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'João Botelho, João Ribeiro', 'João Botelho', 'Graciano Dias, Maria Flor, Pedro Inês, João Perry, Hugo Mestre Amaro, Maria João Pinho, Adriano Luz, Filipe Vargas', null, 'The tragedy and comedy in Carlos'' life begins, grows and ends like the tragedy and comedy of Portugal. In the company of his close friend, João da Ega, allegedly a brilliant writer, Carlos, with his idle existence as an aristocratic doctor, spends his time to enjoying friends and lovers. Until he falls in love. She is a new character in this revolutionary novel. It''s a vertiginous passion that goes beyond that past gloominess to reach a new and darker abyss, incest.', 'The tragedy and comedy in Carlos'' life begins, grows and ends like the tragedy and comedy of Portugal. In the company of his close friend, João da Ega, allegedly a brilliant writer, Carlos, with his idle existence as an aristocratic doctor, spends his time to enjoying friends and lovers. Until he falls in love. She is a new character in this revolutionary novel. It''s a vertiginous passion that goes beyond that past gloominess to reach a new and darker abyss, incest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaZicpF4Q6Cplr0eoHz0B7jOVR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280636'),
  ('898392567033117541', 'The Maid', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ian Toynton', 'Timothy Prager', 'Martin Sheen, Jacqueline Bisset, Victoria Shalet, Jean-Pierre Cassel, James Faulkner, Isabelle Guiard, Dominic Gould, Catherine Lachens', null, 'A man goes off to Paris to start his new job at a bank. When he falls in love with a beautiful woman, he decides to work as her maid -- until he discovers she not only is his boss, but his colleague at the bank.', 'A man goes off to Paris to start his new job at a bank. When he falls in love with a beautiful woman, he decides to work as her maid -- until he discovers she not only is his boss, but his colleague at the bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjLtYULEUDKzfEQZ4HbAHjPLiC1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100080'),
  ('501505920969044624', 'The Maid', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kelvin Tong, Lucas Jodogne', 'Kelvin Tong', 'Alessandra de Rossi, Hong Huifang, Benny Soh, Zhenwei Guan, Chen Shucheng, Mohd Haizad Bin Imram, Nur Awal''liyah Ja''afar', null, 'Alone for the first time and away from her family in rural Philippines, Rosa Dimaano arrives in the cosmopolitan city state of Singapore to work as a maid. Her employers Mr and Mrs Teo runs a Chinese Teochew dialect opera troupe takes well to their new domestic help. So do their mentally disabled son, Ah Soon. In Chinese superstition, the seventh month of the lunar calendar is regarded as the month when the gates of hell open for forsaken spirits to walk the earth for 30 days. Unknown to Rosa, she arrives on the eve and her hell is about to begin.', 'Alone for the first time and away from her family in rural Philippines, Rosa Dimaano arrives in the cosmopolitan city state of Singapore to work as a maid. Her employers Mr and Mrs Teo runs a Chinese Teochew dialect opera troupe takes well to their new domestic help. So do their mentally disabled son, Ah Soon. In Chinese superstition, the seventh month of the lunar calendar is regarded as the month when the gates of hell open for forsaken spirits to walk the earth for 30 days. Unknown to Rosa, she arrives on the eve and her hell is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xyVfbIb8KcIl1O0ym4uCqq6Qmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52494'),
  ('617997172834739467', 'The Maid', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sebastián Silva, Sergio Armstrong', 'Sebastián Silva, Pedro Peirano', 'Catalina Saavedra, Claudia Celedón, Andrea García-Huidobro, Mariana Loyola, Alejandro Goic, Delfina Guzmán, Anita Reeves, Luis Dubó', null, 'Raquel has been the live-in housekeeper for a kind, reasonably wealthy family for half her life, and the joyless repetition of the job has begun to take its toll. Increasingly dependent on painkillers, Raquel resorts to pranks and childish avoidance to antagonize the family’s college-age daughter and a procession of new servants, all in the hopes of protecting her precarious power within the home. Her antics successfully push everyone away, until new maid Lucy actually pushes back.', 'Raquel has been the live-in housekeeper for a kind, reasonably wealthy family for half her life, and the joyless repetition of the job has begun to take its toll. Increasingly dependent on painkillers, Raquel resorts to pranks and childish avoidance to antagonize the family’s college-age daughter and a procession of new servants, all in the hopes of protecting her precarious power within the home. Her antics successfully push everyone away, until new maid Lucy actually pushes back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JeiuLk0xBHgc4tX0FxoZYb0OpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27567'),
  ('1041205898144457409', 'The Maid', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Paul Emmanuel', 'Paul Emmanuel', 'Claire Kahane, Ryan Cerenko, Olivia Jewson, Keith Hill, Chris Butler, Sylvia Seymour', null, 'An emotionally troubled teenager gets into a passionate relationship with the older French woman working in his father''s house.', 'An emotionally troubled teenager gets into a passionate relationship with the older French woman working in his father''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZerBkR2ChRnOrIO4MoolnjXb8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326947'),
  ('145108986586962993', 'The Maid', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Brandt Hackney, Vladimir Cazacu, Lee Thongkham', 'Piyaluk Tuntisrisakul', 'Ploynarin Sornarin, Kannaporn Puangtong, Savika Chaiyadej, Theerapat Sajakul, Keetapat Pongrue, Nuttanee Sittisamarn, Unruean Rachot, Venus Saksiri', null, 'Joy is the new maid of a royal house, whose previous maid disappeared under mysterious circumstances and is now haunting and terrorizing the family. Joy works to uncover the reason behind the former maid''s disappearance.', 'Joy is the new maid of a royal house, whose previous maid disappeared under mysterious circumstances and is now haunting and terrorizing the family. Joy works to uncover the reason behind the former maid''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ttn2RPsJxNom7XsDg16cuH5a6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709717'),
  ('254938447894520666', 'The Maiden', 2016, 'Horror', 'Michael Chaves', null, 'Alia Raelynn, Penny Orloff, Brian Knudson, Sunnie Pelant, Betsy Sligh', null, 'A real estate agent tries to sell a haunted house.', 'A real estate agent tries to sell a haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twwxj5Utw7f4gaUZBWXuCgTz1Lw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393498'),
  ('77747666791394853', 'The Maiden and the Wolves', 2008, 'Drama, Family', 'Gilles Legrand', null, 'Laetitia Casta, Jean-Paul Rouve, Stefano Accorsi, Miglen Mirtchev, Patrick Chesnais, Michel Galabru, Lorànt Deutsch, Didier Bénureau', null, 'Not long before World War I, in a French Alpine town near the Italian border, a pack of slaughtered wolves is delivered to local taxidermist Leon (Patrick Chesnais). A surviving black cub comes down from the mountains looking for his family, and is saved from discovery and certain death by Leon’s young daughter Angele, who releases him back into the wild. The Great War comes and goes, making local foundry owners the Garcins rich. Family patriarch Albert Garcin (Michel Galabru), who happens to be Angele’s godfather, has given a free lifetime’s lease of a shack in the hills to a gypsy woman (played in flashbacks by Elisa Tovati in which she’s seen, literally, having dances with wolves on stage). Her son Guiseppe (Stefano Accorsi), who appears to be slightly mentally handicapped, guards the wolves he’s befriended up there, especially the black pack leader he calls Carbone.', 'Not long before World War I, in a French Alpine town near the Italian border, a pack of slaughtered wolves is delivered to local taxidermist Leon (Patrick Chesnais). A surviving black cub comes down from the mountains looking for his family, and is saved from discovery and certain death by Leon’s young daughter Angele, who releases him back into the wild. The Great War comes and goes, making local foundry owners the Garcins rich. Family patriarch Albert Garcin (Michel Galabru), who happens to be Angele’s godfather, has given a free lifetime’s lease of a shack in the hills to a gypsy woman (played in flashbacks by Elisa Tovati in which she’s seen, literally, having dances with wolves on stage). Her son Guiseppe (Stefano Accorsi), who appears to be slightly mentally handicapped, guards the wolves he’s befriended up there, especially the black pack leader he calls Carbone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3Pl0QYYFjwS3bbVZ10NYbY4YUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18465'),
  ('856642177029157504', 'The Maiden Heist', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Hewitt, Ueli Steiger, Branko Racki', 'Michael LeSieur', 'Morgan Freeman, Christopher Walken, William H. Macy, Marcia Gay Harden, Philip Dorn Hebert, Todd Weeks, Bhavesh Patel, Stephen Stapinski', 'PG-13', 'A comedy centered on three museum security guards who devise a plan to steal back the artworks to which they have become attached after they are transferred to another museum.', 'A comedy centered on three museum security guards who devise a plan to steal back the artworks to which they have become attached after they are transferred to another museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrp0dqlp74A02YaUiwNpLElgTR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24271'),
  ('172261831162421300', 'The Maiden''s Tune', 1973, 'TV Movie, Horror, Mystery', 'Đorđe Kadijević, Branko Ivatović', 'Đorđe Kadijević', 'Olivera Katarina, Goran Sultanović, Ivan Jagodić, Toma Kuruzović, Osman Halilković', null, 'A man heading through the countryside is drawn to a strange castle, which is reputed by the locals to be haunted. There he meets a beguiling young woman who ensnares him in her world of secrets.', 'A man heading through the countryside is drawn to a strange castle, which is reputed by the locals to be haunted. There he meets a beguiling young woman who ensnares him in her world of secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvIQm48fyqZATIpMicXzt7DvSBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269185'),
  ('987219997531426788', 'The Maidens of Heavenly Mountains', 1994, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Andy Chin Wing-Keung, Wilson Yip', 'Andy Chin Wing-Keung', 'Brigitte Lin, Gong Li, Sharla Cheung, Frankie Lam, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Liu Kai-Chi, James Pax', null, 'Legend has it that in a faraway place beyond the edge of the earth, there exists a broken-hearted man with infinite power. Abandoned by his loved ones, the inheritance of the old man''s chi power becomes a battleground for evil outsiders.', 'Legend has it that in a faraway place beyond the edge of the earth, there exists a broken-hearted man with infinite power. Abandoned by his loved ones, the inheritance of the old man''s chi power becomes a battleground for evil outsiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cehadHKYKkq7z9PhrhWT43LYP3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66015'),
  ('986721876524734740', 'The Maidens'' Conspiracy', 2006, 'Adventure', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine, Richard Walker', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Caspar Zafer, Esther Nubiola, Leonor Watling, Ingrid Rubio, Jane Asher, Charlie Cox, Sid Mitchell, Rafael Amargo', null, 'Constantinople, 1401. The emperor of Byzantium asks the famous knight Tirant lo Blanc to free the city from the siege of the Turks. After his victory, Tirant will have to face a more difficult task: to overcome the natural opposition of Carmesina, heiress to the Ottoman Empire, to surrender her most precious treasure.', 'Constantinople, 1401. The emperor of Byzantium asks the famous knight Tirant lo Blanc to free the city from the siege of the Turks. After his victory, Tirant will have to face a more difficult task: to overcome the natural opposition of Carmesina, heiress to the Ottoman Empire, to surrender her most precious treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQuTs1r9LBftV0MZHvaWF9O479t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48737'),
  ('19418404387658518', 'The Maids', 1975, 'Drama', 'Christopher Miles, Douglas Slocombe', 'Robert Enders, Christopher Miles', 'Glenda Jackson, Susannah York, Vivien Merchant, Mark Burns', null, 'A film version of Genet''s play. Two maids, Solange and Claire, hate their employers and, while they are out, take turns at dressing up as Madame and insulting her.', 'A film version of Genet''s play. Two maids, Solange and Claire, hate their employers and, while they are out, take turns at dressing up as Madame and insulting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O5ArQPg92AKKeBxSTTcDOGMTBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170677'),
  ('769443895475380027', 'The Maids of Wilko', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marek Netzel, Jolanta Jedynak, Krystyna Grochowicz', 'Zbigniew Kaminski', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Anna Seniuk, Christine Pascal, Maja Komorowska, Stanisława Celińska, Krystyna Zachwatowicz, Zofia Jaroszewska, Tadeusz Białoszczyński', null, 'Set in the late ''20s. A thirtyish young man, who heads a small factory, faints at the funeral of a close friend. He decides to go home to his aunt and uncle for a while, but gets involved with a family of five women who had been in love with him at one time though he had apparently loved only one, who, unknown to him, has died since his departure. The women are mainly disillusioned with life or estranged from husbands while the youngest has a crush on him.', 'Set in the late ''20s. A thirtyish young man, who heads a small factory, faints at the funeral of a close friend. He decides to go home to his aunt and uncle for a while, but gets involved with a family of five women who had been in love with him at one time though he had apparently loved only one, who, unknown to him, has died since his departure. The women are mainly disillusioned with life or estranged from husbands while the youngest has a crush on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3C5lc2b4jhoNciDiK80v5gX6wkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117483'),
  ('116596694024460956', 'The Mail Lady 3', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Andre Ray, Jayla Ford, Jhayla Mosley, Benny Jenkins, Venus Yeung', 'Andre Ray', 'Will Coleman, Jessica Jacoby, Amerrah Garrison, Freddie Velatayo, Dior Rutherford', null, 'Hiding off the grid with Derek''s newborn son, vengeful ex-mail carrier Sloan Redding orchestrates one last deadly scheme to claim her twisted family, forcing Derek into a life-or-death showdown to save them.', 'Hiding off the grid with Derek''s newborn son, vengeful ex-mail carrier Sloan Redding orchestrates one last deadly scheme to claim her twisted family, forcing Derek into a life-or-death showdown to save them.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlUxbk56XtgnVXfflXoXQRZ9lCw3.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-mail-lady-3'),
  ('675335742563771413', 'The Mail Pilot', 1933, 'Animation', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey the mail pilot is entrusted with a chest of money. He battles rain and snow, but his biggest battle is against Pete, who has a plane equipped with a machine gun and a harpoon cannon. Mickey''s plane quickly loses its wings and propeller to Pete''s armaments, but he improvises a helicopter blade with a clothes-drying rack, then, when that gives way, a replacement prop from a windmill.', 'Mickey the mail pilot is entrusted with a chest of money. He battles rain and snow, but his biggest battle is against Pete, who has a plane equipped with a machine gun and a harpoon cannon. Mickey''s plane quickly loses its wings and propeller to Pete''s armaments, but he improvises a helicopter blade with a clothes-drying rack, then, when that gives way, a replacement prop from a windmill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLJaeUQvetidSO8p5L5iU0kxOBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61129'),
  ('387795882908197139', 'The Main Event', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Howard Zieff, Pat Kehoe, Ed Milkovich', 'Andrew Smith, Gail Parent', 'Barbra Streisand, Ryan O''Neal, Paul Sand, Whitman Mayo, Patti D''Arbanville, Chu Chu Malave, Richard Lawson, James Gregory', 'PG', 'A bankrupt entrepreneur attempts to recoup some of her losses by getting a washed-out boxer she picked up as a tax loss back into the ring — an idea her protégé isn''t fond of.', 'A bankrupt entrepreneur attempts to recoup some of her losses by getting a washed-out boxer she picked up as a tax loss back into the ring — an idea her protégé isn''t fond of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1qBqBkSOeWDXMkFyhDNF2wo0sy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42176'),
  ('95552400812323023', 'The Main Event', 2020, 'Family, Comedy', 'Steve Bors, Jay Karas, Peter Dashkewytch', 'Larry Postel, Jim Mahoney, Peter Hoare', 'Seth Carr, Tichina Arnold, Adam Pally, Ken Marino, Mike Mizanin, Momona Tamada, Keith Lee, Babatunde Łukasz Aiyegbusi', null, 'An 11-year-old aspiring wrestler enters a competition to become the next WWE superstar by using special powers from a magical mask.', 'An 11-year-old aspiring wrestler enters a competition to become the next WWE superstar by using special powers from a magical mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzg5AEEu1T7nFOCq4gKbGBObhdk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637157'),
  ('687752118959812185', 'The Mainland', 2026, 'Drama', 'Yulia Trofimova, Mikhail Dementev, Stanislav Mikheev, Ivan Gusakov', 'Ekaterina Mavromatis, Dana Zhane', 'Anastasia Kuimova, Artyom Bystrov, Platon Gerasimov', null, 'Marfa returns with her son to the Pacific island where she grew up and where her father worked as a lighthouse keeper. At the same time, her half-brother Ilya appears on the island, whom Marfa has not seen for many years. Marfa and Ilya are connected by a dark secret. But no matter how much they try to escape from the past, it overtakes them in the form of a mysterious whale cruising off the coast of the island and as if trying to convey something to Marfa.', 'Marfa returns with her son to the Pacific island where she grew up and where her father worked as a lighthouse keeper. At the same time, her half-brother Ilya appears on the island, whom Marfa has not seen for many years. Marfa and Ilya are connected by a dark secret. But no matter how much they try to escape from the past, it overtakes them in the form of a mysterious whale cruising off the coast of the island and as if trying to convey something to Marfa.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fj60zVTrweSaVPoaw2avps3y6uHu.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-mainland-2026'),
  ('102843114775683772', 'The Majestic', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Tattersall, Frank Darabont, Paula Case', 'Michael Sloane', 'Jim Carrey, Martin Landau, Laurie Holden, Gerry Black, David Ogden Stiers, Bob Balaban, Jeffrey DeMunn, Hal Holbrook', 'PG', 'Set in 1951, a blacklisted Hollywood writer gets into a car accident, loses his memory and settles down in a small town where he is mistaken for a long-lost son.', 'Set in 1951, a blacklisted Hollywood writer gets into a car accident, loses his memory and settles down in a small town where he is mistaken for a long-lost son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9WrB91B8ghxIZhyFugkoSleBE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11086'),
  ('548128364886807276', 'The Major', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yury Bykov, Aleksey Alekseev, Arcady Noskov', 'Yury Bykov', 'Denis Shvedov, Irina Nizina, Yury Bykov, Boris Nevzorov, Kirill Poluhin, Dmitriy Kulichkov, Dmitry Kuryanov, Ilya Isaev', null, 'On a cold winter’s day Sergey Sobolev, a major at the local police office, is driving to the hospital where his wife is about to give birth to their child. High from happiness, he’s driving too fast and runs down a boy on a passage walk, who dies. Now the major has only two options: go to prison or conceal the crime. Sobolev decides to compromise with his conscience and calls on a colleague to help him out. But the case turns out to be messy and when Sobolev finally changes his mind and tries to make up for his deed, it’s already too late…', 'On a cold winter’s day Sergey Sobolev, a major at the local police office, is driving to the hospital where his wife is about to give birth to their child. High from happiness, he’s driving too fast and runs down a boy on a passage walk, who dies. Now the major has only two options: go to prison or conceal the crime. Sobolev decides to compromise with his conscience and calls on a colleague to help him out. But the case turns out to be messy and when Sobolev finally changes his mind and tries to make up for his deed, it’s already too late…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc1NzhQ9bG2VI0OvcKiKxgwTHcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191717'),
  ('285964728712259734', 'The Major and the Minor', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Billy Wilder, Leo Tover', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Ginger Rogers, Ray Milland, Rita Johnson, Robert Benchley, Diana Lynn, Edward Fielding, Frankie Thomas, Raymond Roe', 'NR', 'Low on funds, working-class girl Susan Applegate disguises herself as a youngster in order to pay half fare home. But little ''Sue Sue'' finds herself in a whole heap of grownup trouble when she hides out in a compartment with handsome Major Philip Kirby.', 'Low on funds, working-class girl Susan Applegate disguises herself as a youngster in order to pay half fare home. But little ''Sue Sue'' finds herself in a whole heap of grownup trouble when she hides out in a compartment with handsome Major Philip Kirby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6ZWWdyWkqiMq8g6KmXibtmSiVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39871'),
  ('185495758808552225', 'The Major Fisherman', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Lorenzo Molossi, Fabio Olmi, Maurizio Zaccaro', 'Maurizio Zaccaro, Sergio Castellitto, Guglielmo Ariè', 'Sergio Castellitto, Anna Ferruzzo, Fabrizio Contri, Maurizio Marchetti, Antonio Pennarella, Andrea Di Maria, Lavinia Guglielman, Orlando Cinque', null, 'In this fact-based drama, an ecology-minded fisherman is elected mayor of his corrupt seaside town and begins crusading against drugs and crime.', 'In this fact-based drama, an ecology-minded fisherman is elected mayor of his corrupt seaside town and begins crusading against drugs and crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIaGfYqzMFwK0sEfVa73o5hg2WE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381763'),
