  ('300919892618320727', 'The Making of De Jeugd van Tegenwoordig', 2026, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jan Hulst, Tomas Kaan', null, 'Eva Breunesse, Freddy Tratlehner, Pepijn Lanen, Olivier Mitshel Locadia', null, 'The documentary follows De Jeugd van Tegenwoordig as they reflect on twenty years of music, friendship, and influence, combining archive footage, performances, and behind-the-scenes moments.', 'The documentary follows De Jeugd van Tegenwoordig as they reflect on twenty years of music, friendship, and influence, combining archive footage, performances, and behind-the-scenes moments.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FxmnNRxISngb1KSvfSNa4uid74XA.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-making-of-de-jeugd-van-tegenwoordig'),
  ('969571029281159761', 'The Making of Dr. Horrible''s Sing-Along Blog', 2007, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Ethan Shaftel', null, 'Felicia Day, Nathan Fillion, Neil Patrick Harris, Simon Helberg, Maurissa Tancharoen, Jed Whedon, Joss Whedon, Zack Whedon', null, 'The making of ''Dr. Horrible''s Sing-Along Blog''.', 'The making of ''Dr. Horrible''s Sing-Along Blog''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLdLg3GqQsiModOWhl3c04cvWBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337374'),
  ('329093527394530515', 'The Making of Fanny and Alexander', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Ingmar Bergman, Arne Carlsson', null, 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist, Daniel Bergman, Allan Edwall, Ewa Fröling, Erland Josephson, Gunnar Björnstrand, Lars Karlsson', null, 'Shot during the making of Fanny and Alexander, this feature-length documentary presents extended behind-the-scenes material from rehearsals and filming sessions, with Bergman at work staging scenes and directing performances. The film focuses on the practical process of production, including collaboration with the principal cast and key crew members such as cinematographer Sven Nykvist and on-set documentarian Arne Carlsson.', 'Shot during the making of Fanny and Alexander, this feature-length documentary presents extended behind-the-scenes material from rehearsals and filming sessions, with Bergman at work staging scenes and directing performances. The film focuses on the practical process of production, including collaboration with the principal cast and key crew members such as cinematographer Sven Nykvist and on-set documentarian Arne Carlsson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz9VDnqUsZ48APUuG5QuKOjy10Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114034'),
  ('367493739819226606', 'The Making of Star Wars', 1977, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Robert Guenette, David Myers', 'Richard Schickel', 'William Conrad, George Lucas, Mark Hamill, Carrie Fisher, Harrison Ford, Alec Guinness, Anthony Daniels, Gary Kurtz', 'G', 'Learn the incredible behind-the-scenes story of how the original Star Wars movie was brought to the big screen in this fascinating documentary hosted by C-3PO and R2-D2 which includes interviews with George Lucas and appearances by Mark Hamill, Harrison Ford and Carrie Fisher.', 'Learn the incredible behind-the-scenes story of how the original Star Wars movie was brought to the big screen in this fascinating documentary hosted by C-3PO and R2-D2 which includes interviews with George Lucas and appearances by Mark Hamill, Harrison Ford and Carrie Fisher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SUuNG1l918uBNMZZRDrUQMvwzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72694'),
  ('789466931909710090', 'The Makioka Sisters', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kon Ichikawa, Tsuneo Shimura, Kiyoshi Hasegawa', 'Shinya Hidaka, Kon Ichikawa', 'Keiko Kishi, Yoshiko Sakuma, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Yuko Kotegawa, Koji Ishizaka, Toshiyuki Hosokawa, Ittoku Kishibe, Jūzō Itami', null, 'This sensuously beautiful film chronicles the activities of four sisters who gather in Kyoto every year to view the cherry blossoms. It paints a vivid portrait of the pre-war lifestyle of the wealthy Makioka family from Osaka, and draws a parallel between their activities and the seasonal variations in Japan.', 'This sensuously beautiful film chronicles the activities of four sisters who gather in Kyoto every year to view the cherry blossoms. It paints a vivid portrait of the pre-war lifestyle of the wealthy Makioka family from Osaka, and draws a parallel between their activities and the seasonal variations in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEZnnJ21zvTXC70BovvR64qFj8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42116'),
  ('1066509845145835958', 'The Malatily Bathhouse', 1973, 'Drama', 'Salah Abu Seif, Abdel Fattah Madbouly, Mohamed Salah Abu Saif', 'Salah Abu Seif, Ismail Waly Eldeen, Mohsen Zayed', 'Shams El-Barudy, Yousuf Shaaban, Mohamed El Arabi, Nemat Mokhtar, Fayez Halawa, Naima ElSoghier, Abdel Ghani El Nagdi, Souad Nasr', null, 'The film is an adaptation of a novel by Ismåeel Walieddin. The main character, Ahmad, leaves rural eastern Egypt for the city hoping to become economically self-sufficient, gets an apartment for his parents, and obtains a law degree. He and his family are refugees from a town occupied by the Israeli army, Ismaåilia. Ali, the owner of the Malatily Bathhouse, offers to let him stay there for free. Ahmad encounters several characters there, including Naåeema, a prostitute who he becomes obsessed with, and Raouf, a homosexual man.', 'The film is an adaptation of a novel by Ismåeel Walieddin. The main character, Ahmad, leaves rural eastern Egypt for the city hoping to become economically self-sufficient, gets an apartment for his parents, and obtains a law degree. He and his family are refugees from a town occupied by the Israeli army, Ismaåilia. Ali, the owner of the Malatily Bathhouse, offers to let him stay there for free. Ahmad encounters several characters there, including Naåeema, a prostitute who he becomes obsessed with, and Raouf, a homosexual man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zA4L8NLiw6IMw7YR90hQibT6rSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263918'),
  ('598989012062200188', 'The Male Animal', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leo F. Forbstein, Elliott Nugent, Arthur Edeson', 'Stephen Morehouse Avery, Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein', 'Henry Fonda, Olivia de Havilland, Joan Leslie, Jack Carson, Eugene Pallette, Herbert Anderson, Hattie McDaniel, Ivan F. Simpson', 'NR', 'The trustees of Midwestern University have forced three teachers out of their jobs for being suspected communists. Trustee Ed Keller has also threatened mild mannered English Professor Tommy Turner, because he plans to read a controversial piece of prose in class. Tommy is upset that his wife Ellen also suggested he not read the passage. Meanwhile, Ellen''s old boyfriend, the football player Joe Ferguson, comes to visit for the homecoming weekend. He takes Ellen out dancing after the football rally, causing Tommy to worry that he will lose her to Joe.', 'The trustees of Midwestern University have forced three teachers out of their jobs for being suspected communists. Trustee Ed Keller has also threatened mild mannered English Professor Tommy Turner, because he plans to read a controversial piece of prose in class. Tommy is upset that his wife Ellen also suggested he not read the passage. Meanwhile, Ellen''s old boyfriend, the football player Joe Ferguson, comes to visit for the homecoming weekend. He takes Ellen out dancing after the football rally, causing Tommy to worry that he will lose her to Joe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDluLy4Q3FFAogmAzZ6Y3dPJyHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90978'),
  ('991173139585128452', 'The Males', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Gilles Carle, René Verzier, Marie Couturier', 'Gilles Carle', 'Donald Pilon, René Blouin, Andrée Pelletier, Katerine Mousseau, Guy L''Écuyer, J. Léo Gagnon, Joël Denis, Marc Gélinas', null, 'Two incredibly primitive backwoods types have just been released from prison for kidnapping the local police chief''s daughter but still have a hankering for a woman. When they return to their campsite, they discover a woodland nymph whom they both bed and who drives them wild. Jealousy arises.', 'Two incredibly primitive backwoods types have just been released from prison for kidnapping the local police chief''s daughter but still have a hankering for a woman. When they return to their campsite, they discover a woodland nymph whom they both bed and who drives them wild. Jealousy arises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcHNSKUZYHFGk1TCbg86oelULXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171212'),
  ('228594062444524415', 'The Malibu Bikini Shop', 1986, 'Comedy', 'David Wechter, Tom Richmond, Clifford C. Coleman', 'David Wechter', 'Michael David Wright, Bruce Greenwood, Amanda Horan Kennedy, Debra Blee, Jay Robinson, Galyn Görg, Ami Julius, Frank Nelson', 'R', 'After inheriting a failing bikini shop, two recent grads decide to make a go of it. One, in the hopes of building it into a successful business, the other, in the hopes of getting to look at lots of women in (and out) of swimsuits. As they try more and more outrageous ways of drumming up business, their antics begin attracting some unwanted attention.', 'After inheriting a failing bikini shop, two recent grads decide to make a go of it. One, in the hopes of building it into a successful business, the other, in the hopes of getting to look at lots of women in (and out) of swimsuits. As they try more and more outrageous ways of drumming up business, their antics begin attracting some unwanted attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qD0Q7Q9K6LSKFtug1heQdjAllvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30296'),
  ('149135628408106528', 'The Maltese Falcon', 1931, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Roy Del Ruth, William Rees', 'Maude Fulton, Brown Holmes', 'Ricardo Cortez, Bebe Daniels, Dudley Digges, Una Merkel, Robert Elliott, Thelma Todd, Otto Matieson, Walter Long', 'NR', 'A lovely dame with dangerous lies employs the services of a private detective, who is quickly caught up in the mystery and intrigue of a statuette known as the Maltese Falcon.', 'A lovely dame with dangerous lies employs the services of a private detective, who is quickly caught up in the mystery and intrigue of a statuette known as the Maltese Falcon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpE6gucVjusGXSS4lcSjqIWCeAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28257'),
  ('261918945992897459', 'The Mambo Kings', 1992, 'Drama, Music', 'Arne Glimcher, Michael Ballhaus', 'Cynthia Cidre', 'Antonio Banderas, Armand Assante, Cathy Moriarty, Maruschka Detmers, Pablo Calogero, Scott Cohen, Desi Arnaz Jr., Mario Grillo', 'R', 'The Mambo Kings tells the story of César and Nestor Castillo, brothers and aspiring musicians who flee from Cuba to America in search of the American Dream.', 'The Mambo Kings tells the story of César and Nestor Castillo, brothers and aspiring musicians who flee from Cuba to America in search of the American Dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAMYoODA6FzHPwycrBwwrjKv1A4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40082'),
  ('475808226181555131', 'The Mammals of Victoria', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'The film begins with a series of horizontally running ocean tide waves, sometimes with mountains in the background, hand-painted patterns, sometimes step-printed hand-painting, abstractions composed of distorted (jammed) TV shapes in shades of blue with occasional red, refractions of light within the camera lens, sometimes mixed with reflections of water. Increasingly closer images of water, and of light reflected off water, as well as of bursts of fire, intersperse the long shots, the seascapes and all the other interwoven imagery. Eventually a distant volleyball arcs across the sky: this is closely followed by, and interspersed with, silhouettes of a young man and woman in the sea, which leads to some extremely out-of-focus images from a front car window, an opening between soft-focus trees, a clearing. Carved wooden teeth suddenly sweep across the frame. Then the film ends on some soft-focus horizon lines, foregrounded by ocean.', 'The film begins with a series of horizontally running ocean tide waves, sometimes with mountains in the background, hand-painted patterns, sometimes step-printed hand-painting, abstractions composed of distorted (jammed) TV shapes in shades of blue with occasional red, refractions of light within the camera lens, sometimes mixed with reflections of water. Increasingly closer images of water, and of light reflected off water, as well as of bursts of fire, intersperse the long shots, the seascapes and all the other interwoven imagery. Eventually a distant volleyball arcs across the sky: this is closely followed by, and interspersed with, silhouettes of a young man and woman in the sea, which leads to some extremely out-of-focus images from a front car window, an opening between soft-focus trees, a clearing. Carved wooden teeth suddenly sweep across the frame. Then the film ends on some soft-focus horizon lines, foregrounded by ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bq3dB3l7SXobVdeaUPDBjXqW9KY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164604'),
  ('639499418441457067', 'The Man', 2005, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Les Mayfield, Adam Kane, Walter Lawlor', 'Jim Piddock, Margaret Oberman, Stephen Carpenter', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Eugene Levy, Luke Goss, Miguel Ferrer, Susie Essman, Anthony Mackie, Gigi Rice, Rachael Crawford', 'PG-13', 'A case of mistaken identity forces a Federal agent and a dental supply salesman to team up as they speed through the streets of Detroit to pull off a sting operation and solve the murder of the agent''s former partner.', 'A case of mistaken identity forces a Federal agent and a dental supply salesman to team up as they speed through the streets of Detroit to pull off a sting operation and solve the murder of the agent''s former partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnofwLKvg2g7Ky9sSpyTHaan37n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9074'),
  ('459506512764405993', 'The Man and the Monster', 1959, 'Horror', 'Rafael Baledón, Gustavo César Carrión, James L. Fields', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Enrique Rambal, Martha Roth, Abel Salazar, Ofelia Guilmáin, José Chávez, Maricarmen Vela, Carlos Suárez, Ana Laura Baledón', null, 'A failed pianist sells his soul to the devil in return for his becoming the greatest musician in the world. The catch: every time he plays he turns into a horrible monster.', 'A failed pianist sells his soul to the devil in return for his becoming the greatest musician in the world. The catch: every time he plays he turns into a horrible monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHAGg9XKMgVgOcYpYHRl1b11eWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90111'),
  ('20498923245538533', 'The Man Between', 1953, 'Thriller', 'Carol Reed, Desmond Dickinson, Hans Schneeberger', 'Harry Kurnitz, Walter Ebert', 'Claire Bloom, James Mason, Hildegard Knef, Geoffrey Toone, Hilde Sessak, Aribert Wäscher, Ernst Schröder, Dieter Krause', 'NR', 'A British woman on a visit to post-war Berlin is caught up in an espionage ring smuggling secrets into and out of the Eastern Bloc.', 'A British woman on a visit to post-war Berlin is caught up in an espionage ring smuggling secrets into and out of the Eastern Bloc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXKmv6vF17wntw0s1vHVgm2DQze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3014'),
  ('1067441380030335944', 'The Man by the Shore', 1993, 'Drama', 'Raoul Peck, Armand Marco', 'André Graill, Raoul Peck', 'Jennifer Zubar, Toto Bissainthe, Patrick Rameau, Jean-Michel Martial, Mireille Metellus, Magaly Berdy, Aïlo Auguste-Judith, Albert Delpy', null, 'Early 1960s Haiti during ''Papa Doc'' Duvalier''s dictatorship seen through the eyes of a young girl whose family has suffered heavily.', 'Early 1960s Haiti during ''Papa Doc'' Duvalier''s dictatorship seen through the eyes of a young girl whose family has suffered heavily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmFJU7dYRdeie7NorGf0jJGQIVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4976'),
  ('701029228382170022', 'The Man Called Flintstone', 1966, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Music, Mystery, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera, Richard Olso', 'R.S. Allen, Harvey Bullock', 'Alan Reed, Mel Blanc, Jean Vander Pyl, Gerry Johnson, Don Messick, Janet Waldo, Paul Frees, Harvey Korman', 'NR', 'In this feature-length film based on the "Flintstones" TV show, secret agent Rock Slag is injured during a chase in Bedrock. Slag''s chief decides to replace the injured Slag with Fred Flintstone, who just happens to look like him. The trip takes Fred to Paris and Rome, which is good for Wilma, Barney, and Betty, but can Fred foil the mysterious Green Goose''s evil plan for a destructive missile without letting his wife and friends in on his secret?', 'In this feature-length film based on the "Flintstones" TV show, secret agent Rock Slag is injured during a chase in Bedrock. Slag''s chief decides to replace the injured Slag with Fred Flintstone, who just happens to look like him. The trip takes Fred to Paris and Rome, which is good for Wilma, Barney, and Betty, but can Fred foil the mysterious Green Goose''s evil plan for a destructive missile without letting his wife and friends in on his secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nnVtJjLQmRcHhJNeyP5UYnkfE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42515'),
  ('1077981705994611148', 'The Man Called Noon', 1973, 'Western', 'Peter Collinson, John Cabrera, José María Ochoa', 'Scot Finch, Antonio Recoder', 'Richard Crenna, Stephen Boyd, Rosanna Schiaffino, Farley Granger, Patty Shepard, Ángel del Pozo, Howard Ross, Aldo Sambrell', 'R', 'Noon is a gunfighter who has become amnesiac. Helped by Rimes, an outlaw who has befriended him, he tries to figure out who he is actually. It gradually appears that his wife and kid have been murdered. As time goes by, Noon also recalls a fortune hidden somewhere. Niland, a scheming judge, and Peg Cullane, a greedy will do everything to prevent Noon and Rimes from achieving their end while Fan Davidge, a woman living in a ghost town, will support them.', 'Noon is a gunfighter who has become amnesiac. Helped by Rimes, an outlaw who has befriended him, he tries to figure out who he is actually. It gradually appears that his wife and kid have been murdered. As time goes by, Noon also recalls a fortune hidden somewhere. Niland, a scheming judge, and Peg Cullane, a greedy will do everything to prevent Noon and Rimes from achieving their end while Fan Davidge, a woman living in a ghost town, will support them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBGvXMRV4OWpun7P9BFVJb7J3vN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134223'),
  ('406624974011048716', 'The Man Cave', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Franziska Meyer Price, Bernhard Jasper', 'Rainer Ewerrien, Kristof Magnusson, David Ungureit', 'Detlev Buck, Christoph Maria Herbst, Elyas M''Barek, Dominic Boeer, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Cosma Shiva Hagen, Serkan Çetinkaya, Jasmin Schwiers', null, 'Quotas for women, parking spaces for women, online shopping, small talk and gossip. Software developer Erol, porta-potty rep Lars, and commercial pilot Helmut are licking the wounds of their masculinity – a female-free zone is what’s needed! In the boiler room of their recently built housing complex, the three stressed husbands create a secret refuge where they can watch football, eat fast-food, drink beer and curse the opposite sex undisturbed. When Aykut, the complex’s facility manager, discovers their last bastion of masculinity, he threatens to close it down. One thing is for sure, the men are not going to give up their little slice of paradise without a fight. Based on the stage play bearing the same name, director Franziska Meyer Price allows men to return to rebellious ladhood.', 'Quotas for women, parking spaces for women, online shopping, small talk and gossip. Software developer Erol, porta-potty rep Lars, and commercial pilot Helmut are licking the wounds of their masculinity – a female-free zone is what’s needed! In the boiler room of their recently built housing complex, the three stressed husbands create a secret refuge where they can watch football, eat fast-food, drink beer and curse the opposite sex undisturbed. When Aykut, the complex’s facility manager, discovers their last bastion of masculinity, he threatens to close it down. One thing is for sure, the men are not going to give up their little slice of paradise without a fight. Based on the stage play bearing the same name, director Franziska Meyer Price allows men to return to rebellious ladhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3u5JDaS0LqXQJJIhNY9Ltih5f6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290599'),
  ('1086627736128213418', 'The Man from Beyond', 1922, 'Mystery, Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'Burton L. King, Harry Fischbeck, Louis Dunmyre', 'Coolidge Streeter, Harry Houdini', 'Harry Houdini, Arthur Maude, Albert Tavernier, Erwin Connelly, Frank Montgomery, Luis Alberni, Yale Benner, Jane Connelly', null, 'The Arctic, 1922. After being buried under the ice for a hundred years, Howard Hillary is thawed and revived. When he meets Felice Strange, he recognizes in her the same woman he once loved deeply. But is it really her?', 'The Arctic, 1922. After being buried under the ice for a hundred years, Howard Hillary is thawed and revived. When he meets Felice Strange, he recognizes in her the same woman he once loved deeply. But is it really her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vJuJCR3sylDeYKmQ9VrKpBC6r8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171432'),
  ('690390129064652227', 'The Man from Bitter Ridge', 1955, 'Western', 'Jack Arnold, Marshall Green, Russell Metty', 'Lawrence Roman', 'Lex Barker, Mara Corday, Stephen McNally, John Dehner, Trevor Bardette, Ray Teal, Myron Healey, Warren Stevens', null, 'The Man from Bitter Ridge is a film directed by Jack Arnold. Jeff Carr, a special investigator, arrives in Tomahawk. His assignment is to discover who has been holding up the local stagecoach and is guilty for a series of killings that terrorize the town. Sheepman Alec Black is suspected by the local population but it is not long before Jeff realizes the man is innocent. Alec even becomes a good friend although he is in love with the same woman as him, Holly. Jeff will manage to arrest the real culprits but not before the latter try to compromise him down.', 'The Man from Bitter Ridge is a film directed by Jack Arnold. Jeff Carr, a special investigator, arrives in Tomahawk. His assignment is to discover who has been holding up the local stagecoach and is guilty for a series of killings that terrorize the town. Sheepman Alec Black is suspected by the local population but it is not long before Jeff realizes the man is innocent. Alec even becomes a good friend although he is in love with the same woman as him, Holly. Jeff will manage to arrest the real culprits but not before the latter try to compromise him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u8topUCFgPFSLcoO2uV7McYVw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210673'),
  ('801266411599010127', 'The Man from Colorado', 1948, 'Western, Drama', 'Henry Levin, William E. Snyder', 'Robert Hardy Andrews, Ben Maddow', 'Glenn Ford, William Holden, Ellen Drew, Ray Collins, Edgar Buchanan, Jerome Courtland, James Millican, Jim Bannon', 'NR', 'Two friends return home after their discharge from the army after the Civil War. However, one of them has had deep-rooted psychological damage due to his experiences during the war, and as his behavior becomes more erratic--and violent--his friend desperately tries to find a way to help him.', 'Two friends return home after their discharge from the army after the Civil War. However, one of them has had deep-rooted psychological damage due to his experiences during the war, and as his behavior becomes more erratic--and violent--his friend desperately tries to find a way to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14x3trG2gMUxIJ3Vca26JfXhwBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60646'),
  ('1075845315252052903', 'The Man from Earth', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Richard Schenkman, Afshin Shahidi', 'Jerome Bixby', 'David Lee Smith, Tony Todd, John Billingsley, Ellen Crawford, Annika Peterson, Alexis Thorpe, William Katt, Richard Riehle', 'NR', 'A departing professor gathers his closest colleagues for an intimate farewell, but the night takes an unexpected turn when he shares a stunning secret about his past. As the conversation unfolds, skepticism and curiosity collide, challenging everything they thought they knew about history, science, and belief.', 'A departing professor gathers his closest colleagues for an intimate farewell, but the night takes an unexpected turn when he shares a stunning secret about his past. As the conversation unfolds, skepticism and curiosity collide, challenging everything they thought they knew about history, science, and belief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/V086R82gNgWrotaXZFO4JhdgB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13363'),
  ('854433270711653732', 'The Man from Earth: Holocene', 2017, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Richard Schenkman, Richard J. Vialet', 'Richard Schenkman, Emerson Bixby', 'David Lee Smith, Vanessa Williams, Michael Dorn, William Katt, Sterling Knight, Brittany Curran, Davi Santos, Doug Haley', 'NR', '14,000-year-old "Man from Earth" John Oldman, now teaching in northern California, realizes that not only is he finally starting to age, but four students have discovered his deepest secret, putting his life in grave danger and potentially destroying the world''s most popular religion.', '14,000-year-old "Man from Earth" John Oldman, now teaching in northern California, realizes that not only is he finally starting to age, but four students have discovered his deepest secret, putting his life in grave danger and potentially destroying the world''s most popular religion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krOWstmTUdfafRbXH9YAjVj2zE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415312'),
  ('174912187571549819', 'The Man from Elysian Fields', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Hickenlooper, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Phillip Jayson Lasker', 'Andy Garcia, Julianna Margulies, Anjelica Huston, Olivia Williams, Mick Jagger, James Coburn, Susan Barnes, Michael Des Barres', null, 'A failed novelist''s inability to pay the bills strains relations with his wife and leads him to work at an escort service, where he becomes entwined with a wealthy woman whose husband is a successful writer.', 'A failed novelist''s inability to pay the bills strains relations with his wife and leads him to work at an escort service, where he becomes entwined with a wealthy woman whose husband is a successful writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCUzyYDMHNdihZVTVH1g3KvTo8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15720'),
  ('342748115792845122', 'The Man from Hong Kong', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Adventure, Drama', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Russell Boyd, Hal McElroy', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, George Lazenby, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Roger Ward, Rosalind Speirs, Grant Page, Rebecca Gilling, Frank Thring', null, 'Australian authorities arrest a man believed to be connected to the Sydney criminal underworld and send for Inspector Fang Sing Leng from Hong Kong to question him. After the alleged criminal is assassinated, Inspector Leng and the Sydney police try to hunt down those responsible and hope to solve their case along the way.', 'Australian authorities arrest a man believed to be connected to the Sydney criminal underworld and send for Inspector Fang Sing Leng from Hong Kong to question him. After the alleged criminal is assassinated, Inspector Leng and the Sydney police try to hunt down those responsible and hope to solve their case along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCLUFxMNxcutYcSXbMySWDJvAUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21990'),
  ('239437409263459386', 'The Man from Laramie', 1955, 'Drama, Western', 'Charles Lang, Anthony Mann, William Holland', 'Philip Yordan, Frank Burt', 'James Stewart, Arthur Kennedy, Donald Crisp, Cathy O''Donnell, Alex Nicol, Aline MacMahon, Wallace Ford, Jack Elam', 'NR', 'Will Lockhart arrives in Coronado, an isolated town in New Mexico, in search of someone who sells rifles to the Apache tribe, finding himself unwillingly drawn into the convoluted life of a local ranching family whose members seem to have a lot to hide.', 'Will Lockhart arrives in Coronado, an isolated town in New Mexico, in search of someone who sells rifles to the Apache tribe, finding himself unwillingly drawn into the convoluted life of a local ranching family whose members seem to have a lot to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKMZoZpN0FobSIDAlj5Ixv0kDeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18264'),
  ('189468856849121998', 'The Man from London', 2008, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Béla Tarr, László Nemes, Ágnes Hranitzky', 'Béla Tarr, László Krasznahorkai', 'Miroslav Krobot, Tilda Swinton, János Derzsi, Ági Szirtes, Gyula Pauer, Erika Bók, István Lénárt, Mihály Kormos', null, 'A switchman at a seaside railway witnesses a murder but does not report it after he finds a suitcase full of money at the scene of the crime.', 'A switchman at a seaside railway witnesses a murder but does not report it after he finds a suitcase full of money at the scene of the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poBhgpN4fJfzaRuG4wMLah3rHLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31262'),
  ('35250752436555074', 'The Man from Majorca', 1984, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Bo Widerberg, Thomas Wahlberg', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Sven Wollter, Tomas von Brömssen, Håkan Serner, Ernst Günther, Thomas Hellberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Niels Jensen, Tommy Johnson', null, 'On 13 December (St Lucy''s Day), a bandit daringly robs a crowded post office. Within a fortnight, two witnesses are dead. Vice cops Johansson and Jarnebring, the first to the scene of the crime, pursue all leads and identify a suspect, an arrogant member of the elite secret police, assigned to guard the country''s Minister of Justice. Just as they think they''ve tightened the noose around the suspect, loose ends appear, witnesses lose certainty, alibis arise, and even the cops doubt what they''ve seen. Who''s protecting the suspect and why?', 'On 13 December (St Lucy''s Day), a bandit daringly robs a crowded post office. Within a fortnight, two witnesses are dead. Vice cops Johansson and Jarnebring, the first to the scene of the crime, pursue all leads and identify a suspect, an arrogant member of the elite secret police, assigned to guard the country''s Minister of Justice. Just as they think they''ve tightened the noose around the suspect, loose ends appear, witnesses lose certainty, alibis arise, and even the cops doubt what they''ve seen. Who''s protecting the suspect and why?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHlJJd4dGYo7OPJumDkPON8yt7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52331'),
  ('941061601970497211', 'The Man from Monterey', 1933, 'Action, Western', 'Mack V. Wright, Ted D. McCord', 'Leslie Mason', 'John Wayne, Duke, Ruth Hall, Luis Alberni, Donald Reed, Nina Quartero, Francis Ford, Lafe McKee', 'NR', 'A cavalry officer helps save a family''s ranch from land grabbers', 'A cavalry officer helps save a family''s ranch from land grabbers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dksd3As6CRbhwpdeWwNwd39TyNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80592'),
  ('281982776074442364', 'The Man from Nowhere', 1937, 'Drama', 'Pierre Chenal', 'Pierre Chenal, Armand Salacrou, Christian Stengel', 'Pierre Blanchar, Isa Miranda, Robert Le Vigan, Ginette Leclerc, Catherine Fonteney, Charlotte Barbier-Krauss, Margo Lion, Sinoël', null, 'Mathias Pascal, saddled with a stupid wife and a nagging mother-in-law, leaves home and is extremely lucky at several gambling resorts. He returns home and discovers that a drowned man, fished out of the river, bears an uncanny likeness to him and is being buried by his family as him. This, to him, is a pleasant turn of events and he goes to Rome, where he falls in love with Louise Paleari. Count Papiano, a jealous suitor of Louise''s, threatens him with arrest unless he produces credentials to prove his identity.', 'Mathias Pascal, saddled with a stupid wife and a nagging mother-in-law, leaves home and is extremely lucky at several gambling resorts. He returns home and discovers that a drowned man, fished out of the river, bears an uncanny likeness to him and is being buried by his family as him. This, to him, is a pleasant turn of events and he goes to Rome, where he falls in love with Louise Paleari. Count Papiano, a jealous suitor of Louise''s, threatens him with arrest unless he produces credentials to prove his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fn6motTAAy54LVyGaXUap9rLLIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354177'),
  ('392397081121828509', 'The Man from Nowhere', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Lee Chol-o, Lee Jeong-beom, Lee Tae-yoon', 'Lee Jeong-beom', 'Won Bin, Kim Sae-ron, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Hie-won, Kim Seung-o, Lee Jong-pil, Thanayong Wongtrakul, Kim Hyo-seo', 'R', 'A reclusive pawnshop owner goes on a brutal rampage to rescue a young girl kidnapped by a criminal organization.', 'A reclusive pawnshop owner goes on a brutal rampage to rescue a young girl kidnapped by a criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld19CFIo27t41JXSGZdaPMUGTxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51608'),
  ('1132529860086512880', 'The Man from Planet X', 1951, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, John L. Russell, Lester D. Guthrie', 'Aubrey Wisberg, Jack Pollexfen', 'Robert Clarke, Margaret Field, Raymond Bond, William Schallert, Roy Engel, David Ormont, Gilbert Fallman, Pat Goldin', null, 'While watching for a planet that may collide with earth, scientists stationed in Scotland are approached by a visitor from outer space.', 'While watching for a planet that may collide with earth, scientists stationed in Scotland are approached by a visitor from outer space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bA8TbHq96DaWxml0j3OneCBjrJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50153'),
  ('809963846386690626', 'The Man from Rome', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Sergio Dow, Aitor Mantxola', 'Sergio Dow, Adrian Bol, Luis Zelkowicz', 'Richard Armitage, Franco Nero, Paul Freeman, Carlos Cuevas, Fionnula Flanagan, Paul Guilfoyle, Will Keen, Amaia Salamanca', 'NR', 'A computer hacker penetrates Vatican security and sends an urgent anonymous plea to the pope. Handsome Father Quart, of the church''s Institute of External Affairs, an arm of the Vatican intelligence, is dispatched to investigate. The message of the hacker concerns a crumbling 17th century Baroque church in the heart of Seville that apparently "kills to defend itself".', 'A computer hacker penetrates Vatican security and sends an urgent anonymous plea to the pope. Handsome Father Quart, of the church''s Institute of External Affairs, an arm of the Vatican intelligence, is dispatched to investigate. The message of the hacker concerns a crumbling 17th century Baroque church in the heart of Seville that apparently "kills to defend itself".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBfkQHFs2Xrerd9Ragul7IgWaUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029862'),
  ('573976044148609543', 'The Man from Snowy River', 1982, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure, Western, Family', 'George T. Miller, Jan Elliott, Murray Newey', 'John Dixon', 'Tom Burlinson, Sigrid Thornton, Terence Donovan, Kirk Douglas, Jack Thompson, Tommy Dysart, Tony Bonner, Chris Haywood', 'PG', 'Jim Craig has lived his first 18 years in the mountains of Australia on his father''s farm. The death of his father forces him to go to the lowlands to earn enough money to get the farm back on its feet.', 'Jim Craig has lived his first 18 years in the mountains of Australia on his father''s farm. The death of his father forces him to go to the lowlands to earn enough money to get the farm back on its feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1alAfoJf7Pjn0QuwzO9wY7SLQCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24266'),
  ('1141371350182794299', 'The Man From Snowy River II', 1988, 'Adventure, Western', 'Geoff Burrowes, Keith Wagstaff', 'John Dixon, Geoff Burrowes', 'Tom Burlinson, Sigrid Thornton, Brian Dennehy, Nicholas Eadie, Mark Hembrow, Bryan Marshall, Rhys McConnochie, Peter Cummins', 'PG', 'After a few years trying to earn money to marry Jessica Harrison, Jim Craig returns to Snowy River. But he finds that a lot of things have changed.', 'After a few years trying to earn money to marry Jessica Harrison, Jim Craig returns to Snowy River. But he finds that a lot of things have changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6I94myoMi28trV8lxDq2DWhzLFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13965'),
  ('708919345758432742', 'The Man from the Alamo', 1953, 'Western', 'Budd Boetticher, Tom Shaw, Russell Metty', 'Steve Fisher, D.D. Beauchamp', 'Glenn Ford, Julie Adams, Chill Wills, Hugh O''Brian, Victor Jory, Neville Brand, John Daheim, Myra Marsh', 'NR', 'During the war for Texas independence, one man leaves the Alamo before the end (chosen by lot to help others'' families) but is too late to accomplish his mission, and is branded a coward. Since he cannot now expose a gang of turncoats, he infiltrates them instead. Can he save a wagon train of refugees from Wade''s Guerillas?', 'During the war for Texas independence, one man leaves the Alamo before the end (chosen by lot to help others'' families) but is too late to accomplish his mission, and is branded a coward. Since he cannot now expose a gang of turncoats, he infiltrates them instead. Can he save a wagon train of refugees from Wade''s Guerillas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfbzo1t4hCbK28aXeeGfGSv5aLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38808'),
  ('325687450337725387', 'The Man from the Future', 2011, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Cláudio Torres, Ricardo Della Rosa, Isabel Valiante', 'Cláudio Torres', 'Wagner Moura, Alinne Moraes, Maria Luísa Mendonça, Fernando Ceylão, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Daniel Uemura, José Steimberg, Malu Rodrigues', 'PG-13', 'Zero is a brilliant scientist. However, 20 years ago, he was publicly humiliated when he lost Helena, the love of his life. One day, an accidental experience with one of his inventions causes him to travel back in time to 1991. Having taken the opportunity to change history, Zero returns to own time to find totally changed.', 'Zero is a brilliant scientist. However, 20 years ago, he was publicly humiliated when he lost Helena, the love of his life. One day, an accidental experience with one of his inventions causes him to travel back in time to 1991. Having taken the opportunity to change history, Zero returns to own time to find totally changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWfdBMbe3SodE14h3VptXy6sQZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73624'),
  ('668263329024574667', 'The Man from the Sea', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Koji Fukada', 'Koji Fukada', 'Dean Fujioka, Mayu Tsuruta, Taiga Nakano, Junko Abe, Adipati Dolken, Sekar Sari, Sha Ine Febriyanti, Zainuddin Idris', null, 'A man is found washed up on a beach in Banda Aceh, Indonesia, suffering from amnesia and speaking in broken Indonesian and Japanese.', 'A man is found washed up on a beach in Banda Aceh, Indonesia, suffering from amnesia and speaking in broken Indonesian and Japanese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etCZhqruOMVOSDjqeJS36Un1hU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500861'),
  ('560496460223770554', 'The Man from Toronto', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Rob Hardy, Eric Heffron, Aric Dupere', 'Chris Bremner, Robbie Fox', 'Kevin Hart, Woody Harrelson, Kaley Cuoco, Jasmine Mathews, Lela Loren, Pierson Fodé, Jencarlos Canela, Ellen Barkin', 'PG-13', 'A case of mistaken identity forces a bumbling entrepreneur to team up with a notorious assassin known as The Man from Toronto in hopes of staying alive.', 'A case of mistaken identity forces a bumbling entrepreneur to team up with a notorious assassin known as The Man from Toronto in hopes of staying alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTCfTibqtk4f90cC59bLPMOmsfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667739'),
  ('549649762256486081', 'The Man from U.N.C.L.E.', 2015, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Guy Ritchie, John Mathieson, Anna Bregman', 'Guy Ritchie, Lionel Wigram', 'Henry Cavill, Armie Hammer, Alicia Vikander, Elizabeth Debicki, Luca Calvani, Sylvester Groth, Hugh Grant, Jared Harris', 'PG-13', 'At the height of the Cold War, a mysterious criminal organization plans to use nuclear weapons and technology to upset the fragile balance of power between the United States and Soviet Union. CIA agent Napoleon Solo and KGB agent Illya Kuryakin are forced to put aside their hostilities and work together to stop the evildoers in their tracks. The duo''s only lead is the daughter of a missing German scientist, whom they must find soon to prevent a global catastrophe.', 'At the height of the Cold War, a mysterious criminal organization plans to use nuclear weapons and technology to upset the fragile balance of power between the United States and Soviet Union. CIA agent Napoleon Solo and KGB agent Illya Kuryakin are forced to put aside their hostilities and work together to stop the evildoers in their tracks. The duo''s only lead is the daughter of a missing German scientist, whom they must find soon to prevent a global catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5yZaForGSJbPD66Cvq9AT5WMAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203801'),
  ('636094437707469896', 'The Man from Utah', 1934, 'Action, Adventure, Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, Archie Stout', 'Lindsley Parsons', 'John Wayne, Polly Ann Young, Anita Campillo, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Edward Peil Sr., Yakima Canutt, George Cleveland, Lafe McKee', 'G', 'The Marshal sends John Weston to a rodeo to see if he can find out who is killing the rodeo riders who are about to win the prize money. Barton has organized the rodeo and plans to leave with all the prize money put up by the townspeople. When it appears that Weston will beat Barton''s rider, he has his men prepare the same fate for him that befell the other riders.', 'The Marshal sends John Weston to a rodeo to see if he can find out who is killing the rodeo riders who are about to win the prize money. Barton has organized the rodeo and plans to leave with all the prize money put up by the townspeople. When it appears that Weston will beat Barton''s rider, he has his men prepare the same fate for him that befell the other riders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aP8xAUCwVakayNApyXBNZ9dPiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53622'),
  ('191424067716567473', 'The Man I Love', 1946, 'Drama, Music', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, Ridgeway Callow', 'Catherine Turney', 'Ida Lupino, Robert Alda, Andrea King, Martha Vickers, Bruce Bennett, Alan Hale, Dolores Moran, John Ridgely', 'NR', 'Tough torch singer Petey Brown, visiting her family, finds a nest of troubles: her sister, brother, and the neighbor''s wife are involved in various ways with shady nightclub owner Nicky Toresca. Petey has what it takes to handle Nicky, but then she meets San Thomas, formerly great jazz pianist now on the skids, and falls for him hard.', 'Tough torch singer Petey Brown, visiting her family, finds a nest of troubles: her sister, brother, and the neighbor''s wife are involved in various ways with shady nightclub owner Nicky Toresca. Petey has what it takes to handle Nicky, but then she meets San Thomas, formerly great jazz pianist now on the skids, and falls for him hard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65XBeEUjTLSPR8vnCrvN8XsyqSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26663'),
  ('441215648355276658', 'The Man I Love', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stéphane Giusti, Didier Carteron, Frédérique Juhel', 'Stéphane Giusti', 'Jean-Michel Portal, Marcial Di Fonzo Bo, Mathilde Seigner, Vittoria Scognamiglio, Jacques Hansen, Stéphane Lévêque, Karim Lounis, Bernard Nissile', null, 'This is a combination coming out and first love story. The swimmer and diver Lucard is interested in attractive Martin. The film follows the characters'' coming out with all its difficulties, the bitter-sweet pleasures of first love and the dreadful moment when one comes down to reality and realizes that one''s beloved friend has a hard way to go yet. The positive message the film tries to transmit is the somewhat common motto "Live each day of your life as if it were your last."', 'This is a combination coming out and first love story. The swimmer and diver Lucard is interested in attractive Martin. The film follows the characters'' coming out with all its difficulties, the bitter-sweet pleasures of first love and the dreadful moment when one comes down to reality and realizes that one''s beloved friend has a hard way to go yet. The positive message the film tries to transmit is the somewhat common motto "Live each day of your life as if it were your last."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDAA2Lbn3M0Tnj74iwBd0wBe1kF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19654'),
  ('5656128712567687', 'The Man I Married', 1940, 'Drama', 'Irving Pichel, J. Peverell Marley', 'Oliver H.P. Garrett', 'Joan Bennett, Francis Lederer, Lloyd Nolan, Anna Sten, Otto Kruger, Maria Ouspenskaya, Ludwig Stössel, Johnny Russell', 'NR', 'An American vacations in Europe with her husband and watches him turn into a Nazi.', 'An American vacations in Europe with her husband and watches him turn into a Nazi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGHcD3RmZPqMiqBF5ySZCvOtCQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177790'),
  ('48412169564753850', 'The Man in Black', 1950, 'Thriller', 'Francis Searle, Cedric Williams, Jimmy Sangster', 'John Gilling', 'Betty Ann Davies, Sheila Burrell, Sidney James, Anthony Forwood, Hazel Penwarden, Valentine Dyall, Courtney Hope, Mollie Palmer', null, 'A woman conspires to steal her stepdaughter''s inheritance following the mysterious death of her millionaire husband.', 'A woman conspires to steal her stepdaughter''s inheritance following the mysterious death of her millionaire husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feQTmMDgvGfxGKIqTdsGw25pgiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193372'),
  ('396312754006865456', 'The Man in Grey', 1943, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leslie Arliss, Arthur Crabtree, Louis Levy', 'Doreen Montgomery', 'Margaret Lockwood, Phyllis Calvert, James Mason, Stewart Granger, Harry Scott, Beatrice Varley, Martita Hunt, Helen Haye', 'NR', 'After marrying a dour and disinterested lord for status, a young woman falls in love with a stage actor while her best friend from boarding school enters an affair with her husband.', 'After marrying a dour and disinterested lord for status, a young woman falls in love with a stage actor while her best friend from boarding school enters an affair with her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byqKdKW2XgVoQ1nhJYEuzAuyYwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41996'),
  ('901658506292040202', 'The Man in My Basement', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nadia Latif, Ula Pontikos, Jeroen Bogaert', 'Walter Mosley, Nadia Latif', 'Corey Hawkins, Willem Dafoe, Anna Diop, Jonathan Ajayi, Gershwyn Eustache Jnr, Pamela Nomvete, Tamara Lawrance, Brian Bovell', 'R', 'Down on his luck, Charles Blakey agrees to rent his basement to a mysterious stranger, unaware he may be letting in a force much darker than he imagined.', 'Down on his luck, Charles Blakey agrees to rent his basement to a mysterious stranger, unaware he may be letting in a force much darker than he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zpeH8wOrM8p2TTAmBetwhe2BIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957121'),
  ('548618696241605056', 'The Man in the Basement', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Guillaume Deffontaines, Philippe Le Guay', 'Gilles Taurand, Philippe Le Guay', 'François Cluzet, Bérénice Bejo, Jérémie Renier, Jonathan Zaccaï, Martine Chevallier, Jack Claudany, Antoine Levannier, Victoria Eber', null, 'A Parisian couple decides to sell an unsanitary basement in their building. A very ordinary, nondescript man, Mr. Fonzic, shows up to buy it. Nothing unusual there, until the man moves into the cellar and makes it his permanent residence. The couple tries desperately to cancel the sale but to no avail. Worse, Mr. Fonzic becomes a threat to their family as he befriends their teenage daughter on whom he seems to exert a perverted influence.', 'A Parisian couple decides to sell an unsanitary basement in their building. A very ordinary, nondescript man, Mr. Fonzic, shows up to buy it. Nothing unusual there, until the man moves into the cellar and makes it his permanent residence. The couple tries desperately to cancel the sale but to no avail. Worse, Mr. Fonzic becomes a threat to their family as he befriends their teenage daughter on whom he seems to exert a perverted influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HtI86nxQSy924wgYNBxWi3VH2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796891'),
  ('1138829101051741104', 'The Man in the Brown Suit', 1989, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Alan Grint, Ken Westbury', null, 'Rue McClanahan, Tony Randall, Edward Woodward, Stephanie Zimbalist, Ken Howard, Nickolas Grace, Simon Dutton, María Casal', null, 'An American woman gets involved in a diamond theft in South Africa.', 'An American woman gets involved in a diamond theft in South Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnzlhDn36gx1TsSeLBHGgNphExa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42036'),
  ('301379484171669779', 'The Man in the Buick', 1968, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Michel Legrand, Jean Tournier, Gilles Grangier', 'Gilles Grangier, Georges Godefroy', 'Fernandel, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Danielle Darrieux, Georges Descrières, Mario David, Bernard Dhéran, Claude Piéplu, Jacques Marin', null, 'Mr Jo, nicknamed "the man with the Buick", is the darling of the small town of Honfleur. But he is in fact a trafficker with a bad reputation who would like to forget about his past, now limiting himself to smuggling rubies under the cover of a charitable organization which offers underprivileged children holidays in Switzerland. However, Mr. Jo is in love with a pretty widow and, in order to marry her, he is willing to get involved in a hold-up again. And "the man with the Buick", who seemed so honorable, will surprise the inhabitants of Honfleur when Inspector Menard reveals his secret activities.', 'Mr Jo, nicknamed "the man with the Buick", is the darling of the small town of Honfleur. But he is in fact a trafficker with a bad reputation who would like to forget about his past, now limiting himself to smuggling rubies under the cover of a charitable organization which offers underprivileged children holidays in Switzerland. However, Mr. Jo is in love with a pretty widow and, in order to marry her, he is willing to get involved in a hold-up again. And "the man with the Buick", who seemed so honorable, will surprise the inhabitants of Honfleur when Inspector Menard reveals his secret activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uhVp3Y6RdE82ZeikNTOny4jQor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79254'),
  ('814151865096834427', 'The Man in the Glass Booth', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Arthur Hiller, Sam Leavitt', 'Edward Anhalt', 'Maximilian Schell, Lois Nettleton, Lawrence Pressman, Luther Adler, Lloyd Bochner, Robert H. Harris, Henry Brown, Norbert Schiller', 'PG', 'Arthur Goldman is a rich Jewish industrialist, living in luxury in a Manhattan high-rise. He banters with his assistant Charlie, often shocking him with his outrageousness and irreverent musings on aspects of Jewish life. Nonetheless, Charlie is astonished one day when Israeli secret agents burst in and arrest Goldman for being a Nazi war criminal. Whisked to Israel for trial, Goldman forces his accusers to face, not only his presumed guilt, but their own.', 'Arthur Goldman is a rich Jewish industrialist, living in luxury in a Manhattan high-rise. He banters with his assistant Charlie, often shocking him with his outrageousness and irreverent musings on aspects of Jewish life. Nonetheless, Charlie is astonished one day when Israeli secret agents burst in and arrest Goldman for being a Nazi war criminal. Whisked to Israel for trial, Goldman forces his accusers to face, not only his presumed guilt, but their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl3kNLxWpUatLAgWE8jSH7c7Be4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48364'),
  ('1004970396253055404', 'The Man in the Gray Flannel Suit', 1956, 'Drama', 'Nunnally Johnson, Charles G. Clarke, Hal Herman', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Gregory Peck, Jennifer Jones, Fredric March, Marisa Pavan, Lee J. Cobb, Ann Harding, Keenan Wynn, Gene Lockhart', null, 'Tom Rath is a suburban father and husband haunted by his memories of World War II, including a wartime romance with Italian village girl Maria, which resulted in an illegitimate son he''s never seen. Pressed by his unhappy wife to get a higher-paying job, Rath goes to work as a public relations man for television network president Ralph Hopkins. Drawn into poisonous office politics, Tom finds he must choose his career or his family.', 'Tom Rath is a suburban father and husband haunted by his memories of World War II, including a wartime romance with Italian village girl Maria, which resulted in an illegitimate son he''s never seen. Pressed by his unhappy wife to get a higher-paying job, Rath goes to work as a public relations man for television network president Ralph Hopkins. Drawn into poisonous office politics, Tom finds he must choose his career or his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSsJcyfufRUx7eJ74NiW4Wiochc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28290'),
  ('737667646097463317', 'The Man in the Hat', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Warbeck, John-Paul Davidson, Kanamé Onoyama', 'Stephen Warbeck, John-Paul Davidson', 'Ciarán Hinds, Stephen Dillane, Maïwenn, Amit Shah, Brigitte Roüan, Mark Padmore, Claire Tran, Joseph Marcell', null, 'The Man In The Hat sets off from Marseilles in a small Fiat 500. On the seat beside him is a framed photograph of an unknown woman. Behind him is a 2CV into which is squeezed Five Bald Men. Why are they chasing him? And how can he shake them off? As he travels North through France, he encounters razeteurs, women with stories to tell, bullfights, plenty of delicious food, a damp man, mechanics, nuns, a convention of Chrystallographers and much more, coming face to face with the vivid eccentricities of an old country.', 'The Man In The Hat sets off from Marseilles in a small Fiat 500. On the seat beside him is a framed photograph of an unknown woman. Behind him is a 2CV into which is squeezed Five Bald Men. Why are they chasing him? And how can he shake them off? As he travels North through France, he encounters razeteurs, women with stories to tell, bullfights, plenty of delicious food, a damp man, mechanics, nuns, a convention of Chrystallographers and much more, coming face to face with the vivid eccentricities of an old country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYLhSAbVW1Wa9mRX05DGCL5X20w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737195'),
  ('612394046993410920', 'The Man in the Iron Mask', 1939, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'James Whale, Robert H. Planck, Edgar Anderson', 'George Bruce', 'Louis Hayward, Joan Bennett, Warren William, Joseph Schildkraut, Alan Hale, Walter Kingsford, Miles Mander, Bert Roach', 'NR', 'Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.', 'Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRA8czTcw7x0cVPCGgGYswGCJOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43836'),
  ('627612125019976119', 'The Man in the Iron Mask', 1977, 'History, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Mike Newell, Freddie Young', 'William Bast', 'Richard Chamberlain, Jenny Agutter, Patrick McGoohan, Louis Jourdan, Ian Holm, Vivien Merchant, Brenda Bruce, Ralph Richardson', 'NR', 'Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.', 'Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hReotlx9HXp6WqJLoBqfehqyMiq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4199'),
  ('710980245300838263', 'The Man in the Iron Mask', 1998, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Peter Suschitzky, Randall Wallace, David Tomblin', 'Randall Wallace', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Gabriel Byrne, Jeremy Irons, John Malkovich, Gérard Depardieu, Anne Parillaud, Judith Godrèche, Edward Atterton', 'PG-13', 'Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.', 'Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSLWIX3NzqFPWNMNX7FfeExHCRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9313'),
  ('119225417209130564', 'The Man in the Lower-Left Hand Corner of The Photograph', 1997, 'Animation, Horror', 'Robert Morgan', 'Robert Morgan', null, null, 'A man in a decaying room looks at an old photograph of himself and tries to recreate the happiness he once felt.', 'A man in a decaying room looks at an old photograph of himself and tries to recreate the happiness he once felt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aC8kbnDA2Xq92nUApyyWxxlsblK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123919'),
  ('668290602620247418', 'The Man in the Moon', 1991, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Robert Mulligan, Eric Wall, Freddie Francis', 'Jenny Wingfield', 'Reese Witherspoon, Jason London, Emily Warfield, Sam Waterston, Tess Harper, Gail Strickland, Bentley Mitchum, Ernie Lively', 'PG-13', 'Maureen Trant and her younger sibling Dani share a strong connection, but local boy Court Foster threatens to throw their bond off balance. Dani and Court meet first and have a flirtatious rapport -- but when he meets Maureen, he falls hard and they begin a passionate affair. The new couple try to keep their love hidden from Dani, but she soon learns the truth, disavowing her sister. But a heartbreaking accident later reunites the girls.', 'Maureen Trant and her younger sibling Dani share a strong connection, but local boy Court Foster threatens to throw their bond off balance. Dani and Court meet first and have a flirtatious rapport -- but when he meets Maureen, he falls hard and they begin a passionate affair. The new couple try to keep their love hidden from Dani, but she soon learns the truth, disavowing her sister. But a heartbreaking accident later reunites the girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57r0TXlqV5GIn4h0Htgh81OZou9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17474'),
  ('512474514989784878', 'The Man in the Net', 1959, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Michael Curtiz, John F. Seitz', 'Reginald Rose', 'Alan Ladd, Carolyn Jones, Diane Brewster, John Lupton, Charles McGraw, Tom Helmore, Betty Lou Holland, John Alexander', 'NR', 'An artist living in a quiet Connecticut town is the main suspect in the disappearance of his shrew wife. Things turn ugly when the townsfolk attempt to take the law into their own hands.', 'An artist living in a quiet Connecticut town is the main suspect in the disappearance of his shrew wife. Things turn ugly when the townsfolk attempt to take the law into their own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdJlxL96ZIOi9oB7Uq35cp9mlGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46434'),
  ('650778663169821795', 'The Man in the Raincoat', 1957, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Julien Duvivier, Roger Hubert', 'Julien Duvivier', 'Fernandel, Bernard Blier, Jacques Duby, Jean Rigaux, Judith Magre, Pierre Spiers, John McGiver, Armande Navarre', 'NR', 'In the absence of his wife, a clarinet player is induced by a friend to meet a call girl, but arrived after a crime. Perceived by some people leaving the scene of the crime covered by his raincoat, he became the only suspect for the police. His only hope is to discover the murderer before is name is mentionned publicly, specially in front of his wife.', 'In the absence of his wife, a clarinet player is induced by a friend to meet a call girl, but arrived after a crime. Perceived by some people leaving the scene of the crime covered by his raincoat, he became the only suspect for the police. His only hope is to discover the murderer before is name is mentionned publicly, specially in front of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2O0mS461fi72z3GNpUyRRSRCYoC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95455'),
  ('919876576416469144', 'The Man in the Sky', 1957, 'Drama', 'Charles Crichton, Douglas Slocombe', 'John Eldridge, William Rose', 'Jack Hawkins, Elizabeth Sellars, Walter Fitzgerald, Eddie Byrne, John Stratton, Victor Maddern, Lionel Jeffries, Donald Pleasence', null, 'The efforts of test pilot John Mitchell to make a better life for his wife Mary and their two children seem doomed to failure and he blames himself. At the Conway Aero-Manufacturing Company of Wolverhampton, Mitchell is to take the company''s new rocket-propulsion transport plane up for tests, fully loaded and carrying two important passengers - Ministry official Crabtree and buyer''s representative Ashmore. Mitchell learns from his boss, Reg Conway, that if Ashmore does not recommend the plane, the company will be out of business and Mitchell out of a job, since the plane is not even insured as the firm''s entire capital is tied up in the plane. Aloft, an engine catches fire and the passengers and other crew bail out, but Mitchell refuses to obey orders to jettison the plane in the Irish Sea.', 'The efforts of test pilot John Mitchell to make a better life for his wife Mary and their two children seem doomed to failure and he blames himself. At the Conway Aero-Manufacturing Company of Wolverhampton, Mitchell is to take the company''s new rocket-propulsion transport plane up for tests, fully loaded and carrying two important passengers - Ministry official Crabtree and buyer''s representative Ashmore. Mitchell learns from his boss, Reg Conway, that if Ashmore does not recommend the plane, the company will be out of business and Mitchell out of a job, since the plane is not even insured as the firm''s entire capital is tied up in the plane. Aloft, an engine catches fire and the passengers and other crew bail out, but Mitchell refuses to obey orders to jettison the plane in the Irish Sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8YsqeGweX9ZTRgvQNPJ9dTePX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65651'),
  ('76814746294251534', 'The Man in the White Suit', 1951, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Douglas Slocombe, Alexander Mackendrick, Len Wills', 'Roger MacDougall, John Dighton, Alexander Mackendrick', 'Alec Guinness, Joan Greenwood, Cecil Parker, Michael Gough, Ernest Thesiger, Vida Hope, Howard Marion-Crawford, Miles Malleson', null, 'The unassuming, nebbishy inventor Sidney Stratton creates a miraculous fabric that will never be dirty or worn out. Clearly he can make a fortune selling clothes made of the material, but may cause a crisis in the process. After all, once someone buys one of his suits they won''t ever have to fix them or buy another one, and the clothing industry will collapse overnight. Nevertheless, Sidney is determined to put his invention on the market, forcing the clothing factory bigwigs to resort to more desperate measures...', 'The unassuming, nebbishy inventor Sidney Stratton creates a miraculous fabric that will never be dirty or worn out. Clearly he can make a fortune selling clothes made of the material, but may cause a crisis in the process. After all, once someone buys one of his suits they won''t ever have to fix them or buy another one, and the clothing industry will collapse overnight. Nevertheless, Sidney is determined to put his invention on the market, forcing the clothing factory bigwigs to resort to more desperate measures...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laTLoNZB7Ar3ZDoQmspBDVa5mbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32568'),
  ('695513520990983189', 'The Man in the White Van', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Warren Skeels, Gareth Paul Cox, David Eric Chapman', 'Warren Skeels', 'Madison Wolfe, Brec Bassinger, Ali Larter, Sean Astin, Skai Jackson, Gavin Warren, Noah Lomax, Addison Riecke', 'PG-13', 'In early 1970s Florida, an ominous white van stalks young women. A teenage girl is the latest victim, but this one won''t stay a victim.', 'In early 1970s Florida, an ominous white van stalks young women. A teenage girl is the latest victim, but this one won''t stay a victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A98LHlo4wvgV3d79IovLhL0KSL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877087'),
  ('144134172612314849', 'The Man in the Window', 2026, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Richard Switzer, Alonso Homs', 'Richard Switzer, Amy Irons', 'Teri Polo, Jamie-Lynn Sigler, Dylan Walsh, Al Sapienza, Jonetta Kaiser', 'TV-14', 'A grieving widow grows suspicious of her mysterious new neighbor after local crimes occur. Despite her friend''s support, the community dismisses her concerns, leaving her to uncover the unsettling truth alone.', 'A grieving widow grows suspicious of her mysterious new neighbor after local crimes occur. Despite her friend''s support, the community dismisses her concerns, leaving her to uncover the unsettling truth alone.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FibMqDOCXMzbM9Ek92l9L6UCyCJ2.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-man-in-the-window-2026'),
  ('719946452549400456', 'The Man Inside', 1958, 'Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'John Gilling', 'David Shaw', 'Jack Palance, Anita Ekberg, Nigel Patrick, Anthony Newley, Bonar Colleano, Sean Kelly, Sidney James, Donald Pleasence', null, 'A detective tracking a stolen gem begins to suspect there''s more to the case than just theft.', 'A detective tracking a stolen gem begins to suspect there''s more to the case than just theft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rILW1TRmen4vB0QPV3wAPgROzA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181368'),
  ('280605551142952449', 'The Man Is Armed', 1956, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bud Thackery, Franklin Adreon', 'Robert C. Dennis, Richard H. Landau', 'Dane Clark, May Wynn, William Talman, Barton MacLane, Robert Horton, Fredd Wayne, Richard Benedict, Richard Reeves', 'NR', 'Crime drama in which a man unknowingly helps a gang pull off a big heist. The gang discovers that the man is more trouble than he is worth and as a result, things don''t go as smoothly as planned.', 'Crime drama in which a man unknowingly helps a gang pull off a big heist. The gang discovers that the man is more trouble than he is worth and as a result, things don''t go as smoothly as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4v54RAcWMeOUf2MeXZwaOsBVPpv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72771'),
  ('584140595690955493', 'The Man Next Door', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat, Laura Bernasconi', null, 'Rafael Spregelburd, Daniel Aráoz, Eugenia Alonso, Inés Budassi, Loren Acuña, Eugenio Scopel, Debora Zanolli, Bárbara Hang', null, 'When two neighbours clash, their argument becomes less about proposed building alterations and more about the wider battle between class and social status. The hugely impressive building in question is the only example of a Le Corbusier residential home in all of Latin America, adding to the poignancy of their argument.', 'When two neighbours clash, their argument becomes less about proposed building alterations and more about the wider battle between class and social status. The hugely impressive building in question is the only example of a Le Corbusier residential home in all of Latin America, adding to the poignancy of their argument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMx6TUb9pltfRkj3YboYLxUL2Hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47383'),
  ('830063281617268373', 'The Man of My Life', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Michel Amathieu, Zabou Breitman', 'Zabou Breitman, Agnès de Sacy', 'Bernard Campan, Charles Berling, Léa Drucker, Eric Prat, Jacqueline Jehanneuf, Niels Lexcellent, Léocadia Rodriguez-Henocq, Antonin Chalon', null, 'A man vacationing in the country with his wife and children finds ideas he has of himself unexpectedly challenged.', 'A man vacationing in the country with his wife and children finds ideas he has of himself unexpectedly challenged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zInbAqvkUCMpdwyvcRdWqJpSyll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12840'),
  ('847981831011501773', 'The Man of the Crowd', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Marcelo Gomes, Cao Guimarães', 'Marcelo Gomes, Cao Guimarães', 'Paulo André, Sílvia Lourenço, Jean-Claude Bernardet', null, 'Juvenal is a metro driver from Belo Horizonte. Margô, a station controller. Both live in a state of complete solitude – each in a particular way. Juvenal refuses to be alone and strolls through the streets of this metropolis taking comfort by mingling with the anonimous crowd. Margo seeks relief in the virtual world of social networks where she struggles to establish long lasting relations with real persons.', 'Juvenal is a metro driver from Belo Horizonte. Margô, a station controller. Both live in a state of complete solitude – each in a particular way. Juvenal refuses to be alone and strolls through the streets of this metropolis taking comfort by mingling with the anonimous crowd. Margo seeks relief in the virtual world of social networks where she struggles to establish long lasting relations with real persons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69ixElGDaT9G8eYwZePzYS9t47z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259767'),
  ('429801014878126137', 'The Man of the Sea', 1920, 'Drama', 'Marcel L''Herbier', 'Marcel L''Herbier', 'Jaque Catelain, Roger Karl, Charles Boyer, Philippe Hériat, Marcelle Pradot, Claire Prélia, Suzanne Doris, Claude Autant-Lara', null, 'Nolff, a tough Breton fisherman is happy: his wife has just given birth to a son, Michel. His only wish is to make him a fisherman like him. But when he becomes a man, Michel becomes a good-for-nothing who spends his time in taverns.', 'Nolff, a tough Breton fisherman is happy: his wife has just given birth to a son, Michel. His only wish is to make him a fisherman like him. But when he becomes a man, Michel becomes a good-for-nothing who spends his time in taverns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13c3AJysZ3sNdO0GpsA4RmNktAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175206'),
  ('1146277248269185337', 'The Man of The Sputnik', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Manga, Özen Sermet, Radamés Gnattali', 'José Cajado Filho', 'Oscarito, Cyll Farney, Zezé Macedo, Neide Aparecida, Alberto Pérez, Norma Bengell, Heloísa Helena, Hamilton Ferreira', null, 'An UFO that could be the Russian satellite Sputnik falls on a hillbilly''s hencoop.', 'An UFO that could be the Russian satellite Sputnik falls on a hillbilly''s hencoop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fv4K5SgngOES106xB2awNqak7XD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194734'),
  ('276324491523973284', 'The Man of the Year', 2003, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'José Henrique Fonseca, Breno Silveira', 'Rubem Fonseca, Patrícia Mello', 'Murilo Benício, Cláudia Abreu, Natália Lage, Jorge Dória, Paulo Moska, André Gonçalves, Lázaro Ramos, Perfeito Fortuna', null, 'Maiquél has lost a bet and dyed his hair blond. This seemingly innocuous event triggers a head-on collision with destiny in which he goes from nobody to hero to outlaw — all in 24 hours.', 'Maiquél has lost a bet and dyed his hair blond. This seemingly innocuous event triggers a head-on collision with destiny in which he goes from nobody to hero to outlaw — all in 24 hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Qai7kYNbx5k8Dy4mGTPHdVxXjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8441'),
  ('1041627801122887275', 'The Man on the Balcony', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Daniel Alfredson, Peter Mokrosinski, Serina Björnbom', 'Jonas Cornell, Daniel Alfredson', 'Gösta Ekman, Kjell Bergqvist, Rolf Lassgård, Niklas Hjulström, Jonas Falk, Ulf Friberg, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Tova Magnusson', null, 'A serial-killer attacks and murders young girls in the parks of Stockholm. The police have trouble finding any evidence to find the killer. But when a newsstand is robbed in one of the parks while the murderer strikes again, police inspector Martin Beck believes that the robber may be an important witness. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'A serial-killer attacks and murders young girls in the parks of Stockholm. The police have trouble finding any evidence to find the killer. But when a newsstand is robbed in one of the parks while the murderer strikes again, police inspector Martin Beck believes that the robber may be an important witness. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP2uq4gV5Vshv7sAD4avIF4g39f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46320'),
  ('832093605863384895', 'The Man on the Eiffel Tower', 1949, 'Thriller', 'Stanley Cortez, Burgess Meredith', 'Harry Brown', 'Charles Laughton, Franchot Tone, Burgess Meredith, Robert Hutton, Jean Wallace, Patricia Roc, Belita, George Thorpe', 'NR', 'A down-and-out student is hired to kill a wealthy woman. When someone else is suspected of the crime, the student taunts police until they realize that they may have to wrong man.', 'A down-and-out student is hired to kill a wealthy woman. When someone else is suspected of the crime, the student taunts police until they realize that they may have to wrong man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/celxAgKWC5Ngi7PPNWX2uhXwIVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47308'),
  ('580744384992948000', 'The Man on the Road', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Luca Ciuti, Gianluca Mangiasciutti, Gabriella Giannattasio', 'Serena Cervoni, Mariano Di Nardo', 'Aurora Giovinazzo, Lorenzo Richelmy, Astrid Casali, Eugenio Gradabosco, Marit Nissen, Jozef Gjura, Elisa Lucarelli, Manuela Grippi', null, 'Irene is only eight years old when she witnesses her father’s death at the hands of a hit-and-run. Haunted by the sense of guilt of not being able to remember the killer’s face, Irene becomes a rebellious and introverted teen with the sole obsession of getting herself justice.', 'Irene is only eight years old when she witnesses her father’s death at the hands of a hit-and-run. Haunted by the sense of guilt of not being able to remember the killer’s face, Irene becomes a rebellious and introverted teen with the sole obsession of getting herself justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onTrzlqrTD4wtkVN3J4OuuCd2zX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033569'),
  ('469914649641991865', 'The Man Standing Next', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Woo Min-ho, Go Rak-sun, Lee Seung-bin', 'Woo Min-ho, Lee Ji-min', 'Lee Byung-hun, Lee Sung-min, Kwak Do-won, Lee Hee-jun, Kim So-jin, Seo Hyun-woo, Kim Min-sang, Kim Hong-pa', null, 'When the investigation of ''Koreagate'' takes place, Park Yong-gak, a former KCIA director who knows everything about the government''s operations, heads to the United States in exile.', 'When the investigation of ''Koreagate'' takes place, Park Yong-gak, a former KCIA director who knows everything about the government''s operations, heads to the United States in exile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWavVXt7U20Vu2v5jX5ABE3e6gV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566397'),
  ('756453709180296571', 'The Man They Could Not Hang', 1939, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Crime', 'Nick Grindé, Benjamin H. Kline, Morris Stoloff', 'Karl Brown', 'Boris Karloff, Lorna Gray, Robert Wilcox, Roger Pryor, Don Beddoe, Ann Doran, Joe De Stefani, Charles Trowbridge', 'NR', 'Dr. Henryk Savaard is a scientist working on experiments to restore life to the dead. When he is unjustly hanged for murder, he is brought back to life by his trusted assistant. Re-animated he turns decidedly nasty and sets about murdering the jury that convicted him.', 'Dr. Henryk Savaard is a scientist working on experiments to restore life to the dead. When he is unjustly hanged for murder, he is brought back to life by his trusted assistant. Re-animated he turns decidedly nasty and sets about murdering the jury that convicted him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR03TUMEd5bnnAMnOEGcVoLcGSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26925'),
  ('857773933304284356', 'The Man to Kill', 1979, 'Fantasy, History, Drama, Horror', 'Veljko Bulajić, Branko Ivatović', 'Veljko Bulajić, Bruno Di Geronimo, Ratko Đurović', 'Zvonimir Črnko, Vladimir Popović, Charles Millot, Ranko Kovačević, Tanja Bošković, Dušica Žegarac, Tanasije Uzunović, Mate Ergović', null, 'After the murder of the Russian Emperor Peter III, who was succeeded by Empress Catherine, Satan decides that the balance between good and evil on Earth has been destabilized. In order to set things right, he sends his representative to Earth - the teacher Farfa, who bears an unusual resemblance to Peter III. His mission is to seize power from the old Duke of Montenegro, and then to take back the Russian throne as Peter III. The people of Montenegro accept Farfa as their new leader, and he proclaims himself the new Emperor, Scepan Mali, successfully resisting an invasion by the Turks. Farfa is touched by the Montenegrins'' kindness and courage, falls in love with the beautiful Elfa, and fails to follow Satan''s plan. Not one to be crossed, Satan sets out to kill him.', 'After the murder of the Russian Emperor Peter III, who was succeeded by Empress Catherine, Satan decides that the balance between good and evil on Earth has been destabilized. In order to set things right, he sends his representative to Earth - the teacher Farfa, who bears an unusual resemblance to Peter III. His mission is to seize power from the old Duke of Montenegro, and then to take back the Russian throne as Peter III. The people of Montenegro accept Farfa as their new leader, and he proclaims himself the new Emperor, Scepan Mali, successfully resisting an invasion by the Turks. Farfa is touched by the Montenegrins'' kindness and courage, falls in love with the beautiful Elfa, and fails to follow Satan''s plan. Not one to be crossed, Satan sets out to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45kf9AbiaJT2ZelXm1XuPouuknw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221007'),
  ('124803526039809367', 'The Man Who Bought The Moon', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ramiro Civita, Paolo Zucca', 'Paolo Zucca, Barbara Alberti, Geppi Cucciari', 'Jacopo Cullin, Francesco Pannofino, Ángela Molina, Stefano Fresi, Benito Urgu, Lazar Ristovski, Gregory Dayton, Andrea Prodan', null, 'A Sardinian fisherman has promised the moon to the woman he loves. And Sardinian men always keep their promises.', 'A Sardinian fisherman has promised the moon to the woman he loves. And Sardinian men always keep their promises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9zS0xGyxlDO4DUwYIhv26k1sBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569930'),
  ('717637777510953252', 'The Man Who Came to Dinner', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William Keighley, Tony Gaudio, Richard Maybery', 'Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein', 'Bette Davis, Ann Sheridan, Monty Woolley, Richard Travis, Jimmy Durante, Billie Burke, Reginald Gardiner, Elisabeth Fraser', 'NR', 'An acerbic critic wreaks havoc when a hip injury forces him to move in indefinitely with a Midwestern family.', 'An acerbic critic wreaks havoc when a hip injury forces him to move in indefinitely with a Midwestern family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3k6KVD9RKADkfFzHLE4ho9yWumO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26319'),
  ('219408458509936389', 'The Man Who Captured Eichmann', 1996, 'TV Movie, Drama, History, War', 'William A. Graham, Robert Steadman', null, 'Robert Duvall, Arliss Howard, Jeffrey Tambor, Jack Laufer, Nicolas Surovy, Joel Brooks, Michael Laskin, Sam Robards', 'NR', 'Set in 1960, the story follows the efforts of the Mossad, the Israeli Secret Service, to find former SS Colonel Adolf Eichmann, who ran from Germany to Argentina and took the name Ricardo Clement. He was wanted for the murders of both Europeans and Jews during the Holocaust. Learning of Eichmann''s living in Argentina, the Mossad sends a team to capture him, led by agent Peter Malkin. The standing order: bring Eichmann back alive to Israel for trial.', 'Set in 1960, the story follows the efforts of the Mossad, the Israeli Secret Service, to find former SS Colonel Adolf Eichmann, who ran from Germany to Argentina and took the name Ricardo Clement. He was wanted for the murders of both Europeans and Jews during the Holocaust. Learning of Eichmann''s living in Argentina, the Mossad sends a team to capture him, led by agent Peter Malkin. The standing order: bring Eichmann back alive to Israel for trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUuHzPsRD38TlPwbSXBjlT3ojJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193212'),
  ('378466544300654543', 'The Man Who Challenged the Devil', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Moacyr Góes, Jacques Cheuiche, Guto Vaz', 'Bráulio Tavares, Moacyr Góes', 'Marcos Palmeira, Flávia Alessandra, Fernanda Paes Leme, Lívia Falcão, Antônio Pitanga, Leandro Firmino, Otto, Antônio Pompêo', null, 'After being forced into a marriage and enduring a humiliating work routine in the hands of his father-in-law, Zé Araújo becomes the mythical Ojuara, an unconventional hero devoted to debauchery.', 'After being forced into a marriage and enduring a humiliating work routine in the hands of his father-in-law, Zé Araújo becomes the mythical Ojuara, an unconventional hero devoted to debauchery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie5sQLxoOzga7YdVHFm8dL5nKgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19147'),
  ('330702280256012816', 'The Man Who Changed His Mind', 1936, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert Stevenson, Jack E. Cox', 'John L. Balderston, Sidney Gilliat, L. du Garde Peach', 'Boris Karloff, Anna Lee, John Loder, Frank Cellier, Donald Calthrop, Cecil Parker, Lyn Harding, Clive Morton', null, 'Dr. Laurence, a once-respectable scientist, begins to research the origin of the mind and the soul. The science community rejects him, and he risks losing everything for which he has worked. He begins to use his discoveries to save his research and further his own causes, thereby becoming ... a mad scientist, almost unstoppable.', 'Dr. Laurence, a once-respectable scientist, begins to research the origin of the mind and the soul. The science community rejects him, and he risks losing everything for which he has worked. He begins to use his discoveries to save his research and further his own causes, thereby becoming ... a mad scientist, almost unstoppable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBED6CQG2K81L19occPCO7IEEP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30640'),
  ('367226063605971534', 'The Man Who Cheated Himself', 1950, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Felix E. Feist, Russell Harlan, Louis Forbes', 'Seton I. Miller, Philip MacDonald', 'Lee J. Cobb, Jane Wyatt, John Dall, Lisa Howard, Harlan Warde, Tito Vuolo, Charles Arnt, Marjorie Bennett', 'NR', 'A veteran homicide detective who has witnessed his socialite girlfriend kill her husband sees his inexperienced brother assigned to the case.', 'A veteran homicide detective who has witnessed his socialite girlfriend kill her husband sees his inexperienced brother assigned to the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJKWfhHjDaFGSNvRnXx0Xxehhls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38751'),
  ('893333325758981334', 'The Man Who Copied', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Jorge Furtado, Alex Sernambi', 'Jorge Furtado', 'Lázaro Ramos, Leandra Leal, Luana Piovani, Pedro Cardoso, Carlos Cunha Filho, Júlio Andrade, Gregory Garcia, Sheron Menezzes', null, 'A young photocopier operator becomes infatuated with his neighbor and, unable to afford anything from her shop, turns to shady schemes to make money.', 'A young photocopier operator becomes infatuated with his neighbor and, unable to afford anything from her shop, turns to shady schemes to make money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RsEkEdLEFd0Q5HThqMd4X8tYZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40823'),
  ('1001663939847852062', 'The Man Who Could Cheat Death', 1959, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Asher, Terence Fisher, John Peverall', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Anton Diffring, Hazel Court, Christopher Lee, Arnold Marlé, Delphi Lawrence, Francis de Wolff, Gerda Larsen, Middleton Woods', null, 'Dr. Bonner plans to live forever through periodic gland transplants from younger, healthier human victims. Bonner looks about 40; he''s really 104 years old. But people are starting to get suspicious, and he may not make 200.', 'Dr. Bonner plans to live forever through periodic gland transplants from younger, healthier human victims. Bonner looks about 40; he''s really 104 years old. But people are starting to get suspicious, and he may not make 200.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xL8b3Q88zCzW8JFr2NK8cqqR1kL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28770'),
  ('1023459641899206052', 'The Man Who Could Not Remain Silent', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Nebojša Slijepčević, Gregor Božič, Hana Hribar', 'Nebojša Slijepčević', 'Goran Bogdan, Dragan Mićanović, Silvio Mumelaš, Alexis Manenti, Lara Nekić, Priska Ugrina, Dušan Gojić, Nebojša Pop-Tasić', null, '1993. A passenger train from Belgrade to Bar is stopped by paramilitary forces in an ethnic cleansing operation. As they haul off innocent civilians, only one man dares to stand up to them. This is the true story of a man who could not remain silent.', '1993. A passenger train from Belgrade to Bar is stopped by paramilitary forces in an ethnic cleansing operation. As they haul off innocent civilians, only one man dares to stand up to them. This is the true story of a man who could not remain silent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAJ99Gg9wxci967WdsCXTn4JWsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279229'),
  ('409631093058368991', 'The Man Who Could Work Miracles', 1936, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Lothar Mendes, Harold Rosson, Imlay Watts', 'H. G. Wells, Lajos Biró', 'Roland Young, Ralph Richardson, Edward Chapman, Ernest Thesiger, Joan Gardner, Sophie Stewart, Robert Cochran, Lady Tree', 'NR', 'An ordinary man, while vigorously asserting the impossibility of miracles, suddenly discovers that he can perform them.', 'An ordinary man, while vigorously asserting the impossibility of miracles, suddenly discovers that he can perform them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAfQRixZWBzQhJ7vwgCIyQhxNW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68849'),
  ('1025778859208352861', 'The Man Who Cracked the Nazi Code: The Story of Alan Turing', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Denis van Waerebeke', 'Mathilde Damoisel', 'Alan Turing, Rachel Williams, Paul Bandey, Ken Starcevic, Jean Valentine, Karl Dönitz', null, 'During the Second World War, the allies'' key objective was to crack the German army''s encrypted communications code. Without a doubt, the key player in this game was Alan Turing, an interdisciplinary scientist and a long-forgotten hero.', 'During the Second World War, the allies'' key objective was to crack the German army''s encrypted communications code. Without a doubt, the key player in this game was Alan Turing, an interdisciplinary scientist and a long-forgotten hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZBkR05BnA9EuE9BWee6xqBsJjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276477'),
  ('1020842766309022984', 'The Man Who Cried', 2000, 'Romance, Drama, Music, War', 'Sally Potter, Sacha Vierny', 'Sally Potter', 'Christina Ricci, Johnny Depp, Cate Blanchett, John Turturro, Harry Dean Stanton, Oleg Yankovskiy, Don Fellows, Claudia Lander-Duke', null, 'A young refugee travels from Russia to America in search of her lost father and falls in love with a gypsy horseman.', 'A young refugee travels from Russia to America in search of her lost father and falls in love with a gypsy horseman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCwee9sPHD2lxgo1ISlHve384oc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29572'),
  ('343856045748264557', 'The Man Who Died Twice', 1958, 'Crime', 'Joseph Kane, Jack A. Marta', 'Richard C. Sarafian', 'Rod Cameron, Vera Ralston, Mike Mazurki, Gerald Milton, Richard Karlan, Louis Jean Heydt, Don Megowan, John Maxwell', null, 'An innocent nightclub singer becomes mixed up in illegal drug dealings shortly after witnessing her husband''s death and the murder of a couple of narcotics agents.', 'An innocent nightclub singer becomes mixed up in illegal drug dealings shortly after witnessing her husband''s death and the murder of a couple of narcotics agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8y1udwNba6W7zdOupa6IbXdTJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48887'),
  ('833756004159119550', 'The Man Who Feels No Pain', 2019, 'Action, Comedy', 'Eric Jacobus, Anand Shetty, Vasan Bala', 'Kamlesh Pandey', 'Abhimanyu Dasani, Radhikka Madan, Gulshan Devaiah, Mahesh Manjrekar, Jimit Trivedi, Sartaaj Kakkar, Riva Arora, Elena Kazan', null, 'Leveraging his ability to withstand pain, a young man trains to follow in the footsteps of his martial arts hero.', 'Leveraging his ability to withstand pain, a young man trains to follow in the footsteps of his martial arts hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxHYXswJjaT5k0hPOMmNDRz1EjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541495'),
  ('1039142328282418889', 'The Man Who Fell to Earth', 1976, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Nicolas Roeg, Michael Stevenson', 'Paul Mayersberg', 'David Bowie, Rip Torn, Candy Clark, Tony Mascia, Buck Henry, Bernie Casey, Adrienne La Russa, Claudia Jennings', 'R', 'Thomas Jerome Newton is an alien who has come to Earth in search of water to save his home planet. Aided by lawyer Oliver Farnsworth, Thomas uses his knowledge of advanced technology to create profitable inventions. While developing a method to transport water, Thomas meets Mary-Lou, a quiet hotel clerk, and begins to fall in love with her. Just as he is ready to leave Earth, Thomas is intercepted by the U.S. government, and his entire plan is threatened.', 'Thomas Jerome Newton is an alien who has come to Earth in search of water to save his home planet. Aided by lawyer Oliver Farnsworth, Thomas uses his knowledge of advanced technology to create profitable inventions. While developing a method to transport water, Thomas meets Mary-Lou, a quiet hotel clerk, and begins to fall in love with her. Just as he is ready to leave Earth, Thomas is intercepted by the U.S. government, and his entire plan is threatened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwmPVphE5DMFFGXGMhfEFyxOOYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991'),
  ('579985899296680775', 'The Man Who Finally Died', 1963, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Quentin Lawrence, Stephen Dade, Robert Porter', 'Lewis Greifer, Louis Marks', 'Stanley Baker, Peter Cushing, Mai Zetterling, Eric Portman, Nigel Green, Georgina Ward, Niall MacGinnis, Barbara Everest', 'NR', 'Joe Newman, a naturalised Briton, is telephoned by his German father, whom he believed long dead, at the same time as a funeral is taking place in Bavaria - with his father''s name on the coffin. His investigation in Bavaria reveals startling facts and the obstruction he meets makes him suspect foul play.', 'Joe Newman, a naturalised Briton, is telephoned by his German father, whom he believed long dead, at the same time as a funeral is taking place in Bavaria - with his father''s name on the coffin. His investigation in Bavaria reveals startling facts and the obstruction he meets makes him suspect foul play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZedAaw8MYipEmaUyCRH7aZy8wn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126755'),
  ('60579043930192472', 'The Man Who Had His Hair Cut Short', 1966, 'Drama', 'André Delvaux, Ghislain Cloquet, Roland Delcour', 'Anna De Pagter', 'Senne Rouffaer, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Hector Camerlynck, Hilde Uitterlinden, Annemarie Van Dijk, Hilda Van Roose, François Beukelaers, Arlette Emmery', null, 'Govert Miereveld is a lawyer from a small Flemish town who also teaches in a school for girls. He harbors a secret love for one of his young students, Fran, whom he loses touch with after her graduation. Some time later, Miereveld has to attend an autopsy, and the shock of the experience deeply affects his mental balance. He finds out - or he believes so - that Fran has become a popular singer. He arranges to meet her to finally reveal his feelings. An ambiguous but perhaps tragic denouement follows which might be a figment of the protagonist''s disturbed mind.', 'Govert Miereveld is a lawyer from a small Flemish town who also teaches in a school for girls. He harbors a secret love for one of his young students, Fran, whom he loses touch with after her graduation. Some time later, Miereveld has to attend an autopsy, and the shock of the experience deeply affects his mental balance. He finds out - or he believes so - that Fran has become a popular singer. He arranges to meet her to finally reveal his feelings. An ambiguous but perhaps tragic denouement follows which might be a figment of the protagonist''s disturbed mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qMYOTz9aKfC0EQgSMKN963MSf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86482'),
  ('831081767101415519', 'The Man Who Haunted Himself', 1970, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Basil Dearden, Tony Spratling', 'Basil Dearden, Michael Relph', 'Roger Moore, Anton Rodgers, Olga Georges-Picot, Freddie Jones, Hugh Mackenzie, Kevork Malikyan, Thorley Walters, Ruth Trouncer', null, 'Executive Harold Pelham suffers a serious accident after which he faces the shadow of death. When, against all odds, he miraculously recovers, he discovers that his life does not belong to him anymore.', 'Executive Harold Pelham suffers a serious accident after which he faces the shadow of death. When, against all odds, he miraculously recovers, he discovers that his life does not belong to him anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gItc85LIfLxRWo9foVTPwIgAB2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4910'),
  ('908213238927251659', 'The Man Who Invented Christmas', 2017, 'Drama, History, Comedy, Family', 'Bharat Nalluri, Ben Smithard, Tim Morris', 'Susan Coyne', 'Dan Stevens, Christopher Plummer, Jonathan Pryce, Justin Edwards, Morfydd Clark, Donald Sumpter, Miles Jupp, Simon Callow', 'PG', 'In 1843, despite the fact that Dickens is a successful writer, the failure of his latest book puts his career at a crossroads, until the moment when, struggling with inspiration and confronting reality with his childhood memories, a new character is born in the depths of his troubled mind; an old, lonely, embittered man, so vivid, so human, that a whole world grows around him, a story so inspiring that changed the meaning of Christmas forever.', 'In 1843, despite the fact that Dickens is a successful writer, the failure of his latest book puts his career at a crossroads, until the moment when, struggling with inspiration and confronting reality with his childhood memories, a new character is born in the depths of his troubled mind; an old, lonely, embittered man, so vivid, so human, that a whole world grows around him, a story so inspiring that changed the meaning of Christmas forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRkzRue5rTzB6PESXBJCKqROOXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450322'),
  ('221577505305152480', 'The Man Who Killed Don Quixote', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Terry Gilliam, Dino Estrelinha, Terry Bamber', 'Tony Grisoni, Terry Gilliam', 'Adam Driver, Jonathan Pryce, Stellan Skarsgård, Jordi Mollà, Joana Ribeiro, Óscar Jaenada, Olga Kurylenko, Will Keen', 'NR', 'Toby, a cynical film director finds himself trapped in the outrageous delusions of an old Spanish shoe-maker who believes himself to be Don Quixote. In the course of their comic and increasingly surreal adventures, Toby is forced to confront the tragic repercussions of a film he made in his idealistic youth.', 'Toby, a cynical film director finds himself trapped in the outrageous delusions of an old Spanish shoe-maker who believes himself to be Don Quixote. In the course of their comic and increasingly surreal adventures, Toby is forced to confront the tragic repercussions of a film he made in his idealistic youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4o4zw2c9sfHvszIb5xpuFagnouR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297725'),
  ('703565936952664968', 'The Man Who Killed Hitler and Then the Bigfoot', 2019, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, War', 'Robert D. Krzykowski, Alex Vendler, Elaine Marie Gibson', 'Robert D. Krzykowski', 'Sam Elliott, Aidan Turner, Caitlin FitzGerald, Rizwan Manji, Larry Miller, Ron Livingston, Nikolai Tsankov, Ellar Coltrane', 'R', 'Decades after serving in WWII and assassinating Adolf Hitler, a legendary American war veteran must now hunt down the fabled Bigfoot.', 'Decades after serving in WWII and assassinating Adolf Hitler, a legendary American war veteran must now hunt down the fabled Bigfoot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQNeWBT1VqtSMtgfEn3zFjRogyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530081'),
  ('525292903974994314', 'The Man Who Knew Infinity', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Lydia Currie, Andrew Munro, Jennie Fava', 'Matt Brown', 'Dev Patel, Jeremy Irons, Toby Jones, Devika Bhise, Stephen Fry, Kevin McNally, Jeremy Northam, Anthony Calf', 'PG-13', 'Growing up poor in Madras, India, Srinivasa Ramanujan Iyengar earns admittance to Cambridge University during WWI, where he becomes a pioneer in mathematical theories with the guidance of his professor, G.H. Hardy.', 'Growing up poor in Madras, India, Srinivasa Ramanujan Iyengar earns admittance to Cambridge University during WWI, where he becomes a pioneer in mathematical theories with the guidance of his professor, G.H. Hardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2X1BtkxaV8pzLbmM8a5gTdpg7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353326'),
  ('552671144985117156', 'The Man Who Knew Too Little', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Jon Amiel, Robert M. Stevens', 'Robert Farrar, Howard Franklin', 'Bill Murray, Peter Gallagher, Joanne Whalley, Alfred Molina, Richard Wilson, John Standing, Simon Chandler, Geraldine James', 'PG', 'An American gets a ticket for an audience participation game in London, then gets involved in a case of mistaken identity. As an international plot unravels around him, he thinks it''s all part of the act.', 'An American gets a ticket for an audience participation game in London, then gets involved in a case of mistaken identity. As an international plot unravels around him, he thinks it''s all part of the act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVlIZa0u6CTN5LudxGX77Fk46iz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9414'),
  ('811242407726876110', 'The Man Who Knew Too Much', 1934, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Curt Courant, Louis Levy', 'D.B. Wyndham-Lewis, Charles Bennett, A.R. Rawlinson', 'Leslie Banks, Edna Best, Peter Lorre, Frank Vosper, Hugh Wakefield, Nova Pilbeam, Pierre Fresnay, Cicely Oates', 'NR', 'While vacationing in St. Moritz, a British couple receive a clue to an imminent assassination attempt, only to learn that their daughter has been kidnapped to keep them quiet.', 'While vacationing in St. Moritz, a British couple receive a clue to an imminent assassination attempt, only to learn that their daughter has been kidnapped to keep them quiet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qghwbSfQblFYRFq675uK5qDGr3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8208'),
  ('89935491261383050', 'The Man Who Knew Too Much', 1956, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Robert Burks, Howard Joslin', 'John Michael Hayes', 'James Stewart, Doris Day, Brenda De Banzie, Bernard Miles, Ralph Truman, Daniel Gélin, Mogens Wieth, Alan Mowbray', 'PG', 'An American doctor and his wife, a former singing star, witness a murder while vacationing in Morocco, and are drawn into a twisting plot of international intrigue when their young son is kidnapped.', 'An American doctor and his wife, a former singing star, witness a murder while vacationing in Morocco, and are drawn into a twisting plot of international intrigue when their young son is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy8YBRjCQRIT9x9G9F5fpnFD4xw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574'),
  ('211985427684786470', 'The Man who Laughs', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Vladimir Kott, Maksim Koliganov, Stasya Muts, Yuliya Erokhina', 'Evgeny Tsyganov, Vladimir Kott, Aleksandr Berezhnoy', 'Stepan Devonin, Sergey Garmash, Dmitry Gorevoy, Aleksey Smirnov, Garik Navasardyan', null, 'Dmitriy is a popular actor, a star of action films. The public loves him for his image of a macho with an impenetrable face. One day, Dmitriy receives an offer from a stern but very rich businessman from Siberia, Sergey, to star in a crime drama about the 90s in the lead role of a cold-blooded killer. Sergey offers Dmitriy''s agent a fee 10 times higher than usual. They agree. During the filming, Dmitriy is accidentally wounded by a shot. After a simple operation, he is ready to return to the frame, but faces an unexpected side effect: now he constantly smiles, and any emotions are expressed with laughter. Dmitriy has no chance to stop filming and "upset" Sergey, who clearly knows firsthand what he is making a movie about.', 'Dmitriy is a popular actor, a star of action films. The public loves him for his image of a macho with an impenetrable face. One day, Dmitriy receives an offer from a stern but very rich businessman from Siberia, Sergey, to star in a crime drama about the 90s in the lead role of a cold-blooded killer. Sergey offers Dmitriy''s agent a fee 10 times higher than usual. They agree. During the filming, Dmitriy is accidentally wounded by a shot. After a simple operation, he is ready to return to the frame, but faces an unexpected side effect: now he constantly smiles, and any emotions are expressed with laughter. Dmitriy has no chance to stop filming and "upset" Sergey, who clearly knows firsthand what he is making a movie about.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3HLUZzg2YklIN1vPOg82lrMUmJB.jpg', 'plex:movie:chelovek-kotoryy-smeyotsya'),
  ('467367219150106566', 'The Man Who Laughs', 1928, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Paul Leni, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Walter Anthony, May McLean, Marion Ward', 'Conrad Veidt, Mary Philbin, Cesare Gravina, Brandon Hurst, Olga Baclanova, Sam De Grasse, Stuart Holmes, Josephine Crowell', null, 'When a proud noble refuses to kiss the hand of the despotic King James in 1690, he is cruelly executed and his son surgically disfigured.', 'When a proud noble refuses to kiss the hand of the despotic King James in 1690, he is cruelly executed and his son surgically disfigured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQXBMr4NzQst4X0rDU6MII6ZUOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27517'),
  ('892952858640845033', 'The Man Who Laughs', 2012, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Gérard Simon, Vincent Dizien', 'Guillaume Laurant', 'Gérard Depardieu, Marc-André Grondin, Emmanuelle Seigner, Christa Théret, Arben Bajraktaraj, Serge Merlin, Christèle Tual, Swann Arlaud', null, 'During a winter storm, Ursus offers shelter to two orphans, Gwynplaine and Déa; some years later, they are still living together. Gwynplaine has become a famous star, but his success threatens his relationships with Déa and Ursus.', 'During a winter storm, Ursus offers shelter to two orphans, Gwynplaine and Déa; some years later, they are still living together. Gwynplaine has become a famous star, but his success threatens his relationships with Déa and Ursus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyZ6OW6750keTIftUWwFuPa4uCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151826'),
  ('202621404930107654', 'The Man Who Left His Will on Film', 1970, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Tōichirō Narushima, Kazuo Kawashima', 'Mamoru Sasaki, Masato Hara', 'Tomoyo Oshima, Naomi Shiraishi, Kenji Shiiya, Kiyoko Tsuji, Kazuo Goto, Kenji Yoshino, Tetsurō Tsuno, Sukio Fukuoka', null, 'When a man chases down his stolen movie camera, the thief commits suicide by jumping off a building. But after the police take the camera as evidence, it becomes unclear if there was ever a thief in the first place.', 'When a man chases down his stolen movie camera, the thief commits suicide by jumping off a building. But after the police take the camera as evidence, it becomes unclear if there was ever a thief in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPQFw7HojNLJsqL0L53KYS7vpwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104343'),
  ('794344288921787866', 'The Man Who Lies', 1968, 'Mystery, Drama, War', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Michel Fano, Alexander Bada', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Sylvie Bréal, Zuzana Kocúriková, Dominique Prado, Catherine Robbe-Grillet, Sylvia Turbová, Ivan Mistrík, Dušan Blaškovič', null, 'A man may or may not have betrayed a resistance fighter during World War II. He has supposedly been shot down by the Nazis and wanders into town. Mourning the death of an unseen comrade, he is taken in by the family of the dead rebel. He engages in a superfluous affair and witnesses the lesbian relationship between the man''s sister and a female servant. When passions subside, the family has doubts about the reliability of the man''s story.', 'A man may or may not have betrayed a resistance fighter during World War II. He has supposedly been shot down by the Nazis and wanders into town. Mourning the death of an unseen comrade, he is taken in by the family of the dead rebel. He engages in a superfluous affair and witnesses the lesbian relationship between the man''s sister and a female servant. When passions subside, the family has doubts about the reliability of the man''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oe1w5aSLgwNozAE2K4hhmZgVTtV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63213'),
