  ('1028076329811863683', 'The Man Who Loved Women', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'François Truffaut, Néstor Almendros, Alain Maline', 'François Truffaut, Michel Fermaud, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Charles Denner, Leslie Caron, Nelly Borgeaud, Valérie Bonnier, Sabine Glaser, Brigitte Fossey, Geneviève Fontanel, Anna Perrier', 'NR', 'At Bertrand Morane''s burial there are many of the women that the 40-year-old engineer loved. In flashback Bertrand''s life and love affairs are told by himself while writing an autobiographical novel.', 'At Bertrand Morane''s burial there are many of the women that the 40-year-old engineer loved. In flashback Bertrand''s life and love affairs are told by himself while writing an autobiographical novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAbqXoN6ucpN8jvHOxZOzwyP8pE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421'),
  ('927116265618119415', 'The Man Who Loved Women', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Blake Edwards, Haskell Wexler', 'François Truffaut, Michel Fermaud, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Burt Reynolds, Julie Andrews, Kim Basinger, Marilu Henner, Cynthia Sikes, Jennifer Edwards, Sela Ward, Denise Crosby', 'R', 'A womanizing sculptor seeks help from a psychiatrist to cure him of his obsession with women.', 'A womanizing sculptor seeks help from a psychiatrist to cure him of his obsession with women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uO8atMbKAAbagLtAKhgjnsJqA0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69928'),
  ('23804101210618375', 'The Man Who Loved Yngve', 2008, 'Drama', 'Stian Kristiansen, Trond Høines', 'Tore Renberg', 'Rolf Kristian Larsen, Arthur Berning, Ida Elise Broch, Ole Christoffer Ertvaag, Jørgen Langhelle, Trine Wiggen, Knut Sverdrup Kleppestø, Andreas Cappelen', null, 'It’s November 1989 and the world is changing. So is Jarle, who attends Kongsgård High School in Stavanger. He plays the guitar/lead singer in a local punk band, has a great girlfriend, and has the coolest best friend. But it''s all about to change when Yngve enters the classroom.', 'It’s November 1989 and the world is changing. So is Jarle, who attends Kongsgård High School in Stavanger. He plays the guitar/lead singer in a local punk band, has a great girlfriend, and has the coolest best friend. But it''s all about to change when Yngve enters the classroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ph8Idvt8WjKx6MzTvpDmCd1yy7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13617'),
  ('599270409810067302', 'The Man Who Loves', 2008, 'Drama', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi, Ivan Cotroneo', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Monica Bellucci, Kseniya Rappoport, Michele Alhaique, Glen Blackhall, Piera Degli Esposti, Arnaldo Ninchi, Marisa Paredes', null, 'A man is broken hearted at the loss of his lover, then later visits the same pain on the next woman with whom he becomes involved.', 'A man is broken hearted at the loss of his lover, then later visits the same pain on the next woman with whom he becomes involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR57w7pjj29ztH5rPltPWoEkrD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24191'),
  ('1024107385224307991', 'The Man Who Never Was', 1956, 'Thriller, War, Drama, History', 'Ronald Neame, Gerry O''Hara, Erica Masters', 'Nigel Balchin', 'Clifton Webb, Gloria Grahame, Robert Flemyng, Josephine Griffin, Stephen Boyd, Laurence Naismith, Geoffrey Keen, Moultrie Kelsall', 'NR', 'The true story of a British effort to trick the Germans into weakening Sicily''s defenses before the 1943 attack. A dead soldier is dressed as a British officer and outfitted with faked papers showing that the Allies were intending to invade occupied Greece. His body is put into the sea where it will ultimately drift ashore and the papers be passed along to German Intelligence.', 'The true story of a British effort to trick the Germans into weakening Sicily''s defenses before the 1943 attack. A dead soldier is dressed as a British officer and outfitted with faked papers showing that the Allies were intending to invade occupied Greece. His body is put into the sea where it will ultimately drift ashore and the papers be passed along to German Intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajb6naQi07fPhyJQ9DxkrGNU4Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43791'),
  ('287957245831508327', 'The Man Who Planted Trees', 1987, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Frédéric Back', 'Jean Giono', 'Philippe Noiret', null, 'The story of one shepherd''s single-handed quest to re-forest a desolate valley in the foothills of the French Alps throughout the first half of the 20th century.', 'The story of one shepherd''s single-handed quest to re-forest a desolate valley in the foothills of the French Alps throughout the first half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEzdXghDipM4b8Qs1mzt4mvXT6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49565'),
  ('1003259436406927474', 'The Man Who Quit Smoking', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Tage Danielsson, Kalle Bergholm, Per Carleson', 'Tage Danielsson', 'Gösta Ekman, Grynet Molvig, Toivo Pawlo, Holger Löwenadler, Gunn Wållgren, Pierre Lindstedt, Carl-Gustaf Lindstedt, Jan-Olof Strandberg', null, 'The Plot focuses on Dante Alighieri, a young man who loves smoking. When his father dies Dante inherits $17 million on one special condition: He must give up smoking in 14 days and then stay smoke-free for an entire year. If he fails, his uncle inherits the $17 million instead. Dante has a living hell while trying to quit, and hires a private detective agency called Little Secret Service who he gives free hands to stop him from smoking, While his uncle, who has taken up smoking himself, also does everything he can to make Dante smoke again.', 'The Plot focuses on Dante Alighieri, a young man who loves smoking. When his father dies Dante inherits $17 million on one special condition: He must give up smoking in 14 days and then stay smoke-free for an entire year. If he fails, his uncle inherits the $17 million instead. Dante has a living hell while trying to quit, and hires a private detective agency called Little Secret Service who he gives free hands to stop him from smoking, While his uncle, who has taken up smoking himself, also does everything he can to make Dante smoke again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laatM94ERVlk2bWnRxlGy5j4YoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44618'),
  ('105864749978531770', 'The Man Who Saved the World', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Çetin İnanç', 'Cüneyt Arkın', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Aytekin Akkaya, Füsun Uçar, Hüseyin Peyda, Necla Fide, Hikmet Taşdemir, Mehmet Uğur, Kadir Kök', 'NR', 'Two space cadets crash-land on a desert planet, where an evil wizard seeks the ultimate power to take over the world. Although the movie borrows some background footage from Star Wars, the plot is mostly unrelated.', 'Two space cadets crash-land on a desert planet, where an evil wizard seeks the ultimate power to take over the world. Although the movie borrows some background footage from Star Wars, the plot is mostly unrelated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osC4REvPVBBGca3sleO7pANbSVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20787'),
  ('95855516495478032', 'The Man Who Saved the World', 2014, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Peter Anthony', 'Peter Anthony', 'Stanislav Petrov, Kevin Costner, Sergey Shnyryov, Nataliya Vdovina, Walter Cronkite, Oleg Kassin, Galina Kalinina, Robert De Niro', null, 'The Man Who Saved the World is a feature documentary film about Stanislav Petrov, a former lieutenant colonel of the Soviet Air Defence Forces.', 'The Man Who Saved the World is a feature documentary film about Stanislav Petrov, a former lieutenant colonel of the Soviet Air Defence Forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IyL7p8BiCBO5yme5bvEuCu41EY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214137'),
  ('307374326463353052', 'The Man Who Saw Tomorrow', 1981, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Robert Guenette', 'Alan Hopgood, Robert Guenette', 'Orson Welles, Ray Laska, Harry Bugin, David Burke, Ross Evans, Paul Valentine, Philip L. Clarke, Queen Mary', 'PG', 'Hosted by Orson Welles, this documentary utilizes a grab bag of dramatized scenes, stock footage, TV news clips and interviews to ask: Did 16th century French astrologer and physician Nostradamus actually predict such events as the fall of King Louis XVI, the rise of Napoleon, the assassination of President John F. Kennedy? And are there prophecies that have yet to come true?', 'Hosted by Orson Welles, this documentary utilizes a grab bag of dramatized scenes, stock footage, TV news clips and interviews to ask: Did 16th century French astrologer and physician Nostradamus actually predict such events as the fall of King Louis XVI, the rise of Napoleon, the assassination of President John F. Kennedy? And are there prophecies that have yet to come true?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEf5Dfi0ZKDXRTJzCyTzF8PUkmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46973'),
  ('692524796642523473', 'The Man Who Saw Too Much', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Trisha Ziff, Felipe Perez-Burchard', 'Trisha Ziff', 'Enrique Metinides, Felipe León Romo, Pedro Meyer, Michael Nyman, Elizabeth Metinides, Denise Wolff, Dan Gilroy, Carole Naggar', null, 'A film about fragility; about a man obsessed with photographing the accident who discovered that the fate of others was his way of connecting to life. When does the image of the accident become the object of desire? Following the footsteps of Metinides and the work of contemporary tabloid photographers, we discover Mexico City through a narrative of crime scenes and accidents; rubbernecking though Metinides’ Gaze.', 'A film about fragility; about a man obsessed with photographing the accident who discovered that the fate of others was his way of connecting to life. When does the image of the accident become the object of desire? Following the footsteps of Metinides and the work of contemporary tabloid photographers, we discover Mexico City through a narrative of crime scenes and accidents; rubbernecking though Metinides’ Gaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/246XMTlPPihO3mOx687m04GVxE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363293'),
  ('22035580450112601', 'The Man Who Sleeps', 1974, 'Drama', 'Bernard Queysanne, Jacques Lederer, Jean-Pierre Poussin', 'Georges Perec', 'Jacques Spiesser, Ludmila Mikaël', null, 'A young student decides to have no more interaction with the world than is needed to minimally sustain life. His increasingly automaton-like behavior is coupled with a strange clarity of insight about the world around him.', 'A young student decides to have no more interaction with the world than is needed to minimally sustain life. His increasingly automaton-like behavior is coupled with a strange clarity of insight about the world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEX0pQzpmsBM6pRo3meindwNTzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104086'),
  ('22697432052508291', 'The Man Who Sold His Skin', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kaouther Ben Hania, Christopher Aoun', 'Kaouther Ben Hania', 'Yahya Mahayni, Dea Liane, Koen De Bouw, Monica Bellucci, Saad Lostan, Darina Al Joundi, Jan Dahdouh, Christian Vadim', null, 'To be able to travel to Europe and find the love of his life, Sam Ali, a Syrian refugee, accepts to have his back tattooed by one of the most sulfurous contemporary artist; becoming that way a precious work of art.', 'To be able to travel to Europe and find the love of his life, Sam Ali, a Syrian refugee, accepts to have his back tattooed by one of the most sulfurous contemporary artist; becoming that way a precious work of art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1wRIwEttuWUByTm1wXsfCstNlh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669363'),
  ('1068426642371460213', 'The Man Who Stole the Sun', 1979, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Kazuhiko Hasegawa, Shinji Sōmai, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Kazuhiko Hasegawa', 'Kenji Sawada, Bunta Sugawara, Kimiko Ikegami, Kazuo Kitamura, Shigeru Kōyama, Kei Satō, Yūnosuke Itō, Eimei Esumi', null, 'A high school science teacher is the butt of all his students'' jokes, until their bus is hijacked on a school trip. But something more sinister lurks beneath the surface: he''s building an atomic bomb in his apartment.', 'A high school science teacher is the butt of all his students'' jokes, until their bus is hijacked on a school trip. But something more sinister lurks beneath the surface: he''s building an atomic bomb in his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCzqMbajf0p9aGe7Z4HU5FHl5AA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59352'),
  ('859649572547060595', 'The Man Who Sued God', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Mark Joffe, Peter James, David Woodland', 'Don Watson', 'Billy Connolly, Judy Davis, Colin Friels, Wendy Hughes, Emily Browning, Bille Brown, John Howard, Blair Venn', null, 'A lawyer becomes a fisherman from frustration. When his one piece of property, his boat, is struck by lightning and destroyed he is denied insurance money because it was “an act of God”. He re-registers as a lawyer and sues the insurance company and, as God’s representative, The Church.', 'A lawyer becomes a fisherman from frustration. When his one piece of property, his boat, is struck by lightning and destroyed he is denied insurance money because it was “an act of God”. He re-registers as a lawyer and sues the insurance company and, as God’s representative, The Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mB43zGijLyPZPgX9jC3oRtC4BY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9648'),
  ('926183039823456686', 'The Man Who Thought Life', 1969, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Witold Leszczyński, Jens Ravn, Gert Fredholm', 'Jens Ravn, Henrik Stangerup', 'Preben Neergaard, John Price, Lotte Tarp, Lars Lunøe, Kirsten Rolffes, Ejner Federspiel, Elith Pio, Jørgen Beck', null, 'The mysterious Mr. Steinmetz has acquired the ability to create things and beings by will alone. Only, after a while his creations invariably disappear. He therefore approaches a famous brain surgeon, Max Holst, who he hopes can help him with this problem. When Max refuses, Steinmetz brings his doppelgänger into being to replace him.', 'The mysterious Mr. Steinmetz has acquired the ability to create things and beings by will alone. Only, after a while his creations invariably disappear. He therefore approaches a famous brain surgeon, Max Holst, who he hopes can help him with this problem. When Max refuses, Steinmetz brings his doppelgänger into being to replace him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zetHjyxYVRlctuNFyz2Tv1QzeuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96148'),
  ('575348154749434883', 'The Man Who Turned to Stone', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'László Kardos, Sam Nelson, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Victor Jory, William Hudson, Charlotte Austin, Jean Willes, Ann Doran, Paul Cavanagh, George Lynn, Victor Varconi', 'NR', 'A new social worker at a girls'' reformatory discovers that her charges are being used by a group of ancient alchemists, who have insinuated themselves as the prison''s chief staffers, to keep themselves alive and free from an insidious petrification, which is already afflicting one of their number.', 'A new social worker at a girls'' reformatory discovers that her charges are being used by a group of ancient alchemists, who have insinuated themselves as the prison''s chief staffers, to keep themselves alive and free from an insidious petrification, which is already afflicting one of their number.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3OhX5wLUAsbjUEQhwdDspIOCIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29238'),
  ('420521334639642706', 'The Man Who Wagged His Tail', 1957, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ladislao Vajda, Heinrich Gärtner, Riccardo Pazzaglia', 'Ladislao Vajda, José Santugini, Ugo Guerra', 'Peter Ustinov, Pablito Calvo, Aroldo Tieri, Silvia Marco, Maurizio Arena, Julia Caba Alba, Luis Sánchez Polack, José Isbert', null, 'The owner of a building tyrannizes his immigrant tenants. Transformed into a dog by an old woman''s curse, he experiences all the hardships of his situation; when a child''s affection turns him back into a man, his soul is radically changed.', 'The owner of a building tyrannizes his immigrant tenants. Transformed into a dog by an old woman''s curse, he experiences all the hardships of his situation; when a child''s affection turns him back into a man, his soul is radically changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGm05JB54vcP5vnZIT1CfYDeH5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105054'),
  ('449004930276841590', 'The Man Who Walked Through the Wall', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Ladislao Vajda', 'Marcel Aymé, István Békeffy, Hans Jacoby', 'Heinz Rühmann, Rudolf Vogel, Hubert von Meyerinck, Peter Vogel, Nicole Courcel, Elfie Pertramer, Lina Carstens, Karl Lieffen', null, 'Mr. Buchsbaum, third class taxes employee, lives a peaceful life until the new chief immediately criticizes his work. His only confort is his stamps collection. Sadly, even this consolation and his peace are threatened by a new, charming, neighbour who teaches piano. Increasingly infuriated, he discovers accidentally one evening that he has the ability to go through walls. With this power, he decides to settle the scores, firstly with his boss who downgraded him.', 'Mr. Buchsbaum, third class taxes employee, lives a peaceful life until the new chief immediately criticizes his work. His only confort is his stamps collection. Sadly, even this consolation and his peace are threatened by a new, charming, neighbour who teaches piano. Increasingly infuriated, he discovers accidentally one evening that he has the ability to go through walls. With this power, he decides to settle the scores, firstly with his boss who downgraded him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naGj2FbC0BZXGQWRojAuPRFzouV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232186'),
  ('499923087376053233', 'The Man Who Was Sherlock Holmes', 1937, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Karl Hartl, Fritz Arno Wagner, Karl Plintzner', 'Karl Hartl, Robert A. Stemmle', 'Hans Albers, Heinz Rühmann, Marieluise Claudius, Hansi Knoteck, Günther Ballier, Ernst Behmer, Paul Bildt, Harry Hardt', null, 'Two dubious characters disguise themselves as Holmes and Watson to gain attention and end up chasing counterfeiters and stolen stamps.', 'Two dubious characters disguise themselves as Holmes and Watson to gain attention and end up chasing counterfeiters and stolen stamps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvLpnsjwKK9gudKWLYl15oexjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6155'),
  ('1044082227783987211', 'The Man Who Wasn''t There', 1983, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Bruce Malmuth, Frederick Moore, Gary Dahl', 'Stanford Sherman', 'Steve Guttenberg, Lisa Langlois, Jeffrey Tambor, Art Hindle, Morgan Hart, Bruce Malmuth, Ivan Naranjo, Harold Ayer', 'R', 'When he accidentally takes possession of a top-secret invisibility potion while en route to his wedding, government bureaucrat Sam Cooper finds himself engulfed in a madcap free-for-all as Russians and other bad guys try to get the substance. To elude the Reds, his own State Department bosses and his livid fiancée, Cooper takes the vanishing juice himself—which only makes matters worse.', 'When he accidentally takes possession of a top-secret invisibility potion while en route to his wedding, government bureaucrat Sam Cooper finds himself engulfed in a madcap free-for-all as Russians and other bad guys try to get the substance. To elude the Reds, his own State Department bosses and his livid fiancée, Cooper takes the vanishing juice himself—which only makes matters worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAf6k3B98uyp50yEqTEJh9ZGyaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29610'),
  ('654110982800993458', 'The Man Who Wasn''t There', 2001, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joel Coen, Roger Deakins, Betsy Magruder', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Frances McDormand, Michael Badalucco, James Gandolfini, Katherine Borowitz, Jon Polito, Scarlett Johansson, Richard Jenkins', 'R', 'A tale of murder, crime and punishment set in the summer of 1949. Ed Crane, a barber in a small California town, is dissatisfied with his life, but his wife Doris'' infidelity and a mysterious opportunity presents him with a chance to change it.', 'A tale of murder, crime and punishment set in the summer of 1949. Ed Crane, a barber in a small California town, is dissatisfied with his life, but his wife Doris'' infidelity and a mysterious opportunity presents him with a chance to change it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrCgt8NNMyFsfmXyXiSSCRXNH4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10778'),
  ('556293275809532298', 'The Man Who Watched Trains Go By', 1952, 'Crime, Drama', 'Otto Heller, Harold French, Elven Webb', 'Paul Jarrico, Harold French', 'Claude Rains, Marius Goring, Märta Torén, Anouk Aimée, Herbert Lom, Lucie Mannheim, Felix Aylmer, Ferdy Mayne', 'NR', 'A Dutch company''s owner bankrupts his own company, burns the incriminating ledgers and plans to run to Paris with the company funds but he is caught in the act by his accountant who challenges his actions, leading to a reversal of roles.', 'A Dutch company''s owner bankrupts his own company, burns the incriminating ledgers and plans to run to Paris with the company funds but he is caught in the act by his accountant who challenges his actions, leading to a reversal of roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuCWsTC1UXjpAelhQCGpvNskJL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37340'),
  ('457860165831067800', 'The Man Who Will Come', 2009, 'Drama', 'Giorgio Diritti, Roberto Cimatti, Irene Caselli', 'Giovanni Galavotti, Giorgio Diritti, Tania Pedroni', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Greta Zuccheri Montanari, Maria Grazia Naldi, Eleonora Mazzoni, Maya Sansa, Claudio Casadio, Vito, Orfeo Orlando', null, 'A group of Italian villagers struggle to survive during a tumultuous time in 1943, debating how much assistance to give the partisans with the impending arrival of the Germans. Based on True Events.', 'A group of Italian villagers struggle to survive during a tumultuous time in 1943, debating how much assistance to give the partisans with the impending arrival of the Germans. Based on True Events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyECMT8vSpUpaCRHPNPSBlaVV09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42808'),
  ('850310204901250560', 'The Man Who Would Be King', 1975, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Oswald Morris, John Huston, Michael D. Moore', 'Gladys Hill, John Huston', 'Sean Connery, Michael Caine, Christopher Plummer, Saeed Jaffrey, Doghmi Larbi, Jack May, Karroom Ben Bouih, Mohammad Shamsi', 'PG', 'Tired of life as soldiers, Peachy Carnehan and Danny Dravot travel to the isolated land of Kafiristan, where they are ultimately embraced by the people and revered as rulers. After a series of misunderstandings, the natives come to believe that Dravot is a god, but he and Carnehan can''t keep up their deception forever.', 'Tired of life as soldiers, Peachy Carnehan and Danny Dravot travel to the isolated land of Kafiristan, where they are ultimately embraced by the people and revered as rulers. After a series of misunderstandings, the natives come to believe that Dravot is a god, but he and Carnehan can''t keep up their deception forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnEhm0CtgJoM9Z1dGGSQAwxU7oJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983'),
  ('125369492246912397', 'The Man Who Wouldn''t Die', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Emil Newman, Joseph MacDonald, Herbert I. Leeds', 'Arnaud d''Usseau', 'Lloyd Nolan, Marjorie Weaver, Helene Reynolds, Henry Wilcoxon, Richard Derr, Paul Harvey, Billy Bevan, Olin Howland', null, 'A man believed to be dead and buried escapes from his grave and returns to the scene of the crime seeking revenge.', 'A man believed to be dead and buried escapes from his grave and returns to the scene of the crime seeking revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZJOxN0N91ftyO4AfD4DSwupM7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106060'),
  ('125032965189402016', 'The Man with a Cloak', 1951, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fletcher Markle, George J. Folsey', 'Frank Fenton', 'Joseph Cotten, Barbara Stanwyck, Louis Calhern, Leslie Caron, Joe De Santis, Jim Backus, Margaret Wycherly, Richard Hale', 'NR', 'Set in 19th-century New York, this mystery begins when a Frenchwoman shows up at the home of one of Napoleon''s former marshals. The alcoholic man is badly crippled and slowly dying, but this doesn''t stop the forthright lady from pushing him to change his will to include his estranged grandson so that he can help out the struggling French Republic. Unfortunately, the dying man''s conniving housekeeper and butler, already planning murder to get the money themselves, overhear her and begin plotting her demise.', 'Set in 19th-century New York, this mystery begins when a Frenchwoman shows up at the home of one of Napoleon''s former marshals. The alcoholic man is badly crippled and slowly dying, but this doesn''t stop the forthright lady from pushing him to change his will to include his estranged grandson so that he can help out the struggling French Republic. Unfortunately, the dying man''s conniving housekeeper and butler, already planning murder to get the money themselves, overhear her and begin plotting her demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZbpS0m9G2F3DR2y2RGwTgSVNcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83664'),
  ('229751928619725122', 'The Man with a Shotgun', 1961, 'Crime, Action', 'Seijun Suzuki, Hiromi Higuchi, Shigeyoshi Mine', 'Kenrō Matsuura, Kiichi Ishii', 'Hideaki Nitani, Izumi Ashikawa, Yuji Odaka, Yōko Minamida, Toshio Takahara, Eiji Gō, Takashi Ebata, Akio Tanaka', null, 'Ryoji, a wanderer, arrives in a remote mountain town, carrying a shotgun and claiming to be a hunter. He quickly becomes embroiled in a web of trouble surrounding the town''s mill.', 'Ryoji, a wanderer, arrives in a remote mountain town, carrying a shotgun and claiming to be a hunter. He quickly becomes embroiled in a web of trouble surrounding the town''s mill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwpYMtkm5FFl2AXDxMxMSjfstgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370969'),
  ('948916684470163833', 'The Man with a Thousand Faces', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Sonia Kronlund', null, null, null, 'Through the eyes of the victims, filmmaker Sonia Kronlund investigates to find out who is the man hiding himself behind so many identities.', 'Through the eyes of the victims, filmmaker Sonia Kronlund investigates to find out who is the man hiding himself behind so many identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wO2xTdJyqshKDUifZZDt9o50ufX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1230141'),
  ('780935896059584493', 'The Man with Bogart''s Face', 1980, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Robert Day, Richard C. Glouner', 'Andrew J. Fenady', 'Robert Sacchi, Franco Nero, Michelle Phillips, Olivia Hussey, Misty Rowe, Victor Buono, Herbert Lom, Sybil Danning', 'PG', 'In this send-up of the Humphrey Bogart detective films of the 1940s, a man idolizes Bogart so much that he has his features altered to look exactly like him and then opens up a detective agency under the name Sam Marlow.', 'In this send-up of the Humphrey Bogart detective films of the 1940s, a man idolizes Bogart so much that he has his features altered to look exactly like him and then opens up a detective agency under the name Sam Marlow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77nNaCecAyWIwWVhKsAGbQFTiPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36460'),
  ('736129269061214087', 'The Man with Connections', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Claude Berri', 'Claude Berri', 'Guy Bedos, Yves Robert, Rosy Varte, Georges Géret, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Zorica Lozić, Claude Piéplu, Coluche', null, 'Following "The Two of Us", Claude is now 21 years old. Content with his life, he has a girlfriend Tania and he aspires to become an actor. When he receives his draft notice, a friend convinces Claude he can get out of military service with his connections in Paris. When the connections fall through, Claude is sent for basic training outside Paris before being shipped off to Algeria. His stops in Morocco and Algeria are uneventful as far as military action goes. He returns home with few bad memories of his army life ...', 'Following "The Two of Us", Claude is now 21 years old. Content with his life, he has a girlfriend Tania and he aspires to become an actor. When he receives his draft notice, a friend convinces Claude he can get out of military service with his connections in Paris. When the connections fall through, Claude is sent for basic training outside Paris before being shipped off to Algeria. His stops in Morocco and Algeria are uneventful as far as military action goes. He returns home with few bad memories of his army life ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0B0ysxwxKVKjkLhTuFY7hndFC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138573'),
  ('1140991428448129708', 'The Man with My Face', 1951, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Edward Montagne, Fred Jackman Jr.', 'Tom McGowan, Vin Bogert, Samuel W. Taylor', 'Barry Nelson, Carole Mathews, John Harvey, Lynn Ainley, Jim Boles, Jack Warden, Henry Lascoe, Johnny Kane', 'NR', 'A man discovers that an evil twin has taken over his life.', 'A man discovers that an evil twin has taken over his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pnFtIROcBnQipmxpg3Cxv2NAa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72773'),
  ('627283242884275125', 'The Man with Nine Lives', 1940, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Nick Grindé, Morris Stoloff, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Karl Brown', 'Boris Karloff, Roger Pryor, Jo Ann Sayers, Stanley Brown, John Dilson, Hal Taliaferro, Byron Foulger, Charles Trowbridge', 'NR', 'Dr. Leon Kravaal develops a potential cure for cancer, which involves freezing the patient. But an experiment goes awry when authorities believe Kravaal has killed a patient. Kravaal freezes the officials, along with himself. Years later, they are discovered and revived in hopes that Kravaal can indeed complete his cure. But human greed and weakness compound to disrupt the project.', 'Dr. Leon Kravaal develops a potential cure for cancer, which involves freezing the patient. But an experiment goes awry when authorities believe Kravaal has killed a patient. Kravaal freezes the officials, along with himself. Years later, they are discovered and revived in hopes that Kravaal can indeed complete his cure. But human greed and weakness compound to disrupt the project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRXAx97EKJDfeCSJbyfJY2UtOiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26924'),
  ('50386239597320602', 'The Man with One Red Shoe', 1985, 'Action, Comedy', 'Stan Dragoti, Richard H. Kline, Alan B. Curtiss', 'Francis Veber, Yves Robert', 'Tom Hanks, Dabney Coleman, Lori Singer, Charles Durning, Carrie Fisher, Edward Herrmann, Jim Belushi, Irving Metzman', 'PG', 'A man is mistaken as a spy by the CIA when he arrives at the airport with one red shoe.', 'A man is mistaken as a spy by the CIA when he arrives at the airport with one red shoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lD44uiCKnLVCKiEnB0urtqIR0nE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10905'),
  ('564050372559067311', 'The Man with Rain in His Shoes', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'María Ripoll, Javier Salmones', 'Rafa Russo', 'Lena Headey, Douglas Henshall, Penélope Cruz, Charlotte Coleman, Gustavo Salmerón, Mark Strong, Elizabeth McGovern, Heather Weeks', 'R', 'Victor Bukowski is an out-of-work actor with problems. He''s got a lousy agent, he has a habit of falling out with directors and he''s still in love with his ex-girlfriend. However, Victor is about to embark on an unexpected emotional journey which will make him confront his future and his past mistakes.', 'Victor Bukowski is an out-of-work actor with problems. He''s got a lousy agent, he has a habit of falling out with directors and he''s still in love with his ex-girlfriend. However, Victor is about to embark on an unexpected emotional journey which will make him confront his future and his past mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVuJserJVW7bWJ0Ni95nowncIWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55912'),
  ('673825594445642402', 'The Man with the Answers', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Thodoros Mihopoulos, Stelios Kammitsis', 'Stelios Kammitsis', 'Vasilis Magouliotis, Anton Weil, Stella Fyrogeni, Marc Pistono, Brando Rossi, Pierpaolo Vitale, Antonis Katsaris, Rinio Dragasaki', null, 'Ex-championship diver Victoras whiles away his days on the Greek coast, toiling away at a factory with only his dreams, medals and grandmother for company. When a phone call summons him to Germany, a simple road trip is the answer - that is until he crosses paths with the handsome Mathias - a free-spirited hitchhiker who tempts Victoras to take the road not taken.', 'Ex-championship diver Victoras whiles away his days on the Greek coast, toiling away at a factory with only his dreams, medals and grandmother for company. When a phone call summons him to Germany, a simple road trip is the answer - that is until he crosses paths with the handsome Mathias - a free-spirited hitchhiker who tempts Victoras to take the road not taken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDyVNPJD39yAE2p6a8ZtbvyDanc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788669'),
  ('32339182499400109', 'The Man with the Balloons', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Marco Ferreri, Giancarlo Santi, Aldo Tonti', 'Rafael Azcona, Marco Ferreri', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Catherine Spaak, Ugo Tognazzi, William Berger, Sarah Ross, Antonio Altoviti, Charlotte Folcher, Gian Luigi Polidoro', null, 'Mario is a Milan industrialist who is constantly testing balloons to see how much air one can take before busting.', 'Mario is a Milan industrialist who is constantly testing balloons to see how much air one can take before busting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdouNDhHp2acw4qbodFOXHq5xW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248592'),
  ('365294343198205208', 'The Man with the Beautiful Eyes', 1999, 'Animation', 'Jonathan Hodgson', null, 'Peter Blegvad, Louis Schendler', null, 'A Charles Bukowski poem is put to animation. Four kids who are friends are drawn to a strange house that their parents tell them to avoid. One day they see a man of about 30 step outside, cigar and whiskey bottle in hand. He becomes a symbol for them of all that is strong, natural, and beautiful. What happens later to this man with the beautiful eyes introduces the boys to the gray and uptight world of adulthood that awaits them.', 'A Charles Bukowski poem is put to animation. Four kids who are friends are drawn to a strange house that their parents tell them to avoid. One day they see a man of about 30 step outside, cigar and whiskey bottle in hand. He becomes a symbol for them of all that is strong, natural, and beautiful. What happens later to this man with the beautiful eyes introduces the boys to the gray and uptight world of adulthood that awaits them.', null, 'tmdb:movie:226429'),
  ('527635012693697629', 'The Man with the Carnation', 1980, 'History, Drama', 'Nikos Kavoukidis, Nikos Tzimas', 'Nikos Tzimas', 'Foivos Gikopoulos, Alekos Alexandrakis, Manos Katrakis, Angelos Antonopoulos, Mirka Papakonstantinou, Kostas Kazakos, Anestis Vlahos, Antonis Antoniou', null, 'The story of Nikos Belogiannis member of the communist party and officer of Ellas that has come back to Greece only to get arrested, tried for espionage on behalf of Russia and executed.', 'The story of Nikos Belogiannis member of the communist party and officer of Ellas that has come back to Greece only to get arrested, tried for espionage on behalf of Russia and executed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PpeepjpCZkF6IHfjc61ZrHlJlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300949'),
  ('693679805734873473', 'The Man with the Cross', 1943, 'War', 'Roberto Rossellini, Guglielmo Lombardi, Mariano Cafiero', 'Alberto Consiglio, Asvero Gravelli, Roberto Rossellini', 'Alberto Tavazzi, Roswita Schmidt, Aldo Capacci, Franco Castellani, Attilio Dottesio, Doris Hild, Gualtiero Isnenghi, Antonio Marietti', null, 'Ukraine, 1942. Italian troops are fighting against the Soviet Union. A military chaplain volunteers to stay behind with a badly wounded Italian soldier, even though this means certain capture.', 'Ukraine, 1942. Italian troops are fighting against the Soviet Union. A military chaplain volunteers to stay behind with a badly wounded Italian soldier, even though this means certain capture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QvxwRUwxRumidqw1dHP1hNcoL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65629'),
  ('388407359910003886', 'The Man with the Glass Eye', 1969, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'Paul Hengge', 'Horst Tappert, Karin Hübner, Hubert von Meyerinck, Stefan Behrens, Fritz Wepper, Ilse Pagé, Christiane Krüger, Ewa Strömberg', null, 'A man is found dead in a London hotel. The knife is still firmly stuck in the victim''s chest, and Inspector Perkins strangely finds a glass eye in his jacket pocket. Kurt after that a second, mysterious murder happens: A city-famous dancer of the Las Vegas Girls, who perform at the London Odeon Theater, is poisoned. Is there a connection between the pretty dancer and the hotel guest? Inspector Perkins and his colleagues are pressed for time. The "man with the glass eye" strikes deadly again and again. A first clue leads Scotland Yard to a billiard club, where one has to show a glass eye as an admission ticket.', 'A man is found dead in a London hotel. The knife is still firmly stuck in the victim''s chest, and Inspector Perkins strangely finds a glass eye in his jacket pocket. Kurt after that a second, mysterious murder happens: A city-famous dancer of the Las Vegas Girls, who perform at the London Odeon Theater, is poisoned. Is there a connection between the pretty dancer and the hotel guest? Inspector Perkins and his colleagues are pressed for time. The "man with the glass eye" strikes deadly again and again. A first clue leads Scotland Yard to a billiard club, where one has to show a glass eye as an admission ticket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dokZPVLz0dtqeKdY6wK3SVaO8BO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100124'),
  ('604407491335095987', 'The Man with the Golden Arm', 1955, 'Drama, Crime', 'Otto Preminger, Sam Leavitt, Horace Hough', 'Walter Newman, Lewis Meltzer', 'Frank Sinatra, Eleanor Parker, Kim Novak, Arnold Stang, Darren McGavin, Robert Strauss, John Conte, Doro Merande', 'NR', 'When illegal card dealer and recovering heroin addict Frankie Machine gets out of prison, he decides to straighten up. Armed with nothing but an old drum set, Frankie tries to get honest work as a drummer. But when his former employer and his old drug dealer re-enter his life, Frankie finds it hard to stay clean and eventually finds himself succumbing to his old habits.', 'When illegal card dealer and recovering heroin addict Frankie Machine gets out of prison, he decides to straighten up. Armed with nothing but an old drum set, Frankie tries to get honest work as a drummer. But when his former employer and his old drug dealer re-enter his life, Frankie finds it hard to stay clean and eventually finds himself succumbing to his old habits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TUOhZhM5GCYIbxwFO3chpZ0DHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541'),
  ('440938576571606482', 'The Man with the Golden Gun', 1974, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Guy Hamilton, Ted Moore, Oswald Morris', 'Richard Maibaum, Tom Mankiewicz', 'Roger Moore, Christopher Lee, Britt Ekland, Maud Adams, Hervé Villechaize, Clifton James, Richard Loo, Soon-Tek Oh', 'PG', 'Cool government operative James Bond searches for a stolen invention that can turn the sun''s heat into a destructive weapon. He soon crosses paths with the menacing Francisco Scaramanga, a hitman so skilled he has a seven-figure working fee. Bond then joins forces with the swimsuit-clad Mary Goodnight, and together they track Scaramanga to a Thai tropical isle hideout where the killer-for-hire lures the slick spy into a deadly maze for a final duel.', 'Cool government operative James Bond searches for a stolen invention that can turn the sun''s heat into a destructive weapon. He soon crosses paths with the menacing Francisco Scaramanga, a hitman so skilled he has a seven-figure working fee. Bond then joins forces with the swimsuit-clad Mary Goodnight, and together they track Scaramanga to a Thai tropical isle hideout where the killer-for-hire lures the slick spy into a deadly maze for a final duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVkbKwGnBVNQ122GN5bCTMyPbWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682'),
  ('289604847779264166', 'The Man with the Gun', 1938, 'History', 'Sergei Yutkevich, Iosif Martov, A. Goldburt', 'Nikolay Pogodin', 'Maksim Shtraukh, Boris Tenin, Mikheil Gelovani, Vladimir Lukin, Mark Bernes, Stepan Kayukov, Boris Chirkov, Serafima Birman', null, 'The story of the Bolshevik revolution through the eyes of a peasant who, as a soldier, gets caught up in the proceedings under the tutelage of Lenin.', 'The story of the Bolshevik revolution through the eyes of a peasant who, as a soldier, gets caught up in the proceedings under the tutelage of Lenin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTqhrL6Bbydtp2hhfriHthRJo5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406287'),
  ('750000205012608228', 'The Man with the Iron Fists', 2012, 'Action', 'RZA, Chan Chi-Ying, Thomas Chow Wai-Kwan', 'Eli Roth, RZA', 'RZA, Russell Crowe, Pam Grier, Dave Bautista, Lucy Liu, Jamie Chung, Cung Le, Zhu Zhu', 'R', 'In feudal China, a blacksmith who makes weapons for a small village is put in the position where he must defend himself and his fellow villagers.', 'In feudal China, a blacksmith who makes weapons for a small village is put in the position where he must defend himself and his fellow villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHgkRj6Igx3QsHmTyF4oAfBjAE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97430'),
  ('816621389417759619', 'The Man with the Iron Fists 2', 2015, 'Action, Adventure', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'RZA, John Jarrell', 'RZA, Dustin Nguyễn, Eugenia Yuan, Pim Bubear, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Carl Ng Ka-Lung, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Ocean Hou', 'R', 'When a stranger, Thaddeus, is found badly wounded near the village, miner Li Kung and his wife Ah Ni offer him refuge. As he heals, he becomes entrenched in a conflict that pits the townsfolk against the evil Master Ho, his nefarious Beetle Clan and the terrifying Lord Pi.', 'When a stranger, Thaddeus, is found badly wounded near the village, miner Li Kung and his wife Ah Ni offer him refuge. As he heals, he becomes entrenched in a conflict that pits the townsfolk against the evil Master Ho, his nefarious Beetle Clan and the terrifying Lord Pi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9QkkyM8nqmwYGU9FCEuzcV9y4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321494'),
  ('139910842704577330', 'The Man with the Iron Heart', 2017, 'War, Action, History, Thriller', 'Cédric Jimenez, Laurent Tangy', 'David Farr, Cédric Jimenez, Audrey Diwan', 'Jason Clarke, Rosamund Pike, Jack O''Connell, Jack Reynor, Mia Wasikowska, Stephen Graham, Thomas M. Wright, Barry Atsma', 'R', 'With the Third Reich at its peak in 1942, the Czech resistance in London plans the most ambitious military operation of WWII – Anthropoid. Two young recruits are sent to Prague to assassinate the most ruthless Nazi leader – Reinhard Heydrich, head of the Reich Security Main Office, the Gestapo and the architect of the Final Solution.', 'With the Third Reich at its peak in 1942, the Czech resistance in London plans the most ambitious military operation of WWII – Anthropoid. Two young recruits are sent to Prague to assassinate the most ruthless Nazi leader – Reinhard Heydrich, head of the Reich Security Main Office, the Gestapo and the architect of the Final Solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZVQfCY2DgCjrm8w2saXvT8Ao3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339259'),
  ('770697220715842654', 'The Man with the Magic Box', 2017, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Bodo Kox, Arkadiusz Tomiak', 'Bodo Kox', 'Olga Bołądź, Piotr Polak, Sebastian Stankiewicz, Helena Norowicz, Wojciech Zieliński, Bartłomiej Firlet, Iwo Adamczyk, Lena Adamczyk', 'PG-13', 'A man stricken with amnesia, discovers a mysterious radio whose music brings back troubling memories from his forgotten past.', 'A man stricken with amnesia, discovers a mysterious radio whose music brings back troubling memories from his forgotten past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TtS4G89BHBBTNMWReTVasFlmVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484917'),
  ('218260249376147005', 'The Man with the Rubber Head', 1901, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A chemist carries out a bizarre experiment with his own head.', 'A chemist carries out a bizarre experiment with his own head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h268Nn1UjDm5x02tkEgId7CF9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49279'),
  ('268025992428611758', 'The Man with Two Brains', 1983, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Michael Chapman, Carl Reiner', 'George Gipe, Steve Martin, Carl Reiner', 'Steve Martin, Kathleen Turner, David Warner, Paul Benedict, Richard Brestoff, James Cromwell, George Furth, Peter Hobbs', 'R', 'A brain surgeon marries a femme fatale, causing his life to turn upside down. Things go more awry when he falls in love with a talking brain.', 'A brain surgeon marries a femme fatale, causing his life to turn upside down. Things go more awry when he falls in love with a talking brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSnGiPE17sgicRyTPrE6UB0pnEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11591'),
