  ('1102990664209580768', 'The Man with Wax Faces', 1914, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Maurice Tourneur', 'André de Lorde', 'Henry Roussel, Emile Tramont, Henri Gouget', null, 'A man does not know what fear is. His good friend dares him to spend one night in a scary place. A house of wax will get the job done.', 'A man does not know what fear is. His good friend dares him to spend one night in a scary place. A house of wax will get the job done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib2OIPAQ4cB2qJUb1WbvqFelBRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134615'),
  ('953846202879785280', 'The Man Without a Country', 1937, 'Drama', 'Crane Wilbur, Allen M. Davey', 'Forrest Barnes', 'John Litel, Gloria Holden, Ted Osborne, Donald Brian, Holmes Herbert, Erville Alderson, John Harron, Wilfred Lucas', null, 'This short film tells the story of a disgraced U.S. army officer who is charged with treason. At his court martial he is sentenced to lifetime exile aboard American ships at sea, no crew member can mention anything about the United States within his hearing, and in the books he is allowed to read all references to the United States are removed.', 'This short film tells the story of a disgraced U.S. army officer who is charged with treason. At his court martial he is sentenced to lifetime exile aboard American ships at sea, no crew member can mention anything about the United States within his hearing, and in the books he is allowed to read all references to the United States are removed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4KGBEG65XuZiSPU464MJhRytoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233710'),
  ('971728736628434219', 'The Man Without a Face', 1950, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Juan Bustillo Oro, Jorge Stahl Jr., Valerio Olivo', 'Juan Bustillo Oro', 'Arturo de Córdova, Carmen Molina, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Queta Lavat, Chela Campos, Fernando Galiana, Armando Sáenz, Ramón Sánchez', null, 'A faceless killer who hunts women can only be stopped by a detective with a disturbing past.', 'A faceless killer who hunts women can only be stopped by a detective with a disturbing past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jSmEGZhblLWCEYawOhgTHxYNjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210653'),
  ('692259910980845568', 'The Man Without a Face', 1993, 'Drama', 'Mel Gibson, Donald McAlpine', 'Malcolm MacRury', 'Mel Gibson, Nick Stahl, Margaret Whitton, Fay Masterson, Gaby Hoffmann, Geoffrey Lewis, Richard Masur, Michael DeLuise', 'PG-13', 'Justin McLeod is a former teacher who lives as a recluse on the edge of town after his face is disfigured from an automobile accident ten years earlier, in which a boy was incinerated--and for which he was convicted of involuntary manslaughter. Also suspected of being a paedophile, he is befriended by Chuck, causing the town''s suspicions and hostility to be ignited.', 'Justin McLeod is a former teacher who lives as a recluse on the edge of town after his face is disfigured from an automobile accident ten years earlier, in which a boy was incinerated--and for which he was convicted of involuntary manslaughter. Also suspected of being a paedophile, he is befriended by Chuck, causing the town''s suspicions and hostility to be ignited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dmH2jc6jwlZo90JQTFOx4XaBWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10502'),
  ('592005655751868428', 'The Man Without a Head', 2003, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Juan Diego Solanas, Juan Diego Solanas', 'Juan Diego Solanas', 'Laurent Bert, Yannick Blivet, Christophe Botti', null, 'A shy man prepares for his date but feels he must buy a head for the occasion.', 'A shy man prepares for his date but feels he must buy a head for the occasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40KuQohc3QkK68LXZqGqSQXkaAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110108'),
  ('765007826481493168', 'The Man Without a Map', 1968, 'Mystery', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara, Akira Okazaki, Akira Uehara', 'Kōbō Abe', 'Shintarō Katsu, Etsuko Ichihara, Osamu Ōkawa, Kiyoshi Atsumi, Tamao Nakamura, Kinzō Shin, Reiko Kasahara, Hōsei Komatsu', null, 'A private detective is hired to find a missing man by his wife. While his search is unsuccessful, the detective''s own life begins to resemble the man for whom he is searching.', 'A private detective is hired to find a missing man by his wife. While his search is unsuccessful, the detective''s own life begins to resemble the man for whom he is searching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IuragDDzBq7Zin4RfEwmYEw5fO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56599'),
  ('791253874238043811', 'The Man Without a Past', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Nadja Delcos', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Markku Peltola, Kati Outinen, Juhani Niemelä, Kaija Pakarinen, Sakari Kuosmanen, Annikki Tähti, Anneli Sauli, Elina Salo', 'PG-13', 'Arriving in Helsinki, a nameless man is beaten within an inch of his life by thugs, miraculously recovering only to find that he has completely lost his memory. Back on the streets, he attempts to begin again from zero, befriending a moody dog and becoming besotted with a Salvation Army volunteer.', 'Arriving in Helsinki, a nameless man is beaten within an inch of his life by thugs, miraculously recovering only to find that he has completely lost his memory. Back on the streets, he attempts to begin again from zero, befriending a moody dog and becoming besotted with a Salvation Army volunteer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tBepCujkyNg1qM52MsaJfDkIRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7294'),
