  ('233623676790033389', 'The Man Without Gravity', 2019, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Michele D''Attanasio, Marco Bonfanti', 'Marco Bonfanti, Giulio Carrieri', 'Elio Germano, Michela Cescon, Silvia D''Amico, Elena Cotta, Vincent Scarito, Pietro Pescara, Jennifer Brokshi, Andrea Pennacchi', null, 'A gravity-defying boy raised in seclusion matures into an extraordinary man -- and an international celebrity -- who longs for human connection.', 'A gravity-defying boy raised in seclusion matures into an extraordinary man -- and an international celebrity -- who longs for human connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9Ppy5NfGmw25f6lWa1zJFRgXjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636698'),
  ('20190529847455629', 'The Man-Eater', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Aurelio Grimaldi, Massimo Intoppa', 'Aurelio Grimaldi, Michele Lo Foco', 'Loredana Cannata, Arturo Paglia, Pascal Persiano, Loredana Solfizi, Gianluca Cuomo, Francesco Di Leva, Marcello Aiello, Johnny Scavone', 'NR', 'This is the story of a Sicilian woman that tries to have avidly as many sexual adventures as possible. She uses different identities and personalities, but she can''t stop collecting adventures. One day she meets Valerio, a young student who falls in love with her.', 'This is the story of a Sicilian woman that tries to have avidly as many sexual adventures as possible. She uses different identities and personalities, but she can''t stop collecting adventures. One day she meets Valerio, a young student who falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvusAHZoSSjnLkkPdAMmqmOyxwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69733'),
  ('1077555713793383875', 'The Manchurian Candidate', 1962, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lionel Lindon, John Frankenheimer, Joseph C. Behm', 'George Axelrod', 'Frank Sinatra, Laurence Harvey, Angela Lansbury, Janet Leigh, James Gregory, Henry Silva, Leslie Parrish, John McGiver', 'PG-13', 'Near the end of the Korean War, a platoon of U.S. soldiers is captured by communists and brainwashed. Following the war, the platoon is returned home, and Sergeant Raymond Shaw is lauded as a hero by the rest of his platoon. However, the platoon commander, Captain Bennett Marco, finds himself plagued by strange nightmares and soon races to uncover a terrible plot.', 'Near the end of the Korean War, a platoon of U.S. soldiers is captured by communists and brainwashed. Following the war, the platoon is returned home, and Sergeant Raymond Shaw is lauded as a hero by the rest of his platoon. However, the platoon commander, Captain Bennett Marco, finds himself plagued by strange nightmares and soon races to uncover a terrible plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xQ856kd9hw6bB3OnusGyTvvkwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982'),
  ('142329785368114386', 'The Manchurian Candidate', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jonathan Demme, Tak Fujimoto, Robert Braun', 'Dean Georgaris, Daniel Pyne', 'Denzel Washington, Meryl Streep, Liev Schreiber, Simon McBurney, Kimberly Elise, Bruno Ganz, Jon Voight, Jeffrey Wright', 'R', 'Years after his squad was ambushed during the Gulf War, Major Ben Marco finds himself having terrible nightmares. He begins to doubt that his fellow squad-mate Sergeant Raymond Shaw, now a vice-presidential candidate, is the hero he remembers him being. As Marco''s doubts deepen, Shaw''s political power grows, and, when Marco finds a mysterious implant embedded in his back, the memory of what really happened begins to return.', 'Years after his squad was ambushed during the Gulf War, Major Ben Marco finds himself having terrible nightmares. He begins to doubt that his fellow squad-mate Sergeant Raymond Shaw, now a vice-presidential candidate, is the hero he remembers him being. As Marco''s doubts deepen, Shaw''s political power grows, and, when Marco finds a mysterious implant embedded in his back, the memory of what really happened begins to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xEWtEbKK2EXMZ8UPff8hDCSiVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14462'),
