  ('1059451466799480676', 'The March of the Machines', 1927, null, 'Eugène Deslaw, Boris Kaufman', null, null, null, 'La marche des machines is a thundering, thumping symphony of turbines, belts, flanges, wheels and sparks.', 'La marche des machines is a thundering, thumping symphony of turbines, belts, flanges, wheels and sparks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7i25geN9162SuYmFct9d1xm2Kdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189651'),
  ('713525833190715881', 'The Marchers', 2013, 'Drama', 'Nabil Ben Yadir, Danny Elsen', 'Nabil Ben Yadir', 'Olivier Gourmet, Jamel Debbouze, Charlotte Le Bon, Hafsia Herzi, Tewfik Jallab, Vincent Rottiers, M''Barek Belkouk, Lubna Azabal', null, 'In 1983, in France experiencing intolerance and racial violence , three young teens and the priest Minguettes launching a largely peaceful march for equality and against racism, over 1,000 km between Marseille and Paris . Despite the difficulties and resistance encountered, their movement will bring about a real boost of hope in the way of Gandhi and Martin Luther King. They unite with their arrival more than 100 000 people from all walks of life and give France its new face.', 'In 1983, in France experiencing intolerance and racial violence , three young teens and the priest Minguettes launching a largely peaceful march for equality and against racism, over 1,000 km between Marseille and Paris . Despite the difficulties and resistance encountered, their movement will bring about a real boost of hope in the way of Gandhi and Martin Luther King. They unite with their arrival more than 100 000 people from all walks of life and give France its new face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbfglHmVCKz2LGUMiHXUmckqwjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225160'),
  ('331087981868469492', 'The Marching Band', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Emmanuel Courcol, Marie-Frédérique Lauriot-Dit-Prévost, Maxence Lemonnier', 'Emmanuel Courcol, Irène Muscari', 'Benjamin Lavernhe, Pierre Lottin, Sarah Suco, Clémence Massart-Weit, Ludmila Mikaël, Anne Loiret, Jacques Bonnaffé, Yvon Martin', null, 'Diagnosed with leukemia, a successful orchestra conductor learns that he is adopted, and his younger brother is in a village marching band. The conductor decides to help them win a regional contest.', 'Diagnosed with leukemia, a successful orchestra conductor learns that he is adopted, and his younger brother is in a village marching band. The conductor decides to help them win a regional contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lATJ42bWGAIQ0cG2dzSZD8bNcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000866'),
  ('1108830522363939262', 'The Marco Effect', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Aske Foss, Martin Zandvliet, Christian Bonke', 'Martin Zandvliet, Thomas Porsager, Anders Frithiof August', 'Ulrich Thomsen, Zaki Youssef, Sofie Torp, Anders Matthesen, Luboš Oláh, Henrik Noël Olesen, Thomas W. Gabrielsson, Lisa Carlehed', null, 'When a homeless Romani boy is arrested at the Danish border for possession of a missing public servant''s passport, police inspector Carl Mørck and Department Q are tasked with finding the connection.', 'When a homeless Romani boy is arrested at the Danish border for possession of a missing public servant''s passport, police inspector Carl Mørck and Department Q are tasked with finding the connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iedopRnMHIDyQlZzTTfroJfHhSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659940'),
