  ('273880250551691266', 'The Marine 4: Moving Target', 2015, 'Action', 'William Kaufman, Mark Rutledge', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Mike Mizanin, Danielle Moinet, Atlin Mitchell, Melissa Roxburgh, Josh Blacker, Paul McGillion, Curtis Caravaggio, Matthew MacCaull', 'R', 'WWE Superstar Mike "The Miz" Mizanin returns as Jake Carter where he is assigned to protect a whistleblower who wishes to expose a corrupt military defense contractor. However, the military hires a heavily armed team of mercenaries to kill her and it''s up to Carter to stop them at any cost.', 'WWE Superstar Mike "The Miz" Mizanin returns as Jake Carter where he is assigned to protect a whistleblower who wishes to expose a corrupt military defense contractor. However, the military hires a heavily armed team of mercenaries to kill her and it''s up to Carter to stop them at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR4R4SP6nLwwJ30DZOCVXefqPhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329540'),
