  ('59490146726269752', 'The Mark of Zorro', 1940, 'Adventure, Romance, Action', 'Rouben Mamoulian, Arthur C. Miller', 'John Taintor Foote', 'Tyrone Power, Linda Darnell, Basil Rathbone, Gale Sondergaard, Eugene Pallette, J. Edward Bromberg, Montagu Love, Janet Beecher', 'NR', 'In 1820 Spain, the son of a California nobleman comes home to find his native land under a villainous dictatorship. On one hand, he plays the useless fop, while on the other, he is the masked avenger Zorro.', 'In 1820 Spain, the son of a California nobleman comes home to find his native land under a villainous dictatorship. On one hand, he plays the useless fop, while on the other, he is the masked avenger Zorro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJDonmAPnDV8jDv9jLlsejAdAoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32093'),
  ('406346861435986850', 'The Mark of Zorro', 1974, 'Western, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Don McDougall, Jack Woolf, Joseph M. Ellis', 'Brian Taggert', 'Frank Langella, Ricardo Montalban, Gilbert Roland, Louise Sorel, Robert Middleton, Anne Archer, Yvonne De Carlo, Tom Lacy', null, 'The swishing fop Don Diego de la Vega becomes the swashbuckling masked hero Zorro when tyranny threatens his people in nineteenth-century California.', 'The swishing fop Don Diego de la Vega becomes the swashbuckling masked hero Zorro when tyranny threatens his people in nineteenth-century California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEEJU8OutMZNINs3RCY8uko6sY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114721'),
