  ('115743829449334308', 'The Marksman', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Marcus Adams, Michael Slovis', 'Andy Hurst, J.S. Cardone', 'Wesley Snipes, Emma Samms, William Hope, Anthony Warren, Peter Youngblood Hills, Ryan McCluskey, Warren Derosa, Christiaan Haig', 'R', 'When Chechen rebels take over a Russian nuclear reactor, it’s up to a special ops marksman to rescue the hostages and prevent nuclear catastrophe.', 'When Chechen rebels take over a Russian nuclear reactor, it’s up to a special ops marksman to rescue the hostages and prevent nuclear catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbXe9sBc7ZpyFJKwp24njaBI5kN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6473'),
  ('100773408929641365', 'The Marksman', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Mark Patten, Robert Lorenz', 'Robert Lorenz, Danny Kravitz, Chris Charles', 'Liam Neeson, Jacob Perez, Katheryn Winnick, Teresa Ruiz, Sean A. Rosales, Jose Vasquez, Juan Pablo Raba, Alfredo Quiroz', 'PG-13', 'Jim Hanson’s quiet life is suddenly disturbed by two people crossing the US/Mexico border – a woman and her young son – desperate to flee a Mexican cartel. After a shootout leaves the mother dead, Jim becomes the boy’s reluctant defender. He embraces his role as Miguel’s protector and will stop at nothing to get him to safety, as they go on the run from the relentless assassins.', 'Jim Hanson’s quiet life is suddenly disturbed by two people crossing the US/Mexico border – a woman and her young son – desperate to flee a Mexican cartel. After a shootout leaves the mother dead, Jim becomes the boy’s reluctant defender. He embraces his role as Miguel’s protector and will stop at nothing to get him to safety, as they go on the run from the relentless assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vcDalR50RWa309vBH1NLmG2rjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634528'),
  ('82827590075224163', 'The Marquez-Castillo Siblings', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mark Alazraki, Fernando Rovzar', 'Gary Alazraki, Mark Alazraki, Fernando Rovzar', 'Héctor Suárez, Osvaldo Benavides, Mauricio Isaac, Mauricio Barrientos, Ximena Romo, Sofía Sisniega, Gerardo Taracena, Antonio Gaona', null, 'A group of four siblings compete for the heritage of their father.', 'A group of four siblings compete for the heritage of their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rHJJcmCd4cyGoF9dVJ2Nw4KQph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585894'),
  ('341322154076737267', 'The Marquis', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Farrugia, Éric Guichard, Michaël Laguens', 'Jean-Paul Bathany, Guillaume Lemans', 'Franck Dubosc, Richard Berry, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Luisa Ranieri, Sara Martins, Joel Torre, Alain Zef, Fatsah Bouyahmed', null, 'Thomas Gardesse, a traveling alarm systems salesman, is arrested for a minor offense and sentenced to six months imprisonment. To win the respect of his fellow inmates, he claims he is "The Marquis," a brilliant robber whose identity has remained a mystery. Two weeks before his release, an armed robber named Quentin Tasseau helps him escape and takes him to Manila so he can take part in a robbery whose mastermind requires the talents of the Marquis.', 'Thomas Gardesse, a traveling alarm systems salesman, is arrested for a minor offense and sentenced to six months imprisonment. To win the respect of his fellow inmates, he claims he is "The Marquis," a brilliant robber whose identity has remained a mystery. Two weeks before his release, an armed robber named Quentin Tasseau helps him escape and takes him to Manila so he can take part in a robbery whose mastermind requires the talents of the Marquis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHXiv8lsH2PtYGp8ua1ldRtaEHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58858'),
  ('799352329375415094', 'The Marquise of O', 1976, 'History, Drama', 'Éric Rohmer, Néstor Almendros', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Edith Clever, Bruno Ganz, Edda Seippel, Peter Lühr, Otto Sander, Eduard Linkers, Ruth Drexel, Bernhard Frey', null, 'A German Marquise has to deal with a pregnancy she cannot explain and an infatuated Russian Count.', 'A German Marquise has to deal with a pregnancy she cannot explain and an infatuated Russian Count.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7oWathRvbObBUeCWae8AKrI5ZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48205'),
  ('317025390744921744', 'The Marriage App', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sebastián De Caro, Ramiro García Bogliano, Fernando Lockett', 'Daniel Cúparo, Gabriel Korenfeld, Rocío Blanco', 'Luisana Lopilato, Juan Minujín, Betiana Blum, Andrea Rincón, Cristina Castaño, Santiago Gobernori, Julián Lucero, Aylen Malisani', 'R', 'Tangled in a troubled marriage, a frustrated couple finds hope in a watch-based app that rewards good deeds — until unhealthy obsessiveness takes over.', 'Tangled in a troubled marriage, a frustrated couple finds hope in a watch-based app that rewards good deeds — until unhealthy obsessiveness takes over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caMOaq9aBvLt4eUzP05JwLfQyKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948037'),
  ('993373957592094462', 'The Marriage Certificate', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Huang Jianxin', null, 'Feng Gong, Li Xiaomeng, Lü Liping, Xiangjin Luo, Wang Zhiwen, Jiang Shan, Feng Xiaogang, Fu Biao', null, 'The wife of a prominent psychiatrist can''t find her marriage certificate one day. This "jiehunzheng" is all important. Without it, the family officially has never existed, including the daughter. The couple go on a wild goose chase through the Chinese bureaucracy, meeting catch-22 all the way....they need a certificate to get a new one, etc. They even journey back to the People''s Commune where they met, now the site of modern private enterprises where nobody even recalls the former occupants.', 'The wife of a prominent psychiatrist can''t find her marriage certificate one day. This "jiehunzheng" is all important. Without it, the family officially has never existed, including the daughter. The couple go on a wild goose chase through the Chinese bureaucracy, meeting catch-22 all the way....they need a certificate to get a new one, etc. They even journey back to the People''s Commune where they met, now the site of modern private enterprises where nobody even recalls the former occupants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJWjuBFyaKJQJBmffP9VkNYzCCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47583'),
  ('272118501171685058', 'The Marriage Circle', 1924, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Charles Van Enger', 'Paul Bern, Lothar Schmidt', 'Florence Vidor, Monte Blue, Marie Prevost, Creighton Hale, Adolphe Menjou, Harry Myers, Dale Fuller, Esther Ralston', 'NR', 'An unhappily married couple moves to Vienna, where the wife’s married best friend lives, and soon, sparks fly between the wife and the best friend’s husband.', 'An unhappily married couple moves to Vienna, where the wife’s married best friend lives, and soon, sparks fly between the wife and the best friend’s husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Umgljr4iMnuAw2BrEVGiaxOH6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96713'),
  ('243703689745138360', 'The Marriage Escape', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Johan Nijenhuis', null, 'Herman Finkers, Johanna ter Steege, Leonie ter Braak, Ferdi Stofmeel, Stef Assen, Aniek Stokkers, Daphne Bunskoek, Belinda van der Stoep', null, 'Jan has been married to Gedda for 35 years. Gedda loves Jan so much that she smothers him: before he can grab a glass from the table, she has already given him one. She picks out his clothing, his friends, his vacations and all their other activities. In an attempt to get some space Jan concocts a strange plan that literally transforms his marriage into a locked ward. Their daughter finds herself in a similar predicament with her exacting and jealous boyfriend.', 'Jan has been married to Gedda for 35 years. Gedda loves Jan so much that she smothers him: before he can grab a glass from the table, she has already given him one. She picks out his clothing, his friends, his vacations and all their other activities. In an attempt to get some space Jan concocts a strange plan that literally transforms his marriage into a locked ward. Their daughter finds herself in a similar predicament with her exacting and jealous boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZNlF6i3MOvwhRV8SDfp5M40hVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591915'),
  ('29602976241847346', 'The Marriage of Balzaminov', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Konstantin Voinov, Georgiy Kupriyanov, Vladimir Krachkovskiy', 'Konstantin Voinov', 'Georgiy Vitsin, Lyudmila Shagalova, Lidiya Smirnova, Ekaterina Savinova, Zhanna Prokhorenko, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Tamara Nosova, Nikolay Kryuchkov', null, 'Based on the trilogy of Aleksandr Ostrovsky. Moscow, XIX century. A small official Misha Balzaminov lives in a small house. He, like his mother, sees his happiness in marrying a rich bride. Misha images in dreams and fantasies that he is a general or even a king — rich and domineering. And in reality, poor Balzaminov is haunted by setbacks...', 'Based on the trilogy of Aleksandr Ostrovsky. Moscow, XIX century. A small official Misha Balzaminov lives in a small house. He, like his mother, sees his happiness in marrying a rich bride. Misha images in dreams and fantasies that he is a general or even a king — rich and domineering. And in reality, poor Balzaminov is haunted by setbacks...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueENoMrWYpx0Xx7tkEFNDhshn4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76277'),
  ('81427890076402838', 'The Marriage of Chiffon', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Philippe Agostini, Jean Isnard', 'Jean Aurenche', 'Odette Joyeux, André Luguet, Jacques Dumesnil, Pierre Larquey, Robert Le Vigan, Suzanne Dantès, Louis Seigner, France Ellys', null, 'Odette Joyeux plays an eccentric young aristocrat called "Chiffon", who is struggling to comply with the social conventions of the community. A widow, her mother (Suzanne Dantes) would like to remarry a rich noble. Without realizing it, Chiffon is in love with her uncle, a ruined pioneer of aviation ...', 'Odette Joyeux plays an eccentric young aristocrat called "Chiffon", who is struggling to comply with the social conventions of the community. A widow, her mother (Suzanne Dantes) would like to remarry a rich noble. Without realizing it, Chiffon is in love with her uncle, a ruined pioneer of aviation ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWn0HD9llpJWjtwwDsRnPHVCyEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265990'),
  ('976394615898470261', 'The Marriage of Convenience', 1967, 'Comedy, Music', 'Bohdan Borewicz, Waldemar Podgórski, Daniel Bargielowski', 'Krzysztof Gruszczyński', 'Elżbieta Czyżewska, Daniel Olbrychski, Bohdan Łazuka, Hanka Bielicka, Alicja Bobrowska, Wiesława Kwaśniewska, Janina Romanówna, Tadeusz Chyła', null, 'Joanna, the daughter of quite wealthy traders from the Różycki bazaar, is in love with Andrzej, a young, talented, but poor painter. However, the girl''s father, Kazimierz Burczyk, decides to find a suitable husband for her himself. A shrewd tradesman, unwilling to disclose his income, searches for a candidate whose professional position would justify his possession of a villa, a car and many other material possessions. In the end, his choice falls on Andrew, who is unsuccessfully trying to sell paintings under the walls of Warsaw''s Barbican.', 'Joanna, the daughter of quite wealthy traders from the Różycki bazaar, is in love with Andrzej, a young, talented, but poor painter. However, the girl''s father, Kazimierz Burczyk, decides to find a suitable husband for her himself. A shrewd tradesman, unwilling to disclose his income, searches for a candidate whose professional position would justify his possession of a villa, a car and many other material possessions. In the end, his choice falls on Andrew, who is unsuccessfully trying to sell paintings under the walls of Warsaw''s Barbican.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl6y5S7k91LLr8Hpnm89cwk9hou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240833'),
  ('862814100575205252', 'The Marriage of Maria Braun', 1979, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Rolf Bührmann', 'Pea Fröhlich, Peter Märthesheimer', 'Hanna Schygulla, Klaus Löwitsch, Ivan Desny, George Eagles, Gisela Uhlen, Elisabeth Trissenaar, Gottfried John, Hark Bohm', null, 'Maria marries a young soldier in the last days of World War II, only for him to go missing in the war. She must rely on her beauty and ambition to navigate the difficult post-war years alone.', 'Maria marries a young soldier in the last days of World War II, only for him to go missing in the war. She must rely on her beauty and ambition to navigate the difficult post-war years alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXjZEzlf4WQwZ4Dt53gXeJVuO7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661'),
  ('115892046292461023', 'The Married Couple of the Year Two', 1971, 'Adventure, Comedy, History', 'Claude Renoir, Jean-Paul Rappeneau', 'Maurice Clavel, Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Claude Sautet', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Marlène Jobert, Laura Antonelli, Sami Frey, Pierre Brasseur, Michel Auclair, Julien Guiomar, Sim', null, 'Nicolas Philibert goes to America after killing a French aristocrat. On his return he tries to divorce his wife, Charlotte, but when he sees others trying to woo her his own interest is rekindled.', 'Nicolas Philibert goes to America after killing a French aristocrat. On his return he tries to divorce his wife, Charlotte, but when he sees others trying to woo her his own interest is rekindled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVKoO20twVTFZO8ivf1gSCD3tdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4279'),
  ('327428047612174028', 'The Married Couples', 1976, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Hasan Abduselam', 'Faisal Nada', 'Samir Ghanem, Sherine, George Sedhom, Rawia Saaeed, Nagah El-Mogui, Howaida, Ahmed Maher, Mohamed Al Tagy', null, 'The story revolves around the problems of married people in (Egypt) from the economic and social aspects, where the poor young man (Masoud) falls in love with the aristocratic girl (Lina), and marries her despite her father''s refusal. The simple poor life experience with her husband, whom she loves, her father tries to pressure her by various means, including threatening to deprive her of the inheritance, but she is determined to stay with her husband, Masoud asks Lina to move with her to her father''s villa in order to get out of the difficult life he lives in rented home.', 'The story revolves around the problems of married people in (Egypt) from the economic and social aspects, where the poor young man (Masoud) falls in love with the aristocratic girl (Lina), and marries her despite her father''s refusal. The simple poor life experience with her husband, whom she loves, her father tries to pressure her by various means, including threatening to deprive her of the inheritance, but she is determined to stay with her husband, Masoud asks Lina to move with her to her father''s villa in order to get out of the difficult life he lives in rented home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZXR4LYgyX1G4IDraaE4o9QLBW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187302'),
  ('814232667952220517', 'The Married Woman', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Raoul Coutard, Hélène Kalougine', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Macha Méril, Bernard Noël, Philippe Leroy, Christophe Bourseiller, Roger Leenhardt, Margareth Clémenti, Véronique Duval, Rita Maiden', 'NR', 'A superficial woman finds conflict choosing between her abusive husband and her vain lover.', 'A superficial woman finds conflict choosing between her abusive husband and her vain lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NUhCU2LsffAZNe2Ej0ZjKIpRsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40652'),
  ('562163982362754329', 'The Marrying Kind', 1952, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George Cukor, Joseph Walker', 'Ruth Gordon, Garson Kanin', 'Judy Holliday, Aldo Ray, Madge Kennedy, Sheila Bond, John Alexander, Phyllis Povah, Rex Williams, Mickey Shaughnessy', 'NR', 'Florence and Chet Keefer have had a troublesome marriage. Whilst in the middle of a divorce hearing the judge encourages them to remember the good times they have had hoping that the marriage can be saved.', 'Florence and Chet Keefer have had a troublesome marriage. Whilst in the middle of a divorce hearing the judge encourages them to remember the good times they have had hoping that the marriage can be saved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bf7MKkF2izIZ6B3W3kOUDFq8Kox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84903'),
  ('1111500887998957051', 'The Marrying Man', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Jerry Rees, Bruce Crone, David B. Householter', 'Neil Simon', 'Kim Basinger, Alec Baldwin, Robert Loggia, Elisabeth Shue, Armand Assante, Paul Reiser, Fisher Stevens, Rebecca Staab', 'R', 'Charley Pearl, wealthy heir and gadabout, is slated to marry Adele, the daughter of a Hollywood tycoon. But, during a wild bachelor party in Las Vegas, Charley strikes up a flirtation with nightclub crooner Vicki Anderson that soon leads to her bedroom. When the couple are discovered by Vicki''s beau, infamous gangster Bugsy Siegel, he makes a surprising pronouncement -- they''d better marry, or Charley is a dead man.', 'Charley Pearl, wealthy heir and gadabout, is slated to marry Adele, the daughter of a Hollywood tycoon. But, during a wild bachelor party in Las Vegas, Charley strikes up a flirtation with nightclub crooner Vicki Anderson that soon leads to her bedroom. When the couple are discovered by Vicki''s beau, infamous gangster Bugsy Siegel, he makes a surprising pronouncement -- they''d better marry, or Charley is a dead man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLER1ftW22IWFbz9GQy9lHAaDwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31633'),
  ('178834252440812832', 'The Marseille Contract', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Robert Parrish, Douglas Slocombe', 'Judd Bernard', 'Michael Caine, Anthony Quinn, James Mason, Maurice Ronet, Alexandra Stewart, Maureen Kerwin, Catherine Rouvel, Marcel Bozzuffi', 'PG', 'An important drug lord settled in Marseille is suspected of having ordered the killing of an American agent, but it is impossible to impute him due to his political influences, so the dead agent''s boss decides to hire the services of a hitman to kill him.', 'An important drug lord settled in Marseille is suspected of having ordered the killing of an American agent, but it is impossible to impute him due to his political influences, so the dead agent''s boss decides to hire the services of a hitman to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2oI6xQOKik3g42YIOJctLA5QHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72639'),
  ('50571140789451717', 'The Marsh', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jordan Barker, David Perrault', 'Michael Stokes', 'Gabrielle Anwar, Louis Ferreira, Forest Whitaker, Peter MacNeill, Niamh Wilson, Joe Dinicol, Brooke Johnson, Jessica Greco', 'R', 'Writer Claire Holloway is troubled by nightmares of Rose Marsh Farm. She decides to vacation at the farm which unbeknown to her is haunted by the ghost of a little girl and a teenage boy. Claire enlists the help of Geoffry Hunt to help uncover a decade old tragedy.', 'Writer Claire Holloway is troubled by nightmares of Rose Marsh Farm. She decides to vacation at the farm which unbeknown to her is haunted by the ghost of a little girl and a teenage boy. Claire enlists the help of Geoffry Hunt to help uncover a decade old tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGZoo3qjhxMpl5GhsisFOeYyypn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22066'),
  ('928406191439787741', 'The Marsh King''s Daughter', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Alwin H. Küchler, Urs Hirschbiegel, Mark Romanelli', 'Mark L. Smith, Elle Smith', 'Daisy Ridley, Ben Mendelsohn, Garrett Hedlund, Caren Pistorius, Brooklynn Prince, Joey Carson, Yanna McIntosh, Gil Birmingham', 'R', 'Helena, a woman living a seemingly ordinary life, hides a dark secret—her father is the infamous ''Marsh King'', the man who kept her and her mother captive in the wilderness for years. After a lifetime of trying to escape her past, Helena is forced to face her demons when her father unexpectedly escapes from prison.', 'Helena, a woman living a seemingly ordinary life, hides a dark secret—her father is the infamous ''Marsh King'', the man who kept her and her mother captive in the wilderness for years. After a lifetime of trying to escape her past, Helena is forced to face her demons when her father unexpectedly escapes from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcuEjrwhp5HgEUnFe5lc4xpEqzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798362'),
  ('584232391443047953', 'The Martha Mitchell Effect', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime, History', 'Debra McClutchy, Anne Alvergue', null, 'Martha Mitchell, Richard Nixon, Connie Chung, Dwight L. Chapin, Piper Dankworth, John Dean, Dan Romaine Kirkham, Sally Quinn', 'PG', 'She was once as famous as Jackie O—and then she tried to take down a President. Martha Mitchell was the unlikeliest of whistleblowers: a Republican wife who was discredited by Nixon to keep her quiet. Until now.', 'She was once as famous as Jackie O—and then she tried to take down a President. Martha Mitchell was the unlikeliest of whistleblowers: a Republican wife who was discredited by Nixon to keep her quiet. Until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbv5THLM8FbvnPXUiRZQHdEiW6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914268'),
  ('1117357998402608643', 'The Martian', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Adventure', 'Ridley Scott, Dariusz Wolski, Mark Patten', 'Drew Goddard', 'Matt Damon, Jessica Chastain, Kristen Wiig, Jeff Daniels, Michael Peña, Sean Bean, Kate Mara, Sebastian Stan', 'PG-13', 'During a manned mission to Mars, Astronaut Mark Watney is presumed dead after a fierce storm and left behind by his crew. But Watney has survived and finds himself stranded and alone on the hostile planet. With only meager supplies, he must draw upon his ingenuity, wit and spirit to subsist and find a way to signal to Earth that he is alive.', 'During a manned mission to Mars, Astronaut Mark Watney is presumed dead after a fierce storm and left behind by his crew. But Watney has survived and finds himself stranded and alone on the hostile planet. With only meager supplies, he must draw upon his ingenuity, wit and spirit to subsist and find a way to signal to Earth that he is alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fASz8A0yFE3QB6LgGoOfwvFSseV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286217'),
  ('695270986736207868', 'The Martyr of Calvary', 1952, 'History, Drama', 'Miguel Morayta', null, 'Enrique Rambal, Manolo Fábregas, Consuelo Frank, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Armando Sáenz, Felipe de Alba, Alicia Palacios, Carmen Molina', null, 'The life of Jesus from the beginning of his ministry, his miracles, the Sermon on the Mount and his death on the cross.', 'The life of Jesus from the beginning of his ministry, his miracles, the Sermon on the Mount and his death on the cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noZzrITSNEqSOGDU0KKNyGgzQsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199449'),
  ('344049471016419084', 'The Marvellous Wreath', 1903, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician performs tricks with a marvelous wreath.', 'A magician performs tricks with a marvelous wreath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chawaPCL3lQAMpuGTove13282L8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108297'),
