  ('893535949456169728', 'The Marvels', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Sean Bobbitt, Jack Ravenscroft, Peng Zhang', 'Elissa Karasik, Nia DaCosta, Megan McDonnell', 'Brie Larson, Teyonah Parris, Iman Vellani, Samuel L. Jackson, Zawe Ashton, Gary Lewis, Park Seo-jun, Zenobia Shroff', 'PG-13', 'When her duties send her to an anomalous wormhole linked to a Kree revolutionary, Carol''s powers become entangled with that of Jersey City super-fan Kamala Khan, aka Ms. Marvel, and Carol''s estranged niece, now S.A.B.E.R. astronaut Captain Monica Rambeau. Together, this unlikely trio must team up and learn to work in concert to save the universe.', 'When her duties send her to an anomalous wormhole linked to a Kree revolutionary, Carol''s powers become entangled with that of Jersey City super-fan Kamala Khan, aka Ms. Marvel, and Carol''s estranged niece, now S.A.B.E.R. astronaut Captain Monica Rambeau. Together, this unlikely trio must team up and learn to work in concert to save the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GBhzXMFjgcZ3FdR9w3bUMMTps5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609681'),
  ('663353190544560553', 'The Mascot', 1933, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Władysław Starewicz, Irene Starewicz', null, null, null, 'A toy stuffed dog has just been sewn together when it hears a young child ask for an orange. The child''s mother explains that they have no money, and so she cannot buy any oranges. The dog is then packed up along with a box full of other toys to be sold, but it soon winds up in the street. The dog picks up an orange from a curb side stand, and hopes to take it home to the child. But that night, before the dog can get back to the child''s home, it must face a series of strange and frightening adventures.', 'A toy stuffed dog has just been sewn together when it hears a young child ask for an orange. The child''s mother explains that they have no money, and so she cannot buy any oranges. The dog is then packed up along with a box full of other toys to be sold, but it soon winds up in the street. The dog picks up an orange from a curb side stand, and hopes to take it home to the child. But that night, before the dog can get back to the child''s home, it must face a series of strange and frightening adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntOnxz6FNfLrE74NbYNasM3mNgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67654'),
  ('557513807577738247', 'The Mask', 1961, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Julian Roffman, Herbert S. Alpert, Hugo Wuethrich', 'Frank Taubes, Sandy Haver, Franklin Delessert', 'Paul Stevens, Claudette Nevins, Anne Collings, Bill Walker, Martin Lavut, Leo Leyden, Norman Ettlinger, W.B. Brydon', null, 'A young archaeologist believes he is cursed by a mask that causes him to have weird nightmares and possibly to murder. Before committing suicide, he mails the mask to his psychiatrist, Dr. Barnes, who is soon plunged into the nightmare world of the mask.', 'A young archaeologist believes he is cursed by a mask that causes him to have weird nightmares and possibly to murder. Before committing suicide, he mails the mask to his psychiatrist, Dr. Barnes, who is soon plunged into the nightmare world of the mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0TzUtwGt1oz4nmraLwIwaJ64FO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57665'),
  ('67578872740412373', 'The Mask', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime, Fantasy', 'Chuck Russell, John R. Leonetti, Denis L. Stewart', 'Mike Werb', 'Jim Carrey, Peter Riegert, Peter Greene, Amy Yasbeck, Richard Jeni, Orestes Matacena, Tim Bagley, Nancy Fish', 'PG-13', 'Stanley Ipkiss, an insecure banker who has lost his zest for life stumbles upon an ancient mask, that turns him into a confident suave cartoon-like character who upsets his ordinary life.', 'Stanley Ipkiss, an insecure banker who has lost his zest for life stumbles upon an ancient mask, that turns him into a confident suave cartoon-like character who upsets his ordinary life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPC2eYub74zwf2tPGVtzSlBW6Oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854'),
