  ('703065346496730609', 'The Mask of Dimitrios', 1944, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Arthur Edeson, Jack Sullivan', 'Frank Gruber', 'Peter Lorre, Sydney Greenstreet, Zachary Scott, Faye Emerson, Victor Francen, Steven Geray, Florence Bates, Eduardo Ciannelli', 'NR', 'A mystery writer is intrigued by the tale of notorious criminal Dimitrios Makropolous, whose dead body was found washed up on the shore in Istanbul. He decides to follow the career of Dimitrios around Europe, in order to learn more about the man. Along the way he is joined by the mysterious Mr. Peters, who has his own motivation.', 'A mystery writer is intrigued by the tale of notorious criminal Dimitrios Makropolous, whose dead body was found washed up on the shore in Istanbul. He decides to follow the career of Dimitrios around Europe, in order to learn more about the man. Along the way he is joined by the mysterious Mr. Peters, who has his own motivation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsf399maXMnhOWfQSjOxErURxzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35006'),
  ('278052012864445916', 'The Mask of Fu Manchu', 1932, 'Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Charles Brabin, Tony Gaudio, Cedric Gibbons', 'Irene Kuhn, Edgar Allan Woolf, John Willard', 'Boris Karloff, Lewis Stone, Karen Morley, Charles Starrett, Myrna Loy, Jean Hersholt, Lawrence Grant, David Torrence', null, 'The villainous Dr. Fu Manchu races against a team of Englishmen to find the tomb of Ghengis Khan, because he wants to use the relics to cause an uprising in the East to wipe out the white race.', 'The villainous Dr. Fu Manchu races against a team of Englishmen to find the tomb of Ghengis Khan, because he wants to use the relics to cause an uprising in the East to wipe out the white race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iMjZwxFGxlF0RkfSAzgn6iTUb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3484'),
  ('474033418112516292', 'The Mask of Satan', 1990, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Lamberto Bava, Silvia Innocenzi, Antonio Lusci', 'Massimo De Rita, Giorgio Stegani', 'Giovanni Guidelli, Debora Caprioglio, Eva Grimaldi, Alessandra Bonarota, Mary Sellers, Laura Devoti, Stanko Molnar, Michele Soavi', 'NR', 'Skiers in Northern Italy unwittingly awaken an ancient witch after removing her mask in a crevasse. Their actions unleash a curse, leading to terrifying consequences.', 'Skiers in Northern Italy unwittingly awaken an ancient witch after removing her mask in a crevasse. Their actions unleash a curse, leading to terrifying consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a1THMze2COZmcZCQYkPis4a6QN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48613'),
  ('892486534888668097', 'The Mask of the Gorilla', 1958, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Bernard Borderie, Louis Page', 'Antoine-Louis Dominique, Jacques Robert, Bernard Borderie', 'Lino Ventura, Charles Vanel, Pierre Dux, Bella Darvi, René Lefèvre, Robert Manuel, André Valmy, Henri Crémieux', null, 'Géo Paquet, aka The Gorilla, breaks from jail. Now an escaped convict, the elite agent must infiltrate a dangerous gang working for a foreign embassy as their leader, a spy enjoying diplomatic immunity, can''t be arrested by regular police.', 'Géo Paquet, aka The Gorilla, breaks from jail. Now an escaped convict, the elite agent must infiltrate a dangerous gang working for a foreign embassy as their leader, a spy enjoying diplomatic immunity, can''t be arrested by regular police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0sGS3CDfKCiQPqg4ElJr0thGiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95456'),
  ('587349314302289953', 'The Mask of Zorro', 1998, 'Action, Adventure', 'Martin Campbell, Phil Meheux, George Parra', 'John Eskow, Ted Elliott, Terry Rossio', 'Antonio Banderas, Anthony Hopkins, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Stuart Wilson, Matt Letscher, L.Q. Jones, Diego Sieres, José María de Tavira', 'PG-13', 'It has been twenty years since Don Diego de la Vega fought Spanish oppression in Alta California as the legendary romantic hero, Zorro. Having escaped from prison he transforms troubled bandit Alejandro into his successor, in order to foil the plans of the tyrannical Don Rafael Montero who robbed him of his freedom, his wife and his precious daughter.', 'It has been twenty years since Don Diego de la Vega fought Spanish oppression in Alta California as the legendary romantic hero, Zorro. Having escaped from prison he transforms troubled bandit Alejandro into his successor, in order to foil the plans of the tyrannical Don Rafael Montero who robbed him of his freedom, his wife and his precious daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdMufwGDDzqu4kTSQwrKc5WR4bu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9342'),
  ('656496952567054126', 'The Mask You Live In', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jennifer Siebel Newsom', 'Jennifer Siebel Newsom, Jessica Congdon', 'Michael Kimmel, Caroline Heldman, Tony Porter, Nadine Burke, William Pollack, Steven Mason, Luis Vallejo, Ana Montes', null, 'Compared to girls, research shows that boys in the United States are more likely to be diagnosed with a behaviour disorder, prescribed stimulant medications, fail out of school, binge drink, commit a violent crime, and/or take their own lives. The Mask You Live In asks: as a society, how are we failing our boys?', 'Compared to girls, research shows that boys in the United States are more likely to be diagnosed with a behaviour disorder, prescribed stimulant medications, fail out of school, binge drink, commit a violent crime, and/or take their own lives. The Mask You Live In asks: as a society, how are we failing our boys?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7436ZhdHSvCojPYinu1eFgpgCjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224972'),
  ('579500085942615346', 'The Masked Avenger: Lagardere', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Henri Helman', 'Lorraine Lévy, Didier Lacoste', 'Bruno Wolkowitch, Yvon Back, Frédéric van den Driessche, Florence Pernel, Clio Baran, Jacques Frantz, Ticky Holgado, Christian Hecq', null, 'France, 17th century, during the reign of Louis XIII. When a dear friend, the Duke of Nevers, is treacherously assassinated by a powerful relative, a skilled swordsman, the noble Henri de Lagardère, seeks his rightful vengeance as he tries to protect the innocent life of the duke''s last heir.', 'France, 17th century, during the reign of Louis XIII. When a dear friend, the Duke of Nevers, is treacherously assassinated by a powerful relative, a skilled swordsman, the noble Henri de Lagardère, seeks his rightful vengeance as he tries to protect the innocent life of the duke''s last heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52uLXNLgnOAEvy6ZCbup1u34Uz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154756'),
