  ('868584116434393662', 'The Masked Saint', 2016, 'Crime, Action', 'Warren P. Sonoda', 'Brett Granstaff, Scott Crowell', 'Brett Granstaff, Lara Jean Chorostecki, T.J. McGibbon, Diahann Carroll, Roddy Piper, James Preston Rogers, Mykel Shannon Jenkins, Patrick McKenna', 'PG-13', 'The journey of a professional wrestler who becomes a small town pastor and moonlights as a masked vigilante fighting injustice. While facing crises at home and at the church, the Pastor must evade the police and somehow reconcile his violent secret identity with his calling as a pastor.', 'The journey of a professional wrestler who becomes a small town pastor and moonlights as a masked vigilante fighting injustice. While facing crises at home and at the church, the Pastor must evade the police and somehow reconcile his violent secret identity with his calling as a pastor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlT1Tc9hA1Ntye5hr7Gxos9U6U9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370464'),
  ('751510944327541404', 'The Masked Scammer', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Yvann Yagchi, Dominic Sivyer', null, 'Gilbert Chickli', 'R', 'Featuring interviews with his accomplices and victims alike, this deep dive explores how a master con man scammed French elites out of millions of euros.', 'Featuring interviews with his accomplices and victims alike, this deep dive explores how a master con man scammed French elites out of millions of euros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TQLEXSrGPMn0EVCjyBJkSHGpqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046529'),
  ('953466175025053058', 'The Masks of Death', 1984, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy Ward Baker, Brendan J. Stafford', 'N.J. Crisp', 'Peter Cushing, John Mills, Anne Baxter, Ray Milland, Anton Diffring, Gordon Jackson, Marcus Gilbert, Susan Penhaligon', null, 'Sherlock Holmes has retired. But when MacDonald asks him to take on another case, he says yes. There have been some mysterious murders, and there are no visible causes for the deaths. At the same time Holmes gets this case, Graf Udo Von Felseck gives him another case: find a young and missing prince to prevent war between Germany and England. But Von Felseck is not as honest as he seems...', 'Sherlock Holmes has retired. But when MacDonald asks him to take on another case, he says yes. There have been some mysterious murders, and there are no visible causes for the deaths. At the same time Holmes gets this case, Graf Udo Von Felseck gives him another case: find a young and missing prince to prevent war between Germany and England. But Von Felseck is not as honest as he seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xz2hdlJzgD2pLFLkUqEyZMLKeDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28771'),
  ('366237662811306591', 'The Masque of the Red Death', 1964, 'Drama, Horror', 'Roger Corman, Peter Price, Nicolas Roeg', 'Charles Beaumont, R. Wright Campbell', 'Vincent Price, Hazel Court, Jane Asher, David Weston, Nigel Green, Patrick Magee, Paul Whitsun-Jones, Robert Brown', null, 'A European prince terrorizes the local peasantry while using his castle as a refuge against the "Red Death" plague that stalks the land.', 'A European prince terrorizes the local peasantry while using his castle as a refuge against the "Red Death" plague that stalks the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSYceyGZrWskWDsn3MHtipJ1wFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25319'),
  ('243606841493195687', 'The Masque of the Red Death', 1989, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Alan Birkinshaw', 'Michael J. Murray', 'Frank Stallone Jr., Brenda Vaccaro, Herbert Lom, Michelle McBride, Christine Lunde, Christobel d''Ortez, Simon Poland', null, 'Lovely photographer Rebecca winds up in a Bavarian castle at a "Masque of the Red Death" party hosted by the wealthy Ludwig. Mayhem ensues as assorted Poe story devices start doing away with the guests.', 'Lovely photographer Rebecca winds up in a Bavarian castle at a "Masque of the Red Death" party hosted by the wealthy Ludwig. Mayhem ensues as assorted Poe story devices start doing away with the guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syi8vAD9zf1u6Xi90Ta9Vfn0I8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30523'),
  ('827504641550899409', 'The Mass Is Ended', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nanni Moretti, Daniele Luchetti, Mario Monaci Toschi', 'Nanni Moretti, Sandro Petraglia', 'Nanni Moretti, Ferruccio De Ceresa, Margarita Lozano, Marco Messeri, Vincenzo Salemme, Dario Cantarelli, Roberto Vezzosi, Enrica Maria Modugno', null, 'The young priest Father Giulio returns to Rome, his hometown, after a long pilgrimage. Don Giulio hopes to live peacefully with his family and his friends, but discovers that many of them are depressed or frustrated, and some suicidal.', 'The young priest Father Giulio returns to Rome, his hometown, after a long pilgrimage. Don Giulio hopes to live peacefully with his family and his friends, but discovers that many of them are depressed or frustrated, and some suicidal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCdfHMyFRc5uDG2cdIOlc5rBGUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60732'),
  ('529564483083789206', 'The Masseurs and a Woman', 1938, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Shimizu, Masao Saito, Akira Kiyosuke', 'Hiroshi Shimizu', 'Mieko Takamine, Shin Tokudaiji, Shinichi Himori, Bakudan Kozo, Shin Saburi, Ayuko Hirano, Toru Hirose, Takeshi Sakamoto', null, 'A pair of blind masseurs, an enigmatic city woman, a lonely man and his ill-behaved nephew—The Masseurs and a Woman is made up of crisscrossing miniature studies of love and family at a remote resort in the mountains. With delicate and surprising humor, Hiroshi Shimizu paints a timeless portrait of loneliness and the human need to connect.', 'A pair of blind masseurs, an enigmatic city woman, a lonely man and his ill-behaved nephew—The Masseurs and a Woman is made up of crisscrossing miniature studies of love and family at a remote resort in the mountains. With delicate and surprising humor, Hiroshi Shimizu paints a timeless portrait of loneliness and the human need to connect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNI9KvOl2ZTgN354EDvonL8sLHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91094'),
  ('185879330833198483', 'The Masseuses', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Giovanni Fago, Stefano Rolla', 'Italo De Tuddo, Oreste Biancoli, Vittorio Metz', 'Sylva Koscina, Cristina Gaïoni, Valeria Fabrizi, Marisa Merlini, Ernesto Calindri, Philippe Noiret, Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia', null, 'Two industry managers from Milan are in Rome to get the contract to build a YMCA hostel. They get in touch with a masseuses ring and one of the masseuses is introduced to the president of the catholic association as the wife of one of the managers. During a vice squad roundup, the president is about to be discovered with one of the girls when he dies of a stroke. How will the others try to hide his death?', 'Two industry managers from Milan are in Rome to get the contract to build a YMCA hostel. They get in touch with a masseuses ring and one of the masseuses is introduced to the president of the catholic association as the wife of one of the managers. During a vice squad roundup, the president is about to be discovered with one of the girls when he dies of a stroke. How will the others try to hide his death?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBGD75aIjQGD2Y6O7lNPJeAs38V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107099'),
  ('47278904457594301', 'The Master', 1980, 'Action', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Ho Luk-Ying', 'Ni Kuang', 'Chen Kuan-Tai, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Richard Yuen Tak, Candy Man, Chan Lau, Lam Fai-Wong, Ching Miao, Wong Ching-Ho', 'NR', 'Although injured, a martial-arts expert teaches an orphan his methods.', 'Although injured, a martial-arts expert teaches an orphan his methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uN7Gi0oy8cpNhxdAj7mRFZsbdlu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108665'),
  ('1102726551878098327', 'The Master', 1992, 'Action', 'Tsui Hark, Henry Chan, Paul A. Edwards', 'Lau Tai-Muk', 'Jet Li, Yuen Wah, Crystal Kwok, Jerry Trimble, Anne Rickets, Rubén C. González, Guy Fadollone, Derek Anunciation', 'R', 'When old martial arts master Master Tak disappears, his best student, Jet, steps in to find him. However, when he learns that Tak''s life is in danger, he decides to protect him at all costs.', 'When old martial arts master Master Tak disappears, his best student, Jet, steps in to find him. However, when he learns that Tak''s life is in danger, he decides to protect him at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9Eji1A8AyelmdHCJTlVBCZziGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20811'),
  ('868010421436857951', 'The Master', 2012, 'Drama', 'Mihai Malaimare Jr., Paul Thomas Anderson, Adam Somner', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Amy Adams, Rami Malek, Laura Dern, Jesse Plemons, Ambyr Childers, Madisen Beaty', 'R', 'Freddie, a volatile, heavy-drinking veteran who suffers from post-traumatic stress disorder, finds some semblance of a family when he stumbles onto the ship of Lancaster Dodd, the charismatic leader of a new "religion" he forms after World War II.', 'Freddie, a volatile, heavy-drinking veteran who suffers from post-traumatic stress disorder, finds some semblance of a family when he stumbles onto the ship of Lancaster Dodd, the charismatic leader of a new "religion" he forms after World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUSjbyvYWN9H4az8xt0tDtU7I6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68722'),
  ('223587981979851493', 'The Master and Margarita', 1972, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Aleksandar Petrović, Roberto Gerardi', 'Barbara Alberti, Amedeo Pagani, Aleksandar Petrović', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Mimsy Farmer, Alain Cuny, Velimir Živojinović, Pavle Vuisić, Fabijan Šovagović, Ljuba Tadić, Taško Načić', null, 'Maestro Nikolai Masoudov, a talented writer, and his assistant Margaret, are working on a biblical story of Pontius Pilate. The Satan — Woland, and his lieutenants, are harassing Master by surveillance, by killing his friend, and sending another friend to Gulag prison in Siberia. Victimized by their harassment, Master becomes paranoid, and is locked up in a mental institution. Margaret is trying to save him regardless of the danger.', 'Maestro Nikolai Masoudov, a talented writer, and his assistant Margaret, are working on a biblical story of Pontius Pilate. The Satan — Woland, and his lieutenants, are harassing Master by surveillance, by killing his friend, and sending another friend to Gulag prison in Siberia. Victimized by their harassment, Master becomes paranoid, and is locked up in a mental institution. Margaret is trying to save him regardless of the danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjzqzltXsjHW8lVxlH4jMaU6zhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80701'),
  ('772719053729441832', 'The Master and Margarita', 2024, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Michael Lockshin, Maxim Zhukov, Aleksey Samodelko', 'Roman Kantor', 'August Diehl, Yuliya Snigir, Evgeny Tsyganov, Claes Bang, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Aleksey Guskov, Aleksey Rozin, Aleksandr Yatsenko', null, 'A writer in 1930s Moscow has his work banned and is expelled from the official union, leaving him without income. He then writes a novel about a mysterious dark visitor and gradually starts confusing his real life with the story.', 'A writer in 1930s Moscow has his work banned and is expelled from the official union, leaving him without income. He then writes a novel about a mysterious dark visitor and gradually starts confusing his real life with the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw172VAlwfYtWNWvhVrXZPW3jGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586353'),
  ('921121633273612166', 'The Master Blackmailer', 1992, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Peter Hammond, David Odd', 'Jeremy Paul', 'Jeremy Brett, Edward Hardwicke, Robert Hardy, Norma West, Gwen Ffrangcon Davies, Colin Jeavons, Serena Gordon, Rosalie Williams', null, 'For years, a blackmailer has been preying on the weaknesses of others throughout London. When Holmes hears of the utter misery this mystery man is creating, he adopts a campaign to thwart his evil scheming. The campaign astonishes Dr. Watson by its strangeness and finds Holmes falling in love.', 'For years, a blackmailer has been preying on the weaknesses of others throughout London. When Holmes hears of the utter misery this mystery man is creating, he adopts a campaign to thwart his evil scheming. The campaign astonishes Dr. Watson by its strangeness and finds Holmes falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNrEjZyGi6vOuogEVjimq6hGFKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309199'),
  ('837616156012029839', 'The Master Butcher', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Hannes Hubach, Uli Edel', 'Ruth Stadler, Doris Dörrie', 'Jonas Nay, Aylin Tezel, Leonie Benesch, Sylvester Groth, Vladimir Korneev, Claudia Kottal, Therese Hämer, Martin Leutgeb', null, 'After his return from World War I, there is no more work for Fidelis in his parents'' butcher shop in Swabia, Germany. To make a better life for himself and Eva, the former fiancée of a friend who fell in battle, he emigrates to Argus, a town in North Dakota, in the United States. The artist Delphine, in whom Eva will find a friend, also moves there. To relieve Eva''s homesickness, Fidelis founds a singing club.', 'After his return from World War I, there is no more work for Fidelis in his parents'' butcher shop in Swabia, Germany. To make a better life for himself and Eva, the former fiancée of a friend who fell in battle, he emigrates to Argus, a town in North Dakota, in the United States. The artist Delphine, in whom Eva will find a friend, also moves there. To relieve Eva''s homesickness, Fidelis founds a singing club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOt9v8v1WqAeiUPwjfO1JNAT13Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658200'),
  ('614377700901637405', 'The Master Key', 2009, 'Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Patrice Sauvé, Ronald Plante', 'Frédéric Ouellet', 'Marc Messier, Normand Daneau, Fanny Mallette, Maude Guérin, Gabrielle Lazure, Frédéric Gilles, Monique Mercure, Vassili Schneider', null, 'To save his best friend, Louis-Bernard Lapointe has to transport himself to a parallel world to find the ''Key of Possibilities'', a magical and legendary object that allow his user to visit an infinite numbers of universes where everything is possible.', 'To save his best friend, Louis-Bernard Lapointe has to transport himself to a parallel world to find the ''Key of Possibilities'', a magical and legendary object that allow his user to visit an infinite numbers of universes where everything is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOC9QKleFR0H4Hxb4AinpZS8M4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20826'),
  ('842490516438758176', 'The Master of Ballantrae', 1953, 'Adventure', 'William Keighley, Jack Cardiff, Muir Mathieson', 'Herb Meadow', 'Errol Flynn, Roger Livesey, Anthony Steel, Beatrice Campbell, Yvonne Furneaux, Felix Aylmer, Mervyn Johns, Charles Goldner', 'NR', 'Scottish highlander Jamie Durie falls into a life of piracy after joining the failed rebellion of Bonnie Prince Charlie against the British crown.', 'Scottish highlander Jamie Durie falls into a life of piracy after joining the failed rebellion of Bonnie Prince Charlie against the British crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYoPcDtJEAoyZZ7e0QHCgTPynQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43355'),
  ('1128145533055531526', 'The Master of Disguise', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Perry Andelin Blake, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Dana Carvey, Harris Goldberg', 'Dana Carvey, Brent Spiner, Jennifer Esposito, Harold Gould, James Brolin, Austin Wolff, Edie McClurg, Maria Canals-Barrera', 'PG', 'After the patriarch of the Disguisey family is kidnapped by Devlin Bowman in an attempt to steal the most precious treasures from around the world, Italian waiter Pistachio Disguisey utilizes his supernatural ability to disguise himself in an attempt to stop him.', 'After the patriarch of the Disguisey family is kidnapped by Devlin Bowman in an attempt to steal the most precious treasures from around the world, Italian waiter Pistachio Disguisey utilizes his supernatural ability to disguise himself in an attempt to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JFKuKJeHHFFVb0ubpkPIXmkIOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13908'),
  ('819890075588957819', 'The Master of Taiga', 1969, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Vladimir Nazarov, Vladimir Nikolayev, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Boris Mozhayev', 'Valeriy Zolotukhin, Vladimir Vysotsky, Lionella Pyryeva, Mikhail Kokshenov, Dmitriy Masanov, Leonid Kmit, Eduard Bredun, Ivan Kosykh', null, 'Based on the story of Boris Mozhayev “The Power of the Taiga”. In the taiga village, where everyone is in sight, almost unbelievable happens — a local store is robbed. One of the rafters of the forest is recognized as a hacker. But some “inconsistencies” haunt the young precinct Vasily Seryozhkin. And in the end, he goes on the trail of the true participants in the crime...', 'Based on the story of Boris Mozhayev “The Power of the Taiga”. In the taiga village, where everyone is in sight, almost unbelievable happens — a local store is robbed. One of the rafters of the forest is recognized as a hacker. But some “inconsistencies” haunt the young precinct Vasily Seryozhkin. And in the end, he goes on the trail of the true participants in the crime...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvkTk8GkF0ejLGZhFleDzIkT9Qz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76248'),
  ('8876761429508731', 'The Master Touch', 1972, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Michele Lupo, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Mino Roli, Nico Ducci, Michele Lupo', 'Kirk Douglas, Giuliano Gemma, Florinda Bolkan, Wolfgang Preiss, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Romano Puppo, Bruno Corazzari, John Bartha', 'PG', 'A master thief, just out of prison, concocts a risky final score that would net him over a million dollars.', 'A master thief, just out of prison, concocts a risky final score that would net him over a million dollars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vERYn335kquASx8pLL96ug4NidJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18568'),
  ('923770790835922978', 'The Mastermind', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kelly Reichardt, Christopher Blauvelt, Chris Carroll', 'Kelly Reichardt', 'Josh O''Connor, Alana Haim, Hope Davis, John Magaro, Gaby Hoffmann, Jasper Thompson, Sterling Thompson, Eli Gelb', 'R', 'In a sedate Massachusetts suburb circa 1970, unemployed family man and amateur art thief J.B. Mooney sets out on his first heist. With the museum cased and accomplices recruited, he has an airtight plan. Or so he thinks.', 'In a sedate Massachusetts suburb circa 1970, unemployed family man and amateur art thief J.B. Mooney sets out on his first heist. With the museum cased and accomplices recruited, he has an airtight plan. Or so he thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPaEQ3m4zHOzIAstgXCZZtzcHTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1352624'),
  ('451920629657021467', 'The Matador', 2005, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Richard Shepard, David Tattersall, Marco Polo Constandse', 'Richard Shepard', 'Pierce Brosnan, Greg Kinnear, Hope Davis, Portia Dawson, Adam Scott, Israel Tellez, Arlin Miller, Azucena Medina', 'R', 'The life of Danny Wright, a salesman forever on the road, veers into dangerous and surreal territory when he wanders into a Mexican bar and meets a mysterious stranger, Julian, who''s very likely a hit man. Their meeting sets off a chain of events that will change their lives forever, as Wright is suddenly thrust into a far-from-mundane existence that he takes to surprisingly well … once he gets acclimated to it.', 'The life of Danny Wright, a salesman forever on the road, veers into dangerous and surreal territory when he wanders into a Mexican bar and meets a mysterious stranger, Julian, who''s very likely a hit man. Their meeting sets off a chain of events that will change their lives forever, as Wright is suddenly thrust into a far-from-mundane existence that he takes to surprisingly well … once he gets acclimated to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJnlAGmrhsg4QrlVKGgP91J6WPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9515'),
  ('270765844600488297', 'The Match', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mick Davis, Witold Stok', 'Mick Davis', 'Max Beesley, Isla Blair, James Cosmo, Richard E. Grant, Laura Fraser, Ian Holm, David Hayman, Tom Sizemore', null, 'Romantic comedy set against the story of a grudge football match between two pubs. The prize for the winner of the centenary match is the the closure of their opponent''s bar. The Match was mainly filmed around Straiton in Ayrshire.', 'Romantic comedy set against the story of a grudge football match between two pubs. The prize for the winner of the centenary match is the the closure of their opponent''s bar. The Match was mainly filmed around Straiton in Ayrshire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7sS80bAgJrPm31eKHNV5JqzdEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41160'),
  ('216317936944794604', 'The Match', 2020, 'Drama', 'Francesco Carnesecchi, Stefano Ferrari', 'Francesco Carnesecchi', 'Francesco Pannofino, Alberto Di Stasio, Gabriele Fiore, Giorgio Colangeli, Fabrizio Sabatucci, Stefano Ambrogi, Daniele Mariani, Lidia Vitale', null, 'One football match on a dirt pitch near Rome becomes a day of reckoning as a young player, his coach and their team''s owner wrestle internal demons.', 'One football match on a dirt pitch near Rome becomes a day of reckoning as a young player, his coach and their team''s owner wrestle internal demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPOoMzOC7GX5aFbdbQCczSqywMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671812'),
  ('738870549445763599', 'The Match', 2021, 'Drama, History, War', 'Dominik Sedlar, Jakov Sedlar, Bruno Štampalija', 'Stephen Ollendorff, Dominik Sedlar, Gary Hertz', 'Franco Nero, Caspar Phillipson, Filip Tallhamn, Andrej Dojkić, Viktor Kulhanek, Armand Assante, Milton Welsh, Robert Maaser', 'PG-13', 'Inspired by true events from the spring of 1944 when the Nazis organized a football match between a team of camp inmates and an elite Nazi team on Adolf Hitler''s birthday. A match the prisoners are determined to win, no matter what happens.', 'Inspired by true events from the spring of 1944 when the Nazis organized a football match between a team of camp inmates and an elite Nazi team on Adolf Hitler''s birthday. A match the prisoners are determined to win, no matter what happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMMcBauzPqcMPKXUdoqB2O0dkAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840283'),
  ('954235017303247645', 'The Match', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Kim Hyung-joo, Yu Eok, Han Gyeong-wook', 'Kim Hyung-joo, Yoon Jong-bin', 'Lee Byung-hun, Yoo Ah-in, Ko Chang-seok, Hyun Bong-sik, Moon Jeong-hee, Jo Woo-jin, Son Jong-hak, Kim Kang-hoon', null, 'When a legendary Go master loses his title to a one-time friend and protégé, he sets out to reclaim it in a high-stakes battle of wits and skill.', 'When a legendary Go master loses his title to a one-time friend and protégé, he sets out to reclaim it in a high-stakes battle of wits and skill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epI43M0kT1FNr2qPXOoke4ux8U1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760497'),
  ('289890898938911890', 'The Match Factory Girl', 1990, 'Drama', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Pauli Pentti', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Kati Outinen, Elina Salo, Esko Nikkari, Vesa Vierikko, Reijo Taipale, Silu Seppälä, Outi Mäenpää, Marja Packalén', 'NR', 'Iris is a shy and dowdy young woman stuck in a dead-end job at a match factory, who dreams of finding love at the local dancehall. Finding herself pregnant after a one-night stand and abandoned by the father, Iris finally decides the time has come to get even and she begins to plot her revenge.', 'Iris is a shy and dowdy young woman stuck in a dead-end job at a match factory, who dreams of finding love at the local dancehall. Finding herself pregnant after a one-night stand and abandoned by the father, Iris finally decides the time has come to get even and she begins to plot her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHfabvr3RKEbNfksFBs2Cder91i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7974'),
  ('587050382749789188', 'The Match That Changed Tennis', 2026, 'Documentary, Sport', 'Chris Hay', null, 'Novak Đoković, Rafael Nadal, John McEnroe', null, 'Highlights the 2022 Australian Open final between Novak Djokovic and Rafael Nadal as a pivotal match that changed tennis by redefining physical and mental endurance. This 6 hours encounter set new, extreme standards for modern pro-tennis.', 'Highlights the 2022 Australian Open final between Novak Djokovic and Rafael Nadal as a pivotal match that changed tennis by redefining physical and mental endurance. This 6 hours encounter set new, extreme standards for modern pro-tennis.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6blM6rlNOILvNAT1FatIJVuWmly.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-match-that-changed-tennis'),
  ('191910949357530809', 'The Matchbreaker', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Caleb Vetter', 'Torry Martin, Marshal Younger', 'Wesley Elder, Christina Grimmie, Osric Chau, Olan Rogers, Shawna Howson, Tessa Violet, Victoria Jackson, Torry Martin', 'PG', 'When an idealistic romantic gets fired from his day job, he is offered a "one-time gig" to break up a girl''s relationship for her disapproving parents. This "one-time" gig spreads through word-of-mouth and he ends up becoming a professional match-breaker. However, he ends up falling for one of his clients and must figure out how to balance his secret job with his love-life.', 'When an idealistic romantic gets fired from his day job, he is offered a "one-time gig" to break up a girl''s relationship for her disapproving parents. This "one-time" gig spreads through word-of-mouth and he ends up becoming a professional match-breaker. However, he ends up falling for one of his clients and must figure out how to balance his secret job with his love-life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9RWMUNtaFZpYKtB8HH5Yg11P5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413417'),
  ('758462404463578484', 'The Matches of a Beautiful Dragoon', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jiří Sequens, Jiří Mikeťuk, Alena Mikeťuková', 'Jiří Marek, Jiří Sequens', 'Jaroslav Marvan, Josef Vinklář, Josef Bláha, Vladimír Menšík, Stella Zázvorková, Josef Abrhám, Květa Fialová, Helga Čočková', null, 'In a suburban villa, a woman of means is murdered. Police Superintendent Zdychynec from the Prague Liben neighborhood reports the case to Police Councilman Vacátko, upon whose order an investigation is launched immediately. Zdychynec begins to suspect the wooer of his own daughter, a handsome dragoon named Rudi, of the crime. In Rudi''s absence, Zdychynec searches his rented room in the apartment of the elegant Mrs Dragicová. All his findings - among others, sand left on Rudi''s jackboots and a decent amount of money in his bedside table - convince the superintendent that he is following the right lead, especially when Rudi refuses to say where he was at the time of the murder.', 'In a suburban villa, a woman of means is murdered. Police Superintendent Zdychynec from the Prague Liben neighborhood reports the case to Police Councilman Vacátko, upon whose order an investigation is launched immediately. Zdychynec begins to suspect the wooer of his own daughter, a handsome dragoon named Rudi, of the crime. In Rudi''s absence, Zdychynec searches his rented room in the apartment of the elegant Mrs Dragicová. All his findings - among others, sand left on Rudi''s jackboots and a decent amount of money in his bedside table - convince the superintendent that he is following the right lead, especially when Rudi refuses to say where he was at the time of the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcjToGvibZ2X2Xtv1QNYUv6j94n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48427'),
  ('171519712460996992', 'The Matchmaker', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles C. Coleman, Joseph Anthony, Charles Lang', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Shirley Booth, Anthony Perkins, Shirley MacLaine, Paul Ford, Robert Morse, Perry Wilson, Wallace Ford, Russell Collins', null, 'Thornton Wilder''s tale of a matchmaker who desires the man she''s supposed to be pairing with another woman.', 'Thornton Wilder''s tale of a matchmaker who desires the man she''s supposed to be pairing with another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g27RVCu3hqi0ihYrLedpxHdUUvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43141'),
  ('461756008051839094', 'The Matchmaker', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Joffe, Ellery Ryan', 'Karen Janszen, Greg Dinner, Louis Nowra', 'Janeane Garofalo, David O''Hara, Milo O''Shea, Jay O. Sanders, Rosaleen Linehan, Paul Hickey, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Saffron Burrows', 'R', 'Marcy, a worker in the reelection campaign of bumbling Senator John McGlory, is sent to Ireland on a quest to find the Irish ancestry of Sen. McGlory, to help him win the Irish vote. But when Marcy arrives in the small village of Ballinagra, she finds herself in the middle of a matchmaking festival, and the local matchmaker is determined to pair her off with one of the local bachelors.', 'Marcy, a worker in the reelection campaign of bumbling Senator John McGlory, is sent to Ireland on a quest to find the Irish ancestry of Sen. McGlory, to help him win the Irish vote. But when Marcy arrives in the small village of Ballinagra, she finds herself in the middle of a matchmaking festival, and the local matchmaker is determined to pair her off with one of the local bachelors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TlW75w0Lo4uT6l8WRf3pdxbHHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20457'),
  ('910187163472325197', 'The Matchmaker''s Playbook', 2018, 'Romance', 'Denis Maloney, Tosca Musk', 'Joany Kane', 'Nick Bateman, Caitlin Carver, Tyler Johnson, Justene Alpert, Trey Tucker, Bayley Corman', null, 'After a career-ending accident, former NFL recruit Ian Hunter is back on campus, and he''s putting his extensive skills with women to work as one of the masterminds behind a successful and secretive dating service. But when Blake Olson requests the services of Wingmen, Inc., Ian may have landed his most hopeless client yet. As Blake begins the transformation from hot mess to smokin'' hot, Ian realizes he''s in danger of breaking his cardinal rule....', 'After a career-ending accident, former NFL recruit Ian Hunter is back on campus, and he''s putting his extensive skills with women to work as one of the masterminds behind a successful and secretive dating service. But when Blake Olson requests the services of Wingmen, Inc., Ian may have landed his most hopeless client yet. As Blake begins the transformation from hot mess to smokin'' hot, Ian realizes he''s in danger of breaking his cardinal rule....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpdLAbE4C7AMY77xFNguMX1XIb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510938'),
  ('901507090384140444', 'The Mathematician and the Devil', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Semyon Raytburt, Pavel Tartakov', 'Semyon Raytburt', 'Vsevolod Shestakov, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Alla Pokrovskaya', null, 'A mathematician offers to sell his soul to the devil for a proof or disproof of Fermat''s Last Theorem. Based on "The Devil and Simon Flagg" by Arthur Porges.', 'A mathematician offers to sell his soul to the devil for a proof or disproof of Fermat''s Last Theorem. Based on "The Devil and Simon Flagg" by Arthur Porges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JCaWtCySRPy2JbHwgUAmYJBM8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399168'),
  ('48454275895106211', 'The Matinee Idol', 1928, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Frank Capra, Philip Tannura, Eugene De Rue', null, 'Bessie Love, Johnnie Walker, Ernest Hilliard, Lionel Belmore, David Mir, Joe Bordeaux, Sidney Bracey, Sidney D''Albrook', 'NR', 'The famous matinee idol and blackface comedian, Don Wilson, heads out of town to escape adulation. There, calling himself Harry Mann, he accidentally joins a traveling acting troupe, and falls in love with Ginger Bolivar, who runs the troupe and stars in their Civil War melodrama. Don''s producer sees the play, and thinks it''s a comic masterpiece, and just what Don''s Broadway show needs. But when Ginger finds out she''s been played for a fool, will she forgive Don? Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Sony Pictures Entertainment, Inc. in 1997.', 'The famous matinee idol and blackface comedian, Don Wilson, heads out of town to escape adulation. There, calling himself Harry Mann, he accidentally joins a traveling acting troupe, and falls in love with Ginger Bolivar, who runs the troupe and stars in their Civil War melodrama. Don''s producer sees the play, and thinks it''s a comic masterpiece, and just what Don''s Broadway show needs. But when Ginger finds out she''s been played for a fool, will she forgive Don? Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Sony Pictures Entertainment, Inc. in 1997.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ07uptDt7N79st0cqUnzmaq7xL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75429'),
  ('1149283893349081219', 'The Mating Game', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Al Jennings, George Marshall, Robert J. Bronner', 'William Roberts', 'Debbie Reynolds, Tony Randall, Paul Douglas, Fred Clark, Una Merkel, Philip Ober, Philip Coolidge, Charles Lane', null, 'Tax collector Lorenzo Charlton comes to the Larkins'' farm to ask why Pop Larkins hasn''t paid his back taxes. Charlton has to stay for a day to try to estimate the income from the farm, but it isn''t easy to calculate when the farmer has such a lovely daughter.', 'Tax collector Lorenzo Charlton comes to the Larkins'' farm to ask why Pop Larkins hasn''t paid his back taxes. Charlton has to stay for a day to try to estimate the income from the farm, but it isn''t easy to calculate when the farmer has such a lovely daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e87jyPk8Hx4LIdyTdP3IHdc3RH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43110'),
  ('671104770164409750', 'The Mating Habits of the Earthbound Human', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Abugov, Michael K. Bucher, Melissa Cummins Lorenz', 'Jeff Abugov', 'Mackenzie Astin, Carmen Electra, David Hyde Pierce, Markus Redmond, Lucy Liu, Lisa Rotondi, Sharon Wyatt, Jack Kehler', 'R', 'David Hyde Pierce, playing an alien (credited as infinity-cubed in the opening credits), narrates a courtship in a late-20th century American city as an extraterrestrial nature documentary. The relationship "footage" is played straight, while the voice-over (with its most often wildly inaccurate theories) and elaborate visual metaphors add comedy.', 'David Hyde Pierce, playing an alien (credited as infinity-cubed in the opening credits), narrates a courtship in a late-20th century American city as an extraterrestrial nature documentary. The relationship "footage" is played straight, while the voice-over (with its most often wildly inaccurate theories) and elaborate visual metaphors add comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HKeiRaPRstC5Uc7y6MmolV5dbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17198'),
  ('908584283134224535', 'The Mating of Millie', 1948, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Levin, Milton Feldman, Joseph Walker', 'Louella MacFarlane, St. Clair McKelway', 'Glenn Ford, Evelyn Keyes, Ron Randell, Willard Parker, Jimmy Hunt, Mabel Paige, Virginia Hunter, Virginia Brissac', 'NR', 'Self-sufficient in life and successful in business, prim and proper Millie McGonigle wants just one more thing, a child. When she asks to adopt orphan Tommy Bassett, but learns that she will first have to have a husband, Millie turns to a recently fired bus driver, Doug Andrews. Though he has no interest in marriage, Doug offers to help Millie find a husband by transforming her into a beautiful and exciting woman, one who catches the eye of two eligible bachelors, including the orphanage''s president.', 'Self-sufficient in life and successful in business, prim and proper Millie McGonigle wants just one more thing, a child. When she asks to adopt orphan Tommy Bassett, but learns that she will first have to have a husband, Millie turns to a recently fired bus driver, Doug Andrews. Though he has no interest in marriage, Doug offers to help Millie find a husband by transforming her into a beautiful and exciting woman, one who catches the eye of two eligible bachelors, including the orphanage''s president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrGTuzfSLvwrirNOoF3fr956XKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252622'),
  ('963507898134616907', 'The Mating Season', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Oscar Rudolph, Charles Lang', 'Charles Brackett, Walter Reisch, Richard L. Breen', 'John Lund, Gene Tierney, Thelma Ritter, Miriam Hopkins, Jan Sterling, Larry Keating, James Lorimer, Gladys Hurlbut', null, 'Ellen McNulty leaves her New Jersey hamburger stand and heads west to pay a surprise visit to her son and his new bride. When Ellen arrives, her daughter-in-law mistakes her for the maid she has hired for a big party they are throwing. Rather than cause any embarrassment, Ellen goes along with the charade, which leads to many complications.', 'Ellen McNulty leaves her New Jersey hamburger stand and heads west to pay a surprise visit to her son and his new bride. When Ellen arrives, her daughter-in-law mistakes her for the maid she has hired for a big party they are throwing. Rather than cause any embarrassment, Ellen goes along with the charade, which leads to many complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ54MP0RvqS9VTY18W2121LrNmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108232'),
  ('766765408918358169', 'The Matrimony', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Teng Huatao, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Zhang Jialu, Yeung Sin-Ling', 'Leon Lai Ming, René Liu, Fan Bingbing, Xu Songzi, Zheng Yuzhi, Niu Ben, Koan Hui, Li Qian', null, 'A woman finds the key to a room in the attic that her husband forbids her from entering. When she opens the door, she is confronted with the haunting existence of the woman her husband refuses to forget.', 'A woman finds the key to a room in the attic that her husband forbids her from entering. When she opens the door, she is confronted with the haunting existence of the woman her husband refuses to forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBKTd8qgvli5Oo3jR8bnTtlu1vK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44673'),
  ('1090435180408565504', 'The Matrix', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Bill Pope, Ross Emery, Tom Read', 'Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Keanu Reeves, Laurence Fishburne, Carrie-Anne Moss, Hugo Weaving, Gloria Foster, Joe Pantoliano, Marcus Chong, Julian Arahanga', 'R', 'Set in the 22nd century, The Matrix tells the story of a computer hacker who joins a group of underground insurgents fighting the vast and powerful computers who now rule the earth.', 'Set in the 22nd century, The Matrix tells the story of a computer hacker who joins a group of underground insurgents fighting the vast and powerful computers who now rule the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOIuZAjPaRIE6CMzbazvcHuHXDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603'),
  ('967939448677001141', 'The Matrix Reloaded', 2003, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski, Bill Pope', 'Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Keanu Reeves, Laurence Fishburne, Carrie-Anne Moss, Hugo Weaving, Jada Pinkett Smith, Gloria Foster, Harold Perrineau, Monica Bellucci', 'R', 'The Resistance builds in numbers as humans are freed from the Matrix and brought to the city of Zion. Neo discovers his superpowers, including the ability to see the code inside the Matrix. With machine sentinels digging to Zion in 72 hours, Neo, Morpheus and Trinity must find the Keymaker to ultimately reach the Source.', 'The Resistance builds in numbers as humans are freed from the Matrix and brought to the city of Zion. Neo discovers his superpowers, including the ability to see the code inside the Matrix. With machine sentinels digging to Zion in 72 hours, Neo, Morpheus and Trinity must find the Keymaker to ultimately reach the Source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aA5qHS0FbSXO8PxcxUIHbDrJyuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604'),
  ('757581246047791787', 'The Matrix Resurrections', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Daniele Massaccesi, Maya Shimoguchi, Stephan O. Gessler', 'David Mitchell, Lana Wachowski, Aleksandar Hemon', 'Keanu Reeves, Carrie-Anne Moss, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Jonathan Groff, Jessica Henwick, Neil Patrick Harris, Jada Pinkett Smith, Priyanka Chopra Jonas', 'R', 'Plagued by strange memories, Neo''s life takes an unexpected turn when he finds himself back inside the Matrix.', 'Plagued by strange memories, Neo''s life takes an unexpected turn when he finds himself back inside the Matrix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8c4a8kE7PizaGQQnditMmI1xbRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624860'),
  ('746653708453816375', 'The Matrix Revisited', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Josh Oreck, Bill Pope, Richard Henkels', null, 'Keanu Reeves, Hugo Weaving, Carrie-Anne Moss, Laurence Fishburne, Lorenzo di Bonaventura, Joel Silver, Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', null, 'The film goes behind the scenes of the 1999 sci-fi movie The Matrix.', 'The film goes behind the scenes of the 1999 sci-fi movie The Matrix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yxSztoc5sqZiGuKcFuVOh65B6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14543'),
  ('590575192735191229', 'The Matrix Revolutions', 2003, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Bill Pope, Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Lilly Wachowski, Lana Wachowski', 'Keanu Reeves, Laurence Fishburne, Carrie-Anne Moss, Hugo Weaving, Jada Pinkett Smith, Mary Alice, Harold Perrineau, Collin Chou', 'R', 'The human city of Zion defends itself against the massive invasion of the machines as Neo fights to end the war at another front while also opposing the rogue Agent Smith.', 'The human city of Zion defends itself against the massive invasion of the machines as Neo fights to end the war at another front while also opposing the rogue Agent Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkkS61w94ZVMNVd8KEyyJl2tnY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605'),
  ('905080471592351947', 'The Matrix: Generation', 2023, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Benjamin Clavel', null, null, null, 'After the 1999 premiere of the first Matrix movie, it became a pop culture phenomenon. A special documentary about the Matrix saga and its prophetic aspects.', 'After the 1999 premiere of the first Matrix movie, it became a pop culture phenomenon. A special documentary about the Matrix saga and its prophetic aspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53McB8R9RUBxfINRxWaPwUMtL5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217455'),
  ('674475374594816396', 'The Matrix: What Is Bullet-Time?', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Josh Oreck', null, 'John Gaeta', null, 'Special Effects wizard John Gaeta demonstrates how the "Bullet-Time" effects were created for the film The Matrix (1999).', 'Special Effects wizard John Gaeta demonstrates how the "Bullet-Time" effects were created for the film The Matrix (1999).', null, 'tmdb:movie:684428'),
  ('657787895750123978', 'The Matsugane Potshot Affair', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Takahiro Tsutai', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Kosuke Mukai', 'Hirofumi Arai, Takashi Yamanaka, Miwa Kawagoe, Yuichi Kimura, Tamae Ando, Midoriko Kimura, Mari Nishio, Setsuko Karasuma', null, 'When a gold ingot and a severed human head are discovered in a small provincial town, the rush to solve the curious case wavers between tragic and darkly humorous.', 'When a gold ingot and a severed human head are discovered in a small provincial town, the rush to solve the curious case wavers between tragic and darkly humorous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b84dEwKqOm5ajotQbxskviOrSWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99751'),
  ('38991408484189090', 'The Mattei Affair', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Francesco Rosi, Marco Guarnaschelli, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Nerio Minuzzo, Tito De Stefano', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Luigi Squarzina, Peter Baldwin, Renato Romano, Franco Graziosi, Gianfranco Ombuen, Elio Jotta, Luciano Colitti', null, 'Enrico Mattei helped change Italy’s future, first as freedom-fighter against the Nazis, then as an investor in methane gas through a public company, A.G.I.P., and ultimately as the head of ENI, a state body formed for the development of oil resources. On October 27, 1962, he died when his private airplane crashed during a flight to Milan. Officially, it is declared an accident, but many journalists explore other plausible reasons for Mattei''s untimely death.', 'Enrico Mattei helped change Italy’s future, first as freedom-fighter against the Nazis, then as an investor in methane gas through a public company, A.G.I.P., and ultimately as the head of ENI, a state body formed for the development of oil resources. On October 27, 1962, he died when his private airplane crashed during a flight to Milan. Officially, it is declared an accident, but many journalists explore other plausible reasons for Mattei''s untimely death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4EHDfdbgjNXmQb7WB9fYmom0s1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62382'),
  ('611915688608053148', 'The Matthew Shepard Story', 2002, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Annie Bradley', 'Jacob Krueger, John Wierick', 'Stockard Channing, Shane Meier, Wendy Crewson, Kristen Thomson, Joseph Ziegler, Yani Gellman, Sam Waterston, Drew Nelson', null, 'In a senseless act of hatred, openly gay college student Matthew Shepard was murdered in 1998. This critically-acclaimed, moving film recounts the final days of Matthew''s killers'' trial—and the weeks leading to Matthew''s death—with unnerving detail. Stockard Channing delivers an unforgettable, Emmy® Award-winning performance as Matthew''s grieving mother, Judy, in a story of a murder that moved a nation to action. Also starring Law & Order''s Sam Waterston.', 'In a senseless act of hatred, openly gay college student Matthew Shepard was murdered in 1998. This critically-acclaimed, moving film recounts the final days of Matthew''s killers'' trial—and the weeks leading to Matthew''s death—with unnerving detail. Stockard Channing delivers an unforgettable, Emmy® Award-winning performance as Matthew''s grieving mother, Judy, in a story of a murder that moved a nation to action. Also starring Law & Order''s Sam Waterston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TChFELYf4ccNaenxCSyGFRyDTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44528'),
  ('330597993293885219', 'The Mauritanian', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kevin Macdonald, Alwin H. Küchler', 'Rory Haines, Sohrab Noshirvani, Michael Bronner', 'Tahar Rahim, Jodie Foster, Benedict Cumberbatch, Shailene Woodley, Zachary Levi, Langley Kirkwood, Saamer Usmani, Corey Johnson', 'R', 'The true story of the Mauritanian Mohamedou Ould Slahi, who was held at the U.S military''s Guantanamo Bay detention center without charges for over a decade and sought help from a defense attorney for his release.', 'The true story of the Mauritanian Mohamedou Ould Slahi, who was held at the U.S military''s Guantanamo Bay detention center without charges for over a decade and sought help from a defense attorney for his release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIADEa6oH74uUapjsPbNRzxus8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644583'),
  ('926915050233961498', 'The Maus', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Rafael Reparaz, Gerardo Herrero Pereda', 'Gerardo Herrero Pereda', 'Alma Terzić, August Wittgenstein, Aleksandar Seksan, Ella Jazz, Sanin Milavić, Diana Fernández Pérez', null, 'Alex and Selma are a couple in love on a trip to the heart of Bosnia and Herzegovina. Suddenly, Selma feels a mysterious force is chasing them.', 'Alex and Selma are a couple in love on a trip to the heart of Bosnia and Herzegovina. Suddenly, Selma feels a mysterious force is chasing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOnVhuqmirMo3c1vlQcI2jnfWT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461931'),
  ('452336502052842155', 'The Maverick Queen', 1956, 'Western', 'Joseph Kane', 'Kenneth Gamet, DeVallon Scott', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Barry Sullivan, Scott Brady, Mary Murphy, Wallace Ford, Howard Petrie, Jim Davis, Emile Meyer', 'NR', 'Kit Banion, a Virginia-born beauty and product of post-Civil War chaos, has settled in Wyoming and prospered; acquiring a fortune and a hotel, which, like the owner bears the name of "The Maverick Queen."---a title picked up by Kit in her earlier days in Wyoming when she took every unbranded steer and put her own brand on it. Love and trouble enter her life in the person of a Pinkerton detective posing as Jeff Younger, nephew of the infamous Younger brothers. He is dedicated to catching Butch Cassidy and the members of The Wild Bunch', 'Kit Banion, a Virginia-born beauty and product of post-Civil War chaos, has settled in Wyoming and prospered; acquiring a fortune and a hotel, which, like the owner bears the name of "The Maverick Queen."---a title picked up by Kit in her earlier days in Wyoming when she took every unbranded steer and put her own brand on it. Love and trouble enter her life in the person of a Pinkerton detective posing as Jeff Younger, nephew of the infamous Younger brothers. He is dedicated to catching Butch Cassidy and the members of The Wild Bunch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUui9ihSk5u1xmimVIF6yskGopE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118939'),
  ('955109079956976306', 'The Maximum Penalty', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Felipe Solarte, Edwin Cortés, Juan Carlos Vásquez', 'Luis Felipe Salamanca, Dago García', 'Enrique Carriazo, Robinson Díaz, Fernando Arévalo, Sandra Reyes, Álvaro Bayona, Consuelo Moure, Aura Helena Prada, Luis Fernando Múnera', null, 'After seeing how the Colombian National Football Team achieves a draw against Argentina, Mariano Concha —a public employee for whom football is a great passion— starts a whole process to attend the next crucial match, in Bogotá and against the same team, going over all his duties and risking the future of his reduced economy. An unexpected event transforms his plans to go to the stadium.', 'After seeing how the Colombian National Football Team achieves a draw against Argentina, Mariano Concha —a public employee for whom football is a great passion— starts a whole process to attend the next crucial match, in Bogotá and against the same team, going over all his duties and risking the future of his reduced economy. An unexpected event transforms his plans to go to the stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gE01KExKS62RxfSDp3hK8HVuIfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327265'),
  ('949635332665909492', 'The Mayor', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Park In-je, Park Yoon-seo, Kim Tae-sung', 'Park Sin-gyu, Park In-je', 'Choi Min-sik, Kwak Do-won, Shim Eun-kyung, Moon So-ri, Ra Mi-ran, Ryu Hye-young, Ki Hong Lee, Kim Hong-pa', null, 'For the first time in Korean history, the mayor of Seoul attempts a third term in office, with his entire campaign team ready to soil their hands.', 'For the first time in Korean history, the mayor of Seoul attempts a third term in office, with his entire campaign team ready to soil their hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2egTMMZjTYgW8XkbdXBqp4amDuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437073'),
  ('1015580337280638260', 'The Mayor of Hell', 1933, 'Crime, Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Barney McGill, Frank Shaw', 'Edward Chodorov', 'James Cagney, Madge Evans, Frankie Darro, Dudley Digges, Arthur Byron, Allen Jenkins, Sheila Terry, Robert Barrat', 'NR', 'Members of a teenage gang are sent to the State Reformatory, presided over by the callous Thompson. Soon Patsy Gargan, a former gangster appointed Deputy Commissioner, arrives and takes over the administration to run the place on radical principles. Thompson needs a quick way to discredit him.', 'Members of a teenage gang are sent to the State Reformatory, presided over by the callous Thompson. Soon Patsy Gargan, a former gangster appointed Deputy Commissioner, arrives and takes over the administration to run the place on radical principles. Thompson needs a quick way to discredit him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqYNH0qqCDrWQ19WHmyLP6q2PjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100894'),
  ('1072394554853131839', 'The Mayor of Rione Sanità', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edoardo Petti, Ferran Paredes, Luca Federico', 'Mario Martone, Ippolita Di Majo', 'Francesco Di Leva, Massimiliano Gallo, Roberto De Francesco, Adriano Pantaleo, Daniela Ioia, Giuseppe M. Gaudino, Gennaro Di Colandrea, Lucienne Perreca', null, 'Antonio Barracano is a respected figure among the Neapolitan underworld, keeping order and administering justice according to his own criteria, beyond the law. One day he''s faced with a dilemma after a youth asks him permission to kill his father.', 'Antonio Barracano is a respected figure among the Neapolitan underworld, keeping order and administering justice according to his own criteria, beyond the law. One day he''s faced with a dilemma after a youth asks him permission to kill his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBisIIYprZfw0HXx00weMmeQtBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608315'),
  ('717490513835294137', 'The Maze', 1953, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'William Cameron Menzies, Harry Neumann', 'Daniel B. Ullman', 'Richard Carlson, Veronica Hurst, Katherine Emery, Michael Pate, John Dodsworth, Hillary Brooke, Stanley Fraser, Lilian Bond', null, 'A Scotsman abruptly breaks off his engagement to pretty Kitty and moves to his uncle''s castle in the Scottish highlands. Kitty and her aunt follow Gerald a few weeks later, and discover he has suddenly aged. Some mysterious things happen in a maze made from the hedges adjoining the castle.', 'A Scotsman abruptly breaks off his engagement to pretty Kitty and moves to his uncle''s castle in the Scottish highlands. Kitty and her aunt follow Gerald a few weeks later, and discover he has suddenly aged. Some mysterious things happen in a maze made from the hedges adjoining the castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlfJKdjwUZNfT2QUEUv0RozVuEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85498'),
  ('1103227287897760892', 'The Maze Runner', 2014, 'Action, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'H.H. Cooper, Mirashyam Blakeslee, Chris Craine', 'Grant Pierce Myers, Noah Oppenheim, T.S. Nowlin', 'Dylan O''Brien, Kaya Scodelario, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Ki Hong Lee, Will Poulter, Aml Ameen, Patricia Clarkson, Blake Cooper', 'PG-13', 'A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.', 'A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198663'),
  ('910400143909275364', 'The McKenzie Break', 1970, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Lamont Johnson, Michael Reed', 'William W. Norton', 'Brian Keith, Helmut Griem, Ian Hendry, Jack Watson, Horst Janson, Patrick O''Connell, Alexander Allerson, John Abineri', 'PG', 'A German U-Boat commander plans a daring escape from a PoW camp in Scotland.', 'A German U-Boat commander plans a daring escape from a PoW camp in Scotland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6TEXFrCkUp7lSCDv06BYbU7k3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45398'),
  ('1086289173129352603', 'The McMasters', 1970, 'Western, War', 'Alf Kjellin, Lester Shorr', 'Harold Jacob Smith', 'Burl Ives, Brock Peters, David Carradine, Nancy Kwan, Jack Palance, John Carradine, L.Q. Jones, R.G. Armstrong', null, 'When a black Civil War veteran becomes co-owner of the southern McMasters ranch, the incensed local Confederate veterans come gunning for him and his Indian wife.', 'When a black Civil War veteran becomes co-owner of the southern McMasters ranch, the incensed local Confederate veterans come gunning for him and his Indian wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFAYOq2sYSKYZw2bFe6WKABJM82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86968'),
  ('336759443036640498', 'The Mean One', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Steven LaMorte, Allyson Sereboff, Stephanie Bates', 'Finn Kobler, Flip Kobler', 'David Howard Thornton, Krystle Martin, Chase Mullins, John Bigham, Erik Baker, Amy Schumacher, Flip Kobler, Christopher Sanders', 'NR', 'In a sleepy mountain town, Cindy witnesses the murder of her parents by a blood-thirsty green figure in a red Santa suit. Twenty years later, the Christmas-hating monster begins to terrorize the town once more. Cindy finds new purpose in stopping the creature and saving the holiday.', 'In a sleepy mountain town, Cindy witnesses the murder of her parents by a blood-thirsty green figure in a red Santa suit. Twenty years later, the Christmas-hating monster begins to terrorize the town once more. Cindy finds new purpose in stopping the creature and saving the holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56yQqjnGo9Ky65bSSGxz5vDaNUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033052'),
  ('232471189572381872', 'The Mean Season', 1985, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Phillip Borsos, Michelle Marx, Frank Tidy', 'Leon Piedmont', 'Kurt Russell, Mariel Hemingway, Richard Jordan, Richard Masur, Richard Bradford, Joe Pantoliano, Andy Garcia, Rose Portillo', 'R', 'A routine investigation of a shocking murder takes a bizarre twist when the killer contacts the reporter and appoints him his personal spokesman. As the killer''s calls and clues increase, the reporter is lured into a deadly trap.', 'A routine investigation of a shocking murder takes a bizarre twist when the killer contacts the reporter and appoints him his personal spokesman. As the killer''s calls and clues increase, the reporter is lured into a deadly trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCPzsNt2Hznkr54J6wfGzpnE1Z4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31652'),
  ('876479517228411868', 'The Meanest Men in the West', 1978, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Charles S. Dubin, Samuel Fuller, Enzo A. Martinelli', 'Samuel Fuller, Ed Waters', 'Charles Bronson, Lee J. Cobb, Lee Marvin, Miriam Colon, James Drury, Albert Salmi, Charles Grodin, Don Mitchell', null, 'Bronson and Marvin star as murderous half-brothers who are running from the law as well as each other. A climatic confrontation proves to each of them just how mean the other can be. "The Meanest Men in the West" is actually an amalgam of two episodes of the hit 1960''s TV series, "The Virginian." In one installment, a wealthy man''s daughter is kidnapped by a nasty gunslinger. But the crime is only just a means for the ruffian to draw the tough title character into a blood- thirsty revenge scheme. In the second, a drifter burglarizes the Shiloh ranch. Then an unhinged girl relies on the man to aid in her flight from home.', 'Bronson and Marvin star as murderous half-brothers who are running from the law as well as each other. A climatic confrontation proves to each of them just how mean the other can be. "The Meanest Men in the West" is actually an amalgam of two episodes of the hit 1960''s TV series, "The Virginian." In one installment, a wealthy man''s daughter is kidnapped by a nasty gunslinger. But the crime is only just a means for the ruffian to draw the tough title character into a blood- thirsty revenge scheme. In the second, a drifter burglarizes the Shiloh ranch. Then an unhinged girl relies on the man to aid in her flight from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x69g4XJhRCQermM9n6TdY1SGOKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137458'),
  ('981034823610098474', 'The Meaning of Life', 2005, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Murwarid Abdiani, Jaden Alexander', null, 'Evolution on Earth over the course of a billion years.', 'Evolution on Earth over the course of a billion years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2ukqauJx4x5gfL4VT0YKz76Xh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32539'),
  ('356734211059053697', 'The Measure of a Man', 2015, 'Drama', 'Stéphane Brizé, Éric Dumont', 'Stéphane Brizé, Olivier Gorce', 'Vincent Lindon, Karine de Mirbeck, Mathieu Schaller, Yves Ory, Xavier Mathieu, Noel Mairot, Catherine Saint-Bonnet, Christophe Rossignon', 'NR', 'At the age of 51 and after 20 months on unemployment, Thierry starts a new job that soon brings him face to face with a moral dilemma. How much is he willing to accept to keep his job?', 'At the age of 51 and after 20 months on unemployment, Thierry starts a new job that soon brings him face to face with a moral dilemma. How much is he willing to accept to keep his job?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMsOEBcAeBL74xWMUj6hgDv4l1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329712'),
  ('25151350766747873', 'The Mechanic', 1972, 'Action, Thriller', 'Peter Price, Antonio Tarruella, Mel Efros', 'Lewis John Carlino', 'Charles Bronson, Jan-Michael Vincent, Keenan Wynn, Jill Ireland, Linda Ridgeway, Frank De Kova, James Davidson, Lindsay Crosby', 'PG', 'Arthur Bishop is a veteran hit man who, owing to his penchant for making his targets'' deaths seem like accidents, thinks himself an artist. It''s made him very rich, but as he hits middle age, he''s so depressed and lonely that he takes on one of his victim''s sons, Steve McKenna, as his apprentice. Arthur puts him through a rigorous training period and brings him on several hits. As Steven improves, Arthur worries that he''ll discover who killed his father.', 'Arthur Bishop is a veteran hit man who, owing to his penchant for making his targets'' deaths seem like accidents, thinks himself an artist. It''s made him very rich, but as he hits middle age, he''s so depressed and lonely that he takes on one of his victim''s sons, Steve McKenna, as his apprentice. Arthur puts him through a rigorous training period and brings him on several hits. As Steven improves, Arthur worries that he''ll discover who killed his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hizE0MwFJOBlfLSFqFNKv7cSxkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19403'),
  ('1014506866481197564', 'The Mechanic', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Simon West, Eric Schmidt, David Leitch', 'Richard Wenk, Lewis John Carlino', 'Jason Statham, Ben Foster, Donald Sutherland, Mini Anden, Tony Goldwyn, Christa Campbell, Katarzyna Wolejnio, Jeff Chase', 'R', 'Arthur Bishop is a ''mechanic'' - an elite assassin with a strict code requiring professional perfection and total detachment. One of an elite group of assassins, Bishop may be the best in the business - with a unique talent for cleanly eliminating targets. When Harry McKenna, his close friend and mentor, is murdered, Harry''s son comes to him with vengeance in his heart and a desire to learn Bishop''s trade, signaling the birth of a deadly partnership.', 'Arthur Bishop is a ''mechanic'' - an elite assassin with a strict code requiring professional perfection and total detachment. One of an elite group of assassins, Bishop may be the best in the business - with a unique talent for cleanly eliminating targets. When Harry McKenna, his close friend and mentor, is murdered, Harry''s son comes to him with vengeance in his heart and a desire to learn Bishop''s trade, signaling the birth of a deadly partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8IcT4oBKL793qyo91P1RnhroiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27582'),
  ('498769004045336184', 'The Mechanic Gavrilov''s Beloved Woman', 1982, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Pyotr Todorovskiy, Evgeniy Guslinskiy, S. Bits', 'Sergei Bodrov', 'Lyudmila Gurchenko, Sergey Shakurov, Anatoli Vasilyev, Mikhail Svetin, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Vsevolod Shilovsky, Natalya Nazarova, Lyudmila Arinina', null, 'Story of 38-years-old Rita whose fiance didn''t show up at their wedding.', 'Story of 38-years-old Rita whose fiance didn''t show up at their wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAm96YKmnZyCoZ69qxe1yM98Nmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83459'),
  ('156416213684812107', 'The Mechanical Butcher', 1895, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A butcher puts a full-grown live pig into his large box-like machine. Moments later, he draws out a full range of pork products, many already packaged for sale.', 'A butcher puts a full-grown live pig into his large box-like machine. Moments later, he draws out a full range of pork products, many already packaged for sale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZfjNRgeOrbM78E208ndG9cd9fA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189571'),
  ('216071870432973047', 'The Mechanical Cow', 1927, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald wakes up grumpy and takes it out on his alarm clock, afterward trying his best to wake up the mechanical cow sleeping in the bed beside him, with limited success. They finally do get going, sailing around the barnyard offering milk to denizens of the farm. When kidnappers arrive and takes Oswald''s girlfriend away, he and the cow set off to rescue her.', 'Oswald wakes up grumpy and takes it out on his alarm clock, afterward trying his best to wake up the mechanical cow sleeping in the bed beside him, with limited success. They finally do get going, sailing around the barnyard offering milk to denizens of the farm. When kidnappers arrive and takes Oswald''s girlfriend away, he and the cow set off to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGI67FC8gpfvI6Mtqylpi0nliRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39035'),
  ('117893603537104740', 'The Mechanical Man', 1921, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'André Deed', 'André Deed', 'André Deed, Valentina Frascaroli, Giulia Costa, Mathilde Lambert, Gabriel Moreau, Ferdinando Vivas-May', null, 'The story begins with a scientist creating a device shaped like a man that can be remote-controlled by a machine. The mechanical man possess super-human speed and strength. The scientist is killed however by a gang of criminals, led by a woman named Mado, who wish to get the instructions for building the mechanical man. The criminals are captured before they are able to get them and are brought to trial and condemned. Mado manages to escape and kidnaps the scientist''s niece whom she forces to give her the instructions which she uses to build a mechanical man.', 'The story begins with a scientist creating a device shaped like a man that can be remote-controlled by a machine. The mechanical man possess super-human speed and strength. The scientist is killed however by a gang of criminals, led by a woman named Mado, who wish to get the instructions for building the mechanical man. The criminals are captured before they are able to get them and are brought to trial and condemned. Mado manages to escape and kidnaps the scientist''s niece whom she forces to give her the instructions which she uses to build a mechanical man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rT0AATJ8lh4hwFREWNEeLHMinVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94814'),
  ('999781000855525937', 'The Mechanical Monsters', 1941, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Dave Fleischer, Steve Muffati', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck', null, 'Superman battles a criminal mastermind and his robot army.', 'Superman battles a criminal mastermind and his robot army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JujDGA5QIwcQ8vMHtt7mxBsl5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71129'),
  ('483216369450454528', 'The Mechanics of Love', 1955, 'Romance', 'Willard Maas, Ben Moore', null, 'Michael Crane, Nina Glenn', null, 'This short begins with a couple about to make love, and then does a tour of innocuous objects in the room around them that invariably suggest sexual activity.', 'This short begins with a couple about to make love, and then does a tour of innocuous objects in the room around them that invariably suggest sexual activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIqzlz0CawJdTIKp7VRhWoqa2Lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201344'),
  ('874418078261510226', 'The Medallion', 2003, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 'Gordon Chan, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Bey Logan, Paul Wheeler, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting', 'Jackie Chan, Lee Evans, Claire Forlani, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Julian Sands, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Johann Myers, John Rhys-Davies', 'PG-13', 'A Hong Kong detective suffers a fatal accident involving a mysterious medallion and is transformed into an immortal warrior with superhuman powers.', 'A Hong Kong detective suffers a fatal accident involving a mysterious medallion and is transformed into an immortal warrior with superhuman powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbjFWKfe8WdS8Pj6WVPlyEKeVEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10610'),
  ('595396880332138642', 'The Meddler', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Brett Pawlak, Lorene Scafaria', 'Lorene Scafaria', 'Susan Sarandon, Rose Byrne, J.K. Simmons, Cecily Strong, Jerrod Carmichael, Michael McKean, Jason Ritter, Billy Magnussen', 'PG-13', 'With a new iPhone, an apartment near the Grove, and a comfortable bank account left to her by her beloved late husband, Marnie Minervini has happily relocated from New Jersey to Los Angeles to be near her daughter Lori, a successful (but still single) screenwriter, and smother her with motherly love. But when the dozens of texts, unexpected visits, and conversations dominated by unsolicited advice force Lori to draw strict personal boundaries, Marnie finds ways to channel her eternal optimism and forceful generosity to change the lives of others - as well as her own - and find a new purpose in life.', 'With a new iPhone, an apartment near the Grove, and a comfortable bank account left to her by her beloved late husband, Marnie Minervini has happily relocated from New Jersey to Los Angeles to be near her daughter Lori, a successful (but still single) screenwriter, and smother her with motherly love. But when the dozens of texts, unexpected visits, and conversations dominated by unsolicited advice force Lori to draw strict personal boundaries, Marnie finds ways to channel her eternal optimism and forceful generosity to change the lives of others - as well as her own - and find a new purpose in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzj9ZSleGgsKkY3q6sDDoAxjSu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337154'),
  ('170089069262249045', 'The Mediator', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Yuri Yelkhov, Vladimir Potapov, Emmanuil Tafel', 'Alexander Mirer', 'Evgeniy Redko, Olesya Sudzilovskaya, Andrey Tarasenko, Daria Sidorina, Denis Chlenov, Inara Slucka, Valeriy Storozhik, Algis Matulionis', null, 'In an ordinary industrial Soviet town, notable only for presence of a radio-telescope, people start behaving strangely, in a robotic manner, while assuming geometry-inspired aliases and organizing into a new hierarchy. The phenomenon spreads via a device of alien origin, called “the mediator”, capable of implanting extraterrestrial minds into human bodies. The aliens are bound by limitations of the terrestrial technology, having to use the means at the disposal of humans to prepare the grounds for the full-scale invasion. With “the mediator" being unable to subdue minds of children, lunatics, geniuses, and rebels, a struggle over the fate of the town and the human civilization ensues.', 'In an ordinary industrial Soviet town, notable only for presence of a radio-telescope, people start behaving strangely, in a robotic manner, while assuming geometry-inspired aliases and organizing into a new hierarchy. The phenomenon spreads via a device of alien origin, called “the mediator”, capable of implanting extraterrestrial minds into human bodies. The aliens are bound by limitations of the terrestrial technology, having to use the means at the disposal of humans to prepare the grounds for the full-scale invasion. With “the mediator" being unable to subdue minds of children, lunatics, geniuses, and rebels, a struggle over the fate of the town and the human civilization ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKSdOB5JjtpqCIeF0wEETBTL8qm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53962'),
  ('81657559474482252', 'The Medic', 1979, 'War, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Claude Renoir', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Pascal Jardin', 'Alain Delon, Véronique Jannot, Bernard Giraudeau, Francine Bergé, Michel Auclair, Bernard Le Coq, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Dominique Zardi', null, 'The film is set in a modern war, probably between a European country and a country in the Far East. Behind the battle lines, in a medical unit, a surgeon falls in love with an idealistic nurse after an initially difficult meeting.', 'The film is set in a modern war, probably between a European country and a country in the Far East. Behind the battle lines, in a medical unit, a surgeon falls in love with an idealistic nurse after an initially difficult meeting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckwDXjegC3rXioF3IQuWjZT8r63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52546'),
  ('230386339147217918', 'The Medicine Man', 1930, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Scott Pembroke, Arthur Reeves, Max Dupont', 'Eve Unsell', 'Jack Benny, Betty Bronson, E. Alyn Warren, Eva Novak, Billy Butts, Adolph Milar, George E. Stone, Tom Dugan', 'NR', 'The son and daughter of an abusive shopkeeper turn to a medicine show salesman for help.', 'The son and daughter of an abusive shopkeeper turn to a medicine show salesman for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgpUfJYpQQAKyPU9Smr14lUHzSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166580'),
  ('890190321594566177', 'The Medicine Seller', 2013, 'Drama', 'Antonio Morabito, Duccio Cimatti, Nicola Scorza', 'Michele Pellegrini, Amedeo Pagani, Antonio Morabito', 'Claudio Santamaria, Isabella Ferrari, Evita Ciri, Marco Travaglio, Roberto De Francesco, Ignazio Oliva, Giorgio Gobbi, Vincenzo Tanassi', null, 'A farmaceutical salesman is involved in the spiral of corruption in the medical assistance of the welfare state system.', 'A farmaceutical salesman is involved in the spiral of corruption in the medical assistance of the welfare state system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umrcOR06YG3kXfUBp2XyJp3Xeke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234162'),
  ('18590443255841447', 'The Medium', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Siwawut Sewatanon, Naruphol Chokanapitak, Banjong Pisanthanakun', 'Banjong Pisanthanakun', 'Narilya Gulmongkolpech, Sawanee Utoomma, Sirani Yankittikan, Yasaka Chaisorn, Boonsong Nakphoo, Arunee Wattana, Thanutphon Boonsang, Pakapol Srirongmuang', null, 'A shaman''s family learn that their goddess is supposedly controlling one of them. However, their lives take a frightening turn when they realise the goddess has nothing to do with the possession.', 'A shaman''s family learn that their goddess is supposedly controlling one of them. However, their lives take a frightening turn when they realise the goddess has nothing to do with the possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWoSE8SH6XhgWKHIL3p0sj7lA3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745881'),
  ('713762395778941417', 'The Medium', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emmanuel Laskar, Margot Besson, Romy Engels', 'Raphaëlle Desplechin, Emmanuel Laskar, Antoine Barraud', 'Louise Bourgoin, Noémie Lvovsky, Maud Wyler, Emmanuel Laskar, Alexandre Steiger, Maxence Tual, Christophe Paou, Charlotte Laemmel', null, 'Michael, a young medium, falls in love with Alice, who is shaken by the recent death of her life companion. The two are forced to confront their "ghosts" in order to get their lives back on track.', 'Michael, a young medium, falls in love with Alice, who is shaken by the recent death of her life companion. The two are forced to confront their "ghosts" in order to get their lives back on track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ow7N8NXC83dobCrNONpZQQPeHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196134'),
  ('436999590904187876', 'The Medusa Touch', 1978, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Jack Gold, Arthur Ibbetson', 'John Briley', 'Richard Burton, Lino Ventura, Lee Remick, Harry Andrews, Alan Badel, Marie-Christine Barrault, Jeremy Brett, Michael Hordern', null, 'A French detective in London reconstructs the life of a man lying in hospital with severe injuries with the help of journals and a psychiatrist. He realises that the man had powerful telekinetic abilities.', 'A French detective in London reconstructs the life of a man lying in hospital with severe injuries with the help of journals and a psychiatrist. He realises that the man had powerful telekinetic abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSJZA6hSwxv8O3d1DfyuN7wZ0Zi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11623'),
  ('276094436379468277', 'The Meek One', 1960, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Borisov, Dmitri Meskhiyev, Lev Makhtin', 'Aleksandr Borisov, Akiba Golburt', 'Iya Savvina, Andrei Popov, Vera Kuznetsova, Nikolai Kryukov, Pantelejmon Krymov, Sergey Polezhaev, Zinaida Dorogova, Georgiy Kurovskiy', null, 'Having married a poor girl, the moneylender tries to take out his anger for the injustices he has suffered in life on the helpless orphan, hoping that she will live meekly, constantly begging for his noble soul. However, Anna enters into an irreconcilable moral battle with her husband...', 'Having married a poor girl, the moneylender tries to take out his anger for the injustices he has suffered in life on the helpless orphan, hoping that she will live meekly, constantly begging for his noble soul. However, Anna enters into an irreconcilable moral battle with her husband...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KwhCdorJsTJRjiIWaXwmofXEsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277701'),
  ('633383541028352680', 'The Meerkats', 2008, 'Documentary, TV Movie, Family', 'James Honeyborne, Tony Miller, Barrie Britton', 'Alexander McCall Smith', 'Paul Newman, Rufus Beck, Guillaume Canet', null, 'A coming of age story following a young meerkat pup, Kolo, growing up in the Kalahari desert; and an inspiring look at how one family''s connection to each other and their surroundings is a model of resilience and fortitude for us all. Shot using ground-breaking techniques, this dramatised documentary is a one-of-a-kind presentation from The Weinstein Company and the BBC, featuring narration by Paul Newman.', 'A coming of age story following a young meerkat pup, Kolo, growing up in the Kalahari desert; and an inspiring look at how one family''s connection to each other and their surroundings is a model of resilience and fortitude for us all. Shot using ground-breaking techniques, this dramatised documentary is a one-of-a-kind presentation from The Weinstein Company and the BBC, featuring narration by Paul Newman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pi9WB2zAVruUryVhZhuXFZ4BpG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16971'),
  ('127990690023305791', 'The Meeting Place Cannot Be Changed', 1979, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Leonid Burlaka', 'Georgiy Vayner, Arkadiy Vayner', 'Vladimir Vysotsky, Vladimir Konkin, Sergei Yursky, Viktor Pavlov, Natalya Fateyeva, Leonid Kuravlyov, Svetlana Svetlichnaya, Aleksandr Belyavskiy', null, 'Summer of 1945. The salute of the Great Victory died down and the country is gradually returning to peaceful life. From "fire yes into the fire" a young reconnaissance commander Volodya Sharapov falls, having come to the MUR for distribution, to the department for combating banditry. In the city the Black Cat gang rages, terrifying Muscovites. Captain Gleb Zheglov enters the fray with the bandits, for whom Sharapov soon becomes his right hand.', 'Summer of 1945. The salute of the Great Victory died down and the country is gradually returning to peaceful life. From "fire yes into the fire" a young reconnaissance commander Volodya Sharapov falls, having come to the MUR for distribution, to the department for combating banditry. In the city the Black Cat gang rages, terrifying Muscovites. Captain Gleb Zheglov enters the fray with the bandits, for whom Sharapov soon becomes his right hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zQ9YplCntIrUrR2Hsq1i5vEPjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67467'),
  ('695871544843338316', 'The Meetings of Anna', 1978, 'Drama', 'Chantal Akerman, Jean Penzer, Romain Goupil', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Aurore Clément, Helmut Griem, Magali Noël, Hanns Zischler, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Lea Massari, Alain Berenboom, Françoise Bonnet', null, 'Detached filmmaker Anna Silver arrives in Germany to show her latest film; over the course of some days, she encounters a variety of new and old faces, some of whom make personal revelations to her to little affect.', 'Detached filmmaker Anna Silver arrives in Germany to show her latest film; over the course of some days, she encounters a variety of new and old faces, some of whom make personal revelations to her to little affect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftiGDxhxmmAQr3FHPBybWlikFQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93669'),
  ('241184696535863892', 'The Meg', 2018, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jon Turteltaub, Hamish McFarlane, Maxine Zhang', 'Erich Hoeber, Jon Hoeber, Dean Georgaris', 'Jason Statham, Li Bingbing, Rainn Wilson, Cliff Curtis, Ruby Rose, Jessica McNamee, Masi Oka, Winston Chao', 'PG-13', 'A deep sea submersible pilot revisits his past fears in the Mariana Trench, and accidentally unleashes the seventy foot ancestor of the Great White Shark believed to be extinct.', 'A deep sea submersible pilot revisits his past fears in the Mariana Trench, and accidentally unleashes the seventy foot ancestor of the Great White Shark believed to be extinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyWICPcxOuTcDDDbTMOZawoOn8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345940'),
  ('256908893891775046', 'The Mehta Boys', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Boman Irani, Anmol Ahuja, Krish Makhija', 'Boman Irani, Alexander Dinelaris', 'Avinash Tiwary, Boman Irani, Shreya Chaudhary, Puja Sarup, Harssh A. Singh, Siddhartha Basu, Flora Jacob, Shreyash Jadhav', 'PG-13', 'After the loss of his mother, Amay, a struggling young architect is forced to live for 48 hours with the one person he cannot stand, his father. It seems like a recipe for disaster. Wrong! It''s much worse. Will the young architect crumble or will this bumpy ride help him rebuild his relationship with his crabby old man?', 'After the loss of his mother, Amay, a struggling young architect is forced to live for 48 hours with the one person he cannot stand, his father. It seems like a recipe for disaster. Wrong! It''s much worse. Will the young architect crumble or will this bumpy ride help him rebuild his relationship with his crabby old man?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fDGHQLhauxRAzProug4AspfYwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262530'),
  ('211067319553277508', 'The Méliès Mystery', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Eric Lange', null, 'Leonard Maltin, Serge Bromberg, Costa-Gavras, Michel Gondry, Randy Haberkamp, Heather Linville, Laurent Mannoni, Georges Méliès', 'NR', 'A documentary that details the process of restoring 270 of the 520 lost films of pioneering director Georges Méliès, all orchestrated by a Franco-American collaboration between Lobster Films, the National Film Center, and the Library of Congress.', 'A documentary that details the process of restoring 270 of the 520 lost films of pioneering director Georges Méliès, all orchestrated by a Franco-American collaboration between Lobster Films, the National Film Center, and the Library of Congress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAZAeE6O1i8NQbVV1GmjHiZoK3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782165'),
