  ('475741268098641295', 'The Memory Game', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Reinier van Brummelen, Mark van Aller, Jaap Van Veen', 'Jan Verheyen, Lien Willaert', 'Anna Drijver, Gert Winckelmans, Maarten Heijmans, Vic de Wachter, Louis Talpe, Gilda De Bal, Martijn Hillenius, Ella Van Remortel', null, 'The body of Nathalie, who disappeared 25 years ago, is found on the Deridder family estate. The event reveals a long-hidden crime, and when secrets are brought forth, the present is overshadowed by the past.', 'The body of Nathalie, who disappeared 25 years ago, is found on the Deridder family estate. The event reveals a long-hidden crime, and when secrets are brought forth, the present is overshadowed by the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c59z3Hguyq2jpcEXNNsHDNBQb9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110820'),
  ('760245956197249204', 'The Memory Keeper''s Daughter', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Mick Jackson, Theo van de Sande', null, 'Emily Watson, Dermot Mulroney, Gretchen Mol, Krystal Hope Nausbaum, Rob Stewart, Hugh Thompson, Martha Irving, Mary-Colin Chisholm', 'PG', 'During a blizzard in 1964, Dr. David Henry delivers his son Paul with the help of nurse Caroline. But when Henry realizes his wife is also carrying a girl with Down syndrome, he hands the second child over to Caroline without his wife''s knowledge. Henry''s fateful decision yields grave consequences for his family over the next 20 years.', 'During a blizzard in 1964, Dr. David Henry delivers his son Paul with the help of nurse Caroline. But when Henry realizes his wife is also carrying a girl with Down syndrome, he hands the second child over to Caroline without his wife''s knowledge. Henry''s fateful decision yields grave consequences for his family over the next 20 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gq8nK7OnNjjrGq08jXVhIBsSTKW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14772'),
  ('501600965960109296', 'The Memory of a Killer', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Erik Van Looy', 'Erik Van Looy', 'Koen De Bouw, Werner De Smedt, Jan Decleir, Jo De Meyere, Filip Peeters, Hilde De Baerdemaeker, Geert Van Rampelberg, Tom van Dyck', 'R', 'Vincke and Verstuyft are one of the best detective teams of the Antwerp police force. When they are confronted with the disappearance of a top official and the murder of two prostitutes, the trail leads to the almost retired assassin Angelo Ledda. Since Ledda starts showing symptoms of Alzheimer''s, it''s getting more and more difficult to complete his contracts. When he has to murder a 12-year old call-girl, he refuses and becomes a target himself. While Vincke and Verstuyft are chasing him and counting the corpses, Ledda is taking care of his employers.', 'Vincke and Verstuyft are one of the best detective teams of the Antwerp police force. When they are confronted with the disappearance of a top official and the murder of two prostitutes, the trail leads to the almost retired assassin Angelo Ledda. Since Ledda starts showing symptoms of Alzheimer''s, it''s getting more and more difficult to complete his contracts. When he has to murder a 12-year old call-girl, he refuses and becomes a target himself. While Vincke and Verstuyft are chasing him and counting the corpses, Ledda is taking care of his employers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKFzSI5XtDOfXoULnY5TEaNpuMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24860'),
  ('484642243370092310', 'The Memory of Justice', 1976, 'Documentary, History', 'Marcel Ophüls, Mike Davis', 'Marcel Ophüls', 'Albert Speer, Karl Dönitz, Adolf Hitler, Hermann Göring, Herta Oberheuser, Noël Favrelière, Telford Taylor, Jacques Pâris de Bollardière', 'PG', 'This exceptional, disturbing, and thought-provoking two-part documentary compares the atrocities committed by the Nazis as revealed during the Nuremberg trials to those committed by the French in Algeria and those done by the Americans in Vietnam. The four-hour epic questions the right of any country to pass self-righteous moral judgements upon the actions of another country.', 'This exceptional, disturbing, and thought-provoking two-part documentary compares the atrocities committed by the Nazis as revealed during the Nuremberg trials to those committed by the French in Algeria and those done by the Americans in Vietnam. The four-hour epic questions the right of any country to pass self-righteous moral judgements upon the actions of another country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFlC9K4buNbUJZRkuDipe5NcCBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87041'),
  ('41953047068045941', 'The Memory of Water', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matías Bize, Arnaldo Rodríguez', 'Matías Bize, Julio Rojas', 'Benjamín Vicuña, Elena Anaya, Etienne Bobenrieth, Néstor Cantillana, Sergio Hernández, Silvia Marty, Antonia Zegers, Pablo Cerda', null, 'After the tragic loss of their 4-year-old son, Javier and Amanda struggle to make sense of their lives together.', 'After the tragic loss of their 4-year-old son, Javier and Amanda struggle to make sense of their lives together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N3Kqo661eHmZAZvBCNnffuGesY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278464'),
  ('652054389999746821', 'The Memphis Belle', 1944, 'Documentary, War', 'William Wyler, William H. Clothier, William Wyler', 'Lester Koenig, Jerome Chodorov, William Wyler', 'Vince Evans, Jacob L. Devers, Ira C. Eaker, Haywood Hansell, Robert J. Hanson, Eugene Kern, King George VI of the United Kingdom, Captain Charles B. Leighton', 'NR', 'This WW2 documentary centers on the crew of the American B-17 Flying Fortress Memphis Belle as it prepares to execute a strategic bombing raid on Nazi submarine pens in Wilhelmshaven, Germany.', 'This WW2 documentary centers on the crew of the American B-17 Flying Fortress Memphis Belle as it prepares to execute a strategic bombing raid on Nazi submarine pens in Wilhelmshaven, Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nB3fVpM6JumgiyeuL59Ht1FfzI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41355'),
  ('904856596297760909', 'The Men', 1950, 'Drama', 'Fred Zinnemann, Robert De Grasse, Dimitri Tiomkin', 'Carl Foreman', 'Marlon Brando, Teresa Wright, Everett Sloane, Jack Webb, Richard Erdman, Arthur Jurado, Virginia Farmer, Dorothy Tree', null, 'Ken, a WWII GI, returns home after he''s paralyzed in battle. Residing in the paraplegic ward of a veteran''s hospital and embittered by his condition, he refuses to see his fiancée and sinks into a solitary world of hatred and hostility. Head physician, Dr. Brock cajoles the withdrawn Ken into the life of the ward, where fellow patients Norm, Leo and Angel begin to pull him out of his spiritual dilemma.', 'Ken, a WWII GI, returns home after he''s paralyzed in battle. Residing in the paraplegic ward of a veteran''s hospital and embittered by his condition, he refuses to see his fiancée and sinks into a solitary world of hatred and hostility. Head physician, Dr. Brock cajoles the withdrawn Ken into the life of the ward, where fellow patients Norm, Leo and Angel begin to pull him out of his spiritual dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88hG50Z7EMxKdsKOBc5o2yOpPB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1882'),
  ('337720818623493309', 'The Men in the Family', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Raoul André', 'Jacques Dreux', 'Francis Blanche, Jean Poiret, Michel Serrault, Jean Yanne, Darry Cowl, Michel Galabru, Annie Cordy, Anne Carrère', null, 'Gabriel Pelletier, sales manager for a major industrial firm, would be the happiest of men if he didn''t have a family of rare originality. The day Gabriel Pelletier is asked by the firm''s management to welcome and accommodate an important American industrialist who has come to Paris to handle a major contract, he realizes the difficulties that lie ahead. How will Mr. Strumberger, who has the reputation of a fierce puritan, react to the behavior of the various members of the family?', 'Gabriel Pelletier, sales manager for a major industrial firm, would be the happiest of men if he didn''t have a family of rare originality. The day Gabriel Pelletier is asked by the firm''s management to welcome and accommodate an important American industrialist who has come to Paris to handle a major contract, he realizes the difficulties that lie ahead. How will Mr. Strumberger, who has the reputation of a fierce puritan, react to the behavior of the various members of the family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVWy7ET9SoJnLKEnZrWOftoZBGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85395'),
  ('939453559597119558', 'The Men of Sherwood Forest', 1954, 'Adventure, History', 'Val Guest, Walter J. Harvey, Jack Causey', 'Allan MacKinnon', 'Don Taylor, Reginald Beckwith, Eileen Moore, David King-Wood, Douglas Wilmer, Harold Lang, Ballard Berkeley, Patrick Holt', null, 'Robin Hood is persuaded by two nobles whom he believes to be loyal to King Richard to recover secret plans attaining to the rescue of the king from captivity in Germany. Though disguised as a troubadour, Robin is betrayed and captured. Lady Alys and the merry men help him escape in time to foil an intended ambush on King Richard as he returns from the Crusades.', 'Robin Hood is persuaded by two nobles whom he believes to be loyal to King Richard to recover secret plans attaining to the rescue of the king from captivity in Germany. Though disguised as a troubadour, Robin is betrayed and captured. Lady Alys and the merry men help him escape in time to foil an intended ambush on King Richard as he returns from the Crusades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv71hZeb835Pi9f6DA0NYHyuaYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123186'),
  ('1021242114871574866', 'The Men Who Made the Movies: Howard Hawks', 1973, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Richard Schickel, Erik Daarstad', 'Richard Schickel', 'Sydney Pollack, Howard Hawks, Marilyn Monroe, Lauren Bacall, Humphrey Bogart, Walter Brennan, Montgomery Clift, Cary Grant', null, 'A documentary filmography of Howard Hawks, including lengthy footage of Hawks himself discussing his films and many clips from his best-known pictures.', 'A documentary filmography of Howard Hawks, including lengthy footage of Hawks himself discussing his films and many clips from his best-known pictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWOFvfIHmEg6puVFo5kWRjl9gye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150392'),
