  ('984368986480061813', 'The Mental State', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'James Camali', 'James Camali, Jeremy Anderson, Joshua Barclay', 'Jance Enslin, Carly Pope, Alyssa Sutherland, Alison Thornton, Bryan Greenberg, William R. Moses, Michael Gladis, Jim True-Frost', 'NR', 'In the heart of rural Kentucky, a high school senior and his family struggle to cope with the true identity and intentions of a dangerous town shooter.', 'In the heart of rural Kentucky, a high school senior and his family struggle to cope with the true identity and intentions of a dangerous town shooter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6Hadim8IGfnveV2Fx2ZWwZqmjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685709'),
  ('320938393010484752', 'The Menu', 2022, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Mark Mylod, Peter Deming, Madelyn Wilkime', 'Seth Reiss, Will Tracy', 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Ralph Fiennes, Nicholas Hoult, Janet McTeer, Paul Adelstein, Rob Yang, Aimee Carrero, John Leguizamo', 'R', 'A young couple travels to a remote island to eat at an exclusive restaurant where the chef has prepared a lavish menu, with some shocking surprises.', 'A young couple travels to a remote island to eat at an exclusive restaurant where the chef has prepared a lavish menu, with some shocking surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPtUgMcLIboqlTlPrq0bQpKK8eq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593643'),
  ('474692188462576943', 'The Mephisto Waltz', 1971, 'Horror', 'Paul Wendkos, William W. Spencer, David Hall', 'Ben Maddow', 'Alan Alda, Jacqueline Bisset, Barbara Parkins, Bradford Dillman, William Windom, Curd Jürgens, Kathleen Widdoes, Pamelyn Ferdin', 'R', 'A frustrated pianist himself, music journalist Myles Clarkson is thrilled to interview virtuoso Duncan Ely. Duncan, however, is terminally ill and not much interested in Myles until noticing that Myles'' hands are ideally suited for piano. Suddenly, he can''t get enough of his new friend, and Myles'' wife, Paula, becomes suspicious of Duncan''s intentions. Her suspicions grow when Duncan dies and Myles mysteriously becomes a virtuoso overnight.', 'A frustrated pianist himself, music journalist Myles Clarkson is thrilled to interview virtuoso Duncan Ely. Duncan, however, is terminally ill and not much interested in Myles until noticing that Myles'' hands are ideally suited for piano. Suddenly, he can''t get enough of his new friend, and Myles'' wife, Paula, becomes suspicious of Duncan''s intentions. Her suspicions grow when Duncan dies and Myles mysteriously becomes a virtuoso overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2zyPibxcUtvcL9Fxxsh1RRkW49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40158'),
  ('185325795648842252', 'The Mercenary', 1968, 'Western', 'Sergio Corbucci, Filiberto Fiaschi, Ricardo Huertas', 'Sergio Spina, Adriano Bolzoni, Sergio Corbucci', 'Franco Nero, Tony Musante, Jack Palance, Giovanna Ralli, Franco Giacobini, Eduardo Fajardo, Franco Ressel, Álvaro de Luna', null, 'While a Mexican revolutionary lies low as a U.S. rodeo clown, the cynical Polish mercenary who tutored the idealistic peasant tells how he and a dedicated female radical fought for the soul of the guerrilla general Paco, as Mexicans threw off repressive government and all-powerful landowners in the 1910s. Tracked by the vengeful Curly, Paco liberates villages, but is tempted by social banditry''s treasures, which Kowalski revels in.', 'While a Mexican revolutionary lies low as a U.S. rodeo clown, the cynical Polish mercenary who tutored the idealistic peasant tells how he and a dedicated female radical fought for the soul of the guerrilla general Paco, as Mexicans threw off repressive government and all-powerful landowners in the 1910s. Tracked by the vengeful Curly, Paco liberates villages, but is tempted by social banditry''s treasures, which Kowalski revels in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIRRNEpkZg41syNBw0phpQfXa3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48169'),
  ('481862099572452773', 'The Mercenary', 2020, 'Action', 'Casey McBeath, Jesse V. Johnson', 'David Filmore', 'Dominique Vandenberg, Louis Mandylor, Carmen Argenziano, Manny Alva, Brad Ashten, Robb Zbacnik, Jeremiah B. McQueen, Geordie Robinson', null, 'When a mission in South America goes wrong a mercenary is left for dead, but he is nursed back to health and reborn with a new outlook on life. But his peaceful days are short-lived when mercenaries he used to work with cross his path again and he is forced to revisit and face his own demons.', 'When a mission in South America goes wrong a mercenary is left for dead, but he is nursed back to health and reborn with a new outlook on life. But his peaceful days are short-lived when mercenaries he used to work with cross his path again and he is forced to revisit and face his own demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dgJiDjsRmlHk6prxXmBbFZOcLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660521'),
  ('998669976186338096', 'The Merchant of Four Seasons', 1972, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Dietrich Lohmann, Harry Baer', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Hans Hirschmüller, Irm Hermann, Hanna Schygulla, Andrea Schober, Karl Scheydt, Klaus Löwitsch, Gusti Kreissl, Ingrid Caven', null, 'Hans is a street fruit peddler and born loser. His choice of career upsets his bourgeois family, causing him to turn to drinking and violence. After recovering from a debilitating heart attack, his business finally begins to take off. However, the more he becomes a credit to his family, the more depressed he becomes.', 'Hans is a street fruit peddler and born loser. His choice of career upsets his bourgeois family, causing him to turn to drinking and violence. After recovering from a debilitating heart attack, his business finally begins to take off. However, the more he becomes a credit to his family, the more depressed he becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SoPBvDdx3WoG1t86XHWyfV6JQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10309'),
  ('836649409150171631', 'The Merchant of Venice', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Radford, Benoît Delhomme, Sharon Howard-Field', 'Michael Radford', 'Al Pacino, Jeremy Irons, Joseph Fiennes, Lynn Collins, Zuleikha Robinson, Kris Marshall, Charlie Cox, Heather Goldenhersh', 'R', 'Venice, 1596. Bassanio begs his friend Antonio, a prosperous merchant, to lend him a large sum of money so that he can woo Portia, a very wealthy heiress; but Antonio has invested his fortune abroad, so they turn to Shylock, a Jewish moneylender, and ask him for a loan.', 'Venice, 1596. Bassanio begs his friend Antonio, a prosperous merchant, to lend him a large sum of money so that he can woo Portia, a very wealthy heiress; but Antonio has invested his fortune abroad, so they turn to Shylock, a Jewish moneylender, and ask him for a loan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvpPg5oTD1qT7hjY3BOsoniYdHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11162'),
  ('140579614561715160', 'The Merciless', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Cho Hyoung-rae, Park Cheong-woo', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Kim Min-su', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Yim Si-wan, Kim Hie-won, Jeon Hye-jin, Lee Kyung-young, Moon Ji-yoon, Jang In-sub, Kim Ji-hoon', null, 'Jae-ho, who aims to become the number one in a crime organization, gets to build up trust with Hyun-su, an ambitious newbie in the prison. While they try to take over the organization after the prison release, their ulterior motives starts to emerge.', 'Jae-ho, who aims to become the number one in a crime organization, gets to build up trust with Hyun-su, an ambitious newbie in the prison. While they try to take over the organization after the prison release, their ulterior motives starts to emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMNGy8kfySmmNDHw3X4puqPIbx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451997'),
  ('551782616550362576', 'The Mercy', 2018, 'Drama, Adventure', 'James Marsh, Éric Gautier, Deborah Saban', 'Scott Z. Burns', 'Colin Firth, Rachel Weisz, David Thewlis, Mark Gatiss, Genevieve Gaunt, Jonathan Bailey, Andrew Buchan, Simon McBurney', 'PG-13', 'In 1968, Donald Crowhurst, an amateur sailor, endangers the fate of his family and business, and his own life, blinded by his ambition to compete in the Sunday Times Golden Globe Race, attempting to become the first person in history to single-handedly circumnavigate the world without making any stopover.', 'In 1968, Donald Crowhurst, an amateur sailor, endangers the fate of his family and business, and his own life, blinded by his ambition to compete in the Sunday Times Golden Globe Race, attempting to become the first person in history to single-handedly circumnavigate the world without making any stopover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51qWwl16Mb0hqorgffCtyENwTPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414001'),
  ('931418592134763938', 'The Mercy of the Jungle', 2019, 'War, Drama', 'Joachim Philippe, Joel Karekezi, Kantarama Gahigiri', 'Joel Karekezi, Casey Schroen', 'Marc Zinga, Stéphane Bak, Ibrahim Ahmed, Abby Mukiibi Nkaaga, Michael Wawuyo Jr., Kantarama Gahigiri, Mathew Nabwiso, Michael Wawuyo', null, 'The Mercy of the Jungle is a road movie that deals with wars in Congo through the eyes of two lost soldiers in the jungle by showcasing their struggle, weakness and hope.', 'The Mercy of the Jungle is a road movie that deals with wars in Congo through the eyes of two lost soldiers in the jungle by showcasing their struggle, weakness and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uulrHScxepJ6WSBJLmerw2YjdUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515348'),
  ('355399450305188622', 'The Mermaid', 1904, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician conjures up a mermaid while fishing.', 'A magician conjures up a mermaid while fishing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ephwcaKv583rxK7HQGej1moEKl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44328'),
  ('374090465069332828', 'The Mermaid', 2016, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Stephen Chow, Choi Sung-Fai, Ku Huen-Chiu', 'Stephen Chow, Kelvin Lee Si-Zhen, Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang', 'Lin Yun, Deng Chao, Zhang Yuqi, Show Lo, Tsui Hark, Wen Zhang, Kris Wu, Lee Sheung-Ching', 'R', 'When Xuan''s real estate project threatens the home of mermaids, Shan is sent to stop him. When they fall in love, he is encouraged to cancel the project. However, he must save them from bigger danger.', 'When Xuan''s real estate project threatens the home of mermaids, Shan is sent to stop him. When they fall in love, he is encouraged to cancel the project. However, he must save them from bigger danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YVB8VxQqx3J1FtOVvoHybBKNPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381890'),
  ('1056105618476538199', 'The Mermaid: Lake of the Dead', 2018, 'Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Anton Zenkovich', 'Nataliya Dubovaya, Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Ivan Kapitonov', 'Victoria Agalakova, Efim Petrunin, Nikita Elenev, Cécile Pleuge, Sofya Shidlovskaya, Igor Khripunov, Dariya Yartseva, Dmitry Yartsev', null, 'An evil Mermaid falls in love with Marina''s fiancé Roman and aims to keep him away from Marina in her Kingdom of Death under water. The Mermaid is a young woman who drowned a few centuries ago. Marina only has one week to overcome her fear of the dark water, to remain human in the deathly fight with the monsters and not to become one herself.', 'An evil Mermaid falls in love with Marina''s fiancé Roman and aims to keep him away from Marina in her Kingdom of Death under water. The Mermaid is a young woman who drowned a few centuries ago. Marina only has one week to overcome her fear of the dark water, to remain human in the deathly fight with the monsters and not to become one herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGFZ84plg0TPM737j8ccpseh96l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516850'),
  ('277887668060950259', 'The Merry Dwarfs', 1929, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, 'NR', 'A village of dwarfs dance and play through their day. A blacksmith shoes a centipede, a street-cleaner sweeps, a marching-band strikes up and the townsmen roll out beer barrels.', 'A village of dwarfs dance and play through their day. A blacksmith shoes a centipede, a street-cleaner sweeps, a marching-band strikes up and the townsmen roll out beer barrels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kn3pGbWKYg2z018CIfEhfaVoLrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68408'),
  ('128280582554683989', 'The Merry Frolics of Satan', 1906, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Two travellers are tormented by Satan from inn to inn and eventually experience a buggy ride through the heavens courtesy of the Devil before he takes one of them down to Hell and roasts him on a spit.', 'Two travellers are tormented by Satan from inn to inn and eventually experience a buggy ride through the heavens courtesy of the Devil before he takes one of them down to Hell and roasts him on a spit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9849q4qp8wHWrhxQ3SUSOPmiluh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137757'),
  ('268451669253854699', 'The Merry Gentleman', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael Keaton, Chris Seager', 'Ron Lazzeretti', 'Michael Keaton, Kelly Macdonald, Tom Bastounes, Mike Bradecich, Debbi Burns, Maritza Cabrera, Bobby Cannavale, Esther Claire', null, 'A woman who leaves an abusive relationship to begin a new life in a new city, where she forms an unlikely and ironic relationship with a suicidal hit man (unbeknownst to her). Enter a worn, alcoholic detective to form the third party in a very unusual triangle as this story begins to unfold.', 'A woman who leaves an abusive relationship to begin a new life in a new city, where she forms an unlikely and ironic relationship with a suicidal hit man (unbeknownst to her). Enter a worn, alcoholic detective to form the third party in a very unusual triangle as this story begins to unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN5nQC6vdxb17WRvgcpN7KsL3IG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24053'),
  ('510441972732550725', 'The Merry Gentlemen', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Peter Sullivan, Lars Lindstrom, Jeff Robinson', 'Marla Sokoloff', 'Britt Robertson, Chad Michael Murray, Marla Sokoloff, Marc Anthony Samuel, Maxwell Caulfield, Colt Prattes, Hector David Jr., Michael Gross', 'PG', 'To save her parents'' small-town nightclub, a Broadway dancer stages an all-male, Christmas-themed revue — and meets a guy with all the right moves.', 'To save her parents'' small-town nightclub, a Broadway dancer stages an all-male, Christmas-themed revue — and meets a guy with all the right moves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4t80WORFWqDYf4BRwV2jrXNHJdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290486'),
  ('1059159328377999350', 'The Merry Jail', 1917, 'Comedy', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Ernst Lubitsch', 'Harry Liedtke, Emil Jannings, Paul Biensfeldt, Erich Schönfelder, Käthe Dorsch, Kitty Dewall, Agda Nilsson, Ossi Oswalda', null, 'A neglected wife disguises herself in order to lure her wastrel husband into a compromising position.', 'A neglected wife disguises herself in order to lure her wastrel husband into a compromising position.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mG1B5KKTP0rwqOqFIPYNfjDVqoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48214'),
  ('1046435690954532079', 'The Merry Old Soul', 1933, 'Animation', 'William Nolan, Walter Lantz', null, null, 'NR', 'Oswald the Rabbit gathers some of the greatest entertainers of the age to cure Old King Cole of the blues.', 'Oswald the Rabbit gathers some of the greatest entertainers of the age to cure Old King Cole of the blues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyDM1qTm1RKPYACAoXS3T7jYSPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87951'),
  ('108510346193906808', 'The Merry Old Soul', 1935, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Bernice Hansen', null, 'Old King Cole marries the Woman in the Shoe. As soon as they get home, the babies show up from every drawer and closet, much to the king''s chagrin.', 'Old King Cole marries the Woman in the Shoe. As soon as they get home, the babies show up from every drawer and closet, much to the king''s chagrin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWhjKxoJG6nXrJRrlPA4lFOlEke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184629'),
  ('252515642282926347', 'The Merry Widow', 1926, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erich von Stroheim, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Erich von Stroheim', 'Mae Murray, John Gilbert, Roy D''Arcy, Josephine Crowell, George Fawcett, Tully Marshall, Edward Connelly, Joan Crawford', 'NR', 'Prince Danilo falls in love with dancer Sally O''Hara. However, his uncle, King Nikita I of Monteblanco, forbids the marriage due to her being a commoner. Thinking she''s been jilted by her prince, Sally marries lecherous old Baron Sadoja, whose wealth has kept the kingdom afloat. When he suddenly dies, Sally must be wooed all over again by Danilo.', 'Prince Danilo falls in love with dancer Sally O''Hara. However, his uncle, King Nikita I of Monteblanco, forbids the marriage due to her being a commoner. Thinking she''s been jilted by her prince, Sally marries lecherous old Baron Sadoja, whose wealth has kept the kingdom afloat. When he suddenly dies, Sally must be wooed all over again by Danilo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cicZpacvh3MINqNorntTl8xdOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53230'),
  ('1073740372157411100', 'The Merry Widow', 1934, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Oliver T. Marsh, Joseph M. Newman', 'Ernest Vajda, Samson Raphaelson', 'Maurice Chevalier, Jeanette MacDonald, Edward Everett Horton, Una Merkel, George Barbier, Minna Gombell, Ruth Channing, Sterling Holloway', 'NR', 'A prince from a small kingdom courts a wealthy widow to keep her money in the country.', 'A prince from a small kingdom courts a wealthy widow to keep her money in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjrHjvP5PGxGLmba2Gu6SVPh59I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43689'),
  ('338842426964535040', 'The Merry Widow', 1952, 'Drama, Music', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Robert Surtees, Jay Blackton', 'Viktor Léon, Leo Stein', 'Lana Turner, Fernando Lamas, Una Merkel, Richard Haydn, Thomas Gomez, John Abbott, Marcel Dalio, King Donovan', 'NR', 'Marshovia, a small European kingdom, is on the brink of bankruptcy but the country may be saved if the wealthy American Crystal Radek, widow of a Marshovian, can be convinced to part with her money and marry the king''s nephew count Danilo. Arriving to Marshovia on a visit, Crystal Radek change places with her secretary Kitty. Following them to Paris, Danilo has a hard time wooing the widow after meeting an attractive young woman at a nightclub, the same Crystal Radek who presents herself as Fifi the chorus girl. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'Marshovia, a small European kingdom, is on the brink of bankruptcy but the country may be saved if the wealthy American Crystal Radek, widow of a Marshovian, can be convinced to part with her money and marry the king''s nephew count Danilo. Arriving to Marshovia on a visit, Crystal Radek change places with her secretary Kitty. Following them to Paris, Danilo has a hard time wooing the widow after meeting an attractive young woman at a nightclub, the same Crystal Radek who presents herself as Fifi the chorus girl. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Uu7F30ZnQVY6f6JuotYLjFhyPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185197'),
  ('274513751403181389', 'The Merry Widow', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Isabelle Mergault, Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty', 'Isabelle Mergault', 'Michèle Laroque, Jacques Gamblin, Wladimir Yordanoff, Tom Morton, Valérie Mairesse, Claire Nadeau, Éva Darlan, Paul Crauchet', null, 'Anne-Marie lives an easy life with Gilbert, a rich plastic surgeon: a beautiful house, a doggy, a cleaning lady, expensive furniture, the lot. Not so easy in fact when she thinks twice. She does not get on with her husband any longer. She gets on his nerves and he does not attract her any longer. She feels good only when she jogs on the beach and ... when she is the arms of her lover, Leo. One day, Gilbert gets killed in a car accident. Good news, since she will be able to live with Leo. The trouble is her well-meaning family settle at her villa with a view to supporting the "poor widow" morally. Anne-Marie just cannot admit she is not distressed at all, especially to her son Christophe. She is now even more of a prisoner than when Gilbert was alive...', 'Anne-Marie lives an easy life with Gilbert, a rich plastic surgeon: a beautiful house, a doggy, a cleaning lady, expensive furniture, the lot. Not so easy in fact when she thinks twice. She does not get on with her husband any longer. She gets on his nerves and he does not attract her any longer. She feels good only when she jogs on the beach and ... when she is the arms of her lover, Leo. One day, Gilbert gets killed in a car accident. Good news, since she will be able to live with Leo. The trouble is her well-meaning family settle at her villa with a view to supporting the "poor widow" morally. Anne-Marie just cannot admit she is not distressed at all, especially to her son Christophe. She is now even more of a prisoner than when Gilbert was alive...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1CtwEsCDdeyqp50fwq7CS3REm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13710'),
  ('1135282438951921690', 'The Merry World of Leopold Z', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Gilles Carle, Jean-Claude Labrecque, Bernard Gosselin', 'Gilles Carle', 'Guy L''Écuyer, Paul Hébert, Jacques Poulin, Monique Joly, Suzanne Valéry, Gilles Latulippe, Bernard Assiniwi, Albert Millaire', null, 'A worker, called in a hurry to remove the snow in the city street, try to buy his remaining gifts in the tumult of Christmas eve without quitting his work.', 'A worker, called in a hurry to remove the snow in the city street, try to buy his remaining gifts in the tumult of Christmas eve without quitting his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcTSMDIOUGFwYO1Vu8p41NrnFGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264218'),
  ('973860664550174601', 'The Message', 1976, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, History', 'Moustapha Akkad', 'Tawfiq Al-Hakim, H.A.L. Craig, Mohammad Ali Maher', 'Anthony Quinn, Irene Papas, Michael Ansara, Johnny Sekka, Michael Forest, Garrick Hagon, Nicholas Amer, Damien Thomas', 'PG', 'In sixth-century Mecca, Prophet Muhammad receives his first revelation from God as a messenger. Three years later, he''s not alone in his quest and publicly declares his prophecy. Muhammad is fought by Abu Sufian and his wife Hind, rulers of Mecca. Muhammad''s followers are hunted and tortured but he continues his calling.', 'In sixth-century Mecca, Prophet Muhammad receives his first revelation from God as a messenger. Three years later, he''s not alone in his quest and publicly declares his prophecy. Muhammad is fought by Abu Sufian and his wife Hind, rulers of Mecca. Muhammad''s followers are hunted and tortured but he continues his calling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVCBMg4ZuLPnWhIWJHD9IP4nIuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26842'),
  ('418641135592233783', 'The Message', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jake Pollock, Chen Kuofu, Gao Qunshu', 'Chen Kuofu', 'Zhou Xun, Zhang Hanyu, Li Bingbing, Huang Xiaoming, Wang Zhiwen, Alec Su, Ying Da, Shi Zhaoqi', null, 'After a series of assassinations in Nanking, a Japanese spy master gathers a group of suspects in a mansion, then a tense cat-and-mouse game erupts as the Chinese agent tries to keep his or her identity a secret.', 'After a series of assassinations in Nanking, a Japanese spy master gathers a group of suspects in a mansion, then a tense cat-and-mouse game erupts as the Chinese agent tries to keep his or her identity a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HKxRzAiIz3pHdKMO3gawagT2TZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32582'),
  ('582573067317586722', 'The Messenger', 2008, 'Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Çağan Irmak, Irmak Çığ, Mirsad Herović', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çetin Tekindor, Hümeyra, Şerif Sezer, Yetkin Dikinciler, Kaya Akkaya, Melis Birkan, Feride Çetin, Şener Kökkaya', null, 'In a place where there is no time, a traveler comes to an unnamed village where we do not know where on the map. The weary traveler is a messenger. They have stories to tell, words to say.', 'In a place where there is no time, a traveler comes to an unnamed village where we do not know where on the map. The weary traveler is a messenger. They have stories to tell, words to say.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ce3lsHK1wTS6kSsUlsR3UiQD5v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52147'),
  ('6562635977851201', 'The Messenger', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Oren Moverman, Bobby Bukowski', 'Alessandro Camon, Oren Moverman', 'Ben Foster, Woody Harrelson, Jena Malone, Eamonn Walker, Samantha Morton, Steve Buscemi, Dale Soules, Stevie Ray Dallimore', 'R', 'Will Montgomery, a U.S. Army Staff Sergeant who has returned home from Iraq, is assigned to the Army’s Casualty Notification service. Montgomery is partnered with Captain Tony Stone, to give notice to the families of fallen soldiers. The Sergeant is drawn to Olivia Pitterson, to whom he has delivered news of her husband’s death.', 'Will Montgomery, a U.S. Army Staff Sergeant who has returned home from Iraq, is assigned to the Army’s Casualty Notification service. Montgomery is partnered with Captain Tony Stone, to give notice to the families of fallen soldiers. The Sergeant is drawn to Olivia Pitterson, to whom he has delivered news of her husband’s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4fJyH7mMbasiFYwiw2nE7D6pMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28089'),
  ('98156533065121595', 'The Messenger: The Story of Joan of Arc', 1999, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, History, War', 'Thierry Arbogast, Luc Besson', 'Andrew Birkin', 'Milla Jovovich, John Malkovich, Faye Dunaway, Dustin Hoffman, Pascal Greggory, Vincent Cassel, Tchéky Karyo, Richard Ridings', 'R', 'In 1429, a French teenager stood before her King with a message she claimed came from God; that she would defeat the world''s greatest army and liberate her country from its political and religious turmoil. As she reclaims God''s diminished kingdom, this courageous young woman has various amazing victories until her violent and untimely death.', 'In 1429, a French teenager stood before her King with a message she claimed came from God; that she would defeat the world''s greatest army and liberate her country from its political and religious turmoil. As she reclaims God''s diminished kingdom, this courageous young woman has various amazing victories until her violent and untimely death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFzOGA2LPdOfQyhEiY74uDf2WKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10047'),
  ('936021589863442368', 'The Messengers', 2007, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Danny Pang Phat, Oxide Pang Chun, David Geddes', 'Mark Wheaton', 'Kristen Stewart, Dylan McDermott, Penelope Ann Miller, John Corbett, Dustin Milligan, William B. Davis, Evan Turner, Theodore Turner', 'PG-13', 'When the Solomons trade in the craziness of big-city life for the quiet of a North Dakota farm, little do they expect the nightmare that follows. Soon after arriving, teenage Jess and her younger brother see terrifying apparitions and endure attacks from a supernatural source. Jess must warn her disbelieving family before it is too late to save them.', 'When the Solomons trade in the craziness of big-city life for the quiet of a North Dakota farm, little do they expect the nightmare that follows. Soon after arriving, teenage Jess and her younger brother see terrifying apparitions and endure attacks from a supernatural source. Jess must warn her disbelieving family before it is too late to save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ituR560dbnV4WAFPY0jJlEenGiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9966'),
  ('415858316127480624', 'The Messiah', 1975, 'History, Drama', 'Roberto Rossellini, Mario Montuori, Mark Lombardo', 'Roberto Rossellini, Silvia D''Amico Bendicò', 'Pier Maria Rossi, Mita Ungaro, Carlos de Carvalho, Fausto Di Bella, Vernon Dobtcheff, Antonella Fasano, Jean Martin, Toni Ucci', null, 'Rossellini takes numerous liberties with the original source material, rearranging and omitting events at will, presenting everything in a highly undramatic fashion. The film begins in the time of the Old Testament, allowing Rossellini to present the story of Jesus in its ancient, historic context.', 'Rossellini takes numerous liberties with the original source material, rearranging and omitting events at will, presenting everything in a highly undramatic fashion. The film begins in the time of the Old Testament, allowing Rossellini to present the story of Jesus in its ancient, historic context.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMaTs0SHEn5rFn2VLaQTQysO55t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8430'),
  ('1051585198343774748', 'The Metamorphosis of Birds', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Catarina Vasconcelos, Paulo Menezes, Mariana Veloso', 'Catarina Vasconcelos', 'Manuel Rosa, João Móra, Ana Vasconcelos, Henrique Vasconcelos, Inês Campos, José Manuel Mendes, João Pedro Mamede, Cláudia Varejão', null, 'Filmmaker Catarina Vasconcelos sifts through the memories of her ancestors. Her naval officer grandfather, Henrique, who married her grandmother, Beatriz, on her 21st birthday, spent extended periods at sea, leaving her with six children. This is the beginning of a generational saga.', 'Filmmaker Catarina Vasconcelos sifts through the memories of her ancestors. Her naval officer grandfather, Henrique, who married her grandmother, Beatriz, on her 21st birthday, spent extended periods at sea, leaving her with six children. This is the beginning of a generational saga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsXOh2SG9yMb8i5zwCBVqByYJPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664576'),
  ('225874263718807070', 'The Metamorphosis of Mr. Samsa', 1978, 'Animation', 'Caroline Leaf', 'Caroline Leaf', null, null, 'An animated adaptation of Franz Kafka’s acclaimed novella, “The Metamorphosis,” made from carving images into sand with glass.', 'An animated adaptation of Franz Kafka’s acclaimed novella, “The Metamorphosis,” made from carving images into sand with glass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWrL3IeQemyah3o7MbRfhXJdYOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224382'),
  ('449843213727008886', 'The Meteor Man', 1993, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'John A. Alonzo, Robert Townsend', 'Robert Townsend', 'Robert Townsend, Marla Gibbs, Eddie Griffin, Robert Guillaume, James Earl Jones, Roy Fegan, Don Cheadle, Sinbad', 'PG', 'One night Jefferson Reed gets hit in the chest by a souped-up chunk of meteor. So he can fly, but he''s scared of heights. He can master the information in any book ... for about thirty seconds. Now his friends and family want him to protect their community from the dreaded Golden Lords.', 'One night Jefferson Reed gets hit in the chest by a souped-up chunk of meteor. So he can fly, but he''s scared of heights. He can master the information in any book ... for about thirty seconds. Now his friends and family want him to protect their community from the dreaded Golden Lords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d30mZVOrY8n5KCvwaPkiQEFv1tc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11244'),
  ('737964761105996119', 'The Method', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Alfredo Mayo', 'Jordi Galcerán, Mateo Gil, Marcelo Piñeyro', 'Eduardo Noriega, Najwa Nimri, Eduard Fernández, Pablo Echarri, Ernesto Alterio, Natalia Verbeke, Adriana Ozores, Carmelo Gómez', null, 'Seven candidates to a high executive position on a multinational company show up for a selection test in a skyscraper at the financial district. Among them, the most disparate personalities: the winner, the aggressive, the insecure, the critic, the indecisive…', 'Seven candidates to a high executive position on a multinational company show up for a selection test in a skyscraper at the financial district. Among them, the most disparate personalities: the winner, the aggressive, the insecure, the critic, the indecisive…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rucoX7xqDizjvUsBfJ0PGD1re3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21043'),
  ('511812127767015870', 'The Mexican', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Gore Verbinski, Dariusz Wolski, Denise Chamian', 'J. H. Wyman', 'Brad Pitt, Julia Roberts, James Gandolfini, J.K. Simmons, David Krumholtz, Bob Balaban, Gene Hackman, Michael Cerveris', 'R', 'Jerry Welbach, a reluctant bagman, has been given two ultimatums: The first is from his mob boss to travel to Mexico and retrieve a priceless antique pistol, known as "the Mexican"... or suffer the consequences. The second is from his girlfriend Samantha to end his association with the mob. Jerry figures alive and in trouble with Samantha is better than the more permanent alternative, so he heads south of the border.', 'Jerry Welbach, a reluctant bagman, has been given two ultimatums: The first is from his mob boss to travel to Mexico and retrieve a priceless antique pistol, known as "the Mexican"... or suffer the consequences. The second is from his girlfriend Samantha to end his association with the mob. Jerry figures alive and in trouble with Samantha is better than the more permanent alternative, so he heads south of the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GqF6rVjUW6CVTuj7w1A2JE49AF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6073'),
  ('1031580827781711619', 'The Mexican Suitcase', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Trisha Ziff', 'Trisha Ziff', 'Ernest Alós, Juan Diego Botto, Antonio de la Fuente Ferraz, Gerda Taro', null, 'The story of the recovery of the negatives of thousands of photos taken by three photographers during the Spanish Civil War that were found seventy years later in a suitcase, inside a closet in Mexico City.', 'The story of the recovery of the negatives of thousands of photos taken by three photographers during the Spanish Civil War that were found seventy years later in a suitcase, inside a closet in Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHA3cRw1mxPmKCdC9mAxD2sC1cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80118'),
