  ('7263819021254199', 'The Miami Story', 1954, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fred F. Sears, Henry Freulich, Charles S. Gould', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Barry Sullivan, Luther Adler, John Baer, Adele Jergens, Beverly Garland, Dan Riss, Damian O''Flynn, Chris Alcaide', null, 'Fed up with the raising crime in Miami, the police chief and the leading members of the city council hire a former Miami gangster, gone straight, to help eliminate the biggest crime syndicate in the city.', 'Fed up with the raising crime in Miami, the police chief and the leading members of the city council hire a former Miami gangster, gone straight, to help eliminate the biggest crime syndicate in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azFkuF28WAlfsrCmuz1PbNhEL9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72823'),
  ('1069588293555667106', 'The Microchip', 2011, 'Comedy, Action', 'Krissanapong Rachata', 'Krissanapong Rachata', 'Akarin Akaranitimaytharatt, Akom Preedakul, Anake Inthajun, Andrew Scott Dixon, Simon Kook, Yaow Lookyee, Padung Songsang, Anuwat Tharapan', null, 'A group of friends have misplaced an important microchip that apparently holds top-secret information. They set off on a quest to find it.', 'A group of friends have misplaced an important microchip that apparently holds top-secret information. They set off on a quest to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xp8QFNtahsVC0QRSpVkJeAT9mwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65303'),
  ('1099949455854901316', 'The Microscopic Dancer', 1902, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, '“This is an absolutely new and extraordinary subject. A juggler takes in succession about a dozen eggs out of his servant''s mouth. He breaks all the eggs into a hat, and after having beaten them up after the manner of a cook, he extracts an egg as large as the hat itself. As soon as he sets this egg on the table there appears a tiny dancing girl, full of life, as big as a baby''s doll, and who performs on the table some beautiful stage dances. All of a sudden she increases to the size of a ordinary woman, and jumping on the floor she delights the audience with her turns. The juggler and the dancing girl disappear in the most extraordinary way.” (Méliès Catalog)', '“This is an absolutely new and extraordinary subject. A juggler takes in succession about a dozen eggs out of his servant''s mouth. He breaks all the eggs into a hat, and after having beaten them up after the manner of a cook, he extracts an egg as large as the hat itself. As soon as he sets this egg on the table there appears a tiny dancing girl, full of life, as big as a baby''s doll, and who performs on the table some beautiful stage dances. All of a sudden she increases to the size of a ordinary woman, and jumping on the floor she delights the audience with her turns. The juggler and the dancing girl disappear in the most extraordinary way.” (Méliès Catalog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lC4Tib7qKpDnMmF35kEfLpgJ1X2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108269'),
  ('340669474321644736', 'The Middle Man', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Christian Rosenlund, Bent Hamer', 'Bent Hamer', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Tuva Novotny, Nina Andresen Borud, Aksel Hennie, Trond Fausa Aurvåg, Kenneth Welsh, Nicolas Bro, Don McKellar', null, 'Frank Farrelli takes on the job as a middle man in the God-forsaken town of Karmack, USA, a community in a depression so deep that they need a middle man to professionally communicate more of the bad news.', 'Frank Farrelli takes on the job as a middle man in the God-forsaken town of Karmack, USA, a community in a depression so deep that they need a middle man to professionally communicate more of the bad news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lQb8Vy1mRUIfb0SdoZlvb6i8Nf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646376'),
  ('698671509498275490', 'The Middle of the World', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alain Tanner, Renato Berta', 'John Berger, Alain Tanner', 'Olimpia Carlisi, Philippe Léotard, Juliet Berto, Denise Péron, Jacques Denis, Roger Jendly, Gilbert Bahon, Lise Lachenal', null, 'Paul is married, a successful engineer, and a conservative candidate in an upcoming local election. He falls in love with Adriana, a café waitress from Italy. Paul''s party is very critical of foreign labour and wants to keep Switzerland to the Swiss. Where Paul falls deeper and deeper into the relationship and is ready to leave his wife, Adriana feels the social pressure growing and has to make her own decision.', 'Paul is married, a successful engineer, and a conservative candidate in an upcoming local election. He falls in love with Adriana, a café waitress from Italy. Paul''s party is very critical of foreign labour and wants to keep Switzerland to the Swiss. Where Paul falls deeper and deeper into the relationship and is ready to leave his wife, Adriana feels the social pressure growing and has to make her own decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxWkYJ5AuoN4EgRhpkUxP0xRgm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116595'),
  ('55252206355083718', 'The Middle of the World', 2003, 'Drama', 'Vicente Amorim, Gustavo Hadba', 'David França Mendes', 'Cláudia Abreu, Wagner Moura, Ravi Ramos Lacerda, Carol Castro, Caco Monteiro, Sidney Magal, Fábio Lago, Claudio Jaborandy', null, 'Romão, illiterate and unemployed, feels destiny drawing him on an odyssey to Rio de Janeiro in pursuit of a job and a decent life. A family of seven journeys 2,000 miles across the hinterlands of Brazil on bicycles. Along the way, the story explores the inner dynamics of a family facing a great challenge with the courage to pursue dreams.', 'Romão, illiterate and unemployed, feels destiny drawing him on an odyssey to Rio de Janeiro in pursuit of a job and a decent life. A family of seven journeys 2,000 miles across the hinterlands of Brazil on bicycles. Along the way, the story explores the inner dynamics of a family facing a great challenge with the courage to pursue dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8yJOq6yWWc1ACIgdOwRjAsLDQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47089'),
  ('221116834547223804', 'The Middleman', 1976, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Pradip Mukherjee, Satya Banerjee, Dipankar Dey, Lily Chakravarty, Aparna Sen, Gautam Chakraborty, Utpal Dutt, Arati Bhattacharya', null, 'A bright and idealistic young graduate steels himself for a dog-eat-dog world, only to flounder in a job market packed with thousands of other hopefuls. When he eventually decides to start his own business as a middle-man, he discovers that the world of business does not live up to his lofty ideals.', 'A bright and idealistic young graduate steels himself for a dog-eat-dog world, only to flounder in a job market packed with thousands of other hopefuls. When he eventually decides to start his own business as a middle-man, he discovers that the world of business does not live up to his lofty ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dOHOKvGzL1raSjWPLrnzllweqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122445'),
  ('822999630938639117', 'The Midnight After', 2014, 'Comedy, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Fruit Chan, Jack Wong, Nikki Lau Siu-Shu', 'Chan Fai-Hung, Kong Hiu-Yan', 'Wong Yau-Nam, Janice Man Wing-San, Chui Tien-You, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Simon Yam, Sam Lee, Lee Sheung-Ching, Lam Suet', null, 'On a night just like any other, a minibus full of passengers drives through a tunnel and arrives in another dimension; the eclectic group of passengers seek refuge in a deserted cafe and make a horrific discovery.', 'On a night just like any other, a minibus full of passengers drives through a tunnel and arrives in another dimension; the eclectic group of passengers seek refuge in a deserted cafe and make a horrific discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dk7FyOT3g294P4BUJ09P4XGJ98D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254526'),
  ('447316014981091680', 'The Midnight Hour', 1985, 'Comedy, Horror, TV Movie, Romance', 'Jack Bender, Steve Cohen, Fred Gerber', 'William Bleich', 'Jonelle Allen, Shari Belafonte, LeVar Burton, Peter DeLuise, Jonna Lee, Kevin McCarthy, Lee Montgomery, Cindy Morgan', null, 'Phil, Melissa, Mitch, Mary, and Vinnie are high school friends, who unwittingly raise the dead on Halloween night. Once the dead have returned, Pitchford Cove will never be the same again....or will it?', 'Phil, Melissa, Mitch, Mary, and Vinnie are high school friends, who unwittingly raise the dead on Halloween night. Once the dead have returned, Pitchford Cove will never be the same again....or will it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge4JJ1T8dD36IdEAo0U8lz3CBas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35564'),
  ('544255119559264807', 'The Midnight Man', 1974, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Roland Kibbee, Jack Priestley, Brad H. Aronson', 'Roland Kibbee, Burt Lancaster', 'Burt Lancaster, Susan Clark, Cameron Mitchell, Morgan Woodward, Harris Yulin, Robert Quarry, Joan Lorring, Lawrence Dobkin', 'R', 'An ex-convict, and ex-cop, finds himself in the midst of drama as a murder, of a female student, is commited at the university where he works as a night watchman. He is reluctantly drawn into the criminal investigation and eventually becomes a suspect in the case. Will he be able to find the real murderer and clear his own name, or not?', 'An ex-convict, and ex-cop, finds himself in the midst of drama as a murder, of a female student, is commited at the university where he works as a night watchman. He is reluctantly drawn into the criminal investigation and eventually becomes a suspect in the case. Will he be able to find the real murderer and clear his own name, or not?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMSertsKUUrGhGL43cfjpcaTnfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116138'),
  ('874695072823032879', 'The Midnight Man', 2016, 'Horror', 'Travis Zariwny, Gavin Kelly, Reed Makayev', 'Rob Kennedy, Travis Zariwny', 'Gabrielle Haugh, Grayson Gabriel, Lin Shaye, Robert Englund, Em Haine, Louise Linton, Abigail Pniowsky, Michael Sirow', null, 'A girl and her friends find a game in the attic that summons a creature known as The Midnight Man, who uses their worst fears against them.', 'A girl and her friends find a game in the attic that summons a creature known as The Midnight Man, who uses their worst fears against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtrxCwIvpb70NR9RECkt8dPrTJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492621'),
  ('402948156941233378', 'The Midnight Meat Train', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Jonathan Sela, David Leitch', 'Jeff Buhler', 'Bradley Cooper, Vinnie Jones, Brooke Shields, Leslie Bibb, Roger Bart, Ted Raimi, Peter Jacobson, Barbara Eve Harris', 'R', 'A photographer''s obsessive pursuit of dark subject matter leads him into the path of a serial killer who stalks late night commuters, ultimately butchering them in the most gruesome ways.', 'A photographer''s obsessive pursuit of dark subject matter leads him into the path of a serial killer who stalks late night commuters, ultimately butchering them in the most gruesome ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5YbfyUA8huK0shr008xwzNVJ5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10185'),
