  ('1144174975021396372', 'The Midnight Patrol', 1933, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd French, Jack Roach', 'Stan Laurel, Sidney Rauh, Charley Rogers', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Frank Brownlee, Bob Kortman, Charlie Hall, Frank Terry, Al Corporal, Eddie Dunn', 'NR', 'Novice policemen Stan and Ollie bungle a burglary investigation.', 'Novice policemen Stan and Ollie bungle a burglary investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOwFnoM809ovlQIofKuMPMGElHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46731'),
  ('112652907386374164', 'The Midnight Sky', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Martin Ruhe, George Clooney, Lee Grumett', 'Mark L. Smith', 'George Clooney, Felicity Jones, David Oyelowo, Caoilinn Springall, Kyle Chandler, Demián Bichir, Tiffany Boone, Sophie Rundle', 'PG-13', 'A lone scientist in the Arctic races to contact a crew of astronauts returning home to a mysterious global catastrophe.', 'A lone scientist in the Arctic races to contact a crew of astronauts returning home to a mysterious global catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8lXesOLXKS0VYjzWNZN6gDxv2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614911'),
  ('792952339012248597', 'The Midnight Snack', 1941, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Harry Lang', 'NR', 'Jerry takes a midnight snack from the fridge unaware that Tom is watching him.', 'Jerry takes a midnight snack from the fridge unaware that Tom is watching him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ATU8QpHIovzXvsAYaWCIwCePB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40234'),
  ('1115040490394227440', 'The Midnight Story', 1957, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joseph Pevney, Russell Metty, Wilbur Mosier', 'Edwin Blum', 'Tony Curtis, Gilbert Roland, Marisa Pavan, Jay C. Flippen, Argentina Brunetti, Ted de Corsia, Richard Monda, Kathleen Freeman', 'NR', 'Beloved priest Father Thomasino is murdered in a San Francisco alley, and the police have few clues. But traffic cop Joe Martini becomes obsessed with finding the killer; he suspects Sylvio Malatesta. Ordered off the case, Joe turns in his badge and investigates alone. Soon he is a close friend of the Malatesta family, all delightful people, especially lovely cousin Anna. Uncertain whether Sylvio is guilty or innocent, Joe is now torn between old and new loyalties.', 'Beloved priest Father Thomasino is murdered in a San Francisco alley, and the police have few clues. But traffic cop Joe Martini becomes obsessed with finding the killer; he suspects Sylvio Malatesta. Ordered off the case, Joe turns in his badge and investigates alone. Soon he is a close friend of the Malatesta family, all delightful people, especially lovely cousin Anna. Uncertain whether Sylvio is guilty or innocent, Joe is now torn between old and new loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFfn6Dxyi7TbLY095yO5YyFjSBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72903'),
  ('856593223426640533', 'The Midwife', 2017, 'Drama', 'Martin Provost, Yves Cape', 'Martin Provost', 'Catherine Frot, Catherine Deneuve, Olivier Gourmet, Quentin Dolmaire, Mylène Demongeot, Marie Paquim, Karidja Touré, Pauline Étienne', null, 'Claire is a midwife and has devoted her life to others. At a moment when she is preoccupied by the imminent closure of the maternity clinic where she works, her life is further turned upside down when Béatrice, her father''s former mistress, turns up on the scene. Béatrice is a capricious and selfish woman, Claire''s exact opposite.', 'Claire is a midwife and has devoted her life to others. At a moment when she is preoccupied by the imminent closure of the maternity clinic where she works, her life is further turned upside down when Béatrice, her father''s former mistress, turns up on the scene. Béatrice is a capricious and selfish woman, Claire''s exact opposite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBrJGrTmUaGeJVPxAqJT2iZHQCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439154'),
  ('727564247019672709', 'The Mighty', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John de Borman, Peter Chelsom', 'Charles Leavitt', 'Sharon Stone, Elden Henson, Kieran Culkin, Gena Rowlands, Harry Dean Stanton, Meat Loaf, Jenifer Lewis, Dov Tiefenbach', 'PG-13', 'Kevin, an intelligent guy helps out Maxwell to improve his reading skills. In return, Kevin wants Maxwell to take him out places since he is not authorized to go out. Being the social outcasts of the town, Kevin and Maxwell come to realize that they are similar to each other and accept that they are "freaks" and nothing will stop them.', 'Kevin, an intelligent guy helps out Maxwell to improve his reading skills. In return, Kevin wants Maxwell to take him out places since he is not authorized to go out. Being the social outcasts of the town, Kevin and Maxwell come to realize that they are similar to each other and accept that they are "freaks" and nothing will stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8wJa7LVixCtgcmCJX3eg7dxgJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9821'),
  ('1006266698975333554', 'The Mighty Ducks', 1992, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, Action', 'Thomas Del Ruth, Stephen Herek, Douglas E. Wise', 'Steven Brill', 'Emilio Estevez, Joss Ackland, Lane Smith, Heidi Kling, Josef Sommer, Joshua Jackson, Shaun Weiss, Vincent Larusso', 'PG', 'After reckless young lawyer Gordon Bombay gets arrested for drunk driving, he must coach a kids hockey team for his community service. Gordon has experience on the ice, but isn''t eager to return to hockey, a point hit home by his tense dealings with his own former coach, Jack Reilly. The reluctant Gordon eventually grows to appreciate his team, which includes promising young Charlie Conway, and leads them to take on Reilly''s tough players.', 'After reckless young lawyer Gordon Bombay gets arrested for drunk driving, he must coach a kids hockey team for his community service. Gordon has experience on the ice, but isn''t eager to return to hockey, a point hit home by his tense dealings with his own former coach, Jack Reilly. The reluctant Gordon eventually grows to appreciate his team, which includes promising young Charlie Conway, and leads them to take on Reilly''s tough players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxaCHxKDFNi6frh1Q0dj19L216o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10414'),
  ('28014138177021772', 'The Mighty Kong', 1998, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Art Scott', 'William J. Keenan', 'Dudley Moore, Jodi Benson, Randy Hamilton, William Sage, Ian James Corlett, Paul Dobson, Michael Dobson, Jason Gray-Stanford', 'G', 'The classic story of the mighty Eighth Wonder of the World is given a musical update, utilizing the talents of Disney musical giants The Sherman Brothers. Boosting this family-friendly take on the 1933 film are the acting talents of Jodi Benson and Dudley Moore.', 'The classic story of the mighty Eighth Wonder of the World is given a musical update, utilizing the talents of Disney musical giants The Sherman Brothers. Boosting this family-friendly take on the 1933 film are the acting talents of Jodi Benson and Dudley Moore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQCDOycvbVnWUcFq6KV5eCC2O9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291309'),
  ('376650031845961846', 'The Mighty Peking Man', 1977, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure, Horror', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Hung Hak, Wu Cho-Hua', 'Ni Kuang', 'Evelyne Kraft, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Ku Feng, Lam Wai-Tiu, Hsiao Yao, Chen Ping, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Ng Hong-Sang', 'PG-13', 'Word of a monster ape ten stories tall living in the Himalayas reaches fortune hunters in Hong Kong. They travel to India to capture it, but wild animals and quicksand dissuade all but Johnny, an adventurer with a broken heart. He finds the monster and discovers it''s been raising a scantily-clad woman, Samantha, since she survived a plane crash years before that killed her parents. In the idyllic jungle, Johnny and Samantha fall in love. Then Johnny asks her to convince "Utam" to go to Hong Kong. Lu Tien, an unscrupulous promoter, takes over: Utam is in chains for freak show exhibitions. When Lu Tien assaults Samantha, Utam''s protective instincts take over: havoc in Hong Kong.', 'Word of a monster ape ten stories tall living in the Himalayas reaches fortune hunters in Hong Kong. They travel to India to capture it, but wild animals and quicksand dissuade all but Johnny, an adventurer with a broken heart. He finds the monster and discovers it''s been raising a scantily-clad woman, Samantha, since she survived a plane crash years before that killed her parents. In the idyllic jungle, Johnny and Samantha fall in love. Then Johnny asks her to convince "Utam" to go to Hong Kong. Lu Tien, an unscrupulous promoter, takes over: Utam is in chains for freak show exhibitions. When Lu Tien assaults Samantha, Utam''s protective instincts take over: havoc in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89vf9Gzxj50YdqB9X1zwFMxjNrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42230'),
  ('587364749400349709', 'The Mighty Quinn', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Carl Schenkel, J. Stephen Buck, Joe Camp III', 'Hampton Fancher', 'Denzel Washington, James Fox, Mimi Rogers, M. Emmet Walsh, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Art Evans, Esther Rolle, Norman Beaton', 'R', 'Police chief Xavier Quinn investigates the gruesome murder of Donald Pater, one of the wealthiest residents on a Caribbean island. He was found decapitated in his Jacuzzi. Although the local political establishment, especially crooked Governor Chalk, insists that small-time thief Maubee is responsible, Xavier has his doubts. This view is complicated by the police chief''s personal history with Maubee: The men have been friends since childhood.', 'Police chief Xavier Quinn investigates the gruesome murder of Donald Pater, one of the wealthiest residents on a Caribbean island. He was found decapitated in his Jacuzzi. Although the local political establishment, especially crooked Governor Chalk, insists that small-time thief Maubee is responsible, Xavier has his doubts. This view is complicated by the police chief''s personal history with Maubee: The men have been friends since childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4slxiAx6kBl7h80df2xOobWRUTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31004'),
  ('659517222012342046', 'The Mighty River', 1993, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Frédéric Back', null, 'Paul Hébert', null, 'This film illustrates the history of the St. Lawrence river. From prehistoric times on, it has been a magnificent source of life. The film covers the impact of humanity beginning with the careful relationship with the Native Americans. This soon changes with the arrival of Europeans who begin the insatiable exploitation that would led to the river''s damage, creating a situation that we must resolve for all our sakes.', 'This film illustrates the history of the St. Lawrence river. From prehistoric times on, it has been a magnificent source of life. The film covers the impact of humanity beginning with the careful relationship with the Native Americans. This soon changes with the arrival of Europeans who begin the insatiable exploitation that would led to the river''s damage, creating a situation that we must resolve for all our sakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNiTnOwNvrb52cSnxlR9KW2Y2dU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90823'),
  ('459580099738045315', 'The Migrumpies', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Arman T. Riahi, Mario Minichmayr', 'Aleksandar Petrović, Faris Rahoma, Arman T. Riahi', 'Faris Rahoma, Aleksandar Petrović, Doris Schretzmayer, Josef Hader, Julia Jelinek, Daniela Zacherl, Mehmet Ali Salman, Zijah Sokolović', null, 'For a TV documentary, the two unemployed friends Benny and Marko pretend to be petty criminals with immigrant background until the coin flips and reality turns against them.', 'For a TV documentary, the two unemployed friends Benny and Marko pretend to be petty criminals with immigrant background until the coin flips and reality turns against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4I1eWyXkV9SCzr3KpYVqY76HE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459908'),
  ('526805149119757624', 'The Mikado', 1939, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Victor Schertzinger, Bernard Knowles', 'William S. Gilbert', 'Martyn Green, Sydney Granville, John Barclay, Kenny Baker, Jean Colin, Gregory Stroud, Constance Willis, Elizabeth Paynter', 'G', 'In a small Japanese town, Ko-Ko is appointed to the unenviable position of executioner. Knowing he must successfully perform before the appearance of the Mikado in a month''s time, Ko-Ko finds a suitable victim in Nanki-Poo, who is distraught over his unrequited love for the maiden Yum-Yum. Nanki-Poo agrees to sacrifice his life if he is allowed to spend his remaining days with Yum-Yum, who is betrothed to Ko-Ko.', 'In a small Japanese town, Ko-Ko is appointed to the unenviable position of executioner. Knowing he must successfully perform before the appearance of the Mikado in a month''s time, Ko-Ko finds a suitable victim in Nanki-Poo, who is distraught over his unrequited love for the maiden Yum-Yum. Nanki-Poo agrees to sacrifice his life if he is allowed to spend his remaining days with Yum-Yum, who is betrothed to Ko-Ko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cMjvpBjKJZ2xTKLlvOGhszOeuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68201'),
  ('365998029597944749', 'The Milagro Beanfield War', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Robert Redford, Charles Myers, Kaären F. Ochoa', 'John Nichols, David S. Ward', 'Rubén Blades, Richard Bradford, Sonia Braga, Julie Carmen, James Gammon, Melanie Griffith, John Heard, Carlos Riquelme', 'R', 'The accidental breakdown of an irrigation valve launches a hot confrontation between the mainly Latino farmers in a tiny New Mexico town and the real estate developers and politicians determined to acquire their land for a golf resort.', 'The accidental breakdown of an irrigation valve launches a hot confrontation between the mainly Latino farmers in a tiny New Mexico town and the real estate developers and politicians determined to acquire their land for a golf resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVLZuiNfKua7C2x3rGUiAR8wGEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13482'),
  ('1080729748026064703', 'The Milk of Human Kindness', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dominique Cabrera', null, 'Patrick Bruel, Marilyne Canto, Dominique Blanc, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Marthe Villalonga, Yolande Moreau, Claude Brasseur, Sergi López', null, 'A woman, scared by motherhood and her new born baby, runs away from her home and family to find a shelter at her upstairs neighbour''s place.', 'A woman, scared by motherhood and her new born baby, runs away from her home and family to find a shelter at her upstairs neighbour''s place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHQgya5blUynXzLLhkMgQmyJ4ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57945'),
  ('497219371572812389', 'The Milk of Sorrow', 2009, 'Drama', 'Claudia Llosa, Natasha Braier', 'Claudia Llosa', 'Magaly Solier, Susi Sánchez, Efraín Solís, Marino Ballón, Daniel Nuñez Duran', null, 'Fausta is suffering from a rare disease called the Milk of Sorrow, which is transmitted through the breast milk of pregnant women who were abused or raped during or soon after pregnancy. While living in constant fear and confusion due to this disease, she must face the sudden death of her mother. She chooses to take drastic measures to not follow in her mother''s footsteps.', 'Fausta is suffering from a rare disease called the Milk of Sorrow, which is transmitted through the breast milk of pregnant women who were abused or raped during or soon after pregnancy. While living in constant fear and confusion due to this disease, she must face the sudden death of her mother. She chooses to take drastic measures to not follow in her mother''s footsteps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdg1wZ76HSVEtEKh7FUXYGqW9nW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28644'),
  ('860306953096399454', 'The Milky Waif', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Jerry finds himself in charge of a foundling mouse called Nibbles, who is eager to steal milk from Tom''s bowl and oblivious to the danger.', 'Jerry finds himself in charge of a foundling mouse called Nibbles, who is eager to steal milk from Tom''s bowl and oblivious to the danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYfhd8Tv7JiWWcN4GSeG8mddjrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40450'),
  ('950572813025166985', 'The Milky Way', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Alfred Gilks', 'Grover Jones, Frank Butler, Richard Connell', 'Harold Lloyd, Adolphe Menjou, Verree Teasdale, Helen Mack, William Gargan, George Barbier, Dorothy Wilson, Lionel Stander', 'NR', 'Timid milkman, Burleigh Sullivan, somehow knocks out a boxing champ in a brawl. The fighter''s manager decides to build up the milkman''s reputation in a series of fixed fights and then have the champ beat him to regain his title.', 'Timid milkman, Burleigh Sullivan, somehow knocks out a boxing champ in a brawl. The fighter''s manager decides to build up the milkman''s reputation in a series of fixed fights and then have the champ beat him to regain his title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSbzM4MI4K2h0R3jBu9N73Zhseq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41349'),
  ('688288460512170941', 'The Milky Way', 1940, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Rudolf Ising', 'Maurice "Jake" Day', 'Bernice Hansen', null, 'The three little kittens have lost their mittens and are sent to bed without dinner. From their room, they see the Milky Way and sail up to it, using a basket and helium balloons, passing through some fanciful astronomical bodies, until they reach a Milky Way filled with every conceivable form of milk.', 'The three little kittens have lost their mittens and are sent to bed without dinner. From their room, they see the Milky Way and sail up to it, using a basket and helium balloons, passing through some fanciful astronomical bodies, until they reach a Milky Way filled with every conceivable form of milk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucKGGYLXTwz2WD1SLX64Kj6eB2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163882'),
  ('945654593101640421', 'The Milky Way', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, Michel Breuil, Pierre Lary', 'Luis Buñuel, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Paul Frankeur, Laurent Terzieff, Alain Cuny, Édith Scob, Bernard Verley, François Maistre, Claude Cerval, Muni', null, 'Two men, part tramp, part pilgrim, are on their way from France to Santiago de Compostela in Spain. On their way, they meet a vast assortment of characters—some truculent, some violent, and some bizarre; they experience many adventures—some mysterious, some erotic, some even supernatural.', 'Two men, part tramp, part pilgrim, are on their way from France to Santiago de Compostela in Spain. On their way, they meet a vast assortment of characters—some truculent, some violent, and some bizarre; they experience many adventures—some mysterious, some erotic, some even supernatural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lV9Ogp4F8MIB5slKQGrfU9JuEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35031'),
  ('537053589341303039', 'The Mill', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Colin Duerr, Seamus Tierney, Sean King O''Grady', 'Jeffrey David Thomas', 'Lil Rel Howery, Pat Healy, Karen Obilom, Patrick Fischler, Getchie Argetsinger, Jaiden K. Brown, Blair Wilson, Allya F. Robinson', 'R', 'A businessman wakes up beside an ancient grist mill situated in the center of an open-air prison cell with no idea how he got there. Forced to work as a beast of burden to stay alive, he must find a way to escape before the birth of his child.', 'A businessman wakes up beside an ancient grist mill situated in the center of an open-air prison cell with no idea how he got there. Forced to work as a beast of burden to stay alive, he must find a way to escape before the birth of his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCga8NK6mzRHTd7t1m8bvLDDvSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081400'),
  ('1152899531135521467', 'The Mill and the Cross', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'Lech Majewski, Lech Majewski, Adam Sikora', 'Michael Francis Gibson, Lech Majewski', 'Rutger Hauer, Charlotte Rampling, Michael York, Joanna Litwin, Dorota Lis, Bartosz Capowicz, Mateusz Machnik, Marian Makula', null, 'What would it be like to step inside a great work of art, have it come alive around you, and even observe the artist as he sketches the very reality you are experiencing? From Lech Majewski, one of Poland''s most acclaimed filmmakers, The Mill and the Cross is a cinematic re-staging of Pieter Bruegel''s masterpiece "Procession to Calvary," presented alongside the story of its creation.', 'What would it be like to step inside a great work of art, have it come alive around you, and even observe the artist as he sketches the very reality you are experiencing? From Lech Majewski, one of Poland''s most acclaimed filmmakers, The Mill and the Cross is a cinematic re-staging of Pieter Bruegel''s masterpiece "Procession to Calvary," presented alongside the story of its creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IKLkxxXf38C2hY9ONi6Lvlz1qM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57829'),
  ('656055780194913783', 'The Mill of Good Luck', 1957, 'Drama, Crime', 'Victor Iliu, Liviu Ciulei, Ovidiu Gologan', 'Titus Popovici, Alexandru Struțeanu', 'Constantin Codrescu, Geo Barton, Ioana Bulcă, Colea Răutu, Marietta Rareș, Gheorghe Ghițulescu, Benedict Dabija, I. Atanasiu-Atlas', null, 'Follows the inner transformation of a man who tried to fight his demon, the love for money, and lost.', 'Follows the inner transformation of a man who tried to fight his demon, the love for money, and lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mPYplh413KwBJp6n9tcP9r7Va2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199206'),
  ('622122934101919943', 'The Mill on the Floss', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Johnson, Graham Theakston', 'Hugh Stoddart', 'Emily Watson, James Frain, Cheryl Campbell, Bernard Hill, Joanna David, Shenagh Govan, Nicholas Gecks, Peter Gunn', null, 'Lawyer Wakem takes the mill on the river Floss away from Edward Tulliver (whose ancestors have owned it for 300 years) and becomes the worst enemy of Tulliver''s family. When Edward''s daughter, Maggie, grows up, she falls in love with Wakem''s son Philip. However, her brother Tom (true to the memory of their father) forbids her to meet him again. When she visits her cousin Lucy Deane, Lucy''s fiance, Stephen Guest, falls in love with Maggie at first sight, further complicating matters.', 'Lawyer Wakem takes the mill on the river Floss away from Edward Tulliver (whose ancestors have owned it for 300 years) and becomes the worst enemy of Tulliver''s family. When Edward''s daughter, Maggie, grows up, she falls in love with Wakem''s son Philip. However, her brother Tom (true to the memory of their father) forbids her to meet him again. When she visits her cousin Lucy Deane, Lucy''s fiance, Stephen Guest, falls in love with Maggie at first sight, further complicating matters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0VckChXGd5A0zsPe1DMUhd3Uap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101463'),
  ('327009379569794597', 'The Mill on the Po', 1949, 'History, Drama', 'Alberto Lattuada, Carlo Lizzani, Paolo Gargano', 'Federico Fellini, Tullio Pinelli', 'Carla Del Poggio, Jacques Sernas, Mario Besesti, Giacomo Giuradei, Nino Pavese, Giulio Calì, Anna Carena, Leda Gloria', null, 'In the Po Valley during the 19th century, a rich girl engaged to a well-to-do farmer ends up penniless and is forced to work for her fiancé’s relatives. Peasant unrest, carried to extremes by both workers and landowners, leads to violence and tragedy.', 'In the Po Valley during the 19th century, a rich girl engaged to a well-to-do farmer ends up penniless and is forced to work for her fiancé’s relatives. Peasant unrest, carried to extremes by both workers and landowners, leads to violence and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muLCCH6azxWEqbHFJEoyfZWhi7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276155'),
  ('245494575257507914', 'The Millennial Bee', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Juraj Jakubisko, Jana Uherová, Michal Ruttkay', 'Peter Jaroš, Juraj Jakubisko', 'Štefan Kvietik, Jozef Kroner, Michal Dočolomanský, Ivana Valešová, Eva Jakoubková, Jana Janovská, Štefan Šafárik, Pavol Mikulík', null, 'A family saga taking place mostly in a small Slovak village over a period of thirty years (1887–1917). The first part captures the life of Martin Pichandu in the development of his craft, masonry; in the second part, his son is center stage living in a period of socio-political crisis, which ultimately results in the first World War. After originally airing on Czechoslovakian television in 1983 as a four-part 226-minute mini-series, this production received a 163-minute theatrical release in 1984.', 'A family saga taking place mostly in a small Slovak village over a period of thirty years (1887–1917). The first part captures the life of Martin Pichandu in the development of his craft, masonry; in the second part, his son is center stage living in a period of socio-political crisis, which ultimately results in the first World War. After originally airing on Czechoslovakian television in 1983 as a four-part 226-minute mini-series, this production received a 163-minute theatrical release in 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXCLliSnNk4YF4RA2adTC7N9YV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117214'),
  ('1090168450198088277', 'The Miller''s Beautiful Wife', 1955, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mario Camerini, Otto Pellegrini, Isa Bartalini', 'Mario Camerini, Ennio De Concini, Augusto Camerini', 'Vittorio De Sica, Sophia Loren, Marcello Mastroianni, Paolo Stoppa, Yvonne Sanson, Mario Passante, Carlo Sposito, Virgilio Riento', null, 'A lecherous governor of Naples in 1680 lusts after the wives of several peasants, particularly after the miller''s wife Carmela. The miller himself plans to avenge his honor by seducing the wife of the governor.', 'A lecherous governor of Naples in 1680 lusts after the wives of several peasants, particularly after the miller''s wife Carmela. The miller himself plans to avenge his honor by seducing the wife of the governor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhhQmAWZth1FkGBSWOew994DWhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81308'),
  ('879274474584240086', 'The Million Dollar Cat', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'William Hanna, Jerry Mann', 'NR', 'Tom inherits $1,000,000 from an eccentric aunt on the condition that he not harm any living thing - even a mouse. And guess which mouse keeps following him around and pointing this out to him?', 'Tom inherits $1,000,000 from an eccentric aunt on the condition that he not harm any living thing - even a mouse. And guess which mouse keeps following him around and pointing this out to him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuVhw0UDEgckplhwZW8eRbsa6KZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73632'),
  ('515175489071577712', 'The Million Dollar Duck', 1971, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vincent McEveety, William E. Snyder', 'Roswell Rogers', 'Dean Jones, Sandy Duncan, Joe Flynn, Tony Roberts, James Gregory, Lee Montgomery, Jack Kruschen, Virginia Vincent', 'G', 'Professor Dooley takes home a duck from his research laboratory as a toy for his son, but soon finds out that it lays golden eggs.', 'Professor Dooley takes home a duck from his research laboratory as a toy for his son, but soon finds out that it lays golden eggs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fC6VILpXvnyn6w5o0zjM0TTtBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22777'),
  ('639593229495762072', 'The Million Dollar Hotel', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Phedon Papamichael, Wim Wenders, Christine Larson', 'Nicholas Klein, Bono', 'Mel Gibson, Milla Jovovich, Jeremy Davies, Peter Stormare, Amanda Plummer, Bud Cort, Jimmy Smits, Julian Sands', 'R', 'A federal agent searches for a potential killer among the bizarre residents of a dilapidated Los Angeles hotel.', 'A federal agent searches for a potential killer among the bizarre residents of a dilapidated Los Angeles hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGRyPsZF0lfIL3IadmBdoAsYzyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318'),
  ('72021822210364341', 'The Million Eyes of Sumuru', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'John von Kotze, Lindsay Shonteff, Anthony Waye', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'Frankie Avalon, George Nader, Shirley Eaton, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Klaus Kinski, Patti Chandler, Salli Sachse, Ursula Rank', 'NR', 'Sumuru is a beautiful but evil woman who plans world domination by having her sexy all-female army eliminate male leaders and replace them with her female agents.', 'Sumuru is a beautiful but evil woman who plans world domination by having her sexy all-female army eliminate male leaders and replace them with her female agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4MBJan6wojQJTjO7FQYoTdH4j3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37960'),
  ('1061901683083813308', 'The Million Game', 1970, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Toelle, Rudolf Holan, Jan Kališ', 'Wolfgang Menge, Tom Toelle', 'Jörg Pleva, Dieter Thomas Heck, Friedrich Schütter, Dieter Hallervorden, Theo Fink, Josef Fröhlich, Peter Schulze-Rohr, Annemarie Schradiek', null, 'A candidate in a game show is hunted by three men. He will get a Million DMark, if he survives for a week; the hunters will get the money, if they can kill the candidate. The audience of the show is watching the transmissions of twenty camera teams filming the hunt. The showmaster appeals to the TV-viewers to help either the candidate or the hunters, whomever they want.', 'A candidate in a game show is hunted by three men. He will get a Million DMark, if he survives for a week; the hunters will get the money, if they can kill the candidate. The audience of the show is watching the transmissions of twenty camera teams filming the hunt. The showmaster appeals to the TV-viewers to help either the candidate or the hunters, whomever they want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RUB5goPRL6TvS59oy5P4qsQ5BO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5465'),
  ('803369964781587885', 'The Million Hare', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson', 'David Detiege', 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs races Daffy to get to the TV station first and win the prize on the "Beat Your Buddy" show.', 'Bugs races Daffy to get to the TV station first and win the prize on the "Beat Your Buddy" show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkUH3f9nKBALxQKtysMBCXMREOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234465'),
  ('79418103962503581', 'The Million Pound Note', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Ronald Neame, Robert Asher, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Jill Craigie', 'Gregory Peck, Ronald Squire, Joyce Grenfell, A.E. Matthews, Maurice Denham, Reginald Beckwith, Brian Oulton, John Slater', 'PG', 'An impoverished American sailor is fortunate enough to be passing the house of two rich gentlemen who have conceived the crazy idea of distributing a note worth one million pounds. The sailor finds that whenever he tries to use the note to buy something, people treat him like a king and let him have whatever he likes for free. Ultimately, the money proves to be more troublesome than it is worth when it almost costs him his dignity and the woman he loves.', 'An impoverished American sailor is fortunate enough to be passing the house of two rich gentlemen who have conceived the crazy idea of distributing a note worth one million pounds. The sailor finds that whenever he tries to use the note to buy something, people treat him like a king and let him have whatever he likes for free. Ultimately, the money proves to be more troublesome than it is worth when it almost costs him his dignity and the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB5bI215fOPg3rDkOwP1aS4Z2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34000'),
  ('478772818794449624', 'The Millionaire', 1963, 'Animation', 'Yuri Prytkov, Vitold Bordzilovskiy, Ekaterina Rizo', 'Sergey Mikhalkov', 'Emmanuil Kaminka, Yuri Khrzhanovsky', null, 'A dog inherits a fortune and becomes an influential capitalist snob in the human world.', 'A dog inherits a fortune and becomes an influential capitalist snob in the human world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fikNO0mO3b97forruyTJ8lVr694.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91675'),
  ('791452728847012896', 'The Millionaire Tour', 2012, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Inon Shampanier, Michael Fimognari', 'Natalie Shampanier, Inon Shampanier', 'Jordan Belfi, Agnes Bruckner, Dominic Monaghan, Rick Gomez, Bruce Davison, Marisa Petroro, Dave Vescio, Jeff Scott', 'R', 'A mysterious cab passenger taken hostage must convince the hijackers that he is not the con man they set out to kill.', 'A mysterious cab passenger taken hostage must convince the hijackers that he is not the con man they set out to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7dKu2jxjkraa2LwrNrMaYB4TTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101056'),
  ('499154456165567035', 'The Millionaire’s Anniversary', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Tadas Vidmantas', 'Tadas Vidmantas', 'Giedrius Savickas, Arvydas Dapšys, Renata Kutinaitė, Mantas Bendžius', null, 'A wealthy farmer''s son enjoys a bohemian life in the capital-painting, partying, nameless women in his bed. Why inherit a farm? But when his world collapses, the prodigal son returns to his father, head bowed.', 'A wealthy farmer''s son enjoys a bohemian life in the capital-painting, partying, nameless women in his bed. Why inherit a farm? But when his world collapses, the prodigal son returns to his father, head bowed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjL31wCCRE86al1B0I0jqmvpptav.jpg', 'plex:movie:milijonieriaus-jubiliejus'),
  ('646976658558677778', 'The Millionairess', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony Asquith, Jack Hildyard', 'Riccardo Aragno, Wolf Mankowitz', 'Sophia Loren, Peter Sellers, Vittorio De Sica, Alastair Sim, Dennis Price, Gary Raymond, Miriam Karlin, Noel Purcell', null, 'When her father dies, Epifania Parerga, an Italian in London, becomes the world''s richest woman. She feels incomplete without a husband and falls in love with a humble, Indian physician, Ahmed el Kabir, much loved by his indigent English patients.', 'When her father dies, Epifania Parerga, an Italian in London, becomes the world''s richest woman. She feels incomplete without a husband and falls in love with a humble, Indian physician, Ahmed el Kabir, much loved by his indigent English patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byMubSKFewDCU2dxyPFbINBDnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3582'),
  ('581226703052260559', 'The Millwood Murders: Buried Truth', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'David F. Mewa, Jeff Maher', 'Al Kratina', 'Steve Belford, Rainbow Sun Francks, LeToya Luckett', 'TV-14', 'A prosecutor condemns her husband as the Millwood Murderer. Years later, as his execution nears, their daughter disappears after finding evidence of his innocence - and the real killer still free.', 'A prosecutor condemns her husband as the Millwood Murderer. Years later, as his execution nears, their daughter disappears after finding evidence of his innocence - and the real killer still free.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fjy789vYmOl0VQP7LutMs4szKMsm.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-millwood-murders-buried-truth'),
  ('628173427895204694', 'The Mimic', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Min-jae, Huh Jung, Kim Il-yeon', 'Huh Jung', 'Yum Jung-ah, Park Hyuk-kwon, Heo Jin, Shin Rin-a, Lee Jun-hyeok, Lee Ju-won, Kil Hae-yeon, Noh Susanna', null, 'The mother of a missing child takes in a lost girl she finds in the woods, but soon begins to wonder if she is even human.', 'The mother of a missing child takes in a lost girl she finds in the woods, but soon begins to wonder if she is even human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWseLt8PzOgMMzE3Jnoz2PN11NP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437108'),
  ('412181138018588544', 'The Mind Benders', 1963, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Basil Dearden, Denys N. Coop, Basil Rayburn', 'James Kennaway', 'Dirk Bogarde, Mary Ure, John Clements, Michael Bryant, Wendy Craig, Harold Goldblatt, Geoffrey Keen, Terry Palmer', null, 'A British scientist is discovered to have been passing information to the Communists, then kills himself. Another scientist decides that they might have brainwashed him by a sensory deprivation technique, but he doesn’t know if someone really can be convinced to act against their strongest feelings. So he agrees to be the subject in an experiment in which others will try to make him stop loving his wife.', 'A British scientist is discovered to have been passing information to the Communists, then kills himself. Another scientist decides that they might have brainwashed him by a sensory deprivation technique, but he doesn’t know if someone really can be convinced to act against their strongest feelings. So he agrees to be the subject in an experiment in which others will try to make him stop loving his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHVjp7YcgoOAyTR854oU2YYJL1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51539'),
  ('1016685446970308553', 'The Mind of Mr. Soames', 1970, 'Drama', 'Alan Cooke, Jake Wright, Ariel Levy', 'Edward Simpson, John Hale', 'Terence Stamp, Robert Vaughn, Nigel Davenport, Christian Roberts, Donal Donnelly, Norman Jones, Dan Jackson, Vickery Turner', null, 'A 30-year-old man, who has been in a coma since birth, is finally restored to consciousness by a breakthrough brain operation. Although physically an adult, the man is "reborn" in the eye of an infant; the doctors caring for him must teach him to walk, talk and prepare for life in the outside world. Tension builds as he escapes from the hospital, wanders among people who do not realize his identity, and is hunted by the police.', 'A 30-year-old man, who has been in a coma since birth, is finally restored to consciousness by a breakthrough brain operation. Although physically an adult, the man is "reborn" in the eye of an infant; the doctors caring for him must teach him to walk, talk and prepare for life in the outside world. Tension builds as he escapes from the hospital, wanders among people who do not realize his identity, and is hunted by the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNDPjAGvYRYTkiyjKMB5AmbNj2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119575'),
  ('368236288754701541', 'The Mind Reader', 1933, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Roy Del Ruth, Sol Polito', 'Wilson Mizner, Robert Lord', 'Warren William, Constance Cummings, Allen Jenkins, Natalie Moorhead, Mayo Methot, Clarence Muse, Earle Foxe, Irving Bacon', null, 'Con-man Chandler and his partner Frank decide to start a clairvoyant act. Chandler falls for Sylvia, one of their marks, but their relationship is challenged when his deception impacts others'' lives and Sylvia urges him to reform.', 'Con-man Chandler and his partner Frank decide to start a clairvoyant act. Chandler falls for Sylvia, one of their marks, but their relationship is challenged when his deception impacts others'' lives and Sylvia urges him to reform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfx6D7naaqpNsEF3RJcNSBpaKxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126122'),
  ('403416407731774510', 'The Mind Snatchers', 1972, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Bernard Girard, Manny Wynn', 'Ron Whyte, Dennis Reardon', 'Christopher Walken, Ronny Cox, Joss Ackland, Ralph Meeker, Marco St. John, Bette Henritze, Susan Travers, Tom Aldredge', null, 'A German scientist works on a way of quelling overly aggressive soldiers by developing implants that directly stimulate the pleasure centers of the brain.', 'A German scientist works on a way of quelling overly aggressive soldiers by developing implants that directly stimulate the pleasure centers of the brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSdaX4J53ZEVnRCWgnB43Rv7tB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56718'),
  ('210202910169761564', 'The Mind''s Eye', 1990, 'Animation', 'Jan Nickman', null, null, null, 'The Mind''s Eye is a compilation of experimental computer animations from when such technology was in its early infancy. The animations are from various studios, having been arranged in a sort of "2001" evolution-timeline theme, and set to synthesized music. These pioneering CGI projects later gave rise to films such as Toy Story, A Bug''s Life, Antz, and Shrek.', 'The Mind''s Eye is a compilation of experimental computer animations from when such technology was in its early infancy. The animations are from various studios, having been arranged in a sort of "2001" evolution-timeline theme, and set to synthesized music. These pioneering CGI projects later gave rise to films such as Toy Story, A Bug''s Life, Antz, and Shrek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8owGK5kSi9Hodybs3fQjRMZq0ht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165220'),
  ('633819746154273791', 'The Mind''s Eye', 2015, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joe Begos, Mark M. Greene, Joe Begos', 'Joe Begos', 'Graham Skipper, Lauren Ashley Carter, John Speredakos, Larry Fessenden, Noah Segan, Matt Mercer, Brian Morvant, Michael A. LoCicero', 'NR', 'Zack Connors and Rachel Meadows were born with incredible psychokinetic capabilities. When word of their supernatural talents gets out, they find themselves the prisoners of Michael Slovak, a deranged doctor intent on harvesting their powers.', 'Zack Connors and Rachel Meadows were born with incredible psychokinetic capabilities. When word of their supernatural talents gets out, they find themselves the prisoners of Michael Slovak, a deranged doctor intent on harvesting their powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwyhFGCaSpqR9nvWpt9CRnr6oDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336265'),
  ('70573522756021787', 'The Mindscape of Alan Moore', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Dez Vylenz, Donald Winkler, Moritz Winkler', 'Dez Vylenz, Moritz Winkler', 'Alan Moore, Glenn Doherty, Florian Fischer', null, 'The Mindscape of Alan Moore is a psychedelic journey into one of the world''s most powerful minds; chronicling the life and work of Alan Moore, author of several acclaimed graphic novels, including "From Hell," "Watchmen" and "V for Vendetta." It is the only feature film production on which Alan Moore has collaborated, with permission to use his work. Alan Moore presents the story of his development as an artist, starting with his childhood and working through to his comics career and impact on that medium, and his emerging interest in magic.', 'The Mindscape of Alan Moore is a psychedelic journey into one of the world''s most powerful minds; chronicling the life and work of Alan Moore, author of several acclaimed graphic novels, including "From Hell," "Watchmen" and "V for Vendetta." It is the only feature film production on which Alan Moore has collaborated, with permission to use his work. Alan Moore presents the story of his development as an artist, starting with his childhood and working through to his comics career and impact on that medium, and his emerging interest in magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5nfg2whuLPW052oijLCN5ENA4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67857'),
  ('486756743642905594', 'The Mine', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'İzzet Akay, Yavuz Özkan', 'Yavuz Özkan', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Tarık Akan, Halil Ergün, Hale Soygazi, Meral Orhonsay, Nurhan Nur, Baki Tamer, Ahmet Kostarika', null, 'When work accidents in a coal mine start to result in death, İlyas warns his colleagues working in the mine. It starts to collect signatures for the necessary measures to be taken, but the necessary solidarity among the workers cannot be established. A tent theater that comes to the region further complicates things.', 'When work accidents in a coal mine start to result in death, İlyas warns his colleagues working in the mine. It starts to collect signatures for the necessary measures to be taken, but the necessary solidarity among the workers cannot be established. A tent theater that comes to the region further complicates things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SYeLxsAZHfo5sMM8ksIjCbQL6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449662'),
  ('1120892988277806760', 'The Minimalists: Less Is Now', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Matt D''Avella, Chris Newhard', null, 'Joshua Fields Millburn, Ryan Nicodemus', null, 'They''ve built a movement out of minimalism. Longtime friends Joshua Fields Millburn and Ryan Nicodemus share how our lives can be better with less.', 'They''ve built a movement out of minimalism. Longtime friends Joshua Fields Millburn and Ryan Nicodemus share how our lives can be better with less.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1foXpKnMMAL1OzBrCS3CcwnHO7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774054'),
  ('536475230342251174', 'The Minion', 1998, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Jean-Marc Piché, Barry Parrell, Harold Trépanier', 'Matt Roe, Ripley Highsmith', 'Dolph Lundgren, Françoise Robertson, Roc LaFortune, David Nerman, Allen Altman, Jean-Marc Bisson, Don Francks, Michael Greyeyes', null, 'New York, Christmas Eve, 1999 - at the dawn of the new millennium - a subway construction crew unearths an eight hundred year old Celtic skeleton and a mysterious key. Archeologist Karen Goodleaf is called in to determine the meaning of the discovery. News of the discovery reaches a Middle East monastery where the warrior monks knowns as the Knights Templar - an ancient sect entrusted with protecting holy relics - choose their best pupil, Lukas to face the diabolical threat. As Lukas races to New York, an evil Minion seizes Karen and uses her body like a parasite and host!', 'New York, Christmas Eve, 1999 - at the dawn of the new millennium - a subway construction crew unearths an eight hundred year old Celtic skeleton and a mysterious key. Archeologist Karen Goodleaf is called in to determine the meaning of the discovery. News of the discovery reaches a Middle East monastery where the warrior monks knowns as the Knights Templar - an ancient sect entrusted with protecting holy relics - choose their best pupil, Lukas to face the diabolical threat. As Lukas races to New York, an evil Minion seizes Karen and uses her body like a parasite and host!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3O4P5i1T0qScKRI0qOzIksDuzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51831'),
  ('34989466193876093', 'The Minister', 2011, 'Drama', 'Pierre Schoeller, Julien Hirsch', 'Pierre Schoeller', 'Olivier Gourmet, Michel Blanc, Zabou Breitman, Laurent Stocker, Sylvain Deblé, Didier Bezace, Jacques Boudet, François Chattot', null, 'Transport Minister Bertrand Saint-Jean is awoken in the middle of the night by his head of staff. A bus has gone off the road into a gully. He has no choice but to go to the scene of the accident. Thus begins the odyssey of a politician in a world that is increasingly more complex and hostile.', 'Transport Minister Bertrand Saint-Jean is awoken in the middle of the night by his head of staff. A bus has gone off the road into a gully. He has no choice but to go to the scene of the accident. Thus begins the odyssey of a politician in a world that is increasingly more complex and hostile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asri7RwmdY5OMqlLED8CF92Hdc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95448'),
  ('758471491618766382', 'The Minister and Me', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Jorge Stahl Jr., Américo Fernández', 'Tito Davison', 'Cantinflas, Chela Castro, Lucía Méndez, Ángel Garasa, Manolita Saval, Delia Peña Orta, Alonso Castaño, Miguel Manzano', null, 'Mateo Melgarejo is a notary public and scribe for the illiterate people of Santo Domingo, a neighborhood north of Mexico City''s Zócalo. A squatter friend asks for his help in negotiating with the land census bureau to regularize a land title. After a great deal of frustration with the government bureaucracy, he writes a letter to the cabinet minister, earning an audience with him. The minister hires Melgarejo to reform the bureau, and the appointee proceeds to lecture the officials on their duties in a democratic society. At the end, he gives up the post, returning to Santo Domingo to help its poor residents.', 'Mateo Melgarejo is a notary public and scribe for the illiterate people of Santo Domingo, a neighborhood north of Mexico City''s Zócalo. A squatter friend asks for his help in negotiating with the land census bureau to regularize a land title. After a great deal of frustration with the government bureaucracy, he writes a letter to the cabinet minister, earning an audience with him. The minister hires Melgarejo to reform the bureau, and the appointee proceeds to lecture the officials on their duties in a democratic society. At the end, he gives up the post, returning to Santo Domingo to help its poor residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77sTJrC54qXyHxRTuaSDvpPlQHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82776'),
  ('645402705645380033', 'The Minister''s Wife', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Carlos Suárez', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Gonzalo Goicoechea, Ángel Sastre', 'Amparo Muñoz, Simón Andreu, María Martín, Irina Kuberskaya, Julieta Serrano, Manuel Torres, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., José Luis Fernández ''Pirri''', null, 'Rafael, a young man from the provinces, works as a waiter in a resort and helps himself economically having sex for money with rich older women. During a bomb threat, he is discovered in bed with one of the guest, Leonor Marchioness of Montenegro, and he is fired as a consequence. The Marchioness of Montenegro is an aging aristocrat, ruined economically, but still with wealthy and influential friends. She helps Rafael finds a new job in Madrid as the gardener in the mansion of Antonio Fernández Herrador, Minister of economy in the new democratic Spanish government.', 'Rafael, a young man from the provinces, works as a waiter in a resort and helps himself economically having sex for money with rich older women. During a bomb threat, he is discovered in bed with one of the guest, Leonor Marchioness of Montenegro, and he is fired as a consequence. The Marchioness of Montenegro is an aging aristocrat, ruined economically, but still with wealthy and influential friends. She helps Rafael finds a new job in Madrid as the gardener in the mansion of Antonio Fernández Herrador, Minister of economy in the new democratic Spanish government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b94E64zy2VF8Ok4RSb5W4fcL5x8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115896'),
  ('900470178698801466', 'The Ministers', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Franc. Reyes, Frank Byers', 'Franc. Reyes', 'John Leguizamo, Harvey Keitel, Florencia Lozano, Diane Venora, Wanda De Jesus, Manny Perez, Saul Stein, Benny Nieves', 'R', 'A NYPD detective attempts to avenge the death of her father, but unwittingly becomes involved with one of his killers.', 'A NYPD detective attempts to avenge the death of her father, but unwittingly becomes involved with one of his killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voQjcICAdz11ukMPI1TndkTAWNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26861'),
  ('848777917462152719', 'The Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, War', 'Ed Wild, Hasret Arpaci, Paul Bennett', 'Paul Tamasy, Eric Johnson, Guy Ritchie', 'Henry Cavill, Eiza González, Alan Ritchson, Henry Golding, Cary Elwes, Alex Pettyfer, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Babs Olusanmokun', 'R', 'During World War II, the British Army assigns a group of competent soldiers to carry out a mission against the Nazi forces behind enemy lines... A true story about a secret British WWII organization — the Special Operations Executive. Founded by Winston Churchill, their irregular warfare against the Germans helped to change the course of the war, and gave birth to modern black operations.', 'During World War II, the British Army assigns a group of competent soldiers to carry out a mission against the Nazi forces behind enemy lines... A true story about a secret British WWII organization — the Special Operations Executive. Founded by Winston Churchill, their irregular warfare against the Germans helped to change the course of the war, and gave birth to modern black operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aF0iAKH9MJMYAZdi0Slg77RYa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799583'),
  ('823220903110182444', 'The Miniver Story', 1950, 'Drama', 'H. C. Potter, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Ronald Millar, George Froeschel', 'Greer Garson, Walter Pidgeon, John Hodiak, Leo Genn, Cathy O''Donnell, Reginald Owen, Anthony Bushell, Richard Gale', null, 'The Second World War is over, and the Miniver family is trying to keep themselves together in post-War Britain, among continuing shortages and growing tensions within the family.', 'The Second World War is over, and the Miniver family is trying to keep themselves together in post-War Britain, among continuing shortages and growing tensions within the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDv5a1KUeVmiVsebSYgSIAVsvJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92699'),
  ('299513623968850919', 'The Minor', 1974, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Silvio Amadio, Roberto Silvestrini, Antonio Maccoppi', 'Silvio Amadio, Piero Regnoli', 'Gloria Guida, Rosemary Dexter, Marco Guglielmi, Luciano Roffi, Corrado Pani, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Fabrizio Moroni, Gabriella Lepori', null, 'Suffocated from the strict atmosphere of her high school, Valeria has been experiencing erotic dreams with sadistic motorcyclist rapists, a doctor who decides more than an exam is in order and a torturous priest whipping her in pure delight. After leaving school she finds out that the her bourgeois family setting has something to do with her recurring dreams and suppressed desires. She idealistically seeks out romance and love, but falls short time and time again...', 'Suffocated from the strict atmosphere of her high school, Valeria has been experiencing erotic dreams with sadistic motorcyclist rapists, a doctor who decides more than an exam is in order and a torturous priest whipping her in pure delight. After leaving school she finds out that the her bourgeois family setting has something to do with her recurring dreams and suppressed desires. She idealistically seeks out romance and love, but falls short time and time again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW4xf5DTlykkdpRTGCZcNJ1Z4ih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198380'),
  ('277805197586475608', 'The Minor''s Wife ... Takes Her Pick', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Franz Marischka, Gunter Otto', 'Gunter Otto, Franz Marischka', 'Michel Jacot, Anne Graf, Gunter Wallace, Rinaldo Talamonti, Willy Krause, Ruth Eiben, Marc Nissimoff, Elke Boltenhagen', null, 'Heiner works in a mine, drinks beer, and goes to bed with other women, except from his wife, because of his baby son and the neighbours downstairs. But she does not feel like giving up all the fun for so long.', 'Heiner works in a mine, drinks beer, and goes to bed with other women, except from his wife, because of his baby son and the neighbours downstairs. But she does not feel like giving up all the fun for so long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2j779lPbJz9heRMttJXo2lMrxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265184'),
  ('1077817976284535806', 'The Minus Man', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hampton Fancher, Carolyn Sara Fine, William Paul Clark', 'Hampton Fancher', 'Owen Wilson, Janeane Garofalo, Brian Cox, Mercedes Ruehl, Sheryl Crow, Dwight Yoakam, Dennis Haysbert, Alex Warren', 'R', 'When the quiet and amiable Vann Siegert drifts into town, no one suspects the evil that lies beneath the surface. Despite his easy charm, Vann is merely a reflection of what those he encounters want him to be. Soon, as locals start to disappear, it becomes clear that an eerie subtraction is at work in the sleepy hamlet.', 'When the quiet and amiable Vann Siegert drifts into town, no one suspects the evil that lies beneath the surface. Despite his easy charm, Vann is merely a reflection of what those he encounters want him to be. Soon, as locals start to disappear, it becomes clear that an eerie subtraction is at work in the sleepy hamlet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrui0mDUWY3poirLrjHtoOU1rGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21719'),
  ('640313646184971102', 'The Minute You Wake Up Dead', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Mailer, Adam Biddle, Ruben Mazzoleni', 'Timothy Holland', 'Cole Hauser, Jaimie Alexander, Morgan Freeman, Darren Mann, Andrew Stevens, Kenneth Farmer, Ben VanderMey, Tony DeMil', 'R', 'A stockbroker in a small southern town gets embroiled in an insurance scam with a next-door neighbor that leads to multiple murders when a host of other people want in on the plot. Sheriff Thurmond Fowler, the by-the-book town sheriff for over four decades, works earnestly to try and unravel the town’s mystery and winds up getting more than he bargained for.', 'A stockbroker in a small southern town gets embroiled in an insurance scam with a next-door neighbor that leads to multiple murders when a host of other people want in on the plot. Sheriff Thurmond Fowler, the by-the-book town sheriff for over four decades, works earnestly to try and unravel the town’s mystery and winds up getting more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUPwTbnAqfm95BZjNBnMMf39ChT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934641'),
  ('232794161630282577', 'The Miracle', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Rousselot, Neil Jordan', 'Neil Jordan', 'Beverly D''Angelo, Donal McCann, Niall Byrne, Lorraine Pilkington, J.G. Devlin, Cathleen Delany, Tom Hickey, Shane Connaughton', 'R', 'Two teenagers Jimmy and Rose spend their vacation at the small Irish sea-resort Bray. Out of boredom they observe other people and imagine wild stories about them. One day they observe the blonde Renee, and Jimmy is immediately fascinated by her and even follows her home. She, too, seems to like him, but for a mysterious reason keeps him at a distance.', 'Two teenagers Jimmy and Rose spend their vacation at the small Irish sea-resort Bray. Out of boredom they observe other people and imagine wild stories about them. One day they observe the blonde Renee, and Jimmy is immediately fascinated by her and even follows her home. She, too, seems to like him, but for a mysterious reason keeps him at a distance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzv25hJ20tgRC0VEXCtpGBX1hDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41802'),
  ('7870238583455945', 'The Miracle', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Talat Bulut, Mert Turak, Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Erdem Yener, Erol Demiröz, Ali Sürmeli, Meral Çetinkaya, Büşra Pekin', null, '1960s Turkey countryside. A newly assigned teacher finds out that the solitary village is missing a school. He gets fond of the village people and especially a disabled man. The teacher helps the village to build a new school and educate the children and the disabled man.', '1960s Turkey countryside. A newly assigned teacher finds out that the solitary village is missing a school. He gets fond of the village people and especially a disabled man. The teacher helps the village to build a new school and educate the children and the disabled man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baXozaGF8180QrZFuqlPrlLqCQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321050'),
  ('764302410011214217', 'The Miracle Club', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thaddeus O''Sullivan, John Conroy, Roisin Harrington', 'Timothy Prager, Joshua Maurer, Jimmy Smallhorne', 'Maggie Smith, Laura Linney, Kathy Bates, Agnes O''Casey, Stephen Rea, Mark O''Halloran, Eric D. Smith, Mark McKenna', 'PG-13', 'Three close friends who have never left the outskirts of Dublin (much less Ireland) get the journey of a lifetime — a visit to Lourdes, the picturesque French town and place of miracles.', 'Three close friends who have never left the outskirts of Dublin (much less Ireland) get the journey of a lifetime — a visit to Lourdes, the picturesque French town and place of miracles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MOOL38IZTylA7K04FvJ4PaklaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830721'),
  ('1073450791703062409', 'The Miracle Fighters', 1982, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Ma Koon-Wah', 'Yuen Cheung-Yan, Yuen Woo-Ping, Chiu Chung-Hing', 'Yuen Yat-Choh, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Yuen Cheung-Yan, Brandy Yuen Jan-Yeung, Eddy Ko Hung, Yuen Shun-Yi, Huang Ha, Tino Wong', null, 'Two elderly Taoist priests, Chi Men and Dun Jai, who learn their magic from the same teacher always quarrel with each other. They provide mirth and expert kung fu tuition to young man who is mistakenly presumed to be the crown prince of the Imperial Court, missing since childhood. The emperor dispatches an eunuch with the magic powers to apprehend the young man. But he must first deal with Chi Men and Dun Jia who are the young man''s protector.', 'Two elderly Taoist priests, Chi Men and Dun Jai, who learn their magic from the same teacher always quarrel with each other. They provide mirth and expert kung fu tuition to young man who is mistakenly presumed to be the crown prince of the Imperial Court, missing since childhood. The emperor dispatches an eunuch with the magic powers to apprehend the young man. But he must first deal with Chi Men and Dun Jia who are the young man''s protector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPoK3MR2PJ5naouXxO3DtkOnRp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74262'),
  ('838147238767391443', 'The Miracle in Valby', 1989, 'Family, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Åke Sandgren, Dan Laustsen', 'Åke Sandgren, Stig Larsson', 'Jakob Katz, Troels Asmussen, Lina Englund, Amalie Ihle Alstrup, Gregers Reimann, Ingvar Hirdwall, Mona Seilitz, Jens Okking', null, '14 year old Sven is a technical genius, who has rebuilt an old caravan into a radio communication center. Via radio he is in contact with his father, who works at a big ship at the other side of the globe. One day the radio communication is suddenly interrupted by something which sounds like a Latin mass. In school Sven attends a lesson about radio-astronomy. The teacher explains that astronomers can receive radio waves that are thousand years old. Sven understands that the Latin mass he heard was transmitted to him from another age. He gets curious and starts making experiments by connecting his radio kit to bigger aerials. When he sits in the caravan together with his friends Bo and Petra, they not only hear the Latin mass on his radio, but the whole caravan is turned into a time-machine that brings them to the Middle Ages. They get in trouble with some warriors, who capture Petra, while Sven and Bo escape with the help of their time-machine...', '14 year old Sven is a technical genius, who has rebuilt an old caravan into a radio communication center. Via radio he is in contact with his father, who works at a big ship at the other side of the globe. One day the radio communication is suddenly interrupted by something which sounds like a Latin mass. In school Sven attends a lesson about radio-astronomy. The teacher explains that astronomers can receive radio waves that are thousand years old. Sven understands that the Latin mass he heard was transmitted to him from another age. He gets curious and starts making experiments by connecting his radio kit to bigger aerials. When he sits in the caravan together with his friends Bo and Petra, they not only hear the Latin mass on his radio, but the whole caravan is turned into a time-machine that brings them to the Middle Ages. They get in trouble with some warriors, who capture Petra, while Sven and Bo escape with the help of their time-machine...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdx9BzO8T9rPcESAjKAbgZPetxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33417'),
  ('1122708658967039937', 'The Miracle Maker', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Drama', 'Stanislav Sokolov, Derek W. Hayes', 'Murray Watts', 'Ralph Fiennes, Michael Bryant, Julie Christie, Rebecca Callard, James Frain, Richard E. Grant, Ian Holm, William Hurt', null, 'A mother and father in search of help for their sick daughter cross paths with an extraordinary carpenter named Jesus, who has devoted his life to spreading God''s word. An amazing miracle brings to light the true meaning of Christ, and the sacrifices he endured for the deliverance of mankind. A compelling story of faith, trust, and devotion.', 'A mother and father in search of help for their sick daughter cross paths with an extraordinary carpenter named Jesus, who has devoted his life to spreading God''s word. An amazing miracle brings to light the true meaning of Christ, and the sacrifices he endured for the deliverance of mankind. A compelling story of faith, trust, and devotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdloDloT8L5UehG5kMpoSTjfmZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30628'),
  ('1133418514354511893', 'The Miracle of Bern', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sönke Wortmann', null, 'Louis Klamroth, Peter Lohmeyer, Johanna Gastdorf, Mirko Lang, Birthe Wolter, Katharina Wackernagel, Peter Franke, Sascha Göpel', null, 'The movie deals with the championship-winning German soccer team of 1954. Its story is linked with two others: The family of a young boy is split due to the events in World War II, and the father returns from Russia after eleven years. The second story is about a reporter and his wife reporting from the tournament.', 'The movie deals with the championship-winning German soccer team of 1954. Its story is linked with two others: The family of a young boy is split due to the events in World War II, and the father returns from Russia after eleven years. The second story is about a reporter and his wife reporting from the tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujNucP3lk3VpJAswjNBUc0DYHPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1611'),
  ('1004950728040637830', 'The Miracle of Marcelino', 1955, 'Drama', 'Ladislao Vajda, Heinrich Gärtner', null, 'Pablito Calvo, Rafael Rivelles, Antonio Vico, Juan Calvo, José Marco Davó, José Nieto, Fernando Rey, Juanjo Menéndez', 'NR', 'Left on the doorstep of a monastery as an infant, Marcelino was raised by the monks. He was well-cared for but lonely and missed having a mother. One day he found a special friend in the forbidden attic, hanging on a cross. A friend that would repay Marcelino''s kindness by granting him one heart-felt wish.', 'Left on the doorstep of a monastery as an infant, Marcelino was raised by the monks. He was well-cared for but lonely and missed having a mother. One day he found a special friend in the forbidden attic, hanging on a cross. A friend that would repay Marcelino''s kindness by granting him one heart-felt wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kC93MPfNxFGqATbRDQ4fFh6TSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62395'),
  ('284686900918701997', 'The Miracle of Marcelino', 2010, 'Family, Drama', 'José Luis Gutiérrez, Ignacio Prieto', 'Mikel Garcia Bilbao', 'Teresa Ruiz, Alejandro Tommasi, Jorge Lavat, Mark Hernández Mosqueda, Gerardo Moscoso, Gaston Peterson, Andres Fierro, Guillermo Larrea', null, 'Mexico at the beginning of the 20th century: one night the monks of the San Francisco Abbey find a baby in front of their gate. They call the boy Marcelino and take care of the little one with devotion...', 'Mexico at the beginning of the 20th century: one night the monks of the San Francisco Abbey find a baby in front of their gate. They call the boy Marcelino and take care of the little one with devotion...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7yqPRKOv0cpAR1Flv937eOm4bp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75956'),
  ('55386952778716936', 'The Miracle of Morgan''s Creek', 1944, 'Comedy, Romance, War', 'Preston Sturges, John F. Seitz', 'Preston Sturges', 'Eddie Bracken, Betty Hutton, Diana Lynn, William Demarest, Porter Hall, Emory Parnell, Al Bridge, Julius Tannen', 'NR', 'A small-town girl with a soft spot for American soldiers wakes up the morning after a wild farewell party for the troops to find that she married someone she can''t remember.', 'A small-town girl with a soft spot for American soldiers wakes up the morning after a wild farewell party for the troops to find that she married someone she can''t remember.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rf2OgScEs3zsJL0Gp4ZMsR2ScdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42879'),
  ('930905749506237560', 'The Miracle of Our Lady of Fatima', 1952, 'Drama', 'John Brahm, Edwin B. DuPar', 'James O''Hanlon, Crane Wilbur', 'Gilbert Roland, Angela Clarke, Frank Silvera, Jay Novello, Richard Hale, Norman Rice, Frances Morris, Carl Milletaire', 'NR', 'In 1917, three shepherd children living just outside Fatima, Portugal have visions of a lovely lady in a cloud. The anticlerical government wishes to squelch the Church; reports of religious experiences are cause for serious concern. Yet the children stand by their story, and the message of peace and hope the Lady brings. In the last vision, attended by thousands of people, the Lady proves her reality with a spectacular miracle that is seen by everyone present. Based on actual events at Fatima in the summer of 1917.', 'In 1917, three shepherd children living just outside Fatima, Portugal have visions of a lovely lady in a cloud. The anticlerical government wishes to squelch the Church; reports of religious experiences are cause for serious concern. Yet the children stand by their story, and the message of peace and hope the Lady brings. In the last vision, attended by thousands of people, the Lady proves her reality with a spectacular miracle that is seen by everyone present. Based on actual events at Fatima in the summer of 1917.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIAnF7FtMpiSZXTZhS9W5e6Zb0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49616'),
  ('38395044540827876', 'The Miracle of P. Tinto', 1998, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Javier Fesser, Paco Pino, Pedro Manuel Lazaga', 'Javier Fesser, Guillermo Fesser', 'Luis Ciges, Pablo Pinedo, Silvia Casanova, Emilio Gavira, Javier Aller, Janfri Topera, Bermúdez, Tomás Sáez', null, 'Wafer factory-owner P. Tinto and his wife Olivia want a child of their own more than anything else in the world. Years of trying, however, have left them with nothing but a pair of extraterrestrial midgets living in the spare bedroom. When they decide to try adoption, a series of misroutings and chance encounters results in an escaped adult mental patient arriving at their door with adoption papers in hand. P. Tinto and Olivia accept this without question and welcome him in as their son. Can this family arrangement work?', 'Wafer factory-owner P. Tinto and his wife Olivia want a child of their own more than anything else in the world. Years of trying, however, have left them with nothing but a pair of extraterrestrial midgets living in the spare bedroom. When they decide to try adoption, a series of misroutings and chance encounters results in an escaped adult mental patient arriving at their door with adoption papers in hand. P. Tinto and Olivia accept this without question and welcome him in as their son. Can this family arrangement work?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcADIJ08E0m95gI1BZGN7ZjJqxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30145'),
  ('1012514202095600282', 'The Miracle of the Bells', 1948, 'Drama', 'Irving Pichel, Robert De Grasse, Harry D''Arcy', 'Ben Hecht, Quentin Reynolds', 'Fred MacMurray, Alida Valli, Frank Sinatra, Lee J. Cobb, Harold Vermilyea, Charles Meredith, James Nolan, Veronica Pataky', 'NR', 'The body of a young actress is brought to her home town by the man who loved her. He knows that she wanted all the church bells to ring for three days after she was buried, but is told that this will cost a lot of money. The checks that he writes to the various churches all bounce, but it is the weekend and, in desperation, he prays that a miracle will happen before the banks reopen. It does, but not in the way he hoped.', 'The body of a young actress is brought to her home town by the man who loved her. He knows that she wanted all the church bells to ring for three days after she was buried, but is told that this will cost a lot of money. The checks that he writes to the various churches all bounce, but it is the weekend and, in desperation, he prays that a miracle will happen before the banks reopen. It does, but not in the way he hoped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1C8wDuJoCZ5BhtAGinhejcyjcge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43456'),
  ('933116954449197035', 'The Miracle on 34th Street', 1955, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Stevenson, Lloyd Ahern Sr.', 'George Seaton', 'Macdonald Carey, Teresa Wright, Thomas Mitchell, Sandy Descher, Hans Conried, Ray Collins, Dick Foran, John Abbott', null, 'One Kris Kringle, a department-store Santa Claus, causes quite a commotion by suggesting customers go to a rival store for their purchases. But this is nothing to the stir he causes by announcing that he is not merely a make-believe St. Nick, but the real thing.', 'One Kris Kringle, a department-store Santa Claus, causes quite a commotion by suggesting customers go to a rival store for their purchases. But this is nothing to the stir he causes by announcing that he is not merely a make-believe St. Nick, but the real thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csvpHmWBtpTvsPVvrqLDQJcX8hQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141871'),
  ('280956658933820862', 'The Miracle Season', 2018, 'Drama', 'Brian Pearson, Pete Shilaimon, Jason Still', 'Elissa Matsueda, David Aaron Cohen', 'Erin Moriarty, Danika Yarosh, Helen Hunt, William Hurt, Nesta Cooper, Jason Gray-Stanford, Natalie Sharp, Tiera Skovbye', 'PG', 'After the tragic death of star volleyball player Caroline "Line" Found, a team of dispirited high school girls must band together under the guidance of their tough-love coach in hopes of winning the state championship!', 'After the tragic death of star volleyball player Caroline "Line" Found, a team of dispirited high school girls must band together under the guidance of their tough-love coach in hopes of winning the state championship!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIVYjwi8QcZ9AQk4WRYgW4iUmXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425373'),
  ('547807908190509718', 'The Miracle Woman', 1931, 'Drama', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker, Sam Nelson', 'Jo Swerling, Robert Riskin, John Meehan', 'Barbara Stanwyck, David Manners, Sam Hardy, Beryl Mercer, Russell Hopton, Charles Middleton, Eddie Boland, Thelma Hill', 'NR', 'After an unappreciated minister dies, his daughter loses her faith in God, prompting her to open a phony temple with a con man. Can the love of a blind former aviator restore her faith and happiness?', 'After an unappreciated minister dies, his daughter loses her faith in God, prompting her to open a phony temple with a con man. Can the love of a blind former aviator restore her faith and happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwtCXSnl2RhLu9KFtBSbQpAhoqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44463'),
  ('742327645927305420', 'The Miracle Worker', 1979, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul Aaron, Lon Massey III, Ted Voigtlander', 'William Gibson', 'Patty Duke, Melissa Gilbert, Diana Muldaur, Charles Siebert, Anne Seymour, Stanley Wells, Hilda Haynes, Titos Vandis', null, 'The true story of Helen Keller and Annie Sullivan, a gripping battle to overcome impossible obstacles and the struggle to communicate. As a young girl, Helen Keller is stricken with scarlet fever. The illness leaves her blind, mute, and deaf. Sealed off from the world, Helen cannot communicate with anyone, nor anyone with her. Often frustrated and desperate, Helen flies into uncontrollable rages and tantrums that terrify her hopeless family. The gifted teacher Annie Sullivan is summoned by the family to help the girl understand the world from which she is isolated, freeing Helen Keller from her internal prison forever. Television remake of the 1962 film which also starred Patty Duke in the role of Helen Keller.', 'The true story of Helen Keller and Annie Sullivan, a gripping battle to overcome impossible obstacles and the struggle to communicate. As a young girl, Helen Keller is stricken with scarlet fever. The illness leaves her blind, mute, and deaf. Sealed off from the world, Helen cannot communicate with anyone, nor anyone with her. Often frustrated and desperate, Helen flies into uncontrollable rages and tantrums that terrify her hopeless family. The gifted teacher Annie Sullivan is summoned by the family to help the girl understand the world from which she is isolated, freeing Helen Keller from her internal prison forever. Television remake of the 1962 film which also starred Patty Duke in the role of Helen Keller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XUMATsAU1ZUjNWi5ZBf6thmUDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257578'),
  ('1099007701206578530', 'The Miracle Worker', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nadia Tass, David Parker', 'Monte Merrick', 'Hallie Eisenberg, Alison Elliott, David Strathairn, Lucas Black, Kate Greenhouse, Stewart Arnott', 'PG', 'Devoted teacher Anne Sullivan leads deaf, blind and mute Helen Keller out of solitude and helps integrate her into the world.', 'Devoted teacher Anne Sullivan leads deaf, blind and mute Helen Keller out of solitude and helps integrate her into the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0PfwIMM7Mkit0ZoLzspgOWrmsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1163'),
  ('257424054401768245', 'The Miracles of the Namiya General Store', 2017, 'Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Family', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Atsuhiro Nabeshima, Takafumi Kitaoka', 'Hiroshi Saito', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Machiko Ono, Toshiyuki Nishida, Nijiro Murakami, Kanichiro Sato, Kento Hayashi, Riko Narumi, Mugi Kadowaki', null, 'In 2012, Atsuya and his 2 childhood friends do something bad and run into an old general store. They decide to stay there until the morning. Late into the night, Atsuya sees a letter in the mailbox. The letter is addressed to the Namiya General Store and the letter was written by someone to consult about worries. Incredibly, the letter was written 32 years ago. The mailbox is somehow connected to the year 1980. Atsuya and his friends decide to write a reply and place their letter in the mailbox.', 'In 2012, Atsuya and his 2 childhood friends do something bad and run into an old general store. They decide to stay there until the morning. Late into the night, Atsuya sees a letter in the mailbox. The letter is addressed to the Namiya General Store and the letter was written by someone to consult about worries. Incredibly, the letter was written 32 years ago. The mailbox is somehow connected to the year 1980. Atsuya and his friends decide to write a reply and place their letter in the mailbox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ebBoOAva5PiPkkG9zkDzCpqCt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477652'),
  ('909199720646420662', 'The Mirage', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ricardo Trogi, Catherine Didelot, Jonathan Decoste', 'Louis Morissette', 'Louis Morissette, Julie Perreault, Christine Beaulieu, Patrice Robitaille, Alexandra Cyr, Émile Boucher, Jasmine Lemée, Lorna Gordon', null, 'Le Mirage is the perspective of a man in his thirties asking himself "what am I chasing?" Our society has become all about consumerism, if not excess. Success is determined by what and how much we have and "stuff" becomes the band-aid to a meaningless existence. Stuff fills the void of the existence we weren''t meant to lead.', 'Le Mirage is the perspective of a man in his thirties asking himself "what am I chasing?" Our society has become all about consumerism, if not excess. Success is determined by what and how much we have and "stuff" becomes the band-aid to a meaningless existence. Stuff fills the void of the existence we weren''t meant to lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myF1Uwf0LSvqPixkT76tpZpTq4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353163'),
  ('254317224250402775', 'The Mirror', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erden Kıral, Kenan Ormanlar', 'Erden Kıral', 'Nur Sürer, Suavi Eren, Hikmet Çelik, Nikos Skiadas, Vasilis Tsaglos, Vera Deludi', null, 'Zelihan and Necmettin, a young couple, live in a small village in the service of an agha. They share their poor "one-eye" room with the agha''s ox. In this environment of poverty and loneliness, the agha''s brother is determined to seduce Zelihan, whom he has set his eyes on.', 'Zelihan and Necmettin, a young couple, live in a small village in the service of an agha. They share their poor "one-eye" room with the agha''s ox. In this environment of poverty and loneliness, the agha''s brother is determined to seduce Zelihan, whom he has set his eyes on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UKukHfKLU8woG0q4Fr3o4LYGwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204154'),
  ('1126736545109087404', 'The Mirror', 1997, 'Drama', 'Jafar Panahi, Farzad Jadat, Hassan Yektapanah', 'Jafar Panahi', 'Mina Mohammad Khani, Kazem Mojdehi, Naser Omuni, M. Shirzad, T. Samadpour', null, 'When a young girl''s mother doesn''t meet her after school, she tries to navigate the streets of Tehran by herself.', 'When a young girl''s mother doesn''t meet her after school, she tries to navigate the streets of Tehran by herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/386PqQoYxUIHV2i03jXG8sS5Q8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40882'),
  ('738830142305523090', 'The Mirror', 2010, 'Family', 'Laurent Fauchere, Antoine Tinguely, Sonia Rossier', 'Laurent Fauchere, Antoine Tinguely, Pierrick Destraz', 'Zacharie Destraz, Jules Martinet, Pierrick Destraz, Henri Destraz, Zoé Tinguely, Patricia Rodrigues', null, 'About a man going from early childhood to old age in the time it takes to freshen up.', 'About a man going from early childhood to old age in the time it takes to freshen up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSjw0QsOeStmnAbZeIGrjfOp4dd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212295'),
  ('20124787367458161', 'The Mirror Crack''d', 1980, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Guy Hamilton, Christopher Challis', 'Jonathan Hales, Barry Sandler', 'Angela Lansbury, Geraldine Chaplin, Tony Curtis, Edward Fox, Rock Hudson, Kim Novak, Elizabeth Taylor, Wendy Morgan', 'PG', 'Jane Marple solves the mystery when a local woman is poisoned and a visiting movie star seems to have been the intended victim.', 'Jane Marple solves the mystery when a local woman is poisoned and a visiting movie star seems to have been the intended victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rirt2BbnEDzgWfUzsAew0qHm1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6028'),
  ('1052192715951375008', 'The Mirror Has Two Faces', 1958, 'Drama', 'André Cayatte', 'Gérard Oury, André Cayatte', 'Michèle Morgan, Bourvil, Ivan Desny, Gérard Oury, Sylvie, Elisabeth Manet, Jane Marken, Georges Chamarat', null, 'A teacher runs an ad in the newspaper to find a wife. Afraid of beautiful ladies, he weds an ugly woman. After a car accident, he meets a doctor who offers to reveal his wife''s beauty.', 'A teacher runs an ad in the newspaper to find a wife. Afraid of beautiful ladies, he weds an ugly woman. After a car accident, he meets a doctor who offers to reveal his wife''s beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjQARa5H5WF74bBiGmkZedJHy7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86260'),
  ('356313752105072412', 'The Mirror Has Two Faces', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Barbra Streisand, Dante Spinotti, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'Richard LaGravenese', 'Barbra Streisand, Jeff Bridges, Pierce Brosnan, Lauren Bacall, Mimi Rogers, George Segal, Brenda Vaccaro, Austin Pendleton', 'PG-13', 'Rose Morgan, who still lives with her mother, is a professor of Romantic Literature who desperately longs for passion in her life. Gregory Larkin, a mathematics professor, has been burned by passionate relationships and longs for a sexless union based on friendship and respect.', 'Rose Morgan, who still lives with her mother, is a professor of Romantic Literature who desperately longs for passion in her life. Gregory Larkin, a mathematics professor, has been burned by passionate relationships and longs for a sexless union based on friendship and respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekk8MKMp3tlJjcMuhOgKsMCRrvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25189'),
  ('911079453820962893', 'The Misadventures of Hedi and Cokeman', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Julien Royal', 'Nassim Lyes, Julien Royal', 'Hedi Bouchenafa, Nassim Lyes, Fred Testot, Benjamin Tranié, Vincent Desagnat, Bun-hay Mean, Charlotte Gabris, Boris Gamthety', 'NR', 'In Paris, two dysfunctional dealers use family ties to try to boost their small drug business in this crass comedy based on the webseries.', 'In Paris, two dysfunctional dealers use family ties to try to boost their small drug business in this crass comedy based on the webseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6lnTrwkxM8ppIdTQL0keDuNrtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659063'),
  ('826503475372360058', 'The Misadventures of Merlin Jones', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Family, Comedy', 'Robert Stevenson, Edward Colman', 'Alfred Lewis Levitt', 'Tommy Kirk, Annette Funicello, Leon Ames, Stuart Erwin, Alan Hewitt, Connie Gilchrist, Norman Grabowski, Burt Mustin', null, 'Merlin Jones, a precocious and intelligent high-school boy, experiments with hypnosis and creates a mind-reading machine. However, his experiments land him in deep trouble with the law.', 'Merlin Jones, a precocious and intelligent high-school boy, experiments with hypnosis and creates a mind-reading machine. However, his experiments land him in deep trouble with the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzayW3AacpmxyTbnlQCh5Y9qQbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64873'),
  ('917459987075795850', 'The Misandrists', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bruce LaBruce, James Carman, Yotam Ishay', 'Bruce LaBruce', 'Susanne Sachße, Viva Ruiz, Kembra Pfahler, Caprice Crawford, Grete Gehrke, Kita Updike, Victoire Laly, Olivia Kundisch', null, 'In Ger(wo)many, when an army of radical females is preparing for a final revolution and a utopian world without men, a young male soldier arrives seeking refuge at the convent.', 'In Ger(wo)many, when an army of radical females is preparing for a final revolution and a utopian world without men, a young male soldier arrives seeking refuge at the convent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSAPYrWmR1cGo4y1crWGGA3MInE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440038'),
  ('364999409772505983', 'The Mischief Makers', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Jean Malige, François Truffaut, Claude de Givray', 'François Truffaut', 'Gérard Blain, Bernadette Lafont, Michel François, Alain Baldy, Robert Bulle, Henri Demaegdt, Dimitri Moretti, Daniel Ricaulx', null, 'A group of young boys develops a crush on a girl, leading to jealousy toward her boyfriend. They scheme to disrupt their relationship, and when the boyfriend catches one of them spying, he punishes him harshly. In retaliation, the boys attempt to make the girl doubt her boyfriend''s love.', 'A group of young boys develops a crush on a girl, leading to jealousy toward her boyfriend. They scheme to disrupt their relationship, and when the boyfriend catches one of them spying, he punishes him harshly. In retaliation, the boys attempt to make the girl doubt her boyfriend''s love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfRDSP9HbDSNkCJcBTDfIj74Pbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35847'),
  ('789525037268497987', 'The Miseducation of Cameron Post', 2018, 'Drama', 'Desiree Akhavan, Ashley Connor, Frank Baran', 'Desiree Akhavan, Cecilia Frugiuele', 'Chloë Grace Moretz, Sasha Lane, Forrest Goodluck, John Gallagher Jr., Jennifer Ehle, Marin Ireland, Owen Campbell, Kerry Butler', 'NR', 'Pennsylvania, 1993. After getting caught with another girl, teenager Cameron Post is sent to a conversion therapy center run by the strict Dr. Lydia Marsh and her brother, Reverend Rick, whose treatment consists in repenting for feeling “same sex attraction.” Cameron befriends fellow sinners Jane and Adam, thus creating a new family to deal with the surrounding intolerance.', 'Pennsylvania, 1993. After getting caught with another girl, teenager Cameron Post is sent to a conversion therapy center run by the strict Dr. Lydia Marsh and her brother, Reverend Rick, whose treatment consists in repenting for feeling “same sex attraction.” Cameron befriends fellow sinners Jane and Adam, thus creating a new family to deal with the surrounding intolerance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFLJDW3na8AADFzQJT6bM1VU5zs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426613'),
  ('905050060100899312', 'The Miser', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Louis de Funès, Edmond Richard, Jean Girault', 'Louis de Funès, Jean Girault', 'Louis de Funès, Michel Galabru, Claude Gensac, Bernard Ménez, Guy Grosso, Michel Modo, Henri Génès, Hervé Bellon', null, 'The children of Harpagon, Cléante and his sister Elise, are each in love but they still haven’t spoken to their father yet. Harpagon is a miser who wants to choose the right man and the right woman for his children. Based on Molière’s play.', 'The children of Harpagon, Cléante and his sister Elise, are each in love but they still haven’t spoken to their father yet. Harpagon is a miser who wants to choose the right man and the right woman for his children. Based on Molière’s play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogjed6gHn7o35i8Fo72DuXvDppa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11680'),
  ('386997727216396690', 'The Miser', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Tonino Cervi, Massimo Carocci, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Tonino Cervi, Cesare Frugoni, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Laura Antonelli, Valérie Allain, Franco Angrisano, Miguel Bosé, Lucia Bosè, Carlo Croccolo, Nicola Farron', null, 'Misery money-lender Arpagone is looking to arrange three weddings simultaneously - to cut down on costs. One for himself and the others for his two children. Of course he doesn''t approve of the choices his son and daughter have made and conspires to arrange more well to do spouses against their will. However, fate will prove itself to be on the side of true love, not of the greedy.', 'Misery money-lender Arpagone is looking to arrange three weddings simultaneously - to cut down on costs. One for himself and the others for his two children. Of course he doesn''t approve of the choices his son and daughter have made and conspires to arrange more well to do spouses against their will. However, fate will prove itself to be on the side of true love, not of the greedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyZyiwgheW5IdbwZhaf0AvCSoI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82471'),
  ('212741930557704451', 'The Misfit Brigade', 1987, 'War, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Gordon Hessler, Djordje Nikolic', 'Nelson Gidding', 'Bruce Davison, David Patrick Kelly, D.W. Moffett, Jay O. Sanders, Keith Szarabajka, Oliver Reed, David Carradine, Branko Vidaković', null, 'War story of the 27th Panzers, Hitler''s heavy-duty combat regiment composed of prisoners.', 'War story of the 27th Panzers, Hitler''s heavy-duty combat regiment composed of prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gzKUnPsnPUz17566fCejSW1bMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21840'),
  ('211993875725949581', 'The Misfits', 1961, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Russell Metty, John Huston, John Gaudioso', 'Arthur Miller', 'Marilyn Monroe, Clark Gable, Eli Wallach, Montgomery Clift, Thelma Ritter, James Barton, Kevin McCarthy, Estelle Winwood', 'NR', 'While filing for a divorce, beautiful ex-stripper Roslyn Taber ends up meeting aging cowboy-turned-gambler Gay Langland and former World War II aviator Guido Racanelli. The two men instantly become infatuated with Roslyn and, on a whim, the three decide to move into Guido''s half-finished desert home together. When grizzled ex-rodeo rider Perce Howland arrives, the unlikely foursome strike up a business capturing wild horses.', 'While filing for a divorce, beautiful ex-stripper Roslyn Taber ends up meeting aging cowboy-turned-gambler Gay Langland and former World War II aviator Guido Racanelli. The two men instantly become infatuated with Roslyn and, on a whim, the three decide to move into Guido''s half-finished desert home together. When grizzled ex-rodeo rider Perce Howland arrives, the unlikely foursome strike up a business capturing wild horses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkIkyPhT5oetT463HxpdIuct30l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11536'),
  ('385829895789416733', 'The Misfits', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Denis Alarkon-Ramires, Renny Harlin', 'Robert Henny, Kurt Wimmer', 'Pierce Brosnan, Tim Roth, Nick Cannon, Rami Jaber, Jamie Chung, Hermione Corfield, Mike Angelo, Qais Qandil', 'R', 'After being recruited by a group of unconventional thieves, renowned criminal Richard Pace finds himself caught up in an elaborate gold heist that promises to have far-reaching implications on his life and the lives of countless others.', 'After being recruited by a group of unconventional thieves, renowned criminal Richard Pace finds himself caught up in an elaborate gold heist that promises to have far-reaching implications on his life and the lives of countless others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPOyYnCkRbWAEem85N3VFpQODf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581644'),
  ('358109766446383037', 'The Misfits Club', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Carlos Sedes', 'Adolfo Valor, Ramón Campos, Cristóbal Garrido', 'Charlotte Vega, Àlex Maruny, Jorge Clemente, Michelle Calvó, Andrea Trepat, Ivana Baquero, Yon González, Patrick Criado', null, 'Valeria has just moved to Madrid after her parent''s separation. What at first seems a bad start for her new life becomes the beginning of an amazing life experience. New friendships, a city full of possibilities, first love...', 'Valeria has just moved to Madrid after her parent''s separation. What at first seems a bad start for her new life becomes the beginning of an amazing life experience. New friendships, a city full of possibilities, first love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FHk0h9sgPoZ9VowdD8dSWRqoZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261102'),
  ('13166341315196972', 'The Misfortunates', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Felix van Groeningen, Ruben Impens', 'Felix van Groeningen, Christophe Dirickx, Dimitri Verhulst', 'Kenneth Vanbaeden, Valentijn Dhaenens, Koen De Graeve, Wouter Hendrickx, Johan Heldenbergh, Bert Haelvoet, Gilda De Bal, Natali Broods', null, '13-year-old Gunther Strobbe grows up surrounded by alcohol, trash and his completely useless father and uncles. Slowly but surely, he''s being prepared for the same hapless life. Can he defy his destiny?', '13-year-old Gunther Strobbe grows up surrounded by alcohol, trash and his completely useless father and uncles. Slowly but surely, he''s being prepared for the same hapless life. Can he defy his destiny?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RjVHr752QAaoQ1SHCx0JwnZwtY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33806'),
