  ('139572111723689268', 'The Miss Of The Mister', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Nikos Dimopoulos, Yiorgos Stamboulopoulos', 'Nikos Tsiforos', 'Dinos Iliopoulos, Gelly Mavropoulou, Hristos Tsaganeas, Ketty Panou, Bety Moshona, Periklis Hristoforidis, Vasos Andronidis, Popi Lazou', null, 'Minas, a conscientious and honest employee, is responsible for procurement at the company where he works. His wife, Eva, is a faithful and obedient spouse who embraces her husband''s principles, but she enjoys luxury, furs, and jewelry. One day, her husband''s boss approaches her and suggests that she recommend one of his suppliers to Minas, without any compensation. Thus begins a story in which, behind her husband''s back, Eva earns money, which she justifies as an inheritance from an uncle. However, when Minas discovers her trick, every trickster sits on his bench.', 'Minas, a conscientious and honest employee, is responsible for procurement at the company where he works. His wife, Eva, is a faithful and obedient spouse who embraces her husband''s principles, but she enjoys luxury, furs, and jewelry. One day, her husband''s boss approaches her and suggests that she recommend one of his suppliers to Minas, without any compensation. Thus begins a story in which, behind her husband''s back, Eva earns money, which she justifies as an inheritance from an uncle. However, when Minas discovers her trick, every trickster sits on his bench.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LbVgHchXoMspWP3WK2Qp3Bob2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410533'),
  ('639955640471274723', 'The Missiles of October', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Anthony Page', 'Stanley R. Greenberg', 'William Devane, Ralph Bellamy, Howard Da Silva, James Hong, Martin Sheen, James T. Callahan, Peter Canon, Keene Curtis', null, 'Based in part on Robert F. Kennedy''s book, "Thirteen Days," this film profiles the Kennedy Administration''s actions during the Cuban Missile Crisis.', 'Based in part on Robert F. Kennedy''s book, "Thirteen Days," this film profiles the Kennedy Administration''s actions during the Cuban Missile Crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xS4gNyO8vAGn1wObfd7HdYzfdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59922'),
  ('81973366700422847', 'The Missing', 2003, 'Thriller, Western, Adventure', 'Salvatore Totino, Ron Howard', 'Ken Kaufman', 'Cate Blanchett, Tommy Lee Jones, Evan Rachel Wood, Jenna Boyd, Aaron Eckhart, Val Kilmer, Eric Schweig, Steve Reevis', 'R', 'When rancher and single mother of two Maggie Gilkeson sees her teenage daughter, Lily, kidnapped by Apache rebels, she reluctantly accepts the help of her estranged father, Samuel, in tracking down the kidnappers. Along the way, the two must learn to reconcile the past and work together if they are going to have any hope of getting Lily back before she is taken over the border and forced to become a prostitute.', 'When rancher and single mother of two Maggie Gilkeson sees her teenage daughter, Lily, kidnapped by Apache rebels, she reluctantly accepts the help of her estranged father, Samuel, in tracking down the kidnappers. Along the way, the two must learn to reconcile the past and work together if they are going to have any hope of getting Lily back before she is taken over the border and forced to become a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86s5nw5F1G8lJtEowO0LBB4hoBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12146'),
  ('1030111767384734122', 'The Missing Gun', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Lu Chuan, Xie Zhengyu', 'Lu Chuan', 'Jiang Wen, Ning Jing, Shi Liang, Liu Xiaoning, Wu Yujuan, Han Sanping, Nina FanHuang, Deng Gang', null, 'After a policeman gets drunk and loses his service weapon, he frantically searches for his revolver and the killer who murdered his former lover.', 'After a policeman gets drunk and loses his service weapon, he frantically searches for his revolver and the killer who murdered his former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG14eUFqiJUmKv5L1kdljPgVFkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83277'),
  ('379927885339810146', 'The Missing Lady', 1946, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Phil Karlson', null, 'Kane Richmond, Barbara Read, George Chandler, James Flavin, Pierre Watkin, Ray Teal, Dorothea Kent, Almira Sessions', null, 'While investigating the theft of a valuable jade statue known as "The Missing Lady" -- and the subsequent murder of an art dealer -- imperceptible sleuth Lamont Cranston aka the Shadow (Kane Richmond) finds himself being blamed for the crime. It doesn''t help the Shadow''s claims of innocence when more bodies begin piling up. Good thing he knows exactly who''s guilty among an increasingly smaller group of suspects.', 'While investigating the theft of a valuable jade statue known as "The Missing Lady" -- and the subsequent murder of an art dealer -- imperceptible sleuth Lamont Cranston aka the Shadow (Kane Richmond) finds himself being blamed for the crime. It doesn''t help the Shadow''s claims of innocence when more bodies begin piling up. Good thing he knows exactly who''s guilty among an increasingly smaller group of suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbrfDmO2ea7qnGe8Kd6PHFmLfih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162009'),
  ('551761813006585840', 'The Missing Link', 1980, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Picha', 'Christian Dura, Picha, Jean Colette', 'Ron Venable, John Graham, Bob Kaliban, Christopher Guest, Clark Warren, Mark Smith, Joseph Plewa, Jonathon Schmock', 'R', 'A woman in prehistoric times gives birth to twins, one of whom is rejected by the tribe and adopted by a brontosaurus and a talkative pterodactyl.', 'A woman in prehistoric times gives birth to twins, one of whom is rejected by the tribe and adopted by a brontosaurus and a talkative pterodactyl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bD4Ibqdwr0yW27GwUZT9J2RSvAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48279'),
  ('652641919102059653', 'The Missing Lynx', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Raúl García, Manuel Sicilia, David Cabrera', 'Raúl García', 'David Robles, Beatriz Berciano, Cecilia Santiago, Abraham Aguilar, Roberto Cuenca Martínez, Stephen Hughes, Carlos del Pino, Pepa Castro', 'PG', 'An eccentric millionaire becomes obsessed with the idea of constructing a new Noah''s Ark. He hires a hunter to kidnap untoward numbers of animals to make this happen. The group of animals amid their valiant attempt to escape from the hunter''s clutches, foil his nefarious plans, and free their captured friends.', 'An eccentric millionaire becomes obsessed with the idea of constructing a new Noah''s Ark. He hires a hunter to kidnap untoward numbers of animals to make this happen. The group of animals amid their valiant attempt to escape from the hunter''s clutches, foil his nefarious plans, and free their captured friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rV0mIugkrdLNMS8m3O1OM5TLf63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29192'),
  ('571888121127000305', 'The Missing Mouse', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Paul Frees', 'NR', 'A moment after a bottle of white shoe polish pours on Jerry, Tom hears on the radio that a white mouse, having swallowed an explosive, has escaped from an experimental laboratory and that slightest jar of the mouse could cause it to explode and blow up the entire city. It is then that Tom notices now-white Jerry and concludes it''s the escapee.', 'A moment after a bottle of white shoe polish pours on Jerry, Tom hears on the radio that a white mouse, having swallowed an explosive, has escaped from an experimental laboratory and that slightest jar of the mouse could cause it to explode and blow up the entire city. It is then that Tom notices now-white Jerry and concludes it''s the escapee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu1tagCFOtPUxSSCQIomHmdqoeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73676'),
  ('810458318274868643', 'The Missing Person', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Noah Buschel, Ryan Samul', 'Noah Buschel', 'Michael Shannon, Amy Ryan, Frank Wood, Linda Emond, John Ventimiglia, Margaret Colin, Paul Sparks, Yul Vazquez', null, 'John Rosow drinks to forget. He is a former New York City cop turned Chicago-based private investigator. At the last minute, he is hired by someone he''s never met to follow a middle-aged male subject on the soon-departing California Zephyr train to Los Angeles.', 'John Rosow drinks to forget. He is a former New York City cop turned Chicago-based private investigator. At the last minute, he is hired by someone he''s never met to follow a middle-aged male subject on the soon-departing California Zephyr train to Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwjX5pXrylMXtPCmYq7MzoTVJ5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35219'),
  ('239121568339549757', 'The Missing Picture', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Prum Mésar, Narith Roeun, Rithy Panh', 'Christophe Bataille, Rithy Panh', 'Randal Douc, Jean-Baptiste Phou', null, 'Rithy Panh uses clay figures, archival footage, and his narration to recreate the atrocities Cambodia''s Khmer Rouge committed between 1975 and 1979.', 'Rithy Panh uses clay figures, archival footage, and his narration to recreate the atrocities Cambodia''s Khmer Rouge committed between 1975 and 1979.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPE5WXwdwKvQ1un90yKEBrh7aY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186997'),
  ('1062884327476741052', 'The Missing Star', 2006, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Lillo Iacolino, Shi Yang', 'Gianni Amelio, Umberto Contarello', 'Sergio Castellitto, Tai Ling, Angelo Costabile, Hiu Sun Ha, Shi Yang, Catherine Sng, Enrico Vanigiani, Roberto Rossi', null, 'Vincenzo, former head of maintenance of a steel plant that''s been outsourced, travels from Italy to China to warn about a defective blast furnace.', 'Vincenzo, former head of maintenance of a steel plant that''s been outsourced, travels from Italy to China to warn about a defective blast furnace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbiS6hlQl8qKOKanThCPBvY6vsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24189'),
  ('413508087468075892', 'The Mission', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, History', 'Roland Joffé, Chris Menges, Norman Dorme', 'Robert Bolt', 'Robert De Niro, Jeremy Irons, Ray McAnally, Aidan Quinn, Liam Neeson, Cherie Lunghi, Ronald Pickup, Chuck Low', 'PG', 'When a Spanish Jesuit goes into the South American wilderness to build a mission in the hope of converting the Indians of the region, a slave hunter is converted and joins his mission. When Spain sells the colony to Portugal, they are forced to defend all they have built against the Portuguese aggressors.', 'When a Spanish Jesuit goes into the South American wilderness to build a mission in the hope of converting the Indians of the region, a slave hunter is converted and joins his mission. When Spain sells the colony to Portugal, they are forced to defend all they have built against the Portuguese aggressors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K9cG6LOOtySZF4D4xBu1MApC1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11416'),
  ('73396522090399561', 'The Mission', 1999, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Jackie Lui Chung-Yin, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Lam Suet, Simon Yam, Eddy Ko Hung, Wong Tin-Lam', null, 'Triad boss Lung, who has just escaped being killed in an assassination attempt hires the killers Curtis, James, Mike, Roy and Shin for his protection.', 'Triad boss Lung, who has just escaped being killed in an assassination attempt hires the killers Curtis, James, Mike, Roy and Shin for his protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDhY2UjbT64vqfO1NDiPH0AxQIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45871'),
  ('797052764323275713', 'The Mission', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Jesse Moss, Thorsten Thielow, Amanda McBaine', 'Amanda McBaine, Jesse Moss', 'Pam Arlund, Dan Davis, Levi Davis, Daniel Everett, Lawrence Kao, David Shih', 'PG-13', 'American Christian missionary John Chau was murdered when he tried to illegally contact and convert some of the world’s last uncontacted indigenous people. Through exclusive interviews and archival footage of John’s journey, THE MISSION explores themes that strike deep at the heart of religion, colonialism, and anthropology, questioning where we draw the line between faith and fanaticism, exploration and exploitation, imagination and destruction.', 'American Christian missionary John Chau was murdered when he tried to illegally contact and convert some of the world’s last uncontacted indigenous people. Through exclusive interviews and archival footage of John’s journey, THE MISSION explores themes that strike deep at the heart of religion, colonialism, and anthropology, questioning where we draw the line between faith and fanaticism, exploration and exploitation, imagination and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGmeAMvTlgvziM2CVDhl9Dumwe5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1117644'),
  ('804161969147076507', 'The Missionary', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Richard Loncraine, Maggie Gray, Irene Lamb', 'Michael Palin', 'Michael Palin, Maggie Smith, Trevor Howard, Denholm Elliott, Graham Crowden, Phoebe Nicholls, Michael Hordern, David Suchet', 'R', 'In 1905, after 10 years of missionary work in Africa, the Rev. Charles Fortesque is recalled to England, where his bishop gives him his new assignment - to minister to London''s prostitutes.', 'In 1905, after 10 years of missionary work in Africa, the Rev. Charles Fortesque is recalled to England, where his bishop gives him his new assignment - to minister to London''s prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDr1EsYWOrteJ0EP9O2WYm1uiT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52083'),
  ('510582031332738416', 'The Mississippi Gambler', 1953, 'Romance, Adventure, Western', 'Irving Glassberg, Rudolph Maté, John Sherwood', 'Seton I. Miller', 'Tyrone Power, Piper Laurie, Julie Adams, John McIntire, Paul Cavanagh, John Baer, Ron Randell, Ralph Dumke', 'NR', 'Mark Fallon, with partner Kansas John Polly, tries to introduce honest gambling on the riverboats. His first success makes enemies of the crooked gamblers and of fair Angelique Dureau, whose necklace he won. Later in New Orleans, Mark befriends Angelique''s father, but she still affects to despise him as his gambling career brings him wealth. Duelling, tragedy, and romantic complications follow.', 'Mark Fallon, with partner Kansas John Polly, tries to introduce honest gambling on the riverboats. His first success makes enemies of the crooked gamblers and of fair Angelique Dureau, whose necklace he won. Later in New Orleans, Mark befriends Angelique''s father, but she still affects to despise him as his gambling career brings him wealth. Duelling, tragedy, and romantic complications follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XVASz6irPDIK31SbtUmR5r4dFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189885'),
  ('1096629412917955036', 'The Missouri Breaks', 1976, 'Western, Drama', 'Arthur Penn, Michael C. Butler, Cheryl Downey', 'Thomas McGuane', 'Marlon Brando, Jack Nicholson, Randy Quaid, Kathleen Lloyd, Frederic Forrest, Harry Dean Stanton, John McLiam, John P. Ryan', 'PG', 'When vigilante land baron David Braxton hangs one of the best friends of cattle rustler Tom Logan, Logan''s gang decides to get even by purchasing a small farm next to Braxton''s ranch. From there the rustlers begin stealing horses, using the farm as a front for their operation. Determined to stop the thefts at any cost, Braxton retains the services of eccentric sharpshooter Robert E. Lee Clayton, who begins ruthlessly taking down Logan''s gang.', 'When vigilante land baron David Braxton hangs one of the best friends of cattle rustler Tom Logan, Logan''s gang decides to get even by purchasing a small farm next to Braxton''s ranch. From there the rustlers begin stealing horses, using the farm as a front for their operation. Determined to stop the thefts at any cost, Braxton retains the services of eccentric sharpshooter Robert E. Lee Clayton, who begins ruthlessly taking down Logan''s gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fbAVOm9w66jt1TMbeTO8wLyqxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42252'),
  ('286617191071677698', 'The Mist', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Rohn Schmidt, Frank Darabont, K.C. Colwell', 'Frank Darabont', 'Thomas Jane, Laurie Holden, Toby Jones, Marcia Gay Harden, Andre Braugher, William Sadler, Jeffrey DeMunn, Frances Sternhagen', 'R', 'After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents. They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.', 'After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents. They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CvJ6diBACKPVGOpcWuY4XPQdqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5876'),
  ('441365423786276037', 'The Mistle-Tones', 2012, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Hoen, Donald Hauer, Suki Medencevic', 'Scott Thomas, Jed Elinoff', 'Tia Mowry, Tori Spelling, Reginald VelJohnson, Andy Gala, Jonathan Patrick Moore, Tammy Townsend, Jason Rogel, Megan Kathleen Duffy', null, 'Holly, blessed with an amazing singing voice, is all set to audition for the newly vacated spot in a legendary local Christmas group which was founded by her late mother years ago. Shocked and upset when the slot goes to the barely talented best friend of the group''s leader, Marci, Holly sets out to create her own musical group, The Mistle-Tones. After challenging their rivals to a sing-off on Christmas Eve, Holly finds herself on a journey to the real meaning of Christmas with some new friends and a new love thrown in for good measure.', 'Holly, blessed with an amazing singing voice, is all set to audition for the newly vacated spot in a legendary local Christmas group which was founded by her late mother years ago. Shocked and upset when the slot goes to the barely talented best friend of the group''s leader, Marci, Holly sets out to create her own musical group, The Mistle-Tones. After challenging their rivals to a sing-off on Christmas Eve, Holly finds herself on a journey to the real meaning of Christmas with some new friends and a new love thrown in for good measure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBrnbTriZlPpWdWCC3rjlBUbVG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149032'),
  ('525974892834188915', 'The Mistletoe Inn', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Alex Wright, Mike Kam', 'Michael Nourse', 'Alicia Witt, David Alpay, Casey Manderson, Lucie Guest, Linden Banks, Tiffani Timms, Benita Ha, Shiren Van Cooten', null, 'When aspiring romance novelist Kim Rossi is unceremoniously dumped by her soon-to-be-published romance novelist boyfriend, Kim takes stock and decides to take a leap. She signs up for a romance writing retreat at a quaint Vermont Inn shortly before Christmas, where a top romance novelist is scheduled to attend and read the work of one lucky writer. Shortly after arriving, she crosses paths with Zeke, whom she initially finds to be intrusive and, naturally, ends up being her assignment partner. Worse yet, her ex is also at the retreat. Despite these bumps in the road, Kim steps outside her comfort zone and plunges into the writing exercises, surprising herself. Equally unexpected is the attraction that seems to be building between her and Zeke that promises to take her down a road she never imagined traveling. Based on the book by Richard Paul Evans.', 'When aspiring romance novelist Kim Rossi is unceremoniously dumped by her soon-to-be-published romance novelist boyfriend, Kim takes stock and decides to take a leap. She signs up for a romance writing retreat at a quaint Vermont Inn shortly before Christmas, where a top romance novelist is scheduled to attend and read the work of one lucky writer. Shortly after arriving, she crosses paths with Zeke, whom she initially finds to be intrusive and, naturally, ends up being her assignment partner. Worse yet, her ex is also at the retreat. Despite these bumps in the road, Kim steps outside her comfort zone and plunges into the writing exercises, surprising herself. Equally unexpected is the attraction that seems to be building between her and Zeke that promises to take her down a road she never imagined traveling. Based on the book by Richard Paul Evans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiB08D4fSiM6ZObwVLbGNo5ej9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475829'),
  ('1039543117228662274', 'The Mistletoe Promise', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Anthony C. Metchie, David Winning', 'Michael Nourse', 'Jaime King, Luke Macfarlane, Christie Laing, Lochlyn Munro, Sarah Smyth, Erin Boyes, Ashley Ross, Benjamin Wilkinson', 'PG', 'A chance meeting between two strangers who share a disdain for Christmas results in The Mistletoe Promise, a pact to help them navigate their holiday complications - together. But as they spend more time with each other and experience the magic of Christmas the phony couple discovers there may be more to their contract than business.', 'A chance meeting between two strangers who share a disdain for Christmas results in The Mistletoe Promise, a pact to help them navigate their holiday complications - together. But as they spend more time with each other and experience the magic of Christmas the phony couple discovers there may be more to their contract than business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyWtlPVrL5vuSfTNqwOXhHHSh8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410315'),
  ('610324121907205703', 'The Mistral', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens', 'René Guyonnet, Joris Ivens, André Verdet', 'Roger Pigaut', null, 'Dutch documentary filmmaker Joris Ivens follows the course of the famous wind as it originates in the Alps and finds its way to the Mediterranean Sea. Natural sounds and creative camera work provide a mood film showing the effect of the fury of the wind on the life of southern France.', 'Dutch documentary filmmaker Joris Ivens follows the course of the famous wind as it originates in the Alps and finds its way to the Mediterranean Sea. Natural sounds and creative camera work provide a mood film showing the effect of the fury of the wind on the life of southern France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JMSP0ylXzMAIMGBzyYSB5UOxoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188919'),
  ('344896794892934578', 'The Mistress', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Greg Pritikin, Antonio Riestra', 'Greg Pritikin', 'John Magaro, Chasten Harmon, Kat Cunning, Aylya Marzolf, James Carpinello, Alexandra Grey, Rae Dawn Chong, Eddie Alfano', null, 'Newlyweds Parker and Madeline move into their dream home. As they settle in, they discover a box of old love letters written to the original owner. And as the couple digs into the increasingly obsessive correspondence, a mysterious woman arrives with a horrifying secret that threatens their lives.', 'Newlyweds Parker and Madeline move into their dream home. As they settle in, they discover a box of old love letters written to the original owner. And as the couple digs into the increasingly obsessive correspondence, a mysterious woman arrives with a horrifying secret that threatens their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kdmre0wlUAUk9BvySv4Xoveieg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094713'),
  ('587951209264471887', 'The Mistress of Spices', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Paul Mayeda Berges, Santosh Sivan', 'Gurinder Chadha, Paul Mayeda Berges', 'Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Dylan McDermott, Nitin Ganatra, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Caroline Chikezie, Anupam Kher, Shaheen Khan, Sonny Gill', null, 'Tilo is an Indian shopkeeper in America with an ability to see the future and a magical connection to powerful spices, which she uses to help her customers satisfy their various needs and desires. One day she falls in love with an American man. But the spices forbid it.', 'Tilo is an Indian shopkeeper in America with an ability to see the future and a magical connection to powerful spices, which she uses to help her customers satisfy their various needs and desires. One day she falls in love with an American man. But the spices forbid it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4B1bLyeRdrVVS9TirZdPUyP9we1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9724'),
  ('384900510029721911', 'The Mitchells vs. the Machines', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jeff Rowe, Mike Rianda', 'Jeff Rowe, Mike Rianda', 'Abbi Jacobson, Danny McBride, Maya Rudolph, Mike Rianda, Eric André, Olivia Colman, Fred Armisen, Beck Bennett', 'PG', 'A quirky, dysfunctional family''s road trip is upended when they find themselves in the middle of the robot apocalypse and suddenly become humanity''s unlikeliest last hope.', 'A quirky, dysfunctional family''s road trip is upended when they find themselves in the middle of the robot apocalypse and suddenly become humanity''s unlikeliest last hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI2Di7HmskQQ34kz0iau6J1vr70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501929'),
  ('584863127119736266', 'The Mitten', 1967, 'Animation, Family', 'Roman Kachanov, Iosif Golomb, Georgiy Martynyuk', 'Zhanna Vitenzon', null, null, 'Short soviet animated movie about a girl who wants a dog, while her mother does not approve. The girl then starts playing with her mitten, pretending that it is a dog...', 'Short soviet animated movie about a girl who wants a dog, while her mother does not approve. The girl then starts playing with her mitten, pretending that it is a dog...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6iVEoZvBxrNHzHAA6ZMNiSzNLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69899'),
  ('189720359039829324', 'The Miu Miu Affaire', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Laura Citarella, Agustina Brizuela, Agustín Mendilaharzu', 'Laura Citarella', 'Verónica Llinás, Laura Paredes, Juliana Muras, Ezequiel Pierri, Rafael Spregelburd, Elisa Carricajo, Cecilia Rainero, Guillermina Villa Simon', null, 'Nothing went as planned: what seemed to be an original idea (taking an international fashion event to a small town in the Argentine Pampas) ended up as a mysterious affair, with a mannequin who seems to have vanished, and who insists on leaving small clues scattered across the immense plains. But nothing seems to be too strange for Commissioner Sirota and her particular method which, this time, includes a clairvoyant, a legendary detective arriving from Santa Rosa and some picturesque “peritas” who choose to work at night, swinging to the rhythm of Ska. In the middle, a disturbing question: Is it a police case they are dealing with, or is someone taking them (the police, the whole town, the Italians – all of us, perhaps) for a fool?', 'Nothing went as planned: what seemed to be an original idea (taking an international fashion event to a small town in the Argentine Pampas) ended up as a mysterious affair, with a mannequin who seems to have vanished, and who insists on leaving small clues scattered across the immense plains. But nothing seems to be too strange for Commissioner Sirota and her particular method which, this time, includes a clairvoyant, a legendary detective arriving from Santa Rosa and some picturesque “peritas” who choose to work at night, swinging to the rhythm of Ska. In the middle, a disturbing question: Is it a police case they are dealing with, or is someone taking them (the police, the whole town, the Italians – all of us, perhaps) for a fool?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBDWotM7p3TsTZZ6z0Y5jboOiXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320284'),
  ('1067920222175996567', 'The Mob', 1951, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Parrish, Joseph Walker', 'William Bowers', 'Broderick Crawford, Betty Buehler, Richard Kiley, Otto Hulett, Matt Crowley, Neville Brand, Ernest Borgnine, Walter Klavun', null, 'An undercover officer tracks waterfront corruption from California to New Orleans and back.', 'An undercover officer tracks waterfront corruption from California to New Orleans and back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDzTY3WAFXE1Bb94PGERVbT52uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25728'),
  ('669367020654657212', 'The Mod Squad', 1999, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Scott Silver, Ellen Kuras, John Hockridge', 'Scott Silver, Kate Lanier, Stephen Kay', 'Claire Danes, Giovanni Ribisi, Omar Epps, Dennis Farina, Josh Brolin, Steve Harris, Richard Jenkins, Larry Brandenburg', 'R', 'Three youthful delinquents escape conviction for their crimes by teaming with the LAPD.', 'Three youthful delinquents escape conviction for their crimes by teaming with the LAPD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c20VEblNKkDiBuA6bE6kbeHqHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16379'),
  ('74560098547451157', 'The Model', 2016, 'Drama', 'Mads Matthiesen, Petrus Sjövik', 'Martin Zandvliet, Anders Frithiof August, Mads Matthiesen', 'Maria Palm, Ed Skrein, Charlotte Tomaszewska, Marco Ilsø, Thierry Hancisse, Virgile Bramly, Claire Tran, Dominic Allburn', null, 'When emerging fashion model Emma gets a chance to pursue her dream of becoming an international top model, she leaves her everyday life in Denmark behind, and moves to Paris. At a photo shoot in her new hometown, she meets the attractive photographer Shane White and they fall in love. But their relationship soon turns into a dangerous obsession for Emma.', 'When emerging fashion model Emma gets a chance to pursue her dream of becoming an international top model, she leaves her everyday life in Denmark behind, and moves to Paris. At a photo shoot in her new hometown, she meets the attractive photographer Shane White and they fall in love. But their relationship soon turns into a dangerous obsession for Emma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kxdItrqseNI0jVana5Qi960kiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348677'),
  ('686700000959940610', 'The Model and the Marriage Broker', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, Saul Wurtzel, Milton Krasner', 'Walter Reisch, Charles Brackett, Richard L. Breen', 'Thelma Ritter, Jeanne Crain, Scott Brady, Nancy Kulp, Jay C. Flippen, Zero Mostel, Michael O''Shea, Dennie Moore', null, 'A marriage broker can''t resist meddling in the life of a model, with disastrous results.', 'A marriage broker can''t resist meddling in the life of a model, with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bL00Xs7GYV1ofGJk4YPWqusNWMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132094'),
  ('1018345857435456969', 'The Model Couple', 1977, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'William Klein, William Klein, Philippe Rousselot', 'William Klein', 'André Dussollier, Anémone, Georges Descrières, Jacques Boudet, Zouc, Eddie Constantine, André Penvern, Karl-Josef Cramer', 'NR', 'In 1977 France, the Ministry of the Future chooses two “normal,” white, middle-class citizens, Claudine and Jean-Michel, for a national experiment. They will be monitored and displayed on television for six months in a model apartment outfitted with state-of-the-art products and nonstop surveillance—the template for “a new city for the new man".', 'In 1977 France, the Ministry of the Future chooses two “normal,” white, middle-class citizens, Claudine and Jean-Michel, for a national experiment. They will be monitored and displayed on television for six months in a model apartment outfitted with state-of-the-art products and nonstop surveillance—the template for “a new city for the new man".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uIhDyEdiBsCiov0ZyLhE4yRu9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67429'),
  ('719148727956606378', 'The Moderator', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Amine Boudour, Idriss Askour, Tariel Meliava', 'Jonathan McConnell, Hicham Hajji', 'Irma Lake, Gary Dourdan, Robert Knepper, Michael Patrick Lane, Brice Bexter, Maria-Claudia Nova, Sabine Crossen, Soraya Azzabi', 'R', 'After the murder of her two Scandinavian friends in Morocco, a Russian blogger decides to do her own justice.', 'After the murder of her two Scandinavian friends in Morocco, a Russian blogger decides to do her own justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB6aJkoFhYUmWEQaoxv67ZEgZOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877619'),
  ('7408198165635522', 'The Moderns', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alan Rudolph, Marie Gislaine Cretier, Madeleine Henrié', 'John Bradshaw, Alan Rudolph', 'Keith Carradine, Linda Fiorentino, Wallace Shawn, Geneviève Bujold, Geraldine Chaplin, Kevin J. O''Connor, John Lone, Charlélie Couture', 'R', 'Nick Hart is a struggling American artist who lives amongst the expatriate community in 1920s Paris. He spends most of his time drinking and socializing in local café''s and pestering gallery owner Libby Valentin to sell his paintings. He becomes involved in a plot by wealthy art patroness Nathalie de Ville to forge three paintings. This leads to several run-ins with American rubber magnate Bertram Stone, who happens to be married to Hart''s ex-wife Rachel.', 'Nick Hart is a struggling American artist who lives amongst the expatriate community in 1920s Paris. He spends most of his time drinking and socializing in local café''s and pestering gallery owner Libby Valentin to sell his paintings. He becomes involved in a plot by wealthy art patroness Nathalie de Ville to forge three paintings. This leads to several run-ins with American rubber magnate Bertram Stone, who happens to be married to Hart''s ex-wife Rachel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ENbrVNqcoCJqyqfyoFv1ox08fC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41971'),
  ('551692090321231498', 'The Mohican', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Valérie Roucher, Jeanne Lapoirie, Célie Valdenaire', 'Frédéric Farrucci', 'Alexis Manenti, Mara Taquin, Théo Frimigacci, Paul Garatte, Marie-Pierre Nouveau, Michel Ferracci, Jean Michelangeli, Luiza Benaïssa', null, 'Joseph is one of the last coastal shepherds in Corsica. His land is coveted by the underworld for a real estate project but he chooses not to give in. When he leaves the man who came to intimidate him, the godfather’s own son, between life and death, he becomes the prey of a merciless hunt.', 'Joseph is one of the last coastal shepherds in Corsica. His land is coveted by the underworld for a real estate project but he chooses not to give in. When he leaves the man who came to intimidate him, the godfather’s own son, between life and death, he becomes the prey of a merciless hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBs48d2NY7gcjDOCwZfAn8CvW4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012601'),
  ('991813310331111616', 'The Mohican Comes Home', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Shuichi Okita, Katsuhito Motegi, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Shuichi Okita', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Atsuko Maeda, Akira Emoto, Masako Motai, Yudai Chiba, Katsumi Kiba, Jun Miho', null, 'Eikichi left his hometown in Hiroshima for Tokyo. He tried to find success with his music band, but failed. Several years later, Eikichi goes home to tell his father, Osamu, that his girlfriend is pregnant. His father curses him out, but he is also excited to have a grandchild. Osamu has a party to celebrate the news, but, at the party, he collapses and goes to the hospital. Eikichi struggles to make his father happy.', 'Eikichi left his hometown in Hiroshima for Tokyo. He tried to find success with his music band, but failed. Several years later, Eikichi goes home to tell his father, Osamu, that his girlfriend is pregnant. His father curses him out, but he is also excited to have a grandchild. Osamu has a party to celebrate the news, but, at the party, he collapses and goes to the hospital. Eikichi struggles to make his father happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybVAC1lCtC0PYcqArLrUb13VF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382545'),
  ('1032970493692431475', 'The Mole Agent', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Maite Alberdi, Pablo Valdés, Loreto Contreras', 'Maite Alberdi', 'Sergio Chamy, Rómulo Aitken, Marta Olivares, Berta Ureta, Zoila González, Petronila Abarca, Rubira Olivares', null, 'When a daughter becomes concerned about her mother''s well-being in a retirement home, private investigator Romulo hires Sergio, an 83-year-old man who becomes a new resident—and a mole inside the home, who struggles to balance his assignment with becoming increasingly involved in the lives of several residents.', 'When a daughter becomes concerned about her mother''s well-being in a retirement home, private investigator Romulo hires Sergio, an 83-year-old man who becomes a new resident—and a mole inside the home, who struggles to balance his assignment with becoming increasingly involved in the lives of several residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWKySzO45iIbT4yL2zVkVB2w6MR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653756'),
  ('435828392414374938', 'The Mole People', 1956, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Virgil W. Vogel, Ellis W. Carter', 'László Görög', 'John Agar, Cynthia Patrick, Hugh Beaumont, Alan Napier, Nestor Paiva, Phil Chambers, Rodd Redwing, Robin Hughes', null, 'A party of archaeologists discovers the remnants of a five millennia-old mutant Sumerian civilization living beneath a glacier atop a mountain in Mesopatamia.', 'A party of archaeologists discovers the remnants of a five millennia-old mutant Sumerian civilization living beneath a glacier atop a mountain in Mesopatamia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utOyyOn1KQ47ONwtAlC8M9i7zmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41516'),
  ('1036823261353670732', 'The Mole Song: Final', 2021, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Toma Ikuta, Riisa Naka, Ryohei Suzuki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Nanao, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Kenichi Endo, Koichi Iwaki', null, 'Reiji''s final mission is to prevent the smuggling of 600 billion yen of drugs. For his mission, he gets on luxury passenger ship and he faces his strongest enemy to date.', 'Reiji''s final mission is to prevent the smuggling of 600 billion yen of drugs. For his mission, he gets on luxury passenger ship and he faces his strongest enemy to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TpHFs5GxSZ1FhuYKswT6jZDQoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845611'),
  ('172151277836711620', 'The Mole Song: Hong Kong Capriccio', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Toma Ikuta, Eita Nagayama, Riisa Naka, Tsubasa Honda, Yusuke Kamiji, Nanao, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Arata Furuta', null, 'A young undercover cop tries to get back with his former love, while unraveling the mystery behind the head of the police force. Meanwhile he has to protect the boss'' daughter.', 'A young undercover cop tries to get back with his former love, while unraveling the mystery behind the head of the police force. Meanwhile he has to protect the boss'' daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bztZIrUjAdHfqvQSGAqpQAKdqdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417413'),
  ('665145026989519197', 'The Mole Song: Undercover Agent Reiji', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Toma Ikuta, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Riisa Naka, Takayuki Yamada, Takashi Okamura, Yusuke Kamiji, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Sarutoki Minagawa', null, 'Reiji Kikukawa, who has a strong sense of justice, graduated from the police academy with the lowest score ever. He becomes a police constable, but is suddenly fired by the Police Chief due to "disciplinary" issues. In actuality, the firing is part of a carefully orchestrated plan to set him up as an undercover cop in the Yakuza.', 'Reiji Kikukawa, who has a strong sense of justice, graduated from the police academy with the lowest score ever. He becomes a police constable, but is suddenly fired by the Police Chief due to "disciplinary" issues. In actuality, the firing is part of a carefully orchestrated plan to set him up as an undercover cop in the Yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zEK8AkJcx5gMEoE9zCcpEL4tvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199926'),
  ('750262306677513607', 'The Mole: Undercover in North Korea', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Mads Brügger, Peter Engel, Heine Kaarsberg', 'Mads Brügger', 'Mads Brügger, Alejandro Cao de Benos de Les y Pérez, Ulrich Løvenskjold Larsen, Jim Latrache-Qvortrup, Annie Machon, Hisham Al-Dasouqi, Kim Ryong Chol, Anders Kristensen', null, 'A real-life undercover thriller about two ordinary men who embark on an outrageously dangerous ten-year mission to penetrate the world''s most secretive and brutal dictatorship: North Korea.', 'A real-life undercover thriller about two ordinary men who embark on an outrageously dangerous ten-year mission to penetrate the world''s most secretive and brutal dictatorship: North Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mA76drf6b9UdtbIJDBU5hci8QPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751490'),
  ('1123552284251595078', 'The Molly Maguires', 1970, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Martin Ritt, James Wong Howe, James A. Rosenberger', 'Walter Bernstein', 'Sean Connery, Richard Harris, Samantha Eggar, Frank Finlay, Anthony Zerbe, Bethel Leslie, Art Lund, Anthony Costello', 'PG', 'Schuylkill County, Pennsylvania, 1876. A secret society of Irish coal miners, bond by a sacred oath, put pressure on the greedy and ruthless company they work for by sabotaging mining facilities in the hope of improving their working conditions and the lives of their families.', 'Schuylkill County, Pennsylvania, 1876. A secret society of Irish coal miners, bond by a sacred oath, put pressure on the greedy and ruthless company they work for by sabotaging mining facilities in the hope of improving their working conditions and the lives of their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ywN7tPWiOkbalS2gAEPzNk4Nq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42345'),
  ('180266006968695906', 'The Moment', 2026, 'Drama, Music, Comedy', 'Aidan Zamiri, Sean Price Williams, Jonathan Farmer', 'Aidan Zamiri, Bertie Brandes', 'Charli xcx, Alexander Skarsgård, Rosanna Arquette, Hailey Benton Gates, Jamie Demetriou, Rachel Sennott, Kate Berlant, Rish Shah', 'R', 'A rising pop sensation navigates fame and industry pressures while preparing for her arena tour debut, revealing the transformation of underground culture into mainstream success.', 'A rising pop sensation navigates fame and industry pressures while preparing for her arena tour debut, revealing the transformation of underground culture into mainstream success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYgCgTqqMnWdsnP2XirdcFB28ch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422562'),
  ('69515075429529978', 'The Moment After', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Wes Llewellyn', 'Kevin Downes', 'Julie Link, Mike Wilson, David A.R. White, Kevin Downes, Greg Davis, Brad Heller, D. David Morin, Brian C. Bennetts', null, 'In the twinkling of an eye, a mass disappearance has occurred. Moments after the turmoil and confusion, the FBI is called in to investigate and locate the missing persons. For Agent Adam Riley (David White), it is personal. For Agent Charles Baker (Kevin Downes), it doesn''t matter, it''s just a job.', 'In the twinkling of an eye, a mass disappearance has occurred. Moments after the turmoil and confusion, the FBI is called in to investigate and locate the missing persons. For Agent Adam Riley (David White), it is personal. For Agent Charles Baker (Kevin Downes), it doesn''t matter, it''s just a job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KsYfVgzPG7VYseyDvaBmguqS30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33501'),
  ('802760917383039133', 'The Moment of Truth', 1952, 'Drama', 'Jean Delannoy', 'Jean Delannoy, Henri Jeanson, Roland Laudenbach', 'Jean Gabin, Michèle Morgan, Daniel Gélin, Denise Clair, Doris Duranti, Lia Di Leo, Simone Paris, Robert Dalban', null, 'After attending to a suicidal young man, Dr Richard learns that his wife has been unfaithful for years. This comes as a shock after 10 years of supposedly happy marriage. Back home, he demands answers from Madeleine. A long night of explanations ensues.', 'After attending to a suicidal young man, Dr Richard learns that his wife has been unfaithful for years. This comes as a shock after 10 years of supposedly happy marriage. Back home, he demands answers from Madeleine. A long night of explanations ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txv9IjADGvfdlxgQ51pp1WDqXpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82170'),
  ('620651718997058418', 'The Moment of Truth', 1965, 'Drama', 'Francesco Rosi, Marco Guarnaschelli, Ricardo Muñoz Suay', 'Pedro Beltrán, Pere Portabella, Ricardo Muñoz Suay', 'Miguel Mateo ''Miguelín'', José Gómez Sevillano, Pedro "Pedrucho" Basauri, Linda Christian, Luque Gago, Salvador Mateo, Manuel Ruiz Serrana, Francisco Cano', null, 'Miguel, a poor young man living in Franco''s Spain becomes a bull fighter to escape starvation.', 'Miguel, a poor young man living in Franco''s Spain becomes a bull fighter to escape starvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nR1WuQpw11Ovpzxs7tcFyivE9pB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86785'),
  ('1046731511637598772', 'The Moment You Fall in Love', 2016, 'Drama, Animation, Romance, Comedy', 'Hideki Okamoto, Masayuki Nomoto, Yoshihiro Sekiya', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Tsubasa Yonaga, Natsuki Hanae, Momo Asakura, Aki Toyosaki, Haruka Tomatsu, Kana Asumi, Yuki Kaji, Sora Amamiya', null, 'Following Natsuki Enomoto''s confession rehearsals with Yuu Setoguchi, their younger siblings Kotarou and Hina struggle to confess their own love. Despite a disastrous first meeting in middle school with her upperclassman Koyuki Ayase, Hina’s heart is captured by his warm smile. Initially confused by these newfound feelings, Hina soon realizes that she has fallen in love for the very first time. Chasing after her brother Yuu and her crush Koyuki, Hina also enrolls in Sakuragaoka High School; but the threads of love are far-reaching, and they entangle Hina and her friends. Boisterous but sensitive, Hina hopes to confess her feelings to the tender-hearted Koyuki. Meanwhile, Kotarou, oblivious to his own feelings for her, is determined to always keep Hina smiling. This movie follows Hina, Kotarou, and Koyuki in high school. Their youthful love forges new relationships, but also threatens to break others.', 'Following Natsuki Enomoto''s confession rehearsals with Yuu Setoguchi, their younger siblings Kotarou and Hina struggle to confess their own love. Despite a disastrous first meeting in middle school with her upperclassman Koyuki Ayase, Hina’s heart is captured by his warm smile. Initially confused by these newfound feelings, Hina soon realizes that she has fallen in love for the very first time. Chasing after her brother Yuu and her crush Koyuki, Hina also enrolls in Sakuragaoka High School; but the threads of love are far-reaching, and they entangle Hina and her friends. Boisterous but sensitive, Hina hopes to confess her feelings to the tender-hearted Koyuki. Meanwhile, Kotarou, oblivious to his own feelings for her, is determined to always keep Hina smiling. This movie follows Hina, Kotarou, and Koyuki in high school. Their youthful love forges new relationships, but also threatens to break others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3NQEmgAYKTDuAXSE0f294lrE4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472516'),
  ('89184665032467867', 'The Mona Lisa Has Been Stolen', 1966, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Michel Deville, Massimo Dallamano', 'Ottavio Poggi, Nina Companéez, Michel Deville', 'George Chakiris, Marina Vlady, Margaret Lee, Jean Lefebvre, Paul Frankeur, Henri Virlogeux, Jess Hahn, Gianrico Tedeschi', null, 'A thief falls in love with a maid and goes on the run after stealing Leonardo da Vinci''s "Mona Lisa."', 'A thief falls in love with a maid and goes on the run after stealing Leonardo da Vinci''s "Mona Lisa."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCn9jXVb37yhxIaQhoi3kuVPDAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182350'),
  ('451736347995942492', 'The Monastery of Sendomir', 1920, 'Drama', 'Victor Sjöström, Henrik Jaenzon', 'Victor Sjöström', 'Tore Svennberg, Tora Teje, Renée Björling, Emil Fjellström, Axel Nilsson, Yngve Nyqvist, Erik A. Petschler, Gustaf Ranft', null, 'Two riders on their way to Warsaw stop at a monastery for the night and ask an old monk there to tell them the story of its founding.', 'Two riders on their way to Warsaw stop at a monastery for the night and ask an old monk there to tell them the story of its founding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKP4f9gYubqhDvZApHw3chZpHRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116991'),
  ('964606455697252710', 'The Money Maker', 2026, 'History, Drama, Crime', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Julien Hisrch, Jean-Christophe Colson', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Bastien Daret', 'Reda Kateb, Sara Giraudeau, Bastien Bouillon, Quentin Dolmaire, Pierre Lottin, Camille Japy, Lolita Chammah, Olivier Loustau', null, 'In post-war France, Jan Bojarski, a young Polish refugee, became the greatest counterfeiter of all time, the "Cézanne of counterfeit money". For more than fifteen years, this man led a double life, unbeknownst to his family, making counterfeits in a garden shed that were "truer" than the bills issued by the Banque de France... All these years, this peerless counterfeiter managed to avoid being caught by the police, and became the bête noire of Commissaire Mattei in a hunt that, for these two obsessives, turned into a duel.', 'In post-war France, Jan Bojarski, a young Polish refugee, became the greatest counterfeiter of all time, the "Cézanne of counterfeit money". For more than fifteen years, this man led a double life, unbeknownst to his family, making counterfeits in a garden shed that were "truer" than the bills issued by the Banque de France... All these years, this peerless counterfeiter managed to avoid being caught by the police, and became the bête noire of Commissaire Mattei in a hunt that, for these two obsessives, turned into a duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hBGDCNJmBljmKbmFvt6Nk3Feua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1376415'),
  ('61323004409173296', 'The Money Masters', 1996, 'History, Documentary', 'Bill Still', null, 'Bill Still', null, 'A documentary that traces the origins of the political power structure that rules our nation and the world today. The modern political power structure has its roots in the hidden manipulation and accumulation of gold and other forms of money.', 'A documentary that traces the origins of the political power structure that rules our nation and the world today. The modern political power structure has its roots in the hidden manipulation and accumulation of gold and other forms of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bkgdHsqC4DyxbdlTh0nhxdiZEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22816'),
  ('1002432406428932594', 'The Money Pit', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gordon Willis, Richard Benjamin, Michael Haley', 'David Giler', 'Tom Hanks, Shelley Long, Alexander Godunov, Maureen Stapleton, Joe Mantegna, Philip Bosco, Josh Mostel, Yakov Smirnoff', 'PG', 'After being evicted from their Manhattan apartment, a couple buy what looks like the home of their dreams—only to find themselves saddled with a bank-account-draining nightmare. Struggling to keep their relationship together as their rambling mansion falls to pieces around them, the two watch in hilarious horror as everything—including the kitchen sink—disappears into the Money Pit.', 'After being evicted from their Manhattan apartment, a couple buy what looks like the home of their dreams—only to find themselves saddled with a bank-account-draining nightmare. Struggling to keep their relationship together as their rambling mansion falls to pieces around them, the two watch in hilarious horror as everything—including the kitchen sink—disappears into the Money Pit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bohhidIi1WWU5NNYF9l5wLQu3Ii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10466'),
  ('88310475941242611', 'The Money Trap', 1965, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Burt Kennedy, Paul Vogel', 'Walter Bernstein', 'Glenn Ford, Elke Sommer, Rita Hayworth, Joseph Cotten, Ricardo Montalban, Tom Reese, James Mitchum, Argentina Brunetti', null, 'When half a million dollars disappears from a doctor office''s safe, the cops assigned to the burglary case, Joe and Pete, decide to find the money and keep it for themselves.', 'When half a million dollars disappears from a doctor office''s safe, the cops assigned to the burglary case, Joe and Pete, decide to find the money and keep it for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvPP8WyhMxhCLBP5hKFmjK4zO7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44141'),
  ('664550961196726641', 'The Moneychanger', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Catriel Vildosola, Federico Veiroj, Arauco Hernández Holz', 'Martín Mauregui, Federico Veiroj, Arauco Hernández Holz', 'Daniel Hendler, Dolores Fonzi, Luis Machín, Benjamín Vicuña, Germán de Silva, Matías Vespa, David Roizner Selanikio, Paulo Betti', null, 'Humberto Brause takes advantage of Uruguay’s poor economy by specializing in offshore money laundering. Spanning the fifties to the seventies, the film follows Humberto as he gets increasingly in over his head with multiple shady book-cooking schemes throughout South America, leading to an ultimate life-or-death decision.', 'Humberto Brause takes advantage of Uruguay’s poor economy by specializing in offshore money laundering. Spanning the fifties to the seventies, the film follows Humberto as he gets increasingly in over his head with multiple shady book-cooking schemes throughout South America, leading to an ultimate life-or-death decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fPN6QWkvE7NByS5vqkdFUelIAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621268'),
  ('292348867931049567', 'The Mongolian Conspiracy', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Sebastián del Amo', 'Sebastián del Amo', 'Damián Alcázar, Bárbara Mori, Eugenio Derbez, Xavier López, Moisés Arizmendi, Ari Brickman, Roberto Sosa, Salvador Sánchez', null, '1963, the Soviet Union intercepts a rumour that China pretends to assassinate the president of the US in his visit to Mexico. Filiberto Garcia, a local policeman, has 72 hours to investigate the Mongolian Conspiracy.', '1963, the Soviet Union intercepts a rumour that China pretends to assassinate the president of the US in his visit to Mexico. Filiberto Garcia, a local policeman, has 72 hours to investigate the Mongolian Conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3C9oEpe4aIgqqSypYaif8rIiFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554577'),
  ('649662618649945804', 'The Mongrel', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Tommaso Pagliai, Massimiliano Battistella', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Vittorio Moroni', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Manrico Gammarota, Giovanni Anzaldo, Sergio Meogrossi, Matteo Taranto, Mădălina Ghenea, Michele Placido, Carolina Facchinetti', null, 'The story of a drug dealer from Romania and his son in Rome''s suburbs.Roman is an immigrant from Romania arrived in Italy 30 years ago. He sells drugs and lives in criminal contexts. His dream is to see his child, Nicu, whom he raised without a mother, live a different and better life.', 'The story of a drug dealer from Romania and his son in Rome''s suburbs.Roman is an immigrant from Romania arrived in Italy 30 years ago. He sells drugs and lives in criminal contexts. His dream is to see his child, Nicu, whom he raised without a mother, live a different and better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsLUmTWe1sdRv3w46anMEEmilQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186984'),
  ('582515896173421279', 'The Mongreloid', 1978, 'Comedy', 'George Kuchar', 'George Kuchar', 'Bocko, George Kuchar, Curt McDowell', null, 'A man, his dog, and the regions they inhabited, each leaving his own distinctive mark on the landscape. Not even time can wash away the residue of what they left behind.', 'A man, his dog, and the regions they inhabited, each leaving his own distinctive mark on the landscape. Not even time can wash away the residue of what they left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWH7TchJqO1gt9thdjT5OZqOavC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179407'),
  ('740155543361986976', 'The Monitor', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pål Sletaune, John Andreas Andersen', 'Pål Sletaune', 'Noomi Rapace, Vetle Qvenild Werring, Kristoffer Joner, Stig R. Amdam, Maria Bock, Torkil Høeg, Henrik Rafaelsen, Tom Hugo Nielsen', 'R', 'Oslo, Norway. After living a traumatic experience, Anna and her son Anders move into a huge apartment building. Feeling constantly terrified and insecure, Anna buys a babycall to monitor Anders while he sleeps.', 'Oslo, Norway. After living a traumatic experience, Anna and her son Anders move into a huge apartment building. Feeling constantly terrified and insecure, Anna buys a babycall to monitor Anders while he sleeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKktKH24h2VmsXidgZN3SouSnNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75229'),
  ('326940243822333273', 'The Monk', 1972, 'Drama, Horror', 'Adonis Kyrou, Sacha Vierny', 'Adonis Kyrou', 'Franco Nero, Nathalie Delon, Nicol Williamson, Nadja Tiller, Eliana De Santis, Agnès Capri, Denis Manuel, Maria Machado', null, 'Ambrosio is a monk who is sexually tempted by an emissary of the Devil, a young girl in monk''s robes. After he has committed numerous crimes, it appears that he will be caught and punished by the Inquisition. Instead, he signs up on the Devil''s team and wins his freedom.. and eventually, the papacy.', 'Ambrosio is a monk who is sexually tempted by an emissary of the Devil, a young girl in monk''s robes. After he has committed numerous crimes, it appears that he will be caught and punished by the Inquisition. Instead, he signs up on the Devil''s team and wins his freedom.. and eventually, the papacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRMLVm2lban0jCj8gvRDnIBuYl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124391'),
  ('283801872906642113', 'The Monk', 2011, 'Thriller', 'Patrick Blossier, Dominik Moll', 'Anne-Louise Trividic, Dominik Moll', 'Vincent Cassel, Déborah François, Joséphine Japy, Sergi López, Catherine Mouchet, Roxane Duran, Geraldine Chaplin, Jordi Dauder', null, 'A virtuous monk descends to the depths of sin and depravity after Satan sends an unholy temptress to lead him astray.', 'A virtuous monk descends to the depths of sin and depravity after Satan sends an unholy temptress to lead him astray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LoYkzsxNroQe42BHEqhxgBBuMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66120'),
  ('1093945950235559544', 'The Monk and the Fish', 1994, 'Animation', 'Michael Dudok de Wit, Patrick Tallaron', 'Michael Dudok de Wit', null, null, 'A plump and exuberant monk goes fishing, and a playful fish eludes him. First the monk uses a rod and reel, then a net; over and over, he ends up fish-less and wet. Sleepless, he tries luring the fish at night with a bank of candles. He tries a bow and arrow. The tireless and insouciant fish leads the monk through a viaduct, over irrigated steppes, across cisterns, down canals.', 'A plump and exuberant monk goes fishing, and a playful fish eludes him. First the monk uses a rod and reel, then a net; over and over, he ends up fish-less and wet. Sleepless, he tries luring the fish at night with a bank of candles. He tries a bow and arrow. The tireless and insouciant fish leads the monk through a viaduct, over irrigated steppes, across cisterns, down canals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2T64qLkVHdll5sw5iDVa7OYbhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48486'),
  ('105517953813702238', 'The Monk and the Gun', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jigme Tenzing, Pawo Choyning Dorji', 'Pawo Choyning Dorji', 'Tandin Wangchuk, Tandin Sonam, Deki Lhamo, Pema Zangmo Sherpa, Harry Einhorn, Kelsang Choejay, Tandin Phubz, Choeying Jatsho', null, 'An American travels to Bhutan searching for a valuable antique rifle and crosses paths with a young monk who wanders through the serene mountains, instructed by his teacher to make things right again.', 'An American travels to Bhutan searching for a valuable antique rifle and crosses paths with a young monk who wanders through the serene mountains, instructed by his teacher to make things right again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhGaCXeBvFo7495aIZr261l6kb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109237'),
  ('257679244112244418', 'The Monk of Monza', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Mario Castellani, Nino Fruscella', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Totò, Nino Taranto, Erminio Macario, Lisa Gastoni, Adriano Celentano, Don Backy, Giacomo Furia, Moira Orfei', null, 'Pasquale takes all of his 12 children and runs away from Monza, looking for a house of a wealthy and generous awning. Having met on the way impoverished peasant, Pasquale takes him also, having granted the rank of "Half-Monk" and thus having gained rustic, but a reliable friend.', 'Pasquale takes all of his 12 children and runs away from Monza, looking for a house of a wealthy and generous awning. Having met on the way impoverished peasant, Pasquale takes him also, having granted the rank of "Half-Monk" and thus having gained rustic, but a reliable friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pzhF6unudbWHGNAX29ZPRV3aeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50190'),
  ('693096303454033281', 'The Monkey', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Osgood Perkins, Nico Aguilar, Hannah Broad', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Theo James, Tatiana Maslany, Christian Convery, Colin O''Brien, Adam Scott, Elijah Wood, Rohan Campbell, Sarah Levy', 'R', 'When twin brothers find a mysterious wind-up monkey, a series of outrageous deaths tear their family apart. Twenty-five years later, the monkey begins a new killing spree forcing the estranged brothers to confront the cursed toy.', 'When twin brothers find a mysterious wind-up monkey, a series of outrageous deaths tear their family apart. Twenty-five years later, the monkey begins a new killing spree forcing the estranged brothers to confront the cursed toy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYa8Onk9ow7ukcnfp2QWVvjWYel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124620'),
  ('1023328848972682316', 'The Monkey King', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheung Man-Po, Tao Yang', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen, Edmond Wong Chi-Mun, Xin Huo', 'Donnie Yen, Aaron Kwok, Joe Chen, Chow Yun-Fat, Peter Ho, Kelly Chen, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai', 'PG-13', 'Sun Wukong is a monkey born from a heavenly stone who acquires supernatural powers. After rebelling against heaven and being imprisoned under a mountain for 500 years, he later accompanies the monk Xuanzang on a journey to India. Thus, according to legend, Buddhism is brought to ancient China.', 'Sun Wukong is a monkey born from a heavenly stone who acquires supernatural powers. After rebelling against heaven and being imprisoned under a mountain for 500 years, he later accompanies the monk Xuanzang on a journey to India. Thus, according to legend, Buddhism is brought to ancient China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9Atjcbidu4DsM7EQltiTZbrvkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119892'),
  ('269287061423589281', 'The Monkey King', 2023, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Anthony Stacchi', 'Rita Hsiao, Steve Bencich, Ron J. Friedman', 'Jimmy O. Yang, Bowen Yang, Jolie Hoang-Rappaport, Jo Koy, Ron Yuan, Nan Li, Andrew Pang, Stephanie Hsu', 'PG', 'A stick-wielding monkey teams with a young girl on an epic quest for immortality, battling demons, dragons, gods — and his own ego — along the way.', 'A stick-wielding monkey teams with a young girl on an epic quest for immortality, battling demons, dragons, gods — and his own ego — along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6ye8ueFhVE5pXatgyRrZ83LBD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:832502'),
  ('411025822441879790', 'The Monkey King 2', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheung Man-Po, Tao Yang', 'Wen Ning, Ran Ping', 'Aaron Kwok, Gong Li, William Feng, Xiao Shenyang, Lo Chung-Him, Kelly Chen, Kris Phillips, Wei Lu', 'G', 'Taking place 500 years after the Havoc in Heaven, the Tang Priest is appointed by Buddha to go to the West to fetch the sacred scriptures, only to accidentally free the Monkey King. With Lady White aiming to break up the team assembled to defeat her, the Monkey King must fight in order to save his world!', 'Taking place 500 years after the Havoc in Heaven, the Tang Priest is appointed by Buddha to go to the West to fetch the sacred scriptures, only to accidentally free the Monkey King. With Lady White aiming to break up the team assembled to defeat her, the Monkey King must fight in order to save his world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOApsyuFG05NaDCNHnicrln1ztM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381902'),
  ('326318358490680940', 'The Monkey King 3', 2018, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Family', 'Cheang Pou-Soi', 'Wen Ning', 'Aaron Kwok, William Feng, Zhao Liying, Xiao Shenyang, Lo Chung-Him, Lin Chi-ling, Wang Luqing, Wang Xiaobai', 'PG-13', 'The Monkey King and his friends try to break free from a ruler that takes them hostage. However, their exploits provoke the anger of a deity that decides to punish them for their actions.', 'The Monkey King and his friends try to break free from a ruler that takes them hostage. However, their exploits provoke the anger of a deity that decides to punish them for their actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMYnxPIkUVaRIuTpS77B8hLGkBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437543'),
  ('372100663431350946', 'The Monkey King 3D: Uproar in Heaven', 2012, 'Animation', 'Su Da, Chen Zhihong, Wan Laiming', null, 'Chen Daoming, Yang Li, Chen Peisi, Zhang Guoli, Liu Ye, He Jiong, Yao Chen, Chen Kaige', null, 'A completely remade animation film based on the original 1961 animation The Monkey King. Mythical ancient China. Born from some magic stones that fell to Earth a long time ago when Goddess Nüwa mended the sky, Sun Wukong, aka Monkey King, sets off on his first adventure to gain a worthy weapon. This earns the attention of the Jade Emperor of Heaven.', 'A completely remade animation film based on the original 1961 animation The Monkey King. Mythical ancient China. Born from some magic stones that fell to Earth a long time ago when Goddess Nüwa mended the sky, Sun Wukong, aka Monkey King, sets off on his first adventure to gain a worthy weapon. This earns the attention of the Jade Emperor of Heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCWKk5tq6XphcncG1bhC6ugAdAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145954'),
  ('1055282872759549036', 'The Monkey King: Reborn', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Family', 'Wang Yunfei', 'Wang Yunfei, Xiaoyu Wu', 'Jiang Bian, Haiting Cai, Su Shangqing, Zhang Lei, Zhang He, Lin Qiang, Liu Sicen, Wang Chenguang', null, 'When the irritable monkey king visits a temple together with his master Tang Monk, he feels offended because of a trifle and thereupon accidentally destroys a magic tree growing on the sacred ground. This brings an ancient demon king back to life, who promptly kidnaps Tang Monk to take revenge for his long imprisonment. The monkey king and his followers have only three days to not only save their master but also to prevent the demon king from regaining his full powers and destroying the world…', 'When the irritable monkey king visits a temple together with his master Tang Monk, he feels offended because of a trifle and thereupon accidentally destroys a magic tree growing on the sacred ground. This brings an ancient demon king back to life, who promptly kidnaps Tang Monk to take revenge for his long imprisonment. The monkey king and his followers have only three days to not only save their master but also to prevent the demon king from regaining his full powers and destroying the world…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67YXOoKGODyGvJXfXzVmgHNXYh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811634'),
  ('916274120919060567', 'The Monkey King: Uproar in Heaven', 1961, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Wan Laiming, Tang Cheng', 'Li Keruo, Wan Laiming', 'Qiu Yuefeng, Fu Runsheng, Bi Ke, Shang Hua, Yu Ding', null, 'Sun Wukong, the King of the Monkeys, sets off on his first adventure to gain a worthy weapon. This earns the attention of the Jade Emperor of Heaven.', 'Sun Wukong, the King of the Monkeys, sets off on his first adventure to gain a worthy weapon. This earns the attention of the Jade Emperor of Heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBHI9QjQyCyJP7EtqoGweahTU8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47759'),
  ('257639911385152596', 'The Monkey''s Mask', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Samantha Lang, James McTeigue, Garry Phillips', 'Anne Kennedy', 'Susie Porter, Kelly McGillis, Abbie Cornish, John Noble, Brendan Cowell, Marton Csokas, Linden Wilkinson, Deborah Mailman', null, 'A lesbian private detective dives head first into murder, manipulation and the consuming power of sex.', 'A lesbian private detective dives head first into murder, manipulation and the consuming power of sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndjld6gVqYxsdxG99hnNjwWVZDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47574'),
  ('542248535194312471', 'The Monkey''s Paw', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brett Simmons, Scott Winig', 'Macon Blair', 'C.J. Thomason, Stephen Lang, Michelle Pierce, Corbin Bleu, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Charles S. Dutton, Tauvia Dawn, Jessica Garvey', 'NR', 'After Jake Tilton is given a mystical "monkey''s paw" talisman that grants its possessor three wishes, he finds his world turned upside down after his first two wishes result in his malevolent coworker, Tony Cobb, being resurrected from the dead. When Cobb pressures Jake into using the final wish to reunite Cobb with his son, his intimidation quickly escalates into relentless murder - forcing Jake to outwit his psychotic friend and save his remaining loved ones.', 'After Jake Tilton is given a mystical "monkey''s paw" talisman that grants its possessor three wishes, he finds his world turned upside down after his first two wishes result in his malevolent coworker, Tony Cobb, being resurrected from the dead. When Cobb pressures Jake into using the final wish to reunite Cobb with his son, his intimidation quickly escalates into relentless murder - forcing Jake to outwit his psychotic friend and save his remaining loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKL3skF2qCQPcVm2PpR52DJfQKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222911'),
