  ('242064511229642520', 'The Monocle''s Sour Laugh', 1964, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Maurice Fellous, Georges Lautner, Claude Vital', 'Colonel Rémy', 'Paul Meurisse, Marcel Dalio, Olivier Despax, Edward Meeks, Henri Nassiet, Pierre Richard, Michel Duplaix, Renée Saint-Cyr', null, 'A French agent goes after a gang of Asian terrorists who plan to blow up an American nuclear aircraft carrier.', 'A French agent goes after a gang of Asian terrorists who plan to blow up an American nuclear aircraft carrier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5y339syhF6XaDF13VkvGVjSZ3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74876'),
  ('76644623825915031', 'The Monolith Monsters', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ellis W. Carter, John Sherwood, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Robert M. Fresco, Norman Jolley', 'Grant Williams, Lola Albright, Les Tremayne, Trevor Bardette, William Flaherty, Harry Jackson, Richard H. Cutting, Linda Scheley', null, 'Rocks from a meteor which grow when in contact with water threaten a sleepy Southwestern desert community.', 'Rocks from a meteor which grow when in contact with water threaten a sleepy Southwestern desert community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIStqMPFzdvOs4Lm0kRwEMGNNm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52196'),
  ('988902830737202624', 'The Monopoly of Violence', 2020, 'Documentary', 'David Dufresne, Edmond Carrère', 'David Dufresne', 'Arié Alimi, Myriam Ayad, Ludivine Bantigny, Benoît Barret, Taha Bouhafs, William Bourdon, Anthony Caillé, Bertrand Cavallier', null, 'As anger and resentment grow in the face of social inequalities, many citizens-led protests are being repressed with an ever-increasing violence. In this documentary, David Dufresne gathers a panel of citizens to question, exchange and confront their views on the social order and the legitimacy of the use of force by the State.', 'As anger and resentment grow in the face of social inequalities, many citizens-led protests are being repressed with an ever-increasing violence. In this documentary, David Dufresne gathers a panel of citizens to question, exchange and confront their views on the social order and the legitimacy of the use of force by the State.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5sNOEbnFPkxEwDmGDPbK80kTTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723124'),
