  ('1090890092576468588', 'The Monster of Frankenstein', 1981, 'Horror, Animation, TV Movie', 'Yugo Serikawa, Toyoo Ashida', 'Akiyoshi Sakai', 'Hōsei Komatsu, Nachi Nozawa, Kei Tomiyama, Mami Koyama, Minori Matsushima, Joji Yanami, Yoku Shioya, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'In an ill-fated attempt to harness the forces of nature, Dr. Frankenstein creates a monster. This gentle giant roams the countryside in search of a peaceful life, but is finally overcome with loneliness and despair as his fearsome visage strikes terror in the minds of young and old alike.', 'In an ill-fated attempt to harness the forces of nature, Dr. Frankenstein creates a monster. This gentle giant roams the countryside in search of a peaceful life, but is finally overcome with loneliness and despair as his fearsome visage strikes terror in the minds of young and old alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCd9Kh37PDE50yWliT2sOy9lgW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3066'),
  ('92761422012202431', 'The Monster of London City', 1964, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Edwin Zbonek, Siegfried Hold, Lucie Berndsen', 'Bryan Edgar Wallace, Robert A. Stemmle', 'Hansjörg Felmy, Marianne Koch, Hans Nielsen, Dietmar Schönherr, Fritz Tillmann, Walter Pfeil, Chariklia Baxevanos, Peer Schmidt', 'NR', 'Then the spirit of Jack the Ripper seems to be very much alive in 1960s London as a series of brutal slayings by the Monster of London City has Scotland Yard baffled. In a macabre coincidence, a new play about the famous murderer is about to become a major West End hit... and the leading man is rapidly becoming the prime suspect!', 'Then the spirit of Jack the Ripper seems to be very much alive in 1960s London as a series of brutal slayings by the Monster of London City has Scotland Yard baffled. In a macabre coincidence, a new play about the famous murderer is about to become a major West End hit... and the leading man is rapidly becoming the prime suspect!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IHXMtuDuuKQXJvTeWPzCdtj6mL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198400'),
  ('880823554782734911', 'The Monster of Piedras Blancas', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Philip H. Lathrop, Irvin Berwick, Joseph C. Cavalier', 'H. Haile Chace', 'Les Tremayne, Forrest Lewis, John Harmon, Frank Arvidson, Jeanne Carmen, Don Sullivan, Pete Dunn, Joseph La Cava', 'NR', 'An old lighthouse keeper who lives with his daughter secretly keeps a prehistoric fish-man by feeding it scraps and fish. One day he misses the feeding and all hell breaks loose.', 'An old lighthouse keeper who lives with his daughter secretly keeps a prehistoric fish-man by feeding it scraps and fish. One day he misses the feeding and all hell breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hfimtEN7ddXwF9k6jZ22x5CZoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90030'),
  ('318108408715256987', 'The Monster of the Opera', 1964, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Renato Polselli, Ugo Brunelli', 'Renato Polselli, Ernesto Gastaldi, Giuseppe Pellegrini', 'Marco Mariani, Giuseppe Addobbati, Barbara Howard, Alberto Archetti, Carla Cavalli, Aldo Nicodemi, Jody Excell, Milena Vukotić', null, 'A theater troupe''s young, energetic leader has secured an old theater in which to produce his new production. The theater''s elderly caretaker urges the group to leave at once. A vampire is awakened and discovers that one of the troupe is the reincarnation of the woman who he once loved.', 'A theater troupe''s young, energetic leader has secured an old theater in which to produce his new production. The theater''s elderly caretaker urges the group to leave at once. A vampire is awakened and discovers that one of the troupe is the reincarnation of the woman who he once loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRvfoKeN49dv7FbXcGCBSXCJ3wv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295647'),
  ('418522352803112460', 'The Monster Project', 2017, 'Action, Horror', 'Victor Mathieu, Robert Moyer, David Michael Harwell', 'Corbin Billings, Victor Mathieu, Shariya Lynn', 'Yvonne Zima, Justin Bruening, Toby Hemingway, Jim Storm, PeiPei Alena Yuan, Shiori Ideta, Shayne Eastin, Murielle Zuker', null, 'A group of aspiring filmmakers interview three individuals who claim to be monsters. However, unique incidents start to occur when they start filming.', 'A group of aspiring filmmakers interview three individuals who claim to be monsters. However, unique incidents start to occur when they start filming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1E0JW9zqFwOO7w0HiuEPo6N7HBl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462036'),
  ('915316418985156316', 'The Monster Squad', 1987, 'Comedy, Action, Fantasy', 'David F. Klassen, Brent Boates, Fred Dekker', 'Shane Black, Fred Dekker', 'André Gower, Robby Kiger, Stephen Macht, Duncan Regehr, Tom Noonan, Brent Chalem, Ryan Lambert, Ashley Bank', 'PG-13', 'Count Dracula returns to the world of humans accompanied by Frankenstein''s Monster, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and the Gillman. The uglies are in search of a powerful amulet that will grant them the ability to rule the world. A group of horror-loving heroes are the only ones daring to stand in their way.', 'Count Dracula returns to the world of humans accompanied by Frankenstein''s Monster, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and the Gillman. The uglies are in search of a powerful amulet that will grant them the ability to rule the world. A group of horror-loving heroes are the only ones daring to stand in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EVuqCcqFzQvc7X8E3fx3w4B5Td.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13509'),
  ('157339026632716221', 'The Monster That Challenged the World', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Arnold Laven, Lester White, Scotty Welbourne', 'Pat Fielder', 'Tim Holt, Audrey Dalton, Hans Conried, Barbara Darrow, Max Showalter, Harlan Warde, Gordon Jones, Mimi Gibson', 'NR', 'Giants Mollusks are released from the earth by an earthquake and start killing people.', 'Giants Mollusks are released from the earth by an earthquake and start killing people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnXcmKzNatbvuXj20xTXQt7Ne9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53949'),
  ('558904493411495094', 'The Monster Walks', 1932, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Frank R. Strayer, Wilfred Black, Jules Cronjager', null, 'Rex Lease, Vera Reynolds, Sheldon Lewis, Mischa Auer, Martha Mattox, Sidney Bracey, Willie Best', 'NR', 'Ruth Earlton has come home to her ancestral mansion to claim her inheritance. Accompanied by her boyfriend, she discovers that her father died suddenly under suspicious circumstances. Now it''s her turn, as her deranged and relentless uncle targets her for death with the help of his wife and son, plus a very unhappy ape.', 'Ruth Earlton has come home to her ancestral mansion to claim her inheritance. Accompanied by her boyfriend, she discovers that her father died suddenly under suspicious circumstances. Now it''s her turn, as her deranged and relentless uncle targets her for death with the help of his wife and son, plus a very unhappy ape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2MEDsZHT2zYCTXnYbsL2JyfWKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95560'),
  ('678062740513218712', 'The Monster Within', 2026, 'Horror', 'Dino Longo Sabanovic', null, 'Russ Brookside, Edward Jack Cole, Nicole Craner, Elizabeth Freeman, Lilly Ann Hernandez', null, 'In a quiet town, reclusive Garrett inherits his family''s 100-acre farm. Beneath the land lies something ancient and hungry. As the evil stirs, he must decide how far he''ll go to keep it buried-before it consumes him entirely.', 'In a quiet town, reclusive Garrett inherits his family''s 100-acre farm. Beneath the land lies something ancient and hungry. As the evil stirs, he must decide how far he''ll go to keep it buried-before it consumes him entirely.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fde0abdab2c2085bdc4bfd6f3fd61a458.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-monster-within-2026'),
  ('771497079083731583', 'The Monster X Strikes Back: Attack the G8 Summit', 2008, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Minoru Kawasaki', 'Masakazu Migita', 'Natsuki Kato, Kazuki Kato, Hide Fukumoto, Akira Matsushita, Matabe Watabe, Jon Heese, Anatoli Krasnov, Inge Murata', null, 'When heads of state gather at the G8 summit in Japan, Guilala -- the intergalactic monster that had been banished from the earth in The X from Outer Space -- returns to ravage the Japanese countryside and threaten the world leaders. Military strikes prove futile against the beast, but a reporter learns that one rural community possesses a strange ritual that might influence the creature. Minoru Kawasaki directs this campy satire.', 'When heads of state gather at the G8 summit in Japan, Guilala -- the intergalactic monster that had been banished from the earth in The X from Outer Space -- returns to ravage the Japanese countryside and threaten the world leaders. Military strikes prove futile against the beast, but a reporter learns that one rural community possesses a strange ritual that might influence the creature. Minoru Kawasaki directs this campy satire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imuNHQ7SsFUdeZeUhY7k3xcMAmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70798'),
  ('376634888392638161', 'The Monsters', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Vana Caruso, Alfio Contini', 'Ruggero Maccari, Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Vittorio Gassman, Lando Buzzanca, Marisa Merlini, Rika Dialina, Michèle Mercier, Marino Masé, Franco Castellani', null, 'The myths of the sixties are satirized in 20 episodes.', 'The myths of the sixties are satirized in 20 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ojy9P8zp1Fz8byLqACux5H2cVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45005'),
  ('359745474134203392', 'The Monuments Men', 2014, 'War, Drama, History, Action', 'George Clooney, Phedon Papamichael, Helen Jarvis', 'Grant Heslov, George Clooney', 'George Clooney, Matt Damon, Bill Murray, John Goodman, Cate Blanchett, Hugh Bonneville, Sam Hazeldine, Jean Dujardin', 'PG-13', 'Based on the true story of the greatest treasure hunt in history, The Monuments Men is an action drama focusing on seven over-the-hill, out-of-shape museum directors, artists, architects, curators, and art historians who went to the front lines of WWII to rescue the world’s artistic masterpieces from Nazi thieves and return them to their rightful owners. With the art hidden behind enemy lines, how could these guys hope to succeed?', 'Based on the true story of the greatest treasure hunt in history, The Monuments Men is an action drama focusing on seven over-the-hill, out-of-shape museum directors, artists, architects, curators, and art historians who went to the front lines of WWII to rescue the world’s artistic masterpieces from Nazi thieves and return them to their rightful owners. With the art hidden behind enemy lines, how could these guys hope to succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiWAg4mKV2S4vImPxsPRIdj2R2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152760'),
  ('255972843472875690', 'The Moon', 1994, 'Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Takashi Ito', null, null, null, '"A long time ago, I would often dream of the uncanny and mystical landscape that appears in moonlight. Irrational landscapes and spaces filled with unspeakable pleasures like a black object that revolves slowly while flying over the scattered clouds that float in the night sky, their lumps illuminated by the light of the moon." - Takashi Ito', '"A long time ago, I would often dream of the uncanny and mystical landscape that appears in moonlight. Irrational landscapes and spaces filled with unspeakable pleasures like a black object that revolves slowly while flying over the scattered clouds that float in the night sky, their lumps illuminated by the light of the moon." - Takashi Ito', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zw7cX8KLt3PR4nEPW936QFKZuZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284255'),
  ('595902783783455118', 'The Moon', 2023, 'Drama, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Kwon Hyuk-ju, Kim Jung-woo, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Park Hee-kang', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Doh Kyung-soo, Kim Hee-ae, Park Byung-eun, Cho Han-cheul, Choi Byung-mo, Hong Seung-hee, Lee Sung-min', null, 'In 2029, Korea''s lunar probe Woori embarks on a historic journey to the moon, capturing global attention.', 'In 2029, Korea''s lunar probe Woori embarks on a historic journey to the moon, capturing global attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LfXejDvxnOGZ0VEBZMBVekGWgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753091'),
  ('837892685639794660', 'The Moon and Sixpence', 1942, 'Drama', 'John F. Seitz, Albert Lewin', 'Albert Lewin', 'George Sanders, Herbert Marshall, Doris Dudley, Eric Blore, Albert Bassermann, Florence Bates, Steven Geray, Elena Verdugo', null, 'Loosely inspired from Gauguin''s life, the story of Charles Strickland, a middle-aged stockbrocker who abandons his middle-classed life, his family, his duties to start painting, what he has always wanted to do. He is from now on a awful human being, wholly devoted to his ideal: beauty.', 'Loosely inspired from Gauguin''s life, the story of Charles Strickland, a middle-aged stockbrocker who abandons his middle-classed life, his family, his duties to start painting, what he has always wanted to do. He is from now on a awful human being, wholly devoted to his ideal: beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymkV9KzBHDRshe4M6CiLi5L7pYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56146'),
  ('910936822382153780', 'The Moon and the Son: An Imagined Conversation', 2005, 'Animation', 'John Canemaker', null, 'Eli Wallach, John Turturro', null, 'An animated documentary that explores the terrain of father/son relationships, as seen through Canemaker''s own turbulent relationship with his father.', 'An animated documentary that explores the terrain of father/son relationships, as seen through Canemaker''s own turbulent relationship with his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6i9BbgXioPZOQidM4UwnScvYTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44360'),
  ('531756569252052941', 'The Moon Has Risen', 1955, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Shōhei Imamura, Shigeyoshi Mine', 'Ryōsuke Saitō, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Chishū Ryū, Shūji Sano, Hisako Yamane, Yōko Sugi, Mie Kitahara, Kō Mishima, Shōji Yasui, Kinuyo Tanaka', null, 'Mokichi is the widowed father of three daughters, with whom he lives on the premises of a temple since the war. All three daughters become involved in some sort of complicated relationships.', 'Mokichi is the widowed father of three daughters, with whom he lives on the premises of a temple since the war. All three daughters become involved in some sort of complicated relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIuPZHNs7aq08o7HNan1kitfMNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256663'),
  ('793871161670160026', 'The Moon in the Gutter', 1983, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Jean-Jacques Beineix, Philippe Rousselot', 'Jean-Jacques Beineix, Olivier Mergault', 'Gérard Depardieu, Nastassja Kinski, Victoria Abril, Bertice Reading, Gabriel Monnet, Dominique Pinon, Milena Vukotić, Vittorio Mezzogiorno', null, 'A dockworker seeking revenge on the killer of his sister finds himself the object of desire for two women.', 'A dockworker seeking revenge on the killer of his sister finds himself the object of desire for two women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfRYqIKGf5hr8wo3IOrCk1nkgBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47489'),
  ('154597820852404771', 'The Moon Is Blue', 1953, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Otto Preminger, Ernest Laszlo', 'F. Hugh Herbert', 'William Holden, David Niven, Maggie McNamara, Tom Tully, Dawn Addams, Fortunio Bonanova, Gregory Ratoff, Johannes Heesters', null, 'Two aging playboys are both after the same attractive young woman, but she fends them off by claiming that she plans to remain a virgin until her wedding night. Both men determine to find a way around her objections.', 'Two aging playboys are both after the same attractive young woman, but she fends them off by claiming that she plans to remain a virgin until her wedding night. Both men determine to find a way around her objections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKwmMM7gBFloF13EapN6XXpQlFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71839'),
  ('546812852192231016', 'The Moon Is Down', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Irving Pichel, Arthur C. Miller', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Cedric Hardwicke, Henry Travers, Lee J. Cobb, Dorris Bowdon, Margaret Wycherly, Peter van Eyck, William Post Jr., Henry Rowland', null, 'The story of a small town in Norway that resists German occupation during World War II. Based on a John Steinbeck novel.', 'The story of a small town in Norway that resists German occupation during World War II. Based on a John Steinbeck novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7h46xgnvYn4f13tx4VZV3fEegK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113534'),
  ('774127374841180484', 'The Moon Is... the Sun''s Dream', 1992, 'Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Park Chan-wook, Park Seung-bae, Kim Kang-il', 'Park Chan-wook, Kim Yong-tae', 'Lee Seung-chul, Na Hyun-Hee, Song Seung-hwan, Bang Eun-hee, Lee Ki-yeol, Kim Dong-soo, Kim Yong-tae, Kim Ye-ryeong', null, 'A gangster in Busan is caught having an affair with his boss'' mistress and the two run off with their organization''s money.', 'A gangster in Busan is caught having an affair with his boss'' mistress and the two run off with their organization''s money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tCi86Yh88WBz1cAvDWV6l1m2Fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208619'),
  ('987215103791259486', 'The Moon-Spinners', 1964, 'Mystery, Family, Thriller, Romance', 'James Neilson, Paul Beeson', 'Michael Dyne', 'Hayley Mills, Eli Wallach, Peter McEnery, Joan Greenwood, Irene Papas, Pola Negri, John Le Mesurier, Sheila Hancock', 'G', 'Young English girl Nikky and her aunt arrive at the Moon-Spinners, a hotel on Crete, to a less than enthusiastic welcome. The coolness of the owner is only out-done by the surliness of her brother Stratos, recently back from London. But then there is nice English lad Mark to make friends with, at least until Stratos and his pal take a shot at him one night. When Nikky helps him hide she finds the Greeks are after her too.', 'Young English girl Nikky and her aunt arrive at the Moon-Spinners, a hotel on Crete, to a less than enthusiastic welcome. The coolness of the owner is only out-done by the surliness of her brother Stratos, recently back from London. But then there is nice English lad Mark to make friends with, at least until Stratos and his pal take a shot at him one night. When Nikky helps him hide she finds the Greeks are after her too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRsJ7CbJG4GibduaQKJ69qJPddf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42795'),
  ('1016242802580032572', 'The Moonlight Sonata', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Olli Soinio, Kari Sohlberg, Nadja Pyykkö', 'Olli Soinio', 'Tiina Björkman, Kari Sorvali, Mikko Kivinen, Kim Gunell, Soli Labbart, Ville-Veikko Salminen, Risto Salmi, Toivo Tuomainen', null, 'A female fashion model Anni Stark takes leave from the fashion business and goes to Finland''s Lapland for a vacation. Little does she know that there''s a totally lunatic bunch of local hillbillies living in a nearby farmhouse. The plot thickens as one of the residents begins to harass Anni, who is left alone in the wilderness with only her dog to protect her. Too bad for her that her dog turns out to have divided loyalties.', 'A female fashion model Anni Stark takes leave from the fashion business and goes to Finland''s Lapland for a vacation. Little does she know that there''s a totally lunatic bunch of local hillbillies living in a nearby farmhouse. The plot thickens as one of the residents begins to harass Anni, who is left alone in the wilderness with only her dog to protect her. Too bad for her that her dog turns out to have divided loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oh5y8z6VgoqwinkQxswrDL4GU6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112427'),
  ('735444916816761099', 'The Moonlighter', 1953, 'Western', 'Roy Rowland, Bert Glennon, Horace Hough', 'Niven Busch', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Fred MacMurray, Ward Bond, William Ching, John Dierkes, Morris Ankrum, Jack Elam, Charles Halton', 'NR', 'Wes Anderson is caught cattle rustling and promptly jailed. The public is outraged, but, since Wes always worked at night, they don''t know what he looks like. Still, they break into the prison and lynch a hobo they think is Wes, while the actual culprit sneaks off to see his old flame, Rela, who has recently taken up with his straitlaced brother, Tom (William Ching). But Tom is envious of his outlaw brother, and he decides to join Wes in a life of crime.', 'Wes Anderson is caught cattle rustling and promptly jailed. The public is outraged, but, since Wes always worked at night, they don''t know what he looks like. Still, they break into the prison and lynch a hobo they think is Wes, while the actual culprit sneaks off to see his old flame, Rela, who has recently taken up with his straitlaced brother, Tom (William Ching). But Tom is envious of his outlaw brother, and he decides to join Wes in a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vCAEVuOWIypE8HDQ5klcvJSsVj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153228'),
  ('777150552919324876', 'The Moonshine War', 1970, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Richard Quine, Richard H. Kline', 'Elmore Leonard', 'Patrick McGoohan, Richard Widmark, Alan Alda, Melodie Johnson, Will Geer, Joe Williams, Susanne Zenor, Lee Hazlewood', 'PG', 'A federal agent attempts to make some real money before the alcohol ban is lifted so he sets his sights on the whiskey cache of an old army buddy.', 'A federal agent attempts to make some real money before the alcohol ban is lifted so he sets his sights on the whiskey cache of an old army buddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utGuA91xgA0niD0d6hKXvZfaXtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123434'),
  ('165809662363493425', 'The Moonstone', 1972, 'Drama, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Paddy Russell', 'Hugh Leonard', 'Robin Ellis, Vivien Heilbron, Martin Jarvis, Kathleen Byron, Peter Sallis, Colin Baker, Stephen Rea, Pat Gorman', null, 'Adaptation of the classic novel. A priceless jewel, originally plundered from a Hindu shrine, is presented to Rachel Verinder on her 18th birthday. The jewel goes missing and suspicion falls over the household, threatening to destroy someone close to Rachel''s heart.', 'Adaptation of the classic novel. A priceless jewel, originally plundered from a Hindu shrine, is presented to Rachel Verinder on her 18th birthday. The jewel goes missing and suspicion falls over the household, threatening to destroy someone close to Rachel''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSwo0WrKk5b9dp4TwqVgZ4tko8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232016'),
  ('5737777914978040', 'The Moor', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Kyle Brearey, Sam Cronin, Chris Cronin', 'Paul Thomas', 'Sophia La Porta, David Edward-Robertson, Elizabeth Dormer-Phillips, Mark Peachey, Vicki Hackett, Bernard Hill, Dexter Sol Ansell, Margaret Brearey', null, 'Claire is approached by the father of her murdered childhood friend to help investigate the haunted moor he believes is his son''s final resting place.', 'Claire is approached by the father of her murdered childhood friend to help investigate the haunted moor he believes is his son''s final resting place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5l3MJjjCWl8GXXNWC7rCMmaB71g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155095'),
  ('497451895850696766', 'The Moose Hunt', 1931, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney', null, 'Mickey''s hunting, along with a characteristically playful and distracted (and uncharacteristically talkative) Pluto. Pluto fetches a forked branch, and Mickey shoots, mistaking it for antlers, but Pluto is OK. Then they find a moose, and Mickey''s gun fails but they escape when Pluto does an impression of Dumbo, with Mickey riding.', 'Mickey''s hunting, along with a characteristically playful and distracted (and uncharacteristically talkative) Pluto. Pluto fetches a forked branch, and Mickey shoots, mistaking it for antlers, but Pluto is OK. Then they find a moose, and Mickey''s gun fails but they escape when Pluto does an impression of Dumbo, with Mickey riding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Cv8zqtQebvlhzi1EAjV4q8TIez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162561'),
  ('894739981895756214', 'The Moralist', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Bianchi, Alvaro Mancori, Silvana Mangini Colizzi', 'Ettore Maria Margadonna, Luciana Corda, Oreste Biancoli', 'Alberto Sordi, Vittorio De Sica, Maria Perschy, Franco Fabrizi, Christiane Nielsen, Mara Berni, Carl Wery, Franca Valeri', null, 'The newly appointed head of a censorship board uses his uncompromising stance against everything "immoral" – from nudity in movies to nightclubs – to hide a rather unseemly double life.', 'The newly appointed head of a censorship board uses his uncompromising stance against everything "immoral" – from nudity in movies to nightclubs – to hide a rather unseemly double life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzjeJS2tTpKg4iRGffULkM6puKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82060'),
  ('859013821618112372', 'The More the Merrier', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Stevens, Morris Stoloff, Ted Tetzlaff', 'Robert Russell, Frank Ross, Richard Flournoy', 'Jean Arthur, Joel McCrea, Charles Coburn, Richard Gaines, Bruce Bennett, Frank Sully, Donald Douglas, Clyde Fillmore', null, 'It''s World War II and there is a severe housing shortage everywhere - especially in Washington, D.C. where Connie Milligan rents an apartment. Believing it to be her patriotic duty, Connie offers to sublet half of her apartment, fully expecting a suitable female tenent. What she gets instead is mischievous, middle-aged Benjamin Dingle. Dingle talks her into subletting to him and then promptly sublets half of his half to young, irreverent Joe Carter - creating a situation tailor-made for comedy and romance.', 'It''s World War II and there is a severe housing shortage everywhere - especially in Washington, D.C. where Connie Milligan rents an apartment. Believing it to be her patriotic duty, Connie offers to sublet half of her apartment, fully expecting a suitable female tenent. What she gets instead is mischievous, middle-aged Benjamin Dingle. Dingle talks her into subletting to him and then promptly sublets half of his half to young, irreverent Joe Carter - creating a situation tailor-made for comedy and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkwpXQh3rNJWooaFXwZ0tVxmqF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80616'),
  ('1111272458309733855', 'The Morgue', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Halder Gomes, Gerson Sanginitto', 'Najla Ann Al-Doori', 'Bill Cobbs, Lisa Crilley, Chris Devlin, Heather Donahue, Googy Gress, Taylor Lipman, Brady Matthews, Fred Ochs', 'R', 'A supernatural killer terrorizes a group of people in an eerie morgue.', 'A supernatural killer terrorizes a group of people in an eerie morgue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJoYci1bXaw2Ev8oxCnkaF5fV7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14209'),
  ('513271862614608015', 'The Morning After', 1986, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance, Crime', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Wolfgang Glattes', 'David Rayfiel', 'Jane Fonda, Jeff Bridges, Raúl Juliá, Diane Salinger, Richard Foronjy, Geoffrey Scott, James "Gypsy" Haake, Kathleen Wilhoite', 'R', 'Failed actress Alex Sternbergen wakes up hungover one morning in an apartment she does not recognize, unable to remember the previous evening -- and with a dead body in bed next to her. As she tries to piece together the events of the night, Alex cannot totally rely on friends or her estranged husband, Joaquin, for assistance. Only a single ally, loner ex-policeman Turner Kendall, can help her escape her predicament and find the true killer.', 'Failed actress Alex Sternbergen wakes up hungover one morning in an apartment she does not recognize, unable to remember the previous evening -- and with a dead body in bed next to her. As she tries to piece together the events of the night, Alex cannot totally rely on friends or her estranged husband, Joaquin, for assistance. Only a single ally, loner ex-policeman Turner Kendall, can help her escape her predicament and find the true killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxuR1RpAUWRHKzCwbjg2bw6RTGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31924'),
  ('294913232541568062', 'The Morning After', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille, Jean-André Silvestro, Méliane Marcaggi', 'Clément Michel, Christophe Duthuron, Méliane Marcaggi', 'Alexandra Lamy, Miou-Miou, Jonathan Zaccaï, Thomas Dutronc, Patrick Mille, Guillaume Bouchède, Léa Léviant, Frank Bellocq', null, 'Fed up with her cheating husband, Louise, 45, takes off for a weekend in Corsica. But after a wild night of unbridled passion with a man who winds up dead, Louise is unwittingly mistaken for his secret, longtime girlfriend by his Corsican fearsome but loving mother.', 'Fed up with her cheating husband, Louise, 45, takes off for a weekend in Corsica. But after a wild night of unbridled passion with a man who winds up dead, Louise is unwittingly mistaken for his secret, longtime girlfriend by his Corsican fearsome but loving mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Hmqp7Ct4aCuGb0SCpUFQj79y58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647745'),
  ('1093209624776805078', 'The Morning Sun Shines', 1929, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Seiichi Ina', 'Chiio Kimura', 'Takako Irie, Joji Oka, Kōju Murata, Eiji Nakano, Ranko Sawa, Heitaro Doi', null, 'The Morning Sun Shines is a fiction-documentary film by Kenji Mizoguchi and Seiichi Ina. The film is a combination of a drama about a reporter, and documentary footage about newspaper production. Only 25 minutes of footage has survived.', 'The Morning Sun Shines is a fiction-documentary film by Kenji Mizoguchi and Seiichi Ina. The film is a combination of a drama about a reporter, and documentary footage about newspaper production. Only 25 minutes of footage has survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1211qy7N6kB7XE5FiWq2Q25jdbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45976'),
  ('575972643375826915', 'The Moro Affair', 1986, 'Drama, History', 'Tersicore Kolosoff, Natale Massara, Franco Angeli', 'Robert Katz, Giuseppe Ferrara, Armenia Balducci', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Mattia Sbragia, Bruno Zanin, Enrica Maria Modugno, Consuelo Ferrara, Enrica Rosso, Maurizio Donadoni, Stefano Abbati', null, 'On March 16, 1978, far-left terrorists of the Red Brigades kidnap Aldo Moro, leader of the Christian Democracy, the ruling party in Italy since the end of WWII. 55 days later, his body will be found in the trunk of a car. This is a neutral and factual account of what happened in between.', 'On March 16, 1978, far-left terrorists of the Red Brigades kidnap Aldo Moro, leader of the Christian Democracy, the ruling party in Italy since the end of WWII. 55 days later, his body will be found in the trunk of a car. This is a neutral and factual account of what happened in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oNzKVu9uaOUaU4vZZSfxflMI4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63269'),
  ('424355861256820708', 'The Moromete Family', 1987, 'Drama', 'Stere Gulea, Vivi Drăgan Vasile', 'Stere Gulea', 'Victor Rebengiuc, Luminița Gheorghiu, Gina Patrichi, Dorel Vișan, Mitică Popescu, Florin Zamfirescu, Viorica Geantă-Chelbea, Emilia Popescu', null, 'Story of a family. Problems, marriage, taxes, revenge, friendship, army, life and much more.', 'Story of a family. Problems, marriage, taxes, revenge, friendship, army, life and much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4J0AN9hUPkzFoTRPsElyDfoXsDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32601'),
  ('1515074180929313', 'The Morrigan', 2026, 'Horror', 'Colum Eastwood, Robert Binnall', 'Colum Eastwood', 'Saffron Burrows, James Cosmo, Emily Flain, Art Parkinson, Jonathan Forbes', null, 'Follows an archaeologist who travels to Ireland to uncover a long-dead tomb. A threat is released and she will have to fight to keep her teenage daughter from falling under the control of The Morrigan, a vengeful "Pagan War Goddess."', 'Follows an archaeologist who travels to Ireland to uncover a long-dead tomb. A threat is released and she will have to fight to keep her teenage daughter from falling under the control of The Morrigan, a vengeful "Pagan War Goddess."', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F5%2Fgracenote%2F5631e25b003d1f59055fb2b2b5a6ca71.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-morrigan-2026'),
  ('326654543447929342', 'The Mortal Instruments: City of Bones', 2013, 'Fantasy, Action, Mystery', 'Harald Zwart, Geir Hartly Andreassen, Barbara Agbaje', 'Jessica Postigo, I. Marlene King', 'Lily Collins, Jamie Campbell Bower, Robert Sheehan, Kevin Zegers, Jemima West, Lena Headey, Aidan Turner, Jared Harris', 'PG-13', 'In New York City, Clary Fray, a seemingly ordinary teenager, learns that she is descended from a line of Shadowhunters — half-angel warriors who protect humanity from evil forces. After her mother disappears, Clary joins forces with a group of Shadowhunters and enters Downworld, an alternate realm filled with demons, vampires, and a host of other creatures. Clary and her companions must find and protect an ancient cup that holds the key to her mother''s future.', 'In New York City, Clary Fray, a seemingly ordinary teenager, learns that she is descended from a line of Shadowhunters — half-angel warriors who protect humanity from evil forces. After her mother disappears, Clary joins forces with a group of Shadowhunters and enters Downworld, an alternate realm filled with demons, vampires, and a host of other creatures. Clary and her companions must find and protect an ancient cup that holds the key to her mother''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaK1aVn5vXfNwLIDop9U8XA3Q0x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123553'),
  ('108809954772674918', 'The Mortal Storm', 1940, 'Drama', 'Frank Borzage, William H. Daniels, Lloyd Knechtel', 'George Froeschel, Hans Rameau, Claudine West', 'Margaret Sullavan, James Stewart, Robert Young, Frank Morgan, Robert Stack, Bonita Granville, Irene Rich, William T. Orr', 'NR', 'The Roth family leads a quiet life in a small village in the German Alps during the early 1930s. After the Nazis come to power, the family is divided and Martin Breitner, a family friend, is caught up in the turmoil.', 'The Roth family leads a quiet life in a small village in the German Alps during the early 1930s. After the Nazis come to power, the family is divided and Martin Breitner, a family friend, is caught up in the turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPvS7UVrJuCyE5NsiDkW39ABLGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989'),
  ('101843044338880059', 'The Mortuary Assistant', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jeremiah Kipp, Kevin Duggin', 'Brian Clarke, Tracee Beebe', 'Willa Holland, Paul Sparks, John Adams, Mark Steger, Shelly Gibson, Emily Bennett, Keena Ferguson', null, 'Rebecca Owens, a recent mortuary science graduate takes a night shift job at River Fields Mortuary. Initially, the job seems straightforward — embalming bodies, completing paperwork, and keeping things tidy. But once Rebecca starts working the night shift, things take a dark turn.', 'Rebecca Owens, a recent mortuary science graduate takes a night shift job at River Fields Mortuary. Initially, the job seems straightforward — embalming bodies, completing paperwork, and keeping things tidy. But once Rebecca starts working the night shift, things take a dark turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72AoFPC5TY4DfJwXXS9rPwPeReD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1470130'),
  ('542021296714879748', 'The Mortuary Collection', 2020, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Zack Walker, Heather I. Denton, Ryan Spindell', 'Ryan Spindell', 'Clancy Brown, Caitlin Custer, Sarah Hay, Mike C. Nelson, Jacob Elordi, Barak Hardley, Christine Kilmer, Ben Hethcoat', 'NR', 'In the phantasmagorical town of Raven''s End, a misguided young girl takes refuge in a decrepit old mortuary. The eccentric undertaker chronicles the strange history of the town through a series of twisted tales, each more terrifying than the last, but the young girl''s world is unhinged when she discovers that the final story... is her own.', 'In the phantasmagorical town of Raven''s End, a misguided young girl takes refuge in a decrepit old mortuary. The eccentric undertaker chronicles the strange history of the town through a series of twisted tales, each more terrifying than the last, but the young girl''s world is unhinged when she discovers that the final story... is her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WXeYnezavNI6hXH74aQYv6yFzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524216'),
  ('294718165778717973', 'The Mosquito Coast', 1986, 'Drama, Adventure', 'John Seale, Peter Weir, Steve E. Andrews', 'Paul Schrader', 'Harrison Ford, Helen Mirren, River Phoenix, Jadrien Steele, Hilary Gordon, Rebecca Gordon, Jason Alexander, Dick O''Neill', 'PG', 'An inventor spurns his city life and moves his family into the jungles of Central America to make a utopia.', 'An inventor spurns his city life and moves his family into the jungles of Central America to make a utopia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A1iDYSp8H5WORWZVCV3E3SpkGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11120'),
  ('1094564572254483522', 'The Mosquito Net', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Agustí Vila', 'Agustí Vila', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Emma Suárez, Martina García, Eduard Fernández, Àlex Brendemühl, Àlex Batllori, Marcos Franz', null, 'Maria suffers from Alzheimer''s disease. Luis, Maria''s fifteen-year-old grandson, doesn''t say very much either; he shuts himself off in his own silent world to escape his parent''s marital crisis, spending time instead picking up stray cats and dogs off the street. His father, Miguel, wants to put a stop to this eccentric behavior, but his protective mother Alice indulges him. Nevertheless, the animals begin to appear at home in increasing numbers, making life complicated for the family in their flat.', 'Maria suffers from Alzheimer''s disease. Luis, Maria''s fifteen-year-old grandson, doesn''t say very much either; he shuts himself off in his own silent world to escape his parent''s marital crisis, spending time instead picking up stray cats and dogs off the street. His father, Miguel, wants to put a stop to this eccentric behavior, but his protective mother Alice indulges him. Nevertheless, the animals begin to appear at home in increasing numbers, making life complicated for the family in their flat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJn1337MVElQA7LRLEHHoOLBavn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83345'),
  ('878505767521821424', 'The Most Assassinated Woman in the World', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Franck Ribière', 'Franck Ribière, Vérane Frédiani, David Murdoch', 'Anna Mouglalis, Niels Schneider, Éric Godon, André Wilms, Michel Fau, Constance Dollé, Jean-Michel Balthazar, Jean-Jacques Rausin', null, 'Set against the backdrop of the infamous Theatre Grand Guignol the story revolves around iconic actress Paula Maxa - the most famous of the Grand Guignol''s leading ladies and the titular Most Assassinated Woman, who was graphically slain on stage multiple times a day.', 'Set against the backdrop of the infamous Theatre Grand Guignol the story revolves around iconic actress Paula Maxa - the most famous of the Grand Guignol''s leading ladies and the titular Most Assassinated Woman, who was graphically slain on stage multiple times a day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tC4IfhFv84CxC19BXN3678IeNRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478100'),
  ('243545589661074702', 'The Most Beautiful', 1944, 'Drama, War', 'Akira Kurosawa, Jōji Ohara', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Takashi Shimura, Shōji Kiyokawa, Ichirō Sugai, Takako Irie, Yôko Yaguchi, Sayuri Tanima, Sachiko Ozaki, Shizuko Nishigaki', null, 'Young women at a precision optics factory in wartime Japan push to exceed production quotas, enduring illness, injury, and personal hardship to “serve the country.” Led by Tsuru Watanabe, they fight fatigue and setbacks to keep their line moving—even when duty collides with grief.', 'Young women at a precision optics factory in wartime Japan push to exceed production quotas, enduring illness, injury, and personal hardship to “serve the country.” Led by Tsuru Watanabe, they fight fatigue and setbacks to keep their line moving—even when duty collides with grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37EKyIKpmGLEX5Js0cQq9J8DFW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17988'),
  ('782574151261162273', 'The Most Beautiful Age', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Milan Kadlec, Milan Muchna, Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Hana Brejchová, Jan Stöckl, Josef Šebánek, Milada Ježková, Vladimír Šmeral, Jiří Sýkora, Ladislav Jakim, Věra Křesadlová', null, 'An artist''s studio is descended upon by a group of retired men and a young mother who agree to model in the nude for money. Comedy ensues as the students and the local bureaucracy react to the models, all in need of extra money. Several running gags border on slapstick as the officials and the students don''t know what to do with the nude models.', 'An artist''s studio is descended upon by a group of retired men and a young mother who agree to model in the nude for money. Comedy ensues as the students and the local bureaucracy react to the models, all in need of extra money. Several running gags border on slapstick as the officials and the students don''t know what to do with the nude models.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qT3dwZ7sdvPwHEZC2s7xyJaxIhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155133'),
  ('729092032680472219', 'The Most Beautiful Boy in the World', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Erik Vallsten, Kristian Petri, Kristina Lindström', 'Kristina Lindström, Kristian Petri', 'Björn Andrésen, Robine Román, Annike Andresen, Jessica Vennberg, Ann Lagerström, Miriam Sambol, Silva Filmer, Margareta Krantz', null, 'In 1971, due to the world premiere of Death in Venice, Italian director Lucino Visconti proclaimed his Tadzio as the world’s most beautiful boy. A shadow that today, 50 years later, weighs Björn Andrésen’s life.', 'In 1971, due to the world premiere of Death in Venice, Italian director Lucino Visconti proclaimed his Tadzio as the world’s most beautiful boy. A shadow that today, 50 years later, weighs Björn Andrésen’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNlnSwj34gemONfbBxaG8Trd1vR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730028'),
  ('496273849282710459', 'The Most Beautiful Couple', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Sven Taddicken, Daniela Knapp', 'Sven Taddicken', 'Maximilian Brückner, Luise Heyer, Leonard Kunz, Jasna Fritzi Bauer, Florian Bartholomäi, Matthias Lier, Aurel Manthei, Julius Nitschkoff', null, 'While two young teachers are spending their summer holiday on the Mediterranean coast they are overwhelmed by a sudden attack. Back home, they try to deal with the trauma in their own ways until a surprising encounter changes everything.', 'While two young teachers are spending their summer holiday on the Mediterranean coast they are overwhelmed by a sudden attack. Back home, they try to deal with the trauma in their own ways until a surprising encounter changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKpNGaSBw2ws86OwJZkfzvDwEx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483261'),
  ('95660489188129902', 'The Most Beautiful Day', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florian David Fitz, Bernhard Jasper, Marie-Amélie Steul', 'Florian David Fitz', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Florian David Fitz, Alexandra Maria Lara, Rainer Bock, Tatja Seibt, Henry Buchmann, Andreja Schneider, Kabelo Bouga Chalatsane', null, 'The overambitious pianist Andi and the more laid back Benno have one thing in common: They will both die soon. So the two of them decide to have the most awesome day before its too late.', 'The overambitious pianist Andi and the more laid back Benno have one thing in common: They will both die soon. So the two of them decide to have the most awesome day before its too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kd02ybOkAfmLaZDdAJL8DXT6ix8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373889'),
  ('289054861809516616', 'The Most Beautiful Day in the World', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Roy Bava, Marita D''Elia, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Gianluca Ansanelli, Alessandro Siani', 'Alessandro Siani, Stefania Spampinato, Giovanni Esposito, Stefano Pesce, Leigh Gill, Jun Ichikawa, Nicola Rignanese, Benedetto Casillo', null, 'Arturo Meraviglia is a struggling impresario who has to take care of Gioele and Rebecca, two children "inherited" by an old uncle. When he realizes that little Gioele has superpowers, his luck changes.', 'Arturo Meraviglia is a struggling impresario who has to take care of Gioele and Rebecca, two children "inherited" by an old uncle. When he realizes that little Gioele has superpowers, his luck changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDMEwUG80avoWoQ85ge6VoVyCrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606562'),
  ('35277545626989958', 'The Most Beautiful Girl in the World', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Music', 'Andreas Berger, Aron Lehmann', 'Lars Kraume, Aron Lehmann, Judy Horney', 'Aaron Hilmer, Luna Wedler, Damian Hardung, Jonas Ems, Anke Engelke, Heiko Pinkowski, Amelie Elisa Klein, Heike Makatsch', null, '17-year-old Cyril is funny, smart and an all-round good guy. Just his somewhat overlarge nose spoils the picture. On a school trip to Berlin with Roxy, a stunning new classmate, Cyril is not the only one taken with her. Benno, the class Casanova has his eye on the girl too and makes a nasty wager. Roxy is more interested in the introverted Rick, who is not only shy but also slow. Cyril hastens with his spoken word skills to Rick''s aid, and falls head over heels in love with Roxy himself. So whose brave heart will win the fair lady?', '17-year-old Cyril is funny, smart and an all-round good guy. Just his somewhat overlarge nose spoils the picture. On a school trip to Berlin with Roxy, a stunning new classmate, Cyril is not the only one taken with her. Benno, the class Casanova has his eye on the girl too and makes a nasty wager. Roxy is more interested in the introverted Rick, who is not only shy but also slow. Cyril hastens with his spoken word skills to Rick''s aid, and falls head over heels in love with Roxy himself. So whose brave heart will win the fair lady?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/makJhp5wSURUpHtdgaX3K3TkQcx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517062'),
  ('972575465406976024', 'The Most Beautiful Girl in the World', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Ronny, Hani Pradigya, Riri Pohan', 'Titien Wattimena, Ifan Adriansyah Ismail, Robert Ronny', 'Reza Rahadian, Sheila Dara Aisha, Kevin Julio, Indra Birowo, Jihane Almira, Bucek Depp, Ira Wibowo, Frederika Cull', 'PG-13', 'A playboy stages a dating show to earn his inheritance by granting his father''s last wish: for his son to marry the most beautiful girl in the world.', 'A playboy stages a dating show to earn his inheritance by granting his father''s last wish: for his son to marry the most beautiful girl in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8fgC2kom2ZSKP70tGLLvo3aCcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1393069'),
  ('453208906263562400', 'The Most Beautiful Wife', 1970, 'Crime, Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Mino Giarda, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Damiano Damiani, Enrico Ribulsi, Sofia Scandurra', 'Alessio Orano, Ornella Muti, Tano Cimarosa, Joe Sentieri, Enzo Andronico, Amerigo Tot, Pierluigi Aprà, Salvatore Baccaro', null, 'A 16-year-old Sicilian becomes the target of a mafia hit man after refusing to go through with her prearranged marriage.', 'A 16-year-old Sicilian becomes the target of a mafia hit man after refusing to go through with her prearranged marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbZHtvRh2YJcRXjrFmyzUUTIZaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152846'),
  ('516577029264110717', 'The Most Charming and Attractive', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gerald Bezhanov, Valentin Piganov, Leonid Bulgakov', 'Gerald Bezhanov, Anatoly Eyramdzhan', 'Irina Muravyova, Tatyana Vasileva, Aleksandr Abdulov, Leonid Kuravlyov, Mikhail Kokshenov, Lyudmila Ivanova, Larisa Udovichenko, Vladimir Nosik', null, 'Nadya Klyueva is a single woman. Persuaded by her friend, she decides to charm her co-worker whom she doesn''t really love, but who is the most popular man around.', 'Nadya Klyueva is a single woman. Persuaded by her friend, she decides to charm her co-worker whom she doesn''t really love, but who is the most popular man around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phy8a5Gja6avjQFialfRMNXKqNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65142'),
  ('106383455379558794', 'The Most Colorful Time of the Year', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Max McGuire, Michael Tien', 'Keith Hemstreet', 'Katrina Bowden, Christopher Russell, R Austin Ball, Bert Cardozo, Joanna Douglas, Ava Weiss, Holly Jade Balmer, Celine Bauwmans', 'G', 'Ryan is an elementary school teacher, who learns that he is colorblind. Michelle, an optometrist, and mother of one of his students, helps bring color into his life in time for the holidays.', 'Ryan is an elementary school teacher, who learns that he is colorblind. Michelle, an optometrist, and mother of one of his students, helps bring color into his life in time for the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZq3hbnJ9ekOyauDmja3jhcAfxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028561'),
  ('571386931350240375', 'The Most Dangerous Game', 1932, 'Thriller, Adventure, Horror, Action', 'Irving Pichel, Ernest B. Schoedsack, Henry W. Gerrard', 'James Ashmore Creelman', 'Joel McCrea, Fay Wray, Leslie Banks, Robert Armstrong, Noble Johnson, Steve Clemente, William B. Davidson, Oscar ''Dutch'' Hendrian', null, 'When legendary hunter Bob Rainsford is shipwrecked on the perilous reefs surrounding a mysterious island, he finds himself the guest of the reclusive and eccentric Count Zaroff. While he is very gracious at first, Zaroff eventually forces Rainsford and two other shipwreck survivors, brother and sister Eve and Martin Towbridge, to participate in a sadistic game of cat and mouse in which they are the prey and he is the hunter.', 'When legendary hunter Bob Rainsford is shipwrecked on the perilous reefs surrounding a mysterious island, he finds himself the guest of the reclusive and eccentric Count Zaroff. While he is very gracious at first, Zaroff eventually forces Rainsford and two other shipwreck survivors, brother and sister Eve and Martin Towbridge, to participate in a sadistic game of cat and mouse in which they are the prey and he is the hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aNlOIFlGOnIzxqvAWpgm5Sly1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1994'),
  ('317872703112540468', 'The Most Dangerous Game', 1978, 'Action, Crime', 'Tōru Murakawa, Yōichi Sai, Seizō Sengen', 'Hideichi Nagahara', 'Yūsaku Matsuda, Keiko Tasaka, Yōko Ichiji, Daigo Kusano, Asao Uchida, Bontarō Miake, Hiroshi Nawa, Ryuji Katagiri', null, 'The first movie of Tôru Murakawa’s “Game” trilogy, in which an assassin hired to recover a kidnap victim becomes embroiled in a vicious power struggle between two large corporations over a sizable government defence contract.', 'The first movie of Tôru Murakawa’s “Game” trilogy, in which an assassin hired to recover a kidnap victim becomes embroiled in a vicious power struggle between two large corporations over a sizable government defence contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuPkdMIXqBDuh30knGwOc4GI6iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344341'),
  ('1077307862209826023', 'The Most Dangerous Game', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Mado Smalona, Eamon Long, Justin Lee', 'Justin Lee', 'Tom Berenger, Chris ''C.T.'' Tamburello, Bruce Dern, Judd Nelson, Casper Van Dien, Elissa Dowling, Kevin Porter, Edward Finlay', 'NR', 'A father and son are shipwrecked on a remote island where they are caught up in a trophy hunt held by its mysterious owner, a merciless man who uses the land as an elite hunting preserve for stalking the most dangerous game of all: human.', 'A father and son are shipwrecked on a remote island where they are caught up in a trophy hunt held by its mysterious owner, a merciless man who uses the land as an elite hunting preserve for stalking the most dangerous game of all: human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bq7DORCkAJlipdfgFzQdmzUAiTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994702'),
  ('196507371028995546', 'The Most Dangerous Man in America', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Judith Ehrlich, Dan Krauss, Rick Goldsmith', 'Rick Goldsmith, Michael Chandler, Lawrence Lerew', 'Daniel Ellsberg, Patricia Ellsberg, John Dean, Howard Zinn, Peter Arnett, Ben Bagdikian, Ann Beeson, Robert Ellsberg', null, '"The Most Dangerous Man in America" is the story of what happens when a former Pentagon insider, armed only with his conscience, steadfast determination, and a file cabinet full of classified documents, decides to challenge an "imperial" presidency – answerable to neither Congress, the press, nor the people – in order to help end the Vietnam War.', '"The Most Dangerous Man in America" is the story of what happens when a former Pentagon insider, armed only with his conscience, steadfast determination, and a file cabinet full of classified documents, decides to challenge an "imperial" presidency – answerable to neither Congress, the press, nor the people – in order to help end the Vietnam War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/br3NZWHBAETFmfIBk4o9rvhByKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34576'),
  ('428855769197711973', 'The Most Dangerous Man in Europe: Otto Skorzeny''s After War', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Pedro de Echave, Javier González Bordas, Núria Abad', 'Pedro de Echave', 'Paloma Navarro, Luis María Pardo, José Luis Blanco Corredoira, Ralph P. Ganis, Almudena Grandes, Stuart Smith, Joan Buades, Javier Juárez', null, 'Waffen-SS officer Otto Skorzeny (1908-75) became famous for his participation in daring military actions during World War II. In 1947 he was judged and imprisoned, but he escaped less than a year later and found a safe haven in Spain, ruled with an iron hand by General Francisco Franco. What did he do during the many years he spent there?', 'Waffen-SS officer Otto Skorzeny (1908-75) became famous for his participation in daring military actions during World War II. In 1947 he was judged and imprisoned, but he escaped less than a year later and found a safe haven in Spain, ruled with an iron hand by General Francisco Franco. What did he do during the many years he spent there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ftSXSlgZvp4IDuOmX7Px40q60X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683398'),
  ('355556029858664', 'The Most Distant Course', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lin Jing-Jie, Yang Wei-han, Wen-zhong Song', 'Lin Jing-Jie', 'Gwei Lun-mei, Mo Tzu-yi, Alec Chia, James Wen, Iris Tseng, Eugene Chun-Hui Hsieh, Wu Pong-fong, Wang Tung', null, 'Three young souls, with different purposes, comes to the coast and search for the meaning of their life, a journey considerably longer than any of them has taken before.', 'Three young souls, with different purposes, comes to the coast and search for the meaning of their life, a journey considerably longer than any of them has taken before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUHoT1QhYj2PZCf4DXOX3BS4pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53545'),
  ('144294226608398125', 'The Most Hated Woman in America', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Armando Salas, Tommy O''Haver', 'Tommy O''Haver, Irene Turner', 'Melissa Leo, Josh Lucas, Michael Chernus, Rory Cochrane, Vincent Kartheiser, Adam Scott, Juno Temple, Sally Kirkland', null, 'The true story of Madalyn Murray O''Hair -- iconoclast, opportunist, and outspoken atheist -- from her controversial rise to her untimely demise.', 'The true story of Madalyn Murray O''Hair -- iconoclast, opportunist, and outspoken atheist -- from her controversial rise to her untimely demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRDu3SBQ1hFp2YeLhKa6WONKi3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401743'),
  ('1033244347715955491', 'The Most Precious of Cargoes', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Bernard Devillers, Aymeric Gendre', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Jean-Claude Grumberg', 'Dominique Blanc, Grégory Gadebois, Denis Podalydès, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Serge Hazanavicius, Antonin Maurel, Matej Hofmann, Laurent Bateau', null, 'Once upon a time, a poor woodcutter and his wife lived in a great forest. Cold, hunger, poverty, and a war raging all around them meant their lives were very hard. One day, the woodcutter''s wife rescues a baby. A baby girl thrown from one of the many trains that constantly pass through the forest. This baby, this "most precious of cargoes", will transform the lives of the poor woodcutter''s wife and her husband, as well as those whose paths the child will cross—including the man who threw her from the train. And some will try to protect her, whatever the cost. Their story will reveal the worst and the best in the hearts of men.', 'Once upon a time, a poor woodcutter and his wife lived in a great forest. Cold, hunger, poverty, and a war raging all around them meant their lives were very hard. One day, the woodcutter''s wife rescues a baby. A baby girl thrown from one of the many trains that constantly pass through the forest. This baby, this "most precious of cargoes", will transform the lives of the poor woodcutter''s wife and her husband, as well as those whose paths the child will cross—including the man who threw her from the train. And some will try to protect her, whatever the cost. Their story will reveal the worst and the best in the hearts of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jh5zlkFEkgL0UIkL9CoZGLl0e7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842859'),
  ('499643682528743760', 'The Most Terrible Time in My Life', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kaizo Hayashi, Isao Yukisada, Yuichi Nagata', 'Kaizo Hayashi, Daisuke Tengan', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Kaho Minami, Yang Haitin, Te-chien Hou, Joe Shishido, Shiro Sano, Kiyotaka Nanbara, Haruko Wanibuchi', null, 'Maiku Hama is a private detective working in Yokohama. Hama comes to the aid of a Taiwanese waiter named Yang and agrees to track down his missing brother. Through a series of double-crosses Hama gets embroiled in a gang war and a revenge plot between the two brothers', 'Maiku Hama is a private detective working in Yokohama. Hama comes to the aid of a Taiwanese waiter named Yang and agrees to track down his missing brother. Through a series of double-crosses Hama gets embroiled in a gang war and a revenge plot between the two brothers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffRn0MonRBfQk9xcW1iM0usizpR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85284'),
  ('1015553972025695045', 'The Most Wanted Man', 1953, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Michel Audiard, Jean Manse', 'Fernandel, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Nicole Maurey, Louis Seigner, Saturnin Fabre, Paolo Stoppa, Alfred Adam, Jean Marchat', null, 'A nearsighted clerk gets fired after embarrassing mishaps. He mistakenly takes a gangster''s raincoat, finds a gun inside, and is arrested as Public Enemy No. 1. Chaos erupts as both the police and the mob pursue him.', 'A nearsighted clerk gets fired after embarrassing mishaps. He mistakenly takes a gangster''s raincoat, finds a gun inside, and is arrested as Public Enemy No. 1. Chaos erupts as both the police and the mob pursue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVpDdPTw7QTxcYUugPmh3FxWD6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74764'),
  ('906538843129048591', 'The Most Wonderful Evening of My Life', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Ettore Scola, Claudio Cirillo', 'Ettore Scola, Sergio Amidei', 'Alberto Sordi, Charles Vanel, Claude Dauphin, Janet Ågren, Michel Simon, Giuseppe Maffioli, Pierre Brasseur, Hans-Jürgen Ballmann', null, 'A successful businessman whose destiny leads him to a secluded Swiss chalet where his life is put on trial by a group of retired law professionals. The men assemble to analyze Sordi''s rise to power and his increasingly immoral behavior as he attained success, and the warped perceptions of right and wrong he has adopted to remain successful.', 'A successful businessman whose destiny leads him to a secluded Swiss chalet where his life is put on trial by a group of retired law professionals. The men assemble to analyze Sordi''s rise to power and his increasingly immoral behavior as he attained success, and the warped perceptions of right and wrong he has adopted to remain successful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20ewytvrBwOW0RqjKPwQKsrhmAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58545'),
  ('754961035289648995', 'The Most Wonderful Time of the Year', 2008, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Michael M. Scott, Debra Herst, Vlad Horodinca', 'Bruce Graham', 'Brooke Burns, Henry Winkler, Warren Christie, Connor Christopher Levins, Woody Jeffreys, Serge Houde, Rebecca Toolan, Michael Roberds', null, 'Five-time Emmy nominee and Golden Globe winner Henry Winkler stars in The Most Wonderful Time of the Year, the story of what happens when you open your heart to the power of Christmas. Disenchanted single mom Jennifer Cullen (Brooke Burns) is a Scroogette when it comes to anything Christmas. In fact, even her six-year-old son, Brian, is having trouble believing in Santa Claus. But when her Uncle Ralph (Henry Winkler) visits and brings a fellow passenger from his flight named Morgan Derby (Warren Christie), Jennifer s dubious heart awakens to the possibility that perhaps Christmas really does hold miracles. It s uplifting and laugh-packed and a story that will inspire the whole family to believe.', 'Five-time Emmy nominee and Golden Globe winner Henry Winkler stars in The Most Wonderful Time of the Year, the story of what happens when you open your heart to the power of Christmas. Disenchanted single mom Jennifer Cullen (Brooke Burns) is a Scroogette when it comes to anything Christmas. In fact, even her six-year-old son, Brian, is having trouble believing in Santa Claus. But when her Uncle Ralph (Henry Winkler) visits and brings a fellow passenger from his flight named Morgan Derby (Warren Christie), Jennifer s dubious heart awakens to the possibility that perhaps Christmas really does hold miracles. It s uplifting and laugh-packed and a story that will inspire the whole family to believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVDLByvtadEiUJZqjEfIqyXs68l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35830'),
  ('982355679990138581', 'The Most Wonderful Time of the Year', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Silverman', 'Al Jean, J. Stewart Burns, Dan Greaney', 'Nancy Cartwright, Chris Edgerly, Tress MacNeille, Kelsey Grammer, Maurice LaMarche', 'PG', 'Sideshow Bob teams up with the most infamous villains of Disney+ to share the true meaning of the Halloween season. Filled with music, mayhem, and madness, this short from "The Simpsons" is simply to die for.', 'Sideshow Bob teams up with the most infamous villains of Disney+ to share the true meaning of the Halloween season. Filled with music, mayhem, and madness, this short from "The Simpsons" is simply to die for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ivqP56Jd8RkbDidoe1rGFVGpJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358947'),
  ('270505526457378063', 'The Mostly Unfabulous Social Life of Ethan Green', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Bamber', 'David Vernon', 'Daniel Letterle, Diego Serrano, Shanola Hampton, David Monahan, Richard Riehle, Joel Brooks, Scott Atkinson, Dean Shelton', 'R', 'Ethan Green (Daniel Letterle) has no problem finding guys who want to sleep with him or even date him, but finding someone to settle down with is a different story. Given three choices -- a sexy teenager, a hunky jock, or his ex-boyfriend who is about to get married -- will he find a Mr. Right, or is he destined to an unfabulous existence. Based on a popular gay-themed comic strip.', 'Ethan Green (Daniel Letterle) has no problem finding guys who want to sleep with him or even date him, but finding someone to settle down with is a different story. Given three choices -- a sexy teenager, a hunky jock, or his ex-boyfriend who is about to get married -- will he find a Mr. Right, or is he destined to an unfabulous existence. Based on a popular gay-themed comic strip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbZx18g9NlDzvsCCkajRbZu16cJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33358'),
  ('891747829906473819', 'The Motel Life', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alan Polsky, Roman Vasyanov, Gabe Polsky', 'Noah Harpster, Micah Fitzerman-Blue', 'Emile Hirsch, Stephen Dorff, Dakota Fanning, Kris Kristofferson, Joshua Leonard, Noah Harpster, Garrett Backstrom, Andrew Lee', 'R', 'A pair of working-class brothers flee their Reno Motel after getting involved in a fatal hit-and-run accident.', 'A pair of working-class brothers flee their Reno Motel after getting involved in a fatal hit-and-run accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Vygm1h8MsqSN6WKMdq4MwBbM5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80318'),
  ('930293021220762777', 'The Moth', 1980, 'Drama', 'Tomasz Zygadło, Jacek Zygadlo', 'Tomasz Zygadło', 'Roman Wilhelmi, Anna Seniuk, Iwona Bielska, Nela Obarska, Jerzy Trela, Grzegorz Heromiński, Marek Probosz, Piotr Fronczewski', null, 'This is psychological drama by Tomasz Zygadlo begins as a straightforward story. Jan is the host of a nightly talk show in which he counsels people who call in with their problems. He is dedicated to helping these lonely souls but becomes increasingly disturbed when his co-workers and supervisors at the radio station do not appreciate his program; they seem unable to grasp the importance of what he is doing. Aside from that, Jan''s private life is frayed around the edges. His wife is a heavy drinker and his mistress has no comprehension about who he is or what he is doing. Jan''s frustration over this lack of recognition builds to an explosive level, threatening to upset the balance of his daily life.', 'This is psychological drama by Tomasz Zygadlo begins as a straightforward story. Jan is the host of a nightly talk show in which he counsels people who call in with their problems. He is dedicated to helping these lonely souls but becomes increasingly disturbed when his co-workers and supervisors at the radio station do not appreciate his program; they seem unable to grasp the importance of what he is doing. Aside from that, Jan''s private life is frayed around the edges. His wife is a heavy drinker and his mistress has no comprehension about who he is or what he is doing. Jan''s frustration over this lack of recognition builds to an explosive level, threatening to upset the balance of his daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRG6BbT39HQOUGVLKGatQpZA03X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155852'),
  ('1100542696045986438', 'The Moth Diaries', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Mary Harron, Declan Quinn', 'Mary Harron', 'Sarah Bolger, Lily Cole, Sarah Gadon, Scott Speedman, Valerie Tian, Melissa Farman, Laurence Hamelin, Kathleen Fee', 'R', 'Rebecca is a young girl who, haunted by her father’s suicide, enrolls in an elite boarding school for girls. Before long, her friendship with the popular Lucy is shattered by the arrival of a dark and mysterious new student named Ernessa, whom Rebecca suspects may be responsible for the rising body count at the school.', 'Rebecca is a young girl who, haunted by her father’s suicide, enrolls in an elite boarding school for girls. Before long, her friendship with the popular Lucy is shattered by the arrival of a dark and mysterious new student named Ernessa, whom Rebecca suspects may be responsible for the rising body count at the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVoUBnhef1EPTcg7gIOoDUI3Rhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91549'),
  ('65823454588054092', 'The Mother', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roger Michell, Alwin H. Küchler', 'Hanif Kureishi', 'Anne Reid, Daniel Craig, Peter Vaughan, Steven Mackintosh, Cathryn Bradshaw, Anna Wilson-Jones, Danira Gović, Izabella Telezynska', 'R', 'A grandmother has a passionate affair with a man half her age, who is also sleeping with her daughter.', 'A grandmother has a passionate affair with a man half her age, who is also sleeping with her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCoIolCRu8edvQidFDMOdKLPH3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59210'),
  ('204798857562754096', 'The Mother', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Niki Caro, Ben Seresin, Randy Hutniak', 'Peter Craig, Misha Green', 'Jennifer Lopez, Lucy Paez, Omari Hardwick, Joseph Fiennes, Gael García Bernal, Paul Raci, Jesse García, Yvonne Senat Jones', 'R', 'A deadly female assassin comes out of hiding to protect the daughter that she gave up years before, while on the run from dangerous men.', 'A deadly female assassin comes out of hiding to protect the daughter that she gave up years before, while on the run from dangerous men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnRthEZz16Q9VWcP5homkHxyHoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552688'),
  ('131636993891762029', 'The Mother and the Bear', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Johnny Ma, Inti Briones', 'Johnny Ma', 'Kim Ho-jung, Lee Won-jae, Jonathan Kim, Amara Pedroso, Kalyn Bomback', 'Not Rated', 'After 26-year-old Sumi suffers an accident on the streets of wintry Winnipeg, her overbearing mother Sara flies in from Seoul to be by her now comatose daughter''s side. As Sara meddles in Sumi''s life via a dating app, she ends up on a journey that will leave her forever changed.', 'After 26-year-old Sumi suffers an accident on the streets of wintry Winnipeg, her overbearing mother Sara flies in from Seoul to be by her now comatose daughter''s side. As Sara meddles in Sumi''s life via a dating app, she ends up on a journey that will leave her forever changed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwFn8cdXDjZ32KBvXwLsFM9RtFdE.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-mother-and-the-bear-2026'),
  ('904344301571619397', 'The Mother and the Whore', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Eustache, Pierre Lhomme, Rémy Duchemin', 'Jean Eustache', 'Bernadette Lafont, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Françoise Lebrun, Isabelle Weingarten, Jacques Renard, Jean-Noël Picq, Berthe Granval, Geneviève Mnich', null, 'Aimless young Alexandre juggles his relationships with his girlfriend, Marie, and a casual lover named Veronika. Marie becomes increasingly jealous of Alexandre''s fling with Veronika and as the trio continues their unsustainable affair, the emotional stakes get higher, leading to conflict and unhappiness.', 'Aimless young Alexandre juggles his relationships with his girlfriend, Marie, and a casual lover named Veronika. Marie becomes increasingly jealous of Alexandre''s fling with Veronika and as the trio continues their unsustainable affair, the emotional stakes get higher, leading to conflict and unhappiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJpUVGnjoCvSOLjQaVAESwKzTuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48693'),
  ('931609955011784798', 'The Mother of Tears', 2007, 'Horror', 'Dario Argento, Frederic Fasano', 'Dario Argento, Walter Fasano, Jace Anderson', 'Asia Argento, Cristian Solimeno, Adam James, Moran Atias, Valéria Cavalli, Philippe Leroy, Daria Nicolodi, Coralina Cataldi-Tassoni', 'R', 'An ancient urn is found in a cemetery outside Rome. Once opened, it triggers a series of violent incidents: robberies, rapes and murders increase dramatically, while several mysterious, evil-looking young women coming from all over the world are gathering in the city. All these events are caused by the return of Mater Lacrimarum, the last of three powerful witches who have been spreading terror and death for centuries. Alone against an army of psychos and demons, Sarah Mandy, an art student who seems to have supernatural abilities of her own, is the only person left to prevent the Mother of Tears from destroying Rome.', 'An ancient urn is found in a cemetery outside Rome. Once opened, it triggers a series of violent incidents: robberies, rapes and murders increase dramatically, while several mysterious, evil-looking young women coming from all over the world are gathering in the city. All these events are caused by the return of Mater Lacrimarum, the last of three powerful witches who have been spreading terror and death for centuries. Alone against an army of psychos and demons, Sarah Mandy, an art student who seems to have supernatural abilities of her own, is the only person left to prevent the Mother of Tears from destroying Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ewz6PCWBzKZnQBbG4wODnjwvDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15206'),
  ('731055470774798998', 'The Mother of the Bride', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Atef Salem, Anwar Al Shinnawy, Massoud Issa', 'Abdel Hamid Gouda El Sahhar', 'Tahiya Cariocca, Emad Hamdy, Samira Ahmed, Hassan Youssef, Yousuf Shaaban, Madiha Salem, Soliman ElGendy, Adly Kasseb', null, 'This magnificently madcap comedy classic stars Egyptian film legends Tahiya Karioka and Emad Hamdi as Zeinab and Hussein, overworked parents who get little relief from the never ending demands of their seven mischievous children. When their eldest daughter, Ahlam, meets a dashing young man at a party, it''s love at first sight and wedding plans must quickly be arranged. As preparations get underway, Zeinab and Hussein are soon overwhelmed by the elaborate and costly requests made by the groom''s extravagant family. While tending to the needs of their other six children, Hussein and Zeinab must consider unconventional means to obtain the funds for a ceremony that the newlyweds will be proud of.', 'This magnificently madcap comedy classic stars Egyptian film legends Tahiya Karioka and Emad Hamdi as Zeinab and Hussein, overworked parents who get little relief from the never ending demands of their seven mischievous children. When their eldest daughter, Ahlam, meets a dashing young man at a party, it''s love at first sight and wedding plans must quickly be arranged. As preparations get underway, Zeinab and Hussein are soon overwhelmed by the elaborate and costly requests made by the groom''s extravagant family. While tending to the needs of their other six children, Hussein and Zeinab must consider unconventional means to obtain the funds for a ceremony that the newlyweds will be proud of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vu1bNzLkRTPWRdABhiUxJ56Z8dT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193393'),
  ('296796117475799093', 'The Mothman Prophecies', 2002, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Mark Pellington, Fred Murphy, Robert Grasmere', 'Richard Hatem', 'Richard Gere, Laura Linney, Will Patton, Debra Messing, David Eigenberg, Alan Bates, Lucinda Jenney, Nesbitt Blaisdell', 'PG-13', 'Reporter John Klein is plunged into a world of impossible terror when fate draws him to the sleepy West Virginia town of Point Pleasant, whose residents are being visited by a great winged shape that sows hideous nightmares and fevered visions.', 'Reporter John Klein is plunged into a world of impossible terror when fate draws him to the sleepy West Virginia town of Point Pleasant, whose residents are being visited by a great winged shape that sows hideous nightmares and fevered visions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2PiOTyjbCOnMHY2QJdq3I4jU44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2637'),
  ('6394935438975391', 'The Motive', 2017, 'Drama', 'Manuel Martín Cuenca, Pau Esteve Birba', 'Alejandro Hernández, Manuel Martín Cuenca', 'Javier Gutiérrez, María León, Adelfa Calvo, Adriana Paz, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Antonio de la Torre, Cris Nollet, Rafael Téllez', null, 'Álvaro, a man obsessed with the idea of writing what he brands as “high literature,” manipulates the lives and feelings of the people around him to write about the consequences caused by his devious acts.', 'Álvaro, a man obsessed with the idea of writing what he brands as “high literature,” manipulates the lives and feelings of the people around him to write about the consequences caused by his devious acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GOG0cLhVVnRVyOd3j7AEEpTsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437036'),
  ('1020868508033491647', 'The Motorcycle Diaries', 2004, 'Drama', 'Éric Gautier, Walter Salles, Federico Berón', 'Jose Rivera', 'Gael García Bernal, Rodrigo de la Serna, Mercedes Morán, Mía Maestro, Jean Pierre Noher, Lucas Oro, Marina Glezer, Sofia Bertolotto', null, 'Based on the journals of Che Guevara, leader of the Cuban Revolution. In his memoirs, Guevara recounts adventures he and best friend Alberto Granado had while crossing South America by motorcycle in the early 1950s.', 'Based on the journals of Che Guevara, leader of the Cuban Revolution. In his memoirs, Guevara recounts adventures he and best friend Alberto Granado had while crossing South America by motorcycle in the early 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz2aBYT8CAiJYvX4fRZpJ5G0Oz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1653'),
  ('553383477423466564', 'The Mountain', 1956, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, Franz Planer', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Spencer Tracy, Robert Wagner, Claire Trevor, William Demarest, Barbara Darrow, Richard Arlen, E.G. Marshall, Anna Kashfi', 'NR', 'Selfish Chris Teller pressures his older brother, a retired climber, to accompany him on a treacherous Alpine climb to loot the bodies of plane crash victims.', 'Selfish Chris Teller pressures his older brother, a retired climber, to accompany him on a treacherous Alpine climb to loot the bodies of plane crash victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3sn47VmLGbFeHGBlImPknPzj9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57993'),
  ('924800690417290912', 'The Mountain', 2012, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Renda Güner, Alper Çağlar, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Çağlar Ertuğrul, Ufuk Bayraktar, Fırat Doğruloğlu, Mesut Akusta, Cengiz Coşkun, Gözde Mutluer, Serkan Yanar, Ali Aksöz', null, 'The heroic story of two soldiers trapped in an ambush, fighting for their lives.', 'The heroic story of two soldiers trapped in an ambush, fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxn0f60nKJndC27iFVTQ83EvuM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246871'),
  ('557317094535262729', 'The Mountain', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Thomas Salvador, Alexis Kavyrchine, Pierre Abadie', 'Naïla Guiguet, Thomas Salvador', 'Thomas Salvador, Louise Bourgoin, Martine Chevallier, Andranic Manet, Laurent Poitrenaux, Catherine Lefroid, Hassan Jouhari, Thomas Agathocleous', null, 'Pierre, a Parisian engineer, goes up in the Alps for his work. Irresistibly attracted by what surrounds him, he camps out alone high in the mountains and leaves behind his everyday life. Up there he meets Léa, a chef of an alpine restaurant, while mysterious glows glitter in the deep mountains…', 'Pierre, a Parisian engineer, goes up in the Alps for his work. Irresistibly attracted by what surrounds him, he camps out alone high in the mountains and leaves behind his everyday life. Up there he meets Léa, a chef of an alpine restaurant, while mysterious glows glitter in the deep mountains…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8D2MYB2jHJsK0M5MyPRLMeeS6vt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958736'),
  ('822970112907986418', 'The Mountain Between Us', 2017, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Hany Abu-Assad, Mandy Walker, James Steuart', 'J. Mills Goodloe', 'Idris Elba, Kate Winslet, Dermot Mulroney, Beau Bridges, Linda Sorensen, Mercy Myrdal, Dania Nassar, Vincent Gale', 'PG-13', 'Stranded on a mountain after a tragic plane crash, two strangers must work together to endure the extreme elements of the remote, snow-covered terrain. When they realize help is not coming, they embark on a perilous journey across hundreds of miles of wilderness, pushing each other to survive and discovering their inner strength.', 'Stranded on a mountain after a tragic plane crash, two strangers must work together to endure the extreme elements of the remote, snow-covered terrain. When they realize help is not coming, they embark on a perilous journey across hundreds of miles of wilderness, pushing each other to survive and discovering their inner strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XNfYTW4XGscI81nXMSWGsQ8cpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290512'),
  ('1076078642570983346', 'The Mountain II', 2016, 'War, Drama', 'Alper Çağlar, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Çağlar Ertuğrul, Ufuk Bayraktar, Murat Serezli, Ahu Türkpençe, Atılgan Gümüş, Murat Arkın, Armağan Oğuz, Ahmet Pınar', null, 'In a desolate war zone where screams of the innocent echo, on the very line between disaster and valor, 7 Maroon Berets will dance with death.', 'In a desolate war zone where screams of the innocent echo, on the very line between disaster and valor, 7 Maroon Berets will dance with death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYCqrxuCuzhfgbYJbO2HN4zTeqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427008'),
  ('906496622283744425', 'The Mountain Men', 1980, 'Adventure, Western, Drama', 'Richard Lang, Michel Hugo, Jim Weatherill', 'Fraser Clarke Heston', 'Charlton Heston, Brian Keith, Victoria Racimo, Stephen Macht, Seymour Cassel, David Ackroyd, Cal Bellini, John Glover', 'R', 'The story concerns two grizzled mountain men -- Bill Tyler and Henry Frapp -- during the dying days of the fur-trapping era. The plot begins when Running Moon runs away from her abusive husband Heavy Eagle and comes across the two seedy fur trappers. The mountain men take her in, unaware that Heavy Eagle has dispatched an army of Indian braves to reclaim her.', 'The story concerns two grizzled mountain men -- Bill Tyler and Henry Frapp -- during the dying days of the fur-trapping era. The plot begins when Running Moon runs away from her abusive husband Heavy Eagle and comes across the two seedy fur trappers. The mountain men take her in, unaware that Heavy Eagle has dispatched an army of Indian braves to reclaim her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHezig8cJK9tvkvT1ORU4gfL8X2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75552'),
  ('1097508532568163653', 'The Mourning Forest', 2007, 'Drama', 'Naomi Kawase, Hideyo Nakano, Yuki Kondo', 'Naomi Kawase', 'Machiko Ono, Shigeki Uda, Makiko Watanabe, Yoichiro Saito, Kanako Masuda, Yūsei Yamamoto', null, 'A young woman working at a retirement home takes an elderly man living there on an excursion into the countryside, but the two wind up stranded in the titular forest.', 'A young woman working at a retirement home takes an elderly man living there on an excursion into the countryside, but the two wind up stranded in the titular forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzi6QI5HU1917J9AvWa7uL5AF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2010'),
  ('683656000104421967', 'The Mouse and His Child', 1977, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Charles Swenson, Fred Wolf', 'Carol MonPere', 'Peter Ustinov, Cloris Leachman, Sally Kellerman, Andy Devine, Alan Barzman, Marcy Swenson, John Carradine, Neville Brand', 'G', 'A mouse and his child, the two parts of a single small wind-up toy, go on a quest to become "self-winding".', 'A mouse and his child, the two parts of a single small wind-up toy, go on a quest to become "self-winding".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NEExXlGqwsIhw30eVKzLG0BPYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37049'),
  ('669347349107075209', 'The Mouse Comes to Dinner', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'William Hanna, Lillian Randolph, Sara Berner', 'NR', 'Tom invites Toots to an elegant dinner. However, he''s made the mistake of trying to put Jerry to work, as a serving boy, a corkscrew, and other tasks. Jerry puts up with a little of this, but mostly gets revenge on Tom.', 'Tom invites Toots to an elegant dinner. However, he''s made the mistake of trying to put Jerry to work, as a serving boy, a corkscrew, and other tasks. Jerry puts up with a little of this, but mostly gets revenge on Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZadAJ6RnN9Aw4oe3IFdQ2kBito.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40235'),
  ('415850143111947921', 'The Mouse from H.U.N.G.E.R.', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'Secret agent Jerry-akin has to steal a giant refrigerator full of cheese, guarded by the evil Tom Thrush with a vast array of diabolical gadgets and traps. Of course, Jerry has a few tricks of his own.', 'Secret agent Jerry-akin has to steal a giant refrigerator full of cheese, guarded by the evil Tom Thrush with a vast array of diabolical gadgets and traps. Of course, Jerry has a few tricks of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5KeehWuuCmc3fY1pPOML5T6e9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219580'),
  ('246748325859232937', 'The Mouse on the Moon', 1963, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'William Alexander, Ross MacKenzie, Wilkie Cooper', 'Michael Pertwee', 'Margaret Rutherford, Ron Moody, Bernard Cribbins, David Kossoff, Terry-Thomas, June Ritchie, John Le Mesurier, John Phillips', 'NR', 'Sequel to The Mouse that Roared; The Tiny Country of Grand Fenwick has a hot water problem in the castle. To get the money necessary to put in a new set of plumbing, they request foreign aid from the U.S. for Space Research. The Russians then send aid as well to show that they too are for the internationalization of space. While the grand Duke is dreaming of hot baths, their one scientist is slapping together a rocket. The U.S. and Soviets get wind of the impending launch and try and beat them to the moon.', 'Sequel to The Mouse that Roared; The Tiny Country of Grand Fenwick has a hot water problem in the castle. To get the money necessary to put in a new set of plumbing, they request foreign aid from the U.S. for Space Research. The Russians then send aid as well to show that they too are for the internationalization of space. While the grand Duke is dreaming of hot baths, their one scientist is slapping together a rocket. The U.S. and Soviets get wind of the impending launch and try and beat them to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqkfzHxFJBmh6zFNSyNKvTpZJXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49876'),
  ('760820068103501078', 'The Mouse That Jack Built', 1959, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Jack Benny, Mary Livingstone, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson, Don Wilson, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'In this spoof of "The Jack Benny Program", a mouse with Jack Benny''s personality and poor violin playing ability lives, along with a mouse version of Benny''s valet, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson, in a hole in a wall of Jack Benny''s own home. Jack the rodent takes a mouse version of ''Mary Livingstone (I)'' out to dinner, and the two unwittingly walk right into the disguised mouth of an orange cat!', 'In this spoof of "The Jack Benny Program", a mouse with Jack Benny''s personality and poor violin playing ability lives, along with a mouse version of Benny''s valet, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson, in a hole in a wall of Jack Benny''s own home. Jack the rodent takes a mouse version of ''Mary Livingstone (I)'' out to dinner, and the two unwittingly walk right into the disguised mouth of an orange cat!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc8RzlE519RH7fdiaS6go0ZeZ8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100375'),
  ('1003409963327059636', 'The Mouse That Roared', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Jack Arnold, John Wilcox, Philip Shipway', 'Roger MacDougall, Stanley Mann', 'Peter Sellers, Jean Seberg, William Hartnell, David Kossoff, Leo McKern, MacDonald Parke, Austin Willis, Timothy Bateson', 'PG', 'The Duchy of Grand Fenwick decides that the only way to get out of their economic woes is to declare war on the United States, lose and accept foreign aid. They send an invasion force (in chain mail, armed with bows and arrows) to New York and they arrive during a nuclear drill that has cleared the streets.', 'The Duchy of Grand Fenwick decides that the only way to get out of their economic woes is to declare war on the United States, lose and accept foreign aid. They send an invasion force (in chain mail, armed with bows and arrows) to New York and they arrive during a nuclear drill that has cleared the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHSIXGVmLHsPeWdfyVe8J1eZCFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12649'),
  ('700885809362274021', 'The Mouse Trap', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jamie Bailey, Jamie Bailey', 'Simon Phillips', 'Simon Phillips, Sophie McIntosh, Madeline Kelman, Ben Harris, Calum Sywyk, Mireille Gagné, James Laurin, Kayleigh Styles', 'NR', 'It''s Alex''s 21st Birthday, but she''s stuck at the amusement arcade on a late shift so her friends decide to surprise her, but a masked killer dressed as Mickey Mouse decides to play a game of his own with them which she must survive.', 'It''s Alex''s 21st Birthday, but she''s stuck at the amusement arcade on a late shift so her friends decide to surprise her, but a masked killer dressed as Mickey Mouse decides to play a game of his own with them which she must survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ovFaFeojLFIl5ClqhtgYMDS8sE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1225377'),
  ('219635444615391547', 'The Moustache', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Emmanuel Carrère, Patrick Blossier', 'Jérôme Beaujour', 'Vincent Lindon, Emmanuelle Devos, Mathieu Amalric, Hippolyte Girardot, Cylia Malki, Macha Polikarpova, Fantine Camus, Frédéric Imberty', 'NR', 'One day, on a whim, Marc decides to shave off the moustache he''s worn all of his adult life. He waits patiently for his wife''s reaction, but neither she nor his friends seem to notice. Stranger still, when he finally tells them, they all insist he never had a moustache. Is Marc going mad? Is he the victim of some elaborate conspiracy? Or has something in the world''s order gone terribly awry?', 'One day, on a whim, Marc decides to shave off the moustache he''s worn all of his adult life. He waits patiently for his wife''s reaction, but neither she nor his friends seem to notice. Stranger still, when he finally tells them, they all insist he never had a moustache. Is Marc going mad? Is he the victim of some elaborate conspiracy? Or has something in the world''s order gone terribly awry?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xTwprpMi7KpMukbGl21CMCz4sk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16998'),
  ('492338292682097713', 'The Mouth Agape', 1974, 'Drama', 'Maurice Pialat, Bernard Grenet, Bernard Dubois', 'Maurice Pialat', 'Nathalie Baye, Hubert Deschamps, Philippe Léotard, Monique Mélinand, Henri Saulquin, Alain Grestau, Anna Gayane, Mireille Laurenchet', null, 'Monique is dying of cancer, lying in bed in the apartment above the store her family owns. Her philandering husband carries on with life, her son remains aloof, and her daughter-in-law wonders if she is witnessing her own decline. They all struggle to express, or feel, their love for one another.', 'Monique is dying of cancer, lying in bed in the apartment above the store her family owns. Her philandering husband carries on with life, her son remains aloof, and her daughter-in-law wonders if she is witnessing her own decline. They all struggle to express, or feel, their love for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOdKDFF6RhlbVKiLJNIxHoNPD8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93672'),
  ('283089810248394024', 'The Mouth of the Wolf', 1988, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Francisco J. Lombardi, Susana Bamonde, Felipe Degregori', 'Augusto Cabada, Gonzalo Herrero, Giovanna Pollarolo', 'Gustavo Bueno, Toño Vega, Jose Tejada, Gilberto Torres, Antero Sanchez, Aristóteles Picho, Fernando Vásquez, Luis Saavedra', null, 'The military anti-terrorist army takes control of "Chuspi", an unknown and faraway small village, isolated by the terrorist group "Sendero Luminoso" (Shining Path). A soldier called Vitin Luna, and other young soldiers face an invisible, perhaps superior force. Their unit is commanded by a brutal lieutenant who declares the entire village guilty of treason. In the face of this crisis, Vitin must choose between blind obedience and his own conscience.', 'The military anti-terrorist army takes control of "Chuspi", an unknown and faraway small village, isolated by the terrorist group "Sendero Luminoso" (Shining Path). A soldier called Vitin Luna, and other young soldiers face an invisible, perhaps superior force. Their unit is commanded by a brutal lieutenant who declares the entire village guilty of treason. In the face of this crisis, Vitin must choose between blind obedience and his own conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEm2fg7MhuTIL5AAT1vw1PeftyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53123'),
  ('437595838656138328', 'The Mouth Of The Wolf', 2009, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Pietro Marcello, Pietro Marcello, Beatrice Buzi', 'Pietro Marcello', 'Vincenzo Motta, Mary Monaco, Franco Leo, Stefano Carappa, Anna Massa, Antonio Micheletti, Andrea Cambi, Adriano Rossi', null, 'Upon his release from prison, an ex-convict returns to his beloved city of Genoa, and to his lover.', 'Upon his release from prison, an ex-convict returns to his beloved city of Genoa, and to his lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btCGKOS82XPIZWQdtzOBlVW4PSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53925'),
  ('180448364938462936', 'The Move of the Penguin', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Grambone, Simona Zora, Claudio Amendola', 'Claudio Amendola, Giulio Di Martino, Michele Alberico', 'Edoardo Leo, Ricky Memphis, Ennio Fantastichini, Antonello Fassari, Francesca Inaudi, Sergio Fiorentini, Rita Savagnone, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio', null, 'Two temp workers, a pensioner and an old bully discover the sport of curling by chance and, convinced of their potential, plan to compete at the 2006 Winter Olympics in Turin.', 'Two temp workers, a pensioner and an old bully discover the sport of curling by chance and, convinced of their potential, plan to compete at the 2006 Winter Olympics in Turin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64hdogfl9p7MwPRvy0HqMXXNmHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257593'),
  ('948810060684779102', 'The Movie Emperor', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wang Boxue, Ning Hao', 'Liu Xiaodan, Wang Ang, Tianyou Zhao', 'Andy Lau, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Rima Zeidan, Daniel Yu, Ning Hao, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah', null, 'In an attempt to win back the public''s interest, has-been Hong Kong film star Lau Wai-chi makes a comeback film with a major director. To prepare for his role as a peasant farmer in the 1960s, he travels to the mainland China countryside to experience rural life there, but his arrogance triggers a series of farces.', 'In an attempt to win back the public''s interest, has-been Hong Kong film star Lau Wai-chi makes a comeback film with a major director. To prepare for his role as a peasant farmer in the 1960s, he travels to the mainland China countryside to experience rural life there, but his arrogance triggers a series of farces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gKjxerz72MsB4zPXb09VKPWfgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022659'),
  ('170465726009473836', 'The Movie of My Life', 2017, 'Drama', 'Selton Mello, Walter Carvalho, Rafael Braz', 'Selton Mello, Marcelo Vindicato', 'Johnny Massaro, Vincent Cassel, Bruna Linzmeyer, Selton Mello, Ondina Clais, Bia Arantes, Rolando Boldrin, João Pedro Prates', null, 'The sierras of southern Brazil, 1963. The son of an French man and a Brazilian woman, Tony is a young man with a profound love of cinema and poetry. After graduating from college he returns to his small town in rural Brazil, to find out that his father had left for good, back to France. Tony then looks for the company of his fathers friends in search of information and references of a lost male role-model. He becomes a school teacher and a male figure to kids, in an attempt to provide them with something he lacks himself. A series of developments lead him to a surprising final lead on his fathers'' whereabouts and reasons for leaving.', 'The sierras of southern Brazil, 1963. The son of an French man and a Brazilian woman, Tony is a young man with a profound love of cinema and poetry. After graduating from college he returns to his small town in rural Brazil, to find out that his father had left for good, back to France. Tony then looks for the company of his fathers friends in search of information and references of a lost male role-model. He becomes a school teacher and a male figure to kids, in an attempt to provide them with something he lacks himself. A series of developments lead him to a surprising final lead on his fathers'' whereabouts and reasons for leaving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ESfxMWXQpYCHgDJWnCH9ywMbQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341244'),
  ('1019071258133440577', 'The Movie Orgy', 1968, 'Comedy, Documentary, History', 'Joe Dante', null, 'Goodman Ace, Jane Ace, Ann-Margret, Ngo Dinh Diem, Dwight D. Eisenhower, John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison', null, 'Clips from assorted television programs, B-movies, commercials, music performances, newsreels, bloopers, satirical short films and promotional and government films of the 1950s and 1960s are intercut together to tell a single story of various creatures and societal ills attacking American cities.', 'Clips from assorted television programs, B-movies, commercials, music performances, newsreels, bloopers, satirical short films and promotional and government films of the 1950s and 1960s are intercut together to tell a single story of various creatures and societal ills attacking American cities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KB2YqOPVnwMkQIjHCAr9PBlseS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125960'),
  ('575626533422870543', 'The Movie Star and the Cowboy', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jimmy Wu, Jim Cliffe', 'Alessandra Brook', 'MacKenzie Porter, Toby Levins, Dalias Blake, Dave Kenneth MacKinnon, Beth Fotheringham, Shay Galor, Dana Stoutenburg, Kamryn Marie Roy', null, 'When city girl and actress, Isabella, lands a dream role as a rancher, the studio sends her to live on a ranch to learn the ropes but she soon discovers the rancher, Hunter, is too busy trying to save his ranch from ruin to help make her dreams come true. Can Isabella find a way to help save the ranch and her starring role?', 'When city girl and actress, Isabella, lands a dream role as a rancher, the studio sends her to live on a ranch to learn the ropes but she soon discovers the rancher, Hunter, is too busy trying to save his ranch from ruin to help make her dreams come true. Can Isabella find a way to help save the ranch and her starring role?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nbLEajV2HU79HNuAaO4ll3L5M8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034411'),
  ('282274694319428351', 'The Movie Teller', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Lone Scherfig, Daniel Aranyó', 'Isabel Coixet, Rafa Russo, Walter Salles', 'Bérénice Bejo, Antonio de la Torre, Daniel Brühl, Sara Becker, Alondra Valenzuela, Joaquín Guzmán, Santiago Urbina, Elian Ponce', null, 'María Margarita is the youngest of four siblings in a family living in a mining town in the Atacama Desert (Chile). The most special time of the week for this family is Sunday, when they all go to the movies to enjoy stories that let them escape their everyday lives by transporting them to other worlds. The girl’s parents soon realise that the little girl has a very special gift: an almost uncanny ability to recount movies. The girl’s extraordinary talent will spread throughout the village, changing the fortunes of her family as the country is transformed forever.', 'María Margarita is the youngest of four siblings in a family living in a mining town in the Atacama Desert (Chile). The most special time of the week for this family is Sunday, when they all go to the movies to enjoy stories that let them escape their everyday lives by transporting them to other worlds. The girl’s parents soon realise that the little girl has a very special gift: an almost uncanny ability to recount movies. The girl’s extraordinary talent will spread throughout the village, changing the fortunes of her family as the country is transformed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1TGEhGbcvIp0MnUGdzDdTji9E9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928118'),
  ('381113642458045905', 'The Moving Forest', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Vinicius Coimbra, Pablo Baião', 'Vinicius Coimbra, Manuela Dias', 'Gabriel Braga Nunes, Ana Paula Arósio, Ângelo Antônio, Nelson Xavier, Rui Ricardo Diaz, Fernando Alves Pinto, Miriam Freeland, Tatsu Carvalho', null, 'Based on William Shakespeare''s "Macbeth". Elias is a successful executive who works in the second largest private bank in Brazil. One day, Elias meets a mysterious woman who claims to be able to predict his future and says he will become vice president that day and the next day, he will become president of the Bank. The wheel of fortune is bound activated and a series of murders is committed by Elias and his wife Clara, leaving a trail of blood on his way to power and making them executioners and victims of their own destinies.', 'Based on William Shakespeare''s "Macbeth". Elias is a successful executive who works in the second largest private bank in Brazil. One day, Elias meets a mysterious woman who claims to be able to predict his future and says he will become vice president that day and the next day, he will become president of the Bank. The wheel of fortune is bound activated and a series of murders is committed by Elias and his wife Clara, leaving a trail of blood on his way to power and making them executioners and victims of their own destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Zgllr1UnyiqBNYtmsTiRK71yky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341014'),
  ('451352558979448533', 'The Mozart Brothers', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Suzanne Osten, Hans Welin, Finn Zandén', 'Etienne Glaser, Suzanne Osten, Niklas Rådström', 'Etienne Glaser, Philip Zandén, Henry Bronett, Loa Falkman, Agneta Ekmanner, Lena T. Hansson, Helge Skoog, Grith Fjeldmose', null, 'This is a comedy about people who work in the theater, live for the theater, think of nothing but the theater. The director seems crazy, the art director has idiotic ideas, and the acting coach is eccentric: they even look like brothers, related by their common obsession for the theater, linked as one with the actors. The new project is Mozart''s Don Giovanni, in which the director insists to give it a brand new interpretation and an avant-garde treatment. Now, he has to deal with the violent objection from the actors, the musicians, the singing coach, the stage manager, and even the cafe bar attendants and the cleaners. The situation is further complicated as the director is such a womanizer like Don Juan... and his lovers and kids keep bugging him throughout the rehearsal...', 'This is a comedy about people who work in the theater, live for the theater, think of nothing but the theater. The director seems crazy, the art director has idiotic ideas, and the acting coach is eccentric: they even look like brothers, related by their common obsession for the theater, linked as one with the actors. The new project is Mozart''s Don Giovanni, in which the director insists to give it a brand new interpretation and an avant-garde treatment. Now, he has to deal with the violent objection from the actors, the musicians, the singing coach, the stage manager, and even the cafe bar attendants and the cleaners. The situation is further complicated as the director is such a womanizer like Don Juan... and his lovers and kids keep bugging him throughout the rehearsal...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/L7eNNgEUMdRBsqim5ImE2Kogpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125500'),
  ('825865396512541960', 'The Mozart of Pickpockets', 2006, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Philippe Pollet-Villard, Philippe Piffeteau', null, 'Matteo Razzouki-Safardi, Philippe Pollet-Villard, Richard Morgiève', null, 'Richard and Philippe live hand to mouth, backing up a gang of Spanish pickpockets on the streets of Paris, posing as policemen who arrest a gang member while the others rifle the pockets and purses of gawkers. When all of the gang except Richard and Philippe are pinched, things look grim. Plus, Richard insists that they take in a wide-eyed immigrant lad, a deaf-mute left behind in the arrests. Philippe suggests a three-person pickpocket trick, using the boy, but when that goes spectacularly badly, they hit rock bottom. Then, at the cinema, the lad finds a solution. It''s time to celebrate.', 'Richard and Philippe live hand to mouth, backing up a gang of Spanish pickpockets on the streets of Paris, posing as policemen who arrest a gang member while the others rifle the pockets and purses of gawkers. When all of the gang except Richard and Philippe are pinched, things look grim. Plus, Richard insists that they take in a wide-eyed immigrant lad, a deaf-mute left behind in the arrests. Philippe suggests a three-person pickpocket trick, using the boy, but when that goes spectacularly badly, they hit rock bottom. Then, at the cinema, the lad finds a solution. It''s time to celebrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1J3GExIvB8rQWmgyxuMhRXJqrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116604'),
  ('212077617970000598', 'The Muckles - The Quest for a New Home', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Ali Samadi Ahadi, Markus Dietrich', 'Thomas Springer', 'Uwe Ochsenknecht, André Jung, Christine Urspruch, Marianne Sägebrecht, Stefan Kurt, Marco Lorenzini, Patrick Hastert, Anouk Wagener', null, 'Once upon a time, the Mucklas could be found everywhere. But in an increasingly tidy world, the cheerful goblins have a hard time, since they love disorder more than anything. Soon the last tribe will have to leave their home. For generations, the little creatures have made themselves at home unnoticed in Hansson''s old, chaotic grocer''s store. In the wonderful mess, they find everything they need to live, tinker and make mischief. But Hansson''s successor, Karl the exterminator, turns the paradise into a tiled and sterile nightmare. So Svunja, Tjorben and Smartö set off on a dangerous search for the promised land. The great adventure begins', 'Once upon a time, the Mucklas could be found everywhere. But in an increasingly tidy world, the cheerful goblins have a hard time, since they love disorder more than anything. Soon the last tribe will have to leave their home. For generations, the little creatures have made themselves at home unnoticed in Hansson''s old, chaotic grocer''s store. In the wonderful mess, they find everything they need to live, tinker and make mischief. But Hansson''s successor, Karl the exterminator, turns the paradise into a tiled and sterile nightmare. So Svunja, Tjorben and Smartö set off on a dangerous search for the promised land. The great adventure begins', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTcPj4N6Jr6NnXXbjd3f9wgIz0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020905'),
  ('969457463694161293', 'The Mudboy', 2007, 'Horror, Crime', 'Suso Bello, Jorge Algora', 'Jorge Algora, Héctor Carré, Christian Busquier', 'Maribel Verdú, Daniel Freire, Chete Lera, Abel Ayala, Roly Serrano, Juan Ciancio, César Bordón, Sergio Boris', null, 'Police try to hunt down a serial killer in 1912 Buenos Aires.', 'Police try to hunt down a serial killer in 1912 Buenos Aires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5azU28rQ0maYzV1e9jXJVt1mxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65145'),
  ('241647071338821527', 'The Mudge Boy', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Burke, Vanja Černjul', 'Michael Burke', 'Emile Hirsch, Tom Guiry, Richard Jenkins, Pablo Schreiber, Zachary Knighton, Ryan Donowho, Meredith Handerhan, Beckie King', null, 'Chronicling the troubled existence of Duncan Mudge, a 14-year-old misfit who—while vying for the attention of his vacant father—struggles to fill the void brought on by his mother''s sudden death.', 'Chronicling the troubled existence of Duncan Mudge, a 14-year-old misfit who—while vying for the attention of his vacant father—struggles to fill the void brought on by his mother''s sudden death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daxDdN3vBBqx8KuOXNHBtu9QcbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26899'),
  ('1036361309216840826', 'The Mule', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Radford, Sebastián Grousset', 'Juan Eslava Galán, Michael Radford', 'Mario Casas, María Valverde, Daniel Grao, Giovanna Zacarías, Luis Callejo, Secun de la Rosa, Jorge Suquet, Pepa Rus', null, 'A soldier protects a mule during the Spanish Civil War.', 'A soldier protects a mule during the Spanish Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5FcQQrx6zX5jxF09soevC6TwSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172265'),
  ('485953749018102054', 'The Mule', 2014, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Angus Sampson, Tony Mahony, Stefan Duscio', 'Angus Sampson, Leigh Whannell, Jaime Browne', 'Hugo Weaving, Angus Sampson, Leigh Whannell, Ewen Leslie, Geoff Morrell, Georgina Haig, Noni Hazlehurst, John Noble', null, 'In 1983, a naive man is detained by Australian Federal Police with lethal narcotics hidden in his stomach. After being apprehended, ‘The Mule’ makes a desperate choice... to defy his bodily functions and withhold the evidence – literally.', 'In 1983, a naive man is detained by Australian Federal Police with lethal narcotics hidden in his stomach. After being apprehended, ‘The Mule’ makes a desperate choice... to defy his bodily functions and withhold the evidence – literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwMZYSkLofFC27oBeZ1hZWgliXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253272'),
  ('801498301784540020', 'The Mule', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Yves Bélanger, Geoffrey Miclat', 'Nick Schenk', 'Clint Eastwood, Bradley Cooper, Laurence Fishburne, Michael Peña, Dianne Wiest, Andy Garcia, Ignacio Serricchio, Taissa Farmiga', 'R', 'Earl Stone, a man in his eighties, is broke, alone, and facing foreclosure of his business when he is offered a job that simply requires him to drive. Easy enough, but, unbeknownst to Earl, he''s just signed on as a drug courier for a Mexican cartel. He does so well that his cargo increases exponentially, and Earl hit the radar of hard-charging DEA agent Colin Bates.', 'Earl Stone, a man in his eighties, is broke, alone, and facing foreclosure of his business when he is offered a job that simply requires him to drive. Easy enough, but, unbeknownst to Earl, he''s just signed on as a drug courier for a Mexican cartel. He does so well that his cargo increases exponentially, and Earl hit the radar of hard-charging DEA agent Colin Bates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeZh7yEz3PMnZLgBPhrafFHRbVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504172'),
  ('1099408848411978962', 'The Mummies of Guanajuato', 1972, 'Action, Horror', 'Federico Curiel, Enrique Wallace', 'Rogelio Agrasánchez Sr.', 'El Santo, Aarón Rodríguez Arellano, Blue Demon, Julio Cesar, Elsa Cárdenas, Juan Gallardo, Jorge Pinguino, Carlos Suárez', null, 'Satan, a wrestler who sold his soul to the Lord of Darkness for fame but was thwarted by Santo''s ancestor, who is now rising after a hundred years with his army of mummies to take revenge.', 'Satan, a wrestler who sold his soul to the Lord of Darkness for fame but was thwarted by Santo''s ancestor, who is now rising after a hundred years with his army of mummies to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui9vR8JJvQZ1l4OOO2JiMyaHk94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62928'),
  ('843633460152618695', 'The Mummy', 1932, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Karl Freund, Charles J. Stumar', 'John L. Balderston', 'Boris Karloff, Zita Johann, David Manners, Arthur Byron, Edward Van Sloan, Bramwell Fletcher, Noble Johnson, Kathryn Byron', 'NR', 'An ancient Egyptian priest named Imhotep is revived when a British archaeological expedition finds his mummy and one of the researchers accidentally reads an ancient life-giving spell. Imhotep escapes from the field site and searches for the reincarnation of the soul of his lover.', 'An ancient Egyptian priest named Imhotep is revived when a British archaeological expedition finds his mummy and one of the researchers accidentally reads an ancient life-giving spell. Imhotep escapes from the field site and searches for the reincarnation of the soul of his lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSKpbZVvzqQcw6htiyEinbCY9vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15849'),
  ('936774434580281072', 'The Mummy', 1959, 'Horror', 'Terence Fisher, Jack Asher', 'Griffin Jay, Maxwell Shane, John L. Balderston', 'Peter Cushing, Christopher Lee, Yvonne Furneaux, Eddie Byrne, Felix Aylmer, Raymond Huntley, George Pastell, Michael Ripper', 'NR', 'One by one the archaeologists who discover the 4,000-year-old tomb of Princess Ananka are brutally murdered. Kharis, high priest in Egypt 40 centuries ago, has been brought to life by the power of the ancient gods and his sole purpose is to destroy those responsible for the desecration of the sacred tomb. But Isobel, wife of one of the explorers, resembles the beautiful princess, forcing the speechless and tormented monster to defy commands and abduct Isobel to an unknown fate.', 'One by one the archaeologists who discover the 4,000-year-old tomb of Princess Ananka are brutally murdered. Kharis, high priest in Egypt 40 centuries ago, has been brought to life by the power of the ancient gods and his sole purpose is to destroy those responsible for the desecration of the sacred tomb. But Isobel, wife of one of the explorers, resembles the beautiful princess, forcing the speechless and tormented monster to defy commands and abduct Isobel to an unknown fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3XEtgi8W9tuPQnLVFCPVxtweyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18990'),
  ('1066879690123288078', 'The Mummy', 1999, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Stephen Sommers, Adrian Biddle, Jim Threapleton', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Brendan Fraser, Rachel Weisz, John Hannah, Arnold Vosloo, Patricia Velásquez, Oded Fehr, Kevin J. O''Connor, Jonathan Hyde', 'PG-13', 'Dashing legionnaire Rick O''Connell stumbles upon the hidden ruins of Hamunaptra while in the midst of a battle to claim the area in 1920s Egypt. It has been over three thousand years since former High Priest Imhotep suffered a fate worse than death as a punishment for a forbidden love—along with a curse that guarantees eternal doom upon the world if he is ever awoken.', 'Dashing legionnaire Rick O''Connell stumbles upon the hidden ruins of Hamunaptra while in the midst of a battle to claim the area in 1920s Egypt. It has been over three thousand years since former High Priest Imhotep suffered a fate worse than death as a punishment for a forbidden love—along with a curse that guarantees eternal doom upon the world if he is ever awoken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhIsVvcUm7QxzLfT6HW2wLf5ajY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564'),
  ('701041031023661892', 'The Mummy', 2017, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Alex Kurtzman, Ben Seresin, Steve Street', 'Christopher McQuarrie, David Koepp, Dylan Kussman', 'Tom Cruise, Annabelle Wallis, Sofia Boutella, Jake Johnson, Courtney B. Vance, Russell Crowe, Marwan Kenzari, Neil Maskell', 'PG-13', 'Though safely entombed in a crypt deep beneath the unforgiving desert, an ancient queen whose destiny was unjustly taken from her is awakened in our current day, bringing with her malevolence grown over millennia, and terrors that defy human comprehension.', 'Though safely entombed in a crypt deep beneath the unforgiving desert, an ancient queen whose destiny was unjustly taken from her is awakened in our current day, bringing with her malevolence grown over millennia, and terrors that defy human comprehension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxkY8byBnCsXodEYpK8tmwEGXBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282035'),
  ('791991618772662104', 'The Mummy Lives', 1993, 'Drama, Horror', 'Gerry O''Hara, Avi Koren', 'Nelson Gidding', 'Tony Curtis, Leslie Hardy, Greg Wrangler, Jacques Cohen, Mosko Alkalai, Mohammad Bakri, Moshe Ivgy, Yosef Shiloach', null, 'An Egyptian noble, sentenced to death for a forbidden affair, returns from the grave 3,000 years later and becomes obsessed with a woman whom he thinks is the reincarnation of his dead lover.', 'An Egyptian noble, sentenced to death for a forbidden affair, returns from the grave 3,000 years later and becomes obsessed with a woman whom he thinks is the reincarnation of his dead lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecGbWSLkJhkZoHPZRIFdHlMmwkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5763'),
  ('405655848863370898', 'The Mummy Resurrected', 2014, 'Horror', 'Patrick McManus, Elie Smolkin', 'Joanne Spring', 'Stuart Rigby, Elizabeth Friedman, Alena Savostikova, Bailey Gaddis, Lauren Bronleewe, Sarah Schreiber, Jessie Paddock, Iyad Hajjaj', 'NR', 'A team of archaeologists discover an ancient mummy, unleashing a deadly curse from its eternal tomb.', 'A team of archaeologists discover an ancient mummy, unleashing a deadly curse from its eternal tomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVPbuqzGTJCXzycYT4yOuducdm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268508'),
  ('91555004995670373', 'The Mummy Resurrection', 2023, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Steve Lawson', 'Steve Lawson', 'Carl Wharton, Chris Bell, Marcus Langford, Raven Lee, Sophie Marlowe, Jas Steven Singh', null, 'When an infamous "cursed" Egyptian sarcophagus falls into the hands of unscrupulous huckster Everett Randolph, he becomes obsessed with resurrecting the mummified princess held within it.', 'When an infamous "cursed" Egyptian sarcophagus falls into the hands of unscrupulous huckster Everett Randolph, he becomes obsessed with resurrecting the mummified princess held within it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0pt6KlVvmtG0uhccWjgWfIqJee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984105'),
  ('67452707284334379', 'The Mummy Returns', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Adrian Biddle, Stephen Sommers, Adil Abdelwahab', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Brendan Fraser, Rachel Weisz, John Hannah, Oded Fehr, Arnold Vosloo, Patricia Velásquez, Freddie Boath, Dwayne Johnson', 'PG-13', 'Rick and Evelyn O’Connell, along with their 8-year-old son Alex, discover the key to the legendary Scorpion King’s might: the fabled Bracelet of Anubis. Unfortunately, a newly resurrected Imhotep has designs on the bracelet as well, and isn’t above kidnapping its new bearer, Alex, to gain control of Anubis’s otherworldly army.', 'Rick and Evelyn O’Connell, along with their 8-year-old son Alex, discover the key to the legendary Scorpion King’s might: the fabled Bracelet of Anubis. Unfortunately, a newly resurrected Imhotep has designs on the bracelet as well, and isn’t above kidnapping its new bearer, Alex, to gain control of Anubis’s otherworldly army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdJsW7hcy1lrj7tdMPycTAQPAiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1734'),
  ('601836107838069986', 'The Mummy Strikes', 1943, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Izzy Sparber', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck, Julian Noa', null, 'Egyptologists are attacked by mummies, drawing the attention of Superman.', 'Egyptologists are attacked by mummies, drawing the attention of Superman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRL4mttJbGjuNdEPeTErp6v99LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146061'),
  ('718816769729578301', 'The Mummy: Rebirth', 2019, 'Horror, Action', 'Tristan Price', null, 'Carter, David E. Cazares, Deanna Grace Congo, Brittany Goodwin, Shamel Hashish', 'PG-13', 'Two treasure hunters uncover a sealed tomb and awaken a mummy that has waited years to come back and wipe humanity from the face of the Earth. It''s a race against time as they try to stop the Mummy from wreaking havoc on the modern world.', 'Two treasure hunters uncover a sealed tomb and awaken a mummy that has waited years to come back and wipe humanity from the face of the Earth. It''s a race against time as they try to stop the Mummy from wreaking havoc on the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD5lS1D4tDGMhDdQLV991zHp2IM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615916'),
  ('1025381003549487954', 'The Mummy: Tomb of the Dragon Emperor', 2008, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Rob Cohen, Simon Duggan, Isabelle Guay', 'Alfred Gough, Miles Millar', 'Brendan Fraser, Maria Bello, John Hannah, Luke Ford, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Jet Li, Michelle Yeoh, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang', 'PG-13', 'Archaeologist Rick O''Connell travels to China, pitting him against an emperor from the 2,000-year-old Han dynasty who''s returned from the dead to pursue a quest for world domination. This time, O''Connell enlists the help of his wife and son to quash the so-called ''Dragon Emperor'' and his abuse of supernatural power.', 'Archaeologist Rick O''Connell travels to China, pitting him against an emperor from the 2,000-year-old Han dynasty who''s returned from the dead to pursue a quest for world domination. This time, O''Connell enlists the help of his wife and son to quash the so-called ''Dragon Emperor'' and his abuse of supernatural power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3acM1lX5PNWQa6r5qeMAJOxbnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1735'),
  ('1088566093097714754', 'The Mummy''s Curse', 1944, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Leslie Goodwins, Virgil Miller, Mack V. Wright', 'Bernard Schubert', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Peter Coe, Virginia Christine, Kay Harding, Dennis Moore, Martin Kosleck, Kurt Katch, Addison Richards', null, 'After being buried in quicksand for the past 25 years, Kharis is set free to roam the rural bayous of Louisiana, as is the soul of his beloved Princess Ananka, still housed in the body of Amina Mansouri, who seeks help and protection at a swamp draining project.', 'After being buried in quicksand for the past 25 years, Kharis is set free to roam the rural bayous of Louisiana, as is the soul of his beloved Princess Ananka, still housed in the body of Amina Mansouri, who seeks help and protection at a swamp draining project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzdLuaFsZrxJ7KcrExTh7GEOqJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29242'),
  ('574517625060533700', 'The Mummy''s Ghost', 1944, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Reginald Le Borg, William A. Sickner, Hans J. Salter', 'John L. Balderston, Nina Wilcox Putnam, Richard Schayer', 'Lon Chaney Jr., John Carradine, Robert Lowery, Ramsay Ames, Barton MacLane, George Zucco, Frank Reicher, Harry Shannon', null, 'An Egyptian high priest travels to America to reclaim the bodies of ancient Egyptian princess Ananka and her living guardian mummy Kharis. Learning that Ananka''s spirit has been reincarnated into another body, he kidnaps a young woman of Egyptian descent with a mysterious resemblance to the princess. However, the high priest''s greedy desires cause him to lose control of the mummy...', 'An Egyptian high priest travels to America to reclaim the bodies of ancient Egyptian princess Ananka and her living guardian mummy Kharis. Learning that Ananka''s spirit has been reincarnated into another body, he kidnaps a young woman of Egyptian descent with a mysterious resemblance to the princess. However, the high priest''s greedy desires cause him to lose control of the mummy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRNWTjYXkUQvqopfgz8DvHolxWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29243'),
  ('480445752417851361', 'The Mummy''s Hand', 1940, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Christy Cabanne, Elwood Bredell, Hans J. Salter', 'John L. Balderston, Nina Wilcox Putnam, Richard Schayer', 'Dick Foran, Peggy Moran, Wallace Ford, George Zucco, Cecil Kellaway, Charles Trowbridge, Tom Tyler, Eduardo Ciannelli', null, 'A couple of young, out-of-work archaeologists in Egypt discover evidence of the burial place of the ancient Egyptian princess Ananka. After receiving funding from an eccentric magician and his beautiful daughter, they set out into the desert only to be terrorized by a sinister high priest and the living mummy Kharis who are the guardians of Ananka’s tomb.', 'A couple of young, out-of-work archaeologists in Egypt discover evidence of the burial place of the ancient Egyptian princess Ananka. After receiving funding from an eccentric magician and his beautiful daughter, they set out into the desert only to be terrorized by a sinister high priest and the living mummy Kharis who are the guardians of Ananka’s tomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSSdvLkGXy4oICnSo5Cnz12B6Ae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31498'),
  ('1008856951109928633', 'The Mummy''s Revenge', 1975, 'Horror', 'Carlos Aured, Francisco Sánchez', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Jack Taylor, María Silva, Helga Liné, Rina Ottolina, Eduardo Calvo, Fernando Sánchez Polack, Pilar Bardem', null, 'Paul Naschy has a duel role as Amenhotep/Assad Bey, an ancient egyptian mummified Pharaoh, and the high priest who brought him back to life. In order For Amenhotep to achieve immortality, Assad Bey has to kidnap nubile young virgins in Victorian London for blood sacrifices.', 'Paul Naschy has a duel role as Amenhotep/Assad Bey, an ancient egyptian mummified Pharaoh, and the high priest who brought him back to life. In order For Amenhotep to achieve immortality, Assad Bey has to kidnap nubile young virgins in Victorian London for blood sacrifices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6ESj9vk4FEw3u1VQGyx5zOkIUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29869'),
  ('122913262183310313', 'The Mummy''s Shroud', 1967, 'Horror', 'John Gilling, Arthur Grant, Bluey Hill', 'John Gilling', 'André Morell, John Phillips, David Buck, Elizabeth Sellars, Maggie Kimberly, Michael Ripper, Tim Barrett, Richard Warner', null, 'Archaeologists discover the final resting place of a boy king, removing the remains to be exhibited in a museum. By disturbing the sarcophagus they unleash the forces of darkness. The Mummy has returned to discharge a violent retribution on the defilers as the curse that surrounds the tomb begins to come true. One by one the explorers are murdered until one of them discovers the ancient words that have the power to reduce the brutal killer to particles of dust.', 'Archaeologists discover the final resting place of a boy king, removing the remains to be exhibited in a museum. By disturbing the sarcophagus they unleash the forces of darkness. The Mummy has returned to discharge a violent retribution on the defilers as the curse that surrounds the tomb begins to come true. One by one the explorers are murdered until one of them discovers the ancient words that have the power to reduce the brutal killer to particles of dust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHWIncz6asTzkBeQYO1KmxztS9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39262'),
  ('362669658988991309', 'The Mummy''s Tomb', 1942, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Harold Young, Hans J. Salter, George Robinson', 'Maxwell Shane, John L. Balderston, Nina Wilcox Putnam', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Dick Foran, John Hubbard, Elyse Knox, George Zucco, Wallace Ford, Turhan Bey, Virginia Brissac', null, 'A high priest of Karnak travels to America with the living mummy Kharis (Lon Chaney Jr.) to kill all those who had desecrated the tomb of the Egyptian princess Ananka thirty years earlier.', 'A high priest of Karnak travels to America with the living mummy Kharis (Lon Chaney Jr.) to kill all those who had desecrated the tomb of the Egyptian princess Ananka thirty years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuaqpLGb5PHpUGUCmQwyS5EVLdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29239'),
  ('11361819248113173', 'The Munekata Sisters', 1950, 'Drama', 'Seiichiro Uchikawa, Yasujirō Ozu, Jōji Ohara', 'Kōgo Noda, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Hideko Takamine, Ken Uehara, Sanae Takasugi, Chishū Ryū, So Yamamura, Yūji Hori, Tatsuo Saitō', null, 'Setsuko is unhappily married to Mimura, an engineer with no job and a bad drinking habit. She had always been in love with Hiroshi but both of them failed to propose when Hiroshi left for France a few years ago. Now he is back and Mariko tries to reunite them. She too is secretly in love with Hiroshi.', 'Setsuko is unhappily married to Mimura, an engineer with no job and a bad drinking habit. She had always been in love with Hiroshi but both of them failed to propose when Hiroshi left for France a few years ago. Now he is back and Mariko tries to reunite them. She too is secretly in love with Hiroshi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIIQYqZDeRhqcTyH2BmcZVP7XBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55198'),
  ('309382989514242749', 'The Munsters', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Rob Zombie, Zoran Popović', 'Rob Zombie', 'Jeff Daniel Phillips, Sheri Moon Zombie, Daniel Roebuck, Jorge Garcia, Richard Brake, Cassandra Peterson, Tomas Boykin, Sylvester McCoy', 'PG', 'Lily is a typical 150-year-old lovelorn vampire who''s looking for the man of her nightmares -- until she lays her eyes on Herman, a 7-foot-tall green experiment with a heart of gold. It''s love at first shock as these two ghouls fall fangs over feet for each other in a Transylvanian romance. Unfortunately, it''s not all smooth sailing in the cemetery as Lily''s father has other plans for his beloved daughter''s future, and they don''t involve her new bumbling beau.', 'Lily is a typical 150-year-old lovelorn vampire who''s looking for the man of her nightmares -- until she lays her eyes on Herman, a 7-foot-tall green experiment with a heart of gold. It''s love at first shock as these two ghouls fall fangs over feet for each other in a Transylvanian romance. Unfortunately, it''s not all smooth sailing in the cemetery as Lily''s father has other plans for his beloved daughter''s future, and they don''t involve her new bumbling beau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJaEVFhDouD72GKANMkYqzQky9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804413'),
  ('484079742531468374', 'The Munsters'' Revenge', 1981, 'Comedy, Crime, Family, TV Movie, Horror', 'Don Weis, Harry L. Wolf', null, 'Fred Gwynne, Yvonne De Carlo, Al Lewis, Jo McDonnell, K.C. Martel, Sid Caesar, Peter Fox, Bob Hastings', 'NR', 'The lovable Munster family finds their placid world turned into turmoil by the diabolical Dr. Diablo, the mastermind of an art heist using monster robots, including clones of Herman and Grandpa.', 'The lovable Munster family finds their placid world turned into turmoil by the diabolical Dr. Diablo, the mastermind of an art heist using monster robots, including clones of Herman and Grandpa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgmc7vMmCzR9JTBXsjYxGfn3AFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30002'),
  ('1006826063131009680', 'The Munsters'' Scary Little Christmas', 1996, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Horror', 'Ian Emes, Roger Lanser', null, 'Ann Magnuson, Bug Hall, Mary Woronov, Sam McMurray, Ed Gale, Elaine Hendrix, Noel Ferrier, Sandy Baron', 'NR', 'The made for television movie Munster''s Scary Little Christmas, created three decades after the demise of the original series, concerns son Eddie missing his home in Transylvania. Soon the entire family bands together to teach the young boy everything great about the holiday season.', 'The made for television movie Munster''s Scary Little Christmas, created three decades after the demise of the original series, concerns son Eddie missing his home in Transylvania. Soon the entire family bands together to teach the young boy everything great about the holiday season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13zolr88jYAlhmc56aCOYXfoLk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28559'),
  ('151049630345297132', 'The Muppet Christmas Carol', 1992, 'Music, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Drama', 'Brian Henson, John Fenner, Alan Cassie', 'Jerry Juhl', 'Michael Caine, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Jerry Nelson, Frank Oz, David Rudman, Don Austen, Jessica Fox', 'G', 'A retelling of the classic Dickens tale of Ebenezer Scrooge, miser extraordinaire. He is held accountable for his dastardly ways during night-time visitations by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future.', 'A retelling of the classic Dickens tale of Ebenezer Scrooge, miser extraordinaire. He is held accountable for his dastardly ways during night-time visitations by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssrV29QSVVJuemBHho0Qx7pFYak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10437'),
  ('976339718800514129', 'The Muppet Movie', 1979, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'James Frawley, Isidore Mankofsky, Ron Wright', 'Jack Burns, Jerry Juhl', 'Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Charles Durning, Austin Pendleton, Edgar Bergen', 'G', 'The Muppets gather to watch their newly-finished big-budget rich-and-famous feature film: a talent agent persuades Kermit the Frog to leave the swamp to pursue a career in Hollywood. On his way there, he meets a bear, a pig, a whatever (his future muppet crew), and some special celebrity guest stars, while being chased by the desperate owner of a frog-leg restaurant!', 'The Muppets gather to watch their newly-finished big-budget rich-and-famous feature film: a talent agent persuades Kermit the Frog to leave the swamp to pursue a career in Hollywood. On his way there, he meets a bear, a pig, a whatever (his future muppet crew), and some special celebrity guest stars, while being chased by the desperate owner of a frog-leg restaurant!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfj8yR2vO5BMkaTMu1wvKQLUTsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11176'),
  ('138591466641684483', 'The Muppet Show', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Music, TV Movie', 'Alex Timbers, Rhet Bear, Erica Hemminger', 'Albertina Rizzo, Gabe Liedman, Nedaa Sweiss', 'Bill Barretta, Dave Goelz, Eric Jacobson, Peter Linz, David Rudman, Matt Vogel, Sabrina Carpenter, Seth Rogen', 'PG', 'Music, comedy, and a whole lot of chaos is bound to ensue when The Muppets once again take the stage of the original Muppet Theatre with their very special guest, Sabrina Carpenter!', 'Music, comedy, and a whole lot of chaos is bound to ensue when The Muppets once again take the stage of the original Muppet Theatre with their very special guest, Sabrina Carpenter!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcwar1rL0neoLvnklL7DzYw7sN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1548113'),
  ('251566331270994410', 'The Muppets', 2011, 'Family, Comedy', 'James Bobin, Allan Graf, Bradley Rubin', 'Jason Segel, Nicholas Stoller', 'Jason Segel, Amy Adams, Chris Cooper, Rashida Jones, Steve Whitmire, Peter Linz, Eric Jacobson, Dave Goelz', 'PG', 'When Kermit the Frog and the Muppets learn that their beloved theater is slated for demolition, a sympathetic human, Gary, and his puppet brother, Walter, swoop in to help the gang put on a show and raise the $10 million they need to save the day.', 'When Kermit the Frog and the Muppets learn that their beloved theater is slated for demolition, a sympathetic human, Gary, and his puppet brother, Walter, swoop in to help the gang put on a show and raise the $10 million they need to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOB0Hdm23NslPNDkZC9eueatW3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64328'),
  ('50902847360249736', 'The Muppets at Walt Disney World', 1990, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Peter Harris', 'Jerry Juhl', 'Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Kevin Clash, Charles Grodin', 'G', 'Filmed right after the merger between Disney and Jim Henson productions, the Muppet''s are featured heading to the greatest place on earth, Walt Disney World. Kermit and Robin take the gang to the swamp for a vacation in Califorina. It is the annual Bug Fry and it''s a journey to the roots again for Kermit and Robin. However, the rest of the cast is less than excited about being in a stinking bog. When it is mentioned that they can see the fireworks from Disney, everyone is excited and wants to go to the park instead of being at the bug fry. Kermit says the''ll take a short peak and be right back. As the Muppets accidentally break into the park, security tries to round them all up as they visit all of the parks. Magic Kingdom, Epcot, and Disney/MGM. Finally, after being round back up, they get a chance to meet the one and only Mickey Mouse and show a huge musical number at the end.', 'Filmed right after the merger between Disney and Jim Henson productions, the Muppet''s are featured heading to the greatest place on earth, Walt Disney World. Kermit and Robin take the gang to the swamp for a vacation in Califorina. It is the annual Bug Fry and it''s a journey to the roots again for Kermit and Robin. However, the rest of the cast is less than excited about being in a stinking bog. When it is mentioned that they can see the fireworks from Disney, everyone is excited and wants to go to the park instead of being at the bug fry. Kermit says the''ll take a short peak and be right back. As the Muppets accidentally break into the park, security tries to round them all up as they visit all of the parks. Magic Kingdom, Epcot, and Disney/MGM. Finally, after being round back up, they get a chance to meet the one and only Mickey Mouse and show a huge musical number at the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkFQoTOK4fIv83ytOwMOmBYkllC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72717'),
  ('177442472603260261', 'The Muppets Celebrate Jim Henson', 1990, 'Documentary, Drama, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Don Mischer', 'Jerry Juhl, Sara Lukinson, Bill Prady', 'Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Kevin Clash, Kathryn Mullen', 'G', 'While the Muppets prepare a tribute to the late Jim Henson, they learn about the life and career of the renowned puppeteer/film maker.', 'While the Muppets prepare a tribute to the late Jim Henson, they learn about the life and career of the renowned puppeteer/film maker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTe0U124EjNVFTggA2QDvtnAVoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27870'),
  ('833621304531351360', 'The Muppets Go Hollywood', 1979, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Stan Harris', 'Jerry Juhl, Don Hinkley', 'Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Kathryn Mullen, Jim Henson, Paul Williams', 'NR', 'Kermit the Frog throws a glamorous party at the Cocoanut Grove nightclub to celebrate the premiere of the Muppets'' first feature film, The Muppet Movie. Hosts Dick van Dyke and Rita Moreno interview the wide array of celebrities and Muppets who attend the event. Gary Owens serves as off-camera announcer, and appears on-screen to introduce Miss Piggy.', 'Kermit the Frog throws a glamorous party at the Cocoanut Grove nightclub to celebrate the premiere of the Muppets'' first feature film, The Muppet Movie. Hosts Dick van Dyke and Rita Moreno interview the wide array of celebrities and Muppets who attend the event. Gary Owens serves as off-camera announcer, and appears on-screen to introduce Miss Piggy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytdirqn3SxUdnIePMfdKUfTONNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114671'),
  ('543957155651214776', 'The Muppets Go to the Movies', 1981, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Peter Harris, John Rook', 'Jim Henson, Jerry Juhl, Chris Langham', 'Dudley Moore, Lily Tomlin, Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire', 'NR', 'In this one-hour special taped between March 9-17, 1981, Lily Tomlin and Dudley Moore join the Muppets in a tribute to film classics. Kermit the Frog hosts the program, which begins with an all-cast rendition of "Hey a Movie!" from The Great Muppet Caper.', 'In this one-hour special taped between March 9-17, 1981, Lily Tomlin and Dudley Moore join the Muppets in a tribute to film classics. Kermit the Frog hosts the program, which begins with an all-cast rendition of "Hey a Movie!" from The Great Muppet Caper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/craBU6O4GjPAtxUleIXBh9cS2iZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104934'),
  ('845404426947422037', 'The Muppets Take Manhattan', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Paynter, Frank Oz', 'Tom Patchett, Jay Tarses, Frank Oz', 'Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Richard Hunt, Jerry Nelson, Juliana Donald, Lonny Price', 'G', 'When the Muppets graduate from Danhurst College, they take their song-filled senior revue to New York City, only to learn that it isn''t easy to find a producer who''s willing to back a show starring a frog and a pig. Of course, Kermit the Frog and Miss Piggy won''t take no for an answer, launching a search for someone to take them to Broadway.', 'When the Muppets graduate from Danhurst College, they take their song-filled senior revue to New York City, only to learn that it isn''t easy to find a producer who''s willing to back a show starring a frog and a pig. Of course, Kermit the Frog and Miss Piggy won''t take no for an answer, launching a search for someone to take them to Broadway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm6Gs0tvswtSE8cXBIAJqa6l25T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11899'),
  ('58181710245632461', 'The Muppets'' Wizard of Oz', 2005, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Tony Westman, Kirk R. Thatcher, Ella Kutschera', null, 'Ashanti, Jeffrey Tambor, David Alan Grier, Queen Latifah, Quentin Tarantino, Steve Whitmire, Dave Goelz, Bill Barretta', 'PG', 'A young woman named Dorothy Gale dreams of becoming a singer but is unable to pursue her dreams. After being swept up by a tornado with her pet prawn Toto, Dorothy embarks on a journey to meet the Wizard of Oz, the person who both Dorothy and the citizens of Oz believe can help make her dream come true.', 'A young woman named Dorothy Gale dreams of becoming a singer but is unable to pursue her dreams. After being swept up by a tornado with her pet prawn Toto, Dorothy embarks on a journey to meet the Wizard of Oz, the person who both Dorothy and the citizens of Oz believe can help make her dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpPaN0kRKDVX9Vj8VgxsJyvxe8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20910'),
  ('139426896709178125', 'The Murder at Road Hill House', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery, TV Movie, Crime', 'James Hawes, Matt Gray', 'Neil McKay', 'Paddy Considine, Peter Capaldi, Tom Georgeson, William Beck, Emma Fielding, Tim Pigott-Smith, Kate O''Flynn, Donald Sumpter', null, 'In 1860, Inspector Jack Whicher of Scotland Yard is sent to rural Wiltshire to investigate the murder of the three-year-old boy Saville Kent, who was snatched from his bed at night and murdered.', 'In 1860, Inspector Jack Whicher of Scotland Yard is sent to rural Wiltshire to investigate the murder of the three-year-old boy Saville Kent, who was snatched from his bed at night and murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQbI1m6tT2PrLf9oxWjVIINU7Nr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63339'),
  ('79298768128681190', 'The Murder Clinic', 1966, 'Horror, Crime', 'Elio Scardamaglia, Lionello De Felice, Roberto Pariante', 'Luciano Martino, Ernesto Gastaldi', 'William Berger, Françoise Prévost, Barbara Wilson, Philippe Hersent, Harriet Medin, Germano Longo, Massimo Righi, Delfi Mauro', null, 'Patients and those working in an isolated mental hospitals are murdered, one by one, by a madman lurking in the corridors', 'Patients and those working in an isolated mental hospitals are murdered, one by one, by a madman lurking in the corridors', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhAT1XCjxoWpkhWXRqFwOVozkaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104925'),
  ('358572494443724960', 'The Murder Farm', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bettina Oberli, Till Bosse, Stéphane Kuthy', 'Bettina Oberli, Petra Lüschow', 'Julia Jentsch, Monica Bleibtreu, Volker Bruch, Filip Peeters, Gundi Ellert, Brigitte Hobmeier, Lisa Kreuzer, Vitus Zeplichal', null, 'Bavaria, Germany, 1950s. The sudden return of the young Kathrin to the small village where she was born stirs up the feelings of guilt and personal ghosts of its inhabitants, haunted by dark memories related to a multiple murder that happened two years earlier at the Tannöd farm, a hideous crime that remains unsolved.', 'Bavaria, Germany, 1950s. The sudden return of the young Kathrin to the small village where she was born stirs up the feelings of guilt and personal ghosts of its inhabitants, haunted by dark memories related to a multiple murder that happened two years earlier at the Tannöd farm, a hideous crime that remains unsolved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxSxf9pniqCLBAtSXTC7LBlb7fy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23517'),
  ('653555605740458550', 'The Murder Man', 1935, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tim Whelan, Lester White', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Spencer Tracy, Virginia Bruce, Lionel Atwill, Harvey Stephens, Robert Barrat, James Stewart, William Collier Sr., Bobby Watson', 'NR', 'Steve Grey, reporter for the Daily Star, has a habit of scooping all the other papers in town. When Henry Mander is investigated for the murder of his shady business partner, Grey is one step ahead of the police to the extent that he often dictates his story in advance of its actual occurrence. He leads the police through an ''open and shut'' case resulting in Mander being tried, convicted and sentenced to death. Columnist Mary Shannon is in love with Steve but she sees him struggle greatly with his last story before Mander''s execution. When she starts typing out the story from his recorded dictation, she realizes why.', 'Steve Grey, reporter for the Daily Star, has a habit of scooping all the other papers in town. When Henry Mander is investigated for the murder of his shady business partner, Grey is one step ahead of the police to the extent that he often dictates his story in advance of its actual occurrence. He leads the police through an ''open and shut'' case resulting in Mander being tried, convicted and sentenced to death. Columnist Mary Shannon is in love with Steve but she sees him struggle greatly with his last story before Mander''s execution. When she starts typing out the story from his recorded dictation, she realizes why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjoBHLSJsNml7mcl5lGr1CvYFjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27998'),
  ('157341865160395387', 'The Murder of Nicole Brown Simpson', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Max Schouweiler, Daniel Farrands, Ben Demaree', 'Michael Arter', 'Mena Suvari, Nick Stahl, Taryn Manning, Agnes Bruckner, CC King, Drew Roy, Gene Freeman, Marli Crismon', 'R', 'In 1994 Nicole Brown Simpson and her friend Ronald Goldman were brutally murdered in her Los Angeles home by whom most believe to be O.J Simpson. But what role did Glen Rogers, also known as the Casanova Killer play in their death?', 'In 1994 Nicole Brown Simpson and her friend Ronald Goldman were brutally murdered in her Los Angeles home by whom most believe to be O.J Simpson. But what role did Glen Rogers, also known as the Casanova Killer play in their death?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfTrRimCd5mDnb8qpTZovD5ZIsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527534'),
  ('752587649019134411', 'The Murder Secret', 1988, 'Horror', 'Mario Bianchi', 'Mario Bianchi', 'Adriana Russo, Gabriele Tinti, Anna Maria Placido, Jessica Moore, Maurice Poli, Sacha Darwin', null, 'A family of 4 makes a long drive to Aunt Martha''s house to visit her for the first time in years. Only she isn''t there. Just the caretaker and his message that she will appear the next day...if they survive the night.', 'A family of 4 makes a long drive to Aunt Martha''s house to visit her for the first time in years. Only she isn''t there. Just the caretaker and his message that she will appear the next day...if they survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Hz6AEZUfxnMUDgRVgvrryKsziC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29186'),
  ('425982536175158999', 'The Murdered House', 1988, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Yves Rodallec, Georges Lautner', 'Didier van Cauwelaert, Jacky Cukier, Georges Lautner', 'Patrick Bruel, Anne Brochet, Agnès Blanchot, Ingrid Held, Yann Collette, Jean-Pierre Sentier, Martine Sarcey, Maria Meriko', null, 'After World War I, a young ex-soldier, Sébastien Monge, returns to his home village. Ignorant of his past, he learns that, 24 years before, his entire family was slain in their home one stormy night. Only Sébastien, then a four-month old baby, was spared. Whilst Sébastien is being seduced by Charmaine, Dupin is killed by someone else. Sébastien’s next victim, the miller Didon Pujol, is also murdered before he has a chance to take his revenge. Sébastien realises that someone is watching his every move and is going to extraordinary lengths to protect him. But who, and why..?', 'After World War I, a young ex-soldier, Sébastien Monge, returns to his home village. Ignorant of his past, he learns that, 24 years before, his entire family was slain in their home one stormy night. Only Sébastien, then a four-month old baby, was spared. Whilst Sébastien is being seduced by Charmaine, Dupin is killed by someone else. Sébastien’s next victim, the miller Didon Pujol, is also murdered before he has a chance to take his revenge. Sébastien realises that someone is watching his every move and is going to extraordinary lengths to protect him. But who, and why..?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toO7ehpvoLbuRkc3Ftq4B7hjPiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62087'),
  ('72853679375772986', 'The Murderer', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Wisit Sasanatieng, Niramon Ross, Pipat Jomkoh', 'Abishek J. Bajaj', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Eisaya Hosuwan, James Laver, Sompong Choptham, Sawanee Utoomma, Sunaree Ratchasima, Chotpipat Suttijun, Suthin Khotatha', 'R', 'After a series of deaths in a small provincial town, a determined detective attempts to uncover the killer — and British expat Earl is the prime suspect.', 'After a series of deaths in a small provincial town, a determined detective attempts to uncover the killer — and British expat Earl is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csZRHobe0aPYOGobhLjTnB6S2L9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034335'),
  ('947184884072399576', 'The Murderer Hides His Face', 1966, 'Drama, Crime', 'Miloš Kohout, Marta Kunstová, Stanislava Hutková', 'Lubomír Možný, Petr Schulhoff', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Radoslav Brzobohatý, Jiří Pleskot, Ferdinand Krůta, Ludmila Roubíková, Zuzana Ondrouchová, Zdeněk Kutil, Jaroslav Moučka', null, 'In the forest near the village of Drahovice, a nurse from the local health center is found murdered. Three months ago, another young woman died nearby and a sexual motive was proved in the case of her murder. In the case of the nurse, the motives are not so clear. Two criminologists from Prague - Major Kalas (Rudolf Hrusínský) and Lieutenant Varga (Radoslav Brzobohatý) - patiently collect all available leads and question the villagers.', 'In the forest near the village of Drahovice, a nurse from the local health center is found murdered. Three months ago, another young woman died nearby and a sexual motive was proved in the case of her murder. In the case of the nurse, the motives are not so clear. Two criminologists from Prague - Major Kalas (Rudolf Hrusínský) and Lieutenant Varga (Radoslav Brzobohatý) - patiently collect all available leads and question the villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxrAQAKAc8OFjv424oELOFrkQjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84037'),
  ('315168221168719239', 'The Murderer Lives at Number 21', 1942, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Armand Thirard', 'Stanislas-André Steeman, Henri-Georges Clouzot', 'Pierre Fresnay, Suzy Delair, Jean Tissier, Pierre Larquey, Noël Roquevert, René Génin, Jean Despeaux, Marc Natol', 'NR', 'Paris, France. Commissaire Wens follows the lead of a ruthless murderer to an unexpected place.', 'Paris, France. Commissaire Wens follows the lead of a ruthless murderer to an unexpected place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4qcDAOTJ0BvFqZevtDCp6xViJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74402'),
  ('929726780247757719', 'The Murderers Are Among Us', 1946, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Wolfgang Staudte, Friedl Behn-Grund, Eugen Klagemann', 'Wolfgang Staudte', 'Hildegard Knef, Wilhelm Borchert, Arno Paulsen, Robert Forsch, Albert Johannes, Ursula Krieg, Wolfgang Dohnberg, Erna Sellmer', null, 'After returning from a concentration camp, Susanne finds a traumatized ex-soldier living in her apartment in bombed out Berlin. Together the two try to move past their experiences during WWII.', 'After returning from a concentration camp, Susanne finds a traumatized ex-soldier living in her apartment in bombed out Berlin. Together the two try to move past their experiences during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdkYKcmMSGNvRBoIzmYQQ4CLesz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932'),
  ('245744189416480536', 'The Murders in the Rue Morgue', 1986, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Jeannot Szwarc, Bruno de Keyzer', 'David Epstein', 'George C. Scott, Rebecca De Mornay, Ian McShane, Neil Dickson, Val Kilmer, Maud Rayer, Maxence Mailfort, Fernand Guiot', 'PG', 'A detective comes out of retirement to help his daughter''s fiance prove that he did not commit a series of murders.', 'A detective comes out of retirement to help his daughter''s fiance prove that he did not commit a series of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roGb7CTNwNiRFeJLyJvIEPgz97g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6174'),
  ('883607222913616641', 'The Murri Affair', 1974, 'History, Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Mauro Cappelloni, Pascal Vidal', 'Sergio Bazzini', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Catherine Deneuve, Fernando Rey, Tina Aumont, Rina Morelli, Ettore Manni, Paolo Bonacelli, Giacomo Rossi Stuart', null, 'Based on a true incident, this tells the story of a troubled young man who kills his sister''s reactionary, violent and abusive husband and is eventually arrested for the murder. However, the dead husband happened to be a member of the Italian nobility, and the trial starts to turn into more of a prosecution of the defendant''s socialist politics and the activities of his father, a well known liberal social reformer, than the actual crime itself.', 'Based on a true incident, this tells the story of a troubled young man who kills his sister''s reactionary, violent and abusive husband and is eventually arrested for the murder. However, the dead husband happened to be a member of the Italian nobility, and the trial starts to turn into more of a prosecution of the defendant''s socialist politics and the activities of his father, a well known liberal social reformer, than the actual crime itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VheIeyhe9XTjckgmv3MDdwy9fv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81004'),
  ('78239692602261272', 'The Muse', 1999, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Albert Brooks, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Albert Brooks, Monica Johnson', 'Albert Brooks, Sharon Stone, Andie MacDowell, Jeff Bridges, Cybill Shepherd, Monica Mikala, Jamie Alexis, Marnie Shelton', 'PG-13', 'With his career on the skids, a Hollywood screenwriter enlists the aid of a modern-day muse, who proves to test his patience.', 'With his career on the skids, a Hollywood screenwriter enlists the aid of a modern-day muse, who proves to test his patience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmtvDW52V3EuFmbhTOLjaGMYCDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37718'),
  ('206044157696147751', 'The Music Box', 1932, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Len Powers, Walter Lundin', 'H.M. Walker, Stan Laurel, James Parrott', 'Oliver Hardy, Stan Laurel, Billy Gilbert, William Gillespie, Charlie Hall, Hazel Howell, Lilyan Irene, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'The Laurel & Hardy Moving Co. have a challenging job on their hands (and backs): hauling a player piano up a monumental flight of stairs to Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen''s house. Their task is complicated by a sassy nursemaid and, unbeknownst to them, the impatient Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen himself. But the biggest problem is the force of gravity, which repeatedly pulls the piano back down to the bottom of the stairs.', 'The Laurel & Hardy Moving Co. have a challenging job on their hands (and backs): hauling a player piano up a monumental flight of stairs to Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen''s house. Their task is complicated by a sassy nursemaid and, unbeknownst to them, the impatient Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen himself. But the biggest problem is the force of gravity, which repeatedly pulls the piano back down to the bottom of the stairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwU0Y7VS3d326v1pYY7kif1y7xQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44892'),
  ('579520395052011270', 'The Music Box', 2018, 'Thriller', 'John Real', 'John Real, Adriana Marzagalli', 'Rachel Daigh, Antonio Lujak, Antonella Salvucci, Cearl Pepper, Fiona Whitelaw, Melissa Leone, Anita Tenerelli', null, 'When six-year-old Sophie is tragically orphaned guardianship is assigned to her estranged aunt Annabelle. The two move into a large, eerie, Victorian house where Sophie unearths a locked wooden box with a strange symbol drawn on it. Desperate to connect with her niece Annabelle pries the lock open revealing a beautiful music box. Each time the music box is wound and replayed it''s surprisingly chilling melody plays slightly longer, captivating Sophie even more. When the music box begins affecting Sophie''s behavior and health Annabelle seeks the aid of a child psychologist and clairvoyant who soon discover the music box is possessed by an evil spirit who seeks to haunt Sophie and destroy Annabelle. As the haunting intensifies time begins to run out and Annabelle finds herself racing against the music box''s melody to defeat the spirit before the last note plays.', 'When six-year-old Sophie is tragically orphaned guardianship is assigned to her estranged aunt Annabelle. The two move into a large, eerie, Victorian house where Sophie unearths a locked wooden box with a strange symbol drawn on it. Desperate to connect with her niece Annabelle pries the lock open revealing a beautiful music box. Each time the music box is wound and replayed it''s surprisingly chilling melody plays slightly longer, captivating Sophie even more. When the music box begins affecting Sophie''s behavior and health Annabelle seeks the aid of a child psychologist and clairvoyant who soon discover the music box is possessed by an evil spirit who seeks to haunt Sophie and destroy Annabelle. As the haunting intensifies time begins to run out and Annabelle finds herself racing against the music box''s melody to defeat the spirit before the last note plays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2SEFrLRR2zIUJF6PA8CkuFOWc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585358'),
  ('323421974025677409', 'The Music Lovers', 1971, 'Drama, Music', 'Ken Russell, Douglas Slocombe', 'Melvyn Bragg', 'Richard Chamberlain, Glenda Jackson, Max Adrian, Christopher Gable, Kenneth Colley, Izabella Telezynska, Maureen Pryor, Sabina Maydelle', 'R', 'Composer, conductor and teacher Peter Ilych Tchaikovsky struggles against his homosexual tendencies by marrying, but unfortunately, he chooses wacky nymphomaniac Nina, whom he is unable to satisfy.', 'Composer, conductor and teacher Peter Ilych Tchaikovsky struggles against his homosexual tendencies by marrying, but unfortunately, he chooses wacky nymphomaniac Nina, whom he is unable to satisfy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxqRVEGh86ZZnnzCIlQkuzdcLtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72899'),
  ('670148383344556685', 'The Music Man', 1962, 'Comedy, Family, Music, Romance', 'Morton DaCosta, Robert Burks', 'Marion Hargrove', 'Robert Preston, Shirley Jones, Buddy Hackett, Ron Howard, Hermione Gingold, Paul Ford, Pert Kelton, Timmy Everett', 'G', 'Traveling con artist Harold Hill targets the naïve residents of a small town in 1910s Iowa by posing as a boys'' bandleader to raise money before he can skip town.', 'Traveling con artist Harold Hill targets the naïve residents of a small town in 1910s Iowa by posing as a boys'' bandleader to raise money before he can skip town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yo6qaqVF1IThXMapo4yW9BRWjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13671'),
  ('364292931861187267', 'The Music Man', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Music, Family', 'Jeff Bleckner, James Chressanthis, Jonnie Katz', null, 'Matthew Broderick, Kristin Chenoweth, Victor Garber, Debra Monk, Molly Shannon, David Aaron Baker, Cameron Monaghan, Boyd Banks', 'G', 'Traveling con artist Harold Hill targets the naïve residents of a small town in 1910s Iowa by posing as a boys'' bandleader to raise money before he can skip town.', 'Traveling con artist Harold Hill targets the naïve residents of a small town in 1910s Iowa by posing as a boys'' bandleader to raise money before he can skip town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlXwiVqhZokgCgrzGz63uVe1PBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24105'),
  ('862630062470856669', 'The Music Man', 2007, 'Music, Drama', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Turaj Mansuri', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Vahideh Mohammadifar', 'Bahram Radan, Golshifteh Farahani, Masoud Rayegan, Nader Soleimani, Roya Taymourian, Maede Tahmasbi, Mohammad Solooki, Mahyar Pourhesabi', null, 'Ali is son of a well-off family who plays the santoor (an Iranian instrument) and has earned some reputation through his concerts and teaching music but is rejected by his family because of this profession, which they despise. He falls for one of his music students but after a short blissful period, life doesn''t treat him as well as before and also his addiction agonizes him in his numbered days before redemption.', 'Ali is son of a well-off family who plays the santoor (an Iranian instrument) and has earned some reputation through his concerts and teaching music but is rejected by his family because of this profession, which they despise. He falls for one of his music students but after a short blissful period, life doesn''t treat him as well as before and also his addiction agonizes him in his numbered days before redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l49O4oPHTsdzq9sQp1GEAyq05yW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266234'),
  ('343454389867295336', 'The Music Never Stopped', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jim Kohlberg, Stephen Kazmierski', 'Gwyn Lurie, Gary Marks', 'J.K. Simmons, Lou Taylor Pucci, Julia Ormond, Cara Seymour, Mía Maestro, Tammy Blanchard, Scott Adsit, James Urbaniak', 'PG', 'Henry struggles to bond with his estranged son, Gabriel, who suffers from a brain tumor that prevents him from forming new memories. With Gabriel unable to shed the beliefs and interests that caused their physical and emotional distance, Henry must learn to embrace his son''s choices and try to connect with him through music.', 'Henry struggles to bond with his estranged son, Gabriel, who suffers from a brain tumor that prevents him from forming new memories. With Gabriel unable to shed the beliefs and interests that caused their physical and emotional distance, Henry must learn to embrace his son''s choices and try to connect with him through music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbKqNh3bi2Do4cpefIbBNUdQJg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56401'),
  ('189934446883514553', 'The Music of Chance', 1993, 'Drama', 'Philip Haas, Bernard Zitzermann, Ford Wheeler', 'Philip Haas, Belinda Haas', 'James Spader, Mandy Patinkin, M. Emmet Walsh, Charles Durning, Joel Grey, Samantha Mathis, Chris Penn, Pearl Jones', 'R', 'Two men face the consequences of gambling after playing with men beyond their league.', 'Two men face the consequences of gambling after playing with men beyond their league.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHkIzEe3sYHWSQc3XOw2v5VqsaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39327'),
  ('726118303772441999', 'The Music of Erich Zann', 1980, 'Horror, Mystery', 'John Strysik, Michael Goi', 'John Strysik', 'Robert Rothman, Robert Alexander, Darryl Warren, Barbara Snapp', null, 'Charles Dexter Ward, a young student of metaphysics, befriends Erich Zann, an elderly violinist who lives on the floor above him. Ward is fascinated by Zann''s sinister yet wonderful music, which he hears late at night drifting down from above. But he discovers more then he bargains for when he peers at what beckons beyond that strange curtained window in Zann''s room...', 'Charles Dexter Ward, a young student of metaphysics, befriends Erich Zann, an elderly violinist who lives on the floor above him. Ward is fascinated by Zann''s sinister yet wonderful music, which he hears late at night drifting down from above. But he discovers more then he bargains for when he peers at what beckons beyond that strange curtained window in Zann''s room...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYfuwmEMELN5isJo5O6Idyr3egx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282399'),
  ('409452119292805312', 'The Music of Silence', 2017, 'Drama', 'Michael Radford, Stefano Falivene', 'Michael Radford, Anna Pavignano, Andrea Bocelli', 'Antonio Banderas, Jordi Mollà, Toby Sebastian, Luisa Ranieri, Daniel Vivian, Alessandro Sperduti, Antonella Attili, Nadir Caselli', 'NR', 'Born with a serious eye condition that eventually leads to his blindness, Bocelli nevertheless rises above the challenges, driven by great ambitions towards his passion. The silent pursuit of his daily mission continues.', 'Born with a serious eye condition that eventually leads to his blindness, Bocelli nevertheless rises above the challenges, driven by great ambitions towards his passion. The silent pursuit of his daily mission continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btoHPtkDOEkHC27UpSpqzPXVT22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475242'),
  ('678897163104409623', 'The Music Room', 1958, 'Drama, Music', 'Subrata Mitra, Satyajit Ray, Tapeshwar Prasad', 'Santi P. Choudhury', 'Chhabi Biswas, Gangapada Basu, Kali Sarkar, Tulsi Lahiri, Padmadevi, Pinaki Sengupta, Begum Akhtar, Waheed Khan', 'NR', 'An aging, decadent landlord’s passion for music becomes the undoing of his legacy as he sacrifices his wealth in order to compete with the opulent music room of his younger, richer neighbour.', 'An aging, decadent landlord’s passion for music becomes the undoing of his legacy as he sacrifices his wealth in order to compete with the opulent music room of his younger, richer neighbour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1coINFn9GDeFr09QtkzjgTUbev5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822'),
  ('308483670391025134', 'The Music Teacher', 1988, 'Music, Drama', 'Gérard Corbiau, Philippe Stevenart, Walther van den Ende', 'Andrée Corbiau, Christian Watton', 'José van Dam, Anne Roussel, Philippe Volter, Sylvie Fennec, Patrick Bauchau, Johan Leysen, Marc Schreiber, Alain Carre', 'PG', 'Aging opera singer Joachim Dallayrac retires from the stage and retreats to the countryside to school two young singers. Although the rigorous training takes its toll on both teacher and students, there is plenty of time for relationships to develop between the three.', 'Aging opera singer Joachim Dallayrac retires from the stage and retreats to the countryside to school two young singers. Although the rigorous training takes its toll on both teacher and students, there is plenty of time for relationships to develop between the three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vFoVER0dbfcgmVqnowV8JPbDsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58558'),
  ('344792571035412212', 'The Musical', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Giselle Bonilla', 'Alexander Heller', 'Will Brill, Gillian Jacobs, Nevada Jose, Melanie Herrera, Chyler Emery Stern', null, 'When a frustrated playwright/middle school theater teacher finds out his ex-girlfriend has started dating his nemesis, the school''s principal, he decides to ruin the principal''s chances of winning the Blue Ribbon of Academic Excellence.', 'When a frustrated playwright/middle school theater teacher finds out his ex-girlfriend has started dating his nemesis, the school''s principal, he decides to ruin the principal''s chances of winning the Blue Ribbon of Academic Excellence.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F36pEPdTrYYP6SLeEJmfJpmO0Fs.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-musical-2026'),
  ('486318467235808241', 'The Musical Farmer', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey performs all his chores while whistling or singing. The big excitement is when Fanny the hen, who hasn''t laid an egg in some time, lays a super-giant egg.', 'Mickey performs all his chores while whistling or singing. The big excitement is when Fanny the hen, who hasn''t laid an egg in some time, lays a super-giant egg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alNfQ7HWELjuXEV5BcbE4maRqvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156500'),
  ('178639599681516507', 'The Musical Vampire', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Wilson Tong Wai-Shing, Tenky Tin Kai-Man', 'Wilson Tong Wai-Shing', 'Lam Ching-Ying, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Dickson Lee Kar-Sing, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Xiong Xinxin, Tai Bo, Wong Chi-Keung', null, 'A crazy white scientist resurrects a corpse with a werid chemical creating a super hopping ghost. The only thing that can somewhat control it is the sound of music. A Taoist and his two assistants try and stop it from destroying the countryside.', 'A crazy white scientist resurrects a corpse with a werid chemical creating a super hopping ghost. The only thing that can somewhat control it is the sound of music. A Taoist and his two assistants try and stop it from destroying the countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfv6DXaECNmNiQe677EVDPHjWPO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368672'),
  ('175529498868621848', 'The Musicians', 1960, 'Documentary, Music', 'Kazimierz Karabasz, Stanislaw Niedbalski', 'Kazimierz Karabasz', null, null, 'A documentary about a group of Warsaw tram workers who moonlight in the city orchestra at night.', 'A documentary about a group of Warsaw tram workers who moonlight in the city orchestra at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTww6F2YXbBZbSZesVI9O0MdlFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213118'),
  ('940216892849161', 'The Musicians', 2025, 'Drama, Music, Comedy', 'Grégory Magne, Claudia Cheilian, Antoine Carrard', 'Grégory Magne', 'Valérie Donzelli, Frédéric Pierrot, Mathieu Spinosi, Emma Ravier, Daniel Garlitsky, Marie Vialle, Nicolas Bridet, François Ettori', null, 'Astrid Thompson finally succeeds in fulfilling her father''s dream: to bring together four Stradivarius for a unique concert, eagerly expected by music lovers around the world. But Lise, George, Peter and Apolline, the four virtuosos recruited for the occasion, are incapable of playing together. The rehearsals are one ego crisis after another. With no solution in sight, Astrid decides to go and find the only person who, in her eyes, can still save the event: Charlie Beaumont, the composer of the score.', 'Astrid Thompson finally succeeds in fulfilling her father''s dream: to bring together four Stradivarius for a unique concert, eagerly expected by music lovers around the world. But Lise, George, Peter and Apolline, the four virtuosos recruited for the occasion, are incapable of playing together. The rehearsals are one ego crisis after another. With no solution in sight, Astrid decides to go and find the only person who, in her eyes, can still save the event: Charlie Beaumont, the composer of the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNqeQngh0Owmj0l1zbXy3JnJXP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266805'),
  ('1127348759238441841', 'The Musketeer', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Xiong Xinxin', 'Gene Quintano', 'Justin Chambers, Catherine Deneuve, Mena Suvari, Stephen Rea, Tim Roth, Nick Moran, Steve Speirs, Jan-Gregor Kremp', 'PG-13', 'Young D''Artagnan seeks to join the legendary musketeer brigade and avenge his father''s death - but he finds that the musketeers have been disbanded.', 'Young D''Artagnan seeks to join the legendary musketeer brigade and avenge his father''s death - but he finds that the musketeers have been disbanded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaKp6HZQDTtCOwn4JGi2Mh7Ep95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11370'),
  ('348549420179599195', 'The Musketeers of Pig Alley', 1912, 'Crime, Drama', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer', 'D.W. Griffith, Anita Loos', 'Elmer Booth, Lillian Gish, Walter Miller, Harry Carey, Clara T. Bracy, Alfred Paget, John T. Dillon, Madge Kirby', 'NR', 'A man recognizes the thief who had previously robbed him as one of the men involved in an unrelated mob shootout.', 'A man recognizes the thief who had previously robbed him as one of the men involved in an unrelated mob shootout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diT1AgVS6iLAfqdBtv5lOVZIXQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42553'),
  ('717218205558753145', 'The Muslim', 1995, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Khotinenko, Alexey Rodionov, Sergey Sashnin', 'Valeri Zalotukha', 'Evgeny Mironov, Aleksandr Baluev, Nina Usatova, Evdokiya Germanova, Pyotr Zaychenko, Ivan Bortnik, Vladimir Ilin, Aleksandr Peskov', null, 'A Russian soldier who spent ten years in captivity in Afghanistan, returns to his home village and shocks all its inhabitants because of his conversion to Islam. During his absence, his father hanged himself, his brother served a prison term and his former fiancée has become a woman of very low morals. The village is the scene of endless drinking while the local boss is selling off the land for dollars to new-rich Russians. Our hero turns out as the only sober and hard-working member of the community. However, his attachment to his new faith soon provokes the hatred and rejection of everyone else, including his own family.', 'A Russian soldier who spent ten years in captivity in Afghanistan, returns to his home village and shocks all its inhabitants because of his conversion to Islam. During his absence, his father hanged himself, his brother served a prison term and his former fiancée has become a woman of very low morals. The village is the scene of endless drinking while the local boss is selling off the land for dollars to new-rich Russians. Our hero turns out as the only sober and hard-working member of the community. However, his attachment to his new faith soon provokes the hatred and rejection of everyone else, including his own family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2GN7sPRRFwDa3WlocjmvDf8CNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124624'),
  ('619562483793038969', 'The Mustang', 2019, 'Drama', 'Karim Nabil, Candace Balido, Richard Hicks', 'Laure de Clermont-Tonnerre, Brock Norman Brock, Mona Fastvold', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Jason Mitchell, Gideon Adlon, Connie Britton, Bruce Dern, Josh Stewart, Noel Gugliemi, Thomas Smittle', null, 'While participating in a rehabilitation program training wild mustangs, a convict at first struggles to connect with the horses and his fellow inmates, but he learns to confront his violent past as he soothes an especially feisty horse.', 'While participating in a rehabilitation program training wild mustangs, a convict at first struggles to connect with the horses and his fellow inmates, but he learns to confront his violent past as he soothes an especially feisty horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXQzQcjNAYYosymYPVaXh1nYKaJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500860'),
  ('629321734441670426', 'The Mutations', 1974, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Cardiff, Brian Dunbar, Gareth Tandy', 'Robert D. Weinbach, Edward Mann', 'Donald Pleasence, Tom Baker, Brad Harris, Julie Ege, Michael Dunn, Scott Antony, Jill Haworth, Olga Anthony', 'R', 'A mad scientist crosses plants with people, and the results wind up in a sideshow.', 'A mad scientist crosses plants with people, and the results wind up in a sideshow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mku11cRXXJB3rzid7yS42y35oyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30929'),
  ('650597377042100967', 'The Mute Man of Sardinia', 2022, 'Drama, History, Crime', 'Matteo Fresi, Gherardo Gossi', 'Matteo Fresi, Carlo Orlando', 'Andrea Arcangeli, Marco Bullitta, Giovanni Carroni, Syama Rayner, Aldo Ottobrino, Fulvio Accogli, Nicola Pannelli, Andrea Carroni', null, 'Gallura, the mid-1800s. The feud between the Vasa and Mamia families – historically documented – is causing bloodshed in the region. Bastiano Tansu, a deaf-mute since birth, is one of its protagonists. Mistreated and marginalized since his childhood, after his brother Michele was murdered he joined forces with one of the two leaders of the factions, Pietro Vasa, and put at his service his fury and his amazing aim, becoming a highly feared assassin. The State and the Church try to stem the wave of terror and only after more than 70 deaths, the peace of Aggius arrives. At first, Bastiano finds peace in his love for a pastor''s daughter, but in a violent and superstitious world that already labeled him the devil''s son when he was just a boy, someone like him cannot be found innocent. Thus, he chooses to confront his own destiny.', 'Gallura, the mid-1800s. The feud between the Vasa and Mamia families – historically documented – is causing bloodshed in the region. Bastiano Tansu, a deaf-mute since birth, is one of its protagonists. Mistreated and marginalized since his childhood, after his brother Michele was murdered he joined forces with one of the two leaders of the factions, Pietro Vasa, and put at his service his fury and his amazing aim, becoming a highly feared assassin. The State and the Church try to stem the wave of terror and only after more than 70 deaths, the peace of Aggius arrives. At first, Bastiano finds peace in his love for a pastor''s daughter, but in a violent and superstitious world that already labeled him the devil''s son when he was just a boy, someone like him cannot be found innocent. Thus, he chooses to confront his own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaSFRnIsfbl2TpG8FAj5VfhhAAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910709'),
  ('242323982535965347', 'The Muthers', 1976, 'Drama, Action', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Ricardo Remias', 'Cyril St. James, Cirio H. Santiago', 'Jeannie Bell, Rosanne Katon, Trina Parks, Jayne Kennedy, Tony Carreon, John Montgomery, Sam Sharruff, Dick Piper', 'R', 'A band of female pirates go undercover at a prison camp on a coffee plantation to rescue their leader''s sister.', 'A band of female pirates go undercover at a prison camp on a coffee plantation to rescue their leader''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arGiL9XDbCQlAXNcVj9uUlcwApB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95565'),
  ('370672071018797650', 'The Mutilator', 1985, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Buddy Cooper, Peter Schnall, John Douglass', 'Buddy Cooper', 'Matt Mitler, Ruth Martinez, Bill Hitchcock, Connie Rogers, Frances Sherman, Morey Lampley, Jack Chatham, Ben Moore', 'NR', 'As a child, Ed was cleaning his father’s hunting rifles - a surprise birthday treat for the old man - when one of them went off, hitting and killing his mother. On seeing the bloodshed, his father flew into a murderous rage - Ed just barely escaped with his life. Now in his teens, he returns home; he doesn’t expect to find his father, still there, waiting for a chance to settle the score . . .', 'As a child, Ed was cleaning his father’s hunting rifles - a surprise birthday treat for the old man - when one of them went off, hitting and killing his mother. On seeing the bloodshed, his father flew into a murderous rage - Ed just barely escaped with his life. Now in his teens, he returns home; he doesn’t expect to find his father, still there, waiting for a chance to settle the score . . .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WdTypYAKttmUPWMQ4uLzRS6Hye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40451'),
  ('453850838454820669', 'The Mysterians', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller, War', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Koji Kajita', 'Takeshi Kimura', 'Kenji Sahara, Yumi Shirakawa, Akihiko Hirata, Momoko Kôchi, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Takashi Shimura, Yoshio Kosugi, Susumu Fujita', null, 'In Japan, scientifically advanced invaders from the war-destroyed planet Mysteroid cause an entire village to vanish, then send a giant robot out to storm the city by night, after which they request a small patch of land on Earth and the right to marry earthling women, claiming to be pacifists. Mankind must decide whether to capitulate or to resist.', 'In Japan, scientifically advanced invaders from the war-destroyed planet Mysteroid cause an entire village to vanish, then send a giant robot out to storm the city by night, after which they request a small patch of land on Earth and the right to marry earthling women, claiming to be pacifists. Mankind must decide whether to capitulate or to resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eILFc9gTP1Yxj9oI4hXEBRGnt1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43226'),
  ('842883906051226358', 'The Mysteries of a Hairdresser''s Shop', 1923, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Erich Engel, Bertolt Brecht', 'Bertolt Brecht, Karl Valentin', 'Karl Valentin, Blandine Ebinger, Erwin Faber, Annemarie Hase, Kurt Horwitz, Hans Leibelt, Carola Neher, Dr. Koch', null, 'The Mysteries of a Hairdresser’s Shop describes the absurd goings-on of a by no means ordinary hair salon, where men with great beards wait in vain for a shave while the barber takes a nap.', 'The Mysteries of a Hairdresser’s Shop describes the absurd goings-on of a by no means ordinary hair salon, where men with great beards wait in vain for a shave while the barber takes a nap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ynHfQ4EzNO5P0vfUR74HVDpucJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151391'),
  ('988612317588214579', 'The Mysteries of Paris', 1962, 'History, Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Jean Tournier, Marcel Grignon, André Hunebelle', 'Diego Fabbri, Jean Halain, Pierre Foucaud', 'Jean Marais, Dany Robin, Jill Haworth, Raymond Pellegrin, Robert Dalban, Noël Roquevert, Paulette Dubost, Pierre Mondy', null, 'The Marquis Rodolphe de Sombrueil accidentally runs over a working man with his carriage and helps his widow -- unjustly accused of robbery -- to find her missing daughter.', 'The Marquis Rodolphe de Sombrueil accidentally runs over a working man with his carriage and helps his widow -- unjustly accused of robbery -- to find her missing daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vmJ9ljX6SutJ9DbZAQfJD6pI5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86197'),
  ('965976833645740898', 'The Mysteries of Pittsburgh', 2008, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber, Eric Sherman, Mary Ellen Woods', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber', 'Jon Foster, Peter Sarsgaard, Sienna Miller, Mena Suvari, Omid Abtahi, Nick Nolte, Keith Michael Gregory, Ali Reed', 'R', 'Based on Michael Chabon''s novel, the film chronicles the defining summer of a recent college graduate who crosses his gangster father and explores love, sexuality, and the enigmas surrounding his life and his city.', 'Based on Michael Chabon''s novel, the film chronicles the defining summer of a recent college graduate who crosses his gangster father and explores love, sexuality, and the enigmas surrounding his life and his city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faS3A45FgI44T137fUC51vPP5Ut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20471'),
  ('134642422241905205', 'The Mysteries of the Chateau of Dice', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Man Ray, Jacques-André Boiffard, Jacques-André Boiffard', 'Jacques-André Boiffard, Man Ray', 'Man Ray, Georges Auric, Jacques-André Boiffard', null, 'Mannequin hands hold a pair of dice. A castle is perched on a hilltop. Below it, a posh, modern villa. Meanwhile, far from Paris, two men with masked faces play dice in a bar. They decide to drive to Paris. Country roads, hills, fences. The posh "chateau" appears again: meticulous garden, fancy interior, odd sculptures. And at home? "No one, NO ONE." For the next two days, masked figures play dice, frolic by the pool, perform exercises with a ball. Two new figures arrive. Masked. They search and find the dice. They dance. Mannequin hands hold a pair of dice.', 'Mannequin hands hold a pair of dice. A castle is perched on a hilltop. Below it, a posh, modern villa. Meanwhile, far from Paris, two men with masked faces play dice in a bar. They decide to drive to Paris. Country roads, hills, fences. The posh "chateau" appears again: meticulous garden, fancy interior, odd sculptures. And at home? "No one, NO ONE." For the next two days, masked figures play dice, frolic by the pool, perform exercises with a ball. Two new figures arrive. Masked. They search and find the dice. They dance. Mannequin hands hold a pair of dice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hr7K2DaNBiim7uXYRhpa5WmFw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138750'),
  ('146258766313311096', 'The Mysterious Box', 1903, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'As scene as pleasing as incomprehensible. A juggler summons two chairs, which come to the stage jumping and twirling around. Across the back of these chairs the operator places a sheet of glass on which he lays a box about four inches high. He then takes a table cover, with his servant''s help, rolls it up and from the centre emerges a lady, beautifully dressed. At the juggler''s order she jumps in the box, in which she completely disappears.', 'As scene as pleasing as incomprehensible. A juggler summons two chairs, which come to the stage jumping and twirling around. Across the back of these chairs the operator places a sheet of glass on which he lays a box about four inches high. He then takes a table cover, with his servant''s help, rolls it up and from the centre emerges a lady, beautifully dressed. At the juggler''s order she jumps in the box, in which she completely disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DJq8wiSNgPQeJjDjrEhNUVGE7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195939'),
  ('264380278123186975', 'The Mysterious Castle in the Carpathians', 1981, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Oldřich Lipský, Stanislava Hutková, Viktor Růžička', 'Jiří Brdečka', 'Michal Dočolomanský, Evelyna Steimarová, Vlastimil Brodský, Jan Hartl, Miloš Kopecký, Rudolf Hrušínský, Augustín Kubán, Jaroslava Kretschmerová', null, 'In 1897, in a castle near the town of Werewolfville in the Carpithians, a slightly deranged Professor Orfanik experiments with his new inventions which include, even at this early date, television and a film camera. He is also an obsessed opera fan, keeps the body of his favorite diva preserved in a crypt in the castle. In order to keep away nosy visitors, the baron''s mad-scientist assistant invents all sorts of spooky phenomena in order to give the castle a creepy reputation.', 'In 1897, in a castle near the town of Werewolfville in the Carpithians, a slightly deranged Professor Orfanik experiments with his new inventions which include, even at this early date, television and a film camera. He is also an obsessed opera fan, keeps the body of his favorite diva preserved in a crypt in the castle. In order to keep away nosy visitors, the baron''s mad-scientist assistant invents all sorts of spooky phenomena in order to give the castle a creepy reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nepGOBUOaKqz5Qxzwig4LusBHEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54755'),
  ('1136543442188645449', 'The Mysterious Doctor', 1943, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Henry Sharp, Benjamin Stoloff, Wilbur McGaugh', 'Richard Weil', 'John Loder, Eleanor Parker, Bruce Lester, Lester Matthews, Forrester Harvey, Matt Willis, Phyllis Barry, David Clyde', null, 'The citizens of a tiny Cornish village are tormented during World War II by a headless ghost which is haunting the local tin mine.', 'The citizens of a tiny Cornish village are tormented during World War II by a headless ghost which is haunting the local tin mine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNITwgzLDR1H0gbWkjsLIvL5DqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85226'),
  ('1002005427316230243', 'The Mysterious Dr. Fu Manchu', 1929, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Rowland V. Lee, Harry Fischbeck', 'Lloyd Corrigan, Florence Ryerson', 'Warner Oland, Neil Hamilton, Jean Arthur, O. P. Heggie, William Austin, Claude King, Charles A. Stevenson, Evelyn Selbie', 'NR', 'A Chinese doctor vows revenge against the allied troops who killed his wife and child during the Boxer Rebellion.', 'A Chinese doctor vows revenge against the allied troops who killed his wife and child during the Boxer Rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5oluQCYDuvdyXM8J1uSpNEY4Hh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146158'),
  ('622349468940310244', 'The Mysterious Gaze of the Flamingo', 2025, 'Drama', 'Diego Céspedes', 'Diego Céspedes', 'Tamara Cortés, Matías Catalán, Paula Dinamarca, Claudia Cabezas, Luis Dubó, Andrés Almeida, Felipe Ríos, Vicente Caballero', null, 'As an unknown and deadly disease begins to spread, legend has it that it is transmitted between two men, through a simple glance, when they fall in love. While people are accusing her family, Lidia must find out whether this myth is real or not.', 'As an unknown and deadly disease begins to spread, legend has it that it is transmitted between two men, through a simple glance, when they fall in love. While people are accusing her family, Lidia must find out whether this myth is real or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfPhni21LIEmuV8HiDfrLhcmTwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896096'),
  ('683592104656754116', 'The Mysterious Geographic Explorations of Jasper Morello', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Mystery', 'Anthony Lucas', 'Mark Shirrefs', 'Joel Edgerton, Helmut Bakaitis, Tommy Dysart, Jude Beaumont', null, 'Set in a world of iron dirigibles and steam powered computers, this gothic horror mystery tells the story of Jasper Morello, a disgraced aerial navigator who flees his plague-ridden home on a desperate voyage to redeem himself.', 'Set in a world of iron dirigibles and steam powered computers, this gothic horror mystery tells the story of Jasper Morello, a disgraced aerial navigator who flees his plague-ridden home on a desperate voyage to redeem himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5FygVbGqkePUauEuZYsVTxSpjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52762'),
  ('573169847676068793', 'The Mysterious Island', 1929, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Benjamin Christensen, Lucien Hubbard, Maurice Tourneur', 'Lucien Hubbard', 'Lionel Barrymore, Jacqueline Gadsden, Lloyd Hughes, Montagu Love, Montagu Love, Snitz Edwards, Gibson Gowland, Dolores Brinkman', 'NR', 'On a volcanic island near the Kingdom of Hetvia rules Count Dakkar, a benevolent leader and scientist who has eliminated class distinction among the island''s inhabitants. Dakkar, his sister Sonia and her fiance, engineer Nicolai Roget have designed a submarine which Roget pilots on its initial voyage just before the island is overrun by Baron Falon, despotic ruler of Hetvia. Falon sets out after Roget in a second submarine and the two craft, diving to the ocean''s floor, discover a strange land populated by dragons, giant squid and an eerie undiscovered humanoid race.', 'On a volcanic island near the Kingdom of Hetvia rules Count Dakkar, a benevolent leader and scientist who has eliminated class distinction among the island''s inhabitants. Dakkar, his sister Sonia and her fiance, engineer Nicolai Roget have designed a submarine which Roget pilots on its initial voyage just before the island is overrun by Baron Falon, despotic ruler of Hetvia. Falon sets out after Roget in a second submarine and the two craft, diving to the ocean''s floor, discover a strange land populated by dragons, giant squid and an eerie undiscovered humanoid race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38h2BjStXFadAYce5bCSFqmuvCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95348'),
  ('1040199321805397370', 'The Mysterious Island', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Henri Colpi', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Jacques Champeaux, Henri Colpi', 'Omar Sharif, Ambroise Mbia, Jess Hahn, Philippe Nicaud, Gérard Tichy, Gabriele Tinti, Rafael Bardem Jr., Mariano Vidal Molina', null, '1865, The American Civil War: Five POW manage to escape by balloon from Fort Richmond. Caught in a storm and with the balloon damaged they find themselves ''shipwrecked'' on a volcanic desert island somewhere in the Pacific. Just before crash landing their leader, the brilliant engineer Cyrus Smith falls to his apparent death in the raging waters, but later turns up completely unharmed and with no memory of how he was saved. His fellow castaways are: the famous journalist Gedeon Spilett, the salty sailor Bonaventure Pencroff, the orphaned boy Harbert Brown and the black servant of Smith, Nab. The dog Top also joined them in the escape.', '1865, The American Civil War: Five POW manage to escape by balloon from Fort Richmond. Caught in a storm and with the balloon damaged they find themselves ''shipwrecked'' on a volcanic desert island somewhere in the Pacific. Just before crash landing their leader, the brilliant engineer Cyrus Smith falls to his apparent death in the raging waters, but later turns up completely unharmed and with no memory of how he was saved. His fellow castaways are: the famous journalist Gedeon Spilett, the salty sailor Bonaventure Pencroff, the orphaned boy Harbert Brown and the black servant of Smith, Nab. The dog Top also joined them in the escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fg617Zafb7u2OJWqrDCwMDV2qfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38165'),
  ('726062065454737427', 'The Mysterious Knight', 1899, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A knight performs several magic tricks with a disembodied head materialized from a chalkboard drawing.', 'A knight performs several magic tricks with a disembodied head materialized from a chalkboard drawing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xjIcJL5KqOmNXb7vq2TI1rSPkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106023'),
  ('47008190611428034', 'The Mysterious Lady', 1928, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Fred Niblo, Harold S. Bucquet, William H. Daniels', 'Marian Ainslee, Ruth Cummings', 'Greta Garbo, Conrad Nagel, Gustav von Seyffertitz, Albert Pollet, Edward Connelly, Richard Alexander, Symona Boniface, Geraldine Dvorak', null, 'A beautiful Russian spy seduces an Austrian military officer in order to obtain secret plans. When she falls in love with him, both are placed in danger.', 'A beautiful Russian spy seduces an Austrian military officer in order to obtain secret plans. When she falls in love with him, both are placed in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOmtOcwSLNFwV2kqDsfnSpVphSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108923'),
  ('998192632291861422', 'The Mysterious Magician', 1964, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Karl Löb, Alfred Vohrer, Eva Ebner', 'Harald G. Petersson', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Heinz Drache, Sophie Hardy, Siegfried Lowitz, Margot Trooger, Siegfried Schürenberg, Eddi Arent, Carl Lange', null, 'The sister of a famous, but as yet uncaught, criminal named "The Hexer" is murdered. Inspector Higgins of Scotland Yard believes that "The Hexer" will surface to take his revenge on his sister''s killers, and plans to set a trap to finally capture him. However, soon bodies start piling up, and it looks as if "The Hexer" may get away yet again.', 'The sister of a famous, but as yet uncaught, criminal named "The Hexer" is murdered. Inspector Higgins of Scotland Yard believes that "The Hexer" will surface to take his revenge on his sister''s killers, and plans to set a trap to finally capture him. However, soon bodies start piling up, and it looks as if "The Hexer" may get away yet again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkrGRYJgifUSzP0WlDUBH9AiZGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9630'),
  ('1051790931701072243', 'The Mysterious Mr. Valentine', 1946, 'Crime', 'Philip Ford, Alfred S. Keller', 'Milton Raison', 'William Henry, Linda Stirling, Virginia Christine, Thomas E. Jackson, Barbara Woodell, Kenne Duncan, Virginia Brissac, Lyle Latell', 'NR', 'Janet Spencer is driving down a country road when one of her tires blows out. This seemingly innocuous, everyday occurrence leads Linda into a labyrinth of murder, blackmail and intrigue.', 'Janet Spencer is driving down a country road when one of her tires blows out. This seemingly innocuous, everyday occurrence leads Linda into a labyrinth of murder, blackmail and intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxZCHgsD3Bs0TPgeCVOR1gaBlCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38452'),
  ('810507867443688436', 'The Mysterious Mr. Wong', 1935, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'William Nigh, Harry Neumann, Abe Meyer', 'Nina Howatt', 'Bela Lugosi, Wallace Ford, Arline Judge, E. Alyn Warren, Lotus Long, Robert Emmett O''Connor, Edward Peil Sr., Luke Chan', 'NR', 'Mr. Wong is a "harmless" Chinatown shopkeeper by day and relentless blood-thirsty pursuer of the Twelve Coins of Confucius by night. With possession of the coins, Mr. Wong will be supreme ruler of the Chinese province of Keelat, and his evil destiny will be fulfilled. A killing spree follows in dark and dangerous Chinatown as Wong gets control of 11 of the 12 coins. Reporter Jason Barton and his girl Peg are hot on his trail, but soon find themselves in serious trouble when they stumble onto Wong''s headquarters.', 'Mr. Wong is a "harmless" Chinatown shopkeeper by day and relentless blood-thirsty pursuer of the Twelve Coins of Confucius by night. With possession of the coins, Mr. Wong will be supreme ruler of the Chinese province of Keelat, and his evil destiny will be fulfilled. A killing spree follows in dark and dangerous Chinatown as Wong gets control of 11 of the 12 coins. Reporter Jason Barton and his girl Peg are hot on his trail, but soon find themselves in serious trouble when they stumble onto Wong''s headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifhzSHIs1W2mUPZM6jRw4hvIv2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38494'),
  ('257730609745051177', 'The Mysterious Portrait', 1899, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician produces a living portrait of himself.', 'A magician produces a living portrait of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVoFCxqZognBAi5QSsbukvsO1Yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104922'),
  ('803245123959493374', 'The Mysterious Retort', 1906, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A wizard sleeps at a table in his well-appointed sitting room. From a drawer in the table, a snake appears.', 'A wizard sleeps at a table in his well-appointed sitting room. From a drawer in the table, a snake appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzTHQWlxrCV8ZmJLRrGDL7RFX8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49272'),
  ('468980206809836362', 'The Mysterious Rider', 1948, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Riccardo Freda, Valentino Trevisaneto, Rodolfo Lombardi', 'Riccardo Freda, Steno, Mario Monicelli', 'Vittorio Gassman, María Mercader, Yvonne Sanson, Gianna Maria Canale, Alessandra Mamis, Hans Hinrich, Dante Maggio, Guido Notari', null, 'Giacomo Casanova returns to Venice, to help his brother, falsely accused of robbery.', 'Giacomo Casanova returns to Venice, to help his brother, falsely accused of robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQBbc0hHksYRPguQrvAZSaSez5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225181'),
  ('624650099614167674', 'The Mysterious Wall', 1967, 'Science Fiction', 'Mikhail Sadkovich, Irina Povolotskaya, Boris Brozhovsky', 'Irina Povolotskaya, Aleksandr Chervinsky, Mikhail Sadkovich', 'Lev Kruglyy, Tatyana Lavrova, Irakli Uchaneishvili, Andrey Mironov, Valentin Nikulin, Nikolai Barmin, Georgi Tusuzov, Yevgeni Shutov', null, 'The action takes place in Siberia where a mysterious wall appears from time to time. Scientists are dispatched to study it and some of them believe that the wall is produced by some sort of alien intelligence, "the Martians", as they call them. The scientists attempt to communicate with the Wall, but all they experience in return are hallucinations about their past experiences. In those visions they are faced with some unresolved issues, repressed memories, and absurd dream-like situations. They meet people – messengers – from their past who reveal to them some simple truths about their own lives, which may be hard to accept, so they dismiss those messengers as the Martians and stubbornly continue attempting to "understand" the Mysterious Wall using their rational minds.', 'The action takes place in Siberia where a mysterious wall appears from time to time. Scientists are dispatched to study it and some of them believe that the wall is produced by some sort of alien intelligence, "the Martians", as they call them. The scientists attempt to communicate with the Wall, but all they experience in return are hallucinations about their past experiences. In those visions they are faced with some unresolved issues, repressed memories, and absurd dream-like situations. They meet people – messengers – from their past who reveal to them some simple truths about their own lives, which may be hard to accept, so they dismiss those messengers as the Martians and stubbornly continue attempting to "understand" the Mysterious Wall using their rational minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC3VhIgUj8OygMgUVuv0DV3Ssii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344800'),
  ('184806912235710095', 'The Mystery of Chess Boxing', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Joseph Kuo, Chang Hui-kung, Wang Chi-Sheng', 'Ping Han Chiang, Joseph Kuo', 'Li Yi-Min, Jack Long Shi-Chia, Mark Lung, Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Wang Chi-Sheng, Ricky Cheng Tien-Chi, Jeanie Chang, Hsiao Hou Tao', null, 'Evil Chun Shan uses chess boxing and a five-element ninja style to terrorize the martial arts world until he is challenged in a series of battles, then destroyed.', 'Evil Chun Shan uses chess boxing and a five-element ninja style to terrorize the martial arts world until he is challenged in a series of battles, then destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wF8FQKNI1LZ5UQBXhgAvAqEDfUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54503'),
  ('662977823220755541', 'The Mystery of D.B. Cooper', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime, History', 'John Dower', 'John Dower', 'David Mills, Peter Caulfield, Miles Richardson, Hannah Pauley, Anne Wittman, Marla Cooper, Jo Weber, Tamsyn Kelly', null, 'This documentary brings to life the stories of four people believed by their family and friends to be “DB Cooper,” a man who hijacked a 727 flying out of Seattle and jumped from the plane over the wilds of Washington State with a parachute and $200,000, never to be heard from again.', 'This documentary brings to life the stories of four people believed by their family and friends to be “DB Cooper,” a man who hijacked a 727 flying out of Seattle and jumped from the plane over the wilds of Washington State with a parachute and $200,000, never to be heard from again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDdt8w5RUYZSV6eDShpaFLucZ9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743073'),
  ('782671762923467915', 'The Mystery of Edwin Drood', 1935, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stuart Walker, George Robinson, Phil Karlson', 'Gladys Unger, John L. Balderston', 'Claude Rains, Douglass Montgomery, Heather Angel, Valerie Hobson, David Manners, Francis L. Sullivan, Zeffie Tilbury, Ethel Griffies', 'NR', 'A choirmaster addicted to opium and obsessed with a beautiful young woman will stop at nothing to possess her.', 'A choirmaster addicted to opium and obsessed with a beautiful young woman will stop at nothing to possess her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFFCTnkTyJnVOwndw5KniOhSxnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84718'),
  ('160241908034394942', 'The Mystery of Happiness', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Burman, Daniel Ortega', 'Daniel Burman, Sergio Dubcovsky', 'Guillermo Francella, Inés Estévez, Alejandro Awada, Sergio Boris, María Fiorentino, Fabián Arenillas, Silvina Escudero, Claudia Ohana', null, 'Life-long business partners Santiago and Eugenio care for each other, and need each other. When Eugenio suddenly vanishes, Santiago and Eugenio’s wife, join forces to look for him. What they discover is not what they set out to find, and their shared journey becomes a surprising and lighthearted meditation on friendship, love, and loyalty.', 'Life-long business partners Santiago and Eugenio care for each other, and need each other. When Eugenio suddenly vanishes, Santiago and Eugenio’s wife, join forces to look for him. What they discover is not what they set out to find, and their shared journey becomes a surprising and lighthearted meditation on friendship, love, and loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6H5zTVZdrfM0iCIGgD7kzjqPYTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265563'),
  ('973517895602386014', 'The Mystery of Henri Pick', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Antoine Monod, Rémi Bezançon', 'Rémi Bezançon, Vanessa Portal', 'Fabrice Luchini, Camille Cottin, Alice Isaaz, Bastien Bouillon, Philypa Phoenix, Louis Descols, Josiane Stoléru, Astrid Whettnall', 'PG', 'In a bizarre Breton library that collects rejected, never published manuscripts, a young editor discovers a novel that she considers a masterpiece. It was written by a certain Henri Pick, a cook who died two years earlier and who, according to his widow, had never read a book in his life or written anything but a shopping list... Did he have a secret life? When the book becomes a huge best-seller, Jean- Michel Rouche, a skeptical and stubborn literary critic, teams up with Joséphine, Pick’s daughter, to unravel the mystery.', 'In a bizarre Breton library that collects rejected, never published manuscripts, a young editor discovers a novel that she considers a masterpiece. It was written by a certain Henri Pick, a cook who died two years earlier and who, according to his widow, had never read a book in his life or written anything but a shopping list... Did he have a secret life? When the book becomes a huge best-seller, Jean- Michel Rouche, a skeptical and stubborn literary critic, teams up with Joséphine, Pick’s daughter, to unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkliBAyyb4XVm3Wr234yMRV0qCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566454'),
  ('1130670321044087158', 'The Mystery of Her', 2022, 'Drama', 'Nicholas DiBella', 'Paul Root, Nicholas DiBella', 'Andrea Figliomeni, Winter Andrews, Nicolette Hart, Emma Jessop, Tyler Aser', 'NR', 'After a near fatal car accident, a popular high school student loses her memory and gets a second chance at a more meaningful life.', 'After a near fatal car accident, a popular high school student loses her memory and gets a second chance at a more meaningful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C7reRuXqAgjGdfjqY7Mq6hmHlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944024'),
  ('376691483739392190', 'The Mystery of Marilyn Monroe: The Unheard Tapes', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Emma Cooper, Geoffrey Sentamu', null, 'Anthony Summers, Linzi Hateley, CJ Johnson, Sorel Johnson, Andre Lillis, Sion Lloyd, Shelagh McLeod, Jason Mulhearn', 'R', 'This documentary explores the mystery surrounding the death of movie icon Marilyn Monroe through previously unheard interviews with her inner circle.', 'This documentary explores the mystery surrounding the death of movie icon Marilyn Monroe through previously unheard interviews with her inner circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ab3MEngH2sWK8uydGBFfgZDB4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953300'),
  ('36510123545771736', 'The Mystery of Mr. Wong', 1939, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'William Nigh, Harry Neumann, W.B. Eason', 'Hugh Wiley', 'Boris Karloff, Grant Withers, Dorothy Tree, Craig Reynolds, Ivan Lebedeff, Holmes Herbert, Morgan Wallace, Lotus Long', 'NR', 'Detective James Lee Wong must find the "Eye of the Daughter of the Moon," a priceless but cursed sapphire stolen in China and smuggled to America. His search takes him into the heart of Chinatown and to the dreaded "House of Hate" to find the deadly gem before it can kill again.', 'Detective James Lee Wong must find the "Eye of the Daughter of the Moon," a priceless but cursed sapphire stolen in China and smuggled to America. His search takes him into the heart of Chinatown and to the dreaded "House of Hate" to find the deadly gem before it can kill again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyzLIwsunuF648lukjnk5FrFkP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59703'),
  ('154765512281672319', 'The Mystery of Oberwald', 1981, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Luciano Tovoli', 'Tonino Guerra, Michelangelo Antonioni', 'Monica Vitti, Paolo Bonacelli, Franco Branciaroli, Elisabetta Pozzi, Carla Buzzanca', null, 'A man, mirroring the assassinated King, infiltrates a castle to kill the Queen but hesitates, leading to a deadly dare and revelation of shared history.', 'A man, mirroring the assassinated King, infiltrates a castle to kill the Queen but hesitates, leading to a deadly dare and revelation of shared history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4V7x9w2Xs2GOO0qiZOgaxvIC8vR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130719'),
  ('1126740969005007011', 'The Mystery of Padre Pio', 2018, 'Documentary, Thriller', 'José María Zavala', null, 'John XXIII., Pope Paul VI, Pope John Paul II, Pope Pius XII', null, 'The documentary offers testimonies and documents never disclosed about the plot against its protagonist, who had the stigmata of Jesus Christ in his hands, feet and side for 50 consecutive years.', 'The documentary offers testimonies and documents never disclosed about the plot against its protagonist, who had the stigmata of Jesus Christ in his hands, feet and side for 50 consecutive years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAKEA0StyfKVMB0eO35rW8SjvPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563857'),
  ('857629104876202455', 'The Mystery of Picasso', 1956, 'Documentary', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Claude Renoir', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot', 'Pablo Picasso, Henri-Georges Clouzot, Claude Renoir', null, 'Using a specially designed transparent ''canvas'' to provide an unobstructed view, Picasso creates as the camera rolls. He begins with simple works that take shape after only a single brush stroke. He then progresses to more complex paintings, in which he repeatedly adds and removes elements, transforming the entire scene at will, until at last the work is complete.', 'Using a specially designed transparent ''canvas'' to provide an unobstructed view, Picasso creates as the camera rolls. He begins with simple works that take shape after only a single brush stroke. He then progresses to more complex paintings, in which he repeatedly adds and removes elements, transforming the entire scene at will, until at last the work is complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kY1Qo3rtkTiElT4iQMiHL9oEDNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71822'),
  ('809620159874309153', 'The Mystery of Robin Hood', 1990, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Walter Carvalho', 'Paulo Andrade, Mauro Wilson', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Xuxa Meneghel, Carlos Eduardo Dolabella, Duda Little, Roberto Guilherme, Átila Iório', null, 'A kind wanderer living around a circus, who also happens to work as a modern Robin Hood, must solve the mystery behind the kidnapping of a lost little girl he meets.', 'A kind wanderer living around a circus, who also happens to work as a modern Robin Hood, must solve the mystery behind the kidnapping of a lost little girl he meets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DRQ7Lm3kjrUuaVHKZY4IGVAaUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146541'),
  ('996133642894856171', 'The Mystery of Sintra', 2007, 'Mystery', 'Jorge Paixão da Costa, Luís Branquinho', 'Ramalho Ortigão, Eça de Queirós', 'Ivo Canelas, António Pedro Cerdeira, Bruna Di Tullio, Rogério Samora, José Pedro Vasconcelos, Giselle Itié, Flávio Galvão, James Weber Brown', null, 'Summer of 1870. Two writers, Eça de Queiroz and Ramalho Ortigão, decide to write a four-handed whodunit for the daily "Diário de Notícias". Could it be that the story they wrote as fiction is based on a real case? This question fuels the conflict between the two writers and drives them to a nearly fatal duel. Lisbon is in commotion. One crime follows another in a story in which love is stronger than tradition. Everything happens at frenzied pace, as in a game.', 'Summer of 1870. Two writers, Eça de Queiroz and Ramalho Ortigão, decide to write a four-handed whodunit for the daily "Diário de Notícias". Could it be that the story they wrote as fiction is based on a real case? This question fuels the conflict between the two writers and drives them to a nearly fatal duel. Lisbon is in commotion. One crime follows another in a story in which love is stronger than tradition. Everything happens at frenzied pace, as in a game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zbXphRRh3VBtoskMzRwYRQtbEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173928'),
  ('1084798504226848012', 'The Mystery of the Eternal Night', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Dmitriy Vasilev, Nikolai Bolshakov, Lev Saakov', 'Igor Lukovskiy', 'Ivan Pereverzev, Konstantin Bartashevich, Mikhail Astangov, Apollon Yachnitskiy, Danuta Stolyarskaya, Yelena Izmailova, Ivan Zhevago, Nikolay Yakhontov', null, 'At the bottom of the Pacific Ocean, an explosion occurred, as a result the underwater vegetation started to grow rapidly in size and a part of the coast was flooded by a tsunami.', 'At the bottom of the Pacific Ocean, an explosion occurred, as a result the underwater vegetation started to grow rapidly in size and a part of the coast was flooded by a tsunami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raULSRxgEfxmffP3MPCpChn48oJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264647'),
  ('436926552361468269', 'The Mystery of the Mary Celeste', 1935, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Denison Clift, Eric Ansell, Geoffrey Faithfull', 'Charles Larkworthy', 'Bela Lugosi, Shirley Grey, Arthur Margetson, Edmund Willard, Dennis Hoey, George Mozart, Johnnie Schofield, Gunner Moir', null, 'During a horrific storm at sea, the crew realizes that there is a murderer among them who is killing them off one by one.', 'During a horrific storm at sea, the crew realizes that there is a murderer among them who is killing them off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKRfm0gKco0qbP700NiLipylzQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26921'),
