  ('971569771762212757', 'The Mystery of the Yellow Room', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Bruno Podalydès, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Denis Podalydès, Jean-Noël Brouté, Claude Rich, Scali Delpeyrat, Sabine Azéma, Michael Lonsdale, Julos Beaucarne, Olivier Gourmet', null, 'Joseph Rouletabille, a reporter for a local newspaper, investigates the attempted killing of Mathilde Stangerson, who uses the yellow room of the title as her bedroom. At the time of the revolver shots her room was locked and the windows were barred, but when her father enters after having forced the door, there is no-one there except for Mathilde. So who did it and how did he get away?', 'Joseph Rouletabille, a reporter for a local newspaper, investigates the attempted killing of Mathilde Stangerson, who uses the yellow room of the title as her bedroom. At the time of the revolver shots her room was locked and the windows were barred, but when her father enters after having forced the door, there is no-one there except for Mathilde. So who did it and how did he get away?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDIb3HZ2FgGlbpA7BruuQ76t424.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37351'),
  ('485523320745360716', 'The Mystic', 1925, 'Drama', 'Tod Browning, Ira H. Morgan', 'Tod Browning', 'Aileen Pringle, Conway Tearle, Mitchell Lewis, Robert Ober, Stanton Heck, David Torrence, Gladys Hulette, DeWitt Jennings', 'NR', 'Zara, a phony psychic in a Hungarian carnival who, under the guidance of a Svengali-like con man crashes — and proceeds to swindle — American high society.', 'Zara, a phony psychic in a Hungarian carnival who, under the guidance of a Svengali-like con man crashes — and proceeds to swindle — American high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orUpo81WKjOcdnFKfUoCpgI67IF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184448'),
  ('675156704346548522', 'The Mystic Nine: Begonia from Qingshan', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Adventure', 'Wang Kai', null, 'Dong Haoran, Zhu Zanjin, Ken Lok Tat-Wah, Zhu Yongteng, Guo Jianan, Liu Chang, Hei Ge, Xu Zhanwei', null, 'At the beginning of the 20th century, Zhang Qi Shan and his father were subject to experimentation by the traitor Zuo Qian Zhi. Ten years later, Zhang Qi Shan seeks his revenge. He arrives in Changsha for the first time and meets Er Yue Hong. The two join forces to go against Zuo Qian Zhi and the monster that threatens the city.', 'At the beginning of the 20th century, Zhang Qi Shan and his father were subject to experimentation by the traitor Zuo Qian Zhi. Ten years later, Zhang Qi Shan seeks his revenge. He arrives in Changsha for the first time and meets Er Yue Hong. The two join forces to go against Zuo Qian Zhi and the monster that threatens the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVWYG9W7jNaElA4U7naT6o9JhdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937013'),
  ('382088312209841281', 'The Mystical Flame', 1903, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A juggler enters upon the scene, picks up a skull, throws it into the air, catches it in his hands, where it is transformed into a handkerchief. The handkerchief, after being twirled about a wand, is changed to a napkin, and afterward to a tablecloth. Out of the table cloth comes a servant.', 'A juggler enters upon the scene, picks up a skull, throws it into the air, catches it in his hands, where it is transformed into a handkerchief. The handkerchief, after being twirled about a wand, is changed to a napkin, and afterward to a tablecloth. Out of the table cloth comes a servant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cG2BVMRP3LzwAMXPH7h1STCb2q9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190704'),
  ('739722255417264629', 'The Myth', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, Kwok Man-Ki', 'Li Haishu, Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Wang Huiling', 'Jackie Chan, Kim Hee-seon, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Mallika Sherawat, Sun Zhou, Shao Bing, Yu Rongguang, Ken Wong', null, 'When a fellow scientist asks for Jack''s help in locating the mausoleum of China''s first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.', 'When a fellow scientist asks for Jack''s help in locating the mausoleum of China''s first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11653'),
  ('255085684426401252', 'The Myth of Fingerprints', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bart Freundlich, Stephen Kazmierski', 'Bart Freundlich', 'Randee Allen, Arija Bareikis, Justin Barreto, Chris Bauer, Nicholas Bourgeois, Tom Cumler, Blythe Danner, Hope Davis', 'R', 'When a New England dysfunctional family gathers for Thanksgiving, past demons reveal themselves as one son returns for the first time in three years.', 'When a New England dysfunctional family gathers for Thanksgiving, past demons reveal themselves as one son returns for the first time in three years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aHnhKkmQlSBbOKhYNImUI254KF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98502'),
  ('275552608721648709', 'The Myth of the American Sleepover', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'David Robert Mitchell, James Laxton, Geoff George', 'David Robert Mitchell', 'Claire Sloma, Marlon Morton, Amanda Bauer, Brett Jacobsen, Nikita Ramsey, Jade Ramsey, Amy Seimetz, Megan Boone', 'NR', 'Four young people navigate the suburban wonderland of metro-Detroit looking for love and adventure on the last weekend of summer.', 'Four young people navigate the suburban wonderland of metro-Detroit looking for love and adventure on the last weekend of summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zIu3afpJjz5Js6S7GkDxpCJCYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70588'),
  ('29493074585905931', 'The Nada Gang', 1974, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Claude Chabrol, Antonietta Malzieri, Jean-Patrick Manchette', 'Fabio Testi, Michel Duchaussoy, Maurice Garrel, Michel Aumont, Lou Castel, Didier Kaminka, André Falcon, François Perrot', null, 'Nada, named after a gang of Spanish anarchists, is a small, confused band of French terrorists. They kidnap the American ambassador after one of his regular visits to an exclusive brothel. The gang starts to quarrel amongst themselves as to the diplomat''s fate, while the police purge suspects in their attempts to destroy the Nada faction. As the violence escalates on both sides, the States and the terrorists are forced to use one another''s methods in an increasingly desperate and relentless conflict.', 'Nada, named after a gang of Spanish anarchists, is a small, confused band of French terrorists. They kidnap the American ambassador after one of his regular visits to an exclusive brothel. The gang starts to quarrel amongst themselves as to the diplomat''s fate, while the police purge suspects in their attempts to destroy the Nada faction. As the violence escalates on both sides, the States and the terrorists are forced to use one another''s methods in an increasingly desperate and relentless conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxxNqUgtpQPCFS8Bkg50olhsBFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4790'),
  ('1121363945119375734', 'The Nail Gun Massacre', 1985, 'Horror', 'Bill Leslie, Terry Lofton, Bill Leslie', 'Terry Lofton', 'Rocky Patterson, Ron Queen, Beau Leland, Michelle Meyer, Sebrina Lawless, Monica Lawless, Jerry L. Nelson, Mike Coady', 'NR', 'Following the brutal rape of a young woman by a gang of construction workers, a mysterious figure wearing a motorcycle helmet and driving a gold hearse begins hunting the perpetrators down. The masked avenger''s weapon of choice, obviously, is a nail gun, with which he (or could it be she?) takes out the rapists one by one. Just who is this murderous vigilante?', 'Following the brutal rape of a young woman by a gang of construction workers, a mysterious figure wearing a motorcycle helmet and driving a gold hearse begins hunting the perpetrators down. The masked avenger''s weapon of choice, obviously, is a nail gun, with which he (or could it be she?) takes out the rapists one by one. Just who is this murderous vigilante?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gVmwTn1Pii6T5a1ql304HOwFFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76929'),
  ('764442660363025145', 'The Nail in the Boot', 1931, 'Drama, War', 'Mikhail Kalatozov, Shalva Apaqidze', 'Leonid Perelman', 'Aleqsandre Jaliashvili, Siko Palavandishvili, Akaki Khorava, Arkadi Khintibidze, Mikhail Kalatozov', null, 'Banned in the Soviet Union for its "negative" content and never released, Kalatozov was forced to retreat from filmmaking for seven years because of this film. The film sets out to illustrate the old adage, "For want of a nail, the battle was lost," showing how the inferior quality of something so trivial as a nail in a soldier''s boot leads inexorably to the capture of an armored train. Kalatozov had intended to demonstrate the crucial and universal importance of efficiency in Soviet industry, but the government decided that his fable gave a negative impression of the Red Army''s capabilities.', 'Banned in the Soviet Union for its "negative" content and never released, Kalatozov was forced to retreat from filmmaking for seven years because of this film. The film sets out to illustrate the old adage, "For want of a nail, the battle was lost," showing how the inferior quality of something so trivial as a nail in a soldier''s boot leads inexorably to the capture of an armored train. Kalatozov had intended to demonstrate the crucial and universal importance of efficiency in Soviet industry, but the government decided that his fable gave a negative impression of the Red Army''s capabilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTzlpNtQgBwrBBnARxwIB0moDnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141919'),
  ('942154189246146287', 'The Naked and the Dead', 1958, 'Drama, War', 'Raoul Walsh, Joseph LaShelle', 'Denis Sanders, Terry Sanders', 'Aldo Ray, Cliff Robertson, Raymond Massey, Lili St. Cyr, Barbara Nichols, William Campbell, Richard Jaeckel, James Best', 'NR', 'Fighting men in World War II learn the value of courage and quickness at the risk of losing their lives.', 'Fighting men in World War II learn the value of courage and quickness at the risk of losing their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTfnDST2gy6r0fp3noizqhv1F5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43142'),
  ('943621632311560221', 'The Naked Ape', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Donald Driver, Stu Fleming, Irby Smith', 'Donald Driver', 'Johnny Crawford, Victoria Principal, Dennis Olivieri, Diana Darrin, Norman Grabowski, John Hillerman, Helen Horowitz, Robert Ito', 'PG', 'Somewhat based on Desmond Morris''s fascinating book of pop anthropology, this partially animated satirical docudrama produced by Playboy Magazine publisher Hugh Hefner, traces the evolution of human kind and offers insight into the reasons why we behave the way we do. Though often dealing with sexuality, nothing in the film is terribly offensive or graphic. A prime example of mainstream experimental film-making from the early 70''s featuring a young and breathtakingly lovely Victoria Principal.', 'Somewhat based on Desmond Morris''s fascinating book of pop anthropology, this partially animated satirical docudrama produced by Playboy Magazine publisher Hugh Hefner, traces the evolution of human kind and offers insight into the reasons why we behave the way we do. Though often dealing with sexuality, nothing in the film is terribly offensive or graphic. A prime example of mainstream experimental film-making from the early 70''s featuring a young and breathtakingly lovely Victoria Principal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BjqviHpNXB3SeJ448jyPCUqMHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208333'),
  ('534860309967953071', 'The Naked Brothers Band: The Movie', 2005, 'Comedy, Family', 'Polly Draper, Ken H. Keller', 'Polly Draper', 'Nat Wolff, Alex Wolff, Cooper Pillot, Thomas Batuello, David Levi, Joshua Kaye, Maia Pillot, Dominique Patterson', null, 'After making it to the top of the charts, members of the Silver Boulders, a popular tween rock band, find themselves undermined by internal squabbling as the bandmates seek different creative directions.', 'After making it to the top of the charts, members of the Silver Boulders, a popular tween rock band, find themselves undermined by internal squabbling as the bandmates seek different creative directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWfmmO86k7oEn7Y1zWuP1kX6RnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160166'),
  ('425301755165873612', 'The Naked Cage', 1986, 'Action, Drama', 'Paul Nicholas, Hal Trussell, Karen Gaviola', 'Paul Nicholas', 'Shari Shattuck, Angel Tompkins, Lucinda Crosby, Stacey Shaffer, Christina Whitaker, Nick Benedict, John Terlesky, Faith Minton', 'R', 'A young woman is falsely convicted of a bank robbery and sent to a maximum-security prison run by a corrupt warden, where she is forced to suffer various indignities.', 'A young woman is falsely convicted of a bank robbery and sent to a maximum-security prison run by a corrupt warden, where she is forced to suffer various indignities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iCjhrn0wltvOnuIq9be0VxGW9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42030'),
