  ('410472103444139167', 'The Naked Kiss', 1964, 'Crime, Drama', 'Samuel Fuller, Stanley Cortez, Nate Levinson', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Constance Towers, Michael Dante, Anthony Eisley, Virginia Grey, Patsy Kelly, Marie Devereux, Karen Conrad, Linda Francis', null, 'A former prostitute works to create a new life for herself in a small town, but a shocking discovery could threaten everything.', 'A former prostitute works to create a new life for herself in a small town, but a shocking discovery could threaten everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOChacazF29zAhs2hDxyJ05XUaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26031'),
  ('537367277021715717', 'The Naked Kitchen', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hong Ji-young', 'Hong Ji-young, Lee Kyung-ui', 'Shin Min-a, Kim Tae-woo, Ju Ji-hoon, Jeon Hye-jin, Pang Eun-jin, Kim Ho-won, Baek Jin-hee', null, 'Mo-rae struggles to remain loyal to her husband while living with a handsome and exciting stranger. Her husband is her childhood best friend, but the seductive stranger is imaginative and adventurous. Whom will she choose?', 'Mo-rae struggles to remain loyal to her husband while living with a handsome and exciting stranger. Her husband is her childhood best friend, but the seductive stranger is imaginative and adventurous. Whom will she choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfQowESVg5HlpG5zKbc5lLcaApB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54201'),
  ('760541334495946075', 'The Naked Man', 1976, 'Western, Drama', 'Rogelio A. González', 'Salvador Macias Pérez, Rogelio A. González, Miriam Salinas Price', 'Barry Coe, José Alonso, Irma Lozano, Céline La Frenière, Barney O''Sullivan, Helen Shaver, Terence Kelly, Hagan Beggs', null, 'A child grows up to seek revenge on the man that raped and murdered his parents.', 'A child grows up to seek revenge on the man that raped and murdered his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApQc5yVocPAMerHU9yezbGstnTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329026'),
  ('23684528862430545', 'The Naked Man', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Carvana, Nonato Estrela', 'Fernando Sabino', 'Cláudio Marzo, Isabel Fillardis, Lúcia Veríssimo, Daniel Dantas, Maria Zilda Bethlem, Anselmo Vasconcelos, Milton Gonçalves, David Pinheiro', null, 'Writer Sílvio Proença needs to travel to São Paulo in order to promote his new book. At the airport, he meets a group of old mates. With the boarding canceled due to a strong storm, the group goes to the apartment of Marialva, daughter of one of Proença''s friends. Seduced by Marialva''s music and charms, Proença spends the night there, where he wakes up the next day, completely naked. Still groggy from his hangover, he goes to pick up the bread left outside the apartment; that''s when the wind closes the door and leaves him naked outside.', 'Writer Sílvio Proença needs to travel to São Paulo in order to promote his new book. At the airport, he meets a group of old mates. With the boarding canceled due to a strong storm, the group goes to the apartment of Marialva, daughter of one of Proença''s friends. Seduced by Marialva''s music and charms, Proença spends the night there, where he wakes up the next day, completely naked. Still groggy from his hangover, he goes to pick up the bread left outside the apartment; that''s when the wind closes the door and leaves him naked outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSoh2dKXpM8VR9Z5HhdnmCjodeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52347'),
  ('322587859412419958', 'The Naked Man', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'J. Todd Anderson, James D. Deck, Athena Alexander', 'Ethan Coen, J. Todd Anderson', 'Michael Rapaport, Arija Bareikis, Rachael Leigh Cook, Martin Ferrero, Joe Grifasi, John Carroll Lynch, John Slattery, Michael Jeter', null, 'A man takes matters into his own hands when a pharmaceutical kingpin moves into his town to cause some real trouble.', 'A man takes matters into his own hands when a pharmaceutical kingpin moves into his town to cause some real trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1hMexipfLuNvRNJAFSffCsNUmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8336'),
  ('630065940907593048', 'The Naked Prey', 1965, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Cornel Wilde, H. A. R. Thomson, Bert Batt', 'Don Peters, Clint Johnston', 'Cornel Wilde, Gert Van den Bergh, Ken Gampu, Patrick Mynhardt, Bella Randles, Morrison Gampu, Sandy Nkomo, Eric Mcanyana', null, 'A group of men are on safari. One of the party refuses to give a gift to a tribe they encounter. The tribe is offended, seizes the party, and one-by-one, kills all but one of the safari members in various creative and horrifying ways. The last surviving member is given "The Lion''s Chance" by the tribal leader to be hunted down by a party of tribal warriors.', 'A group of men are on safari. One of the party refuses to give a gift to a tribe they encounter. The tribe is offended, seizes the party, and one-by-one, kills all but one of the safari members in various creative and horrifying ways. The last surviving member is given "The Lion''s Chance" by the tribal leader to be hunted down by a party of tribal warriors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBm8f2eVBKUKVqrdyJTNwdfAUqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18513'),
  ('420546058918834504', 'The Naked Screen', 2014, 'Drama', 'Florence Jaugey', 'Florence Jaugey', 'Paola Baldion, Óscar Sinela, Roberto Guillén, Salvador Espinoza, Carlos Ibarra, María Esther López, Ariana McGuire, Lucero Millán', null, 'All over the world, love stories are written on the screens of mobile phones, but what happens when your privacy becomes public?', 'All over the world, love stories are written on the screens of mobile phones, but what happens when your privacy becomes public?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR4WzWcNv2XR6vOnYI2bMER14vL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321542'),
  ('979100947700566768', 'The Naked Spur', 1953, 'Western', 'Anthony Mann, Carl Roup, William C. Mellor', 'Sam Rolfe, Harold Jack Bloom', 'James Stewart, Janet Leigh, Robert Ryan, Ralph Meeker, Millard Mitchell', null, 'A bounty hunter trying to bring a murderer to justice is forced to accept the help of two less-than-trustworthy strangers.', 'A bounty hunter trying to bring a murderer to justice is forced to accept the help of two less-than-trustworthy strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS5EAgCnFFvHbyRydlqTbDbaXZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20442'),
  ('493320855377875122', 'The Naked Street', 1955, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Floyd Crosby, Maxwell Shane', 'Leo Katcher, Maxwell Shane', 'Farley Granger, Anthony Quinn, Anne Bancroft, Peter Graves, Else Neft, Sara Berner, Jerry Paris, Mario Siletti', 'NR', 'To make an honest woman of his pregnant sister, Rosalie, callous New York mobster Phil Regal intimidates witnesses and bribes a store clerk to get Rosalie’s condemned boyfriend, Nicky Bradna, out of prison. But Regal’s meddling deeds soon backfire.', 'To make an honest woman of his pregnant sister, Rosalie, callous New York mobster Phil Regal intimidates witnesses and bribes a store clerk to get Rosalie’s condemned boyfriend, Nicky Bradna, out of prison. But Regal’s meddling deeds soon backfire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bL0AZU3NmxPN8XYjH95CD4ywnXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122252'),
  ('1014801354216322863', 'The Naked Truth', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Mario Zampi', 'Michael Pertwee', 'Terry-Thomas, Peter Sellers, Peggy Mount, Shirley Eaton, Dennis Price, Georgina Cookson, Joan Sims, Miles Malleson', 'NR', 'Nigel Dennis publishes a scandal magazine. But for each story he writes, he first approaches the person whose scandalous behavior is described (or rather implied, to avoid any libel suit) and says he will suppress the story in return for money. Several of his victims first decide individually to kill him instead of paying, but fail in amusing ways. Then they find that to protect their various secrets they must now join forces for a rather different purpose...', 'Nigel Dennis publishes a scandal magazine. But for each story he writes, he first approaches the person whose scandalous behavior is described (or rather implied, to avoid any libel suit) and says he will suppress the story in return for money. Several of his victims first decide individually to kill him instead of paying, but fail in amusing ways. Then they find that to protect their various secrets they must now join forces for a rather different purpose...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aaf5SMXCVyErqt7Hd2xLTQEaDKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49843'),
  ('254620964405783019', 'The Naked Witch', 1960, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ralph K. Johnson, Larry Buchanan, Claude Alexander', 'Claude Alexander, Larry Buchanan', 'Libby Hall, Robert Short, Jo Maryman, Denis Adams, Howard Ware, Gary Owens', null, 'A student researching the German settlements of Central Texas unearths the grave of a reputed witch. The witch (who happens to be both beautiful and naked) rises from her grave and embarks on a campaign of seduction and murder against the descendants of her persecutors. It''s up to the student to stop her bloody reign of terror-if he can resist the seductive powers of her evil beauty.', 'A student researching the German settlements of Central Texas unearths the grave of a reputed witch. The witch (who happens to be both beautiful and naked) rises from her grave and embarks on a campaign of seduction and murder against the descendants of her persecutors. It''s up to the student to stop her bloody reign of terror-if he can resist the seductive powers of her evil beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezuYnTZmsStoD1Gf5hnDICOj2YO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92725'),
  ('302010811085658326', 'The Naked Witch', 1969, 'Horror, Mystery', 'William O. Brown, John Arthur Morrill', 'William O. Brown', 'Anthony Eisley, Thordis Brandt, Alvy Moore, John Lodge, Shelby Grant, Tony Benson, Robyn Millan, Diane Webber', 'NR', 'A psychic researcher and his assistants investigate a series of murders of beautiful young women.', 'A psychic researcher and his assistants investigate a series of murders of beautiful young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxw6ss3UPirjTzwjKOfRMQGghmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100671'),
  ('752001787753133914', 'The Naked Zoo', 1970, 'Drama', 'Stu Fleming, William Grefé, Gregory Sandor', 'William Grefé', 'Rita Hayworth, Steve Oliver, Fay Spain, Ford Rainey, Willie Pastrano, Fleurette Carter, Joe E. Ross, Gwen Merrill', 'R', 'Love and crime in Miami''s Cocoanut Grove artist''s colony. Swinging young writer Stephen Oliver has a falling-out with benefactress Rita Hayworth in the wake of a wild LSD party. Rita foolishly tries blackmail after Oliver''s reconciliation attempt leaves her crippled millionaire husband dead.', 'Love and crime in Miami''s Cocoanut Grove artist''s colony. Swinging young writer Stephen Oliver has a falling-out with benefactress Rita Hayworth in the wake of a wild LSD party. Rita foolishly tries blackmail after Oliver''s reconciliation attempt leaves her crippled millionaire husband dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPmWWyr7B3YfBm6Tp0QHFjuE9pY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337995'),
  ('386269016052720755', 'The Name of the Game Is Kill', 1968, 'Thriller', 'Gunnar Hellström, Wilbur D''Arcy, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Gary Crutcher', 'Jack Lord, Susan Strasberg, Collin Wilcox Paxton, Tisha Sterling, T.C. Jones, Mort Mills, Lou Lombardo, Marc Desmond', null, 'A desert family offers a traveling stranger its hospitality, but the stranger doesn''t realize exactly what they have in store for him.', 'A desert family offers a traveling stranger its hospitality, but the stranger doesn''t realize exactly what they have in store for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3byBUeNjKeR3oUvcrzDvZmurKad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166468'),
  ('957087826544014274', 'The Name of the Rose', 1986, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Tonino Delli Colli, Nazzareno Piana', 'Gérard Brach, Andrew Birkin, Howard Franklin', 'Sean Connery, Christian Slater, Helmut Qualtinger, Elya Baskin, Michael Lonsdale, Volker Prechtel, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., William Hickey', 'R', '14th-century Franciscan monk William of Baskerville and his young novice arrive at a conference to find that several monks have been murdered under mysterious circumstances. To solve the crimes, William must rise up against the Church''s authority and fight the shadowy conspiracy of monastery monks using only his intelligence; which is considerable.', '14th-century Franciscan monk William of Baskerville and his young novice arrive at a conference to find that several monks have been murdered under mysterious circumstances. To solve the crimes, William must rise up against the Church''s authority and fight the shadowy conspiracy of monastery monks using only his intelligence; which is considerable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6dlbTBb3N7nXDz7tQslDJs2jgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192'),
  ('457899270573773732', 'The Nameless', 1999, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Jaume Balagueró, Xavi Giménez, Fernando Sánchez-Izquierdo', 'Jaume Balagueró', 'Emma Vilarasau, Karra Elejalde, Tristán Ulloa, Toni Sevilla, Brendan Price, Jordi Dauder, Núria Cano, Isabel Ampudia', null, 'The mutilated body of a six year old girl is found in a water hole. The girl is identified as the missing daughter of Claudia. However, only two peices of evidence could be used to identify her; a bracelet with her name on it near the crime scene, and the fact that her right leg was three inches longer than her left. All other methods of identification were removed from her body. Five years later Claudia, now addicted to tranquilizers, receives a phone call from someone claiming to be her daughter, asking for her mother to come find her before ''they'' kill her. Other mysterious clues show up, further indicating that Claudia''s daughter is indeed still alive, and very much in danger. Claudia, a run-down ex-cop, and a parapsychology reporter put together the clues to discover Angela''s whereabouts', 'The mutilated body of a six year old girl is found in a water hole. The girl is identified as the missing daughter of Claudia. However, only two peices of evidence could be used to identify her; a bracelet with her name on it near the crime scene, and the fact that her right leg was three inches longer than her left. All other methods of identification were removed from her body. Five years later Claudia, now addicted to tranquilizers, receives a phone call from someone claiming to be her daughter, asking for her mother to come find her before ''they'' kill her. Other mysterious clues show up, further indicating that Claudia''s daughter is indeed still alive, and very much in danger. Claudia, a run-down ex-cop, and a parapsychology reporter put together the clues to discover Angela''s whereabouts', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZRtWQU6EnqBtPc9xKgQ9SM6ICg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9439'),
  ('779095212603025010', 'The Nameless Days', 2022, 'Horror', 'Andrew Mecham, Matthew Whedon, Ryan Hannah', 'Andrew Mecham, Matthew Whedon', 'Alexia Ioannides, Charles Halford, Andrew Roach, Ashley Marian Ramos, Ambyr Mishelle, Ali Kinkade, Trey Warner, Jeff Dickamore', null, 'Young immigrant Rahui and his pregnant sister are attacked and separated by a demonic spirit as they embark on a dangerous trek across the U.S. border. Injured but determined to survive, Rahui must rescue his sister before the demon takes the one thing she was denied in life–a baby.', 'Young immigrant Rahui and his pregnant sister are attacked and separated by a demonic spirit as they embark on a dangerous trek across the U.S. border. Injured but determined to survive, Rahui must rescue his sister before the demon takes the one thing she was denied in life–a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTfsJkplZPe47xw147KV3qutqpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799878'),
  ('669172458376154237', 'The Names of Love', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Michel Leclerc, Vincent Mathias', 'Michel Leclerc, Baya Kasmi', 'Jacques Gamblin, Sara Forestier, Zinedine Soualem, Jacques Boudet, Carole Franck, Michèle Moretti, Julia Vaidis-Bogard, Nabil Massad', null, 'Bahia Benmahmoud, a free-spirited young woman, has a particular way of seeing political engagement, as she doesn''t hesitate to sleep with those who don''t agree with her to convert them to her cause - which is a lot of people, as all right-leaning people are concerned. Generally, it works pretty well. Until the day she meets Arthur Martin, a discreet forty-something who doesn''t like taking risks. She imagines that with a name like that, he''s got to be slightly fascist. But names are deceitful and appearances deceiving.', 'Bahia Benmahmoud, a free-spirited young woman, has a particular way of seeing political engagement, as she doesn''t hesitate to sleep with those who don''t agree with her to convert them to her cause - which is a lot of people, as all right-leaning people are concerned. Generally, it works pretty well. Until the day she meets Arthur Martin, a discreet forty-something who doesn''t like taking risks. She imagines that with a name like that, he''s got to be slightly fascist. But names are deceitful and appearances deceiving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnUyni6Cc5bQbgyvvof6yNwoIUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50848'),
  ('676636233111516785', 'The Namesake', 2006, 'Drama', 'Mira Nair, Frederick Elmes', 'Sooni Taraporevala', 'Kal Penn, Irrfan Khan, Tabu, Jacinda Barrett, Zuleikha Robinson, Ruma Guha Thakurta, Sabyasachi Chakraborty, Sahira Nair', 'PG-13', 'The American-born son of Indian immigrants strives to fit in among his fellow New Yorkers despite his family''s unwillingness to let go of their traditional ways.', 'The American-born son of Indian immigrants strives to fit in among his fellow New Yorkers despite his family''s unwillingness to let go of their traditional ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxrf7HDwh0nIX4xXE06BdpEKW1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16727'),
  ('510339111522936721', 'The Nan Movie', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Christos Karamanis, Alastair Coomer, Isabella Odoffin', 'Brett Goldstein, Catherine Tate', 'Catherine Tate, Mathew Horne, Katherine Parkinson, Niky Wardley, Parker Sawyers, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Jack Doolan, Jack Michael Cloke', null, 'Catherine Tate''s iconic character Nan hits the big screen as she goes on a wild road trip from London to Ireland with her grandson Jamie to make amends with her estranged sister Nell. Militant vegan arsonists, raucous rugby teams, all night raves and crazed cops on motorbikes all make for a proper day out. An origin story that mixes Nan''s present with her past where we finally find out what''s made her the cantankerous old bastard she is today.', 'Catherine Tate''s iconic character Nan hits the big screen as she goes on a wild road trip from London to Ireland with her grandson Jamie to make amends with her estranged sister Nell. Militant vegan arsonists, raucous rugby teams, all night raves and crazed cops on motorbikes all make for a proper day out. An origin story that mixes Nan''s present with her past where we finally find out what''s made her the cantankerous old bastard she is today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHOQEt5x3MIznoqXtuTJWblHtYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647808'),
  ('3864483681130105', 'The Nannies', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Marianne Capian, Sébastien Deux, Alain Carsoux', 'Jean-Luc Gaget, Julien Rambaldi', 'Eye Haïdara, Ahmed Sylla, Léa Drucker, Vidal Arzoni, Élodie Navarre, Marc Zinga, Bwanga Pilipili, Nolan Van de Weyer', null, 'Angèle, a thirty-something from Ivory Coast, always cope thanks to the gift of gab and audacity. To escape from a bunch of dangerous criminals, she becomes a nanny in the uptown Paris, hired by Hélène, the single mom of eight years old Arthur. Discovering the work conditions of her colleagues, she decides to stand up for their rights, thanks to a young lawyer who will quickly fall for her.', 'Angèle, a thirty-something from Ivory Coast, always cope thanks to the gift of gab and audacity. To escape from a bunch of dangerous criminals, she becomes a nanny in the uptown Paris, hired by Hélène, the single mom of eight years old Arthur. Discovering the work conditions of her colleagues, she decides to stand up for their rights, thanks to a young lawyer who will quickly fall for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ksyjPxZ3aEgZYQX1Bw1LBkE7ns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765822'),
  ('776206845139021936', 'The Nanny', 1965, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Seth Holt, Harry Waxman, Christopher Dryhurst', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Bette Davis, Wendy Craig, Jill Bennett, James Villiers, William Dix, Pamela Franklin, Jack Watling, Maurice Denham', null, 'Nanny, a London family''s live-in maid, brings morbid 10-year-old Joey back from the psychiatric ward he''s been in for two years, since the death of his younger sister. Joey refuses to eat any food Nanny''s prepared or take a bath with her in the room. He also demands to sleep in a room with a lock. Joey''s parents -- workaholic Bill and neurotic Virgie -- are sure Joey is disturbed, but he may have good reason to be terrified of Nanny.', 'Nanny, a London family''s live-in maid, brings morbid 10-year-old Joey back from the psychiatric ward he''s been in for two years, since the death of his younger sister. Joey refuses to eat any food Nanny''s prepared or take a bath with her in the room. He also demands to sleep in a room with a lock. Joey''s parents -- workaholic Bill and neurotic Virgie -- are sure Joey is disturbed, but he may have good reason to be terrified of Nanny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MjaiPWaZVLWnJi8FxiIaXcjvB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39893'),
  ('594583811101877236', 'The Nanny', 1999, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Luigi Pirandello', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Maya Sansa, Jacqueline Lustig, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Elda Alvigini, Elda Alvigini, Fabio Camilli', null, 'Rome, early 20th century: a wealthy psychiatrist, who runs an asylum for women and lacks imagination in his practice, must find a wet nurse for his infant when his wife panics after childbirth. He brings a peasant, Annette, to Rome, forcing her to leave her own baby behind. To the consternation and increasing anger of the wife, the nanny immediately bonds with the couple''s infant son - Annette''s a natural. Against a backdrop of leftist demonstrations, Annette, who''s lover is a teacher jailed for subversion, asks the doctor to teach her to read and write. Her nature and curiosity, the doctor''s bland ideas, he and his wife''s problems, and the two infants bring the story to a head.', 'Rome, early 20th century: a wealthy psychiatrist, who runs an asylum for women and lacks imagination in his practice, must find a wet nurse for his infant when his wife panics after childbirth. He brings a peasant, Annette, to Rome, forcing her to leave her own baby behind. To the consternation and increasing anger of the wife, the nanny immediately bonds with the couple''s infant son - Annette''s a natural. Against a backdrop of leftist demonstrations, Annette, who''s lover is a teacher jailed for subversion, asks the doctor to teach her to read and write. Her nature and curiosity, the doctor''s bland ideas, he and his wife''s problems, and the two infants bring the story to a head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgkiQlcMCKNtSJyLGgR0mgxK0lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188117'),
  ('210607625430726534', 'The Nanny', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Petr Cikhart, Joel Novoa', 'Ed Dougherty, Marcel Sarmiento', 'Jaime Murray, Nicholas Brendon, Schuyler Fisk, Nick Gomez, Sandy Oian-Thomas, Jadin Harris, Christian Ganiere, Jennifer L. Marshall', null, 'Young Noa and Michael are put in the care of their new nanny, Leonor, who Noa suspects is a malicious supernatural being. Dismissed by those around her, Noa works to uncover Leonor''s true identity, but soon finds herself with far more than she bargained for.', 'Young Noa and Michael are put in the care of their new nanny, Leonor, who Noa suspects is a malicious supernatural being. Dismissed by those around her, Noa works to uncover Leonor''s true identity, but soon finds herself with far more than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h324sCgqkyQVre5a4uDfkXhm5c5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513857'),
  ('5535993343978067', 'The Nanny and the Soldier', 1897, 'Comedy', 'Louis Lumière, Auguste Lumière', null, null, null, 'A maid is out walking with her young charge when a soldier takes the boy''s place.', 'A maid is out walking with her young charge when a soldier takes the boy''s place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyHSFp2DrmmSK6PrznvUZgNoYjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189576'),
  ('529042970661819106', 'The Nanny Diaries', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Shari Springer Berman, Robert Pulcini, Terry Stacey', 'Shari Springer Berman, Robert Pulcini', 'Scarlett Johansson, Laura Linney, Alicia Keys, Chris Evans, Donna Murphy, Nicholas Art, Judith Roberts, Julie White', 'PG-13', 'A college graduate goes to work as a nanny for a rich New York family. Ensconced in their home, she has to juggle their dysfunction, a new romance, and the spoiled brat in her charge.', 'A college graduate goes to work as a nanny for a rich New York family. Ensconced in their home, she has to juggle their dysfunction, a new romance, and the spoiled brat in her charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hX6rcxnCidaqegPCyeFm9PODBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12435'),
  ('107822228292016500', 'The Nanny Express', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Yaron Levy, Tim Fitzgerald, Bradford May', 'Judith Heiman Kriegsman, Stephen Langford, Riley Weston', 'Vanessa Marcil, Brennan Elliott, Dean Stockwell, Stacy Keach, Natalie Dreyfuss, Dorie Barton, Peter Dobson, David Barry Gray', null, 'With their mother dead, Emily and Ben torment their nannies to quit as fast as their father hires them. Till a nanny named Kate shows up and slowly wins Ben over. That''s bad enough, but when her father and Kate start to fall in love, Emily sets out to break them up and match him with her ballet teacher.', 'With their mother dead, Emily and Ben torment their nannies to quit as fast as their father hires them. Till a nanny named Kate shows up and slowly wins Ben over. That''s bad enough, but when her father and Kate start to fall in love, Emily sets out to break them up and match him with her ballet teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxzR92vsqUBcBaYKpxE397i0Da7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43735'),
  ('787018864603517977', 'The Napa Boys', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Nick Corirossi, Ross Novie, Markus Mentzer, Alexis Schmidtberger', 'Armen Weitzman, Nick Corirossi', 'Sarah Ramos, Riki Lindhome, Steve Agee, Chloe Cherry, DJ Qualls', 'Not Rated', 'Jack Jr, Miles Jr and the whole gang are back for one last wine-soaked journey prompted by the mysterious "Sommelier." Joined this time by Puck, a fan of The Napa Boys comics, the group will learn about love, loss, friendship and viticulture.', 'Jack Jr, Miles Jr and the whole gang are back for one last wine-soaked journey prompted by the mysterious "Sommelier." Joined this time by Puck, a fan of The Napa Boys comics, the group will learn about love, loss, friendship and viticulture.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ffa7a2bd5b4118c7713b63c4e6735dfd5.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-napa-boys-2026'),
  ('675491916379729707', 'The Narrative', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Martin Schilt, Bernard Weber, Sergio Cassini, Ramon Giger', 'Martin Schilt, Bernard Weber, Ben Hopkins', 'Kweku Adoboli, Marco Teufen, Ramón Orza', null, 'As long as Kweku Adoboli generates millions for UBS London, his golden future seems assured. When the young trader takes responsibility for a loss of 2.3 billion dollars, however, the narrative shifts abruptly. Through a reenactment of the trial based on original court transcripts, the film challenges the dominant version of events and exposes a judicial process that raises more questions than it answers. A film about responsibility, examining how media and judicial narratives shaped a story in which Adoboli was unable to regain control of his own narrative within the machinery of global capitalism.', 'As long as Kweku Adoboli generates millions for UBS London, his golden future seems assured. When the young trader takes responsibility for a loss of 2.3 billion dollars, however, the narrative shifts abruptly. Through a reenactment of the trial based on original court transcripts, the film challenges the dominant version of events and exposes a judicial process that raises more questions than it answers. A film about responsibility, examining how media and judicial narratives shaped a story in which Adoboli was unable to regain control of his own narrative within the machinery of global capitalism.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjX8gITOhad4YotQNgG3AbK336IM.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-narrative-2026'),
  ('1080316370183142681', 'The Narrow Margin', 1952, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Richard Fleischer, George E. Diskant, William Cameron Menzies', 'Earl Felton', 'Charles McGraw, Marie Windsor, Jacqueline White, Gordon Gebert, Queenie Leonard, David Clarke, Peter Virgo, Don Beddoe', 'NR', 'A tough cop meets his match when he has to guard a gangster''s widow on a train journey from Chicago to Los Angeles.', 'A tough cop meets his match when he has to guard a gangster''s widow on a train journey from Chicago to Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdlCfBmTZ7CoJoCvS1b56Xj1qJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31713'),
  ('297366123432998819', 'The Narrows', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'François Velle', 'Tatiana Blackington', 'Kevin Zegers, Vincent D''Onofrio, Sophia Bush, Eddie Cahill, Titus Welliver, Monica Keena, Roger Rees, Tony Cucci', null, 'A 19 year old Brooklyn boy who is torn between two worlds when his photography portfolio wins him a partial scholarship to NYU. He must figure out how to balance his Italian neighborhood roots with the expansive, sophisticated world on the other side of the East River. Based on Tim McLoughlin''s novel "Heart of the Old Country".', 'A 19 year old Brooklyn boy who is torn between two worlds when his photography portfolio wins him a partial scholarship to NYU. He must figure out how to balance his Italian neighborhood roots with the expansive, sophisticated world on the other side of the East River. Based on Tim McLoughlin''s novel "Heart of the Old Country".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArcqdYz9IGyDp2mdRo8E87otYRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24567'),
  ('1000321455251408348', 'The Nasty Girl', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Verhoeven, Axel de Roche', 'Michael Verhoeven', 'Lena Stolze, Hans-Reinhard Müller, Monika Baumgartner, Elisabeth Bertram, Michael Gahr, Robert Giggenbach, Fred Stillkrauth, Barbara Gallauner', null, 'When a young woman investigates her town''s Nazi past, the community turns against her.', 'When a young woman investigates her town''s Nazi past, the community turns against her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMgWMJe7crXnj3MZ39tKSSjFSPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4339'),
  ('498764544554845166', 'The National Anthem Kimigayo', 1931, 'Animation', 'Noburô Ôfuji', null, null, null, 'Very short animated film from Japan, using cut-outs in the style of Lotte Reiniger.', 'Very short animated film from Japan, using cut-outs in the style of Lotte Reiniger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25QcaoabvZsCcUuEAtEZ4yQjWdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319131'),
  ('212453941030950538', 'The National Health', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Jack Gold, John Coquillon', 'Peter Nichols', 'Lynn Redgrave, Colin Blakely, Eleanor Bron, Donald Sinden, Jim Dale, Bob Hoskins, David Hutcheson, Mervyn Johns', null, 'Peter Nichols adapted his own hit play to the screen, based on his experiences in hospitals. A riotous black comedy that''s as timely today as ever, it contrasts the appalling conditions in a overcrowded London hospital with a soap opera playing on the televisions there. In an ingenious touch, the same actors appear in the "real" story as well as the "TV" one, thus blurring the distinctions even further. Jack Gould directs such outstanding British actors as Lynn Redgrave, Colin Blakely, Eleanor Bron, Jim Dale, Donald Sinden, Mervyn Johns, and, in only his second film, Bob Hoskins. The renowned Carl Davis composed the score.', 'Peter Nichols adapted his own hit play to the screen, based on his experiences in hospitals. A riotous black comedy that''s as timely today as ever, it contrasts the appalling conditions in a overcrowded London hospital with a soap opera playing on the televisions there. In an ingenious touch, the same actors appear in the "real" story as well as the "TV" one, thus blurring the distinctions even further. Jack Gould directs such outstanding British actors as Lynn Redgrave, Colin Blakely, Eleanor Bron, Jim Dale, Donald Sinden, Mervyn Johns, and, in only his second film, Bob Hoskins. The renowned Carl Davis composed the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xuZcUr64R1jhTBSk9Uxa5WmFHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201471'),
  ('607283430590159393', 'The National Shotgun', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Carlos Suárez, Miguel Gil', 'Luis García Berlanga, Rafael Azcona', 'José «Saza» Sazatornil, Luis Escobar, José Luis López Vázquez, Antonio Ferrandis, Agustín González, Mónica Randall, Laly Soldevila, Andrés Mejuto', null, 'A catalan manufacturer of intercoms travels to Madrid, accompanied by his mistress, to attend a hunt that he has organized. Its main purpose is to mix with people of high society to improve their business. All seems well until the owner of the farm shows full authority over James, who is the real organizer of the meeting. The celebration is diverse characters who live next to absurd situations.', 'A catalan manufacturer of intercoms travels to Madrid, accompanied by his mistress, to attend a hunt that he has organized. Its main purpose is to mix with people of high society to improve their business. All seems well until the owner of the farm shows full authority over James, who is the real organizer of the meeting. The celebration is diverse characters who live next to absurd situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIYrY2pML6JdKv7J1ugusFnuOHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116312'),
  ('263459885306257409', 'The National Tree', 2009, 'Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Graeme Campbell, François Dagenais', null, 'Andrew McCarthy, Evan Williams, Kari Matchett, Paula Brancati, Jayne Eastwood, Ted Atherton, Craig Eldridge, Trent McMullen', null, 'A teenager has his Sitka Spruce tree chosen to be planted outside the White House as the new national Christmas Tree.', 'A teenager has his Sitka Spruce tree chosen to be planted outside the White House as the new national Christmas Tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNsvuioaqBir1AQV6VkycWXmxBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34426'),
  ('135458510999045233', 'The Nativity Story', 2006, 'Drama', 'Elliot Davis, Catherine Hardwicke', 'Mike Rich', 'Keisha Castle-Hughes, Oscar Isaac, Hiam Abbass, Shaun Toub, Ciarán Hinds, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Stanley Townsend, Alexander Siddig', 'PG', 'Mary and Joseph make the hard journey to Bethlehem for a blessed event in this retelling of the Nativity story. This meticulously researched and visually lush adaptation of the biblical tale follows the pair on their arduous path to their arrival in a small village, where they find shelter in a quiet manger and Jesus is born.', 'Mary and Joseph make the hard journey to Bethlehem for a blessed event in this retelling of the Nativity story. This meticulously researched and visually lush adaptation of the biblical tale follows the pair on their arduous path to their arrival in a small village, where they find shelter in a quiet manger and Jesus is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nd0oj0lmEx1X8WraiVkYMZlDjKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2447'),
  ('1031026168730651985', 'The Natural', 1984, 'Drama', 'Caleb Deschanel, Barry Levinson, Chris Soldo', 'Phil Dusenberry, Roger Towne', 'Robert Redford, Robert Duvall, Glenn Close, Kim Basinger, Wilford Brimley, Barbara Hershey, Robert Prosky, Richard Farnsworth', 'PG', 'An unknown middle-aged batter named Roy Hobbs with a mysterious past appears out of nowhere to take a losing 1930s baseball team to the top of the league.', 'An unknown middle-aged batter named Roy Hobbs with a mysterious past appears out of nowhere to take a losing 1930s baseball team to the top of the league.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwn1gYeOkS1XHKVFdNorKSIpix8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11393'),
