  ('478863435570274698', 'The Natural Sweetness of Skin', 2018, 'Drama', 'Renée Beaulieu, Philippe St-Gelais', 'Renée Beaulieu', 'Brigitte Poupart, Louise Portal, Vincent Leclerc, Pierre-Yves Cardinal, Charlotte Aubin, Nathalie Cavezzali, Romane Denis, Pierre Kwenders', null, 'Revealing women, showing men Dermatology professor Marie-Claire is embarking on a new project linking skin cells and sexuality, when unexpected events disrupt her professional, family and intimate life.', 'Revealing women, showing men Dermatology professor Marie-Claire is embarking on a new project linking skin cells and sexuality, when unexpected events disrupt her professional, family and intimate life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGTV0G00NBZ3n2hoJTEAWcL12SX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539827'),
  ('987020853222188362', 'The Nature of Love', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Monia Chokri, André Turpin, Charles-Olivier Tremblay', 'Monia Chokri', 'Magalie Lépine-Blondeau, Pierre-Yves Cardinal, Francis-William Rhéaume, Monia Chokri, Steve Laplante, Marie-Ginette Guay, Micheline Lanctôt, Guillaume Laurin', 'NR', 'Sophia is a philosophy professor in Montreal and has lived as a couple with Xavier for 10 years. Sylvain is a carpenter in the Laurentians and must renovate their country house. When Sophia meets Sylvain for the first time, it’s love at first sight. Opposites attract, but can it last?', 'Sophia is a philosophy professor in Montreal and has lived as a couple with Xavier for 10 years. Sylvain is a carpenter in the Laurentians and must renovate their country house. When Sophia meets Sylvain for the first time, it’s love at first sight. Opposites attract, but can it last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4IbLxbb1p9X9pMAUn4ddJztO60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912520'),
  ('984449851122977269', 'The Naughty Nine', 2023, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Alberto Belli', 'Jed Elinoff, Scott Thomas', 'Winslow Fegley, Danny Glover, Camila Rodriguez, Anthony John Joo, Imogen Cohen, Clara Stack, Ayden Elijah, Madilyn Kellam', 'G', 'Fifth-grader Andy finds himself without a present from Santa on Christmas morning. Realizing he must have landed on the “naughty list” and feeling unfairly maligned, Andy pulls together a team of eight other naughty-listers to help him execute an elaborate heist on Santa’s Village at the North Pole to get the presents they feel they deserve.', 'Fifth-grader Andy finds himself without a present from Santa on Christmas morning. Realizing he must have landed on the “naughty list” and feeling unfairly maligned, Andy pulls together a team of eight other naughty-listers to help him execute an elaborate heist on Santa’s Village at the North Pole to get the presents they feel they deserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JoTI5Nrh2U639WfwUk0Akum7fQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936059'),
  ('552481770621936321', 'The Naughty Nineties', 1945, 'Comedy', 'Jean Yarbrough, Edgar Fairchild, George Robinson', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Alan Curtis, Rita Johnson, Henry Travers, Lois Collier, Joe Sawyer, Joe Kirk', 'NR', 'In the gay ''90s, cardsharps take over a Mississippi riverboat from a kindly captain. Their first act is to change the showboat into a floating gambling house. A ham actor and his bumbling sidekick try to devise a way to help the captain regain ownership of the vessel.', 'In the gay ''90s, cardsharps take over a Mississippi riverboat from a kindly captain. Their first act is to change the showboat into a floating gambling house. A ham actor and his bumbling sidekick try to devise a way to help the captain regain ownership of the vessel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilmFwtwiheeAFkDsdqiyCASVqZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33536'),
  ('386266061890837146', 'The Naughty Stewardesses', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Al Adamson', 'Bruce Feld, Samuel M. Sherman', 'Robert Livingston, Connie Hoffman, Richard Smedley, Donna Young, Marilyn Joi, Sydney Jordan, Al Richardson, Jerry Mills', 'R', 'A free-spirited Kansas City woman lands a job as a flight attendant and moves in with three worldly stewardesses in Los Angeles, but things get complicated when a wealthy elderly land developer saves the life of one of their passengers.', 'A free-spirited Kansas City woman lands a job as a flight attendant and moves in with three worldly stewardesses in Los Angeles, but things get complicated when a wealthy elderly land developer saves the life of one of their passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWmAt5rNrVeUX8UbcIapwaOPU3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95563'),
  ('608537790083258703', 'The Nautical Chart', 2007, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Imanol Uribe, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Imanol Uribe', 'Carmelo Gómez, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Darío Grandinetti, Enrico Lo Verso, Gonzalo Cunill, Javier García Gallego, Lucina Gil, Carlos Kaniowsky', null, 'Coy, a sailor without ship, banished from the sea by a navigation accident occurred during his guard, knows in an auction of naval objects in Barcelona to an attractive and mysterious woman, Tangier. This, in hard struggle with an Italian adventurer, Nino Palermo, manages to get a cartographic jewel of eighteen, the Maritime Atlas of Urrutia.', 'Coy, a sailor without ship, banished from the sea by a navigation accident occurred during his guard, knows in an auction of naval objects in Barcelona to an attractive and mysterious woman, Tangier. This, in hard struggle with an Italian adventurer, Nino Palermo, manages to get a cartographic jewel of eighteen, the Maritime Atlas of Urrutia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s24q6D6MNejvV8hcMIeZtfm2F9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21447'),
  ('764272330914214163', 'The Navigator', 1924, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Buster Keaton, Donald Crisp, Elgin Lessley', 'Jean C. Havez, Clyde Bruckman, Joseph A. Mitchell', 'Buster Keaton, Kathryn McGuire, Frederick Vroom, Clarence Burton, H.N. Clugston, Noble Johnson', 'NR', 'The wealthy and impulsive Rollo Treadway decides to propose to his beautiful socialite neighbor, Betsy O''Brien. Although Betsy turns Rollo down, he still opts to go on the cruise that he intended as their honeymoon. When circumstances find both Rollo and Betsy on the wrong ship, they end up having adventures on the high seas.', 'The wealthy and impulsive Rollo Treadway decides to propose to his beautiful socialite neighbor, Betsy O''Brien. Although Betsy turns Rollo down, he still opts to go on the cruise that he intended as their honeymoon. When circumstances find both Rollo and Betsy on the wrong ship, they end up having adventures on the high seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFIbnDnBnIi1qnz15UUiMFmjRmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32318'),
  ('324665949376557799', 'The Navigator: A Medieval Odyssey', 1988, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Vincent Ward, Greg Stitt, Christine Haebler', 'Geoff Chapple, Kely Lyons, Vincent Ward', 'Bruce Lyons, Chris Haywood, Hamish McFarlane, Marshall Napier, Noel Appleby, Paul Livingston, Sarah Peirse, Mark Wheatley', null, 'Cumberland, 1348. The plague is spreading in medieval England. The remote village of little Griffin is also threatened. But the 9-year-old boy has a recurring dream that holds the key to a tiny hope of survival: a lake with a coffin floating on it. A white church with an iron cross. A falling glove. A falling silhouette. A torch tumble through a dark shaft into infinity. With his brother he recognizes in it a prophecy to escape the Black Death. So they embark with a few men on a journey to a distant cathedral, where they want to set up an iron cross as an offering to God. Her path leads them through a deep and dark mine shaft into an unknown land and completely outlandish time - into the present-day New Zealand of the 1980s.', 'Cumberland, 1348. The plague is spreading in medieval England. The remote village of little Griffin is also threatened. But the 9-year-old boy has a recurring dream that holds the key to a tiny hope of survival: a lake with a coffin floating on it. A white church with an iron cross. A falling glove. A falling silhouette. A torch tumble through a dark shaft into infinity. With his brother he recognizes in it a prophecy to escape the Black Death. So they embark with a few men on a journey to a distant cathedral, where they want to set up an iron cross as an offering to God. Her path leads them through a deep and dark mine shaft into an unknown land and completely outlandish time - into the present-day New Zealand of the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0aeBvYoaT98Q4IefWuStISdyuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34637'),
  ('1002898163503621966', 'The Navigators', 2001, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd, Mike Eley', 'Rob Dawber', 'Dean Andrews, Thomas Craig, Joe Duttine, Steve Huison, Venn Tracey, Andy Swallow, Sean Glenn, Juliet Bates', null, 'In South Yorkshire, a small group of railway maintenance men discover that because of privatization, their lives will never be the same. When the trusty British Rail sign is replaced by one reading East Midland Infrastructure, it is clear that there will be the inevitable winners and losers as downsizing and efficiency become the new buzzwords.', 'In South Yorkshire, a small group of railway maintenance men discover that because of privatization, their lives will never be the same. When the trusty British Rail sign is replaced by one reading East Midland Infrastructure, it is clear that there will be the inevitable winners and losers as downsizing and efficiency become the new buzzwords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0p4LnzBEipEIfQHZaGU15UIrfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35824'),
