  ('896015659071088703', 'The Navy vs. the Night Monsters', 1966, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stanley Cortez, Michael A. Hoey, Jon Hall', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Anthony Eisley, Mamie Van Doren, Edward Faulkner, Walter Sande, Bobby Van, Billy Gray, Kaye Elhardt, Pamela Mason', 'NR', 'US Navy battles monsters unearthed from the frozen arctic.', 'US Navy battles monsters unearthed from the frozen arctic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A12HFnQeaGx2v9IfteYR0dgtlX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87120'),
  ('993494945294710882', 'The Neanderthal Man', 1953, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'E.A. Dupont, Stanley Cortez', 'Jack Pollexfen, Aubrey Wisberg', 'Robert Shayne, Richard Crane, Joyce Terry, Doris Merrick, Robert Long, Tandra Quinn, Beverly Garland, Dick Rich', null, 'A scientist develops a formula which will cause animals to regress to the form of their primitive ancestors, and tries it on himself with disastrous results.', 'A scientist develops a formula which will cause animals to regress to the form of their primitive ancestors, and tries it on himself with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si8D92lmc2BcA9UiIaTYLQ17SdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28775'),
  ('793146921372057896', 'The Necessities of Life', 2008, 'Drama', 'Benoît Pilon', 'Benoît Pilon', 'Natar Ungalaaq, Éveline Gélinas, Paul-André Brasseur, Louise Marleau, Guy Thauvette, Antoine Bertrand, Vincent-Guillaume Otis, Denis Bernard', null, 'In 1952, an Inuit hunter named Tivii with tuberculosis leaves his northern home and family to go recuperate at a sanatorium in Quebec City. Uprooted, far from his loved ones, unable to speak French and faced with a completely alien world, he becomes despondent. When he refuses to eat and expresses a wish to die, his nurse, Carole, comes to the realization that Tivii''s illness is not the most serious threat to his well-being. She arranges to have a young orphan, Kaki, transferred to the institution. The boy is also sick, but has experience with both worlds and speaks both languages. By sharing his culture with Kaki and opening it up to others, Tivii rediscovers his pride and energy. Ultimately he also rediscovers hope through a plan to adopt Kaki, bring him home and make him part of his family', 'In 1952, an Inuit hunter named Tivii with tuberculosis leaves his northern home and family to go recuperate at a sanatorium in Quebec City. Uprooted, far from his loved ones, unable to speak French and faced with a completely alien world, he becomes despondent. When he refuses to eat and expresses a wish to die, his nurse, Carole, comes to the realization that Tivii''s illness is not the most serious threat to his well-being. She arranges to have a young orphan, Kaki, transferred to the institution. The boy is also sick, but has experience with both worlds and speaks both languages. By sharing his culture with Kaki and opening it up to others, Tivii rediscovers his pride and energy. Ultimately he also rediscovers hope through a plan to adopt Kaki, bring him home and make him part of his family', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tPaeW7gv0AcuaUjfU03O9QeNrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38502'),
  ('214231088866155802', 'The Necklace', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Claude Chabrol, Roberto Venturi', 'Jacques Santamaria, Gérard Jourd''hui', 'Cécile de France, Thomas Chabrol, Charley Fouquet, Jacques Boudet, Valérie Kéruzoré, Christian Hecq, Charline Paul, Rémy Roubakha', null, 'Mathilde and her husband, who works in a minister''s office, are not rich. Mathilde, however, loves beautiful clothes and her husband loves her too much that he lets her do anything she wants. One day they receive an invitation for an important party and she wants to look her best. She borrows a beautiful diamond necklace from her rich friend, but then the necklace gets lost.', 'Mathilde and her husband, who works in a minister''s office, are not rich. Mathilde, however, loves beautiful clothes and her husband loves her too much that he lets her do anything she wants. One day they receive an invitation for an important party and she wants to look her best. She borrows a beautiful diamond necklace from her rich friend, but then the necklace gets lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJCoLEpEvu4ODQA7nbuPUDbSC22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449679'),
  ('805801117935878514', 'The Necro Files', 1997, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Matt Jaissle, Satoru Enomoto, Wade Wellman', 'Todd Tjersland, Sammy Shapiro', 'Isaac Cooper, Steve Sheppard, Gary Browning, Christian Curmudgeon, Jason McGee, Theresa Bestul, Dru Berrymore, Jenn O. Cide', 'NR', 'A cannibalistic rapist rises from the grave as a flesh-eating zombie sex maniac! Two Seattle cops, a satanic cult and a flying demon fetus try to stop the lust-crazed ghoul before he can kill again!', 'A cannibalistic rapist rises from the grave as a flesh-eating zombie sex maniac! Two Seattle cops, a satanic cult and a flying demon fetus try to stop the lust-crazed ghoul before he can kill again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30GqmHZxzPmETiLEI6f7zzumuGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131995'),
  ('909597111376969134', 'The Needle', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Rashid Nugmanov, Murat Nugmanov, Andrei Vlaznev', 'Aleksandr Baranov, Bakhyt Kilibayev', 'Viktor Tsoi, Marina Smirnova, Aleksandr Bashirov, Pyotr Mamonov, Archimed Iskakov, Grigorij Jepshtejn, Rustem Tashibaev, Gennadi Lyui', null, 'Moro returns to Alma-Ata to collect money owed to him. While waiting out an unexpected delay, he visits his former girlfriend Dina and discovers she has become a morphine addict. He decides to help her kick the habit and to fight the local drug mafia responsible for her condition.', 'Moro returns to Alma-Ata to collect money owed to him. While waiting out an unexpected delay, he visits his former girlfriend Dina and discovers she has become a morphine addict. He decides to help her kick the habit and to fight the local drug mafia responsible for her condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jY89jWUNT53D854qY4J7T6RsywL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20847'),
