  ('1092697900736249676', 'The Nest', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Roberto De Feo, Emanuele Pasquet, Stefano Masera', 'Roberto De Feo, Lucio Besana, Margherita Ferri', 'Francesca Cavallin, Ginevra Francesconi, Justin Alexander Korovkin, Maurizio Lombardi, Elisabetta De Vito, Valentina Bartolo, Cristina Golotta, Roberto Accornero', null, 'Samuel, a boy who lives with his mother Elena in Villa dei Laghi, an isolated manor surrounded by woods, feels trapped in the family routine, growing up seemingly protected, but unsatisfied and restless.', 'Samuel, a boy who lives with his mother Elena in Villa dei Laghi, an isolated manor surrounded by woods, feels trapped in the family routine, growing up seemingly protected, but unsatisfied and restless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3DNmm0VXlwaPkTuKgznQdrDveD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600184'),
  ('828778177444287410', 'The Nest', 2020, 'Drama', 'Matthew Scrivener, Alexander Lloyd, Jodie Cowman', 'Sean Durkin', 'Jude Law, Carrie Coon, Charlie Shotwell, Oona Roche, Adeel Akhtar, Wendy Crewson, Anne Reid, Michael Culkin', 'R', 'Rory is an ambitious entrepreneur who brings his American wife and kids to his native country, England, to explore new business opportunities. After abandoning the sanctuary of their safe American suburban surroundings, the family is plunged into the despair of an archaic ''80s Britain and their unaffordable new life in an English manor house threatens to destroy the family.', 'Rory is an ambitious entrepreneur who brings his American wife and kids to his native country, England, to explore new business opportunities. After abandoning the sanctuary of their safe American suburban surroundings, the family is plunged into the despair of an archaic ''80s Britain and their unaffordable new life in an English manor house threatens to destroy the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSTrRgXGzu2t1jVhTexIqwSHlk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545237'),
  ('37552223727963021', 'The Nest', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Suttles', 'Jennifer Trudrung', 'Dee Wallace, Sarah Navratil, Kevin Patrick Murphy, Blaque Fowler, Drez Ryan, Anna Lynn Holleman, Maple Suttles, Penny Munroe', null, 'As a mother becomes suspicious that her daughter may be infected by a parasitic creature, she is thrust into a nightmare as the people she trusts most push her into a chasm of drug addiction, self-destruction, and devastating sacrifice.', 'As a mother becomes suspicious that her daughter may be infected by a parasitic creature, she is thrust into a nightmare as the people she trusts most push her into a chasm of drug addiction, self-destruction, and devastating sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opz1fG0zINwQYU1hDjVXK2vbcYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790803'),
  ('262490747398956420', 'The Nest of the Cuckoo Birds', 1965, 'Drama, Horror', 'Bert Williams', 'Bert Williams', 'Bert Williams, Ann Long, Jackie Scelza, Chuck Frankle', null, 'Johnson, an agent for the Liquor Control Department, comes across the remote Cuckoo Bird Inn after escaping from a band of cut-throat moonshiners and a mysterious killer. He realizes there that he must discover the identity of the killer before the inn''s demented occupants turn him into another display in the grotesque Chapel of the Dead.', 'Johnson, an agent for the Liquor Control Department, comes across the remote Cuckoo Bird Inn after escaping from a band of cut-throat moonshiners and a mysterious killer. He realizes there that he must discover the identity of the killer before the inn''s demented occupants turn him into another display in the grotesque Chapel of the Dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AehvLjfW0ySToQBUoRh65Aix2Xw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337998'),
  ('1057710007302189852', 'The Nesting', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Armand Weston, João Fernandes, Philippe Rivier', 'Armand Weston, Daria Price', 'Robin Groves, Christopher Loomis, Michael David Lally, John Carradine, Bill Rowley, David Tabor, Patrick Farrelly, Bobo Lewis', 'R', 'A New York writer of gothic fiction finds her mansion full of ghosts from a brothel massacre.', 'A New York writer of gothic fiction finds her mansion full of ghosts from a brothel massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxaH5WjkPaXoTeozPPuwcPdLgOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40236'),
  ('24297205505766196', 'The Net', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández, Alex Phillips', 'Emilio Fernández, Neftalí Beltrán', 'Rossana Podestà, Crox Alvarado, Armando Silvestre, Guillermo Cramer, Carlos Riquelme, Margarito Luna, Antonio Bribiesca, Emilio Garibay', null, 'Antonio dives for sponges which are sold by his sweetheart Rossana. One day, the escaped prisoner José-Luis appears and is hid by his friend Antonio. Although José-Luis does not want to betray his friend, a love affair with tragic consequences between him and Rossana develops. The Net was one of Mexico''s entries at the 1953 Cannes Film Festival.', 'Antonio dives for sponges which are sold by his sweetheart Rossana. One day, the escaped prisoner José-Luis appears and is hid by his friend Antonio. Although José-Luis does not want to betray his friend, a love affair with tragic consequences between him and Rossana develops. The Net was one of Mexico''s entries at the 1953 Cannes Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPVfgicaHVbiMxXbnYZwkHOZFqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199481'),
  ('611801909585789129', 'The Net', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Irwin Winkler, J. Michael Haynie, Frank Ferro', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Sandra Bullock, Jeremy Northam, Dennis Miller, Wendy Gazelle, Diane Baker, Ken Howard, Ray McKinnon, Daniel Schorr', 'PG-13', 'Angela Bennett is a freelance computer systems analyst who tracks down software viruses. At night she hooks up to the internet and chats to others ''surfing the net''. While de-bugging a new high-tech game for a cyber friend, she comes across a top secret program and becomes the target of a mysterious organization who will stop at nothing to erase her identity and her existence, in order to protect the project.', 'Angela Bennett is a freelance computer systems analyst who tracks down software viruses. At night she hooks up to the internet and chats to others ''surfing the net''. While de-bugging a new high-tech game for a cyber friend, she comes across a top secret program and becomes the target of a mysterious organization who will stop at nothing to erase her identity and her existence, in order to protect the project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtupntUFMD5iXBo8HLfALt2ET4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1642'),
  ('269554481823139295', 'The Net', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Lutz Dammbeck, Thomas Plenert, István Imreh', 'Lutz Dammbeck', 'Eva Mattes, Tom Vogt, Ted Kaczynski, Lutz Dammbeck, John Brockman, Stewart Brand, Robert W. Taylor, Heinz von Foerster', 'NR', 'Explores the incredibly complex backstory of Ted Kaczynski, the infamous Unabomber. This exquisitely crafted inquiry into the rationale of this mythic figure situates him within a late 20th century web of technology—a system that he grew to oppose. A marvelously subversive approach to the history of the Internet, this insightful documentary combines speculative travelogue and investigative journalism to trace contrasting countercultural responses to the cybernetic revolution.', 'Explores the incredibly complex backstory of Ted Kaczynski, the infamous Unabomber. This exquisitely crafted inquiry into the rationale of this mythic figure situates him within a late 20th century web of technology—a system that he grew to oppose. A marvelously subversive approach to the history of the Internet, this insightful documentary combines speculative travelogue and investigative journalism to trace contrasting countercultural responses to the cybernetic revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Att9uSj2B5Kw57Bfda1qHj4uZIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77786'),
  ('719750667699243149', 'The Net', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk, Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Ryoo Seung-bum, Lee Won-keun, Kim Young-min, Choi Gwi-hwa, Lee Na-ra, Kim Su-an, Jeong Ha-dam, Sung Hyun-ah', null, 'A poor North Korean fisherman finds himself an accidental defector, and is groomed to be a spy by an ambitious South Korean military officer.', 'A poor North Korean fisherman finds himself an accidental defector, and is groomed to be a spy by an ambitious South Korean military officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzR6uMMOixsCg1MjghvbNvOAb73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412094'),
  ('865617123449002858', 'The Net 2.0', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Winkler, Steven Douglas Smith', 'Rob Cowan, John Brancato', 'Nikki DeLoach, Demet Akbağ, Cengiz Bozkurt, Şebnem Dönmez, Güven Kıraç, Charles Winkler, Courtney Vye, Neil Hopkins', 'R', 'The life of a young computer systems analyst is thrown into turmoil after arriving in Istanbul to start a new job. She soon finds her passport missing, her credit cards useless, her bank account empty and her identity stolen. As the story progresses we find people and events may not be what they seem.', 'The life of a young computer systems analyst is thrown into turmoil after arriving in Istanbul to start a new job. She soon finds her passport missing, her credit cards useless, her bank account empty and her identity stolen. As the story progresses we find people and events may not be what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ofTl14cmpu5hCeD2HWh2T5QFH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9834'),
  ('707974899683554146', 'The Nevadan', 1950, 'Western', 'Gordon Douglas, Charles Lawton Jr., Wilbur McGaugh', 'George W. George, George F. Slavin', 'Randolph Scott, Dorothy Malone, Forrest Tucker, Frank Faylen, George Macready, Charles Kemper, Jeff Corey, Tom Powers', 'NR', 'A mysterious stranger crosses paths with an outlaw bank robber and a greedy rancher.', 'A mysterious stranger crosses paths with an outlaw bank robber and a greedy rancher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7JFVv4bUkLu2vQoLpvh1lU3r6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46367'),
  ('940087987606341405', 'The NeverEnding Story', 1984, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Drama', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Jürgen Bieske, Michael Boyadjiew', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Herman Weigel', 'Noah Hathaway, Barret Oliver, Tami Stronach, Alan Oppenheimer, Sydney Bromley, Patricia Hayes, Moses Gunn, Frank Lenart', 'PG', 'While hiding from bullies in his school''s attic, a young boy discovers the extraordinary land of Fantasia, through a magical book called The Neverending Story. The book tells the tale of Atreyu, a young warrior who, with the help of a luck dragon named Falkor, must save Fantasia from the destruction of The Nothing.', 'While hiding from bullies in his school''s attic, a young boy discovers the extraordinary land of Fantasia, through a magical book called The Neverending Story. The book tells the tale of Atreyu, a young warrior who, with the help of a luck dragon named Falkor, must save Fantasia from the destruction of The Nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWJC8om086h01f0CMGR9ombdpnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34584'),
  ('591156007868019255', 'The NeverEnding Story II: The Next Chapter', 1990, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'George T. Miller, David Connell, Bert Batt', 'Karin Howard', 'Jonathan Brandis, Kenny Morrison, Clarissa Burt, John Wesley Shipp, Martin Umbach, Alexandra Johnes, Thomas Hill, Helena Michell', 'PG', 'Once again, Bastian is transported to the world of Fantasia which he recently managed to save from destruction. However, the land is now being destroyed by an evil sorceress, Xayide, so he must join up with Atreyu and face the Emptiness once more.', 'Once again, Bastian is transported to the world of Fantasia which he recently managed to save from destruction. However, the land is now being destroyed by an evil sorceress, Xayide, so he must join up with Atreyu and face the Emptiness once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRSLCuO2B6owYBtUwGYGqWZCVo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34636'),
  ('539322370216151829', 'The NeverEnding Story III', 1994, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Peter MacDonald, Robin Vidgeon, Paul Barry', 'Jeff Lieberman', 'Jason James Richter, Melody Kay, Jack Black, Ryan Bollman, Freddie Jones, Julie Cox, William Hootkins, Tony Robinson', 'G', 'A young boy must restore order when a group of bullies steal the magical book that acts as a portal between Earth and the imaginary world of Fantasia.', 'A young boy must restore order when a group of bullies steal the magical book that acts as a portal between Earth and the imaginary world of Fantasia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o75HHfr23sgeqIeUPwjKY0V9Ppi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27793'),
  ('1126006944537749035', 'The New Adventures of Aladdin', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Arthur Benzaquen, Pierre Aïm, Valérie Othnin-Girard', 'Daive Cohen', 'Kev Adams, Éric Judor, Jean-Paul Rouve, Vanessa Guide, Michel Blanc, William Lebghil, Audrey Lamy, Arthur Benzaquen', null, 'A pair of losers working at department store plan to rob the place after it closes. When a bunch of kids show up begging for a story, the men launch into an improvised version of Aladdin.', 'A pair of losers working at department store plan to rob the place after it closes. When a bunch of kids show up begging for a story, the men launch into an improvised version of Aladdin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/el4obM1DT1o4k7xGowuhtrUmW13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344268'),
  ('576948747596872739', 'The New Adventures of Cinderella', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Lionel Steketee', 'Daive Cohen', 'Marilou Berry, Arnaud Ducret, Josiane Balasko, Didier Bourdon, Vincent Desagnat, Jérôme Commandeur, Joséphine Draï, Camille Verschuere', null, 'It''s Julie''s birthday but she seems to be the only one who remembers... Until Marco, the man she secretly loves, calls her and tells her he''s going to drop off her son because the babysitter had a setback. Julie is devastated, everyone considers her to be a maid. Alone with this particularly obnoxious little boy, Julie decides to tell him the story of Cinderella... well, almost.', 'It''s Julie''s birthday but she seems to be the only one who remembers... Until Marco, the man she secretly loves, calls her and tells her he''s going to drop off her son because the babysitter had a setback. Julie is devastated, everyone considers her to be a maid. Alone with this particularly obnoxious little boy, Julie decides to tell him the story of Cinderella... well, almost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5aK12lpLW2sSQn1yuerHthBd2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408238'),
