  ('387898051089720277', 'The New Adventures of Pinocchio', 1999, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Anderson, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Tom Sheppard, Sherry Mills', 'Martin Landau, Udo Kier, Gabriel Thomson, Gemma Gregory, Warwick Davis, Sarah Alexander, Simon Schatzberger, Philip Philmar', 'NR', 'Puppeteer Geppetto becomes a puppet himself after drinking an elixir that Pinocchio bought from a traveling carnival.', 'Puppeteer Geppetto becomes a puppet himself after drinking an elixir that Pinocchio bought from a traveling carnival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2RQ54SqnN5NfxXgKOE9uRQGb2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256075'),
  ('853485093034557129', 'The New Adventures of Pippi Longstocking', 1988, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Ken Annakin, Roland "Ozzie" Smith', 'Ken Annakin', 'Tami Erin, David Seaman, Cory Crow, Eileen Brennan, Dennis Dugan, Dianne Hull, George DiCenzo, Dick Van Patten', 'G', 'After her father''s ship is carried off by a sudden storm, the spunky Pippi Longstocking is stranded with her horse, Alfonso,and her pet monkey, Mr. Neilson, and takes up residence in the old family home, which is thought by neighborhood children to be haunted. Soon, two children, Tommy and his sister Anika, venture into the house only to meet up with Pippi. The three soon become friends and get into various adventures together, including cleaning the floor with scrubbing shoes, dodging the "splunks", going down a waterfall in barrels, and helping Pippi with the problem of having to go to an orphanage. Older children will probably get the most out of this movie.', 'After her father''s ship is carried off by a sudden storm, the spunky Pippi Longstocking is stranded with her horse, Alfonso,and her pet monkey, Mr. Neilson, and takes up residence in the old family home, which is thought by neighborhood children to be haunted. Soon, two children, Tommy and his sister Anika, venture into the house only to meet up with Pippi. The three soon become friends and get into various adventures together, including cleaning the floor with scrubbing shoes, dodging the "splunks", going down a waterfall in barrels, and helping Pippi with the problem of having to go to an orphanage. Older children will probably get the most out of this movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9o3WEzGjr36YjqTnzuikxHvyET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19051'),
  ('92775054780636560', 'The New Adventures of the Elusive Avengers', 1968, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Edmond Keosayan, Fyodor Dobronravov, Artashes Vanetsian', 'Artur Makarov, Edmond Keosayan', 'Mikhail Metyolkin, Vasiliy Vasilev, Viktor Kosykh, Valentina Kurdyukova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Boris Sichkin, Arkadi Tolbuzin, Vladimir Ivashov', null, 'The action takes place in 1920 during the Civil War. Crimea on the eve of complete liberation from the White Guards. Returning from patrol, the four brave “elusive” knocked down an airplane. In the field bag of the captured pilot, they find a secret report, which speaks of the existence of defensive fortifications around the coastal city, which the Reds have yet to take. Young heroes get the task to get a map of fortifications and go to the city...', 'The action takes place in 1920 during the Civil War. Crimea on the eve of complete liberation from the White Guards. Returning from patrol, the four brave “elusive” knocked down an airplane. In the field bag of the captured pilot, they find a secret report, which speaks of the existence of defensive fortifications around the coastal city, which the Reds have yet to take. Young heroes get the task to get a map of fortifications and go to the city...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy7RVuhoUR53txkGRUeVCQfTNM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65591'),
  ('13449618199245790', 'The New Age', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Tolkin, John J. Campbell', 'Michael Tolkin', 'Peter Weller, Judy Davis, Patrick Bauchau, Rachel Rosenthal, Adam West, Paula Marshall, Bruce Ramsay, Tanya Pohlkotte', null, 'Peter and Katherine Witner are Southern California super-yuppies with great jobs but no center to their lives. When they both lose their jobs and begin marital infidelities, their solution is to start their own business together. In order to find meaning to their empty lives, they follow various New Age gurus and other such groups. Eventually, they hit rock bottom and have to make some hard decisions.', 'Peter and Katherine Witner are Southern California super-yuppies with great jobs but no center to their lives. When they both lose their jobs and begin marital infidelities, their solution is to start their own business together. In order to find meaning to their empty lives, they follow various New Age gurus and other such groups. Eventually, they hit rock bottom and have to make some hard decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0qZgxIlGRPsgamNjIUDKhLmZGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41588'),
  ('910628353993044049', 'The New Babylon', 1929, 'Drama, History', 'Leonid Trauberg, Grigori Kozintsev, Andrey Moskvin', 'Leonid Trauberg, Grigori Kozintsev', 'Yelena Kuzmina, Pyotr Sobolevsky, David Gutman, Sofiya Magarill, Andrei Kostrichkin, Sergei Gerasimov, Yanina Zheymo, Arnold Arnold', null, 'In the short-lived Commune of Paris, a conscripted soldier falls in love with a Communard saleswoman. As the army cracks down on the revolutionaries, the soldier is forced to fight against the Commune, and the pair''s love is put to the test.', 'In the short-lived Commune of Paris, a conscripted soldier falls in love with a Communard saleswoman. As the army cracks down on the revolutionaries, the soldier is forced to fight against the Commune, and the pair''s love is put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNCqMzEEuE8JqBYlCqgNJR9IIrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151068'),
  ('42123335169912089', 'The New Barbarians', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Fausto Zuccoli', 'Tito Carpi, Enzo G. Castellari, Antonio Visone', 'Giancarlo Prete, Fred Williamson, George Eastman, Anna Kanakis, Ennio Girolami, Venantino Venantini, Massimo Vanni, Giovanni Frezza', 'R', 'Two mercenaries help wandering caravans fight off an evil and aimless band of white-clad bikers after the nuclear holocaust.', 'Two mercenaries help wandering caravans fight off an evil and aimless band of white-clad bikers after the nuclear holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1CfbdztfE2WiLBVXtA6OFO1TLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48490'),
  ('684351577754349777', 'The New Boy', 2023, 'Drama', 'Warwick Thornton, James Dubay, Kate Larmer', 'Warwick Thornton', 'Cate Blanchett, Deborah Mailman, Wayne Blair, Aswan Reid, Kenneth Radley, Shane Mckenzie Brady, Tyrique Brady, Laiken Woolmington', null, 'In 1940s Australia, a nameless nine-year-old Aboriginal orphan arrives in the dead of night at a remote monastery overseen by a renegade nun, where his presence disturbs its delicately balanced world.', 'In 1940s Australia, a nameless nine-year-old Aboriginal orphan arrives in the dead of night at a remote monastery overseen by a renegade nun, where his presence disturbs its delicately balanced world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0hNRXZtGaON1wBPqPI4oe1V4CU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937161'),
  ('526424649473971013', 'The New Centurions', 1972, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Richard Fleischer, Ralph Woolsey', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'George C. Scott, Stacy Keach, Jane Alexander, Scott Wilson, Rosalind Cash, Erik Estrada, Clifton James, Richard E. Kalk', 'R', 'An idealistic rookie cop joins the LAPD to make ends meet while finishing law school, and is indoctrinated by a seasoned veteran. As time goes on, he loses his ambitions and family as police work becomes his entire life.', 'An idealistic rookie cop joins the LAPD to make ends meet while finishing law school, and is indoctrinated by a seasoned veteran. As time goes on, he loses his ambitions and family as police work becomes his entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0ve9VvbFKo2LA0HhVbLE9vazCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37608'),
  ('959289593458012422', 'The New Cinderella', 1964, 'Comedy, Music', 'George Sherman, Antonio L. Ballesteros, Manuel de la Cueva', 'Alfonso Paso, Matthew Andrews, Arturo Rígel', 'Marisol, Antonio ''el Bailarín'', Robert Conrad, Fernando Rey, Antonio Casal, Fernando Sancho, Guillermo Marín, Francisco Camoiras', null, 'Antonio, the famous dancer is preparing a big performance for the TV. But he is missing a good female dancer. One day he sees a girl dancing in the streets but when he is going to talk to her she runs away. She lost one of her shoes and this will be the only hint Antonio will have to find her. She is the new Cinderella.', 'Antonio, the famous dancer is preparing a big performance for the TV. But he is missing a good female dancer. One day he sees a girl dancing in the streets but when he is going to talk to her she runs away. She lost one of her shoes and this will be the only hint Antonio will have to find her. She is the new Cinderella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KKIYlxcDX6JS1bPUS4gWzLWpGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216971'),
  ('1090225519426647750', 'The New Comics', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Alessandro D''Eva, Maria Pia Rocco', 'Alessandro Bencivenni, Domenico Saverni, Piero De Bernardi', 'Paolo Villaggio, Renato Pozzetto, Ramona Bădescu, Antonio Allocca, Roberto Caporali, Denis Ganiò, Claudia Zaccari, Gianluigi Ghione', null, 'Third chapter of the Comic saga, with Paolo Villaggio and Renato Pozzetto. Four different gags. From two electricians who combine all kinds of things during a theatrical performance, to competing for the attention of a beautiful girl during a campsite, to hired bodyguards of a judge threatened by the mafia, and finally as the adoptive parents of a newborn found outside the door of the house.', 'Third chapter of the Comic saga, with Paolo Villaggio and Renato Pozzetto. Four different gags. From two electricians who combine all kinds of things during a theatrical performance, to competing for the attention of a beautiful girl during a campsite, to hired bodyguards of a judge threatened by the mafia, and finally as the adoptive parents of a newborn found outside the door of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbcrzKi4qdQ0D5vEokTQCOlpvRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43649'),
  ('888424212151311379', 'The New Daughter', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Checco Varese, Chip Signore, Luiso Berdejo', 'John Travis', 'Kevin Costner, Ivana Baquero, Gattlin Griffith, Samantha Mathis, Noah Taylor, Amanda Garsys, Mark Charles Davis, Edmund Entin', 'PG-13', 'John James is a writer; his wife has left him. He moves with his two middle-school children to an isolated house off a dirt road in South Carolina. The property has an Indian burial mound, which fascinates his daughter, Louisa, who''s entering puberty.', 'John James is a writer; his wife has left him. He moves with his two middle-school children to an isolated house off a dirt road in South Carolina. The property has an Indian burial mound, which fascinates his daughter, Louisa, who''s entering puberty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU5uJoWAcwNVH84G736i4f7oVot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37534'),
  ('52818297344814757', 'The New Eve', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Corsini, Agnès Godard', 'Catherine Corsini, Marc Syrigas', 'Karin Viard, Pierre-Loup Rajot, Catherine Frot, Sergi López, Mireille Roussel, Nozha Khouadra, Laurent Lucas, Valentine Vidal', null, 'Camille is an emancipated 30-something woman who has no desire to settle down and have a family, preferring to coast along on a succession of ephemeral relationships and one-night stands. However, her lifestyle fails to satisfy her fully, and in a moment of depression she runs into a complete stranger, Alexis, whom she instantly falls in love with. Alexis, alas, is married, with two children, and works for the Socialist Party. None of this is going to deter Camille though…', 'Camille is an emancipated 30-something woman who has no desire to settle down and have a family, preferring to coast along on a succession of ephemeral relationships and one-night stands. However, her lifestyle fails to satisfy her fully, and in a moment of depression she runs into a complete stranger, Alexis, whom she instantly falls in love with. Alexis, alas, is married, with two children, and works for the Socialist Party. None of this is going to deter Camille though…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeveJbgNPLqbFipW1aAjSpnirQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18460'),
  ('559167266003385122', 'The New Frontier', 1935, 'Western', 'Carl Pierson, Harry Neumann, Gus Peterson', 'Robert Emmett Tansey', 'John Wayne, Muriel Evans, Warner Richmond, Al Bridge, Sam Flint, Murdock MacQuarrie, Allan Cavan, Mary MacLaren', null, 'In 1889 pioneers race ahead of the law to claim free land in Oklahoma, forming wide-open towns. In one such, citizens elect Milt Dawson to challenge the self-appointed rule of gambler Ace Holmes, only to have him shot in the back. But leading the next batch of settlers is Milt''s quick-on-the-draw son John, who gets help from friendly outlaws.', 'In 1889 pioneers race ahead of the law to claim free land in Oklahoma, forming wide-open towns. In one such, citizens elect Milt Dawson to challenge the self-appointed rule of gambler Ace Holmes, only to have him shot in the back. But leading the next batch of settlers is Milt''s quick-on-the-draw son John, who gets help from friendly outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1fBHosVGrozxtEgoC3WkgK167C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229401'),
  ('343169384152436284', 'The New Girl', 2021, 'Drama', 'Federico Lastra, Micaela Gonzalo', 'Micaela Gonzalo, Lucía Tebaldi', 'Mora Arenillas, Rafael Federman, Jimena Anganuzzi, Luciano Cazaux, Laila Maltz, Marta Salinas, Juliana Simoes Risso, Stella Maris Maidana', null, 'Jimena travels to Río Grande, on the island of Tierra del Fuego in southernmost Argentina, to join her half-brother Mariano. She has almost no money to travel but manages to arrive there hoping to have a better life in that manufacturing region. The wind, the cold and the complex economic crisis form the background against in which Jimena will develop empathy for the people around her and a feeling of belonging there, but also a place where she will learn to know herself better.', 'Jimena travels to Río Grande, on the island of Tierra del Fuego in southernmost Argentina, to join her half-brother Mariano. She has almost no money to travel but manages to arrive there hoping to have a better life in that manufacturing region. The wind, the cold and the complex economic crisis form the background against in which Jimena will develop empathy for the people around her and a feeling of belonging there, but also a place where she will learn to know herself better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYtJzrrioN2TLQkldsfi4cM5E65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802567'),
  ('345922144531193480', 'The New Girlfriend', 2014, 'Drama', 'François Ozon, Pascal Marti, Antoinette Boulat', 'François Ozon', 'Romain Duris, Anaïs Demoustier, Raphaël Personnaz, Isild Le Besco, Aurore Clément, Jean-Claude Bolle-Reddat, Claudine Chatel, Anita Gillier', null, 'A young woman makes a surprising discovery about the husband of her late best friend.', 'A young woman makes a surprising discovery about the husband of her late best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miW6zqiLFXY3uOrN4Ehpho2DMBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283726'),
  ('960536572965638237', 'The New Gulliver', 1935, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Nikolai Renkov', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Grigoriy Roshal, Sigizmund Krzhizhanovsky', 'Vladimir Konstantinov, Ivan Yudin, Ivan Bobrov, Mikhail Dagmarov, Fyodor Brest', null, 'The story, a Communist re-telling of Gulliver''s Travels, is about a young boy who dreams of himself as a version of Gulliver who has landed in Lilliput suffering under capitalist inequality and exploitation.', 'The story, a Communist re-telling of Gulliver''s Travels, is about a young boy who dreams of himself as a version of Gulliver who has landed in Lilliput suffering under capitalist inequality and exploitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAaNyzcizsLSi5Ek9pwxpyc9nK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152948'),
  ('1069554939551867071', 'The New Guy', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Ed Decter, Michael D. O''Shea, Vincent Palmo Jr.', 'David Kendall', 'DJ Qualls, Eliza Dushku, Zooey Deschanel, Lyle Lovett, Jerod Mixon, Illeana Douglas, Parry Shen, Kurt Fuller', 'PG-13', 'Nerdy high school senior Dizzy Harrison has finally gotten lucky -- after purposely getting expelled, he takes lessons in ''badass cool'' from a convict and enrolls at a new school. But can he keep up the ruse?', 'Nerdy high school senior Dizzy Harrison has finally gotten lucky -- after purposely getting expelled, he takes lessons in ''badass cool'' from a convict and enrolls at a new school. But can he keep up the ruse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aekXSzkn3zry6aummMl7AU4rSa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10985'),
  ('1137436046051930372', 'The New Invisible Man', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, Raúl Martínez Solares, Mario Cisneros', 'Julio Alejandro, Alfredo B. Crevenna', 'Arturo de Córdova, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Augusto Benedico, Raúl Meraz, Néstor de Barbosa, Jorge Mondragón, José Muñoz, Roberto G. Rivera', null, 'A man is sentenced to prison for a murder he did not commit. Thanks to a serum invented by his brother, he manages to become invisible and escape from prison in order to prove his innocence, while his brother works feverishly to find an antidote. Theatrically released in USA in Spanish language only; later English-dubbed version syndicated directly to television.', 'A man is sentenced to prison for a murder he did not commit. Thanks to a serum invented by his brother, he manages to become invisible and escape from prison in order to prove his innocence, while his brother works feverishly to find an antidote. Theatrically released in USA in Spanish language only; later English-dubbed version syndicated directly to television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAGHjwCp1Rt0mmqsCwqjP5jMkmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92708'),
  ('780785116459392585', 'The New Kid', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Natalie Engelstein, Rudi Rosenberg, Nicolas Loir', 'Igor Gotesman, Bruno Muschio', 'Réphaël Ghrenassia, Joshua Raccah, Géraldine Martineau, Guillaume Cloud-Roussel, Johanna Lindstedt, Max Boublil, Eythan Chiche, Iléana Courbey', null, 'Benoît, the new kid at school, is bullied by a gang of arrogant boys. Determined not to be pushed around, Benoît organizes a big party, but only three students turn up. What if this bunch of losers was to be the best gang ever?', 'Benoît, the new kid at school, is bullied by a gang of arrogant boys. Determined not to be pushed around, Benoît organizes a big party, but only three students turn up. What if this bunch of losers was to be the best gang ever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg7MuAFkD8MW35MkWcbrLnkeiWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358430'),
  ('802569616237688932', 'The New Kids', 1985, 'Drama, Crime, Horror', 'Harry V. Bring, Brian E. Frankish, Sean S. Cunningham', 'Stephen Gyllenhaal', 'Lori Loughlin, Jean De Baer, James Spader, Paige Price, John Philbin, Vince Grant, Margaret Welsh, Brian Wimmer', 'R', 'A brother and his young sister come to a small town to find out a local gang terrorizes the population.', 'A brother and his young sister come to a small town to find out a local gang terrorizes the population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFmDfsFgEtqhc49e95QK1rvg2l7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72508'),
  ('977328258213356870', 'The New Land', 1972, 'Drama, Western, History', 'Jan Troell, Jan Troell', 'Bengt Forslund, Jan Troell', 'Max von Sydow, Liv Ullmann, Eddie Axberg, Pierre Lindstedt, Allan Edwall, Monica Zetterlund, Hans Alfredson, Agneta Prytz', 'PG', 'A Swedish immigrant family struggles to adapt to their new life on the American frontier during the second half of the 19th century amidst civil war, native uprising and the lure of gold in California.', 'A Swedish immigrant family struggles to adapt to their new life on the American frontier during the second half of the 19th century amidst civil war, native uprising and the lure of gold in California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC9SDdBwCa0FGckc76q1MBxlks9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42488'),
  ('1136410608411173425', 'The New Life of Paul Sneijder', 2016, 'Drama', 'Thomas Vincent, Ronald Plante', 'Yaël Cojot-Goldberg, Thomas Vincent', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Géraldine Pailhas, Guillaume Cyr, Pierre Curzi, Gabriel Sabourin, Hugo Dubé, Aliocha Schneider, Alexa-Jeanne Dubé', null, 'Following a rare accident, Paul Sneijder opened his eyes to the reality of his life as a "senior manager" in Montreal: his work no longer interested him, his wife annoyed him and deceived him, his two sons despised him ... How can we continue to live under these conditions? Starting with a change of profession: dog walker for example! Will his relatives accept this change that will turn him into a free man?', 'Following a rare accident, Paul Sneijder opened his eyes to the reality of his life as a "senior manager" in Montreal: his work no longer interested him, his wife annoyed him and deceived him, his two sons despised him ... How can we continue to live under these conditions? Starting with a change of profession: dog walker for example! Will his relatives accept this change that will turn him into a free man?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55KErHWVB6Vnx31wJx0EUSSaT0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395449'),
  ('875521217225561033', 'The New Monsters', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Dino Risi, Claudio Risi', 'Agenore Incrocci, Ruggero Maccari, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Alberto Sordi, Vittorio Gassman, Ugo Tognazzi, Ornella Muti, Eros Pagni, Aiche Nana, Luigi Diberti, Paolo Baroni', null, 'A comedy film composed of 14 episodes. It is a sequel to I mostri, made in 1963. 1. The Finch of Val Padouan (Ettore Scola) - 2. Tantum ergo (Dino Risi) - 3. Hitchhiking (Mario Monicelli) - 4. Kidnapping of a Beloved Person (Ettore Scola) - 5. First Aid (Mario Monicelli) - 6. Big Boy to His Little Mother (Dino Risi) - 7. Model Citizen (Ettore Scola) - 8. Pornodiva (Dino Risi) - 9. Like a Queen (Ettore Scola) - 10. Inn! (Ettore Scola) - 11. Without Words (Dino Risi) - 12. The Funeral Oration (Ettore Scola)', 'A comedy film composed of 14 episodes. It is a sequel to I mostri, made in 1963. 1. The Finch of Val Padouan (Ettore Scola) - 2. Tantum ergo (Dino Risi) - 3. Hitchhiking (Mario Monicelli) - 4. Kidnapping of a Beloved Person (Ettore Scola) - 5. First Aid (Mario Monicelli) - 6. Big Boy to His Little Mother (Dino Risi) - 7. Model Citizen (Ettore Scola) - 8. Pornodiva (Dino Risi) - 9. Like a Queen (Ettore Scola) - 10. Inn! (Ettore Scola) - 11. Without Words (Dino Risi) - 12. The Funeral Oration (Ettore Scola)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcDAZ2pSmS6fgJKB8lEqlEhA8d2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45004'),
  ('820413600813612467', 'The New Monsters Today', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Federico Masiero', 'Marco Tiberi, Enrico Oldoini, Franco Ferrini', 'Claudio Bisio, Diego Abatantuono, Sabrina Ferilli, Angela Finocchiaro, Carlo Buccirosso, Neri Marcorè, Giorgio Panariello, Massimo Giletti', null, 'Talks about the fears, vices and weaknesses that bedevil the contemporary Italian society. Highlights the degeneration that is plaguing certain quarters of the Italian society today.', 'Talks about the fears, vices and weaknesses that bedevil the contemporary Italian society. Highlights the degeneration that is plaguing certain quarters of the Italian society today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UrZAxxGgAOKDRExOV4A5Ntm688.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56971'),
  ('274624825458514083', 'The New Moscow', 1938, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Aleksandr Medvedkin, Igor Gelein, Yevgeni Nesterov', 'Aleksandr Medvedkin', 'Daniil Sagal, Nina Alisova, Mariya Barabanova, Mariya Blyumental-Tamarina, Pavel Sukhanov, Aleksei Alekseyev, Aleksandr Grave, Mikhail Rumyantsev', null, 'A comedy about a naive young architect and his wild designs for a “New Moscow.” The Soviet censors weren''t at all amused and shelved it.', 'A comedy about a naive young architect and his wild designs for a “New Moscow.” The Soviet censors weren''t at all amused and shelved it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10u8JrSuhmuuR5mgrNDgQhoSYhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262882'),
  ('1042363790498185365', 'The New Mutants', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Josh Boone, Peter Deming, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Josh Boone, Knate Gwaltney', 'Blu Hunt, Charlie Heaton, Maisie Williams, Henry Zaga, Anya Taylor-Joy, Alice Braga, Adam Beach, Happy Anderson', 'PG-13', 'Five young mutants, just discovering their abilities while held in a secret facility against their will, fight to escape their past sins and save themselves.', 'Five young mutants, just discovering their abilities while held in a secret facility against their will, fight to escape their past sins and save themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiDGcXJTvu1lazFRYip6g1eLt9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340102'),
  ('476385058468815408', 'The New Neighbor', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Donald moves into a new home, and discovers his new neighbor is a slob, a mooch, and has a dog that comes crashing through the fence and digging in Donald''s garden. Eventually it escalates into a full-scale war, with crowds cheering and TV coverage.', 'Donald moves into a new home, and discovers his new neighbor is a slob, a mooch, and has a dog that comes crashing through the fence and digging in Donald''s garden. Eventually it escalates into a full-scale war, with crowds cheering and TV coverage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45USBj5Cuqvso8g5wsxe0QXhbfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67593'),
  ('925993855496554712', 'The New One-Armed Swordsman', 1971, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Chang Cheh, Liu Tien-Min, Lee Kwok-Keung', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Li Ching, Ku Feng, Chan Sing, Wong Chung, Liu Gang, Huang Pei-Chih', 'R', 'Lei Li lost his right-arm in a sword duel with the master of a martial arts school, long ago. Now, he is able to defend himself well with just his left arm, and kung fu techniques. That he proves with just the help of his friend Chung-Chieng, when he crosses his path with a beautiful girl in need, Pao Chiao. Even against impossible odds, he will prove a great warrior.', 'Lei Li lost his right-arm in a sword duel with the master of a martial arts school, long ago. Now, he is able to defend himself well with just his left arm, and kung fu techniques. That he proves with just the help of his friend Chung-Chieng, when he crosses his path with a beautiful girl in need, Pao Chiao. Even against impossible odds, he will prove a great warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80wyNgKIPJCMTb8lzaG9rbezV10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28039'),
  ('794446470108556744', 'The New Protocol', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Thomas Vincent, Dominique Bouilleret', 'Éric Besnard, Thomas Vincent', 'Clovis Cornillac, Marie-Josée Croze, Dominique Reymond, Stéphane Hillel, Gilles Cohen, Xavier Boulanger, Frédéric Bocquet, Suzanne Wognin', null, 'A man investigating his son''s death learns some horrific truths about the pharmaceutical industry.', 'A man investigating his son''s death learns some horrific truths about the pharmaceutical industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va9E1rZj79Ph8FAvdNzsuBjPxDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31340'),
  ('637754215422169986', 'The New Romantic', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carly Stone, Mike McLaughlin', 'Carly Stone', 'Jessica Barden, Hayley Law, Brett Dier, Avan Jogia, Timm Sharp, Camila Mendes, Ivy Matheson, Eva Link', null, 'In order to escape her looming post-graduation fate that includes student debt and zero romantic prospects, Blake Conway becomes a sugar baby. As the aspiring journalist and hopeless romantic documents the adventure, she sets out on a quest to figure out if society is right to judge these women and if her own self worth comes with a price.', 'In order to escape her looming post-graduation fate that includes student debt and zero romantic prospects, Blake Conway becomes a sugar baby. As the aspiring journalist and hopeless romantic documents the adventure, she sets out on a quest to figure out if society is right to judge these women and if her own self worth comes with a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh6oz3RoKwTIqvcFLQ1dEqNWCCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497864'),
  ('630954823891469664', 'The New Shaolin Boxers', 1976, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Alexander Fu Sheng, Jenny Tseng, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Lu Ti, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Chen Hui-Lou, Shan Mao', null, 'An honourable carriage driver finds love and death when he battles particularly homicidal street punks', 'An honourable carriage driver finds love and death when he battles particularly homicidal street punks', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH7BetLzC51L19YAV4v10LmTmzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75832'),
  ('579918036243793281', 'The New Snow White', 2011, 'Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Laurent Bénégui, Ali Lakrouf', 'Laurent Bénégui', 'Lou de Laâge, Claire Keim, Bruno Solo, Armelle, Benoît Maréchal, Alain Fromager, Louka Masset, Jonas Hamon', null, 'Stéphane Leroy, a wealthy industrialist, is in a coma. His diabolical wife, Gabrielle, prepares to inherit everything when she discovers that Stéphane has a daughter, Blanche. During a casting, Blanche catches the eye of Adrien Neige, a famous photographer.', 'Stéphane Leroy, a wealthy industrialist, is in a coma. His diabolical wife, Gabrielle, prepares to inherit everything when she discovers that Stéphane has a daughter, Blanche. During a casting, Blanche catches the eye of Adrien Neige, a famous photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKnqB6rVYjp1b02sDA4qZP9ER0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97055'),
  ('390136242126210046', 'The New Spirit', 1942, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson, Ben Sharpsteen, Louis Debney', null, 'Clarence Nash, Fred Shields, Cliff Edwards', 'NR', 'Animated documentary promoting timely filing and payment of Federal income taxes, demonstrated by Donald Duck''s difficulties with his tax return.', 'Animated documentary promoting timely filing and payment of Federal income taxes, demonstrated by Donald Duck''s difficulties with his tax return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sG5gPi4VNKVbhXsJYvSgEgrx7C7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64701'),
  ('335929706836018730', 'The New Swiss Family Robinson', 1998, 'Adventure, Action, TV Movie', 'Willy Kurant, Stewart Raffill', 'Stewart Raffill', 'Jane Seymour, David Carradine, James Keach, John Asher, Blake Bashoff, Jamie Renée Smith, Simone Griffeth, Yumi Iwama', 'PG', 'When Angelino Jack Robinson gets a new job in Australia, he decides to take his sissy wife Ann, brave sons Shane and Todd and wining daughter Elisabeth ''Lizzy'' by sailing yacht from Hong Kong to Syndney. The gun he gets thrown in by Sheldon Blake proves disabled, and for a sinister reason: near Borneo, Blake''s men turn up to capture them. The family escapes but loses the yacht on a reef. They build a cool camp on an island. But the pirates keep coming back, and the boys discover why: he hid a treasure in the yacht. Shane is also discovered and captured in more then one way by French plane wreck survivor Françoise, who later teams up with the family.', 'When Angelino Jack Robinson gets a new job in Australia, he decides to take his sissy wife Ann, brave sons Shane and Todd and wining daughter Elisabeth ''Lizzy'' by sailing yacht from Hong Kong to Syndney. The gun he gets thrown in by Sheldon Blake proves disabled, and for a sinister reason: near Borneo, Blake''s men turn up to capture them. The family escapes but loses the yacht on a reef. They build a cool camp on an island. But the pirates keep coming back, and the boys discover why: he hid a treasure in the yacht. Shane is also discovered and captured in more then one way by French plane wreck survivor Françoise, who later teams up with the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjeLGi0TtkuTDzpVi5tamhPcxY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9810'),
  ('1081586319760282992', 'The New Tenants', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Joachim Back, Kija Brooks, Paweł Edelman', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'David Rakoff, Jamie Harrold, Vincent D''Onofrio, Kevin Corrigan, Helen Hanft, Liane Balaban', null, 'A prying neighbor, a glassy-eyed drug dealer, and a husband brandishing both a weapon and a vendetta make up the welcome wagon. Set amidst the as-yet-unopened boxes and the hopes for a fresh start of two men on what might just be the worst moving day ever. Their new apartment reveals its terrifying history in a film that is by turns funny, frightening, and unexpectedly romantic.', 'A prying neighbor, a glassy-eyed drug dealer, and a husband brandishing both a weapon and a vendetta make up the welcome wagon. Set amidst the as-yet-unopened boxes and the hopes for a fresh start of two men on what might just be the worst moving day ever. Their new apartment reveals its terrifying history in a film that is by turns funny, frightening, and unexpectedly romantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2f0ZRTa4wzMdRFq7ZptC0vnFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47798'),
  ('383890824679113127', 'The New Testament', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Sacha Guitry, Jean Bachelet, Maurice Wolf', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Jacqueline Delubac, Betty Daussmond, Pauline Carton, Marguerite Templey, Charles Dechamps, Christian Gérard, Louis Kerly', null, 'Husbands and wives, lovers and gigolos, all break a sweat when Dr. Marcelin’s newly-revised last will and testament is prematurely exposed.', 'Husbands and wives, lovers and gigolos, all break a sweat when Dr. Marcelin’s newly-revised last will and testament is prematurely exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FCpPWvNdYs1zjyHMxyw2CidDP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76697'),
  ('194710406521028827', 'The New Toy', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'James Huth, Stéphane Le Parc, Bénédicte Dujardin', 'Sonja Shillito', 'Daniel Auteuil, Jamel Debbouze, Alice Belaïdi, Simon Faliu, Lucie Fabry, Anna Cervinka, Laurent Saint-Gérard, Salim Kissari', null, 'Samy lives happily with his wife, Alice, in a poor urban housing project amongst friends and neighbours. For his son’s birthday, the richest man in France throws open his grand department store, offering the boy whatever he wants. Alexandre chooses Samy, the night watchman, as his new toy…', 'Samy lives happily with his wife, Alice, in a poor urban housing project amongst friends and neighbours. For his son’s birthday, the richest man in France throws open his grand department store, offering the boy whatever he wants. Alexandre chooses Samy, the night watchman, as his new toy…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCSxzI0Y0pX6pqD69CusJhvQtIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865498'),
  ('14456355404145560', 'The New Watchdogs', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Gilles Balbastre, Yannick Kergoat', 'Serge Halimi, Pierre Rimbert', 'Renaud Lambert, Nicolas Sarkozy, Laurent Joffrin, Arnaud Lagardère, Alain Duhamel, Michel Naudy, Frédéric Lordon, Jean Gadrey', null, 'In 1932, the writer Paul Nizan published "The New Watchdogs" to denounce the philosophers and writers of his time who, sheltering behind intellectual neutrality, imposed themselves as true watchdogs of the established order. Today the watchdogs are journalists, editors, and media experts who''ve openly become market evangelists and guardians of the social order. In a sardonic manner, "The New Watchdogs" denounces this press that, claiming to be independent, objective and pluralist, makes out it is a democratic force of opposition. With forcefulness and precision, the film puts its finger on the increasing danger of information produced by the major industrial groups of the Paris Stock Exchange and perverted into merchandise.', 'In 1932, the writer Paul Nizan published "The New Watchdogs" to denounce the philosophers and writers of his time who, sheltering behind intellectual neutrality, imposed themselves as true watchdogs of the established order. Today the watchdogs are journalists, editors, and media experts who''ve openly become market evangelists and guardians of the social order. In a sardonic manner, "The New Watchdogs" denounces this press that, claiming to be independent, objective and pluralist, makes out it is a democratic force of opposition. With forcefulness and precision, the film puts its finger on the increasing danger of information produced by the major industrial groups of the Paris Stock Exchange and perverted into merchandise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbE3Gcz3C22rl8G2L2KaemDcgg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150049'),
  ('531400372740366379', 'The New World', 1995, 'Drama', 'Alain Corneau, William Lubtchansky', 'Alain Corneau, Pascal Quignard', 'Nicolas Chatel, Sarah Grappin, James Gandolfini, Alicia Silverstone, Guy Marchand, Baptiste Trotignon, Sylvie Granotier, Dany Brillant', null, 'A young boy who worships all things American comes of age in Orleans, where over 14,000 American GIs were stationed.', 'A young boy who worships all things American comes of age in Orleans, where over 14,000 American GIs were stationed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBRRpbNROVOUVVl9jBLqhKB02Rq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230326'),
  ('1114180200048747861', 'The New World', 2005, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Terrence Malick, Emmanuel Lubezki, Jonathan Short', 'Terrence Malick', 'Colin Farrell, Q''orianka Kilcher, Christopher Plummer, Christian Bale, August Schellenberg, Wes Studi, David Thewlis, Yorick van Wageningen', 'PG-13', 'A drama about explorer John Smith and the clash between Native Americans and English settlers in the 17th century.', 'A drama about explorer John Smith and the clash between Native Americans and English settlers in the 17th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPyWMlQd54r3pK17GKG3iqjvNZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11400'),
  ('857598772690505887', 'The New Year That Never Came', 2024, 'Drama', 'Bogdan Mureșanu', 'Bogdan Mureșanu', 'Adrian Văncică, Nicoleta Hâncu, Emilia Dobrin, Iulian Postelnicu, Mihai Călin, Andrei Miercure, Luca Toma, Ioana Flora', null, 'The New Year That Never Came is a tragicomedy whose action takes place in a single day, before the counter-revolution of 1989, in which the characters search for normality, safety, love, freedom and meaning in an absurd world.', 'The New Year That Never Came is a tragicomedy whose action takes place in a single day, before the counter-revolution of 1989, in which the characters search for normality, safety, love, freedom and meaning in an absurd world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AxoszYlyv6qkFzRxLmlsc3pcs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320276'),
  ('634688989931440841', 'The New Year''s Rate Plan', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Evgeniy Bedarev, Maksim Shinkorenko, Danila Palatkin', 'Elena Laskareva, Anastasiya Volkova', 'Maksim Matveev, Valeriya Lanskaya, Svetlana Sukhanova, Boris Korchevnikov, Ekaterina Malikova, Evgeniy Slavskiy, Roman Polyanskiy, Miroslava Karpovich', null, 'Performing the traditional New Year''s call on the unknown phone number Andrey didn''t even suspected, that just after his return to Moscow, he had bought a magic starting pack of cellular communications operator. Getting through to the deserted in New Year''s eve Alyona, Andrey almost falls in love with her, but there exists a temporal problem. Alyona is celebrating coming 2008 year and Andrey is going to meet 2009. Trying "to set a contact" with Alyona''s «future variant» he comes to know the terrible truth about the events, that appended in the end of 2008. Now the main goal of Andrey and all his friends - to prevent the awful tragedy and to turn into reality the meeting of Alyona and Andrey...', 'Performing the traditional New Year''s call on the unknown phone number Andrey didn''t even suspected, that just after his return to Moscow, he had bought a magic starting pack of cellular communications operator. Getting through to the deserted in New Year''s eve Alyona, Andrey almost falls in love with her, but there exists a temporal problem. Alyona is celebrating coming 2008 year and Andrey is going to meet 2009. Trying "to set a contact" with Alyona''s «future variant» he comes to know the terrible truth about the events, that appended in the end of 2008. Now the main goal of Andrey and all his friends - to prevent the awful tragedy and to turn into reality the meeting of Alyona and Andrey...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0u0g46kxym6UuGkXAv1ehfBHzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50530'),
  ('795257794398966818', 'The New York Ripper', 1982, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Luigi Kuveiller, Lucio Fulci, Marisa Agostini', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Lucio Fulci, Gianfranco Clerici', 'Jack Hedley, Almanta Suska, Howard Ross, Andrea Occhipinti, Alexandra Delli Colli, Paolo Malco, Cinzia de Ponti, Cosimo Cinieri', 'NR', 'A burned-out New York police detective teams up with a college psychoanalyst to track down a vicious serial killer randomly stalking and killing various young women around the city.', 'A burned-out New York police detective teams up with a college psychoanalyst to track down a vicious serial killer randomly stalking and killing various young women around the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm4z31RpL96WrHmVCohU3NZyb6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30874'),
