  ('10679746674522571', 'The Next Best Thing', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Elliot Davis, John Schlesinger', 'Tom Ropelewski', 'Madonna, Rupert Everett, Benjamin Bratt, Malcolm Stumpf, Josef Sommer, Suzanne Krull, Linda Larkin, Illeana Douglas', 'PG-13', 'A comedy-drama about best friends - one a straight woman, Abbie, the other a gay man, Robert - who decide to have a child together. Five years later, Abbie falls in love with a straight man and wants to move away with her and Robert''s little boy Sam, and a nasty custody battle ensues.', 'A comedy-drama about best friends - one a straight woman, Abbie, the other a gay man, Robert - who decide to have a child together. Five years later, Abbie falls in love with a straight man and wants to move away with her and Robert''s little boy Sam, and a nasty custody battle ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYK1ZUtY4etcn91glUmrGuZRH6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1831'),
  ('1149134030028164091', 'The Next Generation Patlabor: Tokyo War', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Kensuke Sonomura, Hiroshi Machida', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Toshio Kakei, Erina Mano, Seiji Fukushi, Rina Ohta, Yoshinori Horimoto, Kohei Shiotsuka, Yoshikatsu Fujiki, Shigeru Chiba', null, 'An attack takes place on Rainbow Bridge in Odaiba, Tokyo by the fighter helicopter `Gray Ghost`. 2 days earlier, the Gray Ghost was stolen. The perpetrators are followers of Yukihito Tsuge. Yukihito Tsuge planned a coup of Tokyo 13 years earlier. The leader of Special Vehicle Section 2, Keiji Gotoda, sets out to stop the terrorists.', 'An attack takes place on Rainbow Bridge in Odaiba, Tokyo by the fighter helicopter `Gray Ghost`. 2 days earlier, the Gray Ghost was stolen. The perpetrators are followers of Yukihito Tsuge. Yukihito Tsuge planned a coup of Tokyo 13 years earlier. The leader of Special Vehicle Section 2, Keiji Gotoda, sets out to stop the terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eUCbteVJWXs22u1VKeoMYIlNLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254538'),
  ('669402484155571193', 'The Next Karate Kid', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Family, Adventure', 'Christopher Cain, László Kovács, Joy Todd', 'Mark Lee', 'Pat Morita, Hilary Swank, Michael Ironside, Constance Towers, Chris Conrad, Arsenio Trinidad, Michael Cavalieri, Walton Goggins', 'PG', 'Mr. Miyagi decides to take Julie, a troubled teenager, under his wing after he learns that she blames herself for her parents'' demise and struggles to adjust with her grandmother and fellow pupils.', 'Mr. Miyagi decides to take Julie, a troubled teenager, under his wing after he learns that she blames herself for her parents'' demise and struggles to adjust with her grandmother and fellow pupils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wI3gCi9w1cuUJCiwhviAy46we9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11231'),
  ('759212517315378984', 'The Next Man', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'Richard C. Sarafian, Alan Hopkins, Barry Blackmore', 'Morton S. Fine, Richard C. Sarafian, Alan Trustman', 'Sean Connery, Cornelia Sharpe, Albert Paulsen, Adolfo Celi, Marco St. John, Ted Beniades, Billie Perkins, Bob Balhatchet', null, 'Khalil is an Arab diplomat who wants to not only make peace with Israel, but admit the Jewish state as a member of OPEC. This instantly makes him a target for a series of ingeniously conceived assassination attempts, most of which he foils with the aid of his friend Hamid and his girlfriend Nicole. But can he trust even them?', 'Khalil is an Arab diplomat who wants to not only make peace with Israel, but admit the Jewish state as a member of OPEC. This instantly makes him a target for a series of ingeniously conceived assassination attempts, most of which he foils with the aid of his friend Hamid and his girlfriend Nicole. But can he trust even them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nByL99cOHyRK0tTSW1v4y94WIY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86133'),
  ('18895683757855594', 'The Next Skin', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Isa Campo, Diego Dussuel', 'Isa Campo, Isaki Lacuesta', 'Emma Suárez, Àlex Monner, Sergi López, Bruno Todeschini, Igor Szpakowski, Greta Fernández, Sílvia Bel, Mikel Iglesias', null, 'A teenager who went missing and was presumed dead returns home after eight years to find a family deeply affected by his disappearance. Gradually, doubts arise about whether he really is the missing boy or an impostor.', 'A teenager who went missing and was presumed dead returns home after eight years to find a family deeply affected by his disappearance. Gradually, doubts arise about whether he really is the missing boy or an impostor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqvK13zn79uTytYk41CKuQKCp9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348555'),
  ('138488189110996216', 'The Next Three Days', 2010, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Paul Haggis, Stéphane Fontaine, David B. Nowell', 'Guillaume Lemans, Fred Cavayé', 'Russell Crowe, Elizabeth Banks, Brian Dennehy, RZA, Moran Atias, Olivia Wilde, Jason Beghe, Nazanin Boniadi', 'PG-13', 'A married couple''s life is turned upside down when the wife is accused of murdering her boss. Her husband John would spend the next few years trying to get her released, but there''s no evidence that negates the evidence against her. When the strain of being separated from her husband and son gets to her, John decides to find a way to break her out.', 'A married couple''s life is turned upside down when the wife is accused of murdering her boss. Her husband John would spend the next few years trying to get her released, but there''s no evidence that negates the evidence against her. When the strain of being separated from her husband and son gets to her, John decides to find a way to break her out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBaRZ3aHa7qoYTSY0ONbXrXYk4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43539'),
