  ('903048195715758321', 'The Nifty Nineties', 1941, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Riley Thomson', null, 'Walt Disney, Thelma Boardman, Florence Gill, Ward Kimball, Fred Moore', 'NR', 'Mickey courts Minnie in the Gay Nineties: they take in a vaudeville show and go for a drive in his horseless carriage, to the strains of "While Strolling Through the Park" and "In the Good Old Summertime". Goofy rides by on a penny-farthing bicycle, and the whole Duck family rides by on a bicycle built for five.', 'Mickey courts Minnie in the Gay Nineties: they take in a vaudeville show and go for a drive in his horseless carriage, to the strains of "While Strolling Through the Park" and "In the Good Old Summertime". Goofy rides by on a penny-farthing bicycle, and the whole Duck family rides by on a bicycle built for five.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sWf8Jirs4ilLcUBTyGSQP7xRA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67594'),
  ('347610822049013226', 'The Night', 1999, 'Animation, Drama', 'Regina Pessoa', 'Yann thual', 'Maria Póvoa da Cruz', null, 'It''s the story of a child and her mother, two lives that don''t communicate with each other. Is that loneliness that sometimes reaches the size of the night. Dark is the night. Dark is the mother. And dark becomes the entire Universe when you are alone and abandoned.', 'It''s the story of a child and her mother, two lives that don''t communicate with each other. Is that loneliness that sometimes reaches the size of the night. Dark is the night. Dark is the mother. And dark becomes the entire Universe when you are alone and abandoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZd70ToN4CZn0inhpr4u0k4WXqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145278'),
