  ('57866145149985039', 'The Night', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Tsai Ming-liang', 'Tsai Ming-liang', null, null, 'In 2019, the night in Hong Kong was still in fascinating beauty and the landscape of everyday life was gradually changing. Travelling the streets, Tsai Ming-liang documented the city''s rhythm and ambience, along with an overpass.', 'In 2019, the night in Hong Kong was still in fascinating beauty and the landscape of everyday life was gradually changing. Travelling the streets, Tsai Ming-liang documented the city''s rhythm and ambience, along with an overpass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56cGHfCgCaZwHjg37vp45hxlHWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854531'),
  ('69201571338732411', 'The Night Affair', 1958, 'Crime, Thriller, Romance', 'Gilles Grangier, Paul Joly, Louis Page', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean Gabin, Danielle Darrieux, Nadja Tiller, Paul Frankeur, Hazel Scott, Robert Manuel, Robert Berri, François Chaumette', 'NR', 'Vallois, a vice inspector for the Paris police, takes special interest in the plight of drug-addicted Lucky (Najda Tiller), whom he considers to be more victim than criminal. Taking it upon himself to wean Lucky away from narcotics, Vallois also wins her love -- and, incidentally, smashes the dope ring responsible for her addiction.', 'Vallois, a vice inspector for the Paris police, takes special interest in the plight of drug-addicted Lucky (Najda Tiller), whom he considers to be more victim than criminal. Taking it upon himself to wean Lucky away from narcotics, Vallois also wins her love -- and, incidentally, smashes the dope ring responsible for her addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPXZx1NLLRGFgb3xSZDI375mTxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76644'),
  ('563640580755332946', 'The Night Before', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Thom Eberhardt, Ronald Víctor García', 'Thom Eberhardt, Gregory Scherick', 'Keanu Reeves, Lori Loughlin, Theresa Saldana, Trinidad Silva, Suzanne Snyder, Ned Bellamy, Diane Rodriguez, Tommy Lister Jr.', 'PG-13', 'A popular beauty surprisingly asks a nerd to take her to the prom. He wakes up hours later in a sleazy alley. She''s missing but he remembers nothing about it.', 'A popular beauty surprisingly asks a nerd to take her to the prom. He wakes up hours later in a sleazy alley. She''s missing but he remembers nothing about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3GOrWh7ytlKsdOGI77WFauZORr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38966'),
  ('235228367103629717', 'The Night Before', 2015, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jonathan Levine, Jonathan Watson, Sandi Greenberg', 'Evan Goldberg, Kyle Hunter, Jonathan Levine', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Seth Rogen, Anthony Mackie, Lizzy Caplan, Jillian Bell, Mindy Kaling, Michael Shannon, Lorraine Toussaint', 'R', 'In New York City for their annual tradition of Christmas Eve debauchery, three lifelong best friends set out to find the Holy Grail of Christmas parties since their yearly reunion might be coming to an end.', 'In New York City for their annual tradition of Christmas Eve debauchery, three lifelong best friends set out to find the Holy Grail of Christmas parties since their yearly reunion might be coming to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfeNBaiMBg0UQsBQFv1qsjTjZWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296100'),
  ('339148121849116892', 'The Night Before Christmas', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Donald Novis, Kenny Baker', 'NR', 'A narrator sings the opening stanzas of the classic poem while we see the house at rest. Santa lands on the roof, comes down the chimney, and opens his bag. The toys march out and decorate the tree, with the toy soldiers shooting balls from their cannon, a toy airplane stringing a garland like skywriting, and the toy firemen applying snow. A blimp delivers the star to the top. Meanwhile, Santa fills the stockings. His laughter awakens the children, who sneak out. The toys rush to their places, and Santa escapes up the chimney just in time.', 'A narrator sings the opening stanzas of the classic poem while we see the house at rest. Santa lands on the roof, comes down the chimney, and opens his bag. The toys march out and decorate the tree, with the toy soldiers shooting balls from their cannon, a toy airplane stringing a garland like skywriting, and the toy firemen applying snow. A blimp delivers the star to the top. Meanwhile, Santa fills the stockings. His laughter awakens the children, who sneak out. The toys rush to their places, and Santa escapes up the chimney just in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTPupN46NmWuHzpM23E46rek3By.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53929'),
  ('576795444535298476', 'The Night Before Christmas', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Frank Graham', 'NR', 'It''s snowy and cold outside, and warm inside where Jerry squeezes past a mousetrap to cavort under a present-laden Christmas tree. Mistaking the sleeping Tom for a plush toy, Jerry wakes him and a mad chase ensues.', 'It''s snowy and cold outside, and warm inside where Jerry squeezes past a mousetrap to cavort under a present-laden Christmas tree. Mistaking the sleeping Tom for a plush toy, Jerry wakes him and a mad chase ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9one6E51wGqCEMsC0AXzC7jjkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39894'),
  ('78503649113441172', 'The Night Before Christmas', 1951, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Valentina Brumberg, Zinaida Brumberg, Elena Petrova', 'Zinaida Brumberg, Valentina Brumberg, Mikhail Yanshin', 'Vladimir Gribkov, Aleksei Gribov, Liliya Gritsenko, Nikolai Gritsenko, Mikhail Yanshin, Vera Maretskaya, Aleksei Zhiltsov', null, 'Based on the work of Nikolay Gogol. Handsome blacksmith Vakula who fell in love with village beauty, Oksana, is ready to do anything for her liking. Even to fly on the devil''s back to Saint-Petersburg and ask the Empress for the slippers that he can present his sweetheart.', 'Based on the work of Nikolay Gogol. Handsome blacksmith Vakula who fell in love with village beauty, Oksana, is ready to do anything for her liking. Even to fly on the devil''s back to Saint-Petersburg and ask the Empress for the slippers that he can present his sweetheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JclRvxO6u5kyJkpTi5GCGRYPOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72210'),
  ('405639907978489638', 'The Night Before Enlisting', 2016, 'Romance', 'Yoo Seung-taek', null, 'Kim Seung-wook, Han Seol-hwa, Heo Yoon-joo, Kim Sang-cheol-I, Lim Hyeong-soon, Moon Yoo-seong, Kim Hye-jin, Min Joon', null, 'Three nights before enlisting, Seung-wook decides to leave his mark since he can''t avoid the military so he flirts with everyone. However, his school senior So-yoon nor his blind date Il-hong will fall for him. The night before he leaves for the army, Seung-wook decides he''s going to see some action with the two girls. The project of ''leaving a mark'' starts now.', 'Three nights before enlisting, Seung-wook decides to leave his mark since he can''t avoid the military so he flirts with everyone. However, his school senior So-yoon nor his blind date Il-hong will fall for him. The night before he leaves for the army, Seung-wook decides he''s going to see some action with the two girls. The project of ''leaving a mark'' starts now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sITpyNP0k8GkW9NVAhCgHJnlJPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391423'),
  ('386866920143936347', 'The Night Before the Exams', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fausto Brizzi, Denver M. Beattie, Chiara della Longa', 'Fausto Brizzi, Marco Martani', 'Giorgio Faletti, Cristiana Capotondi, Nicolas Vaporidis, Sarah Maestri, Chiara Mastalli, Andrea De Rosa, Eros Galbiati, Elena Bouryka', null, 'Rome, 1989. On his last day of high school, Luca gets in trouble when he takes it all out on hated literature teacher Martinelli, only to discover he''s going to be heading the examination board for his finals. During a summer of fruitless study, he falls in love with a girl he met once at a party, unaware that she''s Martinelli''s daughter. The latter, strangely enough, has just offered Luca to prepare with him...', 'Rome, 1989. On his last day of high school, Luca gets in trouble when he takes it all out on hated literature teacher Martinelli, only to discover he''s going to be heading the examination board for his finals. During a summer of fruitless study, he falls in love with a girl he met once at a party, unaware that she''s Martinelli''s daughter. The latter, strangely enough, has just offered Luca to prepare with him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7IhjqqCQSQchXjoYGdFFZOhxvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33365'),
  ('802832096235317838', 'The Night Before the Exams Today', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Fausto Brizzi, Alessandro Pascuzzo, Marcello Montarsi', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi', 'Giorgio Panariello, Nicolas Vaporidis, Carolina Crescentini, Serena Autieri, Paola Onofri, Chiara Mastalli, Sarah Maestri, Andrea De Rosa', null, 'In 2006, as World Cup fever sweeps Italy, high school senior Luca falls hard for dolphin trainer Azzurra and stumbles on a family secret -- right before his exams.', 'In 2006, as World Cup fever sweeps Italy, high school senior Luca falls hard for dolphin trainer Azzurra and stumbles on a family secret -- right before his exams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxIHTUTflZjFK9EfwKQguBoxu8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54309'),
  ('676083211153757237', 'The Night Belongs to Lovers', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Julien Hilmoine, Yoann de Montgrand', 'Julien Hilmoine', 'Laura Müller, Schemci Lauth', null, 'An encounter. Between waves and cliffs. The night. In a week, he gets married. For years, she no longer believes in pleasure. They meet. They play. They speak. They want each other. As a gift - unconditionally. Like a dance - on the edge of the void. For one night. One night only. Their only night.', 'An encounter. Between waves and cliffs. The night. In a week, he gets married. For years, she no longer believes in pleasure. They meet. They play. They speak. They want each other. As a gift - unconditionally. Like a dance - on the edge of the void. For one night. One night only. Their only night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7BHluWuDVffDWU1ijWmd2DM5hZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784130'),
  ('618195805702874501', 'The Night Beyond the Tricornered Window', 2021, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Yukihiro Morigaki, Tetsuya Kondoh', 'Tomoko Aizawa', 'Masaki Okada, Jun Shison, Yurina Hirate, Kenichi Takitoh, Yuki Sakurai, Emi Wakui, Makita Sports, Michitaka Tsutsui', null, 'Bookstore clerk Mikado sees ghosts. When exorcist Hiyakawa pulls him into a cursed murder case, the two uncover dark truths—and the killer’s voice still lingers.', 'Bookstore clerk Mikado sees ghosts. When exorcist Hiyakawa pulls him into a cursed murder case, the two uncover dark truths—and the killer’s voice still lingers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42aFRkGzVy9y66o5nVgfGwhKxhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695244'),
  ('860383767132858558', 'The Night Brings Charlie', 1990, 'Horror', 'Tom Logan, Glenn Kral', 'Bruce Carson', 'Chuck Whiting, Al Arasim, Joe Fishback, Aimee Tenaglia, Monica Simmons, George Carter, Robin Krasny, James O''Donnell', null, 'Upon the return of Charlie Puckett to the small town of Pakoe, a series of teenage beheadings begin. Intent on finding the culprit, Sherrif Carl Carson soon begins to suspect that Charlie''s return may be more than meets the eye.', 'Upon the return of Charlie Puckett to the small town of Pakoe, a series of teenage beheadings begin. Intent on finding the culprit, Sherrif Carl Carson soon begins to suspect that Charlie''s return may be more than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6SWBQUQ2abVqahqWxFS105X9Wq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222900'),
  ('268192319236580538', 'The Night Caller', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'John Gilling, Stephen Dade', 'Jim O''Connolly', 'John Saxon, Patricia Haines, Alfred Burke, Maurice Denham, John Carson, Ballard Berkeley, Stanley Meadows, Barbara French', 'NR', 'The inhabitants of Ganymede need to find mates from another world or they will become extinct. They soon discover a suitable breeding stock amongst the females of planet Earth.', 'The inhabitants of Ganymede need to find mates from another world or they will become extinct. They soon discover a suitable breeding stock amongst the females of planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qkW6ZkGonvfjjUD2z3mWbTwmyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42869'),
  ('158926903309731780', 'The Night Caller', 1975, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Henri Verneuil, Jean Penzer', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Charles Denner, Adalberto Maria Merli, Rosy Varte, Jean Martin, Lea Massari, Jean-François Balmer, Catherine Morin', 'R', 'A serial-killer frightens Paris by phoning young ladies at night, telling them insults about their lives. Minos, as he calls himself, wants to prevent the world from free women and he targets at first these ones. Commissaire Letellier is given the investigation and he has hard work with the maniac.', 'A serial-killer frightens Paris by phoning young ladies at night, telling them insults about their lives. Minos, as he calls himself, wants to prevent the world from free women and he targets at first these ones. Commissaire Letellier is given the investigation and he has hard work with the maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6GSsxdP7OqpV67724sNivK2GWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40180'),
  ('518390896898850472', 'The Night Child', 1975, 'Horror', 'Massimo Dallamano, Franco Delli Colli', 'Franco Marotta, Massimo Dallamano, Laura Toscano', 'Richard Johnson, Joanna Cassidy, Ida Galli, Edmund Purdom, Nicoletta Elmi, Lila Kedrova, Riccardo Garrone, Dana Ghia', 'R', 'The titular medallion is a gift presented to young Nicole Elmi. Once the girl places the gift around her neck, she is possessed by the spirit of a dead child who was a murderess.', 'The titular medallion is a gift presented to young Nicole Elmi. Once the girl places the gift around her neck, she is possessed by the spirit of a dead child who was a murderess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cm6m3Skn7loka4MhW1CQdg5aBHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27706'),
  ('333197965179309089', 'The Night Clerk', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Raphaël Jacoulot', 'Lise Macheboeuf, Raphaël Jacoulot', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Vincent Rottiers, Ludmila Mikaël, Sylvie Testud, Céline Sallette, François Perrot, Xavier Robic, India Hair', null, 'Frédéric, a young man with a troubled past, has the good fortune to be given a job in a luxurious mountain hotel. When one of the hotel guests disappears one evening and is later found dead, Frédéric suspects he may have been killed by the family who employ him. But rather than betray his boss, Jacques Couvreur, he makes up his mind to protect him. Unwittingly, Frédéric puts himself in grave danger...', 'Frédéric, a young man with a troubled past, has the good fortune to be given a job in a luxurious mountain hotel. When one of the hotel guests disappears one evening and is later found dead, Frédéric suspects he may have been killed by the family who employ him. But rather than betray his boss, Jacques Couvreur, he makes up his mind to protect him. Unwittingly, Frédéric puts himself in grave danger...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eetIMh4yO8qzoC0LQutYGelcWLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69106'),
  ('412470497916034787', 'The Night Clerk', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Marty Jedlicka, Michael Cristofer, Rich Delia', 'Michael Cristofer', 'Tye Sheridan, Ana de Armas, John Leguizamo, Helen Hunt, Jacque Gray, Johnathon Schaech, Joey Miyashima, Austin Archer', 'R', 'Hotel night clerk Bart Bromley is a highly intelligent young man on the Autism spectrum. When a woman is murdered during his shift, Bart becomes the prime suspect. As the police investigation closes in, Bart makes a personal connection with a beautiful guest named Andrea, but soon realises he must stop the real murderer before she becomes the next victim.', 'Hotel night clerk Bart Bromley is a highly intelligent young man on the Autism spectrum. When a woman is murdered during his shift, Bart becomes the prime suspect. As the police investigation closes in, Bart makes a personal connection with a beautiful guest named Andrea, but soon realises he must stop the real murderer before she becomes the next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPWjid7yMatyIDHvku7lCMN7zSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526007'),
  ('361629297205785444', 'The Night Crew', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Anthony J. Rickert-Epstein, Christian Sesma', 'Christian Sesma, Paul Sloan', 'Jason Mewes, Danny Trejo, Chasty Ballesteros, Luke Goss, Bokeem Woodbine, Christine Nguyen, Jacqueline Lord, Roberto ''Sanz'' Sanchez', null, 'A group of hard up bounty hunters must survive the night in a desert motel against a horde of savage cartel killers. They soon realize that their fugitive, a mysterious Chinese woman, is much more than she lets on.', 'A group of hard up bounty hunters must survive the night in a desert motel against a horde of savage cartel killers. They soon realize that their fugitive, a mysterious Chinese woman, is much more than she lets on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yirA1oqwcKZ7VAblb3mC15V0z3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251387'),
  ('1060474334663375882', 'The Night Doctor', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Chizallet, Elie Wajeman', 'Agnès Feuvre, Elie Wajeman', 'Vincent Macaigne, Pio Marmaï, Sara Giraudeau, Sarah Le Picard, Florence Janas, Lou Lampros, Ernst Umhauer, Sergio Cavero Egusquiza', null, 'Mikael is doctor on night call. It’s a vocation. Between two patient-visits in slum areas, he cares for those whom no one else wants to see: the drug addicts, the homeless… He rubs shoulders with destitution. His life is in shambles. Especially when it comes to his pharmacist cousin who makes him write false prescriptions for Subutex. Overnight, he decides to get out of drug trafficking and rebuild his life. But there will be a heavy price to pay.', 'Mikael is doctor on night call. It’s a vocation. Between two patient-visits in slum areas, he cares for those whom no one else wants to see: the drug addicts, the homeless… He rubs shoulders with destitution. His life is in shambles. Especially when it comes to his pharmacist cousin who makes him write false prescriptions for Subutex. Overnight, he decides to get out of drug trafficking and rebuild his life. But there will be a heavy price to pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stD3UNUIfqrLzyjzdop4pE0GArR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712124'),
  ('1131018002840229577', 'The Night Eats the World', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Bénédicte Dujardin, Benjamin Papin, Dominique Rocher', 'Guillaume Lemans, Jérémie Guez, Dominique Rocher', 'Anders Danielsen Lie, Golshifteh Farahani, Denis Lavant, Sigrid Bouaziz, David Kammenos, Jean-Yves Cylly, Nancy Murillo, Lina-Rose Djedje', null, 'After waking up to find himself all alone in an apartment where a massive party was being held the night before, Sam is immediately forced to face a terrifying reality: the living dead have invaded the streets of Paris.', 'After waking up to find himself all alone in an apartment where a massive party was being held the night before, Sam is immediately forced to face a terrifying reality: the living dead have invaded the streets of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rR2PxT0clt1Hhw5Cv0YGk5DD2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457955'),
  ('757366014061009324', 'The Night Evelyn Came Out of the Grave', 1971, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Emilio P. Miraglia, Gastone Di Giovanni', 'Massimo Felisatti, Fabio Pittorru, Emilio P. Miraglia', 'Anthony Steffen, Marina Malfatti, Enzo Tarascio, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Umberto Raho, Roberto Maldera, Joan C. Davis, Erika Blanc', 'R', 'A rich, mentally-unstable man with a penchant for playing deadly S&M games with women who resemble his dead wife, sparks off a chain of bizarre events after getting remarried.', 'A rich, mentally-unstable man with a penchant for playing deadly S&M games with women who resemble his dead wife, sparks off a chain of bizarre events after getting remarried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUMDXrKxPRZeNQgKDG5bl3FQ2Zd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42499'),
  ('402889139676126212', 'The Night Flier', 1997, 'Horror, Mystery', 'David Connell, Mark Pavia', 'Jack O''Donnell, Mark Pavia', 'Miguel Ferrer, Julie Entwisle, Dan Monahan, Michael H. Moss, John Bennes, Beverly Skinner, Rob Wilds, Richard K. Olsen', 'R', 'For cynical tabloid journo Richard Dees, facts are always stranger than fiction. Every headline is a dead-line. Serial killers, UFO abductions, tales of molestation, mayhem and murder. To some the tales are mere sleazy fantasy – but his faithful readers believe. And now there''s a new story: The Night Flier. What is it that travels by night in a dark-winged Cessna, lands at secluded airfields and murders local residents? Dees begins to track the unknown killer in a Cessna of his own, uncovering clues that reveal a pilot more terrifying than he could have ever imagined.', 'For cynical tabloid journo Richard Dees, facts are always stranger than fiction. Every headline is a dead-line. Serial killers, UFO abductions, tales of molestation, mayhem and murder. To some the tales are mere sleazy fantasy – but his faithful readers believe. And now there''s a new story: The Night Flier. What is it that travels by night in a dark-winged Cessna, lands at secluded airfields and murders local residents? Dees begins to track the unknown killer in a Cessna of his own, uncovering clues that reveal a pilot more terrifying than he could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bMb6CzdKfpw0pZWVW2RbQRneIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12238'),
  ('401284203862206000', 'The Night Guard', 2016, 'Drama', 'Diego Ros, Jonathan Hernández', 'Diego Ros', 'Leonardo Alonso, Juan Carlos Vives, Ricardo Esquerra, Salomón Santiago, Izmir Gallardo, Iván Cortes, Ari Gallegos, Héctor Holten', null, 'Humberto works as a night watchman at a remote and desolate construction site. One night he becomes, unwittingly, the sole witness to a cover up. Afraid of being retaliated against lest he come forth, he decides to keep quiet. Gradually and without him being aware of it, Humberto ends up inflicting on his family the same violence from which he´s running away.', 'Humberto works as a night watchman at a remote and desolate construction site. One night he becomes, unwittingly, the sole witness to a cover up. Afraid of being retaliated against lest he come forth, he decides to keep quiet. Gradually and without him being aware of it, Humberto ends up inflicting on his family the same violence from which he´s running away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4UscptlmEIyMYYfN9FCiclCspe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264400'),
  ('1112750772021633622', 'The Night Has Eyes', 1942, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Leslie Arliss, Günther Krampf', 'John Argyle, Leslie Arliss', 'James Mason, Wilfrid Lawson, Mary Clare, Joyce Howard, Tucker McGuire, John Fernald, Dorothy Black, Amy Dalby', 'NR', 'Two teachers, man-hungry Doris and restrained Marian, visit the Yorkshire moors a year after friend Evelyn disappeared there. On a stormy night, they take refuge in the isolated cottage of Stephen, one-time pianist shell-shocked in the Spanish Civil War. Doris flees as soon as the flood subsides; but Marian''s suspicions about Evelyn''s fate, in conflict with her growing love for Stephen, prompt her to stay on among the misty bogs.', 'Two teachers, man-hungry Doris and restrained Marian, visit the Yorkshire moors a year after friend Evelyn disappeared there. On a stormy night, they take refuge in the isolated cottage of Stephen, one-time pianist shell-shocked in the Spanish Civil War. Doris flees as soon as the flood subsides; but Marian''s suspicions about Evelyn''s fate, in conflict with her growing love for Stephen, prompt her to stay on among the misty bogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe2iCC78TsPDCOxeYEmyEUWzbH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111066'),
  ('569765389017195076', 'The Night Heaven Fell', 1958, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Roger Vadim, Jacques Météhen, Armand Thirard', 'Jacques Rémy, Roger Vadim', 'Brigitte Bardot, Alida Valli, Stephen Boyd, José Nieto, Fernando Rey, Maruchi Fresno, Adriano Domínguez, José Marco Davó', 'NR', 'Ursula finishes her studies and returns to her aunt Florentine and uncle, Ribera who is the count. She falls in love with Lambert, the killer of her uncle.', 'Ursula finishes her studies and returns to her aunt Florentine and uncle, Ribera who is the count. She falls in love with Lambert, the killer of her uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ryj6nsAaSKQlEmg3wtqHAWKFgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66967'),
  ('1152000466483412172', 'The Night Holds Terror', 1955, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Andrew L. Stone, Fred Jackman Jr., Melville Shyer', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Jack Kelly, Hildy Parks, Vince Edwards, John Cassavetes, David Cross, Eddie Marr, Jack Kruschen, Joyce McCluskey', 'NR', 'A group of escaped convicts holds a household prisoner as the police close in.', 'A group of escaped convicts holds a household prisoner as the police close in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sIK8wFzkFyrQWOYJMY1LikTr84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43608'),
  ('98807549246259152', 'The Night House', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Karen Radzikowski, Erika McGowan, David Bruckner', 'Luke Piotrowski, Ben Collins', 'Rebecca Hall, Sarah Goldberg, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Evan Jonigkeit, Stacy Martin, David Abeles, Christina Jackson, Patrick Klein', 'R', 'Reeling from the unexpected death of her husband, Beth is left alone in the lakeside home he built for her. Soon she begins to uncover her recently deceased husband''s disturbing secrets.', 'Reeling from the unexpected death of her husband, Beth is left alone in the lakeside home he built for her. Soon she begins to uncover her recently deceased husband''s disturbing secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqs2CXpc4d5FzeP1EZCYItAVo81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547565'),
  ('456071279428861312', 'The Night I Fought Against God', 2024, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Fernández Engler, Diego Arroyo', 'Rodrigo Fernández Engler', 'Tomás Kirzner, Carolina Kopelioff, Luciano Cáceres, Andrés Irusta, Marcelo Polakoff, Antonio Cataldi, Zuin Raúl Ermede, Alberto Leiva', null, 'On July 18, 1994, young Benjamín Sheinberg begins his first day as a resident doctor at the Hospital de Clínicas, in Buenos Aires, while at the same time a bomb explodes at the AMIA, causing the death of 85 people. Sheinberg is overwhelmed by the situation that affects him beyond his professional level and decides to go to Israel. There, with the help of Rubén, an old friend of his grandfather, he will “travel” in time, entering the ancient history of Israel, seeing himself reflected in the ancient character Jacob. But what connection is there between both characters?', 'On July 18, 1994, young Benjamín Sheinberg begins his first day as a resident doctor at the Hospital de Clínicas, in Buenos Aires, while at the same time a bomb explodes at the AMIA, causing the death of 85 people. Sheinberg is overwhelmed by the situation that affects him beyond his professional level and decides to go to Israel. There, with the help of Rubén, an old friend of his grandfather, he will “travel” in time, entering the ancient history of Israel, seeing himself reflected in the ancient character Jacob. But what connection is there between both characters?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kx2pehQgSSn8oT9AuOk3H5ILOWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987678'),
  ('92677722182252800', 'The Night I Swam', 2018, 'Drama', 'Damien Manivel, Igarashi Kohei', 'Damien Manivel, Igarashi Kohei', 'Kogawa Takara, Takashi Kogawa, Keiki Kogawa, Chisato Kogawa, Yûji Kudô', null, 'Snow covered mountains in Japan. Every night, a fisherman makes his way to the market in town. His 6 year old son is awoken by his departure and finds it impossible to fall back to sleep. In the sleeping household, the young boy draws a picture he then slips into his satchel. On his way to school, still drowsy, he strays off the path and wanders into the snow...', 'Snow covered mountains in Japan. Every night, a fisherman makes his way to the market in town. His 6 year old son is awoken by his departure and finds it impossible to fall back to sleep. In the sleeping household, the young boy draws a picture he then slips into his satchel. On his way to school, still drowsy, he strays off the path and wanders into the snow...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFAz97rEy9rt4SbwcFhMfKvsW5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474206'),
  ('893526745178020858', 'The Night Is My Kingdom', 1951, 'Drama', 'Georges Lacombe, Philippe Agostini', 'Marcel Rivet', 'Jean Gabin, Simone Valère, Suzanne Dehelly, Robert Arnoux, Gérard Oury, Marthe Mercadier, Jacques Dynam, Cécile Didier', null, 'After an accident, Raymond has gone blind. His family treats him like a child, but fortunately a nun comes to his rescue. She works in a center where blind people learn to read using the Braille alphabet.', 'After an accident, Raymond has gone blind. His family treats him like a child, but fortunately a nun comes to his rescue. She works in a center where blind people learn to read using the Braille alphabet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MHLzVkkTm7e8munjVk7llMIgMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78515'),
  ('446041350008128009', 'The Night It Rained', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Kamran Shirdel', 'Esmail Nooriala, Kamran Shirdel', 'Nosratollah Karimi', null, 'Initially banned for seven years, the film treats the questionable and controversial newspaper story of a heroic village boy who prevented a train disaster as an antiauthoritarian, Rashomon-like puzzle.', 'Initially banned for seven years, the film treats the questionable and controversial newspaper story of a heroic village boy who prevented a train disaster as an antiauthoritarian, Rashomon-like puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cap3GX9JvYrPPH3Dfyk0oYDlMgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146345'),
  ('667135509022533733', 'The Night Listener', 2006, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lisa Rinzler, Patrick Stettner', null, 'Robin Williams, Toni Collette, Rory Culkin, Sandra Oh, Joe Morton, Bobby Cannavale, Rodrigo Lopresti, John Cullum', 'R', 'In the midst of his crumbling relationship, a radio show host begins speaking to his biggest fan—a young boy—via the telephone. But when questions about the boy''s identity come up, the host''s life is thrown into chaos.', 'In the midst of his crumbling relationship, a radio show host begins speaking to his biggest fan—a young boy—via the telephone. But when questions about the boy''s identity come up, the host''s life is thrown into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIQgviGRTxZ6o0iPooGUSn4Q1PW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9782'),
  ('912855793477882148', 'The Night My Dad Saved Christmas', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joaquín Mazón, Víctor Antolí, Alfonso Segura', 'Daniel Monedero, Francisco Arnal', 'Santiago Segura, Pablo Chiapella, Ernesto Sevilla, Unax Hayden, María Botto, Emilio Gavira, Paulina Dávila, Vadhir Derbez', null, 'What would happen if, one year, Santa Claus was forced to cancel his Christmas Eve appointment with the world’s children?A few days before Christmas, the famously cheerful and magical giver of gifts has an accident on his sleigh, right in the middle of Madrid. He ends up in hospital, which is where he’ll have to stay until after Christmas. Fortunately, the guy he’s sharing a room with at the hospital, Salva, is willing to step in and take on his all-important Christmas work. But it won’t be easy… the Christmas countdown clock is ticking and Salva has to find the reindeer, learn to fly the sleigh and, the most difficult part of all… learn to be a good person.', 'What would happen if, one year, Santa Claus was forced to cancel his Christmas Eve appointment with the world’s children?A few days before Christmas, the famously cheerful and magical giver of gifts has an accident on his sleigh, right in the middle of Madrid. He ends up in hospital, which is where he’ll have to stay until after Christmas. Fortunately, the guy he’s sharing a room with at the hospital, Salva, is willing to step in and take on his all-important Christmas work. But it won’t be easy… the Christmas countdown clock is ticking and Salva has to find the reindeer, learn to fly the sleigh and, the most difficult part of all… learn to be a good person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxKSoGWntSZuK2QtpZ2gpoKpd0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100763'),
  ('957456223876142033', 'The Night My Dad Saved Christmas 2', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joaquín Mazón, Ángel Iguacel', 'Francisco Arnal, Daniel Monedero', 'Santiago Segura, Ernesto Sevilla, Pablo Chiapella, María Botto, Unax Hayden, Emilio Gavira, Paulina Dávila, Vadhir Derbez', null, 'When Santa vanishes during a chaotic Christmas, a quirky actor tries to replace him. A father, his teen son and special friends must rescue Santa to save Christmas.', 'When Santa vanishes during a chaotic Christmas, a quirky actor tries to replace him. A father, his teen son and special friends must rescue Santa to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1YtLc6viVt93gOdU8SX7mnq22y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196207'),
  ('1097320311321853306', 'The Night My Mother Killed My Father', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Inés París, Néstor Calvo', 'Fernando Colomo, Inés París', 'Belén Rueda, Diego Peretti, Eduard Fernández, María Pujalte, Fele Martínez, Patricia Montero', null, 'Isabel is torn between the need to feel valued as an actress and her insecurities and contradictions. One night, she hosts a very special dinner: her husband Ángel, who is a scriptwriter, and Susana, Ángel''s ex-wife and film director, want to convince Argentinian actor Diego Peretti to star in a movie. But at some point something unexpected happens that surprises everyone and disturbs the evening.', 'Isabel is torn between the need to feel valued as an actress and her insecurities and contradictions. One night, she hosts a very special dinner: her husband Ángel, who is a scriptwriter, and Susana, Ángel''s ex-wife and film director, want to convince Argentinian actor Diego Peretti to star in a movie. But at some point something unexpected happens that surprises everyone and disturbs the evening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5khUZ1QWNUNd9Ryq56kRbDU1959.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367613'),
  ('884879390491899075', 'The Night My Number Came Up', 1955, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Leslie Norman, Lionel Banes, Tom Pevsner', 'R.C. Sherriff', 'Michael Redgrave, Sheila Sim, Alexander Knox, Denholm Elliott, Ursula Jeans, Bill Kerr, Ralph Truman, Michael Hordern', 'NR', 'British Air Marshal Hardie is attending a party in Hong Kong when he hears of a dream, told by a pilot, in which Hardie''s flight to Tokyo on a small Dakota propeller plane crashes on a Japanese beach. Hardie dismisses the dream as pure fantasy, but while he is flying to Tokyo the next day, circumstances start changing to align with the pilot''s vivid vision, and it looks like the dream disaster may become a reality.', 'British Air Marshal Hardie is attending a party in Hong Kong when he hears of a dream, told by a pilot, in which Hardie''s flight to Tokyo on a small Dakota propeller plane crashes on a Japanese beach. Hardie dismisses the dream as pure fantasy, but while he is flying to Tokyo the next day, circumstances start changing to align with the pilot''s vivid vision, and it looks like the dream disaster may become a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrIpXLmAHULKFSV3NB4SiNQ6DAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55380'),
  ('87333792181409212', 'The Night of a Thousand Cats', 1972, 'Horror', 'René Cardona Jr., Alex Phillips', 'René Cardona Jr., Mario A. Zacarías', 'Anjanette Comer, Zulma Faiad, Hugo Stiglitz, Christa Linder, Teresa Velázquez, Barbara Angely, Gerardo Zepeda, Jorge Russek', 'R', 'Lured to a demented playboy''s secluded castle for a romantic evening, unsuspecting women become dinner for his 1000 cats.', 'Lured to a demented playboy''s secluded castle for a romantic evening, unsuspecting women become dinner for his 1000 cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EKxgct1sMEt6B18RqpMp6VDQJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128971'),
  ('1140424595918000023', 'The Night of Bloody Horror', 1969, 'Horror', 'Joy N. Houck Jr., Robert A. Weaver', 'Joy N. Houck Jr., Robert A. Weaver', 'Gerald McRaney, Gaye Yellen, Herbert Nelson, Evelyn Hendricks, Bert Roberts, Gordon Ogden, Michael Anthony, Lisa Dameron', 'R', 'Wesley goes on a killing spree while experiencing the nightmares of his brother who was killed thirteen years earlier.', 'Wesley goes on a killing spree while experiencing the nightmares of his brother who was killed thirteen years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEvJ6DdwUHe4YqfRdYFL3T4MzYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77319'),
  ('579729212436683955', 'The Night of Counting the Years', 1969, 'Drama, History', 'Shadi Abdel Salam, Abdel Aziz Fahmy, Samir Aouf', 'Shadi Abdel Salam', 'Ahmed Marei, Ahmed Hegazi, Nadia Lotfi, Zouzou Hamdy ElHakim, Abdel Azim Abdel Haqq, Mohamed Nabih, Shafiq Nour ElDein, Mohamed Khairy', null, 'Set in 1881, a year before the start of British colonial rule, it is based on the true story of the Abd el-Rasuls, an Upper-Egyptian clan that had been robbing a cache of mummies they have discovered at tomb DB320 near the village of Kurna, and selling the artifacts on the black market. After a conflict within the clan, one of its members made a crucial decision when the Antiquities Service arrived.', 'Set in 1881, a year before the start of British colonial rule, it is based on the true story of the Abd el-Rasuls, an Upper-Egyptian clan that had been robbing a cache of mummies they have discovered at tomb DB320 near the village of Kurna, and selling the artifacts on the black market. After a conflict within the clan, one of its members made a crucial decision when the Antiquities Service arrived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyhW3umTG8qNrK4XjlXVtvpQ79F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46707'),
  ('920322368227518735', 'The Night of Martial Law', 1980, null, 'Yoshio Miyajima, Yōichi Sai, Kōsaku Yamashita', 'Mamoru Sasaki, Rô Takenaka', 'Takao Itō, Kanako Higuchi, Koji Tsuruta, Kei Satō, Gorō Ibuki, Minoru Ōki, Yoshio Inaba, Isamu Nagato', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8L9kVH0YpwsLEPklQVhZK983aPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721808'),
  ('1021057889374040244', 'The Night Of Open Sex', 1983, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco', null, 'Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Lorna Green, Albino Graziani, Juana de la Morena, Miguel Ángel Aristu, José Ferro, Jesús Franco', null, 'Moira, a beautiful cabaret dancer, is hired to impersonate another woman — who turns out to be a secret agent who must receive an important message that contains the hidden whereabouts of a very important character from World War II who once absconded with a vast fortune in gold.', 'Moira, a beautiful cabaret dancer, is hired to impersonate another woman — who turns out to be a secret agent who must receive an important message that contains the hidden whereabouts of a very important character from World War II who once absconded with a vast fortune in gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2iE7oYFAsg3Z1uVuLdiVQjA2jV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340663'),
  ('115373772539762694', 'The Night of Plastic Bags', 2018, 'Animation, Horror', 'Gabriel Harel', 'Gabriel Harel', 'Anne Steffens, Damien Bonnard, Manuel Castel, Barbara Joan Chossis', null, 'Agathe, 39, has but one obsession: to have a child. She finds her ex, Marc-Antoine, a DJ, mixing techno in Marseille. As she tries to talk to him into getting back together, plastic bags come to life and attack the city.', 'Agathe, 39, has but one obsession: to have a child. She finds her ex, Marc-Antoine, a DJ, mixing techno in Marseille. As she tries to talk to him into getting back together, plastic bags come to life and attack the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csBJrHC64FjaIxfrTtMFdE6b7JT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519137'),
  ('230855752861494787', 'The Night of Taneyamagahara', 2006, 'Animation', 'Kazuo Oga', 'Kazuo Oga', 'Hatsuo Yamaya, Shinchou Kokontei, Yuriko Ishida, Makoto Nonomura', null, 'Four farmers spend the night at a campfire. Three of them talk about work, nature and weather, while one of them has dreams about buying his own plot.', 'Four farmers spend the night at a campfire. Three of them talk about work, nature and weather, while one of them has dreams about buying his own plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHVeh0kWUvA9CbkppgD1a98C0Xn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54058'),
  ('605418063073091794', 'The Night of the 12th', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Stéphane Bidault, Patrick Ghiringhelli, Thierry Verrier', 'Gilles Marchand, Dominik Moll', 'Bastien Bouillon, Bouli Lanners, Anouk Grinberg, Mouna Soualem, Pauline Serieys, Théo Cholbi, Johann Dionnet, Thibaut Évrard', null, 'Young and ambitious Captain Vivés has just been appointed group leader at the Grenoble Criminal Squad when Clara''s murder case lands on his desk. Vivés and his team investigate Clara''s complex life and relations, but what starts as a professional and methodical immersion into the victim''s life soon turns into a haunting obsession.', 'Young and ambitious Captain Vivés has just been appointed group leader at the Grenoble Criminal Squad when Clara''s murder case lands on his desk. Vivés and his team investigate Clara''s complex life and relations, but what starts as a professional and methodical immersion into the victim''s life soon turns into a haunting obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IHnpje2aZ6TI6B385BqGfhcMuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925102'),
  ('36870197355989725', 'The Night of the Chupacabras', 2011, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Rodrigo Aragão', 'Rodrigo Aragão', 'Joel Caetano, Mayra Alarcón, Petter Baiestorf, Ricardo Araújo, Kika de Oliveira, Cristian Verardi, Eduardo Moraes, Markus Konká', null, 'Death and blood are in the middle of a feud between two families. Something creepy rounds the Silva Farm and makes its victims. The Carvalho Family, stuck to their past and hatred, can''t see the secular evil that approaches from the darken woods.', 'Death and blood are in the middle of a feud between two families. Something creepy rounds the Silva Farm and makes its victims. The Carvalho Family, stuck to their past and hatred, can''t see the secular evil that approaches from the darken woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zPkA2XIv09ddBPVW5Nnglm1ZEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200036'),
  ('179077060668541859', 'The Night of the Devils', 1972, 'Horror', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Manuel Berenguer, Gianni Siragusa', 'Eduardo Manzanos, Romano Migliorini, Gianbattista Mussetto', 'Gianni Garko, Agostina Belli, Roberto Maldera, Cinzia De Carolis, Teresa Gimpera, Bill Vanders, Umberto Raho, Maria Monti', 'NR', 'In this adaptation of Tolstoy''s story the Wurdulak, a mentally ill patient known as Nicola flashes back to horrifying experiences that he encountered while driving through the country. Upon damaging his car, Nicola sets out for help, only to meet a mysterious family that lives in total fear of someone or something. This evil force slowly penetrates the household and thrusts each of its members into a frenzy of absolute terror!', 'In this adaptation of Tolstoy''s story the Wurdulak, a mentally ill patient known as Nicola flashes back to horrifying experiences that he encountered while driving through the country. Upon damaging his car, Nicola sets out for help, only to meet a mysterious family that lives in total fear of someone or something. This evil force slowly penetrates the household and thrusts each of its members into a frenzy of absolute terror!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huYSfQPfHQoTSSco1YeS1YqqTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27409'),
  ('3153491395991423', 'The Night of the Following Day', 1969, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Hubert Cornfield, Willy Kurant, Georges Pellegrin', 'Hubert Cornfield, Robert Phippeny', 'Marlon Brando, Richard Boone, Rita Moreno, Pamela Franklin, Jess Hahn, Gérard Buhr, Jacques Marin, Hugues Wanner', 'R', 'A gang of four professional criminals kidnaps a wealthy teenage girl from an airport in Paris in a meticulous plan to extort money from the girl''s wealthy father. Holding her prisoner in an isolated beach house, the gang''s scheme runs perfectly until their personal demons surface and lead to a series of betrayals.', 'A gang of four professional criminals kidnaps a wealthy teenage girl from an airport in Paris in a meticulous plan to extort money from the girl''s wealthy father. Holding her prisoner in an isolated beach house, the gang''s scheme runs perfectly until their personal demons surface and lead to a series of betrayals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytqZNa8eZW1hrMAwDJzXbsz8zpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46495'),
  ('107767581006261929', 'The Night of the Generals', 1967, 'Thriller, Mystery, War, Crime', 'Anatole Litvak, Henri Decaë, Andrzej Żuławski', 'Joseph Kessel, Paul Dehn, Gore Vidal', 'Peter O''Toole, Omar Sharif, Tom Courtenay, Donald Pleasence, Joanna Pettet, Philippe Noiret, Charles Gray, Coral Browne', 'NR', 'A German intelligence officer investigates a prostitute''s killing in Warsaw during World War II. He lands on three major Nazi generals as suspects, two of whom are also involved in a plot to kill Adolf Hitler.', 'A German intelligence officer investigates a prostitute''s killing in Warsaw during World War II. He lands on three major Nazi generals as suspects, two of whom are also involved in a plot to kill Adolf Hitler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcr0rCbqij3dSDpBsAUTItEBMaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42700'),
  ('554600711963035117', 'The Night of the Grizzly', 1966, 'Adventure, Western', 'Joseph Pevney, Harold Lipstein, Loyal Griggs', 'Warren Douglas', 'Clint Walker, Martha Hyer, Keenan Wynn, Ron Ely, Nancy Kulp, Kevin Brodie, Ellen Corby, Jack Elam', null, 'Marshall "Big Jim" Cole turns in his badge and heads to Wyoming with his family in order to settle on some land left him by a relative. He faces opposition both from a neighbor who wants that land for his own sons, and from a grizzly bear nicknamed "Satan" who keeps killing Cole''s livestock.', 'Marshall "Big Jim" Cole turns in his badge and heads to Wyoming with his family in order to settle on some land left him by a relative. He faces opposition both from a neighbor who wants that land for his own sons, and from a grizzly bear nicknamed "Satan" who keeps killing Cole''s livestock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kt23CmHdXll4T4lvjPLltmbzwKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4940'),
  ('270263358563487358', 'The Night of the Hunted', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jean Rollin, Jean-Claude Couty', 'Jean Rollin', 'Brigitte Lahaie, Alain Duclos, Bernard Papineau, Rachel Mhas, Cathy Stewart, Dominique Journet, Natalie Perrey, Cyril Val', null, 'A woman with no memories runs in fear through the night when she is rescued by a man passing by. They will both have to figure out who her mysterious enemies are and what they want to achieve.', 'A woman with no memories runs in fear through the night when she is rescued by a man passing by. They will both have to figure out who her mysterious enemies are and what they want to achieve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quuo0HILA9FoGFQ2EXGBj7jZv1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29565'),
  ('1029486025751642076', 'The Night of the Iguana', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Huston, Gabriel Figueroa, Jaime Contreras', 'Anthony Veiller, John Huston', 'Richard Burton, Ava Gardner, Deborah Kerr, Sue Lyon, Skip Ward, Grayson Hall, Cyril Delevanti, Mary Boylan', 'NR', 'A defrocked Episcopal clergyman leads a bus-load of middle-aged Baptist women on a tour of the Mexican coast and comes to terms with the failure haunting his life.', 'A defrocked Episcopal clergyman leads a bus-load of middle-aged Baptist women on a tour of the Mexican coast and comes to terms with the failure haunting his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HY8MSeoj4s0uSWGW135Jlh7eSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14703'),
  ('761447755423674695', 'The Night of the Living Duck', 1988, 'Animation, Horror, Comedy', 'Greg Ford, Terry Lennon', 'Greg Ford, Terry Lennon', 'Mel Blanc, Mel Tormé', null, 'After indulging in horror comic book reading, Daffy has a dream where he is singing in a nightclub for monsters.', 'After indulging in horror comic book reading, Daffy has a dream where he is singing in a nightclub for monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ig8ptjEB4rYbZRgYR2rkSSF8TLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84600'),
  ('14045635597527230', 'The Night of the Shooting Stars', 1982, 'War, Drama', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Tonino Guerra, Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani', 'Omero Antonutti, Margarita Lozano, Claudio Bigagli, Miriam Guidelli, Massimo Bonetti, Enrica Maria Modugno, Sabina Vannucchi, Giorgio Naddi', null, 'The Night of San Lorenzo, the night of the shooting stars, is the night when dreams come true in Italian folklore. In 1944, a group of Italians flee their town after hearing rumours that the Nazis plan to blow it up and that the Americans are about to arrive to liberate them.', 'The Night of San Lorenzo, the night of the shooting stars, is the night when dreams come true in Italian folklore. In 1944, a group of Italians flee their town after hearing rumours that the Nazis plan to blow it up and that the Americans are about to arrive to liberate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9QgkfHj90rr33KhjLlk5tr7bVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42130'),
  ('42766386204776772', 'The Night of the Sorcerers', 1974, 'Horror', 'Amando de Ossorio, Francisco Sánchez, Juan Antonio Arévalo', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'María Kosty, Simón Andreu, Kali Hansa, Loreta Tovar, José Thelman, Bárbara Rey, Jack Taylor', null, 'A group of researchers gathering material for a magazine article on endangered wildlife encounter vampiric leopard women in the heart of the African jungle.', 'A group of researchers gathering material for a magazine article on endangered wildlife encounter vampiric leopard women in the heart of the African jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5g37PPITIA9aTQ8In6P5LeMl95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77642'),
  ('559123293942627597', 'The Night of the Sunflowers', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jorge Sánchez-Cabezudo, Ángel Iguacel, Sandra Hermida', 'Jorge Sánchez-Cabezudo', 'Carmelo Gómez, Judith Diakhate, Celso Bugallo, Manuel Morón, Mariano Alameda, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Walter Vidarte, Cesáreo Estébanez', null, 'Two speleologists, Esteban and Pedro, travel to a mountainous area located in northern Spain, near a small village, to study a newly discovered cave and determine if it is of scientific interest, while Gabi, Esteban''s wife, awaits their return on a lonely road at the foot of the mountain.', 'Two speleologists, Esteban and Pedro, travel to a mountainous area located in northern Spain, near a small village, to study a newly discovered cave and determine if it is of scientific interest, while Gabi, Esteban''s wife, awaits their return on a lonely road at the foot of the mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBdfW1azCjFGEOTNGHuKg2dJ9Tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58946'),
  ('991161628079933851', 'The Night of the Undead', 2020, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Shin Jung-won, Kim Chang-gyeom, Song Jae-wan', 'Chang Hang-jun, Shin Jung-won', 'Lee Jung-hyun, Kim Seung-o, Seo Young-hee, Yang Dong-geun, Lee Mi-do, Jang Myung-kap, Baek Seung-chul, Kim Ki-cheon', null, 'So-hee enjoys her seemingly perfect life as a newlywed with her seemingly perfect husband. For being so perfect, she begins to suspect that her husband isn’t as he seems. Wanting some answers, she hires a private detective agency to trail him around.', 'So-hee enjoys her seemingly perfect life as a newlywed with her seemingly perfect husband. For being so perfect, she begins to suspect that her husband isn’t as he seems. Wanting some answers, she hires a private detective agency to trail him around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0dIILwqX2BwhsjdYIVowl8wOvh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601062'),
  ('1127415610466617005', 'The Night of the Virgin', 2016, 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy, Thriller, Mystery', 'Roberto San Sebastián', 'Guillermo Guerrero', 'Javier Bódalo, Víctor Amilibia, Miriam Martín, Ignatius Farray, Rocío Suárez, Javier Alaiza', null, 'A virgin looking to get laid instead gets a nightmare full of blood, sweat, ... and various discharges.', 'A virgin looking to get laid instead gets a nightmare full of blood, sweat, ... and various discharges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IhSg77XsqcrAtYYiS8Xts72nQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421663'),
  ('463891774102230994', 'The Night of the Walking Dead', 1975, 'Horror', 'Miguel Fernández Mila, León Klimovsky', 'Juan José Daza, Carlos Pumares', 'Emma Cohen, Carlos Ballesteros, Tota Alba, Barta Barri, Roberto Camardiel, José Lifante, Viky Lussón, Ángel Menéndez', null, 'In a 19th century village, a young aristocrat suffering from a terminal disease finds herself being drawn to the underground world of vampires and their strange rituals.', 'In a 19th century village, a young aristocrat suffering from a terminal disease finds herself being drawn to the underground world of vampires and their strange rituals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ23wMOTLKflnd43jdymQOUPNot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29497'),
  ('823688987200786088', 'The Night Of The Wild Boar', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Ramiro Tenorio', null, 'Catalina Zahri, Fernando Kliche, Gastón Salgado, Renzo Briceño', null, 'Claudia Moratti, a romantic writer travels to the ends of South America looking for the house of her recently deceased boyfriend. As she enters this southern world she finds herself involved in the investigation of a local policeman that points to her boyfriend, a horror writer himself, as the responsible of seven cases of disappeared women in the area. The violent history of the town and the dark memories of the military dictatorship come to surface as the characters involved reveal their true intentions.', 'Claudia Moratti, a romantic writer travels to the ends of South America looking for the house of her recently deceased boyfriend. As she enters this southern world she finds herself involved in the investigation of a local policeman that points to her boyfriend, a horror writer himself, as the responsible of seven cases of disappeared women in the area. The violent history of the town and the dark memories of the military dictatorship come to surface as the characters involved reveal their true intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NaKpVBpuVFUVP9IGeqn1TnzheH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455599'),
  ('176537506789956064', 'The Night Owl', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, History', 'An Tae-jin, Hong Seung-chul, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'An Tae-jin, Hyun Gyu-ri', 'Ryu Jun-yeol, Yoo Hai-jin, Choi Moo-seong, Cho Seong-ha, Park Myung-hoon, Kim Sung-cheol, Ahn Eun-jin, Jo Yoon-seo', null, 'Korea, 1645 - Joseon Dynasty: a partially blind and gifted acupuncturist, Gyeong-su, is invited to work alongside the royal physician in the palace of King Injo, just before the crown prince Sohyeon returns after having been held captive by the Qing Dynasty. Prince Sohyeon and his father begin to differ in opinion on the future direction of their dynasty, leading King Injo to suffer from severe anxiety and paranoia. One night, Gyeong-su witnesses prince Sohyeon''s death. Disbelieved as a witness on account of his blindness, Gyeong-su must struggle to reveal the truth while not falling prey to the power-hungry conspirators of the palace.', 'Korea, 1645 - Joseon Dynasty: a partially blind and gifted acupuncturist, Gyeong-su, is invited to work alongside the royal physician in the palace of King Injo, just before the crown prince Sohyeon returns after having been held captive by the Qing Dynasty. Prince Sohyeon and his father begin to differ in opinion on the future direction of their dynasty, leading King Injo to suffer from severe anxiety and paranoia. One night, Gyeong-su witnesses prince Sohyeon''s death. Disbelieved as a witness on account of his blindness, Gyeong-su must struggle to reveal the truth while not falling prey to the power-hungry conspirators of the palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTePuecC5fJvo66yVaG1wKh9vwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806128'),
  ('404115708662495516', 'The Night Porter', 1974, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Liliana Cavani, Alfio Contini, Franco Cirino', 'Liliana Cavani, Italo Moscati, Amedeo Pagani', 'Dirk Bogarde, Charlotte Rampling, Philippe Leroy, Gabriele Ferzetti, Giuseppe Addobbati, Isa Miranda, Nino Bignamini, Marino Masé', null, 'A concentration camp survivor discovers her former torturer and lover working as a porter at a hotel in postwar Vienna. When the couple attempt to re-create their sadomasochistic relationship, his former SS comrades begin to stalk them.', 'A concentration camp survivor discovers her former torturer and lover working as a porter at a hotel in postwar Vienna. When the couple attempt to re-create their sadomasochistic relationship, his former SS comrades begin to stalk them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTUYhMdh2Jwk5s9jbrU4mCH3CY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26648'),
  ('1072501636613553651', 'The Night Riders', 1939, 'History, Western', 'George Sherman', 'Betty Burbridge, Stanley Roberts', 'John Wayne, Ray Corrigan, Max Terhune, Doreen McKay, Ruth Rogers, George Douglas, Tom Tyler, Kermit Maynard', 'NR', 'Talbot uses a phony land grant to rule thirteen million acres, taxing everyone heavily and evicting those who won''t pay. The Three Mesquiteers becomes mysterious "night riders" to fight this evil.', 'Talbot uses a phony land grant to rule thirteen million acres, taxing everyone heavily and evicting those who won''t pay. The Three Mesquiteers becomes mysterious "night riders" to fight this evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoMBikQFhxIL3JZh05RktWBDHIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138291'),
  ('498358611800611183', 'The Night She Disappeared', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Stefan Brogren, Michael Tien, Sarah Petkov', 'Courtney Cilman', 'Rachel Sellan, Chris Violette, Adi Weiss', 'Not Rated', 'When her daughter vanishes, a single mother becomes obsessed with a local urban legend about teens disappearing after a dangerous initiation ritual. As she starts to dig deeper, she soon finds herself in the crosshairs of a killer.', 'When her daughter vanishes, a single mother becomes obsessed with a local urban legend about teens disappearing after a dangerous initiation ritual. As she starts to dig deeper, she soon finds herself in the crosshairs of a killer.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F7bec9c917c6e386b32b961d27e3a6f68.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-night-she-disappeared'),
  ('561494378367454523', 'The Night She Moves', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sara Gutiérrez Galve, Carlos Rigo', 'Sara Gutiérrez Galve, Núria Roura Benito', 'Dani Casellas, Marta Cañas, Laia Vidal, Max Grosse Majench, Toni Meler, Eduardo Castresana, Carla Linares, Quique Navas', null, 'Max is around thirty and lives with Emma, his intimate friend. Unexpected news create a gap between them causing doubts and concerns to grow inside Max, pushing him to go out at night. Walking aimlessly, Max spends the night alone and accompanied by picturesque characters in remote places of Barcelona. A night of absurd and fantastic drunkenness that is at the same time an inner journey for Max. Yo la busco is a portrait of two friends, their breakup and the strange transforming walk through the nightlife of Barcelona.', 'Max is around thirty and lives with Emma, his intimate friend. Unexpected news create a gap between them causing doubts and concerns to grow inside Max, pushing him to go out at night. Walking aimlessly, Max spends the night alone and accompanied by picturesque characters in remote places of Barcelona. A night of absurd and fantastic drunkenness that is at the same time an inner journey for Max. Yo la busco is a portrait of two friends, their breakup and the strange transforming walk through the nightlife of Barcelona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYXXRTNDRPVnjZRYHz0Ttbpq1UC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517786'),
  ('466031955702669886', 'The Night Stalker', 1972, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Michel Hugo', null, 'Darren McGavin, Carol Lynley, Simon Oakland, Ralph Meeker, Claude Akins, Charles McGraw, Kent Smith, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'Wisecracking reporter Carl Kolchak investigates a string of murders in Las Vegas and suspects the culprit is a vampire. His editor thinks he''s crazy and the police think he''s a nuisance, so Kolchak takes matters into his own hands.', 'Wisecracking reporter Carl Kolchak investigates a string of murders in Las Vegas and suspects the culprit is a vampire. His editor thinks he''s crazy and the police think he''s a nuisance, so Kolchak takes matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dij60cVBL39B5t1SdGQr33APksC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15360'),
  ('26537115608792357', 'The Night Strangler', 1973, 'TV Movie, Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Robert B. Hauser, Dan Curtis', 'Richard Matheson', 'Darren McGavin, Jo Ann Pflug, Simon Oakland, Scott Brady, Wally Cox, Margaret Hamilton, Richard Anderson, John Carradine', 'NR', 'After being run out of Las Vegas, reporter Carl Kolchak heads for Seattle and another reporting job with the local paper. It''s not long before he’s on the trail of another string of bizarre murders. It seems that every 21 years, for the past century, a killer murders a certain number of people, drains them of their blood, and then disappears into the night. Kolchak is on his trail, but can he stop him?', 'After being run out of Las Vegas, reporter Carl Kolchak heads for Seattle and another reporting job with the local paper. It''s not long before he’s on the trail of another string of bizarre murders. It seems that every 21 years, for the past century, a killer murders a certain number of people, drains them of their blood, and then disappears into the night. Kolchak is on his trail, but can he stop him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xp3rvEEb9PsCBYeF6swCE7aIlMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32021'),
  ('77603646821020710', 'The Night That Panicked America', 1975, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jules Brenner, Joseph Sargent', null, 'Vic Morrow, Cliff DeYoung, Michael Constantine, Walter McGinn, Eileen Brennan, Meredith Baxter, Tom Bosley, Will Geer', null, 'A dramatization of the Oct. 30, 1938 mass panic that Orson Welles'' radio play, "The War of the Worlds" accidentally provoked.', 'A dramatization of the Oct. 30, 1938 mass panic that Orson Welles'' radio play, "The War of the Worlds" accidentally provoked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHu6G0jwVBY4kZpsNvf5VEfTJ3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83849'),
  ('106381860157248059', 'The Night the Lights Went Out in Georgia', 1981, 'Drama, Music, Comedy', 'Ronald F. Maxwell, Ray Marsh, Debra Michaelson', 'Bob Bonney', 'Kristy McNichol, Dennis Quaid, Mark Hamill, Don Stroud, Sunny Johnson, Arlen Dean Snyder, Barry Corbin, Lulu McNichol', 'PG', 'An aspiring country singer and his feisty younger sister/manager struggle to reach their dreams of Nashville stardom-as long as she can keep her brother out of trouble with the ladies and the law-in this drama "inspired by," but not really connected to, the hit ''70s ballad.', 'An aspiring country singer and his feisty younger sister/manager struggle to reach their dreams of Nashville stardom-as long as she can keep her brother out of trouble with the ladies and the law-in this drama "inspired by," but not really connected to, the hit ''70s ballad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTTJcK66wvIStNph8v5kKhTMKQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75596'),
  ('937706072844597264', 'The Night the World Exploded', 1957, 'Science Fiction', 'Fred F. Sears, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Jack Natteford, Luci Ward', 'William Leslie, Kathryn Grant, Tristram Coffin, Raymond Greenleaf, Paul Savage, Fred Coby, Frank J. Scannell, Charles Evans', 'NR', 'With his assistant, Laura Hutchinson, Dr. David Conway develops a device to advance the fledgling science of earthquake prediction. After forecasting a large trembleor that will rock California within twenty-four hours, Conway cannot persuade the Governor to act. When the prediction proves true and further tests indicate that there are more quakes to come, Conway and Laura seek to perfect their device. Subsequent tests deep within Carlsbad Caverns discover an unknown element—E-112—that is responsible for the earthquakes and threatens to destroy the globe if it ever reaches the surface. The team determines that with only four weeks until Armageddon, the race is on to neutralize the killer element before it takes a devastating toll.', 'With his assistant, Laura Hutchinson, Dr. David Conway develops a device to advance the fledgling science of earthquake prediction. After forecasting a large trembleor that will rock California within twenty-four hours, Conway cannot persuade the Governor to act. When the prediction proves true and further tests indicate that there are more quakes to come, Conway and Laura seek to perfect their device. Subsequent tests deep within Carlsbad Caverns discover an unknown element—E-112—that is responsible for the earthquakes and threatens to destroy the globe if it ever reaches the surface. The team determines that with only four weeks until Armageddon, the race is on to neutralize the killer element before it takes a devastating toll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W6dOlUFPDIyKfhVOqYxGU5X8d6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61701'),
  ('240473253488327872', 'The Night They Came Home', 2024, 'Western, Thriller, Action', 'Paul G. Volk, Morgan Schmidt, Gabrielle Cooke', 'John A. Russo', 'Brian Austin Green, Tim Abell, Charlie N. Townsend, Danny Trejo, Robert Carradine, Jesse Kove, Kelsey Reinhardt, Kassius Marcil-Green', 'R', 'The combined force of local lawmen and Indian police aim to take down the the Rufus Buck Gang, a cold-heated band of fugitives with vengeance on their minds.', 'The combined force of local lawmen and Indian police aim to take down the the Rufus Buck Gang, a cold-heated band of fugitives with vengeance on their minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ot1GDhZMGTeOcI23BI7A2IlFCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216299'),
  ('1066605122287316694', 'The Night They Raided Minsky''s', 1968, 'Comedy', 'William Friedkin, Andrew Laszlo, Burtt Harris', 'Arnold Schulman, Norman Lear, Sidney Michaels', 'Jason Robards, Britt Ekland, Norman Wisdom, Forrest Tucker, Harry Andrews, Joseph Wiseman, Denholm Elliott, Elliott Gould', 'PG-13', 'Rachel arrives in New York from her Amish community intent on becoming a dancer. Unfortunately Billy Minsky''s Burlesque is hardly the place for her Dances From The Bible. But the show''s comedian Raymond sees a way of wrong-footing the local do-gooders by announcing the new Paris sensation "Mme Fifi" and putting on Rachel''s performance as the place is raided. All too complicated, the more so since her father is scouring the town for her and both Raymond and his straight-man Chick are falling for Rachel.', 'Rachel arrives in New York from her Amish community intent on becoming a dancer. Unfortunately Billy Minsky''s Burlesque is hardly the place for her Dances From The Bible. But the show''s comedian Raymond sees a way of wrong-footing the local do-gooders by announcing the new Paris sensation "Mme Fifi" and putting on Rachel''s performance as the place is raided. All too complicated, the more so since her father is scouring the town for her and both Raymond and his straight-man Chick are falling for Rachel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVZ0zyozUWm4YRWOqF1uYFHO8Bx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42648'),
  ('393902126887996924', 'The Night They Saved Christmas', 1984, 'Drama, Family', 'Jackie Cooper, Cynthia Webster, David Worth', null, 'Jaclyn Smith, Art Carney, Paul Le Mat, Mason Adams, June Lockhart, Paul Williams, Scott Grimes, Laura Jacoby', null, 'An oil company is exploring two Arctic sites for oil. The needed blasting at the first site rocks Santa Claus'' North Pole village. He realizes that any blasting at the second site will destroy his home. He enlists the aid of a woman and her children to convince her husband (who works for the company) that the first site is where the oil they want is. Along the way, Santa explains all his secrets in delivering presents all around the world.', 'An oil company is exploring two Arctic sites for oil. The needed blasting at the first site rocks Santa Claus'' North Pole village. He realizes that any blasting at the second site will destroy his home. He enlists the aid of a woman and her children to convince her husband (who works for the company) that the first site is where the oil they want is. Along the way, Santa explains all his secrets in delivering presents all around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eo67hB52x59UbC61weOqWu6CaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40934'),
  ('420132754144484304', 'The Night Train to Kathmandu', 1988, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Robert Wiemer, Glenn Kershaw', 'Ian Robert, Robert Wiemer', 'Pernell Roberts, Eddie Castrodad, Milla Jovovich, Kavi Raz, Trevor Eyster, Robert Stoeckle, Jan Pessano, Beecey Carlson', null, 'A young girl leaves for Nepal with her parents and brother. She is unhappy to leave her home at first, but soon isn''t when she meets a handome young man. The story unfolds into a romantic and daring quest in search of the "Invisible City."', 'A young girl leaves for Nepal with her parents and brother. She is unhappy to leave her home at first, but soon isn''t when she meets a handome young man. The story unfolds into a romantic and daring quest in search of the "Invisible City."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7553eDqTiApFiU3D7JeZPSGCsoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49434'),
  ('545920737920492773', 'The Night Visitor', 1971, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'László Benedek, Henning Kristiansen', 'Guy Elmes', 'Max von Sydow, Trevor Howard, Liv Ullmann, Per Oscarsson, Rupert Davies, Andrew Keir, Jimmy Kennedy, Arthur Hewlett', 'PG', 'An insane Swedish farmer escapes from an asylum to get revenge on his sister, her husband and others.', 'An insane Swedish farmer escapes from an asylum to get revenge on his sister, her husband and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOKz7uhdjuLC9MNNY2874T5h6pX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72086'),
  ('1084124824146533565', 'The Night Walker', 1964, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'William Castle, Harold E. Stine, Terence Nelson', 'Robert Bloch', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Robert Taylor, Judi Meredith, Rochelle Hudson, Hayden Rorke, Marjorie Bennett, Lloyd Bochner, Jess Barker', 'NR', 'A woman is haunted by recurring nightmares, which seem to be instigated by her late husband who supposedly was killed in a fire.', 'A woman is haunted by recurring nightmares, which seem to be instigated by her late husband who supposedly was killed in a fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWIO2LYQvluWSIWNYqEGmqcmynf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29403'),
  ('948991560129868552', 'The Night Watchman', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Margaret Hill-Talbot', 'NR', 'A little cat must take his sick father''s place as night watchman, but is bullied by a tough mouse and his gang, leaving the rest of the mice free to eat all the food and stage a musical floor show.', 'A little cat must take his sick father''s place as night watchman, but is bullied by a tough mouse and his gang, leaving the rest of the mice free to eat all the food and stage a musical floor show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZF8eioe866CY4ujp65IjST6KiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164785'),
  ('503106392394379086', 'The Night Watchman', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Miguel Ángel Jiménez', 'Miguel Ángel Jiménez, Pablo Aramendi, Luis Moya', 'Jimmy Shaw, Kimberley Tell, Antonio de la Cruz, Matt Horan, Denis Rafter, Eneko Sagardoy, Gio Gabunia', null, 'Jack wants to prove to his wife Alma, that he is a new man after his drug abuse and time spend in prison. He is offered new job as a night watchman of an old mine complex, which he accepts without a question. What no one knows that the dark place holds a disturbing secret that will fill their lives with terror.', 'Jack wants to prove to his wife Alma, that he is a new man after his drug abuse and time spend in prison. He is offered new job as a night watchman of an old mine complex, which he accepts without a question. What no one knows that the dark place holds a disturbing secret that will fill their lives with terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioMrIlUKdCpQHjdbW7EiNu60PBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408612'),
  ('606735525642945514', 'The Night Watchmen', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pierre Jolivet', 'Pierre Jolivet', 'Olivier Gourmet, Valérie Bonneton, Marc Zinga, Thierry Hancisse, Jean-François Cayrey, Paco Boublard, Nader Boussandel, Vincent Debost', null, 'Times have changed a lot for Franck who is a night watchman. About a decade ago he was a specialized worker. Today he feels bored but would jump at any chance to prove his bravery and courage.', 'Times have changed a lot for Franck who is a night watchman. About a decade ago he was a specialized worker. Today he feels bored but would jump at any chance to prove his bravery and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3lbR60zV5TqEMwNGD6irBSJQ1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331113'),
  ('148671950151918342', 'The Night Watchmen', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Mitchell Altieri, Amanda Treyz', 'Jamie Nash, Ken Arnold, Dan De Luca', 'Ken Arnold, Dan De Luca, Kevin Jiggetts, Kara Luiz, Max Gray Wilbur, James Remar, Matt Servitto, Diona Reasonover', null, 'Three inept night watchmen, aided by a young rookie and a fearless tabloid journalist, fight an epic battle to save their lives. A mistaken warehouse delivery unleashes a horde of hungry vampires, and these unlikely heroes must not only save themselves but also stop the scourge that threatens to take over the city of Baltimore.', 'Three inept night watchmen, aided by a young rookie and a fearless tabloid journalist, fight an epic battle to save their lives. A mistaken warehouse delivery unleashes a horde of hungry vampires, and these unlikely heroes must not only save themselves but also stop the scourge that threatens to take over the city of Baltimore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDS6R22AYxP1TvsEjstwhZrTYio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398798'),
  ('738081852978246176', 'The Night We Never Met', 1993, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Warren Leight, John Thomas, Jude Gorjanc', 'Warren Leight', 'Matthew Broderick, Annabella Sciorra, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Christine Baranski, Tim Guinee, Greg Germann, Bradley White, Kevin Anderson', 'R', 'Sam has a problem with his roommates: they are disgusting, and don''t seem to share his views on responsibility, privacy, and basic hygine. Such is his discomfort with his living arrangements that he agrees to share the occupancy of another flat: he gets two nights a week, the owner (a sleazy frat-boy yuppie named Brian, soon to be married) and Ellen (a would-be painter seeking relief from her boring marriage) each get their seperate nights in the flat. Things go extremely well until Sam and Brian swap nights without telling Ellen, who attributes the "nice" things that happen around the place to the slob Brian, while berating the responsible Sam for his hedonistic lifestyle.', 'Sam has a problem with his roommates: they are disgusting, and don''t seem to share his views on responsibility, privacy, and basic hygine. Such is his discomfort with his living arrangements that he agrees to share the occupancy of another flat: he gets two nights a week, the owner (a sleazy frat-boy yuppie named Brian, soon to be married) and Ellen (a would-be painter seeking relief from her boring marriage) each get their seperate nights in the flat. Things go extremely well until Sam and Brian swap nights without telling Ellen, who attributes the "nice" things that happen around the place to the slob Brian, while berating the responsible Sam for his hedonistic lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hE76yhW9dOzweQJxSZEZRI6hWqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41661'),
  ('907901130990978142', 'The Nightcomers', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Winner, Robert Paynter, Michael Dryhurst', 'Michael Hastings', 'Marlon Brando, Stephanie Beacham, Thora Hird, Harry Andrews, Verna Harvey, Christopher Ellis, Anna Palk', null, 'Prequel to the Henry James classic "Turn of the Screw" about the events leading up to the deaths of Peter Quint and Ms. Jessel, and the slow corruption of the children in their care.', 'Prequel to the Henry James classic "Turn of the Screw" about the events leading up to the deaths of Peter Quint and Ms. Jessel, and the slow corruption of the children in their care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKNPk3CqmEpuOLylXAU7ksG7YkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42526'),
  ('546716239433725481', 'The Nightingale', 2014, 'Drama', 'Sun Ming, Philippe Muyl', 'Philippe Muyl', 'Li Baotian, Li Xiaoran, Qin Hao, Yang Xinyi', null, 'In order to keep a promise he made to his wife, an old man sets off to her native village with a bird in a cage. Along the road, together with his granddaughter, he discovers new values, particularly those related to the heart.', 'In order to keep a promise he made to his wife, an old man sets off to her native village with a bird in a cage. Along the road, together with his granddaughter, he discovers new values, particularly those related to the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBt1XRuxdzKjZeCQtJiBfp9u95O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241639'),
  ('485703498114048528', 'The Nightingale', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Western', 'Jennifer Kent, Radek Ładczuk, Killian Maguire', 'Jennifer Kent', 'Aisling Franciosi, Sam Claflin, Baykali Ganambarr, Damon Herriman, Harry Greenwood, Ewen Leslie, Charlie Shotwell, Michael Sheasby', 'R', 'In 1825, Clare, a 21-year-old Irish convict, chases a British soldier through the rugged Tasmanian wilderness, bent on revenge for a terrible act of violence he committed against her family. She enlists the services of an Aboriginal tracker who is also marked by trauma from his own violence-filled past.', 'In 1825, Clare, a 21-year-old Irish convict, chases a British soldier through the rugged Tasmanian wilderness, bent on revenge for a terrible act of violence he committed against her family. She enlists the services of an Aboriginal tracker who is also marked by trauma from his own violence-filled past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEzqFiatOJSbGBu6pb8z5sQuZt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400090'),
  ('896265204113506022', 'The Nightingale of Bursa', 2023, 'Comedy, Music', 'Hakan Algül, Gökhan Atılmış', 'Ata Demirer', 'Ata Demirer, Cem Gelinoğlu, Özge Özaçar, Melek Baykal, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Celil Nalçakan, Toygan Avanoğlu, Seda Türkmen', null, 'Cengiz is the singer at a tea garden in Bursa and his greatest ambition is to release an album. Cengiz''s life changes when he meets Taskin. Believing that the song composed by Taskin''s father, Serafettin, would be a great start for his album, Cengiz buys the song using money he borrowed from his older brother. When Taskin spends all that money, Cengiz starts performing with Taskin and his sister Arzu.', 'Cengiz is the singer at a tea garden in Bursa and his greatest ambition is to release an album. Cengiz''s life changes when he meets Taskin. Believing that the song composed by Taskin''s father, Serafettin, would be a great start for his album, Cengiz buys the song using money he borrowed from his older brother. When Taskin spends all that money, Cengiz starts performing with Taskin and his sister Arzu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ar20IXj63Ac2MEcZOHt7EC4fsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056177'),
  ('327298090744458724', 'The Nightingale''s Prayer', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Abdullah Barakat, Hassan Ibrahim, Henry Barakat', 'Henry Barakat, Youssef Gohar', 'Faten Hamama, Ahmed Mazhar, Zahrat Al-Ola, Amina Rizk, Mimi Chakib, Ragaa Al-Giddawy, Abdelalim Khattab, Hussein Asar', null, 'This compelling tale of love and betrayal, set in the upper Egyptian countryside, follows the story of Amna as she plots her revenge on the engineer who destroyed her family''s honor.', 'This compelling tale of love and betrayal, set in the upper Egyptian countryside, follows the story of Amna as she plots her revenge on the engineer who destroyed her family''s honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Q8BYbJ9GQc9QLQhMIuaeMQkLPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193388'),
  ('627433501229607403', 'The Nightmare', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Achim Bornhak', 'Achim Bornhak', 'Carolyn Genzkow, Arnd Klawitter, Julika Jenkins, Alexander Scheer, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Kim Gordon, Sina Tkotsch, Lynn Femme', null, 'After a massive party one evening, 17-year-old Tina begins experiencing nightmares in which she is haunted by an unusual creature.', 'After a massive party one evening, 17-year-old Tina begins experiencing nightmares in which she is haunted by an unusual creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6x4snE3eJzc5LwLuNcD3gbKOxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346641'),
  ('133214530735969751', 'The Nightmare Before Christmas', 1993, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Henry Selick, Pete Kozachik, Kendal Cronkhite', 'Caroline Thompson', 'Danny Elfman, Chris Sarandon, Catherine O''Hara, William Hickey, Glenn Shadix, Paul Reubens, Ken Page, Edward Ivory', 'PG', 'Tired of scaring humans every October 31 with the same old bag of tricks, Jack Skellington, the spindly king of Halloween Town, kidnaps Santa Claus and plans to deliver shrunken heads and other ghoulish gifts to children on Christmas morning. But as Christmas approaches, Jack''s rag-doll girlfriend, Sally, tries to foil his misguided plans.', 'Tired of scaring humans every October 31 with the same old bag of tricks, Jack Skellington, the spindly king of Halloween Town, kidnaps Santa Claus and plans to deliver shrunken heads and other ghoulish gifts to children on Christmas morning. But as Christmas approaches, Jack''s rag-doll girlfriend, Sally, tries to foil his misguided plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQffRNjK8e19rF7xVYEN8ew0j7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9479'),
  ('999943907504725582', 'The Nights of Paloma', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Isaac', 'Francisco Sánchez', 'Cristina Baker, Bruno Rey, Pancho Córdova, Gregorio Casal, Eric del Castillo, Delia Magaña, Queta Lavat, Mercedes Carreño', null, 'While being shuttled from her convent/boarding school to her wedding, a young lady of the upper classes is kidnapped by bandits. She gets to see the world and meet interesting people.', 'While being shuttled from her convent/boarding school to her wedding, a young lady of the upper classes is kidnapped by bandits. She gets to see the world and meet interesting people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCIRkPdbSLIoLN3jMYKEJSoId3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364248'),
