  ('616369874590749679', 'The Nowhere Inn', 2021, 'Music, Comedy, Thriller', 'Bill Benz, Ian J. Putnam, Mark Bennett', 'Carrie Brownstein, St. Vincent', 'St. Vincent, Carrie Brownstein, Ezra Buzzington, Toko Yasuda, Dakota Johnson, Chris Aquilino, Drew Connick, Tema Louise Sall', null, 'When St. Vincent sets out to make a documentary about her music, the goal is to both reveal and revel in the unadorned truth behind her on-stage persona. But when she hires a close friend to direct, notions of reality, identity, and authenticity grow increasingly distorted and bizarre.', 'When St. Vincent sets out to make a documentary about her music, the goal is to both reveal and revel in the unadorned truth behind her on-stage persona. But when she hires a close friend to direct, notions of reality, identity, and authenticity grow increasingly distorted and bizarre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saXbsVa6eylbaOCXpwGZVjn1fOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653572'),
