  ('342345893358284657', 'The Numbers Station', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kasper Barfoed, Óttar Guðnason, Scott Bunce', 'F. Scott Frazier', 'John Cusack, Malin Åkerman, Hannah Murray, Liam Cunningham, Lucy Griffiths, Bryan Dick, Richard Brake, Finbar Lynch', 'R', 'When the moral values of a longtime wetwork black ops agent is tested during his last operation, he receives an unfavorable psych evaluation. Now he is given a break and a seemingly uncomplicated assignment of simply protecting the security of a young female code announcer, code resources and remote station they are assigned to. After an ambush and one phone call later, it becomes a complicated fight for their survival.', 'When the moral values of a longtime wetwork black ops agent is tested during his last operation, he receives an unfavorable psych evaluation. Now he is given a break and a seemingly uncomplicated assignment of simply protecting the security of a young female code announcer, code resources and remote station they are assigned to. After an ambush and one phone call later, it becomes a complicated fight for their survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcpaJ2JYM2WKzzuRUAB869uMWnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77234'),
  ('937043721896135065', 'The Nun', 1967, 'Drama', 'Jacques Rivette, Alain Levent, Alexis Poliakoff', 'Jacques Rivette, Jean Gruault', 'Anna Karina, Liselotte Pulver, Micheline Presle, Francine Bergé, Francisco Rabal, Christiane Lénier, Yori Bertin, Hubert Buthion', null, 'In eighteenth-century France, a girl is forced against her will to take vows as a nun. Three mothers superior treat her in radically different ways, ranging from maternal concern, to sadistic persecution, to lesbian desire.', 'In eighteenth-century France, a girl is forced against her will to take vows as a nun. Three mothers superior treat her in radically different ways, ranging from maternal concern, to sadistic persecution, to lesbian desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75EehgZs63K70RODuFLXXgopPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42722'),
  ('657700656778697010', 'The Nun', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Luis de la Madrid, David Carretero, Lacris García', 'Manu Díez', 'Anita Briem, Belén Blanco, Manu Fullola, Alistair Freeland, Cristina Piaget, Paulina Gálvez, Natalia Dicenta, Lola Marceli', 'R', 'Years ago, a cruel and merciless nun turned a boarding school into a living hell for her students until they could no longer bear the abuse, and she mysteriously disappeared. Now the alumnae are being brutally murdered one by one.', 'Years ago, a cruel and merciless nun turned a boarding school into a living hell for her students until they could no longer bear the abuse, and she mysteriously disappeared. Now the alumnae are being brutally murdered one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bDojliSLzGFwxlqQZodJAXHy7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42968'),
  ('786477195049583477', 'The Nun', 2013, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Yves Cape', 'Jérôme Beaujour, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Pauline Étienne, Isabelle Huppert, Louise Bourgoin, Martina Gedeck, Agathe Bonitzer, Alice de Lencquesaing, Marc Barbé, Françoise Lebrun', 'PG-13', 'Suzanne Simonin describes her life of suffering in letters. As a young woman she is sent to a convent against her will. Since her parents cannot afford the dowry required for a marriage befitting her rank they decide she must instead become a nun. Although a kind and understanding Mother Superior helps her to learn the convent’s daily routine, Suzanne’s desire for freedom remains unabated. When the Mother Superior dies, Suzanne finds herself faced with reprisals, humiliation and harassment at the hands of the new Abbess and the other Sisters. For many years, Suzanne is subjected to bigotry and religious fanaticism. (Berlinale.de)', 'Suzanne Simonin describes her life of suffering in letters. As a young woman she is sent to a convent against her will. Since her parents cannot afford the dowry required for a marriage befitting her rank they decide she must instead become a nun. Although a kind and understanding Mother Superior helps her to learn the convent’s daily routine, Suzanne’s desire for freedom remains unabated. When the Mother Superior dies, Suzanne finds herself faced with reprisals, humiliation and harassment at the hands of the new Abbess and the other Sisters. For many years, Suzanne is subjected to bigotry and religious fanaticism. (Berlinale.de)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yr1xovsr57JBdEEN9SrajE0ogxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159967'),
  ('663955495914665793', 'The Nun', 2018, 'Horror', 'Corin Hardy, Maxime Alexandre, Diana Ghinea', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Taissa Farmiga, Demián Bichir, Bonnie Aarons, Jonas Bloquet, Ingrid Bisu, Patrick Wilson, Vera Farmiga, Lili Taylor', 'R', 'A priest with a dark past and a novice nearing her final vows are sent by the Vatican to Romania to investigate a nun''s death and face a demonic force.', 'A priest with a dark past and a novice nearing her final vows are sent by the Vatican to Romania to investigate a nun''s death and face a demonic force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFC1ElvoKGdHJIWRpNB3xWJ9lJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439079'),
  ('427009409899409604', 'The Nun and the Devil', 1973, 'Drama, Horror', 'Domenico Paolella, Giuseppe Ruzzolini', 'Tonino Cervi, Domenico Paolella', 'Luc Merenda, Ornella Muti, Martine Brochard, Muriel Catalá, Claudia Gravy, Duilio Del Prete, Pier Paolo Capponi, Claudio Gora', null, 'It''s 1577. The Mother Superior at the convent of Archangel is seriously ill. The determined and calculating Mother Giulia plots to become the next Mother Superior. She receives tough competition from tormented lesbian Sister Chiara and the lusty Sister Carmela.', 'It''s 1577. The Mother Superior at the convent of Archangel is seriously ill. The determined and calculating Mother Giulia plots to become the next Mother Superior. She receives tough competition from tormented lesbian Sister Chiara and the lusty Sister Carmela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihHSgsFhOhOsvxQmLCE7UdFNNyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105865'),
