  ('785852022382180787', 'The Nut Job', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Peter Lepeniotis', 'Peter Lepeniotis, Lorne Cameron', 'Will Arnett, Brendan Fraser, Liam Neeson, Katherine Heigl, Stephen Lang, Maya Rudolph, Jeff Dunham, Gabriel Iglesias', 'PG', 'Surly, a curmudgeon, independent squirrel is banished from his park and forced to survive in the city. Lucky for him, he stumbles on the one thing that may be able to save his life, and the rest of park community, as they gear up for winter - Maury''s Nut Store.', 'Surly, a curmudgeon, independent squirrel is banished from his park and forced to survive in the city. Lucky for him, he stumbles on the one thing that may be able to save his life, and the rest of park community, as they gear up for winter - Maury''s Nut Store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iHnGlmOjAj2k5zUftYDIzSITCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227783'),
  ('901063523901321443', 'The Nut Job 2: Nutty by Nature', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Linda Lamontagne, Cal Brunker, Daryl Graham', 'Cal Brunker, Bob Barlen, Scott Bindley', 'Will Arnett, Maya Rudolph, Bobby Cannavale, Bobby Moynihan, Isabela Merced, Peter Stormare, Gabriel Iglesias, Jeff Dunham', 'PG', 'When the evil mayor of Oakton decides to bulldoze Liberty Park and build a dangerous amusement park in its place, Surly Squirrel and his ragtag group of animal friends need to band together to save their home, defeat the mayor, and take back the park.', 'When the evil mayor of Oakton decides to bulldoze Liberty Park and build a dangerous amusement park in its place, Surly Squirrel and his ragtag group of animal friends need to band together to save their home, defeat the mayor, and take back the park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOfdQHNF9TlrdujyAjiKfUhxSXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335777'),
  ('874983443271479584', 'The Nutcracker', 1973, 'Animation, Music', 'Boris Stepantsev, Mikhail Druyan, Yan Topper', 'Boris Larin, Boris Stepantsev', 'Hans Conried, Shirley MacLaine', null, 'A young chambermaid finds a neglected nutcracker under a Christmas tree. It comes to life, but the Nutcracker is really an enchanted prince.', 'A young chambermaid finds a neglected nutcracker under a Christmas tree. It comes to life, but the Nutcracker is really an enchanted prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/745HxjojoGFiE2L2qvWFVzwlJaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84816'),
  ('320179239717631340', 'The Nutcracker', 1991, 'Fantasy, Music, Family', 'Emile Ardolino, Ralf D. Bode', 'Susan Cooper', 'Kevin Kline, Macaulay Culkin, Marina Squerciati, Alex Wiesendanger, Zoe Zien, Lauren D''Avella, Peter Reznick, Darci Kistler', 'G', 'On Christmas Eve, a little girl named Marie falls asleep and dreams herself into a fantastic world in which her toys become larger than life. She meets up with the Nutcracker Prince who takes her on a journey to his kingdom and defends her from the Mouse King.', 'On Christmas Eve, a little girl named Marie falls asleep and dreams herself into a fantastic world in which her toys become larger than life. She meets up with the Nutcracker Prince who takes her on a journey to his kingdom and defends her from the Mouse King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKGGzL6o27cOurOO0gCUopDCxts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73191'),
  ('794550623207763256', 'The Nutcracker', 1994, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Takashi Masunaga, Toshiyuki Hiruma', 'Jack Olesker', 'Andrea Libman, Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Kathleen Barr, Lillian Carlson, Garry Chalk, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan', 'G', 'It is Christmas Eve, and the Stahlbaum family is happily unwrapping their Christmas gifts. After all the merriment, seven-year-old Marie receives a very special gift--a mysterious Nutcracker--from her beloved Godfather Drosselmeier. When the house falls dark and silent, Marie discovers that this is no ordinary Nutcracker, but Godfather Drosselmeier''s nephew, who was transformed into a wooden toy by the curse of the evil Madame Mouserink. To break the curse, the Nutcracker must win the love of Marie and defeat the malicious, seven-headed Mouse King.', 'It is Christmas Eve, and the Stahlbaum family is happily unwrapping their Christmas gifts. After all the merriment, seven-year-old Marie receives a very special gift--a mysterious Nutcracker--from her beloved Godfather Drosselmeier. When the house falls dark and silent, Marie discovers that this is no ordinary Nutcracker, but Godfather Drosselmeier''s nephew, who was transformed into a wooden toy by the curse of the evil Madame Mouserink. To break the curse, the Nutcracker must win the love of Marie and defeat the malicious, seven-headed Mouse King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUsRVGtKmCgjsCsFikqnwe0ThAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192173'),
