  ('790363405438192104', 'The Nutcracker Prince', 1990, 'Animation, Family', 'Paul Schibli', 'Patricia Watson', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Megan Follows, Mike MacDonald, Peter O''Toole, Phyllis Diller, Peter Boretski, Stephanie Morgenstern, George Merner', 'G', 'After young Clara receives a wooden nutcracker as a Christmas gift, she dreams about a fantastical battle between her Nutcracker Prince and the evil Mouse King. At stake is the Nutcracker''s freedom - and Clara''s future happiness.', 'After young Clara receives a wooden nutcracker as a Christmas gift, she dreams about a fantastical battle between her Nutcracker Prince and the evil Mouse King. At stake is the Nutcracker''s freedom - and Clara''s future happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VVL7lYutdQV4KxP6OANF0gwiXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13759'),
