  ('779103241032239527', 'The Nutty Boy', 1995, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Helvécio Ratton, José Tadeu Ribeiro, Luiz Antônio Gerace', 'Helvécio Ratton, Alcione Araújo, Maria Gessy', 'Samuel Costa, Patricia Pillar, Roberto Bomtempo, Luiz Carlos Arutin, Hilda Rebello, Edyr de Castro, Vera Holtz, Othon Bastos', null, 'The principal character in Helvécio Ratton''s delightful film has been adapted from a book and comic created by the Brazilian cartoonist Ziraldo, and tells the tale of a happy-go-lucky 10-year-old child growing up in a city in the 60s.', 'The principal character in Helvécio Ratton''s delightful film has been adapted from a book and comic created by the Brazilian cartoonist Ziraldo, and tells the tale of a happy-go-lucky 10-year-old child growing up in a city in the 60s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjfE6gZW0TfjskQXAzcsy5Qp6wd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51184'),
  ('476082701138520565', 'The Nutty Boy 2', 1998, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Fabrizia Pinto, Fernando Meirelles, Tony Mitchell', 'Fabrizia Pinto, Daniela Thomas', 'Samuel Costa, Fernando Alves Pinto, Pedro Bismark, Samuel Brandão, Cláudio Cavalcanti, Nelson Dantas, Rui Rezende, Stênio Garcia', null, 'In this new adventure, Maluquinho is spending the holidays at the home of his grandfather Tônico (Stênio Garcia), an inventor who lives in a small community in the interior of Minas Gerais. His friends Junim (Samuel Brandão), Lucio (Cauã Bernard Souza), Bocão (João Romeu Filho) and Nina (Fernanda Guimarães) are coming to the city to help Maluquinho organize the circus for the centenary of the city. On this trip, they meet Tatá-Mirim, a small flame that ends up making the city believe that they are being invaded by the Capeta. So they end up living many adventures.', 'In this new adventure, Maluquinho is spending the holidays at the home of his grandfather Tônico (Stênio Garcia), an inventor who lives in a small community in the interior of Minas Gerais. His friends Junim (Samuel Brandão), Lucio (Cauã Bernard Souza), Bocão (João Romeu Filho) and Nina (Fernanda Guimarães) are coming to the city to help Maluquinho organize the circus for the centenary of the city. On this trip, they meet Tatá-Mirim, a small flame that ends up making the city believe that they are being invaded by the Capeta. So they end up living many adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NS8fQp14xFPofYoY7Ly9YiH8rK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240855'),
  ('784163465887890972', 'The Nutty Professor', 1963, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Jerry Lewis, W. Wallace Kelley, Ralph Axness', 'Jerry Lewis, Bill Richmond', 'Jerry Lewis, Stella Stevens, Del Moore, Henry Gibson, Kathleen Freeman, Richard Kiel, Norman Alden, Howard Morris', 'NR', 'A timid, nearsighted chemistry teacher discovers a magical potion that can transform him into a suave and handsome Romeo. The Jekyll and Hyde game works well enough until the concoction starts to wear off at the most embarrassing times.', 'A timid, nearsighted chemistry teacher discovers a magical potion that can transform him into a suave and handsome Romeo. The Jekyll and Hyde game works well enough until the concoction starts to wear off at the most embarrassing times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3lzU19j7WGfyXVDfPMdh8DAkru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18331'),
  ('786681369902500624', 'The Nutty Professor', 1996, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Tom Shadyac, Julio Macat, Sally Thornton', 'Jerry Lewis, Bill Richmond, Jeffrey Price', 'Eddie Murphy, Jada Pinkett Smith, James Coburn, Larry Miller, Dave Chappelle, John Ales, Patricia Wilson, Jamal Mixon', 'PG-13', 'When beautiful Carla Purty joins the university faculty, genetic professor Dr. Sherman Klump grows desperate to whittle his 400-pound frame down to size and win her heart. So, with one swig of his experimental fat-reducing serum, Sherman becomes ''Buddy Love'', a fast-talking, pumped-up, plumped down Don Juan.', 'When beautiful Carla Purty joins the university faculty, genetic professor Dr. Sherman Klump grows desperate to whittle his 400-pound frame down to size and win her heart. So, with one swig of his experimental fat-reducing serum, Sherman becomes ''Buddy Love'', a fast-talking, pumped-up, plumped down Don Juan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMtb5aZoLRNbMnCkatFsTmPRfl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9327'),
  ('12224239361046321', 'The Nymph', 1996, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lina Wertmüller, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Ugo Pirro, Lina Wertmüller', 'Lucia Cara, Stefania Sandrelli, Raoul Bova, Lorenzo Crespi, Luisa Amatucci, Giuditta Del Vecchio, Pepe Da Rosa, Rino Marcelli', null, 'Set during the second world war, the sentimental education of a sensual adolescent girl, growing out of her childhood in a small, impoverished village in Southern Italy.', 'Set during the second world war, the sentimental education of a sensual adolescent girl, growing out of her childhood in a small, impoverished village in Southern Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZP6tPUXpwiwK982Ubt21Zg3tjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160041'),
