  ('688467014441674495', 'The Oak', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lucian Pintilie, Doru Mitran', 'Lucian Pintilie', 'Maia Morgenstern, Răzvan Vasilescu, Victor Rebengiuc, Dorel Vișan, Mariana Mihuț, Dan Condurache, Magda Catone, Gheorghe Visu', null, 'A description of Romania before Ceausescu''s downfall, through the story of Nela. Daughter of a former colonel of the Securitate, the romanian political police. She refused to become like her sister, an agent of this Securitate, and lives with her father. After he died, she leaves Bucharest, and ends up in a little town, where she meets Mitica, a surgeon, another herself, laughing at everything.', 'A description of Romania before Ceausescu''s downfall, through the story of Nela. Daughter of a former colonel of the Securitate, the romanian political police. She refused to become like her sister, an agent of this Securitate, and lives with her father. After he died, she leaves Bucharest, and ends up in a little town, where she meets Mitica, a surgeon, another herself, laughing at everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eNbNHfsm7SvyFb8LTzsCQ5WiMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41678'),
  ('1050994527933577686', 'The Oak Room', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Michèle DesLauriers, Cody Calahan, Jeff Maher', 'Peter Genoway', 'RJ Mitte, Peter Outerbridge, Ari Millen, Nicholas Campbell, Martin Roach, David Ferry, Amos Crawley, Avery Esteves', null, 'During a raging snowstorm, a drifter returns home to the blue-collar bar located in the remote Canadian town where he was born. When he offers to settle an old debt with a grizzled bartender by telling him a story, the night''s events quickly spin into a dark tale of mistaken identities, double-crosses and shocking violence.', 'During a raging snowstorm, a drifter returns home to the blue-collar bar located in the remote Canadian town where he was born. When he offers to settle an old debt with a grizzled bartender by telling him a story, the night''s events quickly spin into a dark tale of mistaken identities, double-crosses and shocking violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVvNpT2D14K7nuweGzJpoUyfnKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717021'),
  ('725251955158254329', 'The Oasis', 1984, 'Drama', 'Sparky Greene', null, 'Chris Makepeace, Scott Hylands, Richard Cox, Dori Brenner, Suzanne Snyder, Mark Metcalf, Anne Lockhart, Ben Slack', null, 'A plane crash in the Mexican desert leaves a small group of survivors who are desperate for food and water. Fearing that they may never be found where they are, they head for where it is hoped there will be civilization and rescue. When their hopes prove unfounded, they must face the horrible possibility of choosing between giving up and dying, or doing the unthinkable to survive.', 'A plane crash in the Mexican desert leaves a small group of survivors who are desperate for food and water. Fearing that they may never be found where they are, they head for where it is hoped there will be civilization and rescue. When their hopes prove unfounded, they must face the horrible possibility of choosing between giving up and dying, or doing the unthinkable to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDBqg84hMP1waIynzUH9xW8v5vd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255669'),
  ('674589169437577108', 'The Oath', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Óttar Guðnason', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Ólafur Egill Egilsson', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Hera Hilmar, Gísli Örn Garðarsson, Margrét Bjarnadóttir, Auður Aradóttir, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Þorsteinn Bachmann, Joi Johannsson', null, 'When his daughter''s criminal boyfriend becomes an increasing threat to the family, a father must take action to protect them.', 'When his daughter''s criminal boyfriend becomes an increasing threat to the family, a father must take action to protect them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t21ngzRZXfDq5WYBDfLtwHdJv68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346658'),
  ('923375043069178942', 'The Oath', 2018, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Ike Barinholtz', 'Ike Barinholtz', 'Ike Barinholtz, Tiffany Haddish, Billy Magnussen, John Cho, Carrie Brownstein, Jon Barinholtz, Meredith Hagner, Chris Ellis', 'R', 'In a politically-divided United States, a man struggles to make it through the Thanksgiving holiday without destroying his family.', 'In a politically-divided United States, a man struggles to make it through the Thanksgiving holiday without destroying his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHB7Nq93pQxGOit1Lyz1ELfUvy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520596'),
  ('242011469592268218', 'The Object of Beauty', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Michael Lindsay-Hogg, David Watkin', 'Michael Lindsay-Hogg', 'John Malkovich, Andie MacDowell, Lolita Davidovich, Rudi Davies, Joss Ackland, Bill Paterson, Ricci Harnett, Peter Riegert', null, 'American couple Jake and Tina are living in an expensive London hotel above their means, incurring a sizeable debt. When they are asked to pay a lavish dinner bill and Jake''s card is declined, he suggests they sell Tina''s tiny, expensive Henry Moore sculpture to cover the debt. After they hatch a scheme to claim the sculpture was stolen in order to collect insurance on it, the sculpture mysteriously goes missing.', 'American couple Jake and Tina are living in an expensive London hotel above their means, incurring a sizeable debt. When they are asked to pay a lavish dinner bill and Jake''s card is declined, he suggests they sell Tina''s tiny, expensive Henry Moore sculpture to cover the debt. After they hatch a scheme to claim the sculpture was stolen in order to collect insurance on it, the sculpture mysteriously goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtxTzSrjCDH7Ray4RK8FPUrrlSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88818'),
  ('598142039134547676', 'The Object of My Affection', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nicholas Hytner, Loren Weeks, Sam Hoffman', 'Wendy Wasserstein', 'Jennifer Aniston, Paul Rudd, Alan Alda, Nigel Hawthorne, John Pankow, Tim Daly, Allison Janney, Steve Zahn', 'R', 'A pregnant New York social worker begins to develop romantic feelings for her gay best friend, and decides she''d rather raise her child with him, much to the dismay of her overbearing boyfriend.', 'A pregnant New York social worker begins to develop romantic feelings for her gay best friend, and decides she''d rather raise her child with him, much to the dismay of her overbearing boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mA6QEdzhsftNIFV11SGsQLJvJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17127'),
  ('911524120207064212', 'The Objective', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Daniel Myrick, Stephanie Martin, Ahmed Hatimi', 'Daniel Myrick, Wesley Clark, Mark A. Patton', 'Jonas Ball, Matthew R. Anderson, Jon Huertas, Michael C. Williams, Sam Hunter, Jeff Prewett, Vanessa Johansson', null, 'A team of US Special Ops forces is dispatched to a remote mountain region of Afghanistan with orders to locate an influential Muslim cleric. While on the mission they find themselves lost in a Middle Eastern ''Bermuda Triangle'' of ancient evil and faced with an enemy that none of them could have imagined.', 'A team of US Special Ops forces is dispatched to a remote mountain region of Afghanistan with orders to locate an influential Muslim cleric. While on the mission they find themselves lost in a Middle Eastern ''Bermuda Triangle'' of ancient evil and faced with an enemy that none of them could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Kp8e43AjcNKWvfpLMD3DaCHMwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14878'),
  ('228535513267488205', 'The Objects of Love', 2016, 'Drama', 'Adrián Silvestre', 'Adrián Silvestre', 'Laura Rojas Godoy, Nicole Costa, Diana Agámez, Marco Bomba, Paolo Floris, Andrea Iacovacci, Marco La Ferla, Margot Medina', null, 'Luz emigrated to Italy in search of a better future. In Colombia she has left his two years son by his family. But her European dream begins to truncate and turn into a series of misfortunes. She assumes her new social status and start from scratch, working in the cleaning sector. Until unexpectedly she meet Fran, a person who breaks all schemes. Luz and Fran decided to own their own lives, with the world ahead, and Rome at their feet.', 'Luz emigrated to Italy in search of a better future. In Colombia she has left his two years son by his family. But her European dream begins to truncate and turn into a series of misfortunes. She assumes her new social status and start from scratch, working in the cleaning sector. Until unexpectedly she meet Fran, a person who breaks all schemes. Luz and Fran decided to own their own lives, with the world ahead, and Rome at their feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCaHr6HJAlGGtWvwiWLD5OqpGKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453606'),
  ('667748178020874596', 'The Oblong Box', 1969, 'Horror', 'Gordon Hessler, John Coquillon', 'Lawrence Huntington', 'Vincent Price, Christopher Lee, Rupert Davies, Uta Levka, Sally Geeson, Alister Williamson, Peter Arne, Hilary Dwyer', 'PG', 'Evil lurks in the gloomy house at Markham Manor where a deranged Sir Edward is the chained prisoner of his brother Julian. When Sir Edward escapes, he embarks on a monstrous killing spree, determined to seek revenge on all those whom he feels have double-crossed him.', 'Evil lurks in the gloomy house at Markham Manor where a deranged Sir Edward is the chained prisoner of his brother Julian. When Sir Edward escapes, he embarks on a monstrous killing spree, determined to seek revenge on all those whom he feels have double-crossed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MHJRsWmY7rl3ub2ucoZcpGd7hF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55152'),
  ('878257824517247001', 'The Obscure Spring', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ernesto Contreras, Tonatiuh Martínez', 'Carlos Contreras', 'Irene Azuela, José María Yázpik, Cecilia Suárez, Hayden Meyenberg, Margarita Sanz, Fernando Becerril, Marianna Burelli, Flavio Medina', null, 'Igor is a plumber; Pina serves coffee. It is winter and they both deeply desire each other, but they are not free. In trying to figure out how to realize their love, she decides to make a lion costume for her little son and he decides to buy a photocopying machine for his wife. Spring will come at last and with it the consummation of love, filling their lives with hope and sex.', 'Igor is a plumber; Pina serves coffee. It is winter and they both deeply desire each other, but they are not free. In trying to figure out how to realize their love, she decides to make a lion costume for her little son and he decides to buy a photocopying machine for his wife. Spring will come at last and with it the consummation of love, filling their lives with hope and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnUjRT6yWXK8LcV24himYI0T8vR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264529'),
  ('624507805334816456', 'The Observance', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Robert Hollocks, Denton Adkinson, Tessa Hawkes', 'Robert Hollocks, Amy Rhinehart Bailey', 'Ted Raimi, Kate Dailey, Donald Morgan, Alec James, Darby Cappillino', 'R', 'After five years in a coma following a fatal car accident, Madison Neubauer wakes to find her home and family in the grip of ''The Observance'', a religious cult who will stop at nothing to protect their secrets.', 'After five years in a coma following a fatal car accident, Madison Neubauer wakes to find her home and family in the grip of ''The Observance'', a religious cult who will stop at nothing to protect their secrets.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8UXpqgY7rAALTeujRzzWB2TDPPQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-observance'),
  ('545616609354050424', 'The Obsession', 1912, 'Drama', 'Louis Feuillade, Georges Guérin', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Renée Carl, René Navarre, Miss Édith, Henri Jullien, Le Petit Mathieu, Maurice Mathieu', null, 'A mother (Renee Carl) goes to see a palm reader who informs her that a loved one is about to die. The woman doesn''t know if it''s her son or her husband (Rene Navarre) but history buffs will know who it is as it''s April 10, 1912 and the husband is about to board the Titanic.', 'A mother (Renee Carl) goes to see a palm reader who informs her that a loved one is about to die. The woman doesn''t know if it''s her son or her husband (Rene Navarre) but history buffs will know who it is as it''s April 10, 1912 and the husband is about to board the Titanic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbVZps1sS4mBawGmGnJv8Q0O8Ym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193870'),
  ('905301340283329080', 'The Occupant', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'David Pastor, Àlex Pastor, Pau Castejón Ubeda', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor', 'Javier Gutiérrez, Mario Casas, Bruna Cusí, Ruth Díaz, Iris Vallés Torres, Cristian Muñoz, David Ramírez, David Selvas', 'R', 'An unemployed executive is forced to sell his apartment. When he discovers that he still has the keys, he becomes obsessed with the family that now lives there and decides to recover the life he has lost, at any price.', 'An unemployed executive is forced to sell his apartment. When he discovers that he still has the keys, he becomes obsessed with the family that now lives there and decides to recover the life he has lost, at any price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNM2VmqS2FBL92EJ0fUPLgoij8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674944'),
  ('411353676414499428', 'The Occupant', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Hugo Keijzer, Robbie van Brussel', 'Philip Michael Howe, Hugo Keijzer, Roelof Jan Minneboo', 'Ella Balinska, Rob Delaney, Vanessa Ifediora, Stuart Graham, George Lasha, Konstantine Roinishvili, Armin Karima', 'NR', 'Desperate to save her sister, Abby takes a dangerous job in the remote Georgian wilderness. Stranded in the mountains after her helicopter crashes, she finds hope through John, a mysterious helper radioing from nearby. As he guides her through the harsh conditions, Abby struggles to survive, and her grip on reality falters until she is faced with an impossible choice.', 'Desperate to save her sister, Abby takes a dangerous job in the remote Georgian wilderness. Stranded in the mountains after her helicopter crashes, she finds hope through John, a mysterious helper radioing from nearby. As he guides her through the harsh conditions, Abby struggles to survive, and her grip on reality falters until she is faced with an impossible choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIhJcFP7QhL85ag401W2eJw9ukL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280444'),
  ('364495829285626999', 'The Ocean Hop', 1927, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Walt Disney, Ub Iwerks', null, null, null, 'Oswald the Rabbit enters an airplane race with a makeshift aircraft and ends up riding a dachshund lifted into the air by balloons. Meanwhile, his peg-legged rival tries to cheat his way to victory.', 'Oswald the Rabbit enters an airplane race with a makeshift aircraft and ends up riding a dachshund lifted into the air by balloons. Meanwhile, his peg-legged rival tries to cheat his way to victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqwV79hKShIrG4xnyB33zrljvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39822'),
  ('879770993562315466', 'The Octagon', 1980, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Eric Karson, Michel Hugo, Gabriel Torres', 'Leigh Chapman', 'Chuck Norris, Karen Carlson, Lee Van Cleef, Art Hindle, Carol Bagdasarian, Kim Lankford, Tadashi Yamashita, Kurt Grayson', 'R', 'Scott James, a veteran martial arts expert, is recruited as the protector of the wealthy and beautiful Justine after she becomes the target of a ninja clan. When Scott finds out that his ruthless arch-nemesis, McCarn , is involved with the stealthy and dangerous criminals, he is eager to settle old scores. Soon Scott is facing off against McCarn and the entire ninja horde in an effort to take them all down.', 'Scott James, a veteran martial arts expert, is recruited as the protector of the wealthy and beautiful Justine after she becomes the target of a ninja clan. When Scott finds out that his ruthless arch-nemesis, McCarn , is involved with the stealthy and dangerous criminals, he is eager to settle old scores. Soon Scott is facing off against McCarn and the entire ninja horde in an effort to take them all down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CHZCoIruTfZ3ssN5tY7EG7UDvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24825'),
  ('167202504837236695', 'The October Man', 1947, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Roy Ward Baker, Erwin Hillier', 'Eric Ambler', 'John Mills, Joan Greenwood, Edward Chapman, Kay Walsh, Joyce Carey, Catherine Lacey, Adrianne Allen, Felix Aylmer', null, 'Jim Ackland, who suffers from a head injury sustained in a bus crash, is the chief suspect in a murder hunt, when a girl that he has just met is found dead on the local common, and he has no alibi for the time she was killed.', 'Jim Ackland, who suffers from a head injury sustained in a bus crash, is the chief suspect in a murder hunt, when a girl that he has just met is found dead on the local common, and he has no alibi for the time she was killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDkJGh6qlKhV5aMaXcSQWUh3mCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65777'),
  ('1042542914510410', 'The OctoGames', 2022, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Aaron Mirtes, Aaron Mirtes', 'Aaron Mirtes', 'Lacy Hartselle, Cale Adcock, Luv Patel, Henry Haggard, Allison Shrum, Alice Raver, Brad Belemjian, Patrick Sharn', null, 'Eight contestants compete in eight deadly, classic children''s games. They seek fame beyond their wildest dreams, competing for the chance to take over the YouTube channel of the famous yet elusive masked content creator known only as "JaxPro".', 'Eight contestants compete in eight deadly, classic children''s games. They seek fame beyond their wildest dreams, competing for the chance to take over the YouTube channel of the famous yet elusive masked content creator known only as "JaxPro".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGz5rffXhegQH5PGUDiObqoOt06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028703'),
  ('876734011861009380', 'The Octopus', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'An octopus slithers over objects on land—a doll, a skull—then oozes along the shore into the sea. It secretes its ink. The camera follows it along rocks into deeper water, watching closely as it breathes. Its eye is closed then open. Simple titles, in French and German, suggest what to watch. The octopus alternates the use of breathing tubes on either side. It changes color as cells on its skin contract or dilate. Extreme magnification helps us see these changes. Two struggle, one dies. On shore, fishermen catch them and put them in pails. A single tentacle still has life. Back in the sea, two octopi attack a crab. Soon only a couple of crab legs are visible in the mouth of the victor.', 'An octopus slithers over objects on land—a doll, a skull—then oozes along the shore into the sea. It secretes its ink. The camera follows it along rocks into deeper water, watching closely as it breathes. Its eye is closed then open. Simple titles, in French and German, suggest what to watch. The octopus alternates the use of breathing tubes on either side. It changes color as cells on its skin contract or dilate. Extreme magnification helps us see these changes. Two struggle, one dies. On shore, fishermen catch them and put them in pails. A single tentacle still has life. Back in the sea, two octopi attack a crab. Soon only a couple of crab legs are visible in the mouth of the victor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGIIqrcM2NCSdYyi6cqOgYXMuQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117590'),
  ('212522603728539609', 'The Octopus', 1998, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Jean-Bernard Pouy, Patrick Raynal', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Clotilde Courau, Julien Rassam, Stéphane Boucher, Julie Delarme, Aristide Demonico, James Faulkner, Céline Cailleau', null, 'Gabriel, dit Le Poulpe (The Octopus) is a laid-back private investigator who works on cases for his own pleasure. He is drawn to the fictional Loire Valley port of Angerneau, with his lover Clotilde who has been summoned by the police concerning the defacement of a deceased relative''s grave. Since Angernau is her home town, she wants to leave it as soon as possible to avoid old acquaintances, but Gabriel stumbles on intriguing events concerning the cargo of a ship in port.', 'Gabriel, dit Le Poulpe (The Octopus) is a laid-back private investigator who works on cases for his own pleasure. He is drawn to the fictional Loire Valley port of Angerneau, with his lover Clotilde who has been summoned by the police concerning the defacement of a deceased relative''s grave. Since Angernau is her home town, she wants to leave it as soon as possible to avoid old acquaintances, but Gabriel stumbles on intriguing events concerning the cargo of a ship in port.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adlv1HqJ7dQ72FwQjar8yc62NtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62012'),
  ('738411547566938535', 'The Octopuses from the Second Floor', 1987, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Jindřich Polák, Jiří Ostrý, Petr Hartl', 'Ota Hofman, Jindřich Polák', 'Dagmar Havlová Veškrnová, Pavel Zedníček, Žaneta Fuchsová, Milan Šimáček, Přemysl Kočí, Miroslav Macháček, Jan Kanyza, Boris Rösner', null, 'While on vacation with their bickering parents, young Eva and her little brother Johnny find in a polluted lake two strange friendly sentient octopuses made of strange material that attracts electricity. They take them as pets.', 'While on vacation with their bickering parents, young Eva and her little brother Johnny find in a polluted lake two strange friendly sentient octopuses made of strange material that attracts electricity. They take them as pets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86L7GNazmXW7Znq7WkF0MKSJtix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573076'),
  ('771219007534605276', 'The Odd Angry Shot', 1979, 'War, Action, Comedy', 'Tom Jeffrey, Donald McAlpine, Buddy Joe Hooker', 'Tom Jeffrey', 'Graham Kennedy, John Hargreaves, John Jarratt, Bryan Brown, Graeme Blundell, Richard Moir, Peter Drouyn, Ian Gilmour', null, 'A group of Australian SAS regiment soldiers are deployed to Vietnam around 1967/8 and encounter the realities of war, from the numbing boredom of camp life and long range patrols, raids and ambushes where nothing happens, to the the terror of enduring mortar barrages from an unseen enemy. Men die and are crippled in combat by firefights and booby traps, soldiers kill and capture the enemy, gather intelligence and retake ground only to cede it again whilst battling against the bureaucracy and obstinacy of the conventional military hierarchy. In the end they return to civilization, forever changed by their experiences but glad to return to the life they once knew.', 'A group of Australian SAS regiment soldiers are deployed to Vietnam around 1967/8 and encounter the realities of war, from the numbing boredom of camp life and long range patrols, raids and ambushes where nothing happens, to the the terror of enduring mortar barrages from an unseen enemy. Men die and are crippled in combat by firefights and booby traps, soldiers kill and capture the enemy, gather intelligence and retake ground only to cede it again whilst battling against the bureaucracy and obstinacy of the conventional military hierarchy. In the end they return to civilization, forever changed by their experiences but glad to return to the life they once knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5etko0Lq8gMHk6MbWTeVAfQcljZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29582'),
  ('849301542955328198', 'The Odd Couple', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Gene Saks, Robert B. Hauser, Hank Moonjean', 'Neil Simon', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, John Fiedler, Herb Edelman, David Sheiner, Monica Evans, Carole Shelley, Iris Adrian', null, 'In New York, Felix, a neurotic news writer who just broke up with his wife, is urged by his chaotic friend Oscar, a sports journalist, to move in with him, but their lifestyles are as different as night and day are, so Felix''s ideas about housekeeping soon begin to irritate Oscar.', 'In New York, Felix, a neurotic news writer who just broke up with his wife, is urged by his chaotic friend Oscar, a sports journalist, to move in with him, but their lifestyles are as different as night and day are, so Felix''s ideas about housekeeping soon begin to irritate Oscar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3dKPpzEi7WfgmoMnMwWyQnd2ja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11356'),
  ('887052481691937812', 'The Odd Couple II', 1998, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Howard Deutch, Jane Shannon-Smith, Jamie Anderson', 'Neil Simon', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, Richard Riehle, Jonathan Silverman, Lisa Waltz, Mary Beth Peil, Christine Baranski, Jean Smart', 'PG-13', 'Brucey, the son of Oscar, calls his father to invite him to his wedding to Felix''s daughter next Sunday in California. Oscar and Felix meet again at Los Angeles International Airport and rent a car in order to go to San Malina for the wedding.', 'Brucey, the son of Oscar, calls his father to invite him to his wedding to Felix''s daughter next Sunday in California. Oscar and Felix meet again at Los Angeles International Airport and rent a car in order to go to San Malina for the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTajf9LOrL1pok7KnzoHKFJJyWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27472'),
  ('321326608650646105', 'The Odd Girl', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Laurent Perreau, Céline Bozon', 'Laurent Perreau, Marcia Romano, Gaëlle Macé', 'Laura Smet, Marie Bunel, Samir Guesmi, Oulaya Amamra, Naidra Ayadi, Micha Lescot, India Hair, Guillaume Marquet', null, 'Following a long prison term, 30 year-old Céline must find a place in society. Hiding her past, she introduces herself with a new identity to get work for a trial period in a hotel. Céline finds herself endlessly walking a tightrope between truth and fiction. When she meets Idir, despite the threat of being unmasked, Céline falls in love and finds herself a prisoner to her own lies. But how can one live without taking risks?', 'Following a long prison term, 30 year-old Céline must find a place in society. Hiding her past, she introduces herself with a new identity to get work for a trial period in a hotel. Céline finds herself endlessly walking a tightrope between truth and fiction. When she meets Idir, despite the threat of being unmasked, Céline falls in love and finds herself a prisoner to her own lies. But how can one live without taking risks?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJOiu1mvI6im9UNIUKn355XI7kZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450039'),
  ('765617323140230431', 'The Odd Job', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Peter Medak, Ken Hodges, Mary Selway', 'Graham Chapman, Bernard McKenna', 'Graham Chapman, David Jason, Diana Quick, Simon Williams, Edward Hardwicke, Bill Paterson, Michael Elphick, Carolyn Seymour', null, 'Arthur Harris is a happily married man who returns from his job to discover that his wife, Fiona, is leaving him. Devastated he gets really drunk and tries to commit suicide. After a few setbacks and while he is trying to electrocute himself with a lamp, the door bell rings. An odd man in a leather coat asks if there are any odd jobs that he can perform. Arthur hires the man to kill him. The next day his wife returns, but the man he hired is still trying to kill him...', 'Arthur Harris is a happily married man who returns from his job to discover that his wife, Fiona, is leaving him. Devastated he gets really drunk and tries to commit suicide. After a few setbacks and while he is trying to electrocute himself with a lamp, the door bell rings. An odd man in a leather coat asks if there are any odd jobs that he can perform. Arthur hires the man to kill him. The next day his wife returns, but the man he hired is still trying to kill him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJY9NhXMdkJIw7nOXGue7jziC2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164156'),
  ('1093527878623005871', 'The Odd Life of Timothy Green', 2012, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Hedges, John Toll', 'Peter Hedges', 'Jennifer Garner, Joel Edgerton, CJ Adams, Odeya Rush, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Rosemarie DeWitt, David Morse, Ron Livingston', 'PG', 'A childless couple bury a box in their backyard, containing all of their wishes for an infant. Soon, a child is born, though Timothy Green is not all that he appears.', 'A childless couple bury a box in their backyard, containing all of their wishes for an infant. Soon, a child is born, though Timothy Green is not all that he appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24HWf4QBnEbNYDJfNFR1CmwtST5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71864'),
  ('372087924442647557', 'The Odd One Dies', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cheng Siu-Keung, Pad Chan Wai-Hung, Patrick Yau Tat-Chi', 'Wai Ka-Fai', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Byun Woo-min, Ken Choi Fung-wah, Tian Min-zu, Andy Lee Do-Yue, Lam Suet, Lu Ching-Ting', null, 'Mo applies to become a hit-man to pay off all his debt. But just before he starts working, he wins loads of money from gambling and decides to hire a woman to replace him.', 'Mo applies to become a hit-man to pay off all his debt. But just before he starts working, he wins loads of money from gambling and decides to hire a woman to replace him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpA0NuQrCADDBrNiq5eYoAjBAIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41196'),
  ('943274460102904474', 'The Odds', 2019, 'Horror', 'Bob Giordano', 'Bob Giordano', 'Abbi Butler, James J. Fuertes, Katie Gunn, Les Parker, Sean Ramey', 'NR', 'A young woman enlists in an underground game of pain endurance in the hope of winning the million dollar prize. She soon learns the real opponent is the man who''s running the game, as he employs horrific methods to manipulate and defeat her.', 'A young woman enlists in an underground game of pain endurance in the hope of winning the million dollar prize. She soon learns the real opponent is the man who''s running the game, as he employs horrific methods to manipulate and defeat her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjnwhO3Lz7BkWRltlRzTVgCTKGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600892'),
  ('82831015666356087', 'The Odessa File', 1974, 'Thriller', 'Ronald Neame, Oswald Morris, Colin M. Brewer', 'Kenneth Ross, George Markstein', 'Jon Voight, Maximilian Schell, Maria Schell, Mary Tamm, Derek Jacobi, Peter Jeffrey, Klaus Löwitsch, Kurt Meisel', 'PG', 'Following the suicide of an elderly Jewish man, investigative journalist Peter Miller sets out to hunt down an SS Captain and former concentration camp commander. In doing so he discovers that, despite allegations of war crimes, the former commander has become a man of importance in industry in post-war Germany, protected from prosecution by a powerful organisation of former SS members called Odessa.', 'Following the suicide of an elderly Jewish man, investigative journalist Peter Miller sets out to hunt down an SS Captain and former concentration camp commander. In doing so he discovers that, despite allegations of war crimes, the former commander has become a man of importance in industry in post-war Germany, protected from prosecution by a powerful organisation of former SS members called Odessa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8uFsP2PxDMN3bdo5Ve6fYj0ebN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21489'),
  ('396605282109280412', 'The Odyssey', 2016, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jérôme Salle, Matias Boucard, Guionne Leroy', 'Laurent Turner, Jérôme Salle', 'Lambert Wilson, Pierre Niney, Audrey Tautou, Laurent Lucas, Benjamin Lavernhe, Vincent Heneine, Thibault de Montalembert, Roger Van Hool', null, 'The aquatic adventure of the highly influential and fearlessly ambitious pioneer, innovator, filmmaker, researcher, and conservationist, Jacques-Yves Cousteau, covers roughly thirty years of an inarguably rich in achievements life.', 'The aquatic adventure of the highly influential and fearlessly ambitious pioneer, innovator, filmmaker, researcher, and conservationist, Jacques-Yves Cousteau, covers roughly thirty years of an inarguably rich in achievements life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oerzjTh9x226CJUJluIVqgYcOH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332794'),
