  ('874459014169360985', 'The Old Maid', 1939, 'Drama', 'Edmund Goulding, Tony Gaudio, Jack Sullivan', 'Casey Robinson', 'Bette Davis, Miriam Hopkins, George Brent, Donald Crisp, Jane Bryan, Louise Fazenda, James Stephenson, Jerome Cowan', 'NR', 'The lives of two cousins are complicated by the return of an ex-boyfriend and an illegitimate child.', 'The lives of two cousins are complicated by the return of an ex-boyfriend and an illegitimate child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBhLMf4KMayJAQqLmWBaZEF7th9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44919'),
  ('112355318007122049', 'The Old Maid', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Blanc, Pierre Lhomme', 'Jean-Pierre Blanc', 'Philippe Noiret, Annie Girardot, Marthe Keller, Michael Lonsdale, Édith Scob, Jean-Pierre Darras, Catherine Samie, Maria Schneider', null, 'Muriel is a shy woman who bluffs and blusters around in order to hide her shyness and to protect her loneliness, even though she longs wistfully for a companion of some sort. She has been lonely so long that now she is an old maid and has never been wooed. In this gentle French film, Muriel gets a glimpse of romance when Gabriel walks into the seaside hotel she is vacationing in. His car has broken down, and he has to stay there for a few days while it is repaired. Hers is the only dinner table with room at it, and Gabriel cannot prevent himself from charming women. She is stiff with him at first, but soon they develop a friendship.', 'Muriel is a shy woman who bluffs and blusters around in order to hide her shyness and to protect her loneliness, even though she longs wistfully for a companion of some sort. She has been lonely so long that now she is an old maid and has never been wooed. In this gentle French film, Muriel gets a glimpse of romance when Gabriel walks into the seaside hotel she is vacationing in. His car has broken down, and he has to stay there for a few days while it is repaired. Hers is the only dinner table with room at it, and Gabriel cannot prevent himself from charming women. She is stiff with him at first, but soon they develop a friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diFhLbkZOfp4P9Cw19OgJFH24Yg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105576'),
  ('1015850534492458069', 'The Old Man & the Gun', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Scott Bowers, Tomas Deckaj, James M. Johnston', 'David Lowery', 'Robert Redford, Casey Affleck, Sissy Spacek, Danny Glover, Tom Waits, Tika Sumpter, Ari Elizabeth Johnson, Teagan Johnson', 'PG-13', 'The true story of Forrest Tucker, from his audacious escape from San Quentin at the age of 70 to an unprecedented string of heists that confounded authorities and enchanted the public. Wrapped up in the pursuit are a detective, who becomes captivated with Forrest’s commitment to his craft, and a woman, who loves him in spite of his chosen profession.', 'The true story of Forrest Tucker, from his audacious escape from San Quentin at the age of 70 to an unprecedented string of heists that confounded authorities and enchanted the public. Wrapped up in the pursuit are a detective, who becomes captivated with Forrest’s commitment to his craft, and a woman, who loves him in spite of his chosen profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4BfxRK8dBgbQqbRxPs8kmLd8LG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429203'),
  ('296227583167615949', 'The Old Man and the Sea', 1958, 'Adventure, Drama', 'John Sturges, James Wong Howe, Floyd Crosby', 'Peter Viertel', 'Spencer Tracy, Felipe Pazos, Harry Bellaver, Don Diamond, Mary Hemingway, Joey Ray, Mauritz Hugo, Tony Rosa', 'NR', 'Santiago is an aging, down-on-his-luck, Cuban fisherman who, after catching nothing for nearly 3 months, hooks a huge Marlin and struggles to land it far out in the Gulf Stream.', 'Santiago is an aging, down-on-his-luck, Cuban fisherman who, after catching nothing for nearly 3 months, hooks a huge Marlin and struggles to land it far out in the Gulf Stream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Q34dJL6m1vdzAr0jDDKDmNL52e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11331'),
  ('153275296597994460', 'The Old Man and the Sea', 1990, 'Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jud Taylor, Tony Imi, Adam Somner', 'Roger O. Hirson', 'Anthony Quinn, Gary Cole, Patricia Clarkson, Joe Santos, Valentina Quinn, Francesco Quinn, Sully Diaz, Raúl Dávila', null, 'Based on the novel by Ernest Hemingway. Santiago goes out on his usual fishing trip and makes a huge catch, the biggest of his life. Then a shark attacks and tries to steal his catch.', 'Based on the novel by Ernest Hemingway. Santiago goes out on his usual fishing trip and makes a huge catch, the biggest of his life. Then a shark attacks and tries to steal his catch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlX71ziFH52SecHM3pdVcFj3Tbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79775'),
  ('927217908671579436', 'The Old Man and the Sea', 1999, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Sergey Reshetnikov, Aleksandr Petrov', 'Aleksandr Petrov', 'Gordon Pinsent, Kevin Duhaney, Yoji Matsuda, Rentaro Mikuni', null, 'An old fisherman makes the biggest catch of his life.', 'An old fisherman makes the biggest catch of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvzw2rXqSObcBc1RAIWYW7CzLuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38577'),
  ('438136482595586508', 'The Old Man of the Mountain', 1933, 'Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Cab Calloway, Bonnie Poe, Mae Questel', null, 'Betty Boop goes to see the fearsome Old Man of the Mountain for herself; he sings the title song and a duet with Betty.', 'Betty Boop goes to see the fearsome Old Man of the Mountain for herself; he sings the title song and a duet with Betty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plYhlcbOKozBiarJf8VMwhSxZB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148311'),
  ('363452565518261050', 'The Old Mill', 1937, 'Animation, Thriller, Family, Music, Horror', 'Wilfred Jackson, Graham Heid, Jack Atwood', null, 'Marie Arbuckle, Jean MacMurray, Louise Myers, Clarence Nash, Marta Nielsen, Jerry Philipps, Barbara Whitson, Elvia Allman', 'NR', 'Night in an old mill is dramatically depicted in this Oscar-winning short in which the frightened occupants, including birds, timid mice, owls, and other creatures try to stay safe and dry as a storm approaches. As the thunderstorm worsens, the mill wheel begins to turn and the whole mill threatens to blow apart until at last the storm subsides.', 'Night in an old mill is dramatically depicted in this Oscar-winning short in which the frightened occupants, including birds, timid mice, owls, and other creatures try to stay safe and dry as a storm approaches. As the thunderstorm worsens, the mill wheel begins to turn and the whole mill threatens to blow apart until at last the storm subsides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AeBR5ZhhuNM3PsBuR0d6EL3ejL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72640'),
  ('479672136813145085', 'The Old Mill Pond', 1936, 'Animation', 'Rudolf Ising, Hugh Harman', null, null, null, 'The fish and frogs gather at the old mill pond to hear a jazz concert. Performers include caricatures of Cab Calloway, Fats Waller, and tap dancer Bill Robinson ("Bojangles").', 'The fish and frogs gather at the old mill pond to hear a jazz concert. Performers include caricatures of Cab Calloway, Fats Waller, and tap dancer Bill Robinson ("Bojangles").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJXGtjEW4BLdfiMvkTVfUAjFXXT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201973'),
  ('767512363031648464', 'The Old New Year', 1980, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Oleg Efremov, Naum Ardashnikov, Naum Ardashnikov', 'Mikhail Roshchin', 'Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Pyotr Shcherbakov, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Aleksandr Kalyagin, Irina Miroshnichenko, Georgi Burkov, Boris Shcherbakov, Anastasiya Nemolyaeva', null, 'Two families are trying to fix their problems during the celebration of the New Year.', 'Two families are trying to fix their problems during the celebration of the New Year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZGbiN8lsdScmDVZG6w7cTvEAnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65136'),
  ('893103890556548767', 'The Old Oak', 2023, 'Drama', 'Robbie Ryan, Ken Loach, Jamie Hamer', 'Paul Laverty', 'Dave Turner, Ebla Mari, Claire Rodgerson, Trevor Fox, Chris McGlade, Col Tait, Jordan Louis, Chrissie Robinson', null, 'A pub landlord in a previously thriving mining community struggles to hold onto his pub. Meanwhile, tensions rise in the town when Syrian refugees are placed in the empty houses in the community.', 'A pub landlord in a previously thriving mining community struggles to hold onto his pub. Meanwhile, tensions rise in the town when Syrian refugees are placed in the empty houses in the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN293BKB0MDqpILmLCtGGYxQXKW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970348'),
  ('864624999218333262', 'The Old Testament', 1963, 'Adventure, History, Drama', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Giovanni Simonelli, Ignazio Dolce', 'Giovanni Simonelli, Gianfranco Parolini', 'Brad Harris, Ivano Staccioli, Mara Lane, Carlo Tamberlani, Franca Parisi, Philippe Hersent, Jacques Berthier, Đorđe Nenadović', null, 'The Jews of Jerusalem are driven out by their Syrian rulers. They gather their forces, and return to drive out their oppressors.', 'The Jews of Jerusalem are driven out by their Syrian rulers. They gather their forces, and return to drive out their oppressors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtM1iQtjoTZnRMcHZoCEoRo0aav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330395'),
  ('708832203380971055', 'The Old Way', 2023, 'Western, Drama', 'Brett Donowho, Sion Michel', 'Carl W. Lucas', 'Nicolas Cage, Ryan Kiera Armstrong, Noah Le Gros, Clint Howard, Shiloh Fernandez, Abraham Benrubi, Nick Searcy, Kerry Knuppe', 'R', 'An old gunslinger and his daughter must face the consequences of his past, when the son of a man he killed years ago arrives to take his revenge.', 'An old gunslinger and his daughter must face the consequences of his past, when the son of a man he killed years ago arrives to take his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HCCYAIocXxMKn7J9yQfDX1vBM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872954'),
  ('176381764331506868', 'The Old Ways', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Adam Lee, Christopher Alender', 'Marcos Gabriel', 'Brigitte Kali Canales, Andrea Cortés, Julian Lerma, Sal Lopez, Julia Vera, AJ Bowen', 'R', 'Cristina, a journalist of Mexican origin, travels to her ancestral home in Veracruz to investigate a story of sorcery and healing. There, she is kidnapped by a group of locals who claim she''s the devil incarnated.', 'Cristina, a journalist of Mexican origin, travels to her ancestral home in Veracruz to investigate a story of sorcery and healing. There, she is kidnapped by a group of locals who claim she''s the devil incarnated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYnedFgdnN62QXE8HAPVtQKNFFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752505'),
  ('822615241763539000', 'The Old Woman with the Knife', 2025, 'Action, Mystery, Drama', 'Min Kyu-dong, Lee Jae-woo, Lee Jae-geon', 'Min Kyu-dong, Kim Dong-wan', 'Lee Hye-young, Kim Sung-cheol, Yeon Woo-jin, Kim Moo-yul, Shin Sia, Kim Kang-woo, Choi Moo-seong, Ok Ja-yeon', null, 'Aging assassin Hornclaw has seen it all, but she never expected to mentor a reckless rookie like Bullfight. As their unlikely bond deepens, cracks form in the underworld they navigate together. When Hornclaw discovers someone wants her dead, she''s thrust into a deadly game of deception. With enemies closing in and trust in short supply, survival means staying sharp—both blade and mind.', 'Aging assassin Hornclaw has seen it all, but she never expected to mentor a reckless rookie like Bullfight. As their unlikely bond deepens, cracks form in the underworld they navigate together. When Hornclaw discovers someone wants her dead, she''s thrust into a deadly game of deception. With enemies closing in and trust in short supply, survival means staying sharp—both blade and mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbmxnsv41vsg5UEaNDlf203dOWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1247002'),
  ('530897476242945388', 'The Old Young People', 1962, 'Drama', 'Rodolfo Kuhn, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Rodolfo Kuhn', 'María Vaner, Alberto Argibay, Emilio Alfaro, Jorge Rivera López, Marcela López Rey, Beatriz Matar, Anita Larronde, Flora Blum', null, 'The frustrations felt by certain middle-class youth in Argentina during the early sixties.', 'The frustrations felt by certain middle-class youth in Argentina during the early sixties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TNbKFIGs4V7q55Z7PEKIoU9MEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335488'),
  ('127926047919277927', 'The Old-Fashioned Way', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William Beaudine', 'Jack Cunningham, Garnett Weston', 'W.C. Fields, Joe Morrison, Baby LeRoy, Judith Allen, Jan Duggan, Tammany Young, Nora Cecil, Jack Mulhall', null, 'The Great McGonigle and his troupe of third-rate vaudevillians manage to stay one step ahead of the bill collectors and the sheriff.', 'The Great McGonigle and his troupe of third-rate vaudevillians manage to stay one step ahead of the bill collectors and the sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Fv5XXCR8W3JbG5tz4zMDwtYQKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43688'),
  ('554449730965703564', 'The Oldest Profession', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean-Luc Godard, Claude Autant-Lara', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Georges Tabet, Daniel Boulanger', 'Michèle Mercier, Enrico Maria Salerno, Gabriele Tinti, Elsa Martinelli, Gastone Moschin, Giancarlo Cobelli, Jeanne Moreau, Catherine Samie', null, 'A collection of sketches that tells the story of prostitution through the ages.', 'A collection of sketches that tells the story of prostitution through the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gD8jlp7udSKqnty7YXB4ztXQFb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103613'),
  ('594423703321793671', 'The Olive Tree', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sergi Gallardo, Icíar Bollaín', 'Paul Laverty', 'Anna Castillo, Javier Gutiérrez, Pep Ambròs, Manuel Cucala, Miguel Ángel Aladrén, Carme Pla, Ana Isabel Mena, María Romero', null, 'Alma’s family has been producing quality olive oil in the Baix Maestrat area of Spain’s Castellón for generations. Yet changing pressures in the industry have made their traditional practices economically untenable, and the family is now in the mass-production poultry business. Alma’s grandfather has not spoken in years. Sadness envelopes him, and he no longer wants to eat. His sons—Alma’s father and uncle—are impatient with him, but Alma understands her grandfather. She realizes he has been grieving for a thousand-year-old olive tree that the family has uprooted and sold to pay some debts. (A sadly common reality in Castellón at present.) Unable to bear the idea that her grandfather could die without seeing this terrible wrong corrected, Alma undertakes a quixotic mission to locate the tree and return it to the family orchard, so that her grandfather may have peace in his final days.', 'Alma’s family has been producing quality olive oil in the Baix Maestrat area of Spain’s Castellón for generations. Yet changing pressures in the industry have made their traditional practices economically untenable, and the family is now in the mass-production poultry business. Alma’s grandfather has not spoken in years. Sadness envelopes him, and he no longer wants to eat. His sons—Alma’s father and uncle—are impatient with him, but Alma understands her grandfather. She realizes he has been grieving for a thousand-year-old olive tree that the family has uprooted and sold to pay some debts. (A sadly common reality in Castellón at present.) Unable to bear the idea that her grandfather could die without seeing this terrible wrong corrected, Alma undertakes a quixotic mission to locate the tree and return it to the family orchard, so that her grandfather may have peace in his final days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyWCqamhJImIwLdPgSmXNn2UwX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366505'),
  ('397108190565209011', 'The Olsen Gang', 1968, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Jeppe Jeppesen, Claus Loof, Erik Balling', 'Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Peter Steen, Poul Reichhardt, Kirsten Walther, Lotte Tarp, Grethe Sønck', null, 'The first of 14 Olsen Gang films presents us with Egon Olsen, head of the gang, and his friends Benny and Kjeld, who want to become the best known gang in Denmark and eventually Europe by stealing a famous Bavarian work of art currently displayed in a Copenhagen museum. Although Egon''s plan works out fine, there is only trouble ahead for the little gang.', 'The first of 14 Olsen Gang films presents us with Egon Olsen, head of the gang, and his friends Benny and Kjeld, who want to become the best known gang in Denmark and eventually Europe by stealing a famous Bavarian work of art currently displayed in a Copenhagen museum. Although Egon''s plan works out fine, there is only trouble ahead for the little gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AacndEk3B1wBVhhu9jJD8aEohZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11389'),
  ('478395045431210330', 'The Olsen Gang', 1969, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Ousbey, Knut Bohwim, Mattis Mathiesen', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Aud Schønemann, Sverre Wilberg, Solfrid Heier, Georg Richter, Ingeborg Cook', null, 'Egon Olsen is the leader of the Olsen Gang. While he was in the slammer, he planned how he would steal the fantastic golden figure Keizeroppzatsen.', 'Egon Olsen is the leader of the Olsen Gang. While he was in the slammer, he planned how he would steal the fantastic golden figure Keizeroppzatsen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eB52gzj3qEk7VnHJI5vm9PD24W5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24667'),
  ('220053885297149366', 'The Olsen Gang and Data-Harry Blows Up The World Bank', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Helen Perzon, Knut Bohwim, Mattis Mathiesen', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Aud Schønemann, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Henki Kolstad, Ove Verner Hansen, Sverre Wilberg', null, 'With the help of a corrupt diplomat the Olsen Gang plans to rob the World Bank, with help from the re-schooled Dynamite-Harry, now a computer expert.', 'With the help of a corrupt diplomat the Olsen Gang plans to rob the World Bank, with help from the re-schooled Dynamite-Harry, now a computer expert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOqUwsozWzPhAwvbcEIRFiiqitw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24693'),
  ('97673005144133142', 'The Olsen Gang and Dynamite-Harry', 1970, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Truls Olsen, Erik Søby, Ove Kant', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Arve Opsahl, Sverre Holm, Carsten Byhring, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Kari Simonsen, Aud Schønemann, Sverre Wilberg, Georg Richter', null, 'A foreign criminal gang makes a large-scale bank coup. The suspicion falls on the Olsen Gang. They escape, take up the hunt for the real criminals and thus it all starts. The police are looking for the Olsen Gang, and they are looking for the real criminals.', 'A foreign criminal gang makes a large-scale bank coup. The suspicion falls on the Olsen Gang. They escape, take up the hunt for the real criminals and thus it all starts. The police are looking for the Olsen Gang, and they are looking for the real criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4p9CkT5yReMwP9HYWBiR1Rmjha0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24666'),
  ('573827140750972431', 'The Olsen Gang and Dynamite-Harry Goes Wild', 1973, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Ousbey, Knut Bohwim, Mattis Mathiesen', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Aud Schønemann, Pål Johannessen, Sverre Wilberg, Elsa Lystad', null, 'Egon and the gang is about to commit their biggest heist – stealing 6 millions from an undercover operation at a freight company. The money is stored in the most advanced security vault ever constructed, guarded by professional gorillas.', 'Egon and the gang is about to commit their biggest heist – stealing 6 millions from an undercover operation at a freight company. The money is stored in the most advanced security vault ever constructed, guarded by professional gorillas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93MQebDUYKTqhIrbIjpti1DHBfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24670'),
  ('36790135374121505', 'The Olsen Gang and Dynamite-Harry On The Trail', 1977, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lasse Sæther, Knut Bohwim, Knut Gløersen', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Aud Schønemann, Ove Verner Hansen, Sverre Wilberg, Øivind Blunck', null, 'The Olsen Gang is robbed in Spain and loses the millions they earned from their last heist. Egon has a plan to get the money back by robbing the National State Railways for a gold transport.', 'The Olsen Gang is robbed in Spain and loses the millions they earned from their last heist. Egon has a plan to get the money back by robbing the National State Railways for a gold transport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMyMRmUEtlj7JIUqw3wRByryL3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24692'),
  ('1020933488021445428', 'The Olsen Gang and Dynamite-Harry Towards New Heights', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Helen Perzon, Knut Bohwim, Mattis Mathiesen', null, 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Aud Schønemann, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Sverre Wilberg, Øivind Blunck, Arne Aas', null, 'An unfaithful servant in the Norwegian Petroleum Directorate tries to sell top secret information to German industry leaders. Egon has a plan to earn money on the transaction himself.', 'An unfaithful servant in the Norwegian Petroleum Directorate tries to sell top secret information to German industry leaders. Egon has a plan to earn money on the transaction himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaP44dt0NRr77nR1mwEhGSW3QEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24694'),
  ('667489033219794307', 'The Olsen Gang For Full Music', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lasse Sæther, Knut Bohwim, Mattis Mathiesen', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Aud Schønemann, Pål Johannessen, Helge Reiss, Dan Fosse, Alf Malland', null, 'Egon Olsen is commissioned to help a baron with an insurance fraud. As the dividend can finance Basse''s wedding, even Valborg accepts the plans.', 'Egon Olsen is commissioned to help a baron with an insurance fraud. As the dividend can finance Basse''s wedding, even Valborg accepts the plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0gjpNNMyK7hernkCXk9iyJJ2q4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24688'),
  ('679009044927066729', 'The Olsen Gang Goes to War', 1978, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Jeppe Jeppesen, Henning Sprogøe', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Ove Verner Hansen', null, 'Some criminal EU ministers plan to turn Denmark into a gigantic fair ground and holiday paradise. Egon gets his hand at some important documents which could both make him rich and take care of Denmark''s future.', 'Some criminal EU ministers plan to turn Denmark into a gigantic fair ground and holiday paradise. Egon gets his hand at some important documents which could both make him rich and take care of Denmark''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i8vNc8tJPsRFsEKRDnwrQ6KDfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12592'),
  ('181040334644887850', 'The Olsen Gang in a Fix', 1969, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Jørgen Skov, Ib Thorup', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Ghita Nørby, Peter Steen, Preben Kaas, Poul Reichhardt, Paul Hagen', null, 'A good looking female social welfare worker makes Egon Olsen forget about crimes for some time, but when an American gangster breaks into a local bank and the police think its Egon''s work, he has to get back to work to prove he''s innocent.', 'A good looking female social welfare worker makes Egon Olsen forget about crimes for some time, but when an American gangster breaks into a local bank and the police think its Egon''s work, he has to get back to work to prove he''s innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82bLBVTP0xliVmtezGDTy31cJRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12231'),
  ('182110349650969341', 'The Olsen Gang in Jutland', 1971, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Jørgen Skov, Erik Balling, Hans Kristensen', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Helle Virkner, Willy Rathnov, Karl Stegger, Preben Kaas', null, 'The Olsen gang in Jutland. Ones again Egon Olsen has a plan when he gets out of Vridslose State Prison. He has found out that the Germans left a large sum of money (in American dollars and gold bars) in one of their commando bunkers, when they were defeated in 1945; the only problem it''s in Jutland. Egon, Benny and Kjeld "appropriate" a car and drives to Jutland along with Kjelds wife and child Yvonne and Borge. They look forward to fooling the the people in Jutland, but of course, things don''t go quite as planed. It ends with Benny, Kjeld, Borge and Yvonne sitting in the train back to Copenhagen, were they are overtaken by Egon in his car on the road next to the track. This is the last time the Olsen gang goes to Jutland.', 'The Olsen gang in Jutland. Ones again Egon Olsen has a plan when he gets out of Vridslose State Prison. He has found out that the Germans left a large sum of money (in American dollars and gold bars) in one of their commando bunkers, when they were defeated in 1945; the only problem it''s in Jutland. Egon, Benny and Kjeld "appropriate" a car and drives to Jutland along with Kjelds wife and child Yvonne and Borge. They look forward to fooling the the people in Jutland, but of course, things don''t go quite as planed. It ends with Benny, Kjeld, Borge and Yvonne sitting in the train back to Copenhagen, were they are overtaken by Egon in his car on the road next to the track. This is the last time the Olsen gang goes to Jutland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpQNR02pqXynd8fXh0v3mCYIcMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11390'),
  ('779208034558581216', 'The Olsen Gang Jumps the Fence', 1981, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Tom Hedegaard', 'Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Holger Juul Hansen', null, 'As usual, Egon has an ingenious plan. And, as usual, it works just fine until one of the gang members makes some kind of funny error. This time, however, even Egon''s life is in danger, for some international criminals try to get rid of him by throwing him into a container filled with acid.', 'As usual, Egon has an ingenious plan. And, as usual, it works just fine until one of the gang members makes some kind of funny error. This time, however, even Egon''s life is in danger, for some international criminals try to get rid of him by throwing him into a container filled with acid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV9slWgGWYbgfWm5KftRW3XSi67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15539'),
  ('774353491555865402', 'The Olsen Gang Long Gone', 1981, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Tom Hedegaard', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Holger Juul Hansen', null, 'Criminal genius Egon Olsen presents his accomplices Benny and Keld with yet another infallible plan that can only end badly. The booty is a red suitcase containing values ​​worth five million. The sinister mastermind Bang-Johansen carries the suitcase. The Olsen Gang follows him to Paris, where they put their cunning and carefully organized plan into motion.', 'Criminal genius Egon Olsen presents his accomplices Benny and Keld with yet another infallible plan that can only end badly. The booty is a red suitcase containing values ​​worth five million. The sinister mastermind Bang-Johansen carries the suitcase. The Olsen Gang follows him to Paris, where they put their cunning and carefully organized plan into motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNGjDYC5jEdCYrhVQ4uCnYYnS7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15537'),
  ('460321641510283377', 'The Olsen Gang Never Surrenders', 1979, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Claus Loof, Henning Sprogøe', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Peter Steen', null, 'Egon plans to exploit knowledge gained during his latest term of incarceration. By stealing the unmanipulated financial records of DanInvest he obtains the majority of the stocks in the department store Magasin du Nord, just in time for their closing sale. The attempt to get the red suitcase that will save the day they rob the main vault at the EEC headquarters in Brussels and end up hijacking a tank.', 'Egon plans to exploit knowledge gained during his latest term of incarceration. By stealing the unmanipulated financial records of DanInvest he obtains the majority of the stocks in the department store Magasin du Nord, just in time for their closing sale. The attempt to get the red suitcase that will save the day they rob the main vault at the EEC headquarters in Brussels and end up hijacking a tank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpV9dlPjjJg7p8UlRJFPBx4YvKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12712'),
  ('361968179207142620', 'The Olsen Gang on the Track', 1975, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Claus Loof, Claus Ørsted', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Jes Holtsø, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Helge Kjærulff-Schmidt', null, 'Egon and his two cronies managed to sneak a fortune with them to Spain. Here they live a life in a whirl of pleasures, but they are not truly happy. While Egon always has the money chained to him, Bøffen still manages to steal them. Egon ends up in jail once again, and when he comes out, he has a brilliant plan.', 'Egon and his two cronies managed to sneak a fortune with them to Spain. Here they live a life in a whirl of pleasures, but they are not truly happy. While Egon always has the money chained to him, Bøffen still manages to steal them. Egon ends up in jail once again, and when he comes out, he has a brilliant plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQgsDUzKRQ6cX9vfXcvLWhjJpWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11391'),
  ('220837111014243344', 'The Olsen Gang Outta Sight', 1977, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Claus Loof, Erik Balling', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Claus Ryskjær, Paul Hagen, Ove Verner Hansen, Axel Strøbye', null, 'Egon is starting to be a little forgetful; he forgot the zone number, so he fails to open the strongbox. When he gets out of Vridslose State Prison, Kjeld and Benny have become associates of Yvonne''s cousin Georg from America. He is not just some old-fashioned strongbox thief that can''t remember like Egon, but a young hip IT criminal, that thinks that everyone else is inferior. However, Egon doesn''t take lightly to the Georg''s patronizing so he sabotages Georg''s computer and ruins his cup. This time Egon''s ambitions reaches a new high, when he and his gang break in to the World Bank, and they get away with it. Of course, thanks to Yvonne, they aren''t rich very long.', 'Egon is starting to be a little forgetful; he forgot the zone number, so he fails to open the strongbox. When he gets out of Vridslose State Prison, Kjeld and Benny have become associates of Yvonne''s cousin Georg from America. He is not just some old-fashioned strongbox thief that can''t remember like Egon, but a young hip IT criminal, that thinks that everyone else is inferior. However, Egon doesn''t take lightly to the Georg''s patronizing so he sabotages Georg''s computer and ruins his cup. This time Egon''s ambitions reaches a new high, when he and his gang break in to the World Bank, and they get away with it. Of course, thanks to Yvonne, they aren''t rich very long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hU9olfYOg1pDqnH07Ydye3qCoKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12711'),
  ('1137163549361355334', 'The Olsen Gang Runs Amok', 1973, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Jørgen Skov, Tommy Reilly', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Preben Kaas, Axel Strøbye, Birgitte Federspiel, Jesper Langberg', null, 'When Egon Olsen gets out of Vridlose State Prision once again, his friends Benny and Kjeld do not want to know about his new ingenious plan: they are actually WORKING in a shop! Thus, he has to think of something else to get his hands on the money of some international gangster.', 'When Egon Olsen gets out of Vridlose State Prision once again, his friends Benny and Kjeld do not want to know about his new ingenious plan: they are actually WORKING in a shop! Thus, he has to think of something else to get his hands on the money of some international gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUSa33TJXIYA8rlLBsxl5flTRsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15499'),
  ('600469280587935988', 'The Olsen Gang Sees Red', 1976, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Henning Kristiansen, Erik Balling', 'Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Jes Holtsø, Lene Brøndum, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Ove Verner Hansen', null, 'Egon and the gang are hired to stage a robbery of an antique Chinese vase for an economically challenged baron. Naturally they fooled, which infuriates Egon. The gang tries to get back at the baron by switching the vase with a cheap Hong Kong copy. One attempt is made during the barons hunting party, where Egon ends up being bricked up in the catacombs. In another attempt, the gang has to coordinate breaking through several walls at The Royal Theater in Copenhagen with the "Elverhøj" overture.', 'Egon and the gang are hired to stage a robbery of an antique Chinese vase for an economically challenged baron. Naturally they fooled, which infuriates Egon. The gang tries to get back at the baron by switching the vase with a cheap Hong Kong copy. One attempt is made during the barons hunting party, where Egon ends up being bricked up in the catacombs. In another attempt, the gang has to coordinate breaking through several walls at The Royal Theater in Copenhagen with the "Elverhøj" overture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8PtINTFHJKlOIw78M7z3WahhMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11392'),
  ('920997835715586094', 'The Olsen Gang Takes the Gold', 1972, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Knut Bohwim, Alan Ousbey, Mattis Mathiesen', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Arve Opsahl, Carsten Byhring, Sverre Holm, Aud Schønemann, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Anne-Lise Tangstad, Ole-Jørgen Nilsen, Per Theodor Haugen', null, 'Egon returns from prison with the key to a big heist, a hidden Nazi-treasure. The Olsen Gang finds the location of the treasure, but problems arise when the international criminals Carina and Ricco shows up.', 'Egon returns from prison with the key to a big heist, a hidden Nazi-treasure. The Olsen Gang finds the location of the treasure, but problems arise when the international criminals Carina and Ricco shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cllHlH2r7me2Mj8mjdKs1wlc09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24668'),
  ('817203913604124448', 'The Olsen Gang''s Big Score', 1972, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Bo Christensen, Tom Hedegaard', 'Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Arthur Jensen, Poul Reichhardt, Jesper Langberg, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen', null, 'After his usual stay behind bars, Egon has another cunning plan involving millions. They rob over 4 million from a money transport. The gang keeps a low profile and hide the money. But it''s stolen by "Kongen" and "Knægten", who immediately start living it up - in the penthouse suite at the Sheraton. The suitcase with the money changes hands several times, before Kongen''s daughter takes of with all the money.', 'After his usual stay behind bars, Egon has another cunning plan involving millions. They rob over 4 million from a money transport. The gang keeps a low profile and hide the money. But it''s stolen by "Kongen" and "Knægten", who immediately start living it up - in the penthouse suite at the Sheraton. The suitcase with the money changes hands several times, before Kongen''s daughter takes of with all the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SX3CFLzNAQ09y9TcJ7tNgMf7W0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15498'),
  ('574969372345273238', 'The Olsen Gang''s Last Trick', 1998, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Tom Hedegaard, Morten Arnfred, Peter Klitgaard', 'Henning Bahs', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Henrik Koefoed, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Grethe Sønck', null, 'Egon escapes from the psychiatric ward, where he has been incarcerated since the gang''s last coup. Keld and Benny pick him up, and when Egon, as always, is planning the big heist, the Olsen Gang is once again on the move.', 'Egon escapes from the psychiatric ward, where he has been incarcerated since the gang''s last coup. Keld and Benny pick him up, and when Egon, as always, is planning the big heist, the Olsen Gang is once again on the move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkOidJCoRpqVTUlaQlAtG6Ejm9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12549'),
  ('841584423059562486', 'The Olympic Champ', 1942, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jack Kinney, Louis Debney', null, 'George Johnson, John McLeish', 'NR', 'A narrator explains the history of the Olympic Games while Goofy demonstrates events.', 'A narrator explains the history of the Olympic Games while Goofy demonstrates events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gac7DVaKcJNrHVlzTyiHRd3c3Qh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58527'),
  ('1056737596500841394', 'The Olympic Elk', 1952, 'Documentary', 'James Algar, C.O. Slyfield, Erwin L. Verity', 'Ted Sears, James Algar, Winston Hibler', 'Winston Hibler', null, 'Join the majestic Olympic elk as they traverse the alpine path from their winter home in the lowland shadow of Washington''s Mount Olympus, to the fertile grazing grounds of its towering peaks.', 'Join the majestic Olympic elk as they traverse the alpine path from their winter home in the lowland shadow of Washington''s Mount Olympus, to the fertile grazing grounds of its towering peaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23Y4ZjCrghsYG1ZvOCWiuPVyw69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179183'),
  ('1144964769678788664', 'The Olympic Games as They Were Practiced in Ancient Greece', 1924, 'Documentary', 'Jean de Rovera', null, null, null, 'A documentary on the Olympic games of ancient Greece, made during the 1924 games.', 'A documentary on the Olympic games of ancient Greece, made during the 1924 games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj7rvYb7iTkbrKbeDaqFzdIhgw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470826'),
  ('332513544147188207', 'The Omega Code', 1999, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Drama', 'Robert Marcarelli', 'Hollis Barton, Stephan Blinn', 'Casper Van Dien, Michael York, Catherine Oxenberg, Michael Ironside, Jan Tříska, Stella Vordemann, Devon Odessa, William Hootkins', 'PG-13', 'An ancient prophecy is about to be fulfilled as a secret code brings the world to the edge of apocalypse.', 'An ancient prophecy is about to be fulfilled as a secret code brings the world to the edge of apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU73cxp7kxi5142nYZVzRibF5QP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29064'),
  ('822998148135221186', 'The Omega Man', 1971, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Boris Sagal, Russell Metty', 'John William Corrington, Joyce Hooper Corrington', 'Charlton Heston, Anthony Zerbe, Rosalind Cash, Paul Koslo, Eric Laneuville, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Anna Aries, Brian Tochi', 'PG', 'Due to an experimental vaccine, Dr. Robert Neville is the only human survivor of an apocalyptic war waged with biological weapons. Besides him, only a few hundred deformed, nocturnal people remain; sensitive to light, and homicidally psychotic.', 'Due to an experimental vaccine, Dr. Robert Neville is the only human survivor of an apocalyptic war waged with biological weapons. Besides him, only a few hundred deformed, nocturnal people remain; sensitive to light, and homicidally psychotic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlt65C43HeoDm5K5gYBtT20OeA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11234'),
  ('1920800626711729', 'The Omen', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Donner, Gilbert Taylor, David Tomblin', 'David Seltzer', 'Gregory Peck, Lee Remick, David Warner, Billie Whitelaw, Harvey Stephens, Patrick Troughton, Martin Benson, Robert Rietti', 'R', 'Immediately after their miscarriage, the US diplomat Robert Thorn adopts the newborn Damien without the knowledge of his wife. Yet what he doesn’t know is that their new son is the son of the devil.', 'Immediately after their miscarriage, the US diplomat Robert Thorn adopts the newborn Damien without the knowledge of his wife. Yet what he doesn’t know is that their new son is the son of the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDcjjEu1fMNmsXi4l4D8IftlTix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794'),
  ('932979228073527414', 'The Omen', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jonathan Sela, John Moore, Julian Wall', 'David Seltzer', 'Liev Schreiber, Julia Stiles, Mia Farrow, David Thewlis, Pete Postlethwaite, Michael Gambon, Seamus Davey-Fitzpatrick, Predrag Bjelac', 'R', 'A diplomatic couple adopts the son of the devil without knowing it. A remake of the classic horror film of the same name from 1976.', 'A diplomatic couple adopts the son of the devil without knowing it. A remake of the classic horror film of the same name from 1976.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kf1Qq9b32jn4umll9qD2ue5ftnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806'),
  ('772957213393833677', 'The One', 2001, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'James Wong, Robert McLachlan, Richard Graves', 'Glen Morgan', 'Jet Li, Carla Gugino, Delroy Lindo, Jason Statham, James Morrison, Dylan Bruno, Richard Steinmetz, Steve Rankin', 'PG-13', 'A sheriff''s deputy fights an alternate universe version of himself who grows stronger with each alternate self he kills.', 'A sheriff''s deputy fights an alternate universe version of himself who grows stronger with each alternate self he kills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcr3t71KmeXINemMrhaGBGVJPwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10796'),
  ('374151654789823393', 'The One', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Lu Zhengyu, Viktor Petrov, Zhang Yukun', 'Lu Zhengyu', 'Lu Zhengyu, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Fan Wei, Joan Chen, Cai Guoqing, Kong Lianshun, Isabelle Huang, Yasuaki Kurata', null, 'Funny scramble of an esoteric book of cooking between a guy without feeling, a tough girl, a master out of date, a dark-minded rich man, a emotion-manipulating woman and a OCD-suffering samurai.', 'Funny scramble of an esoteric book of cooking between a guy without feeling, a tough girl, a master out of date, a dark-minded rich man, a emotion-manipulating woman and a OCD-suffering samurai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCRe2bn9BaKzaHXunknZ53BOfpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470388'),
  ('778269762353194826', 'The One', 2022, 'Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'Mikhail Kelim, Yuliya Marina, Filipp Lamshin', 'Dmitriy Suvorov, Andrey Nazarov', 'Nadezhda Kaleganova, Maksim Ivanov-Marenin, Victor Dobronravov, Anna Dubrovskaya, Vladimir Vinogradov, Mariya Sokova, Vladislav Vetrov, Diana Enakaeva', null, 'On August 24, 1981, the newlyweds Larisa and Vladimir Savitsky stepped on board the plane following the flight Komsomolsk-on-Amur - Blagoveshchensk. 30 minutes before landing, the civilian aircraft AN-24 collided with another aircraft and broke into pieces at an altitude of more than 5 kilometers above the ground. No one was supposed to survive ... but a miracle happened. Larisa Savitskaya woke up in the middle of the wreckage of the plane in the impenetrable taiga. Now she herself had to create a real miracle, which only a strong-minded person is capable of.', 'On August 24, 1981, the newlyweds Larisa and Vladimir Savitsky stepped on board the plane following the flight Komsomolsk-on-Amur - Blagoveshchensk. 30 minutes before landing, the civilian aircraft AN-24 collided with another aircraft and broke into pieces at an altitude of more than 5 kilometers above the ground. No one was supposed to survive ... but a miracle happened. Larisa Savitskaya woke up in the middle of the wreckage of the plane in the impenetrable taiga. Now she herself had to create a real miracle, which only a strong-minded person is capable of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jtHkKhkA4kioi4km8uPql5G7WH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610363'),
  ('125403835720749841', 'The One and Only', 1978, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carl Reiner, Victor J. Kemper', 'Steve Gordon', 'Henry Winkler, Kim Darby, Gene Saks, William Daniels, Harold Gould, Polly Holliday, Hervé Villechaize, Bill Baldwin', 'PG', 'Andy Schmidt manages to win fellow student Mary’s heart, but getting a job after college turns out much harder than expected. Desperate and dreaming of stardom, he tries wrestling.', 'Andy Schmidt manages to win fellow student Mary’s heart, but getting a job after college turns out much harder than expected. Desperate and dreaming of stardom, he tries wrestling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8zrgfHe7iun7oX5NcAzhTe45KY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47901'),
  ('929027312001676792', 'The One and Only', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Susanne Bier, Jens Schlosser, Eigil Jacobsen', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Sidse Babett Knudsen, Niels Olsen, Søs Egelind, Paprika Steen, Sofie Gråbøl, Lars Kaalund, Hella Joof, Jannie Faurschou', null, 'When kitchen fitter Niller comes to install Sus''s new suite, their immediate attraction to one another proves a sweet escape from both of their problematic relationships.', 'When kitchen fitter Niller comes to install Sus''s new suite, their immediate attraction to one another proves a sweet escape from both of their problematic relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cutsTlDTJWJwYfaLnInKUirKp9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18908'),
  ('664182394441725095', 'The One and Only Ivan', 2020, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Greg Fisher, Thea Sharrock, Randi Hiller', 'Mike White', 'Bryan Cranston, Sam Rockwell, Brooklynn Prince, Angelina Jolie, Danny DeVito, Ariana Greenblatt, Helen Mirren, Phillipa Soo', 'PG', 'A gorilla named Ivan who’s living in a suburban shopping mall tries to piece together his past, with the help of other animals, as they hatch a plan to escape from captivity.', 'A gorilla named Ivan who’s living in a suburban shopping mall tries to piece together his past, with the help of other animals, as they hatch a plan to escape from captivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDOyGAiTaXvjKGmnmXsoFO7zItt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508570'),
  ('740974484690231253', 'The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band', 1968, 'Music, Family', 'Michael O''Herlihy', 'Lowell S. Hawley', 'Walter Brennan, Buddy Ebsen, Lesley Ann Warren, John Davidson, Janet Blair, Kurt Russell, Bobby Riha, Jon Walmsley', 'G', 'The eleven members of the Bower family move to Dakota Territory.', 'The eleven members of the Bower family move to Dakota Territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehE9DsE9boVIJ5CGfeu3vmih6mn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64877'),
  ('6877423219239671', 'The one I love', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Élie Chouraqui', 'Jean-Marie Duprez, Élie Chouraqui', 'Barbara Schulz, Gérard Darmon, Anton Balekdjian, Marc Lavoine, Liina Brunelle, Alex Diot, Anouk Aimée, Jean-Pierre Malo', null, 'Isabelle est une trentenaire célibataire (depuis qu''elle est divorcée). Elle est belle, sexy, drôle, émouvante, intelligente... Irrésistible ! Elle est numéro 2 d''un journal qu''elle a créé avec Brice son partenaire et qu''elle dirige d''une main de fer même pas recouverte d''un gant de velours ! Tous les hommes sont fous d''elle. Tous ! Trois en particuliers ! Son fils, Achille, 10 ans, qui depuis le', 'Isabelle est une trentenaire célibataire (depuis qu''elle est divorcée). Elle est belle, sexy, drôle, émouvante, intelligente... Irrésistible ! Elle est numéro 2 d''un journal qu''elle a créé avec Brice son partenaire et qu''elle dirige d''une main de fer même pas recouverte d''un gant de velours ! Tous les hommes sont fous d''elle. Tous ! Trois en particuliers ! Son fils, Achille, 10 ans, qui depuis le', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZyLzWO7uw3trk15RWHH8cmolF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17407'),
  ('832009515990020787', 'The One I Love', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Charlie McDowell, Doug Emmett, David Paul Jacobson', 'Justin Lader', 'Mark Duplass, Elisabeth Moss, Ted Danson, Kiana Cason, Kaitlyn Dodson, Lori Farrar, Marlene Malin, Tim Peddicord', 'R', 'Ethan and Sophie are a married couple on the brink of separation when, at the urging of their therapist, they decide to salvage their relationship by escaping to a beautiful vacation house for the weekend.', 'Ethan and Sophie are a married couple on the brink of separation when, at the urging of their therapist, they decide to salvage their relationship by escaping to a beautiful vacation house for the weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewsYTI6KKQw3IDPFmVVbHq89kxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242090'),
  ('928194580003873135', 'The One I Loved', 2025, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Diane Kurys, Philippe Rousselot, Morgan Autexier', 'Diane Kurys, Martine Moriconi', 'Roschdy Zem, Marina Foïs, Thierry de Peretti, Vincent Colombe, Pauline Cassan, Xavier Robic', null, 'Simone Signoret and Yves Montand were the most famous couple of their time. Haunted by her husband’s affair with Marilyn Monroe and bruised by all those that followed, Signoret always refused the role of victim. What they knew was that they would never leave each other.', 'Simone Signoret and Yves Montand were the most famous couple of their time. Haunted by her husband’s affair with Marilyn Monroe and bruised by all those that followed, Signoret always refused the role of victim. What they knew was that they would never leave each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IwLq57nfP1wqLH5s1uTaS7PBRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1383266'),
  ('108333198101525042', 'The One Man Band', 1970, 'Comedy, Music', 'Jean Rabier, Serge Korber', 'Géza von Radványi, Serge Korber', 'Louis de Funès, Olivier de Funès, Noëlle Adam, Franco Volpi, Paola Tedesco, Paul Préboist, Daniel Bellus, Max Desrau', null, 'Evan Evans, the director of a ballet troupe, is rehearsing his next show in Monaco, in preparation for a worldwide tour. When one member of his troupe leaves to get married, Evans imposes a regime of strict discipline on his remaining dancers. The latter get their revenge by presenting Evans’ nephew Philippe, the only male member of the group, with a baby and a note claiming he is the father…', 'Evan Evans, the director of a ballet troupe, is rehearsing his next show in Monaco, in preparation for a worldwide tour. When one member of his troupe leaves to get married, Evans imposes a regime of strict discipline on his remaining dancers. The latter get their revenge by presenting Evans’ nephew Philippe, the only male member of the group, with a baby and a note claiming he is the father…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6IYXmSNkWPSrDG8wyUisEP0c8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36179'),
  ('629898882647638400', 'The One That Got Away', 1957, 'War, Drama', 'Roy Ward Baker, Eric Cross', 'Howard Clewes', 'Hardy Krüger, Colin Gordon, Michael Goodliffe, Terence Alexander, Jack Gwillim, Andrew Faulds, Julian Somers, Alec McCowen', null, 'Based on the true story of Oberleutnant Franz von Werra, the only German prisoner of war captured in Britain to escape back to Germany during the Second World War.', 'Based on the true story of Oberleutnant Franz von Werra, the only German prisoner of war captured in Britain to escape back to Germany during the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbBjNhQJCDDWaH0MYXFfN1pU9zy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64735'),
  ('868138523156408450', 'The One-Armed Swordsman', 1967, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Kuang Han-Lu, Yuen Chang-Sam', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Tien Feng, Violet Pan Ying-Zi, Yang Chi-Ching, Tang Ti, Fan Mei-Sheng, Wang Shih-Chieh', null, 'A noble swordsman, whose arm had been chopped off, returns to his former teacher to defend him from a villainous gang of rival swordsmen.', 'A noble swordsman, whose arm had been chopped off, returns to his former teacher to defend him from a villainous gang of rival swordsmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uUwl2cB4O7NmDFsKCmZkYTtVGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54178'),
  ('1015455260974737452', 'The One-Handed Trick', 2008, 'Drama', 'Santiago A. Zannou, Albert Pascual, Juantxo Grafulla', 'Santiago Zannou, Iván Morales', 'El Langui, Ovono Candela, Javier Iglesias Bustamante, Elio Toffana, Mala Rodríguez, Juan Navarro, Diego Carrasco, Younes Bachir', null, 'Quique el Cuajo, a hustler with half a body affected by cerebral palsy, joins forces with his friend Adolfo, a young mulatto, to create a music studio.', 'Quique el Cuajo, a hustler with half a body affected by cerebral palsy, joins forces with his friend Adolfo, a young mulatto, to create a music studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2jatdoQdribmDrZJTIToIRjQXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143344'),
  ('1130202277375628094', 'The One-Man Band', 1900, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A band-leader has arranged seven chairs for the members of his band. When he sits down in the first chair, a cymbal player appears in the same chair, then rises and sits in the next chair. As the cymbal player sits down, a drummer appears in the second chair, and then likewise moves on to the third chair. In this way, an entire band is soon formed, and is then ready to perform.', 'A band-leader has arranged seven chairs for the members of his band. When he sits down in the first chair, a cymbal player appears in the same chair, then rises and sits in the next chair. As the cymbal player sits down, a drummer appears in the second chair, and then likewise moves on to the third chair. In this way, an entire band is soon formed, and is then ready to perform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3YDMnAhIDABS4cXYzT54Cp0QiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49280'),
  ('1086187675242861445', 'The Ones Below', 2016, 'Thriller', 'David Farr, Ed Rutherford, Nick Justin', 'David Farr', 'Stephen Campbell Moore, Clémence Poésy, David Morrissey, Laura Birn, Deborah Findlay, Jonathan Harden, Tuyen Do, Laila Alj', null, 'A young affluent couple expecting their first child hits it off with the new couple that moves in downstairs, until a dinner party between them ends in a shocking accident.', 'A young affluent couple expecting their first child hits it off with the new couple that moves in downstairs, until a dinner party between them ends in a shocking accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOMFKPLZG9DI1EhZfkqxhkum4vw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356842'),
  ('834127183187638092', 'The Ones Who Stay', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Loïc Paillard, Loïc Paillard', 'Loïc Paillard', 'Benoît Chauvin, Camille Claris, Jean Fornerod, Sylvain Mossot, Marica Soyer, Zack Zublena, Clément de Dadelsen, Étienne Beydon', null, 'Alexandre, a somewhat lost thirty-something, decides to start out in the professional world. Loris, his misanthropic roommate, works on a universal method to succeed in life, and Patrick, Alexandre''s father, decides to stop his chemotherapy. Everything is on track, until Manon shows up in their lives.', 'Alexandre, a somewhat lost thirty-something, decides to start out in the professional world. Loris, his misanthropic roommate, works on a universal method to succeed in life, and Patrick, Alexandre''s father, decides to stop his chemotherapy. Everything is on track, until Manon shows up in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOnDwyvivwKCw2fUzels7Phk1fA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503229'),
  ('486346233420831536', 'The Onion Field', 1979, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harold Becker, Charles Rosher Jr., Thomas J. Mack', 'Joseph Wambaugh', 'John Savage, James Woods, Franklyn Seales, Ted Danson, Ronny Cox, David Huffman, Christopher Lloyd, Dianne Hull', 'R', 'An LA police officer is murdered in the onion fields outside of Bakersfield. However, legal loopholes could keep his kidnappers from receiving justice, and his partner is haunted by overwhelming survivor''s guilt.', 'An LA police officer is murdered in the onion fields outside of Bakersfield. However, legal loopholes could keep his kidnappers from receiving justice, and his partner is haunted by overwhelming survivor''s guilt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XQiG3wiaHnJnAU2uNz5OaTBgBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33831'),
  ('779245157010268890', 'The Onion Movie', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Mike Maguire, Tom Kuntz, Maryse Alberti', 'Robert D. Siegel, Todd Hanson', 'Len Cariou, Steven Seagal, Larissa Laskin, Ken Takemoto, Don McManus, Michael Bolton, Ahmed Ahmed, Brendan Fletcher', null, 'Venerable newscaster Norm Archer reports the latest news in politics, health, culture and entertainment - such as an automotive recall of decapitation-inducing "Neckbelts" and a study finding that "depression hits losers hardest". This compilation of bogus news stories, celebrity profiles, movie trailers and skits come courtesy of the ace satirists at The Onion.', 'Venerable newscaster Norm Archer reports the latest news in politics, health, culture and entertainment - such as an automotive recall of decapitation-inducing "Neckbelts" and a study finding that "depression hits losers hardest". This compilation of bogus news stories, celebrity profiles, movie trailers and skits come courtesy of the ace satirists at The Onion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AikMOGbaKpCzHnupsdBzyacsKC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14771'),
  ('570388573052134224', 'The Only Game in Town', 1970, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'George Stevens, Henri Decaë', 'Frank D. Gilroy', 'Warren Beatty, Elizabeth Taylor, Charles Braswell, Olga Valéry, Hank Henry, Suzan E. Claude', 'PG', 'Fran walks into a piano bar for pizza. She comes back home with Joe, the piano player. Joe plans on winning $5,000 and leave Las Vegas. Fran waits for something else. Meanwhile, he moves in with her.', 'Fran walks into a piano bar for pizza. She comes back home with Joe, the piano player. Joe plans on winning $5,000 and leave Las Vegas. Fran waits for something else. Meanwhile, he moves in with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mv5BbmqCNRsYYrEXEUAcWplXrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84481'),
  ('500591657432740876', 'The Only Girl in the Orchestra', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Molly O''Brien, Martina Radwan', null, 'Orin O''Brien, Molly O''Brien, George O''Brien, Marguerite Churchill, Leonard Bernstein', 'G', 'Trailblazing double bassist Orin O''Brien never wanted the spotlight, but when Leonard Bernstein hired her in 1966 as the first female musician in the New York Philarmonic, it was inevitable that she would become the focus of much interest and fascination. Now 87 years old and recently retired, Orin looks back on her remarkable life and career, insisting that a fuss should not be made, much preferring to play a supporting role to the family, students, friends, and colleagues that surround her.', 'Trailblazing double bassist Orin O''Brien never wanted the spotlight, but when Leonard Bernstein hired her in 1966 as the first female musician in the New York Philarmonic, it was inevitable that she would become the focus of much interest and fascination. Now 87 years old and recently retired, Orin looks back on her remarkable life and career, insisting that a fuss should not be made, much preferring to play a supporting role to the family, students, friends, and colleagues that surround her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpsTStOYGfkF590K3kCEjWXCleN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195310'),
  ('939258426987268437', 'The Only Living Boy in New York', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marc Webb, Stuart Dryburgh', 'Allan Loeb', 'Callum Turner, Jeff Bridges, Kate Beckinsale, Pierce Brosnan, Cynthia Nixon, Kiersey Clemons, Tate Donovan, Wallace Shawn', null, 'When a young man learns that his overbearing father is having an affair, he tries to stop it, only to be seduced by the older woman as well.', 'When a young man learns that his overbearing father is having an affair, he tries to stop it, only to be seduced by the older woman as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8e6Q7N2qJ7utBrf6pyf3EiLADja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95608'),
  ('406698686602484817', 'The Only Living Pickpocket in New York', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Noah Segan, Sam Levy, Kat Hess, Laura Klein, Cara Conaway', 'Noah Segan', 'John Turturro, Giancarlo Esposito, Will Price, Tatiana Maslany, Victoria Moroles', null, 'Harry Lehman is an aging pickpocket who plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in a drastically changed New York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been replaced by easily cancelled credit cards, and Harry struggles to make ends meet as he cares for his disabled wife, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins and fences a valuable USB stick, Harry finds himself in a race against time to return the loot or face the rage of a vengeful crime family.', 'Harry Lehman is an aging pickpocket who plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in a drastically changed New York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been replaced by easily cancelled credit cards, and Harry struggles to make ends meet as he cares for his disabled wife, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins and fences a valuable USB stick, Harry finds himself in a race against time to return the loot or face the rage of a vengeful crime family.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FotJsgLxFhsa43dTknU9NqxdkdP4.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york'),
  ('616867773373552063', 'The Only One', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Noah Gilbert, Todd Bell', 'Seth Gilbert', 'Caitlin Stasey, Jon Beavers, Niseema Theillaud, Blake Lindsley, Hugo Armstrong, Ian Merrigan, Gerry McIntyre, Joshua Grothe', null, 'On the brink of resigning herself to a life of independence and wanderlust, a young woman visits an old flame on his vineyard in France and takes one last shot at a committed relationship.', 'On the brink of resigning herself to a life of independence and wanderlust, a young woman visits an old flame on his vineyard in France and takes one last shot at a committed relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq3m6bUqEB67E6dHMo6oWZJJz1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749968'),
  ('718105741265969048', 'The Only Son', 1936, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Nobuo Nishikawa, Hamao Negishi', null, 'Chōko Iida, Shinichi Himori, Masao Hayama, Yoshiko Tsubouchi, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Chishū Ryū, Tomoko Naniwa, Bakudan Kozo', null, 'A silk factory worker is persuaded to support her son''s education up to a college level despite their poverty. Many years later, she travels to Tokyo to visit her son.', 'A silk factory worker is persuaded to support her son''s education up to a college level despite their poverty. Many years later, she travels to Tokyo to visit her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFSHjmpIAyDkrheszNfSM99H3Bl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52047'),
  ('1134265422561069272', 'The Open Door', 2016, 'Drama', 'Marina Seresesky, Roberto Fernández', 'Marina Seresesky', 'Carmen Machi, Terele Pávez, Asier Etxeandia, Lucía Balas, Paco Tous, Sonia Almarcha, Yoima Valdés, Mar Saura', null, 'Rosa, is a prostitute who inherited the profession from Antonia, her mother, who thinks she is Sara Montiel and turns her daily life in a hell. Rosa does not know how to be happy. She just can not. But the unexpected arrival of a new member to her particular (and absurd) family will give her a unique opportunity to achieve happiness', 'Rosa, is a prostitute who inherited the profession from Antonia, her mother, who thinks she is Sara Montiel and turns her daily life in a hell. Rosa does not know how to be happy. She just can not. But the unexpected arrival of a new member to her particular (and absurd) family will give her a unique opportunity to achieve happiness', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OSTTg62jKd1PLuJx9PkhSo7Qpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387536'),
  ('176874978715773832', 'The Open House', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Matt Angel, Suzanne Coote, Filip Vandewal', 'Suzanne Coote, Matt Angel', 'Dylan Minnette, Piercey Dalton, Sharif Atkins, Patricia Bethune, Matt Angel, Suzanne Coote, Aaron Abrams, Kathryn Beckwith', 'NR', 'A teenager and his mother find themselves besieged by threatening forces when they move into a new house.', 'A teenager and his mother find themselves besieged by threatening forces when they move into a new house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JwdoLcbFWaeUBxKaoFulRVK8Ja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485774'),
  ('771078384383766854', 'The Open Road', 1926, 'Documentary', 'Claude Friese-Greene, Claude Friese-Greene', null, 'Norman Swan', null, 'In the summer of 1924 Claude Friese-Greene, a pioneer of colour cinematography, set out from Cornwall with the aim of recording life on the road between Land’s End and John O’Groats. Entitled The Open Road, his remarkable travelogue was conceived as a series of shorts, 26 episodes in all, to be shown weekly at the cinema. The result is a fascinating portrait of inter-war Britain, in which town and country, people and landscapes are captured as never before, in a truly unique and rich colour palette.', 'In the summer of 1924 Claude Friese-Greene, a pioneer of colour cinematography, set out from Cornwall with the aim of recording life on the road between Land’s End and John O’Groats. Entitled The Open Road, his remarkable travelogue was conceived as a series of shorts, 26 episodes in all, to be shown weekly at the cinema. The result is a fascinating portrait of inter-war Britain, in which town and country, people and landscapes are captured as never before, in a truly unique and rich colour palette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLRmSKjeip3PlwgMVIfA6HTZs6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190152'),
  ('159543483065668033', 'The Open Road', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Meredith, Yaron Orbach', 'Michael Meredith', 'Justin Timberlake, Jeff Bridges, Kate Mara, Harry Dean Stanton, Mary Steenburgen, Bret Saberhagen, Allen Overton Battle III, James Harlon Palmer', null, 'Minor leaguer Carlton Garret takes an unexpected road trip to track down his estranged father, legendary baseball player Kyle Garret when Carlton’s mother becomes sick. Once reunited, Carlton struggles to deal with the series of misadventures caused by his father’s antics. Attempts at bonding come to a head as the mismatched duo make their way from Ohio back home to Houston to reunite the family.', 'Minor leaguer Carlton Garret takes an unexpected road trip to track down his estranged father, legendary baseball player Kyle Garret when Carlton’s mother becomes sick. Once reunited, Carlton struggles to deal with the series of misadventures caused by his father’s antics. Attempts at bonding come to a head as the mismatched duo make their way from Ohio back home to Houston to reunite the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOy2b1oj3IZ7rbqvlgZImZCST8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24663'),
  ('1826612219158948', 'The Opening Act', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Julie Ashton, Steve Byrne', 'Steve Byrne', 'Jimmy O. Yang, Neal Brennan, Jermaine Fowler, Cedric the Entertainer, Alex Moffat, Bill Burr, Debby Ryan, Ken Jeong', null, 'The film follows Will Chu whose true life passion is to become a stand-up comedian. He is given the opportunity to emcee a comedy show, opening for his hero, Billy G. Chu has to decide if he wants to continue the life he has set up or to pursue his dream, the life of a comedian.', 'The film follows Will Chu whose true life passion is to become a stand-up comedian. He is given the opportunity to emcee a comedy show, opening for his hero, Billy G. Chu has to decide if he wants to continue the life he has set up or to pursue his dream, the life of a comedian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLzrhDvKXT7KVIDTglnTOhz19cW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664184'),
  ('596464205793425874', 'The Operative', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Maya Markova, Kolja Brandt, Yuval Adler', 'Yuval Adler', 'Diane Kruger, Martin Freeman, Cas Anvar, Werner Daehn, Liron Levo, Hadi Khanjanpour, Maria Gnecchi, Julia Schneider', null, 'A young Western woman is recruited by the Mossad to go undercover in Tehran where she becomes entangled in a complex triangle with her handler and her subject.', 'A young Western woman is recruited by the Mossad to go undercover in Tehran where she becomes entangled in a complex triangle with her handler and her subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fojgblOYLelv0yi9OczouCfR16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574207'),
  ('725717323933289834', 'The Opium War', 1997, 'Drama, War, History', 'Xie Jin, Zhu Shibin, Na Renhua', 'Zhu Sujin, Fuxian Zong, Ni Zhen', 'Bao Guo-an, Liankun Lin, Lung Sihung, Hsin Shao, Simon Williams, 苏民, Jiang Hua, Li Shilong', null, 'The story of the Opium War between China, in the waning days of the Qing Dynasty, and the British Empire, in the 1830s, and the subsequent takeover of Hong Kong by Britain; through the eyes of the key figures, fiercely nationalistic Lin Zexu, and opportunistic British naval diplomat Charles Elliot.', 'The story of the Opium War between China, in the waning days of the Qing Dynasty, and the British Empire, in the 1830s, and the subsequent takeover of Hong Kong by Britain; through the eyes of the key figures, fiercely nationalistic Lin Zexu, and opportunistic British naval diplomat Charles Elliot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpeoFsPyv7QUQo5MNlTw7ylkde0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161382'),
