  ('359383168375120874', 'The Ordinary People', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mathias Gokalp, Christophe Orcand', 'Mathias Gokalp, Nadine Lamari', 'Denis Podalydès, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Mélanie Doutey, Pascal Greggory, Zabou Breitman, Bouli Lanners, Frédéric Bonpart, Dimitri Storoge', null, 'The Muller company organizes a reception to mark the launch of a new product. During the evening, we discover that this is actually a coaching exercise for company executives. Gradually, rumours about the upcoming acquisition of the company start to emerge and everyone finds themselves trying to save their place.', 'The Muller company organizes a reception to mark the launch of a new product. During the evening, we discover that this is actually a coaching exercise for company executives. Gradually, rumours about the upcoming acquisition of the company start to emerge and everyone finds themselves trying to save their place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUNjVnhq4q3ljIRkRpT9HAJGDkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33404'),
  ('151720167893197201', 'The Oregon Trail', 1959, 'Western', 'Gene Fowler Jr.', 'Gene Fowler Jr., Louis Vittes', 'Fred MacMurray, William Bishop, Nina Shipman, Gloria Talbott, Henry Hull, John Carradine, John Dierkes, Roxene Wells', 'NR', 'In 1846, a reporter for the New York Herald joins a wagon train bound for the Oregon Territory. He hopes to confirm a rumor that President Polk is sending in soldiers disguised as settlers in order to strengthen American claims to the Territory.', 'In 1846, a reporter for the New York Herald joins a wagon train bound for the Oregon Territory. He hopes to confirm a rumor that President Polk is sending in soldiers disguised as settlers in order to strengthen American claims to the Territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juv0iyAdVwSIQ0Cl2pNEJm9Zzo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279388'),
