  ('619300466942842531', 'The Orgies Villa', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Pantelis Voulgaris', 'Gerasimos Stavrou', 'Labros Konstadaras, Kakia Analyti, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Andreas Douzos, Giannis Vogiatzis, Christos Parlas, Melpo Zarokosta, Aris Malliagros', null, 'A parliamentary candidate and his mistress will spend the night at the police station. After all, no one is above the law, no matter what his credentials or social status may appear to be.', 'A parliamentary candidate and his mistress will spend the night at the police station. After all, no one is above the law, no matter what his credentials or social status may appear to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUqgXIfNr2pGn4KOwIb1PbLEvfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297564'),
