  ('709939185247295517', 'The Original Kings of Comedy', 2000, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Spike Lee, Mike Ellis, Bradley Mayer', 'D.L. Hughley, Steve Harvey, Cedric the Entertainer', 'Steve Harvey, D.L. Hughley, Cedric the Entertainer, Bernie Mac', 'R', 'The house is rockin'' and the laughs are rollin'' as comedians Steve Harvey (The Steve Harvey Show), D.L. Hughley (The Hughleys), Cedric The Entertainer (The Steve Harvey Show) and Bernie Mac (Life) meet in this riotously comedy summit directed by Spike Lee.', 'The house is rockin'' and the laughs are rollin'' as comedians Steve Harvey (The Steve Harvey Show), D.L. Hughley (The Hughleys), Cedric The Entertainer (The Steve Harvey Show) and Bernie Mac (Life) meet in this riotously comedy summit directed by Spike Lee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjbEcW9OqWoXKr9e2KySG1WZlNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23618'),
  ('863986696114462745', 'The Orion Loop', 1980, 'Science Fiction', 'Vasili Levin, Vadim Avloshenko, Eduard Hubskyi', 'Valentin Selivanov, Alexei Leonov', 'Leonid Bakshtayev, Gennadi Shkuratov, Anatoli Mateshko, Vitaliy Doroshenko, Liudmyla Smorodina, Yelena Tonunts, Roald Sagdeyev, Alexei Leonov', null, 'A strange phenomenon has been noticed on the outskirts of our Solar system that quickly approaches the Earth. It''s called "Orion''s Loop." A spaceship with a crew of people and androids identical to them is sent to intercept the anomaly. But strange events start happening as the spaceship approaches the mysterious loop.', 'A strange phenomenon has been noticed on the outskirts of our Solar system that quickly approaches the Earth. It''s called "Orion''s Loop." A spaceship with a crew of people and androids identical to them is sent to intercept the anomaly. But strange events start happening as the spaceship approaches the mysterious loop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIniQifUOmxpHHPAfZy9Fd2HoX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146964'),
