  ('694350988861677962', 'The Orphans', 2025, 'Action', 'Olivier Schneider, Maxime Cointe, Vianney Perez', 'Olivier Schneider, Nicolas Peufaillit, Alban Lenoir', 'Alban Lenoir, Dali Benssalah, Sonia Faïdi, Anouk Grinberg, Romain Levi, Suzanne Clément, Naidra Ayadi, Guillaume Soubeyran', null, 'Gab and Driss, childhood friends on bad terms since they left the orphanage, now have opposite lives - one is a cop with the IGPN, the other a fixer for thugs. When their first love dies in a suspicious accident, her 17-year-old daughter, Leïla, takes Gab''s gun and sets off on the trail of a powerful organization willing to do anything to cover the case up. Forced to team up, the orphans must stop her before she crosses a line she can''t return from...', 'Gab and Driss, childhood friends on bad terms since they left the orphanage, now have opposite lives - one is a cop with the IGPN, the other a fixer for thugs. When their first love dies in a suspicious accident, her 17-year-old daughter, Leïla, takes Gab''s gun and sets off on the trail of a powerful organization willing to do anything to cover the case up. Forced to team up, the orphans must stop her before she crosses a line she can''t return from...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WtE3XOgnYRkB5vagppTX9TdUOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244975'),
  ('803799681353309998', 'The Oscar', 1966, 'Drama', 'Russell Rouse, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Harlan Ellison, Russell Rouse, Clarence Greene', 'Stephen Boyd, Elke Sommer, Milton Berle, Eleanor Parker, Joseph Cotten, Tony Bennett, Jill St. John, Ernest Borgnine', null, 'An amoral lowlife accidentally stumbles into an acting career that sets him on a trajectory to Hollywood stardom. But everyone on whom he steps on the way to the top remembers when he is nominated for an Oscar and he runs a dirty campaign in an attempt to win.', 'An amoral lowlife accidentally stumbles into an acting career that sets him on a trajectory to Hollywood stardom. But everyone on whom he steps on the way to the top remembers when he is nominated for an Oscar and he runs a dirty campaign in an attempt to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLh7UvVYc5pa0MLJbFRItLN4QTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56168'),
  ('156301181478646307', 'The Oscars', 2026, 'Comedy, Music', 'Hamish Hamilton, Jonathan Stoller-Schoff, John Zuiker, Scott Gairdner', 'Conan O''Brien, Mike Sweeney, Amberia Allen, José Arroyo, Josh Comers, Dan Cronin, Jessie Gaskell, Skyler Higley, Berkley Johnson, Ian Karmel, Brian Kiley, Laurie Kilmartin, Carol Leifer, Todd Levin, Jon Macks, Matt O''Brien, Agathe Panaretos, Levi MacDougall, Eric Roth', 'Matt Berry, Ember Ambrose, Rei Ami, Paul Thomas Anderson, Chris Appelhans', 'TV-14', 'The 98th Academy Awards ceremony, presented by the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences (AMPAS), hosted by Conan O''Brien.', 'The 98th Academy Awards ceremony, presented by the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences (AMPAS), hosted by Conan O''Brien.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYjU0MDUwNzQtYThlYS00ODJkLTk2MGMtYjFlMWJjMTk1YmE2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-oscars-2026'),
  ('3536078497685366', 'The Ossuary', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'A non-narrative voyage round Sedlec Ossuary, which has been constructed from over 50,000 human skeletons (victims of the Black Death).', 'A non-narrative voyage round Sedlec Ossuary, which has been constructed from over 50,000 human skeletons (victims of the Black Death).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxTQa8hxnWnb1XxDrw6wUrkMU8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19020'),
  ('1107566981220340473', 'The Osterman Weekend', 1983, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Sam Peckinpah, John Coquillon', 'Alan Sharp', 'Rutger Hauer, John Hurt, Craig T. Nelson, Dennis Hopper, Chris Sarandon, Meg Foster, Helen Shaver, Cassie Yates', 'R', 'The host of an investigative news show is convinced by the CIA that the friends he has invited to a weekend in the country are engaged in a conspiracy that threatens national security.', 'The host of an investigative news show is convinced by the CIA that the friends he has invited to a weekend in the country are engaged in a conspiracy that threatens national security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ctWib5LJnTl9oqVNzbD2FNZu80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12239'),
  ('714507833410551026', 'The Other', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Ignacio Villareal, Alex Phillips', 'Rian James, José Revueltas, Roberto Gavaldón', 'Dolores del Río, Agustín Irusta, Víctor Junco, José Baviera, Carlos Villarías, Rafael Icardo, Manuel Dondé, Maruja Grifell', null, 'A mousy, poor manicurist seeks to switch places with her more glamorous, wealthy twin sister.', 'A mousy, poor manicurist seeks to switch places with her more glamorous, wealthy twin sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWkDNQkAVIu5Flql2pAwbiwCXuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119806'),
  ('114945660350957530', 'The Other', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Robert Mulligan, Robert Surtees, Bert Gold', 'Tom Tryon', 'Uta Hagen, Diana Muldaur, Chris Udvarnoky, Martin Udvarnoky, Norma Connolly, Victor French, Loretta Leversee, Lou Frizzell', 'PG', 'A series of gruesome accidents plague a small American farming community in the summer of 1935, encircling two identical twin brothers and their family.', 'A series of gruesome accidents plague a small American farming community in the summer of 1935, encircling two identical twin brothers and their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD6ucPw41W8RImWzFSFeWkHrpiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35280'),
  ('507369964500835446', 'The Other', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Youssef Chahine, Mohsen Nasr, Hesham Soliman', 'Youssef Chahine, Khaled Youssef', 'Hanan Turk, Hani Salama, Nabila Obeid, Mahmoud Hemida, Lebleba, Ezzat Abu Ouf, Amr Saad, Ahmed Fouad Selim', null, 'Adam is the son of a wealthy Egyptian-American family who is studying at UCLA and returns home for a brief vacation. Upon his arrival he meets beautiful reporter Hanane, with whom he begins an intense love affair, and eventually they marry. Trouble arises when Hanane'' s journalistic interests lead her to the corrupt business affairs of Adam''s parents, who are interested in building an American tourist compound that would allow Americans further control of Egypt''s tourist industry, and make them a whole lot richer.', 'Adam is the son of a wealthy Egyptian-American family who is studying at UCLA and returns home for a brief vacation. Upon his arrival he meets beautiful reporter Hanane, with whom he begins an intense love affair, and eventually they marry. Trouble arises when Hanane'' s journalistic interests lead her to the corrupt business affairs of Adam''s parents, who are interested in building an American tourist compound that would allow Americans further control of Egypt''s tourist industry, and make them a whole lot richer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7qfb72oaYGEc7v0prHuoGY48wY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125527'),
  ('754060966179070518', 'The Other', 2007, 'Drama', 'Ariel Rotter, Marcelo Lavintman', 'Ariel Rotter', 'Julio Chávez, María Onetto, María Ucedo, Inés Molina, Arturo Goetz, Osvaldo Bonet', null, 'Arriving at a distant town, a businessman decides to take the identity of a passenger who died during the bus trip.', 'Arriving at a distant town, a businessman decides to take the identity of a passenger who died during the bus trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jxxVLx3DgT9LM8lwOE8xVl27lF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78115'),
  ('690128985750471509', 'The Other', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Olcay Oğuz, Özcan Deniz, Talha Dumanoglu', 'Avni Tuna Dilligil, Özcan Deniz', 'Özcan Deniz, Meryem Uzerli, Aslı Enver, Osman Wöber, Ayten Uncuoğlu, Burçin Birben, Sena Çakır', null, 'A successful man leads a happy life with his new lover Ece. But one day, the ambitious old lover Sara, joins her life again with a job offer that she can not refuse. The man who changed his city for his new job by taking his lover Ece with him is soon to be destroyed by the disappearance of Ece.', 'A successful man leads a happy life with his new lover Ece. But one day, the ambitious old lover Sara, joins her life again with a job offer that she can not refuse. The man who changed his city for his new job by taking his lover Ece with him is soon to be destroyed by the disappearance of Ece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZJfyC319mdV3mrmYHiNrPLtbgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477315'),
  ('127379092903931948', 'The Other', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Etheredge, Noe Medrano', 'Paul Etheredge', 'Olivia Macklin, Dylan McTee, Avangeline Friedlander, Shawnee Smith, Lily D. Moore, Morgana Shaw, Denise Lee, Laurence Pete', null, 'Unable to conceive, a couple seeks to build a family with a young orphan, survivor of tragic childhood. But their act of love turns to horror when they realize the violence in their foster''s past has returned to destroy the new family.', 'Unable to conceive, a couple seeks to build a family with a young orphan, survivor of tragic childhood. But their act of love turns to horror when they realize the violence in their foster''s past has returned to destroy the new family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kE6FV8Lc9Aqir6OlgaNgnbFcy9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1162858'),
  ('819846367966645733', 'The Other Bank', 2009, 'Drama', 'Giorgi Ovashvili, Tamar Kandelaki, Shahriar Assadi', 'Nugzar Shataidze', 'Tedo Bekhauri, Tamar Meskhi, Archil Tabukashvili, Temo Goginava, Lia Abuladze, Leila Khokhosadze, Berdia Intskirveli, Jano Izoria', null, 'Life creates many obstacles for 12 years old boy - Tedo. Tedo belongs to the generation, which was forced to mass displacement because of the civil war in Abkhazia, one of the most beatiful places in Georgia. The civil war took away everything Tedo had, even hope. The film tells about an extraordinary internal drama of a little boy, his thoughts, feelings, pasions, sorrows and efforts to take arms against the difficulties.', 'Life creates many obstacles for 12 years old boy - Tedo. Tedo belongs to the generation, which was forced to mass displacement because of the civil war in Abkhazia, one of the most beatiful places in Georgia. The civil war took away everything Tedo had, even hope. The film tells about an extraordinary internal drama of a little boy, his thoughts, feelings, pasions, sorrows and efforts to take arms against the difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yroZgC9rrGI1HGjwUTz5fkJUkVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76459'),
  ('205501179637638717', 'The Other Boleyn Girl', 2003, 'TV Movie, Drama, History, Romance', 'Philippa Lowthorpe, Graham Smith', 'Philippa Lowthorpe', 'Natascha McElhone, Jodhi May, Jared Harris, Steven Mackintosh, Philip Glenister, Jack Shepherd, John Woodvine, Ron Cook', null, 'Based on the controversial novel by Philippa Gregory, "The Other Boleyn Girl" is a fictionalised account of the life of Lady Mary Boleyn who becomes mistress to England''s king, Henry VIII, before being ousted by her younger sister, Anne. Mary leaves the Court to marry a commoner, but returns when Anne embarks on a reckless policy to save herself from ruin.', 'Based on the controversial novel by Philippa Gregory, "The Other Boleyn Girl" is a fictionalised account of the life of Lady Mary Boleyn who becomes mistress to England''s king, Henry VIII, before being ousted by her younger sister, Anne. Mary leaves the Court to marry a commoner, but returns when Anne embarks on a reckless policy to save herself from ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70pAJXRmqr6hab23aimtA43NLSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79905'),
  ('876908217007677326', 'The Other Boleyn Girl', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Kieran McGuigan, Justin Chadwick, Andrew Piotrowski', 'Peter Morgan, T. Rafael Cimino', 'Natalie Portman, Scarlett Johansson, Eric Bana, Jim Sturgess, Mark Rylance, Kristin Scott Thomas, David Morrissey, Benedict Cumberbatch', 'PG-13', 'A sumptuous and sensual tale of intrigue, romance and betrayal set against the backdrop of a defining moment in European history: two beautiful sisters, Anne and Mary Boleyn, driven by their family''s blind ambition, compete for the love of the handsome and passionate King Henry VIII.', 'A sumptuous and sensual tale of intrigue, romance and betrayal set against the backdrop of a defining moment in European history: two beautiful sisters, Anne and Mary Boleyn, driven by their family''s blind ambition, compete for the love of the handsome and passionate King Henry VIII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2lgC8mmAltWTkbqPM8n5EYF4XL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12184'),
  ('503168142148617464', 'The Other Conquest', 1999, 'Drama, History', 'Salvador Carrasco, Arturo de la Rosa', 'Salvador Carrasco', 'Damián Delgado, José Carlos Rodríguez, Elpidia Carrillo, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Iñaki Aierra, Honorato Magaloni, Maya Zapata, Guillermo Ríos', 'R', 'The film is a drama about the aftermath of the 1520s Spanish Conquest of Mexico told from the perspective of the indigenous Aztec people. It explores the social, religious, and psychological changes brought about by a historical process of colonization that both defined the American continent and is also highly reminiscent of today’s neocolonialism.', 'The film is a drama about the aftermath of the 1520s Spanish Conquest of Mexico told from the perspective of the indigenous Aztec people. It explores the social, religious, and psychological changes brought about by a historical process of colonization that both defined the American continent and is also highly reminiscent of today’s neocolonialism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cD1V0wj6CkKvEPrXb0ZAa0v7uJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89540'),
  ('842693953711861973', 'The Other Dumas', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Safy Nebbou, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Safy Nebbou, Gilles Taurand', 'Gérard Depardieu, Benoît Poelvoorde, Mélanie Thierry, Dominique Blanc, Catherine Mouchet, Michel Duchaussoy, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Philippe Magnan', null, 'Alexandre Dumas, at the height of his career, takes Auguste Maquet, his chief literary collaborator or ''ghost writer'' ten years his junior, to meet a young unknown admirer, Charlotte Desrives. The two men are at the summit of their artistic collaboration for they have just published "The Count of Monte Christo", "Queen Margot" and "The Three Musketeers". If it''s Maquet who writes the majority of the texts, both the honours and fame go to Dumas.', 'Alexandre Dumas, at the height of his career, takes Auguste Maquet, his chief literary collaborator or ''ghost writer'' ten years his junior, to meet a young unknown admirer, Charlotte Desrives. The two men are at the summit of their artistic collaboration for they have just published "The Count of Monte Christo", "Queen Margot" and "The Three Musketeers". If it''s Maquet who writes the majority of the texts, both the honours and fame go to Dumas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spLY36qgzp3reEYzEWeTATWtoBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60254'),
  ('502375010724459730', 'The Other End', 2016, 'Drama', 'Felipe Sholl', 'Felipe Sholl', 'Karine Teles, Tom Karabachian, Denise Fraga, Emílio de Mello, Anita Ferraz, Daniel Rangel, Manoela Dexheimer, Guilherme Guaral', null, 'Diogo (17) has a little quirk: he likes to call his mother''s female therapy patients and masturbate while listening to them on the phone. One of these patients is Angela (43), a woman who was just left by her husband When Diogo calls Angela, she thinks it''s her husband calling. She starts having a relationship with the silence on the other end of the line. But when she finds out it''s Diogo, she''s disgusted. She''s furious. But, most of all, she''s attracted to this person who showed so much interest in her. The only person who called her every day. Diogo helps Angela see that she can have a new beginning and she shows him his way to independence. But they have to face a number of obstacles: There''s the age difference, Diogo''s mother, and, especially, his own path to adulthood.', 'Diogo (17) has a little quirk: he likes to call his mother''s female therapy patients and masturbate while listening to them on the phone. One of these patients is Angela (43), a woman who was just left by her husband When Diogo calls Angela, she thinks it''s her husband calling. She starts having a relationship with the silence on the other end of the line. But when she finds out it''s Diogo, she''s disgusted. She''s furious. But, most of all, she''s attracted to this person who showed so much interest in her. The only person who called her every day. Diogo helps Angela see that she can have a new beginning and she shows him his way to independence. But they have to face a number of obstacles: There''s the age difference, Diogo''s mother, and, especially, his own path to adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePFiF7L9airzDkPwI6txjxG9RV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417546'),
  ('773123302113055496', 'The Other End of the Line', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Dodson, Harlan Bosmajian', 'Tracey Jackson', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Shriya Saran, Austin Basis, Larry Miller, Nouva Monika Wahlgren, Sushmita Mukherjee, Michael Chen, Sara Foster', 'PG-13', 'An employee at an Indian call-center travels to San Francisco to be with a guy she falls for over the phone.', 'An employee at an Indian call-center travels to San Francisco to be with a guy she falls for over the phone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiLgARBzUiE7PPRiJILXSh4zOIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17334'),
  ('514675327882156070', 'The Other F Word', 2011, 'Music, Documentary, Drama, Comedy', 'Andrea Nevins', null, 'Jim Lindberg, Tony Adolescent, Art Alexakis, Rob Chaos, Chris De Wolfe, Joe Escalante, Josh Freese, Fat Mike', null, 'What happens when a generation''s ultimate anti-authoritarians — punk rockers — become society''s ultimate authorities — dads? With a large chorus of punk rock''s leading men — Blink-182''s Mark Hoppus, Red Hot Chili Peppers'' Flea, Rise Against''s Tim McIlrath — The Other F Word follows Jim Lindberg, 20-year veteran of skate punk band, Pennywise, on his hysterical and moving journey from belting his band''s anthem, "Fuck Authority", to embracing his ultimately pivotal authoritarian role in mid-life, fatherhood.', 'What happens when a generation''s ultimate anti-authoritarians — punk rockers — become society''s ultimate authorities — dads? With a large chorus of punk rock''s leading men — Blink-182''s Mark Hoppus, Red Hot Chili Peppers'' Flea, Rise Against''s Tim McIlrath — The Other F Word follows Jim Lindberg, 20-year veteran of skate punk band, Pennywise, on his hysterical and moving journey from belting his band''s anthem, "Fuck Authority", to embracing his ultimately pivotal authoritarian role in mid-life, fatherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aXOrCNV9Hlvftw8qzZpvA1lpjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75785'),
  ('885573126167974897', 'The Other Family', 2011, 'Drama', 'Carlos Marcovich, Gustavo Loza', 'Gustavo Loza', 'Bruno Loza, Jorge Salinas, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Nailea Norvind, Ana Serradilla, Ana Soler, Andrés Almeida, Juan Ríos', null, 'Jean Paul and Chema have been together ten years. They have successful careers, a comfortable home and many friends. But that''s all turned turned upside down when close friend Ivana rescues Hendrix from his broken home and asks them to care for the boy. Hendrix''s mother Nina is a drug addict who suffers at the hands of her abusive partner Patrick. The men begin to consider making Hendrix part of their family.', 'Jean Paul and Chema have been together ten years. They have successful careers, a comfortable home and many friends. But that''s all turned turned upside down when close friend Ivana rescues Hendrix from his broken home and asks them to care for the boy. Hendrix''s mother Nina is a drug addict who suffers at the hands of her abusive partner Patrick. The men begin to consider making Hendrix part of their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pUYGPF7L4craDiatttQxfUBH6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75945'),
  ('719339655844632120', 'The Other Guys', 2010, 'Comedy, Action', 'Oliver Wood, William M. Connor, Kristen Ploucha', 'Adam McKay, Chris Henchy', 'Will Ferrell, Mark Wahlberg, Eva Mendes, Michael Keaton, Steve Coogan, Ray Stevenson, Samuel L. Jackson, Dwayne Johnson', 'PG-13', 'Unlike their heroic counterparts on the force, desk-bound NYPD detectives Gamble and Hoitz garner no headlines as they work day to day. When a seemingly minor case turns out to be a big deal, the two cops get the opportunity to finally prove to their comrades that they have the right stuff.', 'Unlike their heroic counterparts on the force, desk-bound NYPD detectives Gamble and Hoitz garner no headlines as they work day to day. When a seemingly minor case turns out to be a big deal, the two cops get the opportunity to finally prove to their comrades that they have the right stuff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNEHNqo3MgHmj3BUiPSqqq5czcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27581'),
  ('272004975983515386', 'The Other Hell', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bruno Mattei, Claudio Fragasso, Maurizio Tanfani', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Franca Stoppi, Carlo De Mejo, Francesca Carmeno, Susanna Forgione, Franco Garofalo, Paola Montenero, Ornella Picozzi, Andrea Aureli', 'R', 'A priest investigates paranormal activity at a nuns'' convent where a deep, dark secret is about to resurface in the guise of murder! Could the devil be behind this, or is that just what Mother Superior wants everyone to believe?', 'A priest investigates paranormal activity at a nuns'' convent where a deep, dark secret is about to resurface in the guise of murder! Could the devil be behind this, or is that just what Mother Superior wants everyone to believe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUQkx1nLYd4Jvmno2oJfwI4sgdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124393'),
  ('189105731446632969', 'The Other Lamb', 2020, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Małgorzata Szumowska, Michał Englert', 'Catherine Smyth-McMullen', 'Raffey Cassidy, Michiel Huisman, Denise Gough, Eve Connolly, Kelly Campbell, Isabelle Connolly, Charlotte Moore, Zara Devlin', null, 'For her entire life, the cult she was born into has been all that teenage Selah has known. Along with a band of similarly cloistered young women she lives seemingly unstuck in time, cut off from modern society in a remote forest commune presided over by a man called Shepherd, a controlling, messiah-like figure with a frightening dark side. But when her insular world is rocked by a series of nightmarish visions and disturbing revelations, Selah begins to question everything about her existence—including her allegiance to the increasingly dangerous Shepherd.', 'For her entire life, the cult she was born into has been all that teenage Selah has known. Along with a band of similarly cloistered young women she lives seemingly unstuck in time, cut off from modern society in a remote forest commune presided over by a man called Shepherd, a controlling, messiah-like figure with a frightening dark side. But when her insular world is rocked by a series of nightmarish visions and disturbing revelations, Selah begins to question everything about her existence—including her allegiance to the increasingly dangerous Shepherd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynPJkpmWNi4rnDUb0PuzDnJj5JI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617786'),
  ('1045349896359144903', 'The Other Laurens', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Fantasy', 'Claude Schmitz, Florian Berutti', 'Kostia Testut, Claude Schmitz', 'Olivier Rabourdin, Louise Leroy, Tibo Vandenborre, Marc Barbé, Kate Moran, Edwin Gaffney, Rodolphe Burger, Francis Soetens', null, 'Gabriel Laurens, fifty years old, is a «private investigator». When his fifteen-year-old niece Jade comes into his life and asks him to investigate her father’s death, the detective is confronted with memories he thought were buried forever. Confronted with the ghosts of his past, Gabriel Laurens finds himself caught up in a strange investigation involving pretense, fantasy and drug trafficking.', 'Gabriel Laurens, fifty years old, is a «private investigator». When his fifteen-year-old niece Jade comes into his life and asks him to investigate her father’s death, the detective is confronted with memories he thought were buried forever. Confronted with the ghosts of his past, Gabriel Laurens finds himself caught up in a strange investigation involving pretense, fantasy and drug trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDbSt56Bmd6dnoWIGEWdQHwzi2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889816'),
  ('1038579843086406141', 'The Other Love', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'André de Toth, Victor Milner', 'Ladislas Fodor, Harry Brown', 'Barbara Stanwyck, David Niven, Richard Conte, Gilbert Roland, Joan Lorring, Lenore Aubert, Maria Palmer, Natalie Schafer', 'NR', 'Seriously ill, concert pianist Karen Duncan is admitted to a Swiss sanitorium. Despite being attracted to Dr Tony Stanton she ignores his warnings of possibly fatal consequences unless she rests completely. Rather, she opts for a livelier time in Monte Carlo with dashing Paul Clermont.', 'Seriously ill, concert pianist Karen Duncan is admitted to a Swiss sanitorium. Despite being attracted to Dr Tony Stanton she ignores his warnings of possibly fatal consequences unless she rests completely. Rather, she opts for a livelier time in Monte Carlo with dashing Paul Clermont.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86W2NuG5ceGKib4x21NIK3urMdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140090'),
  ('1070684458611499750', 'The Other Man', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'James Mathers, Jag Mundhra, Rod Smith', 'Carl Austin', 'Diana Barton, Edward Albert, Chad McQueen, John Laughlin, Samantha Phillips, Don Swayze, Doug Jeffery, Kathy Shower', 'R', 'Unsatisfied by her boring marriage, Christine begins an affair with a seductive, mysterious stranger named Quinn. But they get carried away with their passion, when lust becomes obsession ... and murder. It seems someone wants to frame Christine who could it be?', 'Unsatisfied by her boring marriage, Christine begins an affair with a seductive, mysterious stranger named Quinn. But they get carried away with their passion, when lust becomes obsession ... and murder. It seems someone wants to frame Christine who could it be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fobdQeISF2DT6Ct7pZy0jR643kL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214818'),
  ('1122296958981270969', 'The Other Man', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Richard Eyre, Haris Zambarloukos', 'Richard Eyre, Charles Wood', 'Liam Neeson, Antonio Banderas, Laura Linney, Romola Garai, Abigail Canton, Pam Ferris, Paterson Joseph, Craig Parkinson', 'R', 'The story of a husband who suspects his wife of adultery, and sets out to track down the other man in her life.', 'The story of a husband who suspects his wife of adultery, and sets out to track down the other man in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtHxTrhdLjToXz1nR0lTYf75t5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17606'),
  ('724418416541484198', 'The Other Me', 2000, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Manny Coto, Derek Rogers, Judy Taylor', null, 'Andrew Lawrence, Mark L. Taylor, Lori Hallier, Alison Pill, Brenden Jefferson, Joe Grifasi, Sarah Gadon, Tyler Hynes', 'G', 'When Will Browning is threatened with military summer school if he doesn''t get better grades, he decides to do a science project that will definitely get an A. So he buys some Ocean Pups, unhatched sea creatures that will look spectacular, but he hasn''t bargained for the cloning agent that the unscrupulous manufacturers have put in the kit. Next thing he knows there''s another him.', 'When Will Browning is threatened with military summer school if he doesn''t get better grades, he decides to do a science project that will definitely get an A. So he buys some Ocean Pups, unhatched sea creatures that will look spectacular, but he hasn''t bargained for the cloning agent that the unscrupulous manufacturers have put in the kit. Next thing he knows there''s another him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dA262duALaMG8CJcwnDZWQOa4RP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39242'),
  ('727049537460046992', 'The Other Me', 2017, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Sotiris Tsafoulias', 'Sotiris Tsafoulias', 'Pigmalion Dadakaridis, Dimitris Katalifos, Manos Vakousis, Ioanna Kolliopoulou, Kora Karvouni, François Cluzet, Vassilis Risvas, Giorgos Chrysostomou', null, 'A lonely criminology professor attempts to solve the mystery behind five murders by decoding the puzzle of five Pythagorean theorems, in a crime story that features renowned French actor François Cluzet in a key-role.', 'A lonely criminology professor attempts to solve the mystery behind five murders by decoding the puzzle of five Pythagorean theorems, in a crime story that features renowned French actor François Cluzet in a key-role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azo3wQhQPcx3xF0DAtyZmI1gMkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421365'),
  ('345953452755654740', 'The Other Me', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Konstantin Esadze, Anna Mariakhina, Salome Jugeli', 'Giga Agladze', 'Jim Sturgess, Antonia Campbell-Hughes, Andreja Pejić, Rhona Mitra, Orla Brady, Jordi Mollà, Michael Socha, Billy Barratt', 'NR', 'The life of a young architect is thrown into turmoil when he''s diagnosed with a rare eye disease. As his condition worsens, he questions his life and career choices, and his relationship to his frustrated wife becomes more strained.', 'The life of a young architect is thrown into turmoil when he''s diagnosed with a rare eye disease. As his condition worsens, he questions his life and career choices, and his relationship to his frustrated wife becomes more strained.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cV7EY78064mfKzeOMzKPS7TQuMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717682'),
  ('521767124626342946', 'The Other One', 2009, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Patrick Mario Bernard, Pierre Trividic', 'Patrick Mario Bernard, Pierre Trividic', 'Dominique Blanc, Cyril Gueï, Peter Bonke, Anne Benoît, Christèle Tual, Charlotte Clamens, Christian Chaussex, Anne Verdier', null, 'Anne-Marie has a peaceful break-up with her boyfriend Alex, whom she doesn''t love anymore. However, upon learning that another woman has come into his life, she becomes insanely jealous...', 'Anne-Marie has a peaceful break-up with her boyfriend Alex, whom she doesn''t love anymore. However, upon learning that another woman has come into his life, she becomes insanely jealous...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6LuEJU5OmS6j7hutoeHZelHPo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12425'),
  ('13083543154342363', 'The Other One''s Mug', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime', 'René Mathelin, Pierre Tchernia', 'Jean Poiret', 'Michel Serrault, Jean Poiret, Curd Jürgens, Bernadette Lafont, Andréa Parisy, Paulette Dubost, Bernard Lavalette, Pierre Douglas', null, 'Martial Perrin is the president of a right-wing political party which is gearing itself up for a forthcoming election. When he learns that a notorious criminal named Kraus has escaped from prison, Perrin panics and goes into hiding. His deputy, Constant, hires Perrin’s cousin, Gilbert, an actor who is a perfect double of Perrin, to replace him. What Gilbert does no know is that the killer Kraus is bumping off the people who were implicated in the affair for which he was arrested, and that Perrin is next on his list.', 'Martial Perrin is the president of a right-wing political party which is gearing itself up for a forthcoming election. When he learns that a notorious criminal named Kraus has escaped from prison, Perrin panics and goes into hiding. His deputy, Constant, hires Perrin’s cousin, Gilbert, an actor who is a perfect double of Perrin, to replace him. What Gilbert does no know is that the killer Kraus is bumping off the people who were implicated in the affair for which he was arrested, and that Perrin is next on his list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y41Lg1fRDtDf13mXPyGkFe2ej1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4268'),
  ('54124357425807310', 'The Other Side', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Gregg Bishop, Sherman Johnson', 'Gregg Bishop', 'Nathan Mobley, Jaimie Alexander, Cory Rouse, Poncho Hodges, Shale Nelson, Stephen Caudill, Chris Burns, Vince Canlas', 'R', 'Samuel North (Nathan Mobley) escapes from Hell to find the person who murdered him, but a team of invincible bounty hunters called REAPERS are sent from the Netherworld to bring him back.', 'Samuel North (Nathan Mobley) escapes from Hell to find the person who murdered him, but a team of invincible bounty hunters called REAPERS are sent from the Netherworld to bring him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibnEmQBkRamIj4NcnFdU0sYNzMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51465'),
  ('905591989955339595', 'The Other Side', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo Álvarez Flores, Ana Patricia Esparza, Rafael Estrada', 'Rodrigo Álvarez Flores', 'Eduardo Gómez, Juan Pablo Muro, Edward Coward, Giancarlo Ruiz', null, 'Felipe and Claudio have a unique relationship. Somehow destiny pulls them apart and sets Felipe on a journey where he will risk everything in his pursuit of happiness.', 'Felipe and Claudio have a unique relationship. Somehow destiny pulls them apart and sets Felipe on a journey where he will risk everything in his pursuit of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBLVPbORBKoRl3I5FWO1MnKmE6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489209'),
  ('906795342333491755', 'The Other Side', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Didier Bivel', 'Léa Clavel, Philippe Duchesne', 'Alix Poisson, Tiphaine Daviot, Luna Lou, Alain Blazquez, Nathalie Boutefeu, Thomas Doret, Gaspard Meier-Chaurand, Éric Savin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxTC7E4gj4qSyNRT9hSAXjmfICN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687077'),
  ('435730559636333373', 'The Other Side', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Posada', 'Daniel Posada, Ignacio del Moral', 'Julián Román, Juana Acosta, Christian Tappán, Vicky Hernández, David Noreña, Yuri Vargas, Laura Junco, Ernesto Benjumea', null, 'A forty-year-old poet wakes up handcuffed to a hospital bed. Accused of his mother''s murder, he claims it was an act of love: a plan to aid his mother''s death and end his own life at the same time.', 'A forty-year-old poet wakes up handcuffed to a hospital bed. Accused of his mother''s murder, he claims it was an act of love: a plan to aid his mother''s death and end his own life at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axujDwRWO7K5HSvzvLfZoXbeVbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1369595'),
  ('979718852415838704', 'The Other Side of Heaven', 2001, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Mitch Davis, Brian J. Breheny', 'Mitch Davis', 'Christopher Gorham, Anne Hathaway, Joe Folau, Miriama Smith, Gerald R. Molen, Nathaniel Lees, Alvin Fitisemanu, Peter Sa''ena Brown', 'PG', 'John H. Groberg, a middle class kid from Idaho Falls, crosses the Pacific to become a Mormon missionary in the remote and exotic Tongan island kingdom during the 1950''s. He leaves behind a loving family and the true love of his life, Jean. Through letters and musings across the miles, John shares his humbling and sometimes hilarious adventures with "the girl back home", and her letters buoy up his spirits in difficult times. John must struggle to overcome language barriers, physical hardship and deep-rooted suspicion to earn the trust and love of the Tongan people he has come to serve. Throughout his adventure-filled three years on the islands, he discovers friends and wisdom in the most unlikely places. John H. Groberg''s Tongan odyssey will change his life forever.', 'John H. Groberg, a middle class kid from Idaho Falls, crosses the Pacific to become a Mormon missionary in the remote and exotic Tongan island kingdom during the 1950''s. He leaves behind a loving family and the true love of his life, Jean. Through letters and musings across the miles, John shares his humbling and sometimes hilarious adventures with "the girl back home", and her letters buoy up his spirits in difficult times. John must struggle to overcome language barriers, physical hardship and deep-rooted suspicion to earn the trust and love of the Tongan people he has come to serve. Throughout his adventure-filled three years on the islands, he discovers friends and wisdom in the most unlikely places. John H. Groberg''s Tongan odyssey will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jHSJULA0nEDfVeewlLvppsjve8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16651'),
  ('893101208934313294', 'The Other Side of Hope', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Eevi Kareinen', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Sherwan Haji, Sakari Kuosmanen, Kaija Pakarinen, Niroz Haji, Janne Hyytiäinen, Ilkka Koivula, Nuppu Koivu, Simon Al-Bazoon', null, 'A restaurateur befriends a Syrian refugee who has recently arrived in Finland.', 'A restaurateur befriends a Syrian refugee who has recently arrived in Finland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spqAX6L4YtPaCj2dnc10Tku9AU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429199'),
  ('538399812759609895', 'The Other Side of Midnight', 1977, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Charles Jarrott, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Sidney Sheldon, Herman Raucher', 'Marie-France Pisier, John Beck, Susan Sarandon, Raf Vallone, Clu Gulager, Christian Marquand, Michael Lerner, Sorrell Booke', 'R', 'When French beauty Noelle Page falls in love with American pilot Larry Douglas, she believes he''ll marry her. Instead, he returns to the U.S and marries the sweet but naive Catherine. Even though Noelle has found a new lover, an affluent Greek named Constantin, and has started a great career as an actress, she vows revenge on her onetime lover. But once her plan is in motion, she and Larry fall in love and plot Catherine''s death.', 'When French beauty Noelle Page falls in love with American pilot Larry Douglas, she believes he''ll marry her. Instead, he returns to the U.S and marries the sweet but naive Catherine. Even though Noelle has found a new lover, an affluent Greek named Constantin, and has started a great career as an actress, she vows revenge on her onetime lover. But once her plan is in motion, she and Larry fall in love and plot Catherine''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hX2Z3uaDBKUSzM4qKYpK3bz5vuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80844'),
  ('183275911430924211', 'The Other Side of Sunday', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Berit Nesheim, Arne Borsheim, Ole Martin Bryn', 'Berit Nesheim, Lasse Glomm', 'Marie Theisen, Hildegun Riise, Bjørn Sundquist, Sylvia Salvesen, Ina Sofie Brodahl, Martin Dahl Garfalk, Ann Kristin Rasmussen, Jørgen Langhelle', 'PG-13', 'The Other Side of Sunday, also known in Norwegian as "Søndagsengler", is a movie that criticizes the small, and often tight, church community. We follow the Preacher''s Daughter, Maria, on her journey to liberate herself from the stiff church community and her father.', 'The Other Side of Sunday, also known in Norwegian as "Søndagsengler", is a movie that criticizes the small, and often tight, church community. We follow the Preacher''s Daughter, Maria, on her journey to liberate herself from the stiff church community and her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nJlw1xMfimLc1CoRw0SfocwWaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46754'),
  ('686826298907319610', 'The Other Side of the Bed', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Juan Molina, Aurea Martínez Fresno', 'David Serrano', 'Ernesto Alterio, Paz Vega, Guillermo Toledo, Natalia Verbeke, Alberto San Juan, María Esteve, Ramón Barea, Nathalie Poza', null, 'When Paula leaves her mate Pedro, he misses her and looks for comfort with his best friends, Javier and Sonia. Paula is having an affair with Javier. Pedro tries to find who is the secret lover of Paula, and hires a private eye. Meanwhile, while comforting Pedro, Sonia has a one night stand with him and Javier thinks she is cheating on him with her lesbian friend Luzia.', 'When Paula leaves her mate Pedro, he misses her and looks for comfort with his best friends, Javier and Sonia. Paula is having an affair with Javier. Pedro tries to find who is the secret lover of Paula, and hires a private eye. Meanwhile, while comforting Pedro, Sonia has a one night stand with him and Javier thinks she is cheating on him with her lesbian friend Luzia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qHQ1dnXeJnV9fg7UINvGrZfBKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2722'),
  ('1149426572157107280', 'The Other Side of the Door', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Johannes Roberts, Maxime Alexandre', 'Ernest Riera, Johannes Roberts', 'Sarah Wayne Callies, Jeremy Sisto, Sofia Rosinsky, Logan Creran, Jax Malcolm, Suchitra Pillai, Javier Botet, Vijay Gupta', 'R', 'Grieving over the loss of her son, a mother struggles with her feelings for her daughter and her husband. She seeks out a ritual that allows her say goodbye to her dead child, opening the veil between the world of the dead and the living. Her daughter becomes the focus of terror. She must now protect against the evil that was once her beloved son.', 'Grieving over the loss of her son, a mother struggles with her feelings for her daughter and her husband. She seeks out a ritual that allows her say goodbye to her dead child, opening the veil between the world of the dead and the living. Her daughter becomes the focus of terror. She must now protect against the evil that was once her beloved son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5HubVaGLp1EXQbEXhg6hbEYee9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364116'),
  ('779466944337362118', 'The Other Side of the Mirror', 1973, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Antonio Millán', 'Jesús Franco', 'Emma Cohen, Robert Woods, Françoise Brion, Philippe Lemaire, Alice Arno, Ramiro Oliveros, Howard Vernon, Ada Tauler', null, 'A nightclub singer is haunted by the ghost of her late father. The dead man summons her through a mirror, forcing her to commit a series of violent crimes.', 'A nightclub singer is haunted by the ghost of her late father. The dead man summons her through a mirror, forcing her to commit a series of violent crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JfpE7WblqirkvJPrpmLzKERNiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137103'),
  ('964874645769874595', 'The Other Side of the Mountain', 1975, 'Romance, Drama', 'Larry Peerce, David M. Walsh', 'David Seltzer', 'Marilyn Hassett, Beau Bridges, Belinda Montgomery, Nan Martin, William Bryant, Dabney Coleman, Bill Vint, Hampton Fancher', null, 'One year before the Olympics, Jill Kinmont, an 18-year-old skiing champion, suffers a fall during competition and is left paralyzed. With her life now completely altered, she undergoes an exhausting fight to regain some of what she has lost.', 'One year before the Olympics, Jill Kinmont, an 18-year-old skiing champion, suffers a fall during competition and is left paralyzed. With her life now completely altered, she undergoes an exhausting fight to regain some of what she has lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eikUqnTC2DxVCZGwEUiuNzFpQVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86233'),
  ('274927508040580182', 'The Other Side of the Street', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Marcos Bernstein, Toca Seabra, Lamartine Ferreira', 'Melanie Dimantas, Marcos Bernstein', 'Fernanda Montenegro, Raul Cortez, Laura Cardoso, Luiz Carlos Persy, Miguel Lunardi, Caio Lima, Eliana César, Mauro José', null, 'Regina, a lonely 65 year old who works on the neighborhood watch for the police in Copacabana, believes to have witnessed a murder in the building across the street, and ends up getting involved with the suspect in a potentially dangerous chain of events that will force her to take stock of her life.', 'Regina, a lonely 65 year old who works on the neighborhood watch for the police in Copacabana, believes to have witnessed a murder in the building across the street, and ends up getting involved with the suspect in a potentially dangerous chain of events that will force her to take stock of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojl8oyFlXzYBomln9Xgl00cFSB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77705'),
  ('272547685765418239', 'The Other Side of the Underneath', 1972, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jane Arden, Liz Danciger, Penny Slinger', 'Jane Arden', 'Jane Arden, Sheila Allen, Sally Minford, Penny Slinger, Jack Bond, Jenny Moss, Liz Danciger, Ann Lynn', null, 'A therapist looks into the mind of a woman diagnosed as schizophrenic and finds, not madness, but tortured sexual guilt created by the taboos of society.', 'A therapist looks into the mind of a woman diagnosed as schizophrenic and finds, not madness, but tortured sexual guilt created by the taboos of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69Q1pdyg4q0r6dFq69jBZuE0tNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53806'),
  ('924038821827438716', 'The Other Side of the Wall', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Pau Ortiz', null, null, null, 'Honduran immigrants living in Mexico, teenage siblings Rocío and Ale must take over care of their two younger siblings after their mother is sentenced to prison on dubious grounds. Tensions grow between the pair as the decision must be made on whether to stay together in Mexico or split the family up to cross into the US to work.', 'Honduran immigrants living in Mexico, teenage siblings Rocío and Ale must take over care of their two younger siblings after their mother is sentenced to prison on dubious grounds. Tensions grow between the pair as the decision must be made on whether to stay together in Mexico or split the family up to cross into the US to work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sJbdm5iMnZAiTaZDzEYpP0hHx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455507'),
  ('478825483803127571', 'The Other Side of the Wind', 2018, 'Drama', 'Gary Graver, Orson Welles', 'Oja Kodar', 'John Huston, Oja Kodar, Peter Bogdanovich, Susan Strasberg, Norman Foster, Robert Random, Lilli Palmer, Edmond O''Brien', 'R', 'Surrounded by fans and sceptics, grizzled director J.J. "Jake" Hannaford returns from years abroad in Europe to a changed Hollywood, where he attempts to make his innovative comeback film. This film was started in 1970 by Orson Welles but never completed during his lifetime.', 'Surrounded by fans and sceptics, grizzled director J.J. "Jake" Hannaford returns from years abroad in Europe to a changed Hollywood, where he attempts to make his innovative comeback film. This film was started in 1970 by Orson Welles but never completed during his lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFeWBVcCehkdr1BvXaVrepGUJQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299782'),
  ('713665187306201884', 'The Other Sister', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Wendy Riva, Dante Spinotti', 'Bob Brunner, Garry Marshall', 'Juliette Lewis, Diane Keaton, Tom Skerritt, Giovanni Ribisi, Poppy Montgomery, Sarah Paulson, Linda Thorson, Joe Flanigan', 'PG-13', 'A mentally challenged girl proves herself to be every bit as capable as her "perfect" sister when she moves into an apartment and begins going to college.', 'A mentally challenged girl proves herself to be every bit as capable as her "perfect" sister when she moves into an apartment and begins going to college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rBrYRkB7btGex5Bs0yOpqBZgsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18417'),
  ('364591566605971061', 'The Other Son', 2012, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Soyer, Lorraine Lévy', 'Lorraine Lévy, Nathalie Saugeon', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Pascal Elbé, Jules Sitruk, Mehdi Dehbi, Areen Omari, Khalifa Natour, Mahmoud Shalaby, Bruno Podalydès', 'PG-13', 'Two young men, one Israeli and one Palestinian, discover they were accidentally switched at birth.', 'Two young men, one Israeli and one Palestinian, discover they were accidentally switched at birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOKYfoBrDjysNdafStBwvlXTWCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125623'),
  ('401207686114757205', 'The Other Virginity', 1975, 'Drama', 'Juan Manuel Torres', 'Luis Carrión, Juan Manuel Torres, Luis Alcoriza', 'Valentín Trujillo, Leticia Perdigón, Mercedes Carreño, Arturo Beristáin, Víctor Manuel Mendoza, Eduardo Noriega, Rita Macedo, Patricia Reyes Spíndola', null, 'Two young waitresses, Laura and Eva, become romantically involved with a movie distributor, Adrian, and his friend Luis.', 'Two young waitresses, Laura and Eva, become romantically involved with a movie distributor, Adrian, and his friend Luis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSmUWwymdty1tFNzttUJsrQO48G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351892'),
  ('1077790499875462011', 'The Other Way Around', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonás Trueba, Santiago Racaj, Lionel Braverman', 'Jonás Trueba, Vito Sanz, Itsaso Arana', 'Itsaso Arana, Vito Sanz, Fernando Trueba, Andrés Gertrúdix, Francesco Carril, Ana Risueño, Naiara Carmona, Pedro Lozano', null, 'After 15 years together, Ale and Alex choose an unconventional way to part ways: by hosting a party to celebrate their separation. Their unexpected decision leaves friends and family confused, forcing everyone to confront their own views on love, relationships, and new beginnings in this bittersweet, heartfelt story.', 'After 15 years together, Ale and Alex choose an unconventional way to part ways: by hosting a party to celebrate their separation. Their unexpected decision leaves friends and family confused, forcing everyone to confront their own views on love, relationships, and new beginnings in this bittersweet, heartfelt story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWHEfq6QRwPS9xRz4pzY3oBRSxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214118'),
  ('504378488638304626', 'The Other Woman', 1954, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hugo Haas, Eddie Fitzgerald', 'Hugo Haas', 'Hugo Haas, Cleo Moore, Lance Fuller, Lucille Barkley, Jack Macy, John Qualen, Jan Arvan, Steve Mitchell', 'NR', 'Bit player Sherry Stewart gets miffed when director Walter Darman turns her down after she reads for a small part in his picture. She and her boy friend, Ronnie, devise a plan to lure Darman to her apartment, where she gives him a drugged drink. She tells Darman they had been intimate and blackmails him for $50,000. More than a little distracted by his situation, his wife senses something is wrong and he gets into a violent argument with his father-in-law who owns the producing company Darman works for, and discontinues the picture. Sherry informs Darman she is going to tell his wife all about them. Darman tells his secretary that he is going to work late and is not to be disturbed, sets the moviola runnings, and exits by the back door and hot-foots it to Sherry''s apartment.', 'Bit player Sherry Stewart gets miffed when director Walter Darman turns her down after she reads for a small part in his picture. She and her boy friend, Ronnie, devise a plan to lure Darman to her apartment, where she gives him a drugged drink. She tells Darman they had been intimate and blackmails him for $50,000. More than a little distracted by his situation, his wife senses something is wrong and he gets into a violent argument with his father-in-law who owns the producing company Darman works for, and discontinues the picture. Sherry informs Darman she is going to tell his wife all about them. Darman tells his secretary that he is going to work late and is not to be disturbed, sets the moviola runnings, and exits by the back door and hot-foots it to Sherry''s apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taGFESqIbjVbtM2F9uAiPSRIVnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73357'),
  ('209136557656096031', 'The Other Woman', 2010, 'Drama', 'Don Roos, Steve Yedlin, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Don Roos', 'Natalie Portman, Scott Cohen, Charlie Tahan, Lauren Ambrose, Lisa Kudrow, Michael Cristofer, Debra Monk, Elizabeth Marvel', 'R', 'Emilia, a law-school graduate, falls in love with her married boss, Jack. After Emilia marries Jack, her happiness turns unexpectedly to grief following the death of her infant daughter. Devastated, Emilia nonetheless carries on, attempting to forge a connection with her stepson William and to resist the interference of Jack''s jealous ex-wife.', 'Emilia, a law-school graduate, falls in love with her married boss, Jack. After Emilia marries Jack, her happiness turns unexpectedly to grief following the death of her infant daughter. Devastated, Emilia nonetheless carries on, attempting to forge a connection with her stepson William and to resist the interference of Jack''s jealous ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqbRrPwSpOUgMG8tyjwdT4enfHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52505'),
  ('651506280506794535', 'The Other Woman', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Casey Madigan, Jonathan McGarry, Derek Wimble', 'Melissa K. Stack', 'Cameron Diaz, Leslie Mann, Kate Upton, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Don Johnson, Nicki Minaj, Taylor Kinney, David Thornton', 'PG-13', 'After discovering her boyfriend is married, Carly soon meets the wife he''s been cheating on. And when yet another affair is discovered, all three women team up to plot mutual revenge on the three-timing SOB.', 'After discovering her boyfriend is married, Carly soon meets the wife he''s been cheating on. And when yet another affair is discovered, all three women team up to plot mutual revenge on the three-timing SOB.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHnbb6z8REuFIyBLT2Nj3MX54dY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193610'),
  ('793789551383526249', 'The Other Woman', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-François Robin, Daniel Auteuil', 'Florian Zeller', 'Daniel Auteuil, Gérard Depardieu, Sandrine Kiberlain, Adriana Ugarte, John Sehil, Christina Crevillén, Joffrey Platel, Brigitte Aubry', null, 'When Daniel and Isabelle invite Patrick and his new flame, Emma, to dinner, it’s with some misgivings. After all, Patrick has just dumped his ex-wife — their best friend — to run off with a much younger woman. But when the ravishing Emma appears, all of Daniel’s qualms fly out of the window. He’s instantly smitten with the seductive woman...', 'When Daniel and Isabelle invite Patrick and his new flame, Emma, to dinner, it’s with some misgivings. After all, Patrick has just dumped his ex-wife — their best friend — to run off with a much younger woman. But when the ravishing Emma appears, all of Daniel’s qualms fly out of the window. He’s instantly smitten with the seductive woman...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WcVbQA1lT3iOroeLzRhlRpVo9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499722'),
  ('1037213898831616322', 'The Other Zoey', 2023, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Eve M. Cohen, Sara Zandieh', 'Matthew Tabak', 'Josephine Langford, Drew Starkey, Archie Renaux, Mallori Johnson, Andie MacDowell, Patrick Fabian, Heather Graham, Olive Abercrombie', 'PG-13', 'Highly intelligent computer major Zoey Miller is uninterested in romantic love, but her life is turned upside down when Zack, the school''s soccer star, gets amnesia and mistakes Zoey for his girlfriend.', 'Highly intelligent computer major Zoey Miller is uninterested in romantic love, but her life is turned upside down when Zack, the school''s soccer star, gets amnesia and mistakes Zoey for his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rh9fwqA98ufdx9vP7V6lLhfpfk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912916'),
  ('352963448413119749', 'The Others', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Javier Aguirresarobe, Alejandro Amenábar, Javier Chinchilla', 'Alejandro Amenábar', 'Nicole Kidman, Alakina Mann, James Bentley, Fionnula Flanagan, Christopher Eccleston, Eric Sykes, Elaine Cassidy, Keith Allen', 'PG-13', 'Grace is a religious woman who lives in an old house kept dark because her two children, Anne and Nicholas, have a rare sensitivity to light. When the family begins to suspect the house is haunted, Grace fights to protect her children at any cost in the face of strange events and disturbing visions.', 'Grace is a religious woman who lives in an old house kept dark because her two children, Anne and Nicholas, have a rare sensitivity to light. When the family begins to suspect the house is haunted, Grace fights to protect her children at any cost in the face of strange events and disturbing visions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8g1vlTvpM6nr2hMMiZ1fUlKF0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1933'),
  ('340690856189975342', 'The Ottoman Lieutenant', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Joseph Ruben, Daniel Aranyó', 'Jeff Stockwell', 'Hera Hilmar, Michiel Huisman, Josh Hartnett, Ben Kingsley, Haluk Bilginer, Selçuk Yöntem, Paul Barrett, Affif Ben Badra', null, 'Lillie, a determined American woman, ventures overseas to join Dr. Jude at a remote medical mission in the Ottoman Empire (now Turkey). However, Lillie soon finds herself at odds with Jude and the mission’s founder, Woodruff, when she falls for the titular military man, Ismail, just as the war is about to erupt.', 'Lillie, a determined American woman, ventures overseas to join Dr. Jude at a remote medical mission in the Ottoman Empire (now Turkey). However, Lillie soon finds herself at odds with Jude and the mission’s founder, Woodruff, when she falls for the titular military man, Ismail, just as the war is about to erupt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keHVpf7x6Na3KK7ep2BXzd2jlCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433356'),
  ('718150756846642141', 'The Ottoman Republic', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gani Müjde, Deniz Denizciler', 'Gani Müjde', 'Ata Demirer, Vildan Atasever, Ruhsar Öcal, Ali Düşenkalkar, Sümer Tilmaç, Kerem Kupacı, Belma Canciğer, Ziya Durukan', null, 'The film depicts a world in which Atatürk never became leader, the War of Independence never took place, and the Ottoman Republic continues to exist in a form adapted to the present day. The continuation of the Ottoman Republic instead of the Republic of Turkey, Ankara not being the capital, signs and license plates being in both Turkish and Arabic, and the sultan wearing a suit under his caftan are some of the tragicomic situations that make up the film''s story.', 'The film depicts a world in which Atatürk never became leader, the War of Independence never took place, and the Ottoman Republic continues to exist in a form adapted to the present day. The continuation of the Ottoman Republic instead of the Republic of Turkey, Ankara not being the capital, signs and license plates being in both Turkish and Arabic, and the sultan wearing a suit under his caftan are some of the tragicomic situations that make up the film''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwbRfF7JDYYyNNh2GnZispMRSej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52139'),
  ('248811381828166761', 'The Ouija Board', 1920, 'Horror, Animation, Comedy', 'Max Fleischer', null, 'Dave Fleischer, Max Fleischer, Roland Crandall', null, 'Max Fleischer draws Koko and a haunted house, while his colleague and the janitor mess around with a Ouija board. When Max goes over to take a look, Koko is haunted by ghosts and inanimate objects, and escapes into the real-world studio.', 'Max Fleischer draws Koko and a haunted house, while his colleague and the janitor mess around with a Ouija board. When Max goes over to take a look, Koko is haunted by ghosts and inanimate objects, and escapes into the real-world studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbVCcxSZQgimIQX3sFsl56zWWP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175297'),
  ('173610244511093653', 'The Ouija Experiment', 2011, 'Horror', 'Israel Luna', 'Israel Luna', 'Justin Armstrong, Swisyzinna, Carson Underwood, Eric Window, David Clark, Leah Diaz, Miranda Martinez', null, 'Based on true events, five friends who fall prey to the evil entities of the Ouija board. As they set about filming their experimental session, what starts out as bit of fun, soon escalates into a terrifying series of events as paranoia and personal demons are revealed…. and recorded.', 'Based on true events, five friends who fall prey to the evil entities of the Ouija board. As they set about filming their experimental session, what starts out as bit of fun, soon escalates into a terrifying series of events as paranoia and personal demons are revealed…. and recorded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EeqPNq8D4GckMFmWH2hlIpk73R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207475'),
  ('988554412505880717', 'The Ouija Experiment 2: Theatre of Death', 2015, 'Horror', 'Israel Luna', 'Israel Luna', 'Justin Armstrong, Swisyzinna, Israel Luna, Nicole Holt, Gerald Crum, Jessica Willis, Eric Zettina, Eric Window', null, 'A fun filled weekend turns deadly when a group of unsuspecting theatre goers are trapped inside, after a ravenous spirit is resurrected and released from a Ouija board. They must confront their most terrifying fears and destroy the spirit before it finds and kills them first.', 'A fun filled weekend turns deadly when a group of unsuspecting theatre goers are trapped inside, after a ravenous spirit is resurrected and released from a Ouija board. They must confront their most terrifying fears and destroy the spirit before it finds and kills them first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3VMaDXxXc8VwvvX82sd418HCcx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309063'),
  ('654113928421480373', 'The Out-Laws', 2023, 'Romance, Action, Comedy', 'Iran Kuykendall, Kristina M. Peterson, Tyler Spindel', 'Evan Turner, Ben Zazove', 'Adam Devine, Nina Dobrev, Pierce Brosnan, Ellen Barkin, Julie Hagerty, Richard Kind, Michael Rooker, Poorna Jagannathan', 'R', 'A straight-laced bank manager is about to marry the love of his life. When his bank is held up by infamous Ghost Bandits during his wedding week, he believes his future in-laws who just arrived in town, are the infamous Out-Laws.', 'A straight-laced bank manager is about to marry the love of his life. When his bank is held up by infamous Ghost Bandits during his wedding week, he believes his future in-laws who just arrived in town, are the infamous Out-Laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dliMQ2ODbGNoq0hlefdnuXQxMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921636'),
  ('313005341377329320', 'The Out-of-Towners', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Hiller, Andrew Laszlo, Peter R. Scoppa', 'Neil Simon', 'Jack Lemmon, Sandy Dennis, Sandy Baron, Anne Meara, Robert Nichols, Ann Prentiss, Ron Carey, Philip Bruns', 'G', 'A trip to New York for a job interview turns into a trip to hell for a small town couple.', 'A trip to New York for a job interview turns into a trip to hell for a small town couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mENIq3EZhx0tdnyFvuskmirCCvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20444'),
  ('446942417588741464', 'The Out-of-Towners', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance, Adventure', 'Sam Weisman, John Bailey, Angela Barnes', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Steve Martin, Goldie Hawn, John Cleese, Mark McKinney, Jessica Cauffiel, Charlie Dell, Tom Riis Farrell, Cynthia Nixon', 'PG-13', 'The adventures of married couple Henry and Nancy Clark, vexed by misfortune while in New York City for Henry''s job interview.', 'The adventures of married couple Henry and Nancy Clark, vexed by misfortune while in New York City for Henry''s job interview.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOmLJYh7oOfATE236XpoDfcXhOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8970'),
  ('962062745000391528', 'The Outcasts', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Peter Hutchings, John Thomas', 'Dominique Ferrari, Suzanne Wrubel', 'Victoria Justice, Eden Sher, Ashley Rickards, Avan Jogia, Peyton List, Claudia Lee, Frank Whaley, Ted McGinley', 'PG-13', 'After falling victim to a humiliating prank by the high school Queen Bee, best friends and world-class geeks, Mindy and Jodi, decide to get their revenge by uniting the outcasts of the school against her and her circle of friends.', 'After falling victim to a humiliating prank by the high school Queen Bee, best friends and world-class geeks, Mindy and Jodi, decide to get their revenge by uniting the outcasts of the school against her and her circle of friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44jotbmLRwHSIcd4wVAYCVmli8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306943'),
  ('1011818706879656058', 'The Outfit', 1973, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Flynn, Bruce Surtees, William McGarry', 'John Flynn', 'Robert Duvall, Karen Black, Joe Don Baker, Robert Ryan, Timothy Carey, Richard Jaeckel, Sheree North, Felice Orlandi', 'PG', 'A two-bit criminal takes on the Mafia to avenge his brother''s death. Earl Macklin is a small time criminal who is released from prison after an unsuccessful bank robbery only to discover that a pair of gunmen killed his brother.', 'A two-bit criminal takes on the Mafia to avenge his brother''s death. Earl Macklin is a small time criminal who is released from prison after an unsuccessful bank robbery only to discover that a pair of gunmen killed his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUOsoB8dYJTdSS4gR37HGIR3dh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26762'),
  ('299894012350092827', 'The Outfit', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Graham Moore, Dick Pope', 'Johnathan McClain', 'Mark Rylance, Zoey Deutch, Johnny Flynn, Dylan O''Brien, Simon Russell Beale, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Alan Mehdizadeh, Johnathan McClain', 'R', 'Leonard is an English tailor who used to craft suits on London’s world-famous Savile Row. After a personal tragedy, he’s ended up in Chicago, operating a small tailor shop in a rough part of town where he makes beautiful clothes for the only people around who can afford them: a family of vicious gangsters.', 'Leonard is an English tailor who used to craft suits on London’s world-famous Savile Row. After a personal tragedy, he’s ended up in Chicago, operating a small tailor shop in a rough part of town where he makes beautiful clothes for the only people around who can afford them: a family of vicious gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZa5EB6PVJBT5mxhgZS5ftqdAm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799876'),
  ('582341923529177152', 'The Outing', 1987, 'Horror', 'Tom Daley, Herbert Raditschnig, Kim Fusch', 'Warren Chaney', 'Deborah Winters, James Huston, Andra St. Ivanyi, Scott Bankston, Red Mitchell, André Chimène, Damon Merrill, Barry Coffing', 'R', 'A group of high schoolers decide to stay in a natural museum after closing hours, but a newly acquired and mysterious lamp hiding a deadly force will turn the fun into horror.', 'A group of high schoolers decide to stay in a natural museum after closing hours, but a newly acquired and mysterious lamp hiding a deadly force will turn the fun into horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPVanJPUGHjBuXScbpbopZvMKKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26675'),
  ('669115173003278092', 'The Outlaw', 1943, 'Western, Drama', 'Gregg Toland, Howard Hughes, Sam Nelson', 'Jules Furthman', 'Jack Buetel, Jane Russell, Thomas Mitchell, Walter Huston, Mimi Aguglia, Joe Sawyer, Gene Rizzi, Bobby Callahan', 'NR', 'Newly appointed sheriff Pat Garrett is pleased when his old friend Doc Holliday arrives in Lincoln, New Mexico on the stage. Doc is trailing his stolen horse, and it is discovered in the possession of Billy the Kid. In a surprising turnaround, Billy and Doc become friends. This causes the friendship between Doc and Pat to cool. The odd relationship between Doc and Billy grows stranger when Doc hides Billy at his girl Rio''s place after Billy is shot.', 'Newly appointed sheriff Pat Garrett is pleased when his old friend Doc Holliday arrives in Lincoln, New Mexico on the stage. Doc is trailing his stolen horse, and it is discovered in the possession of Billy the Kid. In a surprising turnaround, Billy and Doc become friends. This causes the friendship between Doc and Pat to cool. The odd relationship between Doc and Billy grows stranger when Doc hides Billy at his girl Rio''s place after Billy is shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqnPtCdL0gF5MvexVeVN1aimWg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22613'),
  ('291789295001053719', 'The Outlaw Josey Wales', 1976, 'Western', 'Clint Eastwood, Bruce Surtees, James Fargo', 'Philip Kaufman, Sonia Chernus', 'Clint Eastwood, Chief Dan George, Sondra Locke, Bill McKinney, John Vernon, Paula Trueman, Sam Bottoms, Geraldine Keams', 'PG', 'After avenging his family''s brutal murder, Wales is pursued by a pack of soldiers. He prefers to travel alone, but ragtag outcasts are drawn to him - and Wales can''t bring himself to leave them unprotected.', 'After avenging his family''s brutal murder, Wales is pursued by a pack of soldiers. He prefers to travel alone, but ragtag outcasts are drawn to him - and Wales can''t bring himself to leave them unprotected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92BZIFPbyCPNhExyFScxA3xF1dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10747'),
  ('783490520059636597', 'The Outlaws', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kang Yun-sung, Ju Sung-lim, Lee Sang-yong', 'Kang Yun-sung', 'Don Lee, Yoon Kye-sang, Jo Jae-yun, Choi Gwi-hwa, Lim Hyung-jun, Jin Sun-kyu, Hong Gi-jun, Heo Dong-won', null, 'In Chinatown, law and order is turned upside down when a trio of feral Chinese gangsters arrive, start terrorizing civilians, and usurping territory. The beleaguered local gangsters team up with the police, lead by the badass loose cannon Ma Seok-do, to bring them down. Based on a true story.', 'In Chinatown, law and order is turned upside down when a trio of feral Chinese gangsters arrive, start terrorizing civilians, and usurping territory. The beleaguered local gangsters team up with the police, lead by the badass loose cannon Ma Seok-do, to bring them down. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khJo0VTt1uDHOqgI4igXHNPj2LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479718'),
  ('26494126128044219', 'The Outlaws Is Coming', 1965, 'Comedy, Western', 'Norman Maurer, Irving Lippman, Donald L. Gold', 'Norman Maurer, Elwood Ullman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Joe DeRita, Adam West, Nancy Kovack, Mort Mills, Don Lamond, Rex Holman', 'NR', 'Rance Roden plans to kill off all the buffalo and thus cause the Indians to riot. After they destroy the US Cavalry, Rance and his gang will take over the West. Meanwhile, a Boston magazine gets wind of the buffalo slaughter and sends editor Kenneth Cabot and his associates to Casper, Wyoming to investigate.', 'Rance Roden plans to kill off all the buffalo and thus cause the Indians to riot. After they destroy the US Cavalry, Rance and his gang will take over the West. Meanwhile, a Boston magazine gets wind of the buffalo slaughter and sends editor Kenneth Cabot and his associates to Casper, Wyoming to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvasGJVrkRi97pHtf2IiCSJoaUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30798'),
  ('1060805481237699086', 'The Outlaws of Sevenhorses', 1971, 'Adventure, History', 'Dinu Cocea', 'Eugen Barbu', 'Florin Piersic, Marga Barbu, Toma Caragiu, Aimee Iacobescu, Florin Scărlătescu, Nucu Păunescu, Constantin Codrescu, Nicolae Gărdescu', null, 'The third movie in the Haiducii series, set in Muntenia during the Phanariote period. Lady Ralu needs a million galbeni to buy a jewelry collection from Vienna. In order to satisfy her desire, the Phanariot ruler institutes the "birul vacăritului" (the tax on the cowherd), impoverishing the people. The band of outlaws led by Anghel Șaptecai, after the death of Captain Amza, tries to recover the galbeni, forcibly taken from the tormented people. In the end, captain Mamulos catches Anghel and sends him to the pit.', 'The third movie in the Haiducii series, set in Muntenia during the Phanariote period. Lady Ralu needs a million galbeni to buy a jewelry collection from Vienna. In order to satisfy her desire, the Phanariot ruler institutes the "birul vacăritului" (the tax on the cowherd), impoverishing the people. The band of outlaws led by Anghel Șaptecai, after the death of Captain Amza, tries to recover the galbeni, forcibly taken from the tormented people. In the end, captain Mamulos catches Anghel and sends him to the pit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gHMXbVOxAvKtHCWfyBnnoKmz7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418817'),
  ('846017820195437311', 'The Outpost', 2020, 'War, Drama, History, Action', 'Lorenzo Senatore, Maya Markova, Rod Lurie', 'Paul Tamasy, Eric Johnson', 'Scott Eastwood, Caleb Landry Jones, Orlando Bloom, Ernest Cavazos, Taylor John Smith, Cory Hardrict, Milo Gibson, Bobby Lockwood', 'R', 'A small unit of U.S. soldiers, alone at the remote Combat Outpost Keating, located deep in the valley of three mountains in Afghanistan, battles to defend against an overwhelming force of Taliban fighters in a coordinated attack. The Battle of Kamdesh, as it was known, was the bloodiest American engagement of the Afghan War in 2009 and Bravo Troop 3-61 CAV became one of the most decorated units of the 19-year conflict.', 'A small unit of U.S. soldiers, alone at the remote Combat Outpost Keating, located deep in the valley of three mountains in Afghanistan, battles to defend against an overwhelming force of Taliban fighters in a coordinated attack. The Battle of Kamdesh, as it was known, was the bloodiest American engagement of the Afghan War in 2009 and Bravo Troop 3-61 CAV became one of the most decorated units of the 19-year conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saN1UywIQMQNXYx2ag9j2tPwaVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531876'),
  ('1104819481797096600', 'The Outrage', 1964, 'Drama, Crime, Western', 'James Wong Howe, Martin Ritt, Daniel McCauley', 'Michael Kanin', 'Paul Newman, Laurence Harvey, Claire Bloom, Edward G. Robinson, William Shatner, Howard Da Silva, Albert Salmi, Thomas Chalmers', null, 'At a disused railway station, three men -- a con artist, a preacher, and a prospector -- discuss the recent trial and sentencing of the outlaw Juan Carrasco for the murder of a man and the rape of his wife. In their recounting, the three explore the conflicting testimonies of the parties involved in the crimes. Disconcerting new questions arise with each different version of the event.', 'At a disused railway station, three men -- a con artist, a preacher, and a prospector -- discuss the recent trial and sentencing of the outlaw Juan Carrasco for the murder of a man and the rape of his wife. In their recounting, the three explore the conflicting testimonies of the parties involved in the crimes. Disconcerting new questions arise with each different version of the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dhtCGXMu0oCLf9Hysrth4cqgKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85609'),
  ('848558815694281636', 'The Outriders', 1950, 'Western', 'Roy Rowland, Jack Gertsman, Charles Schoenbaum', 'Irving Ravetch', 'Joel McCrea, Arlene Dahl, Barry Sullivan, Claude Jarman Jr., Ramon Novarro, Ted de Corsia, Martín Garralaga, Jeff Corey', 'NR', 'Late in the Civil War, three Confederate soldiers escape from a Union prison camp in Missouri. They soon fall into the hands of pro-Confederate raiders, who force them to act as "outriders" (escorts) for a civilian wagon train that will be secretly transporting Union gold from Santa Fe, New Mexico, to St. Louis, Missouri. The three men are to lead the wagons into a raider trap in Missouri, but one of them starts to have misgivings....', 'Late in the Civil War, three Confederate soldiers escape from a Union prison camp in Missouri. They soon fall into the hands of pro-Confederate raiders, who force them to act as "outriders" (escorts) for a civilian wagon train that will be secretly transporting Union gold from Santa Fe, New Mexico, to St. Louis, Missouri. The three men are to lead the wagons into a raider trap in Missouri, but one of them starts to have misgivings....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj4rnCtmu7vbvlWMJA9sFDThPJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134459'),
  ('329299127368397624', 'The Outrun', 2024, 'Drama', 'Martin Kelly, Nora Fingscheidt, Yunus Roy Imer', 'Amy Liptrot, Nora Fingscheidt, Daisy Lewis', 'Saoirse Ronan, Paapa Essiedu, Nabil Elouahabi, Izuka Hoyle, Lauren Lyle, Stephen Dillane, Saskia Reeves, Naomi Wirthner', 'R', 'Fresh out of rehab, Rona returns to the Orkney Islands—a place both wild and beautiful, right off the Scottish coast. Now 29 and after more than a decade of living life on the edge in London, where she both found and lost love, Rona attempts to come to terms with her troubled past. As she reconnects with the dramatic landscape where she grew up, memories of her traumatic childhood merge with more recent challenging events that have set her on the path to recovery.', 'Fresh out of rehab, Rona returns to the Orkney Islands—a place both wild and beautiful, right off the Scottish coast. Now 29 and after more than a decade of living life on the edge in London, where she both found and lost love, Rona attempts to come to terms with her troubled past. As she reconnects with the dramatic landscape where she grew up, memories of her traumatic childhood merge with more recent challenging events that have set her on the path to recovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfRR2CkbvYrLuOPQFm8vBaENyMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785542'),
  ('253217391460440965', 'The Outside Man', 1972, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jacques Deray, Terry K. Meade, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Jacques Deray, Ian McLellan Hunter', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Ann-Margret, Roy Scheider, Angie Dickinson, Georgia Engel, Felice Orlandi, Carlo De Mejo, Michel Constantin', 'PG', 'A French hit man is hired by a crime family to end the life of a rival mobster, but things fall apart when the boss who hired him is killed.', 'A French hit man is hired by a crime family to end the life of a rival mobster, but things fall apart when the boss who hired him is killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JImEXD7hfdet96BGrgPNcR3O6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48153'),
  ('531693160746752059', 'The Outsider', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jacques Deray, Xaver Schwarzenberger, Dominique Rigaux', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Henry Silva, Carlos Sotto Mayor, Pierre Vernier, Maurice Barrier, Claude Brosset, Tchéky Karyo, Jacques Maury', null, 'Philippe Jordan is a policeman prone to advancing the cause of justice by any means necessary. On his agenda is a powerful drug cartel working out of Paris and Marseilles, with a drug lord who is essentially inaccessible -- but not immortal.', 'Philippe Jordan is a policeman prone to advancing the cause of justice by any means necessary. On his agenda is a powerful drug cartel working out of Paris and Marseilles, with a drug lord who is essentially inaccessible -- but not immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li1IrkJldDlHNm8DtcA79b251fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12504'),
  ('301400506057022473', 'The Outsider', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Western, TV Movie', 'Randa Haines, Ben Nott', null, 'Tim Daly, Naomi Watts, Keith Carradine, David Carradine, Thomas Curtis, Brett Tucker, John Noble, Grant Piro', 'R', 'Montana sheep farmer Rebecca Yoder offers sanctuary to an on-the-lam outlaw, Johnny Gault, who is suffering from a gunshot wound. Yoder is a recent widow, and her decision to help the outsider doesn''t sit well with her Quaker community. As a romance brews between her and Gault, it puts in jeopardy her standing among her devout neighbors. But when an evil rancher makes a play for the community''s land, Gault''s sharpshooting skills might prove his worth after all.', 'Montana sheep farmer Rebecca Yoder offers sanctuary to an on-the-lam outlaw, Johnny Gault, who is suffering from a gunshot wound. Yoder is a recent widow, and her decision to help the outsider doesn''t sit well with her Quaker community. As a romance brews between her and Gault, it puts in jeopardy her standing among her devout neighbors. But when an evil rancher makes a play for the community''s land, Gault''s sharpshooting skills might prove his worth after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3q7uQgeLRIcTaQxwc8GkBPY72NU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63502'),
  ('758728954865710122', 'The Outsider', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Brian A. Miller, Eduardo Enrique Mayén, Lisa Marie Dupree', 'Brian A. Miller', 'Jason Patric, Craig Fairbrass, James Caan, Shannon Elizabeth, Melissa Ordway, Johnny Messner, Brittney Alger, Greg Sproles', null, 'Revolves around a British military contractor Lex Walker who is told his daughter has died. When he arrives in Los Angeles and discovers the body is not hers, he begins an investigation.', 'Revolves around a British military contractor Lex Walker who is told his daughter has died. When he arrives in Los Angeles and discovers the body is not hers, he begins an investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYRFAxQpB0VVVO17cPC8nEyZiLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241765'),
  ('1309198688194232', 'The Outsider', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Christophe Barratier', 'Christophe Barratier, Laurent Turner', 'Arthur Dupont, François-Xavier Demaison, Sabrina Ouazani, Tewfik Jallab, Thomas Coumans, Sören Prévost, Franz Lang, Luc Schiltz', null, 'A drama about the less known aspects of the trading activity inside one of the biggest banks in the world - Société Générale. The movie tracks the rise and fall of anonymous trader turned superstar turned escape goat - Jérôme Kerviel - just as the 2008 financial crisis was unfolding', 'A drama about the less known aspects of the trading activity inside one of the biggest banks in the world - Société Générale. The movie tracks the rise and fall of anonymous trader turned superstar turned escape goat - Jérôme Kerviel - just as the 2008 financial crisis was unfolding', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q12hpgdfCoZKHLWJeslJyqz9QJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394161'),
  ('618496829716302973', 'The Outsider', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Martin Zandvliet, Rika Nakanishi', 'Andrew Baldwin', 'Jared Leto, Tadanobu Asano, Kippei Shiina, Shioli Kutsuna, Min Tanaka, Nao Omori, Emile Hirsch, Rory Cochrane', 'R', 'A former American G.I. joins a yakuza family after his release from prison in post-World War II Osaka.', 'A former American G.I. joins a yakuza family after his release from prison in post-World War II Osaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2riQcEzjVrkP8wKHDXwC5EQpHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199928'),
  ('802976822971552704', 'The Outsiders', 1967, 'Drama', 'Juan Ibáñez', 'Carlos Fuentes, Juan Ibáñez', 'Julissa, Enrique Álvarez Félix, Sergio Jiménez, Óscar Chávez, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Eduardo López Rojas, Tamara Garina, Martha Zabaleta', null, 'A couple on the verge of getting married gets mixed up with a gang of thugs in this routine crime drama that underscores the Socio-economic disparity in the Mexican culture. The upper-class couple rides along with outsiders who go club-hopping and resort to petty thievery. After their adventure, the couple questions whether or not they are right for each other.', 'A couple on the verge of getting married gets mixed up with a gang of thugs in this routine crime drama that underscores the Socio-economic disparity in the Mexican culture. The upper-class couple rides along with outsiders who go club-hopping and resort to petty thievery. After their adventure, the couple questions whether or not they are right for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bqviDmyeRntL5kAMNFjEN7Fkyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169428'),
  ('929930385146839359', 'The Outsiders', 1983, 'Crime, Drama', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Stephen H. Burum', 'Kathleen Rowell', 'C. Thomas Howell, Matt Dillon, Ralph Macchio, Patrick Swayze, Rob Lowe, Emilio Estevez, Tom Cruise, Glenn Withrow', 'PG', 'In 1960s Tulsa, class divisions ignite a violent rivalry between the working-class Greasers and the privileged Socs. When a deadly encounter forces two Greasers, Ponyboy and Johnny, to flee, their struggle for survival and redemption exposes the fragile innocence and enduring bonds of youth on the wrong side of town.', 'In 1960s Tulsa, class divisions ignite a violent rivalry between the working-class Greasers and the privileged Socs. When a deadly encounter forces two Greasers, Ponyboy and Johnny, to flee, their struggle for survival and redemption exposes the fragile innocence and enduring bonds of youth on the wrong side of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9os0HcXY8BOkvUWAx4rvby3j6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227'),
  ('934927632771193991', 'The Outskirts', 1998, 'Drama', 'Pyotr Lutsik, Vyacheslav Klyuchnikov, Eduard Melnikov', 'Pyotr Lutsik, Aleksey Samoryadov', 'Yuriy Dubrovin, Nikolay Olyalin, Aleksei Pushkin, Aleksey Vanin, Rimma Markova, Viktor Stepanov, Anatoliy Koshcheev, Viktor Venes', null, 'The hero is an ordinary farmer, Philip Safronov, whose peaceful life is aggressively interrupted when his land is appropriated by a mysterious group to exploit its oil resources.', 'The hero is an ordinary farmer, Philip Safronov, whose peaceful life is aggressively interrupted when his land is appropriated by a mysterious group to exploit its oil resources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ydGsQMPltvlvVtqSqFNmRiJ0Id.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125313');
